The hospital provides a broad range of health services on one campus, using the latest technologies and treatments. Mercy Hospital Oklahoma City is a leader in the treatment of cancer and stroke, breast imaging and research, and robotic surgery, and is home to a level-III neonatal intensive care unit (NICU) for critically ill newborns. Featured medical services include the Birthing Center, Coletta Cancer Center, Mercy Breast Center, and Meinders NeuroScience Institute.

All Mercy patients have access to MyMercy, a free app for managing health and connecting with the care team from any device. Mercy patients can also take part in national clinical trials through Mercy Research. The hospital also offers advanced technology including da Vinci Robotic surgery, radiotherapy, and the TrueBeam linear accelerator.', '4300 W. Memorial Road', 'Oklahoma City', 'OK', '73120', '(405) 755-1515', ARRAY['German', 'Marshallese', 'Korean', 'Italian', 'Swahili', 'Vietnamese', 'Greek', 'Thai', 'Portuguese', 'Arabic', 'Hindi', 'Hmong', 'Cherokee', 'Tagalog', 'Oromo', 'Japanese', 'Amharic', 'Farsi', 'Bosnian', 'Urdu', 'Lao', 'French', 'Russian', 'Polish', 'Chinese (Simplified)', 'Serbian/Croatian', 'Spanish', 'Burmese', 'Gujarati']::text[], 'Hospital', FALSE, '{"images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/mercy-hospital-oklahoma-city-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/mercy-hospital-oklahoma-city-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/mercy-hospital-oklahoma-city-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/mercy-hospital-oklahoma-city-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/mercy-hospital-oklahoma-city-google-5.webp", "https://www.mercy.net/content/dam/mercy/en/web-assets/images/master-photos/WEB_Hero_Location_Mercy-Hospital-Oklahoma-City.jpg", "https://www.mercy.net/content/dam/mercy/en/images/web-highlight-birthplace.jpg.transform/imageTransformDesktop/image.jpeg", "https://www.mercy.net/content/dam/mercy/en/images/web-highlight-infusion.jpg.transform/imageTransformDesktop/image.jpeg", "https://www.mercy.net/content/dam/mercy/en/images/web-highlight-cancer-center.jpg.transform/imageTransformDesktop/image.jpeg", "https://www.mercy.net/content/dam/mercy/en/images/web-highlight-heart-vascular-hospital.jpg.transform/imageTransformDesktop/image.jpeg", "https://cf-images.us-east-1.prod.boltdns.net/v1/static/830934500001/63c95788-26c4-4aab-af34-37a714b838f5/e018a85c-7ac6-4155-a7df-559cefb8cb39/1280x720/match/image.jpg", "https://cf-images.us-east-1.prod.boltdns.net/v1/static/830934500001/63c95788-26c4-4aab-af34-37a714b838f5/18eec8bd-c16e-4750-912a-1eb5d4002747/330x168/match/image.jpg", "https://cf-images.us-east-1.prod.boltdns.net/v1/static/830934500001/d7e701d2-6bee-43ba-86d1-86a7e2efa707/a5c67abb-9376-435c-b914-4a47b1f121b0/330x168/match/image.jpg", "https://cf-images.us-east-1.prod.boltdns.net/v1/static/830934500001/7f6a6e81-30f2-4411-a771-b72973ecc144/d05e7964-3f6f-4791-85d1-7c55ccd6736a/330x168/match/image.jpg", "https://cf-images.us-east-1.prod.boltdns.net/v1/static/830934500001/e508c62b-1ead-42d8-80c0-ae5796cc6218/792466ff-faf5-4d27-83da-adceedf6c5a4/330x168/match/image.jpg", "https://cf-images.us-east-1.prod.boltdns.net/v1/static/830934500001/42c90c46-0636-4cd0-b7eb-61135a9c6c51/a1be35c3-b24f-459b-b4b2-da0bdc16dd44/330x168/match/image.jpg", "https://www.mercy.net/content/dam/mercy/en/web-assets/images/tiles/FY25_MotherBaby_MarektingTiles_update_720x4875_Go_To.png"], "rating": 4.3, "reviews": [{"date": "2026-02-18T20:06:45.451378047Z", "text": "I’ve had an excellent experience with Mercy over the last few years. I couldn’t ask for a better care team. I greatly appreciate their guidance and involvement. For the first time- in my entire life I’m actually  (almost) excited abt my health, even though I still have a long way to go. I feel totally confident that I’ll continue to progress nicely with them.", "author": "Ki", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100093725873790178629/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-04-06T23:09:54.687636393Z", "text": "I would like to take a moment to sincerely thank the entire team at Mercy Hospital for the outstanding care I received during my very first surgery. From the moment I arrived, everyone was incredibly professional, kind, and reassuring.\n\nThe staff did an excellent job of keeping me informed every step of the way, which helped ease any nerves I had going into the procedure. I truly appreciated how gentle, attentive, and compassionate everyone was throughout the entire experience.\n\nIt made a big difference knowing I was in such capable hands. I’m grateful for the level of care and support I received, and I would highly recommend Mercy Hospital to anyone in need of medical care.\n\nThank you again for making what could have been a stressful experience feel comfortable and well-managed.", "author": "Kenneth Henry II", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106304758861873119410/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-26T18:16:09.299281402Z", "text": "I went in for an ultrasound on my legs.  The technician was awesome in every way.  Made my comfort a priority and we were able to have an intelligent conversation about general things including what she was doing, etc. She is TOP SHELF. Kudos in the highest regard for her.  Thank you!!!  I just wish I could remember her name.", "author": "S Meril", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103201353665119743780/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-03-03T23:04:20.155139279Z", "text": "Upon arrival I was a bit intimidated by the amount of people in the waiting room. However within 15 minutes I was triaged, then I had to give a urine sample. As soon as I was in the restroom they called me for labs and let me know that ultrasound would be down to get me in a little while. I had everything done before being called back into a room. The wait was a bit long for a room but that''s to be expected for so many people in the ER.\nThere system was efficient and I was taken really good care of.  My health was a priority and it was nice to be heard. We will make the 1.5 hour drive to this hospital again if need be.", "author": "Shannon Nourozy", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102059668068417401880/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-01-06T18:31:23.777097597Z", "text": "I had a hernia surgery this week, the first surgery I''ve ever had, and I couldn''t be more pleased with my care from the moment I walked in to the time I was discharged. Every person I interacted with was kind and compassionate and helped ease my nerves by answering all my questions and explaining every part of the process patiently and thoroughly. Thank you all for making my visit as smooth as possible.", "author": "Rob Sturma", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105223592969928892552/reviews"}], "website": "https://www.mercy.net/practice/mercy-hospital-oklahoma-city", "location": {"latitude": 35.607198000000004, "longitude": -97.600529}, "services": ["Birthing Center", "Coletta Cancer Center", "Mercy Breast Center", "Meinders NeuroScience Institute", "Women''s Health", "Level III NICU", "Stroke Care", "Robotic Surgery"], "insurance": {"notes": "An online cost estimator is available for price transparency.", "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": [], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": false}, "highlights": [{"title": "100 Top Hospital", "detail": "Named a 2021 100 Top Hospital by Fortune/IBM Watson Health.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Best Maternity Hospital", "detail": "Named 2021 Best Maternity Hospital by Newsweek and The Leapfrog Group.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Patient Safety Excellence Award", "detail": "Received 2021 Patient Safety Excellence Award by Healthgrades.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Comprehensive Stroke Center", "detail": "Comprehensive Stroke Center Certified by T