om/maps/contrib/100093725873790178629/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-04-06T23:09:54.687636393Z", "text": "I would like to take a moment to sincerely thank the entire team at Mercy Hospital for the outstanding care I received during my very first surgery. From the moment I arrived, everyone was incredibly professional, kind, and reassuring.\n\nThe staff did an excellent job of keeping me informed every step of the way, which helped ease any nerves I had going into the procedure. I truly appreciated how gentle, attentive, and compassionate everyone was throughout the entire experience.\n\nIt made a big difference knowing I was in such capable hands. I’m grateful for the level of care and support I received, and I would highly recommend Mercy Hospital to anyone in need of medical care.\n\nThank you again for making what could have been a stressful experience feel comfortable and well-managed.", "author": "Kenneth Henry II", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106304758861873119410/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-26T18:16:09.299281402Z", "text": "I went in for an ultrasound on my legs.  The technician was awesome in every way.  Made my comfort a priority and we were able to have an intelligent conversation about general things including what she was doing, etc. She is TOP SHELF. Kudos in the highest regard for her.  Thank you!!!  I just wish I could remember her name.", "author": "S Meril", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103201353665119743780/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-03-03T23:04:20.155139279Z", "text": "Upon arrival I was a bit intimidated by the amount of people in the waiting room. However within 15 minutes I was triaged, then I had to give a urine sample. As soon as I was in the restroom they called me for labs and let me know that ultrasound would be down to get me in a little while. I had everything done before being called back into a room. The wait was a bit long for a room but that''s to be expected for so many people in the ER.\nThere system was efficient and I was taken really good care of.  My health was a priority and it was nice to be heard. We will make the 1.5 hour drive to this hospital again if need be.", "author": "Shannon Nourozy", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102059668068417401880/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-01-06T18:31:23.777097597Z", "text": "I had a hernia surgery this week, the first surgery I''ve ever had, and I couldn''t be more pleased with my care from the moment I walked in to the time I was discharged. Every person I interacted with was kind and compassionate and helped ease my nerves by answering all my questions and explaining every part of the process patiently and thoroughly. Thank you all for making my visit as smooth as possible.", "author": "Rob Sturma", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105223592969928892552/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Patients consistently praise Mercy Hospital Oklahoma City for its compassionate, professional care and efficient processes, with many highlighting the staff''s ability to ease anxieties and provide thorough explanations.", "about_highlight": "Mercy Hospital Oklahoma City is a full-service hospital located in northwest Oklahoma City just off the Kilpatrick Turnpike. Committed to bringing a full array of medical services to the community, the hospital has earned multiple recognitions including being named a 2021 100 Top Hospital by Fortune/IBM Watson Health, 2021 Best Maternity Hospital by Newsweek and The Leapfrog Group, and receiving the 2021 Patient Safety Excellence Award by Healthgrades. The hospital is also a Comprehensive Stroke Center Certified by The Joint Commission and earned the 2020 Top 100 Consumer Loyalty by NRC Health.\n\nThe hospital provides a broad range of health services on one campus, using the latest technologies and treatments. Mercy Hospital Oklahoma City is a leader in the treatment of cancer and stroke, breast imaging and research, and robotic surgery, and is home to a level-III neonatal intensive care unit (NICU) for critically ill newborns. Featured medical services include the Birthing Center, Coletta Cancer Center, Mercy Breast Center, and Meinders NeuroScience Institute.\n\nAll Mercy patients have access to MyMercy, a free app for managing health and connecting with the care team from any device. Mercy patients can also take part in national clinical trials through Mercy Research. The hospital also offers advanced technology including da Vinci Robotic surgery, radiotherapy, and the TrueBeam linear accelerator.", "appointment_url": "https://www.mercy.net/schedule-online/", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=9313836111055257082&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJE-YSHLkcsocR-n2nn5hkQYE", "important_links": [{"url": "https://www.mercy.net/search/doctor/", "text": "Doctors"}, {"url": "https://www.mercy.net/search/location/", "text": "Locations"}, {"url": "https://www.mercy.net/search/service/", "text": "Services"}, {"url": "https://www.mercy.net/schedule-online/", "text": "First Available Scheduling"}, {"url": "https://www.mercy.net/search/doctor/?solrsort=&distance=9999&options=scheduleOnline&insuranceProviders=&specialties=&servicesOffered=&gender=&languages=&page=1", "text": "Schedule Appointment"}, {"url": "https://www.mercy.net/forms/patient-feedback/", "text": "Contact Us"}, {"url": "https://www.mercy.net/practice/mercy-hospital-oklahoma-city/our-locations/", "text": "At This Location"}, {"url": "https://www.mercy.net/service/mercy-research", "text": "Mercy Research"}, {"url": "https://www.mercy.net/service/womens-health", "text": "Women’s Health"}, {"url": "https://www.mercy.net/service/robotic-surgery", "text": "da Vinci Robotic"}, {"url": "https://www.mercy.net/service/pregnancy/pfork/?tactic_id=7015f000000dcYo&program=mo