 or critically ill newborns"}, {"name": "Stroke Care", "category": "Emergency", "description": "24/7 access to life-saving neurological care. Designated as a Comprehensive Stroke Center.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Stroke patients"}, {"name": "Robotic Surgery", "category": "Surgical", "description": "da Vinci Robotic surgery for minimally invasive procedures.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients needing surgery"}], "short_description": "Located in northwest Oklahoma City just off the Kilpatrick Turnpike, Mercy Hospital Oklahoma City is a full-service hospital committed to bringing a full array of medical services to the community with advanced technology and nationally recognized care.", "google_website_url": "https://www.mercy.net/practice/mercy-hospital-oklahoma-city?utm_source=google&utm_medium=organic_search&utm_campaign=yext&utm_term=West&utm_content=website&y_source=1_MTI5OTY2MDItNzE1LWxvY2F0aW9uLndlYnNpdGU=", "google_primary_type": "General Hospital", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": [], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "4300 W Memorial Rd, Oklahoma City, OK 73120, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/106934637267035329794", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWHSwnYWmDPiTwbhnVk4bYJNA2Th1PiRazF7GdaEt-tPpiidj4=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "R Wheeler"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/117474517562208567511", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU-Yi_yMvZPzNh4ArYkbMQ6DxfZt0aRn9uGWh2TSEuQfX3bFRIscw=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Jen Russell"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/109651797568180252481", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXgX0ZyrTCy-zZvrnHU_gtHvGZ5hCFNXOglwxM8Ej58y1PqadAZeQ=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Laura"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/114828247589585160196", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVPk1nJXCofVDW1zYerPm6W5Affa_2TjK5uoipZYXNM3pH7cip-=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Khup Gin"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/102433745672971779309", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXyRMEtfjtWrBn-jW1Gn4TzWo28Azc0TVEWOlMmAmHjrJmarfTH=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Floyd Vaulner"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-25T16:07:15.572931+00:00', 'mercy-hospital-oklahoma-city', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

From arrival to recovery, we''re here for you every step of the way. As a patient, you’ll have access to a compassionate care team and helpful resources like language assistance, visitor information and personalized guidance throughout your stay. Our hospital is open 24/7 and provides a full spectrum of services including emergency care, heart care, cancer care, neurology, orthopedics, and women''s health.

Baylor St. Luke''s has been recognized for clinical excellence, including being named a Comprehensive Stroke Center for 12 years, performing over 900 advanced robotic heart surgeries, and having 4 specialties ranked by U.S. News & World Report. We are committed to providing culturally responsive care through language interpretation services and international patient services.', '1101 Bates Avenue, Houston, TX 77030', 'Houston', 'TX', '77030', '832-355-1000', ARRAY['English']::text[], 'Hospital', FALSE, '{"images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/baylor-st.-lukes-medical-center-houston-tx-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/baylor-st.-lukes-medical-center-houston-tx-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/baylor-st.-lukes-medical-center-houston-tx-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/baylor-st.-lukes-medical-center-houston-tx-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/baylor-st.-lukes-medical-center-houston-tx-google-5.webp", "https://storage.googleapis.com/blockit-storage-profile-images-prod/a972e1b7-05d7-46cd-a925-e34948ecf785.jpg", "https://storage.googleapis.com/blockit-storage-profile-images-prod/a972e1b7-05d7-46cd-a925-e34948ecf785.jpg", "https://www.commonspirit.org/content/dam/shared/en/logos/commonspirit-logo-1.svg", "https://www.commonspirit.org/content/dam/shared/en/icons/footer/stethoscope.svg", "https://www.commonspirit.org/content/dam/shared/en/icons/footer/medical-center.svg", "https://www.commonspirit.org/content/dam/shared/en/icons/logos/baylor-college-of-medicine.svg", "https://www.commonspirit.org/content/dam/shared/en/icons/facility-types/icon-facility-type-hospital.svg", "https://storage.googleapis.com/blockit-storage-profile-images-prod/426e7b12-39dd-44ba-80ad-b2a467e6c2fd.jpg", "https://www.commonspirit.org/content/dam/shared/en/icons/logos/icon-logo-tx.svg", "https://www.commonspirit.org/content/dam/shared/en/icons/facility-types/icon-facility-type-emergency-room.svg", "https://stausw1cdndev.blob.core.windows.net/location-pressganey/6770%20Bertner%20Ave%20Houston%20TX%2077030.jpg", "https://www.commonspirit.org/content/dam/shared/en/icons/facility-types/icon-facility-type-specialty-center.svg"], "rating": 4.4, "reviews": [{"date": "2026-06-02T23:43:45.420565654Z", "text": "I was totally caught by surprise visiting the ER @ St Luke’s. Before entering I needed a wheelchair but to no avail!! I had to walk to have an XRay done and before I sat we had to wipe down the chairs. The floors were grossly dirty, used blankets were left in the chairs as well as trash cans as I walked through the hallways. I entered around 3:15pm and asked for something to eat around 11:30pm I received a cold turkey n cheese sandwich with a warm juice. My pain was at the max and at least 3 of the doctors wanted me to take some pain medication and go home without a true diagnosis of my condition!! I refused to leave without knowing the problem to my pain and was eventually moved to a room. It was creepy-bathroom light flickering, the tub seen in the picture below as though it was remolding being done as well as the walls were dirty, lastly some stripping with electrical wires on the wall! I was not comfortable but needed to be treated. Which eventually the staff concluded with a diagnosis and appropriate medication. The food was Horrible!! However, the staff was Professional and attentive to my needs during my stay despite the circumstances", "author": "Sheila Snell", "rating": 3, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103216555589619372629/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-30T23:19:00.420249096Z", "text": "There are not enough words to describe how much I enjoyed my stay at Baylor. From the Doctors, nurses, food service workers and the cleaning lady. I was treated with so much love and respect. Medical team was amazing. I thank God for guiding me to Baylor! Thankful! Grateful! Blessed! 🙌🏽", "author": "Rosie Lee", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113986780530120040792/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-09T13:08:46.314479048Z", "text": "Know that this place is very busy. Nursing staff on our floor was excellent. If you have a patient here, go learn the place. Lots of corridors go in all kinds of places. Remember your colors and go explore. There''s a museum, a chapel, a cafeteria. All this helps to get your mind off of certain things. If you''re lost, ask, so many people will help you.", "author": "Don McAlister", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102071104861285345265/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-04-20T01:02:59.897809346Z", "text": "The staff was amazing and Stephanie in recovery and discharge was absolutely wonderful at explaining the procedures and home care. Everyone was very accommodating and Dee Rose went above and beyond making sure I was taken care of. I definitely hope they get a wonderful salary increase for their wonderful care.", "author": "Nora Hooker", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101367929004141207573/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-27T23:24:30.600934337Z", "text": "I could write for hours about how incredible this staff was, and still not even come close to expressing my gratitude to everyone who helped me. I spent weeks in literally agony until I found myself at St Luke’s. After not being listened to or helped in any way at OakBend Medical, I went to St Luke’s, where I believe they saved my life. At that point, I had already lost 25lbs in two weeks due to my illness. The nursing staff was knowledgeable, caring, empathetic, compassionate, loving, kind, and top notch. The doctors took the time to do the tests needed to find out what was actually wrong with me, and not just make random assumptions with no proof, as they did at OakBend Medical (DO NOT EVER VISIT THEM) Without them, I may not be here to write this review. I will never go anywhere else for my health needs. I can honestly say I love each and everyone of those nurses that saved my life. A very special thank you to (please excuse any misspelling) AMY, ALEX, TERESA, KAMAL, JAC, OBI, NATRESSA, MARQUITA, and CELESTE for you loving caring support…. I really needed it! And obviously a special thank you to all the GI Team. You all are a complement to your profession, and if there was ever a question as to whether you have an impact on your patient’s lives, you really really do.", "author": "Thomas Chelly", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117233053169218978232/reviews"}], "website": "https://www.commonspirit.org/find-a-location/st-lukes-health-baylor-st-lukes-medical-center-houston-tx-1733", "location": {"latitude": 29.7076745, "longitude": -95.4004595}, "services": ["Cancer Care", "Heart Care", "Emergency Services", "Primary Care", "Neurology", "Orthopedics", "Women''s Health", "Transplantation"], "insurance": {"notes": "The insurance carriers and plans shown is for references purposes only and is subject to change. It is recommended that you check with your health plan directly to confirm that this location is included.", "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": [], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": false}, "highlights": [{"title": "24/7 Emergency Care", "detail": "Emergency Room open 24 hours a day, 7 days a week.", "category": "access"}, {"title": "Language Assistance", "detail": "Language and interpretation services are available to support patients and families.", "category": "culture"}, {"title": "Nationally Ranked Specialties", "detail": "4 specialties ranked by U.S. News & World Report for clinical excellence.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "International Patient Services", "detail": "A dedicated team supports international patients throughout their care journey.", "category": "convenience"}, {"title": "Magnet Recognition", "detail": "Received Magnet Recognition from the American Nurses Credentialing Center for nursing excellence.", "category": "care"}], "price_tier": "$$", "source_url": "https://www.commonspirit.org/find-a-location/st-lukes-health-baylor-st-lukes-medical-center-houston-tx-1733", "appointment": {"booking_note": null, "appointment_url": null, "new_patient_note": null, "phone_booking_available": null, "online_booking_available": null, "free_consultation_available": null}, "open_sunday": true, "scout_query": "hospitals that speak Korean in Houston, Texas", "search_text": "hospital | english | cancer care | heart care | emergency services | primary care | neurology | orthopedics | women''s health | transplantation | oncology | cardiology | emergency | surgery", "google_types": ["medical_clinic", "hospital", "health", "point_of_interest", "service", "establishment"], "open_weekend": true, "rating_count": 3976, "open_saturday": true, "quality_score": 85, "working_hours": {"friday": "Open 24 hours", "monday": "Open 24 hours", "sunday": "Open 24 hours", "tuesday": "Open 24 hours", "saturday": "Open 24 hours", "thursday": "Open 24 hours", "wednesday": "Open 24 hours"}, "gallery_images": ["https://storage.googleapis.com/blockit-storage-profile-images-prod/a972e1b7-05d7-46cd-a925-e34948ecf785.jpg", "https://storage.googleapis.com/blockit-storage-profile-images-prod/426e7b12-39dd-44ba-80ad-b2a467e6c2fd.jpg", "https://stausw1cdndev.blob.core.windows.net/location-pressganey/6770%20Bertner%20Ave%20Houston%20TX%2077030.jpg", "https://stausw1cdndev.blob.core.windows.net/location-pressganey/7200%20Cambridge%20St%20Houston%20TX%2077030.jpg"], "review_profile": {"rating": 4.4, "source": "google", "themes": [{"theme": "Staff Professionalism", "mentions": 4, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Multiple reviewers praise the staff for being knowledgeable, compassionate, and going above and beyond in their care."}, {"theme": "Facility Environment", "mentions": 1, "sentiment": "Negative", "summary_quote": "One reviewer highlights concerns about cleanliness, including dirty floors, flickering lights, and unfinished remodeling."}, {"theme": "Communication", "mentions": 2, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients appreciate clear explanations of procedures and home care, with staff being described as accommodating and helpful."}, {"theme": "Treatment Outcomes", "mentions": 2, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Several reviewers credit the medical team with accurate diagnoses and life-saving care, expressing deep gratitude."}, {"theme": "ER Experience", "mentions": 1, "sentiment": "Negative", "summary_quote": "One patient reports long wait times, delayed food service, and initial pressure to leave without a proper diagnosis."}], "summary": "Baylor St. Luke''s Medical Center receives mostly positive feedback for its caring and knowledgeable staff, though some patients report concerns about facility cleanliness and ER wait times.", "review_count": 3976, "concern_themes": [], "positive_themes": [], "featured_reviews": [{"date": "2026-06-02T23:43:45.420565654Z", "text": "I was totally caught by surprise visiting the ER @ St Luke’s. Before entering I needed a wheelchair but to no avail!! I had to walk to have an XRay done and before I sat we had to wipe down the chairs. The floors were grossly dirty, used blankets were left in the chairs as well as trash cans as I walked through the hallways. I entered around 3:15pm and asked for something to eat around 11:30pm I received a cold turkey n cheese sandwich with a warm juice. My pain was at the max and at least 3 of the doctors wanted me to take some pain medication and go home without a true diagnosis of my condition!! I refused to leave without knowing the problem to my pain and was eventually moved to a room. It was creepy-bathroom light flickering, the tub seen in the picture below as though it was remolding being done as well as the walls were dirty, lastly some stripping with electrical wires on the wall! I was not comfortable but needed to be treated. Which eventually the staff concluded with a diagnosis and appropriate medication. The food was Horrible!! However, the staff was Professional and attentive to my needs during my stay despite the circumstances", "author": "Sheila Snell", "rating": 3, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103216555589619372629/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-30T23:19:00.420249096Z", "text": "There are not enough words to describe how much I enjoyed my stay at Baylor. From the Doctors, nurses, food service workers and the cleaning lady. I was treated with so much love and respect. Medical team was amazing. I thank God for guiding me to Baylor! Thankful! Grateful! Blessed! 🙌🏽", "author": "Rosie Lee", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113986780530120040792/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-09T13:08:46.314479048Z", "text": "Know that this place is very busy. Nursing staff on our floor was excellent. If you have a patient here, go learn the place. Lots of corridors go in all kinds of places. Remember your colors and go explore. There''s a museum, a chapel, a cafeteria. All this helps to get your mind off of certain things. If you''re lost, ask, so many people will help you.", "author": "Don McAlister", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102071104861285345265/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-04-20T01:02:59.897809346Z", "text": "The staff was amazing and Stephanie in recovery and discharge was absolutely wonderful at explaining the procedures and home care. Everyone was very accommodating and Dee Rose went above and beyond making sure I was taken care of. I definitely hope they get a wonderful salary increase for their wonderful care.", "author": "Nora Hooker", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101367929004141207573/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-27T23:24:30.600934337Z", "text": "I could write for hours about how incredible this staff was, and still not even come close to expressing my gratitude to everyone who helped me. I spent weeks in literally agony until I found myself at St Luke’s. After not being listened to or helped in any way at OakBend Medical, I went to St Luke’s, where I believe they saved my life. At that point, I had already lost 25lbs in two weeks due to my illness. The nursing staff was knowledgeable, caring, empathetic, compassionate, loving, kind, and top notch. The doctors took the time to do the tests needed to find out what was actually wrong with me, and not just make random assumptions with no proof, as they did at OakBend Medical (DO NOT EVER VISIT THEM) Without them, I may not be here to write this review. I will never go anywhere else for my health needs. I can honestly say I love each and everyone of those nurses that saved my life. A very special thank you to (please excuse any misspelling) AMY, ALEX, TERESA, KAMAL, JAC, OBI, NATRESSA, MARQUITA, and CELESTE for you loving caring support…. I really needed it! And obviously a special thank you to all the GI Team. You all are a complement to your profession, and if there was ever a question as to whether you have an impact on your patient’s lives, you really really do.", "author": "Thomas Chelly", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117233053169218978232/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Baylor St. Luke''s Medical Center receives mostly positive feedback for its caring and knowledgeable staff, though some patients report concerns about facility cleanliness and ER wait times.", "about_highlight": "Baylor St. Luke''s Medical Center is known for groundbreaking innovations and exceptional care. Our team has made major breakthroughs in the fields of cardiology, neurology, neurosurgery, oncology and transplantation. In partnership with Baylor College of Medicine, we offer advanced treatments and a strong network of experts to bring you innovative, high-quality care.\n\nFrom arrival to recovery, we''re here for you every step of the way. As a patient, you’ll have access to a compassionate care team and helpful resources like language assistance, visitor information and personalized guidance throughout your stay. Our hospital is open 24/7 and provides a full spectrum of services including emergency care, heart care, cancer care, neurology, orthopedics, and women''s health.\n\nBaylor St. Luke''s has been recognized for clinical excellence, including being named a Comprehensive Stroke Center for 12 years, performing over 900 advanced robotic heart surgeries, and having 4 specialties ranked by U.S. News & World Report. We are committed to providing culturally responsive care through language interpretation services and international patient services.", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=15890358944730080748&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJ_VQh6HPAQIYR7GUW_kTlhdw", "important_links": [{"url": "https://www.commonspirit.org/find-a-doctor", "text": "Find a doctor"}, {"url": "https://www.commonspirit.org/find-a-location", "text": "Find a location"}, {"url": "https://www.commonspirit.org/services-specialties", "text": "View all services and specialties"}, {"url": "https://www.commonspirit.org/services-specialties/cancer-care", "text": "Cancer Care"}, {"url": "https://www.commonspirit.org/services-specialties/heart-care", "text": "Heart Care"}, {"url": "https://www.commonspirit.org/services-specialties/emergency-services", "text": "Emergency Services"}, {"url": "https://www.commonspirit.org/services-specialties/primary-care", "text": "Primary Care"}, {"url": "https://www.commonspirit.org/services-specialties/neurological-care", "text": "Neurology"}, {"url": "https://www.commonspirit.org/services-specialties/orthopedics", "text": "Orthopedics"}, {"url": "https://www.commonspirit.org/services-specialties/urgent-care", "text": "Urgent Care"}, {"url": "https://www.commonspirit.org/services-specialties/womens-health", "text": "Women''s Health"}, {"url": "https://www.commonspirit.org/patient-resources/patient-portal", "text": "Patient portal"}, {"url": "https://www.commonspirit.org/patient-resources/language-interpretation-services", "text": "Language and interpretation services"}, {"url": "https://www.commonspirit.org/patient-resources/international-services", "text": "International services"}, {"url": "https://www.commonspirit.org/patient-resources/insurance", "text": "Insurance"}, {"url": "https://www.commonspirit.org/patient-resources/price-transparency", "text": "Price transparency and cost estimator"}, {"url": "https://www.commonspirit.org/contact-us", "text": "Contact us"}, {"url": "https://www.commonspirit.org/patient-resources/language-interpretation-services", "text": "language assistance"}, {"url": "https://patientportalsouth.commonspirit.org/", "text": "Log into patient portal"}, {"url": "https://www.commonspirit.org/patient-resources/patient-portal", "text": "patient portal"}, {"url": "https://www.commonspirit.org/patient-resources/international-services", "text": "international patient services"}, {"url": "https://www.commonspirit.org/patient-resources/international-services", "text": "Explore global care"}, {"url": "https://www.commonspirit.org/find-a-location/emergency-room-baylor-st-lukes-medical-center-houston-2721", "text": "Emergency Room - Baylor St. Luke''s Medical Center - Houston"}, {"url": "https://www.commonspirit.org/find-a-location/cardiovascular-care-at-baylor-st-lukes-medi