lly noted short wait times and quick service."}, {"theme": "Communication", "mentions": 1, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "A patient mentioned feeling comfortable due to the doctor''s attentive and kind communication."}, {"theme": "Customer Service", "mentions": 1, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "One reviewer praised the clinic for its great customer service and caring approach."}], "summary": "Patients consistently praise Clínica Hispana VidaPlus for its friendly, professional staff and excellent service, with many highlighting the welcoming atmosphere and efficient care.", "review_count": 146, "concern_themes": [], "positive_themes": ["Excelente atención", "Profesionalismo", "Personal amable", "Diagnóstico preciso", "Explicaciones claras", "Seguridad durante el proceso"], "featured_reviews": [{"date": "2026-05-11T22:06:22.959508389Z", "text": "I love this place it’s really good you guys should definitely go it’s amazing very nice people they treat you perfectly and professionally", "author": "Angelina Perez", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110183608144145076391/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-18T17:16:13.345777855Z", "text": "Great experience from the moment I walked in, friendly staff.  Dr was incredibly kind and attentive, felt comfortable.", "author": "Cindy Carmona", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118289350750174136246/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-20T14:27:34.373622512Z", "text": "Treated me like family.  I would definitely recommend this place to everyone.", "author": "Jeff Lay", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105571765307753243368/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-18T17:13:41.952386976Z", "text": "Very friendly staff and wait time was short and got seen quickly!", "author": "Randy Alfred", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111360998508778736115/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-11-23T22:55:00.369372752Z", "text": "Great customer service! Very caring & professional", "author": "Edgar Barrera", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108244371619628019889/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Patients consistently praise Clínica Hispana VidaPlus for its friendly, professional staff and excellent service, with many highlighting the welcoming atmosphere and efficient care.", "about_highlight": "Clínica Hispana VidaPlus se dedica a brindar atención médica de calidad con un enfoque humano y personalizado. Su equipo de profesionales altamente calificados está comprometido con la salud y el bienestar de cada paciente, ofreciendo chequeos generales, urgencias menores, diagnóstico por imagen, salud masculina y femenina, y exámenes especiales. La clínica se enorgullece de haber atendido a miles de pacientes, brindando siempre el mejor servicio y atención personalizada.\n\nAbierta los 7 días de la semana, la clínica ofrece consultas médicas desde $30 y cuenta con un equipo que habla español, facilitando la comunicación para la comunidad hispana. Los pacientes destacan la excelente atención, el profesionalismo y la amabilidad del personal, así como la claridad en las explicaciones médicas.\n\nUbicada en Dallas, TX, la clínica está comprometida con la salud integral de sus pacientes, ofreciendo servicios como ultrasonidos, radiografías, EKG, pruebas de embarazo, Papanicolau y evaluaciones para escuelas, transporte y procesos migratorios.", "appointment_url": "http://www.clinicahispanavidaplus.com/contactanos", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=13139712021080308255&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJ9WAfEgAnTIYRH_prS3eiWbY", "quality_missing": ["insurance", "team_members"], "search_keywords": ["primary care", "family doctor", "general practitioner", "annual physical", "checkup", "bác sĩ gia đình", "khám tổng quát",