The clinic accepts public health insurance and provides services on a sliding fee scale based on income, ensuring that high-quality healthcare is accessible to all community members regardless of their ability to pay. Patients can access care by calling the clinic to schedule an appointment.', '2403 Keith St, San Francisco, CA 94124', 'San Francisco', 'CA', '94124', '628-217-5500', ARRAY['English', 'Vietnamese']::text[], 'Community Health Center', FALSE, '{"images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/southeast-family-health-center-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/southeast-family-health-center-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/southeast-family-health-center-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/southeast-family-health-center-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/southeast-family-health-center-google-5.webp"], "rating": 4.2, "reviews": [{"date": "2026-03-24T00:15:57.325137438Z", "text": "Well I can say in a few words that I''ve been a client of this Medical  Center since 2010 and don''t have any bad tossy", "author": "Roses", "rating": 4, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116727237897874835806/reviews"}, {"date": "2022-06-21T19:36:57.630181Z", "text": "I''ve only used the outdoor Covid testing and vaccination facility and they were all good experiences. The Color sign-up questionnaire kind of takes forever, but that''s not the staff''s fault. I saw the staff help a less technologically proficient person with sign up. Procedures were quick, and the people were nice.", "author": "Rennie Lum", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101060898363405640782/reviews"}, {"date": "2022-04-05T04:47:16.539768Z", "text": "This clinic has been around for as many years as I can remember.  To me it is the best hidden gem in the City.\n\nFrom the receptions at the front desk, to Winnie the medical assistant at the nurses station, to Shemira the best blood drawer ever, to Dr Williams they are all exceptional!!!!\n\nThe clinic is not just for medical needs.  They also make it convenient and draw blood there.  They even have dentists.  I couldn''t believe how rounds the services were.  I will be telling anyone who is looking for medical and wanting to be treated with respect to go here.  They should get more recognition.  They are all the nicest, most humble, and compassionate human beings I had the please if cross paths with.  If you need medical/dental help this clinic is the best kept secret!!  5 stars does not do the clinic justice, they are a 10!!", "author": "Martha D", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115544547271114352796/reviews"}, {"date": "2021-10-06T04:41:55.178018Z", "text": "Went for Covid-19 vaccinations. Everyone was friendly, welcoming, and seemed like they didn''t want to say \"No.\" I''ll be back for flu shot and booster when it''s available. Plus easier street parking than elsewhere! Thank you, Southeast Health Center!!", "author": "carol velasco", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117013574917759648532/reviews"}, {"date": "2022-04-18T23:48:09.668928Z", "text": "If you want to receive good health care DO NOT and I repeat DO NOT come to Southeast.  Getting an appointment is damn near impossible.  The medical center used to care but here lately the place is in shambles.  I have a very serious medical condition that needs to be looked after and I can''t even get an appointment to see my primary doctor to follow up after having to go to the emergency.  I was asked if I wanted a nurse to call me back, really.   Stay away!", "author": "Robyn Buckins", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102387756977222053989/reviews"}], "website": "https://www.sf.gov/location--southeast-family-health-center", "location": {"latitude": 37.7257193, "longitude": -122.39253519999998}, "services": ["Primary Care", "Dental Care", "Prenatal Care", "Pediatrics", "Podiatry", "Gynecology", "Mental Health Services", "HIV/AIDS Care", "Acupuncture", "Substance Use Treatment", "Nutrition Counseling", "Food Pharmacy", "WIC Supplemental Nutrition Program", "Pharmacy", "Re-entry Support", "Pregnancy Testing"], "insurance": {"notes": "Part of the San Francisco Health Network which provides affordable care; no specific insurance plans are mentioned on the page.", "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": [], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": false}, "highlights": [{"title": "Comprehensive Care for All Ages", "detail": "A full-service health clinic serving people of all ages in the Bayview Hunter''s Point area since 1979.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Wide Range of Services", "detail": "Offers primary care, dental, prenatal, podiatry, pediatrics, gynecology, HIV/AIDS care, acupuncture, nutrition, and substance use treatment.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Affordable Care", "detail": "Provides affordable care through the SF Health Network, likely with sliding fee options for low-income patients.", "category": "insurance"}], "price_tier": "$", "source_url": "https://www.sf.gov/location--southeast-family-health-center", "appointment": {"booking_note": "Call (628) 217-5500 for information or to book an appointment.", "appointment_url": null, "new_patient_note": null, "phone_booking_available": true, "online_booking_available": null, "free_consultation_available": null}, "open_sunday": 