igh blood pressure, sexually transmitted diseases (STDs), and offers confidential HIV testing and counselling, pregnancy testing, prenatal care, mental health services, and vision care. Your health care team is ready and looking forward to taking care of your health care needs as well as the needs of your family. The clinic offers a wide range of services including primary care, dental care, prenatal care, pediatrics, podiatry, gynecology, nutrition counseling, acupuncture, substance use treatment, HIV/AIDS care, re-entry support, and access to a clinic pharmacist. It is a part of the San Francisco Health Network and the San Francisco Department of Public Health.\n\nThe clinic accepts public health insurance and provides services on a sliding fee scale based on income, ensuring that high-quality healthcare is accessible to all community members regardless of their ability to pay. Patients can access care by calling the clinic to schedule an appointment.", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=15590076039076963791&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJyZLcTBh_j4ARz-WCyo4TW9g", "quality_missing": ["insurance", "team_members", "appointment_url"], "search_keywords": ["community health center", "community health", "fqhc", "sliding scale", "medicaid", "medicare", "low cost", "trung tâm y tế cộng đồng", "커뮤니티 헬스", "社区医疗中心", "english", "vietnamese", "tiếng việt", "người việt", "bác sĩ việt", "primary care", "dental care", "prenatal care", "pediatrics", "podiatry", "gynecology", "mental health services", "hiv/aids care", "acupuncture", "substance use treatment", "nutrition counseling", "food pharmacy", "wic supplemental nutrition program", "pharmacy", "re-entry support", "pregnancy testing", "dental", "maternity", "specialty", "mental health", "alternative medicine", "preventive", "social services"], "services_offered": [{"name": "Primary Care", "category": "Primary Care", "description": "Comprehensive medical 