Dedicated to personalized, high-quality dental care, our skilled team provides tailored solutions for every smile. We offer innovative treatments designed to boost your confidence and health, from preventive care to smile makeovers and teeth whitening. Discover the difference of personalized dental care and let us help you achieve optimal oral health for you and your family.', '16427 W Little York Rd, Ste H, Houston, TX 77084', 'Houston', 'TX', '77084', '281-201-6440', ARRAY['English', 'Vietnamese']::text[], 'Dental', FALSE, '{"fax": "281-819-7448", "email": "vfamilydentistrytx@gmail.com", "images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/v-family-dentistry-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/v-family-dentistry-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/v-family-dentistry-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/v-family-dentistry-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/v-family-dentistry-google-5.webp"], "rating": 4.9, "reviews": [{"date": "2026-05-14T16:44:15.913492969Z", "text": "Dr. V and her team were very accommodating, professional, and kind. My cleaning went very well, and they were concerned about the care of my teeth. I''m so glad my son recommended V Family Denistry. They are the dentist office I''ve been looking for. I don''t like chain dentist, so to find a privately owned dental office was exciting for me. Thanks  V Family Dentistry!!!", "author": "Troy Cosse", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118091118752221889985/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-20T05:23:45.695439081Z", "text": "Dr. Vi is the best!!!! I hated the dentist absolutely hated going. Until I started going here! Gentle hands! Makes you feel relaxed ! I went in for an extraction I was so nervous and scared. My appointment was at 3 pm. She numbed the area came back I think she knew I was nervous. She said I’m just make sure it’s numbing. Bam! 1,2 and 3! Alrighty I’m done. I was shocked! No pain during and no pain after! I asked my dad to come with me cause I thought I was gonna be in a lot of pain or whatever. She did it so fast my dad was like I didn’t even get thru the intro of my show. lol it’s a drive for me I live in south east Houston. So to tell yall I drive over here even during traffic hours should tell you everything you need to know! And the staff EXCELLENT NICE WELCOMING ALL THE ABOVE!", "author": "Richard Rodriguez", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104934030770692992076/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-10-29T21:38:39.020677551Z", "text": "I liked the doctor and staff. They were very professional and knowledgeable. They treated me very well and took care of my condition with gentleness. They also explained all the procedures and made me feel very comfortable . Also,  the waiting time was excellent.  The place was clean. Thank you.", "author": "Gladys De La Cruz", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106740579609366862396/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-11-25T03:11:54.237582587Z", "text": "Dr. Franklin was an absolute GEM! Lulu, Brianna, and even the dental assistant (sorry, forgot her name) were just a joy to work with! By far, best dental experience I’ve ever had! I only want to see them whenever I come, and I truly felt comfortable and less nervous there with them! Amazing! ☺️", "author": "Jeremy Hosey", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100895405719826978458/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-01-24T17:04:34.727482110Z", "text": "Th