dia/images/locations/eastside/proof-point-piedmont-eastside-expert-medical-team.jpg", "https://www.piedmont.org/-/media/images/services/executive-health/proof-point-1-executive-health.jpg"], "review_profile": {"rating": 3.9, "source": "google", "themes": [{"theme": "Compassionate care", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients highlight compassionate care in their feedback."}, {"theme": "Friendly staff", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients highlight friendly staff in their feedback."}, {"theme": "Clear explanations", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients highlight clear explanations in their feedback."}, {"theme": "Comfortable visits", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients highlight comfortable visits in their feedback."}], "summary": "Piedmont Eastside Medical Center has a 3.9 star Google rating from 4602 Google reviews. Patients commonly mention compassionate care, friendly staff, clear explanations, comfortable visits.", "review_count": 4602, "concern_themes": [], "positive_themes": [], "featured_reviews": [{"date": "2026-06-21T12:33:48.807201577Z", "text": "My experience at Piedmont Eastside Medical Center this past Thursday was quite pleasant. I was running behind for my appointment and I informed the mammogram department of such. The young lady at the desk was very pleasant and helpful. She told me I would have somewhat of a wait, but for certain I would still be able to have my mammogram done. It turned out that my wait was  minimal (I would have gladly waited anyway because it was my fault that I had to wait) and everything went smoothly! I believe in treating others well no matter the circumstances. So, I am most pleased to publicly say my visit to Eastside Medical Center on Thursday June 18th was most positive. At the end of my visit, the technician most kindly told me that she had enjoyed our conversation during my visit! Great customer servi