d Primary Stroke Center and a Breast Imaging Center of Excellence by the American College of Radiology. The medical team includes over 800 physicians, 1,600 employees, and 80 volunteers dedicated to community health.\n\nPiedmont Eastside provides convenient access with two locations, compassionate care, and a commitment to patient safety and quality. The hospital also offers a range of patient and visitor services, including campus maps, visitor policies, and helpful resources for patients and families.", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=8293276328954316881&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJP_cKkNS79YgRUUh6q-GiF3M", "quality_missing": ["languages (non-default)", "insurance", "team_members", "appointment_url"], "search_keywords": ["hospital", "english", "24/7 emergency services", "bariatric surgery", "behavioral health", "cancer care", "emergency medicine", "heart care", "intensive care", "maternity with neonatal intensive care", "neurosciences", "orthopedic care", "rehabilitation", "robotic surgery", "urgent care", "emergency", "surgical", "mental health", "oncology", "cardiology", "critical care", "maternity", "neurology", "orthopedics"], "services_offered": [{"name": "24/7 Emergency Services", "category": "Emergency", "description": "Emergency care available 24 hours a day, 7 days a week.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Bariatric Surgery", "category": "Surgical", "description": "Weight loss surgery services.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Behavioral Health", "category": "Mental Health", "description": "Mental health services.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Cancer Care", "category": "Oncology", "description": "Comprehensive cancer care services.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Emergency Medicine", "category": "Emergency", "description": "Emergency medical services.", "is_featured": false, "patien