HCPC is the teaching hospital within McGovern Medical School at the University of Texas Health Science Center at Houston (UTHealth). Its team of psychiatrists and psychologists are faculty members in the Louis A. Faillace, MD, Department of Psychiatry and Behavioral Sciences, bringing world-class expertise and professional care to behavioral health services across the region.

UTHealth is a member of the Statewide Behavioral Health Coordinating Council, charged by the Texas Legislature with developing a strategic plan to coordinate behavioral health services statewide. HCPC also received a State of Texas Resolution in recognition of its Joint Commission award as a Top Performer in Key Quality Measures.', '2800 South MacGregor Way, Houston, TX 77021', 'Houston', 'TX', '77021', '713-741-5000', ARRAY['English', 'Vietnamese']::text[], 'Mental Health', FALSE, '{"images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/uthealth-houston-harris-county-psychiatric-center-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/uthealth-houston-harris-county-psychiatric-center-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/uthealth-houston-harris-county-psychiatric-center-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/uthealth-houston-harris-county-psychiatric-center-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/uthealth-houston-harris-county-psychiatric-center-google-5.webp"], "rating": 3.1, "pricing": [{"name": "Inpatient Standard Charges", "notes": "Standard charges for inpatient and outpatient services are available at the Inpatient & Outpatient Standard Charges page.", "price": null, "category": "inpatient", "price_range": null}, {"name": "Outpatient Standard Charges", "notes": "Standard charges for inpatient and outpatient services are available at the Inpatient & Outpatient Standard Charges page.", "price": null, "category": "outpatient", "price_range": null}], "reviews": [{"date": "2026-05-15T14:07:41.926872571Z", "text": "I cannot say enough wonderful things about UT Houston Psychiatric Center. From the moment we walked in the staff was professional and truly caring. They create such a welcoming and supportive environment during difficult times.\n\nA VERY SPECIAL THANK YOU TO NURSE MARLEN RIVERA for the compassion , passion and genuine care shown every step of the way . She went above and beyond to make us feel comfortable, heard and supported.Her kindness and dedication made a difference and will never be forgotten.\nI highly recommend UTPC to anyone who is seeking mental health care ⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️", "author": "naoiale lahlou", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108597622186761802374/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-30T17:26:40.060694338Z", "text": "Truly a nest of vipers. I was stuck in there with dangerous people, there were multiple fights and times where patients had to be sedated for fighting staff members (rightfully so, because they were horrible people), and the entire process would''ve been infinitely better for me if the entire Harris Center system hadn''t been so hostile to me. There was very little offered to keep us occupied, and they also used A.I. on some of the commercials and programs on the TV to keep patients confused, which I very much did not appreciate. They also listen in on all phone calls, and will cut the line at any time if they don''t like what you''re talking about.", "author": "Eric Pflughaupt", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110766647751133757748/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-12-10T08:31:16.724707592Z", "text": "Currently on the phone with them for a mental health emergency with my sister and I''ve been transferred twice within the first two minutes and then left on hold for over 20 min. I''d rather you say you just can''t help than leave me on hold like this for 20min with no answer. That''s precious time I could have spent calling someone who actually could help. Make that 40 min and then I called on another line and they said they couldn''t help so why leave me on hold for 40 min losing precious time to help my sister. Utter bs. I would have been fine with you telling me you can''t help just like everyone else. But you lied and then left me on hold for 40 min with no intention of answering. Morally corrupt in my experience", "author": "Heather Osborn", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102515522437471327411/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-11T12:16:22.928437969Z", "text": "their rude. we waited for yours yesterday for an evaluation just for them to tell us my baby need to be hospitalized but they have no beds. they said we could wait until they have them available.but I left cuz I have another child to pick up from school.....they need a program that''s not first come first served literally when I called they said I had to come to see. .your wasting ppl time and money cuz I paid $15 for parking for nothing and waited for over 4 hours ...  y''all park on the side of the street and save your money..   their in a new facility and it was clean and the Drs were nice.....\n\njust don''t waste ppl time when we call u can look it up that your full so ppl don''t waste gas and money.", "author": "Eunice Davis", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100972293302769025848/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-10-05T05:27:43.218945495Z", "text": "Please do not put yourself or a family member in here. They have the worst doctors here and I also got sexually assaulted by one of the night nurses he was a male African American nurse. I’m guessing he is Nigerian but he worked at night when I was there. I was stuck there for almost two weeks even though I wasn’t even suicidal and went there voluntarily and they would not let me out at all until I called the cops and the number to get this on a case. It was the worst time there and they left us with no water sometimes and the bathrooms were disgusting. Also my family had a horrible time dealing with these people from the outside.", "author": "beautybyana109", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111510428532070222012/reviews"}], "website": "https://hcpc.uth.edu/", "location": {"latitude": 29.712116599999998, "longitude": -95.3744837}, "services": ["Inpatient Psychiatric Care", "Outpatient ECT Services", "Child & Adolescent Services", "Dual Diagnosis Program", "Interpreter and Translation Services"], "insurance": {"notes": "Insurance information not specified on the main page. Call 713-741-5000 for admissions, insurance, and referral details.", "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": [], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": false}, "highlights": [{"title": "Largest Inpatient Psychiatric Provider in Houston", "detail": "HCPC is the largest provider of inpatient psychiatric care in Houston, serving 9,000 patients yearly.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Teaching Hospital", "detail": "HCPC is the teaching hospital within McGovern Medical School at UTHealth, with psychiatrists and psychologists as faculty members.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Joint Commission Top Performer", "detail": "HCPC received a State of Texas Resolution in recognition of its Joint Commission award as a Top Performer in Key Quality Measures.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "24/7 Admissions", "detail": "Admissions are open 24/7 for inpatient psychiatric care.", "category": "convenience"}], "price_tier": "$$", "source_url": "https://hcpc.uth.edu/", "appointment": {"booking_note": "Call 713-741-5000 for general information, admissions, insurance, and referrals. Admissions are open 24/7.", "appointment_url": null, "new_patient_note": null, "phone_booking_available": true, "online_booking_available": false, "free_consultation_available": null}, "open_sunday": true, "scout_query": "Vietnamese speaking hospital in Houston, TX"