 situation with my teeth, she examine, she explained in details what she could do and asked about if I needed medication prior to be treated? I said yes. That is a extremely important because I don''t want to get a bacterial infection that could affect my knee replacement. Later, the other nice receptionist came with a breakdown of the work that the doctor was going tò summit to my insurance, how much it was going to cost me and how much the insurance was going to cover. Overall this place was better, more pleasant, more understanding, more professional. I visited in 2 years anout 30 places and all of those they just care about how much money they can get instead of explaining why they didn''t take certain insurance or just be more polite intead of being dismissal. I recommend this place for those people who want to be treated with respect!", "author": "Bear Lookout", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114852853600232911034/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-06-06T18:02:56.047941575Z", "text": "They are very fast here. They got my 2 kids teeth clean and fill ins done in less than hour. Very friendly and professional. The dentist is great with the kids she was very patient yet efficient", "author": "Tabby Franklin", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117891460135431880986/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-04-03T16:42:41.708397692Z", "text": "Tomasa attended to me and she is such a great and efficient professional  . Soft spoken, articulate and very empathetic. Also the Dr Tarapore that attended to meas well did a fantastic job. Not tobe left out is the front desk person that attended to me from the first day. She is super nice and smart using all available resources to keep you glued to smiley. My visits have been woderful experiences.  Thank you smiley dental skillman for the amazing job.❤️💯👌👍👍👍👍👍", "author": "Funmi Salome Johnson", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https: