illed with important knowledgeable information.  Dr. Shore makes you feel most comfortable and relaxed and is very knowledgeable and answers every question thoroughly.  It is so pleasant to not feel rushed. And his advice is priceless.  I look forward to my next visit!", "author": "Layne Taylor", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103229230428953648599/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-06-08T12:11:38.501885885Z", "text": "Check in was great both ladies were very nice and personable. The mammo tech Morgan was amazing. She was friendly and had a great sense of humor. I appreciate her knowledge and gentle hand as we all know mammograms are very uncomfortable. The US tech was not the best, I felt like she just wanted to get me in and out as quickly as possible. She didn’t answer my questions and I felt very “blown off”.  She could at least smile and have some personality. Also take a minute to answer questions and help me feel like I’ve been heard.", "author": "Brian and Marsha Hanson", "rating": 3, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113355660985600724112/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Patients generally appreciate the friendly and knowledgeable staff at Piedmont Atlanta, though some report inconsistencies in care quality and responsiveness.", "about_highlight": "Piedmont Atlanta is a 643-bed, private, not-for-profit hospital that has played a role in transforming health care across our region for the past 100 years. Nationally recognized for quality and patient satisfaction, we strive to make a positive difference in every life we touch and are committed to the communities we serve. Our state-of-the-art facilities, specialty services and compassionate care teams foster real change close to home.\n\nNamed the top acute-care community hospital in Atlanta in U.S. News and World Report''s ''Best Hospitals'' list, Piedmont Atlanta consistently ranks in the top five among Atlanta hospitals in patient experience scores. You''ll find 24-hour emergency services, plus all major medical, diagnostic and surgical specialties on one campus. We''re staffed by over 1,000 experienced physicians and 4,000 health care professionals, and we are conveniently located in Atlanta''s Buckhead neighborhood.", "appointment_url": "https://www.care.piedmont.org/providers?location=Atlanta", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=10361705813315035831&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJZ2L4-KkF9YgRtyK-3YkszI8", "quality_missing": ["insurance", "team_members"], "search_keywords": ["hospital", "english", "vietnamese", "tiếng việt", "người việt", "bác sĩ việt", "emergency services", "cancer care", "heart care", "orthopedic care", "neurology services", "transplant medicine", "women''s care", "pregnancy and newborn care", "weight loss surgery", "emergency", "oncology", "cardiology", "orthopedics", "neurology", "transplant", "women''s health", "surgery"], "services_offered": [{"name": "Emergency services", "category": "Emergency", "description": "24/7 emergency services", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Cancer care", "category": "Oncology", "description": null, "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Heart care", "category": "Cardiology", "description": null, "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Orthopedic care", "category": "Orthopedics", "description": null, "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Neurology services", "category": "Neurology", "description": null, "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Transplant medicine", "category": "Transplant", "description": null, "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Women''s care", "category": "Women''s Health", "description": null, "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Pregnancy and newborn care", "category": "Women''s Health", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Weight loss surgery", "category": "Surgery", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}], "short_description": "Piedmont Atlanta is a 643-bed, private, not-for-profit hospital in Atlanta''s Buckhead neighborhood, nationally recognized for quality and patient satisfaction.", "google_website_url": "https://www.piedmont.org/locations/piedmont-atlanta?utm_source=directorylisting&utm_medium=seo&utm_campaign=10223&y_source=1_MTI5OTY4MzYtNzE1LWxvY2F0aW9uLndlYnNpdGU%3D", "google_primary_type": "Hospital", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": [], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "1968 Peachtree Rd NW, Atlanta, GA 30309, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/111200603766413160806", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXoezEkEKdQUBBZKuxZ3D58PM7GwSMfrGS3fODGfZBuVjrrcwiY=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Piedmont Atlanta"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/111200603766413160806", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXoezEkEKdQUBBZKuxZ3D58PM7GwSMfrGS3fODGfZBuVjrrcwiY=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Piedmont Atlanta"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/111200603766413160806", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXoezEkEKdQUBBZKuxZ3D58PM7GwSMfrGS3fODGfZBuVjrrcwiY=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Piedmont Atlanta"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/111200603766413160806", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXoezEkEKdQUBBZKuxZ3D58PM7GwSMfrGS3fODGfZBuVjrrcwiY=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Piedmont Atlanta"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/117376244220580619716", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUrPplr7TpZodeiI0K5neST604le-YomMjXLoWskEuJ8eIebOfHHQ=s1