The clinic provides a wide range of services including general outpatient care, specialized departments, health checkup programs, USCIS green card immigration exams, and the Woori Skin Clinic. They also have a membership program and a patient portal for medical records. Woori Medical Group has partnerships with major Korean hospitals such as Seoul St. Mary''s Hospital, Asan Medical Center, and Samsung Medical Center, as well as local San Diego hospitals including Rady Children''s, Scripps, UCSD, and Sharp.', '7825 Engineer Rd. Suite 101 San Diego CA 92111', 'San Diego', 'CA', '92111', '858.277.7111', ARRAY['English', 'Korean', 'Chinese']::text[], 'Primary Care', TRUE, '{"fax": "858.277.7667", "email": "info@sdwoori.com", "images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/woori-medical-group-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/woori-medical-group-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/woori-medical-group-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/woori-medical-group-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/woori-medical-group-google-5.webp"], "rating": 3, "reviews": [{"date": "2025-03-27T05:22:01.262749Z", "text": "I actually don''t know why this place have such a negative review?.Like my visit was awesome when I went with them.\n\nSo fully story. I had to go there to work on my skin, right? The people that treated me was SOOOOOO kind and even went above and beyond to make sure I was comfortable.\n\nMaybe I got in on a good day or something, idk, but I very much enjoy it!\n\nFive star!", "author": "Tu Le", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106735664752819297456/reviews"}, {"date": "2018-08-25T18:51:27.641066Z", "text": "Either this isn''t an organized medical group or they just prefer not to treat other ethnicities.  I was assigned this facility from Tricare. From the time I walked through the door they decided they didn''t want to treat me. Even the RN who never said a word to me behaved in the same manner.  After 40 min of answering why I chose them as a clinic, I finally said, I would just reschedule the appt for a later date.  They all were excited and hurried me out of the door.  As a RN myself,  I would NEVER put a patient in an uncomfortable situation like that.", "author": "Daisy Hodge, RN, PMH-BC", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108873408044987643612/reviews"}, {"date": "2019-08-31T09:20:37.687220Z", "text": "Even tho Physician was very professional they sent medical bill through mail after 4 months from my visitation and charge me nonsense amount of money, even tho I had a insurance at that time but they charge more than visitation without insurance that I have to pay same amount as visitation without insurance(went there with same symptom and do exact same examination)\nI always pay nothing but medication when I use my insurance plan at other offices.\nI ll never go this place again.", "author": "Märklín D", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108880873814862964718/reviews"}, {"date": "2016-03-27T07:29:58.533Z", "text": "We have membership here, and it''s been almost 5 years. They treat us like a family and can make fast appointments. They have really good health check-up systems. I''m not afraid to go there and they are cheaper than most hospitals.", "author": "Art Forever 212 Yujin", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115943787544724998569/reviews"}, {"date": "2022-08-13T15:57:09.232115Z", "text": "We experience in woori Medicare  must do early when the patient was fasting for their blood test coz they fasting how many hours priority", "author": "Delia Milla", "rating": 3, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112774574404699039192/reviews"}], "website": "http://sdwoori.com/", "location": {"latitude": 32.8263119, "longitude": -117.1535402}, "services": ["General Outpatient Care", "Specialized Departments", "Health Checkup Programs", "USCIS Green Card Exam", "Woori Skin Clinic", "Telehealth", "Physical Exams"], "insurance": {"notes": "Insurance details not listed on this page; please visit the insurance page or contact the clinic.", "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": [], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": false}, "highlights": [{"title": "Bilingual Staff", "detail": "Staff speaks Korean, English, and Chinese.", "category": "culture"}, {"title": "Telehealth Available", "detail": "Phone and video consultations available for safe remote care.", "category": "technology"}, {"title": "Same-Day Appointments", "detail": "Same-day appointments available by calling ahead.", "category": "convenience"}, {"title": "Infection Prevention", "detail": "Follows CDC and health department guidelines for infection control.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "USCIS Green Card Exams", "detail": "Immigration medical examinations for green card applicants.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Health Checkup Programs", "detail": "Comprehensive health screening programs available.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Partnerships with Top Hospitals", "detail": "Collaborates with leading Korean and San Diego hospitals.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Woori Skin Clinic", "detail": "Dedicated skin care and dermatology services.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Membership Program", "detail": "Membership program for regular patients.", "category": "insurance"}], "price_tier": "$$", "