The Centre MethodTM comprises three deliberate phases—Diagnose, Plan, Execute—with no shortcuts. Dr. Shi personally performs every surgery, and complex cases that other offices turn away are welcomed. With a 4.9 rating from 168 verified Google reviews, the practice serves patients seeking permanent tooth replacement (with lifetime warranty), All-on-X full-arch implants, cosmetic dentistry, Invisalign, and emergency care.
Conveniently located at 139 Centre St, Suite 306, NYC, Centre Dental is open Monday through Saturday and accepts most PPO insurance plans, filing claims directly for patients. A membership plan is available for those without insurance, ensuring transparent pricing and accessible care.', '139 Centre St, Suite 306, New York, NY 10013', 'New York', 'NY', '10013', '(212) 925-7066', ARRAY['English', 'Cantonese', 'Mandarin', 'Chinese']::text[], 'Dental', FALSE, '{"email": "Centredentalnyc@Gmail.com", "images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/centre-dental-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/centre-dental-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/centre-dental-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/centre-dental-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/centre-dental-google-5.webp"], "rating": 4.8, "reviews": [{"date": "2024-05-06T17:16:23.084978Z", "text": "This dental place is so clean and friendly, the price is really reasonable. Thank Doctor Shi, he’s very knowledgeable and professional, friendly with patient too, well experienced. Great dental care place to choose, specially for people who have problem teeth.", "author": "J X (Winnie Copper)", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100444269911210177194/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-11-24T22:50:59.497144038Z", "text": "Did a consultation for denture today. Very satisfied with Dr.Shi plan. All the staff is very nice. Highly recommend!", "author": "Chiumo Ferrarini", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112022391545087708758/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-01-04T23:44:45.670561Z", "text": "This Chinese dental clinic in Manhattan is really great! Whether it is root canal treatment, teeth cleaning, or orthodontics, the doctors are very professional and careful. The whole diagnosis and treatment process made me feel very reassured. The doctor patiently answered all my questions and provided me with a personalized treatment plan. Especially the dental implant technology, the effect is very natural and completely exceeded my expectations. The clinic environment is clean and comfortable, and the staff is very friendly. I highly recommend this dental clinic to anyone who needs dental care or treatment!", "author": "Zhengqin Liu", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100136567930923238039/reviews"}, {"date": "2024-09-23T19:07:33.051714Z", "text": "The staff at center dental are very professional and friendly.  Dr. Shi is great to work with.  He takes good care of his patients and he explains everything (e.g. the treatment plan) clearly and so far all my dental issues have been handled properly.  Great customer satisfaction with Centre Dental.  Five star review.", "author": "Cheng Niu", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114730452247142498860/reviews"}, {"date": "2023-02-26T19:52:06.116129Z", "text": "I have been here since 2017 and always have a wonderful experience at Centre Dental. I recommended couple of my friends and my bf to come here for treatment and annual examine. I am greeted by the friendly and helpful receptionist, May, who made me feel welcome. The facility was clean. Dr. Shi is incredibly knowledgeable and provided me with helpful advice on how to improve my dental health. He is able to diagnose and treat my dental issue with precision and expertise, and the results have been fantastic. I am so grateful to the team at Centre Dental for their top-notch ca