eeth."}, {"name": "Invisalign", "category": "Orthodontic", "description": "Clear aligner therapy, Dr. Shi is an Invisalign provider.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients wanting orthodontic correction with clear aligners."}, {"name": "Solea Laser Dentistry", "category": "Dental", "description": "Laser-assisted dental treatments for reduced discomfort.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients seeking minimally invasive options."}, {"name": "Pinhole Gum Rejuvenation", "category": "Dental", "description": "Minimally invasive gum recession treatment.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients with gum recession."}, {"name": "Root Canal", "category": "Dental", "description": "Endodontic treatment to save infected teeth.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients with severe tooth pain or infection."}, {"name": "Wisdom Teeth Removal", "category": "Dental", "description": "Surgical extraction of wisdom teeth.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients with impacted or problematic wisdom teeth."}, {"name": "Emergency Dentist", "category": "Emergency", "description": "Emergency dental care for urgent issues.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients in need of immediate dental attention."}, {"name": "Cavity Fillings", "category": "Dental", "description": "Restorative fillings for cavities.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients with tooth decay."}, {"name": "Gum Disease Treatment", "category": "Dental", "description": "Periodontal therapy for gum health.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients with gingivitis or periodontitis."}, {"name": "Dentures", "category": "Dental", "description": "Removable partial or full dentures.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients missing multiple teeth."}, {"name": "Sleep Apnea & Snoring Treatment", "category": "Dental", "description": "Oral appliance therapy for sleep apnea and snoring.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients with sleep-disordered breathing."}, {"name": "Night Guards (Bruxism)", "category": "Dental", "description": "Custom night guards for teeth grinding.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients with bruxism."}, {"name": "Dental Anxiety Care", "category": "Dental", "description": "Comfort-focused care for patients with dental fear.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients with dental anxiety."}], "short_description": "Centre Dental is a bilingual (English, Mandarin, Cantonese) implant and cosmetic dentistry practice in Lower Manhattan, led by Dr. John Shi with over 20 years of experience and a 4.9 rating from 168 reviews.", "google_website_url": "https://www.centredent.com/", "insurance_accepted": ["Delta Dental", "Cigna", "Aetna", "MetLife", "Guardian", "Humana", "Blue Cross Blue Shield", "Principal"], "google_primary_type": "Dental Clinic", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": ["Dr. John Shi"], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "139 Centre St Ste 306, New York, NY 10013, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/117714893200011232387", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVib2V7sf1EkhU3qqgR-_WOd3H0TRCyeezVoZvikdcDE6x3QEA=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Centre Dental/中央牙科"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/112624639511208678953", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWXssW4HB29gk4ny8ybMNiKWbgj5z-XnD_ZPaVf1SAtR4aY-ao=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Li Ming Cheng"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/112624639511208678953", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWXssW4HB29gk4ny8ybMNiKWbgj5z-XnD_ZPaVf1SAtR4aY-ao=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Li Ming Cheng"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/100444269911210177194", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV1q7aFLr013Ea55f5n3xAv6-3mGHFv6Ot59U2yjkR9L36dstHX=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "J X (Winnie Copper)"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/117400999747374548292", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWRNS6P845LWs1OPYXffvQNi9jYhdwIRKAZ5aP4uXuFYgbQz5Q=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Yan Zhen"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-26T12:51:08.546208+00:00', 'centre-dental', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

The website lists services ranging from routine oral-health care to cosmetic treatments and more complex surgical procedures. It also offers in-person visits and virtual options; patients are directed to call to find out which option is right for them.

The site features dentist Cam Ngoc T. Dong, DDS, and lists Hien Ngo, R.D.H. among its doctors. Its navigation also includes a page titled “Dentist | Nha SĨ” for Bellaire Chinatown, indicating a Vietnamese-focused resource, though the source does not explicitly state which languages staff speak.', '9979 Beechnut St Ste I', 'Houston', 'TX', '77036', '(832) 581-3993', ARRAY['English', 'Vietnamese']::text[], 'Dental', TRUE, '{"email": "your@email", "images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/the-favour-dental-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/the-favour-dental-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/the-favour-dental-google-3.webp", "https://thefavourdental.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/new.webp", "https://cdn.userway.org/widgetapp/images/spin_wh.svg", "https://cdn.userway.org/widgetapp/images/body_wh.svg", "https://thefavourdental.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/The-Favour-Dental-Houston-Dentist.png", "https://thefavourdental.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/favour_logo.png", "https://thefavourdental.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Dr.DOng-Top100-Certification-4096x2877.webp", "https://thefavourdental.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/topDentist-Houstonia-2025-1.webp", "https://thefavourdental.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Worlds-Top-100-Doctors.webp", "https://thefavourdental.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/The-Favour-Dental_Fort-Bend-County_Cosmetic-Dentist-4096x1495.webp", "https://thefavourdental.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/The-Favour-Dental-Fort-Bend-County-Cosmetic-Dentist.webp", "https://thefavourdental.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/The-Favour-Dentaloffice-thefavour.dental-9.webp", "https://thefavourdental.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/best-of-logo-277x300-1.webp"], "rating": 4.9, "reviews": [{"date": "2025-11-11T16:03:50.482595007Z", "text": "A few days ago, my mom had a severe toothache, and we were referred to Dr. Cam Ngoc Dong. I immediately scheduled an emergency dental appointment.\nWithin just two hours of treatment, Dr. Dong’s gentle and skillful hands helped my mom feel so much better. The root canal was done quickly, carefully, and professionally.\nMy mom and I are truly grateful and thankful to Dr. Cam Ngoc Dong for the excellent care and compassion.", "author": "Nhi Nguyen", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111758067447480474774/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-18T17:41:24.424665844Z", "text": "Cam on Bac Si Dong Cam Ngoc. Thank you Doctor Dong for taking care of my mom’s infected fractured tooth, she is now free of pain and her gums are no longer bleeding. She feels great now and feels a lot healthier", "author": "Tai Nguyen", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101740343325800945167/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-11-18T15:40:01.238128279Z", "text": "Was amazing with my little brother who had to fill in a cavity. Even when he was moving a lot they were able to handle his hyperactivity while fixing his tooth. The doctor was so nice and she always communicated what she was doing and what she wanted the patient to do. 10/10 loved it here.", "author": "Tracy Sosa", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111266795015820800673/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-08-02T17:02:53.683808897Z", "text": "I had both a root canal treatment and wisdom tooth removal here. The staff were exceptionally friendly and caring from the moment I arrived. Before coming, I watched many TikTok and YouTube videos about side effects and painful recoveries of wisdom teeth removal, but I experienced none of that here, even with the strange positions of my wisdom teeth. I was able to eat and return to normal activities within 4-6 hours. Dr. Ngoc was very kind and explained each step as she worked. Having previously gone to American dental clinics, I can confidently say Ms. Cam Ngoc Dong’s clinic is one of the most affordable yet highest-quality clinics in the U.S.! 100/100!", "author": "Ly Nguyen", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103618652577727935264/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-06-24T13:36:47.466733130Z", "text": "Great experience! The customer service was excellent. Everyone was friendly and helpful from the moment I walked in. The dentist was very nice and thoughtful, taking the time to explain everything clearly and making sure I felt comfortable throughout the visit. Highly recommend !", "author": "Gon Out", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112090203999990659726/reviews"}, {"date": null, "text": "I found this dentist office on Yelp after I found it impossible to get my usual office on the phone to make an appointment, and I must say that I’m soooo glad that they were unavailable because I’ve found a new dental home!! They open really early! I had a 7:30a appointment. Everyone was friendly, thorough, informative, and professional and made me feel right at home!", "author": "Jane", "rating": null, "source": "The Favour Dental website testimonial"}], "website": "https://thefavourdental.com/", "location": {"city": "Houston", "state": "TX", "address": "9979 Beechnut St Ste I", "map_url": null, "parking": null, "transit": null, "zip_code": "77036", "nearby_landmarks": []}, "services": ["General Dentistry", "Cosmetic Dentistry", "Surgical Dentistry", "Bridges", "Crowns Dental", "Dentures", "Emergency Care", "Laser Therapy", "Root Canal", "Reversing Cavities", "Sealants", "Dental Bonding", "Full Mouth Rehabilitation", "Gum Lift & Contour", "Teeth Whitening", "Invisalign / Braces", "No Prep Veneers", "Zirconia Veneers", "All-On-X/ All-On-4", "Gummy Smile Reduction", "Implants", "TMJ/TMD", "Wisdom Teeth", "Oral Cancer 