The clinic accepts major insurance plans including Anthem Blue Cross, Cigna, United Healthcare, and Blue Shield, and is currently accepting new clients. Services range from back pain and chronic pain management to women''s health, weight loss, pediatric growth clinic, anti-aging skincare, and more. Treatment approaches include acupuncture, cupping therapy, myofascial release therapy, and MTS needling.

Located at 3350 Scott Blvd Ste 4902 in Santa Clara, the center is dedicated to unlocking the body''s natural healing ability using time-tested Korean Medicine techniques. Patients can schedule appointments by calling 669-770-5795.', '3350 Scott BLVD Ste 4902, Santa Clara, CA 95054-3134', 'Santa Clara', 'CA', '95054', '669-770-5795', ARRAY['English', 'Korean']::text[], 'Acupuncture & TCM', FALSE, '{"images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/soo-korean-medicine-acupuncture-center-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/soo-korean-medicine-acupuncture-center-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/soo-korean-medicine-acupuncture-center-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/soo-korean-medicine-acupuncture-center-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/soo-korean-medicine-acupuncture-center-google-5.webp"], "rating": 5, "reviews": [{"date": "2025-06-12T01:18:19.790780Z", "text": "I usually go to SOO Korean Medicine & Acu Center whenever I have musculoskeletal or joint pain.\n\nI still remember my very first visit there. I had a stiff neck and couldn’t turn my head to one side. While I was filling out the new patient paperwork, the doctor gave me one acupuncture shot on my left hand — and, to my surprise, I could suddenly move my neck again! It was amazing.\n\nThe clinic is clean and well-maintained since it opened recently, and the staff are all friendly and welcoming. The doctor is highly qualified — she graduated from a reputable medical school in Korea and used to run her own clinic there as well.\n\nTheir acupuncture treatments are top-notch — always quick and effective. They also offer myofascial release therapy, provided by a young male therapist who really listens and adjusts the pressure based on your needs. He does a great job working out muscle and joint stiffness.\n\nThey even offer special treatments for kids and skincare services for women.\n\nIf you''re looking for a trustworthy Korean medicine clinic for the whole family in Silicon Valley, I highly recommend this place.", "author": "Kyoungsoo Kim", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103332365012807462588/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-12-17T02:53:18.369153781Z", "text": "I have been visiting Soo Acupuncture Clinic for the past six months for my back pain and I am very satisfied—I highly recommend it. Out of about five clinics I''ve been to in the last four years in the Bay Area, this one is the most friendly and clean. They are also easy to schedule with and accommodate changes, and I''m happy with the pain relief I feel after the acupuncture and massage.", "author": "윤석", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102378270878376838602/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-12-29T06:21:34.465490238Z", "text": "Very effective acupuncture & massage therapy keep me and my husband coming back to this clinic.\n\nThe doctor is extremely qualified and you can tell she''s so knowledgeable. The entire staff is very attentive and will really listen to you in order to take care of any kind of bodily pain you might have.\n\nI initially came here for shoulder pain, which improved tremendously after getting treated here consistently (about once every 2 weeks). Now we''re working on my lower back since I have some issues with it from working out and I''m seeing great results with that too.\n\nI cannot recommend this place enough. If you''re dealing with any kind of chronic pain that''s hard to manage, give this clinic a try!!", "author": "Aly Park", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105359294956259083455/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-12-29T06:36:20.146115796Z", "text": "Highly recommend this place.\n\nI''ve been suffering from neck pain for years and went to a number of acupuncture centers in both Korea and the US. Doctor Soo is definitely one of the best. She performs extremely precise and skillful acupuncture treatment and it works immediately that you could actually feel the pain go away and have much better circulation in your body.\n\nThis place also provides skincare and they took care of a skin concern on my back which was a pain in the butt for a few years.\n\nIf you are looking for an authentic acupuncture treatment clinic, this is the one.", "author": "Brian Yu", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114994910966921726238/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-02-15T01:41:42.784651Z", "text": "I first visited this clinic upon a friend''s recommendation due to neck and shoulder pain. I received acupuncture and massage treatment once a week for about two months, which significantly improved my condition. Since then, I have continued visiting the clinic periodically for over eight months. The clinic is always clean and quiet, providing a comfortable environment to focus on treatment. The staff is incredibly kind, and the doctors communicate well with patients, ensuring a smooth and reassuring experience. My daughter also suffered from chronic abdominal pain for a long time, but thanks to the doctor’s continuous care, she recovered remarkably quickly. She is now pain-free and enjoying a bright and healthy school life. Because of these experiences, my family has complete trust in this clinic. I highly recommend it to anyone seeking effective and compassionate treatment.", "author": "Hyun Kim", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104139951452594176993/reviews"}], "website": "https://sookoreanmedi.