Patients choose Wentworth Dental for its same-day treatment options, personalized care plans, and convenient location serving neighborhoods like Chinatown, The Loop, and Lincoln Park. The clinic is dedicated to making every visit a positive experience, with a focus on communication, transparency, and patient comfort. Whether you need a simple filling or a full smile makeover, the experienced team is ready to help you achieve optimal oral health.

From emergency dentistry to cosmetic enhancements like clear aligners and dental implants, Wentworth Dental Clinic PC strives to be a trusted partner for your dental journey. The welcoming environment and commitment to ongoing education ensure that patients receive the most advanced care available in a setting that feels like family.', '2323 S Wentworth Ave #202, Chicago, IL 60616', 'Chicago', 'IL', '60616', '(312) 225-5500', ARRAY['English', 'Chinese']::text[], 'Dental', FALSE, '{"email": "23Chan23@gmail.com", "images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/wentworth-dental-clinic-pc-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/wentworth-dental-clinic-pc-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/wentworth-dental-clinic-pc-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/wentworth-dental-clinic-pc-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/wentworth-dental-clinic-pc-google-5.webp"], "rating": 4, "reviews": [{"date": "2025-10-28T19:18:56.430563887Z", "text": "Visiting Wentworth Dental Clinic has been an experience worth sharing. This isn''t the first time I''ve trusted their services: I previously had a dental implant and three crowns, and each procedure was handled with the utmost professionalism and efficiency. The team, led by the exceptional Dr. Chan, is distinguished by their dedication and thoroughness. Although the consultation may involve waiting times due to their personalized attention and the fact that Dr. Chan works directly with her team, the quality of the treatment fully justifies the patience. Wentworth Dental Clinic not only earned my trust but has become my undisputed reference for any dental work. If you require high-level dental care, don''t hesitate to choose a place where professional ethics and excellent service are the standard. I highly recommend trusting Dr. Chan and her team to achieve the oral health you deserve. Your smile is in the best hands.", "author": "Hector Herrera", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112492909903552873700/reviews"}, {"date": "2020-09-30T20:41:09.373387Z", "text": "This place is awesome. My family became patients here for a year, and the care and attention he received were great. This is our only family dentist now. Appointments are easily accessible cause they are very fixable and I love that they can accommodate you based on your needs. The staffs are very friendly and are ready to answer any questions. It seems that they have replaced the new receptionist and assistant team. The new team is more friendly and professional. I like the new smile look of these new young teams. Definitely recommend this dental office!", "author": "Xiong Meiyao", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109396885169811746597/reviews"}, {"date": "2022-09-24T14:50:31.486112Z", "text": "I have gotten several crowns done here, and I highly recommend this place for the price and convenience. It only takes one day to make my crowns, though I had to come twice in one day for it. For the most part though, the procedure each time is super quick and they call me if they finish making the crown early.", "author": "Helena M", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104557460332885323356/reviews"}, {"date": "2021-09-29T23:27:58.237291Z", "text": "Ms. Jamilya did a wonderful job today with my teeth whitening procedure. I have attached 3 images below. The first being the before picture, and the other 2 images being the after procedure pictures. Their new whitening technology was painless and great for sensitive teeth. I would highly recommend as Ms. Jamilya is both meticulous and patient. I''d also like to point out that the procedural cost was very reasonable, as their cost includes both an in-office procedure as well as a take home kit. I have been to different dental offices and always found that they tend to overcharge for such procedures. Thank you Dr. Chan for being so cost friendly and introducing me to Ms. Jamilya! I will definitely be back!", "author": "Karina Wong", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110985771976033950445/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-09-30T01:57:24.130539033Z", "text": "I was recommended to DDS Chen by people I know and had high expectations. Unfortunately, my recent experience with your office was extremely disappointing and ruined my day.\nI scheduled my appointment more than a month in advance and was repeatedly contacted to confirm it. I even took a half day off from work to attend. On the day of the appointment, your staff informed me there would be a 30-minute delay. I still arrived 15 minutes early and waited patiently. However, even almost an hour after my scheduled appointment time, I was still waiting without any explanation. During this time, I saw other patients being admitted while I was left in the waiting area with no update.\nThis lack of communication and disregard for my time left me very upset and I ultimately had to walk away. I followed your scheduling process carefully, but the way this was handled wasted my time and caused me great frustration.\nI hope you will take this complaint seriously and make improvements to avoid this happening to other patients in the future.", "author": "Danny Yao", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115225480879860542998/reviews"}], "website": "https://wentworthdentalclinicpc.com/", "location": {"latitude": 41.850257, "longitude": -87.631676}, "ser