h no update.\nThis lack of communication and disregard for my time left me very upset and I ultimately had to walk away. I followed your scheduling process carefully, but the way this was handled wasted my time and caused me great frustration.\nI hope you will take this complaint seriously and make improvements to avoid this happening to other patients in the future.", "author": "Danny Yao", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115225480879860542998/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Wentworth Dental Clinic PC has a 4.0 star Google rating from 55 Google reviews. Patients commonly mention friendly staff, clear explanations, strong results.", "about_highlight": "Wentworth Dental Clinic PC, located in the heart of Chicago''s Chinatown, combines compassionate care with cutting-edge technology to provide top-tier dental services. Led by Dr. Helen Chan, the clinic offers a comprehensive range of treatments from routine cleanings to advanced restorative and cosmetic procedures. The team leverages modern tools like same-day CEREC crowns, 3D printing, and laser dentistry to ensure precise, comfortable, and efficient care.\n\nPatients choose Wentworth Dental for its same-day treatment options, personalized care plans, and convenient location serving neighborhoods like Chinatown, The Loop, and Lincoln Park. The clinic is dedicated to making every visit a positive experience, with a focus on communication, transparency, and patient comfort. Whether you need a simple filling or a full smile makeover, the experienced team is ready to help you achieve optimal oral health.\n\nFrom emergency dentistry to cosmetic enhancements like clear aligners and dental implants, Wentworth Dental Clinic PC strives to be a trusted partner for your dental journey. The welcoming environment and commitment to ongoing education ensure that patients receive the most advanced care available in a setting that feels like family.", "appointment_url": "https://wen