h-dental-clinic-pc', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

River Oaks Hospital & Clinics offers 24/7 emergency care, advanced imaging (MRI, CT), surgery, and specialized programs like Subacute Trauma. Our physicians and specialists work together to deliver faster diagnosis and treatment—reducing wait times and follow-up visits. The hospital is the only full-service acute care hospital located between Memorial City and the Texas Medical Center, providing a convenient option for Houston residents.', '4200 Twelve Oaks Place, Houston, TX 77027', 'Houston', 'TX', '77027', '(713) 980-7900', ARRAY['English']::text[], 'Hospital', FALSE, '{"images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/river-oaks-hospital-clinics-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/river-oaks-hospital-clinics-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/river-oaks-hospital-clinics-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/river-oaks-hospital-clinics-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/river-oaks-hospital-clinics-google-5.webp", "https://www.adhealthcare.com/assets/TRIANGULO LOGO ADHS.svg", "https://www.adhealthcare.com/assets/TRIANGULO LOGO ADHS.svg", "https://www.adhealthcare.com/assets/TRIANGULO LOGO ADHS.svg", "https://adhealthcare.com/assets/ADHS.png", "https://adhealthcare.com/assets/TRIANGULO LOGO ADHS.svg", "https://adhealthcare.com/assets/TEXTO LOGO ADHS.svg", "https://adhealthcare.com/assets/LOGOS/River Oaks Blue JPG.jpg", "https://adhealthcare.com/assets/home/RIVER OAKS LANDING/IMG 2 RIVER OAKS LANDING@2x.webp", "https://adhealthcare.com/assets/home/RIVER OAKS LANDING/IMG 3 RIVER OAKS LANDING@2x.webp", "https://adhealthcare.com/assets/home/RIVER OAKS LANDING/IMG 4 RIVER OAKS LANDING@2x.webp", "https://adhealthcare.com/assets/HERE''S TO YOUR HEALTH BLANCO.svg", "https://adhealthcare.com/assets/LOGOS/AH_seal_450dpi@3in.png"], "rating": 4.7, "reviews": [{"date": "2026-02-17T21:59:12.149302981Z", "text": "Omg I would recommend this hospital 10 out of 10. To all the nurses physicians  personal care assistants and the 6th floor staff I would personally like to thank you all for THE BEST EXPERIENCE I ever had in an hospital!! I was extremely nervous coming in and although I am still currently inpatient I Know without a doubt I am leaving a better person physically mentally and emotionally!! You all most definitely went beyond my expectations for treatment comfortability cleanliness and care! I can’t thank you all enough I hope that you all know that my life has been changed with this experience. I’ve realized that hospitals aren’t soo scary after all and their are a group of people right here at River Oaks hospital and clinics that are extremely passionate about the care they provide during my stay I pray many blessings to you all And Thanks again I could never forget my stay here", "author": "KROWN''DBY Kween", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105175209030239554696/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-04-30T18:39:31.619887835Z", "text": "Ricardo was extremely nice and friendly and professional .\nAs soon as I came in with my wheelchair and he helped me by moving the chairs out so my wheelchair could fit in the check in area. He also got up several times around to me so I don’t have to go up to him. He filled out my paperwork for me because I can’t due nerve manage on my hand.\nVanessa in PAT was very friendly, personable and helpful. When she did my lab work I didn’t feel the needle she put in.\nShe helped me locating a few items on Amazon to prepare me for my surgery.\nFrank the nurse assistant was very attentive and he anticipated my needs that I didn’t have to ask for anything. He found out my family had not ate anything because they had been waiting a while until my surgery was over. He was kind to provide snacks and helped my mother adjust the tv.\nHe went beyond and above.\n\nEveryone did small kind gestures, small talk, friendly smiles that seemed genuine that made me feel welcomed.\nYou can tell everyone is happy to be here.\nThank You!", "author": "Jeronda Clark", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105622642272038664522/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-05T16:37:38.197662714Z", "text": "Wonderful stay! Miss April was such a joy to be around, very accommodating with visitors and went above and beyond to get the Roku/Tv working. Islan was amazing, also very accommodating to visitors and went above and beyond to find us a sandwich :D Geena was very nice and helpful during our stay, changing the bed sheets and getting water/ snacks whatever is needed.. Even came by just to say hi during our 5 day stay. Yasmin was a delight, same as everyone she was accommodating and helpful with tv issues, water refills and any other needs we may have had. From the kitchen staff, to the nurses, to the housekeeping, I couldn’t have been more comfortable at this location. Keep up the good hospitality! More like a hotel is right.", "author": "Brooke Bohanon", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103817239761276387328/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-10-24T00:46:52.027116705Z", "text": "I cannot say enough wonderful things about Yasmin, the receptionist at River Oaks Hospital and Clinics! From the moment I walked in, she greeted me with the warmest smile and genuine kindness that instantly made me feel at ease. Yasmin has that rare combination of professionalism and empathy. She manages to handle every question and request with such patience and grace. I had come in with my family member who needed assistance and she made me feel so taken care of.\n\nShe goes above and beyond for every patient, whether it’s helping with check-in, scheduling, or just offering a reassuring word during a stressful day. It’s clear she truly cares about the people who walk through those doors. The front desk sets the tone for any clinic experience, and thanks to Yasmin, mine was exceptional.\n\nIf every medical facility had a Yasmin at the front desk, visiting the doctor would feel a whole lot easier. She’s truly a gem and a huge asset to the River Oaks team!", "author": "Manushi Shah", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104123017153701002963/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-17T21:59:39.027886375Z", "text": "My state at River Oaks Hospital was like the best I ever had at the hospital from the time I came in. The staff was very friendly and nice. I was admitted on the sixth floor when I say the whole staff was great. They were great. They were friendly. They were understanding and very helpful. They also was there when you needed them. I must say these guys are very good at their job every one of them. I also hate a couple of favorites, Miss Vicky, Miss Helen, also Islam in other styles but overall, I have to give it to every staff there they were awesome they make you feel comfortable and right at home. I give them a 10 all the way.", "author": "Kristy Frazier", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101830902124408552858/reviews"}], "website": "https://adhealthcare.com/locations/river-oaks/", "location": {"latitude": 29.731026099999998, "longitude": -95.44493419999999}, "services": ["24/7 Emergency Room", "Diagnostic Imaging", "Surgery", "Vascular Care", "Subacute Trauma", "Pharmacy", "Multispecialty Clinics"], "insurance": {"notes": "Call (713) 980-7900 to verify your coverage.", "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": true, "accepted_networks": ["Most major insurance plans", "Worker''s Compensation", "Medicare"], "out_of_n