filled out my paperwork for me because I can’t due nerve manage on my hand.\nVanessa in PAT was very friendly, personable and helpful. When she did my lab work I didn’t feel the needle she put in.\nShe helped me locating a few items on Amazon to prepare me for my surgery.\nFrank the nurse assistant was very attentive and he anticipated my needs that I didn’t have to ask for anything. He found out my family had not ate anything because they had been waiting a while until my surgery was over. He was kind to provide snacks and helped my mother adjust the tv.\nHe went beyond and above.\n\nEveryone did small kind gestures, small talk, friendly smiles that seemed genuine that made me feel welcomed.\nYou can tell everyone is happy to be here.\nThank You!", "author": "Jeronda Clark", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105622642272038664522/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-05T16:37:38.197662714Z", "text": "Wonderful stay! Miss April was such a joy to be around, very accommodating with visitors and went above and beyond to get the Roku/Tv working. Islan was amazing, also very accommodating to visitors and went above and beyond to find us a sandwich :D Geena was very nice and helpful during our stay, changing the bed sheets and getting water/ snacks whatever is needed.. Even came by just to say hi during our 5 day stay. Yasmin was a delight, same as everyone she was accommodating and helpful with tv issues, water refills and any other needs we may have had. From the kitchen staff, to the nurses, to the housekeeping, I couldn’t have been more comfortable at this location. Keep up the good hospitality! More like a hotel is right.", "author": "Brooke Bohanon", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103817239761276387328/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-10-24T00:46:52.027116705Z", "text": "I cannot say enough wonderful things about Yasmin, the receptionist at River Oaks Hospital and Clinics! From the moment I walked in, she greeted me with the warmest smile and genuine kindness that instantly made me feel at ease. Yasmin has that rare combination of professionalism and empathy. She manages to handle every question and request with such patience and grace. I had come in with my family member who needed assistance and she made me feel so taken care of.\n\nShe goes above and beyond for every patient, whether it’s helping with check-in, scheduling, or just offering a reassuring word during a stressful day. It’s clear she truly cares about the people who walk through those doors. The front desk sets the tone for any clinic experience, and thanks to Yasmin, mine was exceptional.\n\nIf every medical facility had a Yasmin at the front desk, visiting the doctor would feel a whole lot easier. She’s truly a gem and a huge asset to the River Oaks team!", "author": "Manushi Shah", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104123017153701002963/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-17T21:59:39.027886375Z", "text": "My state at River Oaks Hospital was like the best I ever had at the hospital from the time I came in. The staff was very friendly and nice. I was admitted on the sixth floor when I say the whole staff was great. They were great. They were friendly. They were understanding and very helpful. They also was there when you needed them. I must say these guys are very good at their job every one of them. I also hate a couple of favorites, Miss Vicky, Miss Helen, also Islam in other styles but overall, I have to give it to every staff there they were awesome they make you feel comfortable and right at home. I give them a 10 all the way.", "author": "Kristy Frazier", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101830902124408552858/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Patients overwhelmingly praise River Oaks Hospital & Clinics for exceptional care, highlighting the friendly, professional staff and comfortable environment that made their stays positive and reassuring.", "about_highlight": "As the largest facility in the Advanced Diagnostics network, River Oaks Hospital & Clinics delivers complete, physician-led care. Patients have access to a 24-hour ER, advanced imaging (MRI, CT, ultrasound), surgical suites, pharmacy, and multispecialty clinics—all under one roof with private rooms and valet parking. Private inpatient suites, complimentary valet parking, and concierge support ensure a comfortable experience. Care teams are fully connected: your diagnosis, treatment, and follow-up happen with the same physicians, reducing delays and repeat visits.\n\nRiver Oaks Hospital & Clinics offers 24/7 emergency care, advanced imaging (MRI, CT), surgery, and specialized programs like Subacute Trauma. Our physicians and specialists work together to deliver faster diagnosis and treatment—reducing wait times and follow-up visits. The hospital is the only full-service acute care hospital located between Memorial City and the Texas Medical Center, providing a convenient option for Houston residents.", "appointment_url": "https://app.smartsheet.com/b/form/6a8a2df8c25046798f3fed635e4f51e9", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=12508254298609836685&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJjdHkMaHBQIYRjWLkVAM_lq0", "important_links": [{"url": "https://adhealthcare.com/hospitals-clinics", "text": "LOCATIONS"}, {"url": "https://adhealthcare.com/services-specialties", "text": "SERVICES & SPECIALTIES"}, {"url": "https://app.smartsheet.com/b/form/6a8a2df8c25046798f3fed635e4f51e9", "text": "SCHEDULE AN APPOINTMENT"}, {"url": "https://adhealthcare.com/contact-us", "text": "CONTACT US"}, {"url": "https://app.smartsheet.com/b/form/6a8a2df8c25046798f3fed635e4f51e9", "text": "Schedule an Appointment"}, {"url": "https://app.smartsheet.com/b/form/6a8a2df8c25046798f3fed635e4f51e9", "text": "Schedule Your Visit"}, {"url": "https://adhealthcare.com/contact-us", "text": "Contact Us"}, {"url": "https://ezcost.info/easthoustonhospital", "text": "Price Transparency EHHC"}, {"url": "https://ezcost.info/advanceddallas", "text": "Price Transparency ADHC"}, {"url": "https://ezcost.info/riveroakshospital", "text": "Price Transparency ROHC"}, {"url": "https://ezcost.info/easthoustonhospital", "text": "Price Transparency AHSH"}, {"url": "https://www.facebook.com/AdvancedDiagnosticsHealthcareSystem", "text": "Facebook"}], "json_ld_schemas": [{"@graph": [{"@id": "https://www.adhealthcare.com/hospitals-clinics/river-oaks-hospital-clinics/#webpage", "url": "https://www.adhealthcare.com/hospitals-clinics/river-oaks-hospital-clinics/", "name": "River Oaks Hospital & Clinics | 24/7 ER in Houston", "@type": "WebPage", "about": {"@id": "https://www.adhealthcare.com/hospitals-clinics/river-oaks-hospital-clinics/#hospital"}, "isPartOf": {"@id": "https://www.adhealthcare.com#website", "url": "https://www.adhealthcare.com", "name": "Advanced Diagnostics Healthcare System", "@type": "WebSite"}, "breadcrumb": {"@id": "https://www.adhealthcare.com/hospitals-clinics/river-oaks-hospital-clinics/#breadcrumb"}, "inLanguage": "en-US", "description": "River Oaks Hospital Houston – 24/7 ER, surgery, MRI/CT imaging & vascular care. Walk-ins welcome. Call (713) 980-7900."}, {"@id": "https://www.adhealthcare.com/hospitals-clinics/river-oaks-hospital-clinics/#breadcrumb", "@type": "BreadcrumbList", "itemListElement": [{"item": "https://www.adhealthcare.com", "name": "Home", "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1}, {"item": "https://www.adhealthcare.com/hospitals-clinics/", "name": "Hospitals & Clinics", "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2}, {"item": "https://www.adhealthcare.com/hospitals-clinics/river-oaks-hospital-clinics/", "name": "River Oaks Hospital & Clinics", "@type": "ListItem", "position": 3}]}, {"@id": "https://www.adhealthcare.com/hospitals-clinics/river-oaks-hospital-clinics/#hospital", "geo": {"@type": "GeoCoordinates", "latitu