Known for its warm, patient-first approach and transparent insurance guidance, the bilingual care team supports patients in English, Mandarin, and Vietnamese—making routine checkups, dental implants, and same-day emergency visits comfortable for every generation of the family.', '29 S 13th St, San Jose, CA 95112, USA', 'San Jose', 'CA', '95112', '(408) 586-9663', ARRAY['English', 'Mandarin', 'Vietnamese']::text[], 'Dental', FALSE, '{"email": "GreatCareDental@gmail.com", "images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/great-care-dental-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/great-care-dental-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/great-care-dental-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/great-care-dental-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/great-care-dental-google-5.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/great-care-dental.webp"], "rating": 5, "reviews": [{"date": "2026-06-01T19:28:09.596597222Z", "text": "I had a severe toothache and was in a lot of pain. The team at Great Care Dental was able to see me quickly and made the entire process smooth and comfortable. They carefully explained my options and removed the problem tooth, which provided immediate relief from the pain. The staff was kind, professional, and genuinely cared about my comfort throughout the procedure. I’m very grateful for their help and would highly recommend them to anyone needing dental care or emergency treatment.", "author": "sravan paruchuru", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102740175129714429136/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-04-24T20:06:15.556778051Z", "text": "The Great Care Dental Clinic is awesome! Everyone there is kind and they work hard to explain insurance stuff clearly. They take their jobs seriously and treat you with real kindness. I also love how clean and nice the office looks—it makes going to the dentist much more comfortable.", "author": "Olivia Yi", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103816388353923884989/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-06-01T21:25:56.875667359Z", "text": "Had bridge tooth pain, Dr. Lee was available and provided a thorough exam. Front desk was very welcoming, detailed, and helpful. Easy booking, very happy with the experience. This is my new dental office.", "author": "Sean Lee", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106889696821811721532/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-11-04T19:27:47.385713684Z", "text": "After visiting several dental clinics this year, I’m so glad I finally found Great Care Dental. The entire team is professional, attentive, and genuinely caring. Dr. Andrew Lee took the time to explain every detail and made sure I felt comfortable throughout my visit. The clinic is clean, well-organized, and most importantly, honest. Highly recommend!", "author": "Evelyn Wang", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105485577437750637032/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-31T02:00:44.395821468Z", "text": "They had excellent medical skills and provided outstanding service. They extracted my husband''s tooth, removed the lesion, and charged a reasonable fee. I am very grateful!", "author": "Vivian Zou", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105085719349132741188/reviews"}], "website": "http://greatcaredental.org/", "location": {"city": null, "state": null, "address": null, "map_url": null, "park