The clinic''s website features educational resources including articles, books, and useful links to help patients understand the benefits of acupuncture and herbal medicine. With a focus on natural and integrative treatments, Acupuncture & Herb Clinic serves both new and returning patients seeking alternative or complementary healthcare options.

Patients can easily reach the clinic by phone, email, or through the online contact form. The staff aims to create a welcoming environment where individuals can explore how acupuncture and herbs can support their health goals.', '18170 Dallas Pkwy Ste 102, Dallas, TX 75287', 'Dallas', 'TX', '75287', '(972) 680-0121', ARRAY['English', 'Chinese']::text[], 'Acupuncture & TCM', FALSE, '{"email": "wang1259@aol.com", "images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/acupuncture-herb-clinic-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/acupuncture-herb-clinic-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/acupuncture-herb-clinic-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/acupuncture-herb-clinic-google-4.webp"], "rating": 4.6, "reviews": [{"date": "2025-07-30T15:06:49.927603051Z", "text": "Wonderful experience with Dr. Wang! A good friend of mine has been seeing her monthly, and the results have been amazing: her back pain, headaches, sciatica, and even anxiety have all significantly improved. Dr. Wang is knowledgeable, gentle, and truly cares about her patients'' well-being. Highly recommend!", "author": "Andre Sie", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113345975446631718439/reviews"}, {"date": "2024-02-26T17:14:40.789432Z", "text": "Very rarely found TCM Director nowadays. Dr Wang truly practices this for her passion in TCM and helping her patients, not for money. She is very organized, patient, listens, efficient, but very to the point. She curated my medical records carefully, more than I care about myself. She added additional procedure like cupping in my treatment without charging additional. My symptom has significantly improved since coming here.Dr Wang’s place is not only for acupuncture but my relax and therapeutic haven.", "author": "Mia Ooh", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100844164178396451809/reviews"}, {"date": "2023-04-07T05:36:24.734068Z", "text": "Dr. Yiming Wang transformed my life.  I came to see her after visiting 10+ MD''s to discover why I had no energy and slept all of the time. I had very little hope for a better future.  She gave me a short TCM exam and said she knew what was wrong with me and could help.  My condition had degenerated for a long time and she worked with me for months, it''s not magic.  I quickly started improving.  My hope was restored.  She helped restore my health and maintain it.  Healing is her passion.  She listens and designs a treatment of acupuncture, herbs and other modalities for many conditions. Thank you doctor for restoring my health and hope and enabling a happy future!", "author": "Jeff Williams", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113258240622082059925/reviews"}, {"date": "2020-02-26T22:04:18.909497Z", "text": "I have pretty bad anxiety and stress levels where my heart races or skips a beat every three beats. After treatment, my entire mood, sensation, and breathing improves dramatically. My visits are usually bi weekly now as my stress starts to build up again. Everyone needs this, Dr. Wang will put you in a good postion in health.  My anxiety and stress is erased like it was never there.", "author": "Steven Ha", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117508508499912564728/reviews"}, {"date": "2019-08-11T15:44:54.190738Z", "text": "Dr. Wang is not only an absolute expert and experienced acupuncturist, but also a passionate educator on Chinese Traditional Medicine. She has been college professor and been invited to different universities to speak on philosophies on holistic treatments in the Chinese Medicine. During a recent session with her, she not only effectively treated my discomfort, but COMPREHENSIVELY and PATIENTLY explained to me why I was feeling the way I felt, the Chinese Medicine theory behind the symptoms, and how I can prevent them from getting worse. I walked away feeling not only physically better, but educated as well.", "author": "Kai Fu", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112912548464285566632/reviews"}], "website": "http://www.us-acupuncture.com", "location": {"latitude": 32.9962703, "longitude": -96.82773089999999}, "services": ["Acupuncture", "Herbal Medicine", "Therapy Sessions"], "insurance": {"notes": null, "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": [], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": false}, "highlights": [{"title": "Acupuncture Treatments", "detail": "The clinic provides acupuncture as a core therapy for pain relief, stress reduction, and overall wellness.", "category": "services"}, {"title": "Herbal Medicine", "detail": "Custom herbal formulations and products are used to complement acupuncture treatments.", "category": "services"}, {"title": "Educational Resources", "detail": "Patients have access to articles, books, and useful links to learn about traditional Chinese medicine.", "category": "convenience"}], "price_tier": "$$", "source_url": "http://www.us-acupuncture.com/", "appointment": {"booking_note": null, "appointment_url": null, "new_patient_note": null, "phone_booking_available": true, "online_booking_available": false, "free_consultation_available": null}, "open_sunday": false, "scout_query": "Chinese speaking medical clinic in Dallas, TX", "search_text": "acupuncture & tcm | acupuncture | chinese medicine | tcm | herbal medicine | cupping | pain relief | châm cứu | đông y | y học cổ truyền | 한의원 | 침술 | 한약 | 中医 | 针灸 | 中药 | english | chinese | mandarin | cantonese | 中文 