s are usually bi weekly now as my stress starts to build up again. Everyone needs this, Dr. Wang will put you in a good postion in health.  My anxiety and stress is erased like it was never there.", "author": "Steven Ha", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117508508499912564728/reviews"}, {"date": "2019-08-11T15:44:54.190738Z", "text": "Dr. Wang is not only an absolute expert and experienced acupuncturist, but also a passionate educator on Chinese Traditional Medicine. She has been college professor and been invited to different universities to speak on philosophies on holistic treatments in the Chinese Medicine. During a recent session with her, she not only effectively treated my discomfort, but COMPREHENSIVELY and PATIENTLY explained to me why I was feeling the way I felt, the Chinese Medicine theory behind the symptoms, and how I can prevent them from getting worse. I walked away feeling not only physically better, but educated as well.", "author": "Kai Fu", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112912548464285566632/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Patients consistently praise Dr. Wang for her expertise, compassionate care, and effective treatments, highlighting significant improvements in their health and well-being.", "about_highlight": "Acupuncture & Herb Clinic is a traditional Chinese medicine practice that combines acupuncture and herbal therapies to support patient wellness. Located in the Dallas-Fort Worth area, the clinic offers acupuncture treatments, herbal formulations, therapy sessions, and wellness products designed to restore balance and alleviate a variety of health concerns. The clinic is led by experienced practitioners who emphasize a holistic, patient-centered approach to healing.\n\nThe clinic''s website features educational resources including articles, books, and useful links to help patients understand the benefits of acupuncture and herbal medicine. With a focus on natural and integrative treatments, Acupuncture & Herb Clinic serves both new and returning patients seeking alternative or complementary healthcare options.\n\nPatients can easily reach the clinic by phone, email, or through the online contact form. The staff aims to create a welcoming environment where individuals can explore how acupuncture and herbs can support their health goals.", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=3117959539419245766&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJVQtmHfEjTIYRxuwfc643RSs", "quality_missing": ["working_hours", "insurance", "team_members", "appointment_url"], "search_keywords": ["acupuncture & tcm", "acupuncture", "chinese medicine", "tcm", "herbal medicine", "cupping", "pain relief", "châm cứu", "đông y", "y học cổ truyền", "한의원", "침술", "한약", "中医", "针灸", "中药", "english", "chinese", "mandarin", "cantonese", "中文", "普通话", "国语", "粤语", "广东话", "华人", "therapy sessions", "therapy", "products"], "services_offered": [{"name": "Acupuncture", "category": "Therapy", "description": "Traditional acupuncture treatments to restore energy balance and address various health conditions.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Herbal Medicine", "category": "Products", "description": "Custom-blended herbal formulas and tea preparations for internal and external use.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Therapy Sessions", "category": "Therapy", "description": "Additional therapeutic modalities offered alongside acupuncture and herbs.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}], "short_description": "Acupuncture & Herb Clinic is a traditional Chinese medicine practice offering acupuncture, herbal therapies, and wellness products in the Dallas-Fort Worth area.", "google_website_url": "http://www.us-acupuncture.com/", "google_primary_type": "Medical Clinic", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": [], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "18170 Dallas Pkwy Ste 102, Dallas, TX 75287, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/102048876677384791647", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKrbygCtwLasZHjULbai0GLxwzP-gjKBH3-816w9AL7y2cJQA=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "N V"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/102048876677384791647", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKrbygCtwLasZHjULbai0GLxwzP-gjKBH3-816w9AL7y2cJQA=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "N V"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/102048876677384791647", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKrbygCtwLasZHjULbai0GLxwzP-gjKBH3-816w9AL7y2cJQA=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "N V"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/117508508499912564728", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXcvD9UX7KnF5R04cbsNnNAzvdzBAfC5iFFVNFtgK_xa0dzfbi_9w=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Steven Ha"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-26T11:14:49.232427+00:00', 'acupuncture-herb-clinic', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

Cardioclinic provides cardiac testing, preventive cardiology, rhythm evaluation, and cardiovascular care across Greater Houston, Fort Bend County, Brazoria County, Harris County, and Wharton County, with convenient locations including Sugar Land, Richmond, Rosenberg, Fulshear, Pearland, Wharton, Memorial City, and North Houston. Dr. Khan sees patients at Richmond / Aliana, Fulshear, and Sugar Land locations.', '18440 W Airport Blvd Ste 300, Richmond, TX 77407', 'Richmond', 'TX', '77407', '1-346-279-2221', ARRAY['Hindi', 'Arabic', 'English', 'Urdu', 'Punjabi', 'Vietnamese']::text[], 'Cardiology', FALSE, '{"email": "info@cardioclinic.us", "images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/cardioclinic-dr.-zaka-khan-md-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/cardioclinic-dr.-zaka-khan-md-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/cardioclinic-dr.-zaka-khan-md-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/cardioclinic-dr.-zaka-khan-md-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/cardioclinic-dr.-zaka-khan-md-google-5.webp"], "rating": 4.9, "reviews": [{"date": "2025-09-09T21:17:00.193471985Z", "text": "Dr Khan and his staff were excellent. They took an adequate amount of time to listen to my concerns. The wait time was very short. I highly  recommend his office.", "author": "Thomas Cress", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100432073678033194760/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-06-28T03:09:49.220706437Z", "text": "I had a great experience with each one of the staffs were very helpful in getting me in and out . Dr Zaka amazing and fully supportive and extremely knowledgeable in his field.\nThank you all from deep heart.", "author": "Mike Bell.", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117431911635064532776/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-11-25T20:29:19.583169478Z", "text": "Dr. Zaka is great and very thorough. He is very professional and listens to what you have to say. The staff are great, kind and professional. I am glad I was referred to him by my PCP. Thanks for great service.", "author": "Tammy C", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113030551313563439190/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-10-14T15:01:00.857864372Z", "text": "Staff was very professional and kind. No long waiting for Dr. Khan. Dr Khan spoke with my cardiologist prior to him coming in to see me. Very knowledgeable about my health issues and easy to talk with. I left the office with full understanding of what the next step would be for me medically. I would recommend Dr.Khan to friends and family.", "author": "Carol Eilers", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116529041339996308805/reviews"}, {"date": "2024-11-05T13:56:50.911445Z", "text": "I recently had the pleasure of visiting Dr. Zaka Khan, and I can confidently say that it was an outstanding experience. Dr. Khan''s professionalism, expertise, and compassionate approach immediately put me at ease. He took the time to thoroughly explain my treatment options and answered all of my questions with patience and care.\n\nWhat truly set this visit apart, however, was the incredible staff. Everyone I interacted with was courteous, efficient, and genuinely focused on providing the best care possible.\n\nIt''s rare to find such a well-coordinated, supportive team, and it''s clear that Dr. Khan fosters a positive and patient-centered environment. I highly recommend Dr. Zaka Khan for anyone seeking top-notch care in a friendly, professional setting.", "author": "Ejaz Mohammad", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109952244522672149284/reviews"}], "website": "https://cardioclinic.us/providers/zaka-khan-md/", "location": {"latitude": 29.651057200000004, "longitude": -95.70511909999999}, "services": ["Atrial Fibrillation (AFib) Evaluation and Treatment", "Arrhythmia Evaluation", "Catheter Ablation Consultation", "Pacemaker and ICD Care", "EKG / Electrocardiogram", "Holter Monitoring", "Event Monitoring", "Echocardiogram", "Preventive Cardiology"], "insurance": {"notes": "View all accepted insurances at https://cardioclinic.us/insurance/", "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": ["Aetna", "Blue Cross Blue Shield", "Cigna", "Oxford Health", "UnitedHealthcare"], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": true}, "highlights": [{"title": "Heart Rhythm Specialist", "detail": "Specialized in AFib, SVT, VT, palpitations, irregular heartbeat, and device-related rhythm care.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Advanced Training", "detail": "Cardiovascular disease and cardiac electrophysiology fellowship training.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Multiple Locations", "detail": "Richmond / Aliana, Fulshear, and Sugar Land scheduling access.", "category": "convenience"}, {"title": "Clear Communication", "detail": "Patient-focused explanations, personalized care planning, and multilingual support.", "category": "culture"}], "price_tier": "$$", "source_url": "https://cardioclinic.us/providers/zaka-khan-md/?utm_source=google&utm_medium=organic&utm_campaign=gbp_zaka_khan", "appointment": {"booking_note": "Schedule by calling (346) 279-2221 or using the online appointment link.", "appointment_url": "https://cardioclinic.us/cardioclinic-locations", "new_patient_note": null, "phone_booking_available": true, "online_booking_available": true, "free_consultation_available": null}, "open_sunday": false, "scout_query": "Vietn