remely knowledgeable in his field.\nThank you all from deep heart.", "author": "Mike Bell.", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117431911635064532776/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-11-25T20:29:19.583169478Z", "text": "Dr. Zaka is great and very thorough. He is very professional and listens to what you have to say. The staff are great, kind and professional. I am glad I was referred to him by my PCP. Thanks for great service.", "author": "Tammy C", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113030551313563439190/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-10-14T15:01:00.857864372Z", "text": "Staff was very professional and kind. No long waiting for Dr. Khan. Dr Khan spoke with my cardiologist prior to him coming in to see me. Very knowledgeable about my health issues and easy to talk with. I left the office with full understanding of what the next step would be for me medically. I would recommend Dr.Khan to friends and family.", "author": "Carol Eilers", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116529041339996308805/reviews"}, {"date": "2024-11-05T13:56:50.911445Z", "text": "I recently had the pleasure of visiting Dr. Zaka Khan, and I can confidently say that it was an outstanding experience. Dr. Khan''s professionalism, expertise, and compassionate approach immediately put me at ease. He took the time to thoroughly explain my treatment options and answered all of my questions with patience and care.\n\nWhat truly set this visit apart, however, was the incredible staff. Everyone I interacted with was courteous, efficient, and genuinely focused on providing the best care possible.\n\nIt''s rare to find such a well-coordinated, supportive team, and it''s clear that Dr. Khan fosters a positive and patient-centered environment. I highly recommend Dr. Zaka Khan for anyone seeking top-notch care in a friendly, professional setting.", "author": "Ejaz Mohammad", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109952244522672149284/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "CARDIOCLINIC - Dr. Zaka Khan, MD has a 4.9 star Google rating from 331 Google reviews. Patients commonly mention compassionate care, friendly staff, clear explanations, comfortable visits.", "about_highlight": "Dr. Zaka Khan is a cardiologist with specialized training in Cardiac Electrophysiology and Cardiovascular Diseases. His clinical focus includes diagnosis and treatment of complex heart rhythm disorders, including atrial fibrillation, supraventricular tachycardia, ventricular tachycardia, and other arrhythmias. Dr. Khan’s care style is centered on helping patients understand their diagnosis, review available treatment options, and make informed decisions about long-term heart health. His background in electrophysiology allows him to evaluate rhythm concerns ranging from common palpitations to complex arrhythmias requiring advanced testing or procedures.\n\nCardioclinic provides cardiac testing, preventive cardiology, rhythm evaluation, and cardiovascular care across Greater Houston, Fort Bend County, Brazoria County, Harris County, and Wharton County, with convenient locations including Sugar Land, Richmond, Rosenberg, Fulshear, Pearland, Wharton, Memorial City, and North Houston. Dr. Khan sees patients at Richmond / Aliana, Fulshear, and Sugar Land locations.", "appointment_url": "https://cardioclinic.us/cardioclinic-locations", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=10862366436108991767&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJOwcH6uuWFwURF_1m7LjgvpY", "quality_missing": [], "search_keywords": ["cardiology", "cardiologist", "heart doctor", "ekg", "blood pressure", "tim mạch", "bác sĩ tim", "심장내과", "心脏科", "心血管", "hindi", "arabic", "english", "urdu", "punjabi", "vietnamese", "tiếng việt", "người việt", "bác sĩ việt", "atrial fibrillation (afib) evaluation and treatment", "arrhythmia evaluation", "catheter ablation consultation", "pacemaker and icd care", "ekg / electrocardiogram", "holter monitoring", "event monitoring", "echocardiogram", "preventive cardiology", "treatment", "diagnostic", "preventive", "aetna", "blue cross blue shield", "cigna", "oxford health", "unitedhealthcare", "dr. zaka khan, md", "cardiac electrophysiologist & cardiologist"], "cultural_context": "Dr. Zaka Khan and the Cardioclinic team offer multilingual support in English, Arabic, Hindi, Punjabi, and Urdu, making heart rhythm care accessible to South Asian and Middle Eastern patients in the Greater Houston area.", "services_offered": [{"name": "Atrial Fibrillation (AFib) Evaluation and Treatment", "category": "Treatment", "description": "Diagnosis and management of AFib including EKG, rhythm monitoring, medication review, stroke-risk evaluation, ablation consultation, and long-term AFib management.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients with racing heartbeat, fluttering, skipped beats, shortness of breath, fatigue, dizziness, or AFib detected by wearable device."}, {"name": "Arrhythmia Evaluation", "category": "Diagnostic", "description": "Evaluation of complex cardiac arrhythmias including supraventricular tachycardia, ventricular tachycardia, and other rhythm disorders.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients with palpitations, irregular heartbeat, dizziness, fainting, or abnormal rhythm testing."}, {"name": "Catheter Ablation Consultation", "category": "Treatment", "description": "Consultation for catheter ablation of complex arrhythmias such as atrial fibrillation, ventricular tachycardia, and supraventricular tachycardia.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients with recurrent or symptomatic arrhythmias who may benefit from ablation."}, {"name": "Pacemaker and ICD Care", "category": "Treatment", "description": "Cardiac device therapy evaluation and follow-up, including conventional and leadless pacemakers and implantable cardioverter-defibrillators.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients with pacemaker or ICD needs, including follow-up and device management."}, {"name": "EKG / Electrocardiogram", "category": "Diagnostic", "description": "Records the electrical activity of the heart during a short test to detect AFib, slow rhythm, fast rhythm, or other abnormal rhythm patterns.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients with symptoms of irregular heartbeat or as part of routine evaluation."}, {"name": "Holter Monitoring", "category": "Diagnostic", "description": "Records heart rhythm over a longer period to detect rhythm problems that do not appear during a short office visit.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients with intermittent symptoms or abnormal EKG findings."}, {"name": "Event Monitoring", "category": "Diagnostic", "description": "Longer-term rhythm tracking for symptoms that occur less frequently.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients with infrequent symptoms needing extended monitoring."}, {"name": "Echocardiogram", "category": "Diagnostic", "description": "Ultrasound evaluation of heart structure and function, including pumping strength, chamber size, and valve function.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients with suspected structural heart disease or as part of comprehensive evaluation."}, {"name": "Preventive Cardiology", "category": "Preventive", "description": "Cardiovascular risk reduction, management of high blood pressure, high cholesterol, and family history of heart disease.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients seeking long-term heart health and prevention."}], "short_description": "Heart rhythm care, AFib treatment, arrhythmia evaluation, ablation consultation, pacemaker/ICD care, and preventive cardiology in Richmond / Aliana, Fulshear, and Sugar Land.", "google_website_url": "https://cardioclinic.us/providers/zaka-khan-md/?utm_source=google&utm_medium=organic&utm_campaign=gbp_zaka_khan", "insurance_accepted": ["Aetna", "Blue Cross Blue Shield", "Cigna", "Oxford Health", "UnitedHealthcare"], "google_primary_type": "Doctor", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": ["Dr. Zaka Khan, MD"], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "18440 W Airport Blvd Ste 300, Richmond, TX 77407, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/113237966024073761563", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW50HQpqcI6NNv5HoXCT56xUUBCohATortKUwlfBwsZHH4OITR7=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "CARDIOCLINIC - Dr. Zaka Khan, MD"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/113237966024073761563", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW50HQpqcI6NNv5HoXCT56xUUBCohATortKUwlfBwsZHH4OITR7=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "CARDIOCLINIC - Dr. Zaka Khan, MD"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/113237966024073761563", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW50HQpqcI6NNv5HoXCT56xUUBCohATortKUwlfBwsZHH4OITR7=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "CARDIOCLINIC - Dr. Zaka Khan, MD"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/113237966024073761563", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW50HQpqcI6NNv5HoXCT56xUUBCohATortKUwlfBwsZHH4OITR7=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "CARDIOCLINIC - Dr. Zaka Khan, MD"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/113237966024073761563", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW50HQpqcI6NNv5HoXCT56xUUBCohATortKUwlfBwsZHH4OITR7=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "CARDIOCLINIC - Dr. Zaka Khan, MD"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-26T13:35:57.511527+00:00', 'cardioclinic-dr-zaka-khan-md', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

We provide a wide range of services including preventive care, general dentistry, fillings, crowns, root canals, bridges, implants, All-on-4s, extractions, orthodontics, and emergency care. Our clinic utilizes modern digital equipment such as digital x-ray sensors and 4K intraoral cameras, allowing patients to view details on 50-inch TVs. We take a conservative approach to treatment.

We proudly accept Medi-Cal (Denti-Cal), most major PPO insurance plans, and medical insurance for certain procedures. For those without insurance, we offer payment plans and a discount plan. Our staff speaks English, Spanish, and Korean, serving patients of many ethnicities. We offer same-day emergency appointments and extended hours including Saturdays.', '1517 W. 6th St.', 'Los Angeles', 'CA', '90017', '(213) 463-2632', ARRAY['English', 'Spanish', 'Korean', 'Chinese']::text[], 'Dental', FALSE, '{"images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/union-dental-center-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/union-dental-center-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/union-dental-center-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/union-dental-center-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/union-dental-center-google-5.webp"], "rating": 4.9, "pricing": [{"name": "Full Exam & X-Rays", "notes": "New patient special. Includes comprehensive exam and digital x-rays.", "price": "$99", "category": "Exam", "price_range": null}, {"name": "New Patient Specials", "notes": "Financing options and discount plan available. Call for details.", "price": null, "category": "Membership", "price_range": null}], "reviews": [{"date": "2026-01-31T00:58:45.732052416Z", "text": "Just had an excellent experience with Dr. Kang. Had a cracked tooth and even though they were extremely busy they still fit me in and got me accommodated. Will definitely be back. Highly recommend.", "author": "gentry mcshane", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103854672065496593352/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-12T22:51:55.314383820Z", "text": "Dr. Kang at Union Dental  is absolutely first class. Once you walk inside this clinic, it’s a completely different world from DowntownLA— modern, spotless, high-tech, and incredibly professional.\n\nI had a very complex crown situation causing significant pain, and Dr. Kang and her team accommodated me immediately and completed everything pain free within about 3 hours. Truly incredible.\n\nWhat impressed me most is that they offer same-day crowns with advanced equipment — something that is still surprisingly rare even in many high-end dental offices. No temporary crown, no multiple visits, no hassle.\n\nThe quality of care, efficiency, and professionalism exceeded my expectations. Dr. Kang is highly skilled, caring, and calm under pressure. I highly recommend her and Union Dental to anyone looking for exceptional dental care in Los Angeles.", "author": "Jennifer Storm Hilton", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111714057735458633542/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-12-13T01:31:18.069858375Z", "text": "It''s been years suffering trying to find a good dentist and what can I say ever since I found Union Dental I have been very satisfied and happy with their meticulous care with my teeth. I have gotten two crowns and a regular check up with cleaning. There prices and time are very accommodating. The staff is very courteous and friendly makiing you feel welcomed. They will address any concerns you might have. I 100% recommend you make this your dentist you won''t regret it.", "author": "Erich Maximo Rodriguez", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106912359074318347330/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-13T22:37:03.312189995Z", "text": "Excellent dental clinic with caring and attentive staff. Scheduling was easy, and I was seen right on time. The dentist was gentle, thorough, and took the time to answer all my questions. The results were fantastic, and the pricing was fair. I truly appreciate the professionalism and highly recommend!", "author": "Hattie Noble", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107951379072351588341/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-16T21:33:26.650928003Z", "text": "The Dr she so kind,sweet, care and friendly.  All the front desk staff are so kind,  helpful,  sweet and care when you need. The Nurse dentist she do cleaning excellent work.thank you for for everyone taking care me today and it''s my first. Definitely came back", "author": "Srey Khmer", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102322373550108743528/reviews"}], "website": "https://uniondentalcenter.co", "location": {"latitude": 34.0569534, "longitude": -118.26855459999999}, "services": ["Preventive Dentistry", "General Dentistry", "Dental Fillings", "Dental Crowns", "Root Canal Therapy", "Dental Emergencies", "Dental Bridges", "Dental Implants", "All on 4’s", "Wisdom Tooth Extractions", "Orthodontics"], "insurance": {"notes": "We accept Medi-Cal (Denti-Cal) and most major PPO insurance plans. We also bill medical insurance for certain procedures (e.g., routine exams, x-rays, extractions, surgical procedures). For uninsured patients, we offer payment plans and a discount plan. Call to verify coverage.", "accepts_medicaid": true, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": ["Aetna", "Blue Cross Blue Shield", "Cigna", "Delta Dental", "Guardian", "MetLife", "Medicaid", "Principal", "United Concordia", "UnitedHealthcare", "Most major PPO plans"], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": true}, "highlights": [{"title": "Family-Owned Since 1980", "detail": "Union Dental Center has been serving the Los Angeles community for over 40 years as a family-owned practice.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Over 200,000 Patient Visits", "detail": "The clinic has successfu