xceeded my expectations. Dr. Kang is highly skilled, caring, and calm under pressure. I highly recommend her and Union Dental to anyone looking for exceptional dental care in Los Angeles.", "author": "Jennifer Storm Hilton", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111714057735458633542/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-12-13T01:31:18.069858375Z", "text": "It''s been years suffering trying to find a good dentist and what can I say ever since I found Union Dental I have been very satisfied and happy with their meticulous care with my teeth. I have gotten two crowns and a regular check up with cleaning. There prices and time are very accommodating. The staff is very courteous and friendly makiing you feel welcomed. They will address any concerns you might have. I 100% recommend you make this your dentist you won''t regret it.", "author": "Erich Maximo Rodriguez", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106912359074318347330/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-13T22:37:03.312189995Z", "text": "Excellent dental clinic with caring and attentive staff. Scheduling was easy, and I was seen right on time. The dentist was gentle, thorough, and took the time to answer all my questions. The results were fantastic, and the pricing was fair. I truly appreciate the professionalism and highly recommend!", "author": "Hattie Noble", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107951379072351588341/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-16T21:33:26.650928003Z", "text": "The Dr she so kind,sweet, care and friendly.  All the front desk staff are so kind,  helpful,  sweet and care when you need. The Nurse dentist she do cleaning excellent work.thank you for for everyone taking care me today and it''s my first. Definitely came back", "author": "Srey Khmer", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102322373550108743528/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Patients consistently praise Union Dental Center for its professional, caring staff and high-quality dental care, with many highlighting same-day treatments and a welcoming environment.", "about_highlight": "Union Dental Center is a family-owned general dental practice located in the heart of Los Angeles, serving the community since 1980 with over 200,000 patient visits. Our dentists collectively have over 90 years of experience and are graduates of USC and other leading dental schools. Our support staff have been a part of the team for over 60 years, ensuring you always see a familiar face. We treat patients of all ages, from young children to seniors, and many have been coming to our clinic for over 30 years.\n\nWe provide a wide range of services including preventive care, general dentistry, fillings, crowns, root canals, bridges, implants, All-on-4s, extractions, orthodontics, and emergency care. Our clinic utilizes modern digital equipment such as digital x-ray sensors and 4K intraoral cameras, allowing patients to view details on 50-inch TVs. We take a conservative approach to treatment.\n\nWe proudly accept Medi-Cal (Denti-Cal), most major PPO insurance plans, and medical insurance for certain procedures. For those without insurance, we offer payment plans and a discount plan. Our staff speaks English, Spanish, and Korean, serving patients of many ethnicities. We offer same-day emergency appointments and extended hours including Saturdays.", "appointment_url": "http://www.uniondentalcenter.co/appointments/", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=12384445776654787560&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJWWEWmabHwoAR6GOYedFj3qs", "quality_missing": [], "search_keywords": ["dental", "dentist", "nha khoa", "nha sĩ", "trồng răng", "implant", "root canal", "crowns", "veneers", "braces", "invisalign", "toothache", "치과", "치과의사", "임플란트", "牙医", "牙科", "种植牙", "english", "spanish", "korean", "한국어", "한인", "한국말", "chinese", "mandarin", "cantonese", "中文", "普通话", "国语", "粤语", "广东话", "华人", "preventive dentistry", "general dentistry", "dental fillings", "dental crowns", "root canal therapy", "dental emergencies", "dental bridges", "dental implants", "all on 4’s", "wisdom tooth extractions", "orthodontics", "aetna", "blue cross blue shield", "cigna", "delta dental", "guardian", "metlife", "medicaid", "principal", "united concordia", "unitedhealthcare", "most major ppo plans", "dr. fred", "dr. mardig"], "cultural_context": "The clinic serves a diverse patient base and staff speaks English, Spanish, and Korean. The website is available in both English and Spanish, reflecting a commitment to language access for Spanish-speaking patients. The practice emphasizes family atmosphere and multicultural care.", "services_offered": [{"name": "Preventive Dentistry", "category": "Dental", "description": "The purpose of the highly-recommended bi-annual visits to the dentist is to prevent problems. Regular dental cleanings and exams all work together to prevent cavities and gum diseases, such as gingivitis and periodontitis.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "All patients"}, {"name": "General Dentistry", "category": "Dental", "description": "We would like our office to be the dental care provider for you and all members of your family. In addition to our preventive services, we can diagnose and provide treatment for many dental problems that you may have.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "All patients"}, {"name": "Dental Fillings", "category": "Dental", "description": "Have a toothache and think you might need a dental filling? No worries — dealing with cavities has been pain-free for decades. Cavities only get worse, never better, and fillings are a simple and easy way to prevent further decay.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients with cavities"}, {"name": "Dental Crowns", "category": "Dental", "description": "Also called a ''cap'', a dental crown covers the entire exposed top portion of a tooth. It strengthens and protects the tooth when there is not enough tooth remaining to hold a filling properly. Same-day crowns available.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients with damaged or weakened teeth"}, {"name": "Root Canal Therapy", "category": "Dental", "description": "Despite what you may have heard, root canals are not excruciating. With modern technology, they are mostly painless and can be typically completed in a single visit.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients with infected or severely decayed teeth"}, {"name": "Dental Emergencies", "category": "Dental", "description": "Dental emergencies are frightening and often painful. Prompt treatment is almost always required to alleviate pain and ensure the teeth have the best possible chance of survival. Same-day appointments available.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients experiencing dental emergencies"}, {"name": "Dental Bridges", "category": "Dental", "description": "Bridges replace missing teeth by anchoring a prosthetic tooth to adjacent natural teeth.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients with missing teeth"}, {"name": "Dental Implants", "category": "Dental", "description": "Implants are a permanent solution for missing teeth, using titanium posts placed in the jawbone.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients with missing teeth"}, {"name": "All on 4’s", "category": "Dental", "description": "A full arch restoration using four dental implants to support a complete set of teeth.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients needing full arch replacement"}, {"name": "Wisdom Tooth Extractions", "category": "Dental", "description": "Removal of wisdom teeth to prevent crowding, impaction, or other dental issues.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients with problematic wisdom teeth"}, {"name": "Orthodontics", "category": "Dental", "description": "Straightening teeth and correcting bite issues using braces or aligners.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients seeking orthodontic treatment"}], "short_description": "Union Dental Center is a family-owned general dental practice in Los Angeles, providing comprehensive dental care since 1980.", "google_website_url": "http://www.uniondentalcenter.co/?utm_campaign=gmb", "insurance_accepted": ["Aetna", "Blue Cross Blue Shield", "Cigna", "Delta Dental", "Guardian", "MetLife", "Medicaid", "Principal", "United Concordia", "UnitedHealthcare", "Most major PPO plans"], "google_primary_type": "Dentist", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": ["Dr. Fred", "Dr. Mardig"], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "accepting_new_patients": true, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "1517 W 6th St, Los Angeles, CA 90017, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/111302142961766996420", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVKmiNwx0ED9NnPPtaK1vLvS0hjQOjtj8w5z49whG8eWgVsn8iM=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Union Dental Center"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/111302142961766996420", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVKmiNwx0ED9NnPPtaK1vLvS0hjQOjtj8w5z49whG8eWgVsn8iM=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Union Dental Center"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/111302142961766996420", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVKmiNwx0ED9NnPPtaK1vLvS0hjQOjtj8w5z49whG8eWgVsn8iM=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Union Dental Center"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/104030693216611954745", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI8LCp3v6cZfvvM3jnq8dOID0w0YW9kl4MF3ySJlPY3vV1r9Q=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "T C"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/111302142961766996420", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVKmiNwx0ED9NnPPtaK1v