hink that they have so many patients because he''s such a great doctor. I''m not saying that it''s okay to make patients wait long hours, but, I also know that in general, ophthalmologist visits can easily be couple hours long with tests, waiting for dilation, and such. I usually carve out 3 hours for my once-a-year ophthalmologist visits (I still do with my new opthalmologist).\n\nThat said, I do think they can work on improving their scheduling and maybe even the flow of the visit so that the wait time in the lobby is not as long.", "author": "jane moon", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107889750495339695586/reviews"}, {"date": "2023-08-19T23:01:45.490452Z", "text": "My dad was concerned about an issue he was having with his vision. He’s from\nMichigan and flew into LA on a Friday night. Saturday afternoon we called Serrano, and they took us same day! Within 30 min of entering the doctors office a nurse was treating my dad. He received a full work up and our doctor was FANTASTIC.\n\nI’m grateful for the entire team, their diligent work put my dad’s mind at ease, and consequently mine as well.\n\nI’d give this place 10 stars if I could.", "author": "Chris Hoyle", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118380256861473502202/reviews"}, {"date": "2024-11-15T17:00:02.597469Z", "text": "Please try to avoid dr. Kim as he has tendency of lecturing patients of why patients left their eyes in such bad condition. If I knew what was happening, I would not visit a doctor. Right? I don''t need to feel any more uncomfortable as I am already uncomfortable with bad eye condition.", "author": "sarah shin", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115603337390746702130/reviews"}, {"date": "2019-02-19T04:47:20.680072Z", "text": "I had a terrible experience with this place. I needed a Glaucoma examination due to my periotic check up. I called to m