n\nThe practice is led by founder Andrew S. Cho, M.D., an ophthalmologist, and retina & uveitis specialist Hans H. Kim, M.D. Together, they provide expert guidance for a wide range of eye health needs, from routine check-ups to complex surgeries including laser cataract surgery, minimally invasive glaucoma surgery, and the newest macular degeneration treatments.\n\nSerrano Eye Center accepts most major insurance plans including Anthem, Aetna, Humana, Cigna, and United Healthcare. The clinic welcomes new patients and offers convenient scheduling by phone or online, with same-day appointments often available for urgent concerns.", "appointment_url": "http://www.serranoeyecenter.com/pages/contact-book-appt", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=6491656634438475138&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJvWQDR5m4woARgl2Dk1D_Flo", "quality_missing": [], "search_keywords": ["ophthalmology", "optometry", "optometrist", "eye doctor", "eye exam", "cataract", "lasik", "glasses", "nhãn khoa", "khám mắt", "bác sĩ mắt", "안과", "검안", "眼科", "配镜", "english", "korean", "한국어", "한인", "한국말", "glaucoma", "corneal", "retinal", "surgical", "medical", "blue cross blue shield", "aetna", "humana", "cigna", "unitedhealthcare", "andrew s. cho, m.d.", "ophthalmologist", "hans h. kim, m.d."], "services_offered": [{"name": "Cataract", "category": "Surgical", "description": "Multifocal Lens, Toric Lens (Astigmatism Correction), Laser Cataract Surgery", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Glaucoma", "category": "Surgical", "description": "Trabeculectomy, Minimally Invasive Glaucoma Surgery, Tube Shunt, Laser Treatments (I.E. Iridotomy, SLT)", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Corneal", "category": "Medical", "description": "Dry Eyes Treatment, Plasma Tears, Plugs, Pterygium Removal, Corneal Dystrophies", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Retinal", "category": "Medical", "description": "Newest Macular Degeneration Treatment, Retinal Detachment Treatment, Artery And Vein Occlusion", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}], "short_description": "Serrano Eye Center Medical Group provides comprehensive ophthalmology services with board-certified doctors, advanced technology, and over 20 years of experience in Los Angeles.", "google_website_url": "http://www.serranoeyecenter.com/", "insurance_accepted": ["Blue Cross Blue Shield", "Aetna", "Humana", "Cigna", "UnitedHealthcare"], "google_primary_type": "Medical Clinic", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": ["Andrew S. Cho, M.D.", "Hans H. Kim, M.D."], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "4220 W 3rd St #206, Los Angeles, CA 90020, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/113348131882060850181", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVDV-86zOhDQJe_UNyQOJB08wfE_HfPEBzU3E3ZUb9P8HhXqZnQ5A=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "ParkPark"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/113348131882060850181", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVDV-86zOhDQJe_UNyQOJB08wfE_HfPEBzU3E3ZUb9P8HhXqZnQ5A=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "ParkPark"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/113348131882060850181", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVDV-86zOhDQJe_UNyQOJB08wfE_HfPEBzU3E3ZUb9P8HhXqZnQ5A=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "ParkPark"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/113834100534836350552", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXYoHA-P__ho-vg1E8rK9EZjp6ddqhE7cWiIFFH4XYYXp0CZ2ET=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Yong-Seup Park"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/112694125019025199314", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVH_Q7djJ2XMi932vMrTvkofb6Z69R48knmgxplrK7XCxG9Gn4=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Serrano Eye Center Medical Group"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-26T13:27:32.880135+00:00', 'serrano-eye-center-medical-group', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

The clinic is dedicated to serving diverse communities, with multilingual staff speaking Chinese, Korean, and Spanish, and a dedicated Korean phone line. They are open six days a week, with hours Monday-Friday 10 AM-6 PM and Saturday 9 AM-1 PM. Advanced Eye Care has earned a 5.0-star rating from patient reviews, reflecting their commitment to quality eye care.', '128 Mott St. #408, New York, NY 10013', 'New York', 'NY', '10013', '(212) 732-0073', ARRAY['Korean', 'Chinese', 'Spanish', 'English']::text[], 'Ophthalmology', FALSE, '{"images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/advanced-eye-care.webp"], "rating": 2.1, "reviews": [{"date": "2026-05-03T16:09:44.745919937Z", "text": "The doctor Wilson Ko. has good references, but the surgery didn''t work for me. I paid to see better, and now I have a lot of vision problems. I have to wear very thick sunglasses to go outside, and I can''t tolerate light or sun; I can''t open my eyes properly. I''m in a lot of pain and discomfort. He only prescribed eye drops, and since there''s nothing else that can be done, why did he agree to operate if he knew it wouldn''t work? According to the doctor Wilson Ko, everything was fine, that I would recover, but my vision has gotten much worse.", "author": "Estelia Moreno", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101393854748539154110/reviews"}, {"date": "2024-07-19T20:37:36.978387Z", "text": "I am writing from a burner email. I went to the Chinatown office in May 2023. The Doctor was nice and the front desk was nice. It was a pleasant experience until I received a bill one year later in May 2024. I paid in cash for my visit and was told the upfront cost would cover the entire visit including services for contact prescription and eye exam. However, this year, I received a bill for the said services that I paid for the year earlier. When I went to the office in person to ask, the front staff were very evasive and did not clarify the charges. When I asked to see the manager MARIA, I was redirected to 4 different people before being told that the manager was busy. I waited and was told the manager MARIA left 30 minutes earlier. I left my number for them to call, only to never receive a call. This office does not get back to you for billing issues and promises one thing then claims your insurance. I now have to pay $400 when I was told it would be $150 in total. Again, I visited in 2023 and only received the bill 2024. They claimed my insurance within 3 months of my visit, but waited a year to send me the bill. The front staff were extremely unhelpful when I went to ask about the bill and with a year between the visit and bill, it became a game of remembering what happened and disputing verbal promises.\n\nHighly do not recommend this Chinatown Office!!!!!!!!!!!!!!", "author": "Allison Ng", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104412998733629240877/reviews"}, {"date": "2024-07-31T13:16:03.068080Z", "text": "The doctors at the Flushing location are great. The front office staff and those that answers the phone are RUDE and HORRIBLE. The management needs to train these people. It''s a turn Off. First impression counts. The front office sets the tone for the entire team. My doctors there are great, but I dread interacting with the front.", "author": "Bajan Lady", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115134119026182321927/reviews"}, {"date": "2024-12-18T01:20:56.309282Z", "text": "My mother Yan Ming had Lasik surgery over a year and a half ago from another clinic and was suffering from constant teary and dry eyes, as well as swelling and irritation. Her previous doctor could not figure out why for over a year, or maybe he just didn’t care enough. After months and months of different medication my mother decided to see Dr. Alice Hong. She was able to help my 