With a strong focus on culturally responsive care, Korean Home Health Care provides services in multiple languages including English, Korean, Vietnamese, and Chinese, making it accessible to a diverse patient population. The agency operates under the principle that recovery and independence are best achieved through compassionate, patient-centered care delivered in the comfort of one''s home.

Services include nursing services (supervised by the Texas Board of Nursing), home health aide personal assistance, therapy services (physical therapy to improve recovery), the Primary Home Care (PHC) program for nontechnical medically related personal care, and social services. They cover patients across various service areas in and around Dallas.', '1908 Royal Lane, Suite 100, Dallas, TX 75229', 'Dallas', 'TX', '75229', '972-241-9996', ARRAY['English', 'Korean', 'Chinese', 'Vietnamese']::text[], 'Primary Care', FALSE, '{"fax": "972-241-9997", "email": "khhc@koreanhhc.com", "images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/korean-home-health-care-inc-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/korean-home-health-care-inc-google-2.webp"], "rating": 4, "reviews": [{"date": "2019-02-27T19:41:07.828934Z", "text": "Thank you for your hard work with our agency. We appreciate finding ways to improve. We, at Korean Home Health Care make a promise to put patients and clients needs above all not only for our patients but for our staff as well. Thank you again for your kind feedback.\n\n-Asst. Admin.", "author": "Kyong Chul Lee", "rating": 4, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111689088806097028652/reviews"}, {"date": "2020-02-27T21:52:09.300987Z", "text": "Korea Home Care is a company that works for the community.\nA few years ago, Korea Homecare provided health checkup services with a nursing association.\nDue to expensive medical expenses, health checkups were not possible.\nThank you for your health checkup.", "author": "inkyu lee", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107870361212735145702/reviews"}, {"date": "2020-05-30T03:48:24.730695Z", "text": "I give my respects to the nurses, therapists and caregivers of Korean Home health Care who take care of patients with all their heart despite difficulties at the risk of COVID 19, especially to staffs at DON department.", "author": "V CHUNG", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104904748821850537532/reviews"}, {"date": "2019-04-27T00:06:19.424310Z", "text": "They steal staff salaries so bad  company and bad staff", "author": "Aso Us", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102732104382921154782/reviews"}], "website": "http://khhcusa.com/", "location": {"latitude": 32.8949515, "longitude": -96.9140858}, "services": ["Nursing Services", "Home Health Aide", "Primary Home Care (PHC) Program", "Therapy Services", "Social Services"], "insurance": {"notes": "No insurance information is provided on the website.", "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": [], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": false}, "highlights": [{"title": "Culturally Responsive Care", "detail": "Website available in English, Korean, Vietnamese, and Chinese – serving Dallas’s Asian community.", "category": "culture"}, {"title": "Compassionate Home Health Services", "detail": "Nursing, home health aide, therapy, PHC, and social services delivered with value-driven, high-quality care.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Fully Licensed Nursing Staff", "detail": "Nurses are fully trained and licensed by the Texas Board of Nursing and extensively interviewed.", "category": "care"}], "price_tier": "$$", "source_url": "http://khhcusa.com/", "appointment": {"booking_note": null, "appointment_url": null, "new_patient_note": null, "phone_booking_available": true, "online_booking_available": null, "free_consultation_available": null}, "open_sunday": false, "scout_query": "Korean speaking medical clinic in Dallas, TX", "search_text": "primary care | family doctor | general practitioner | annual physical | checkup | bác sĩ gia đình | khám tổng quát 