ed nurses, home health aides, physical therapists, and social services professionals, offering a comprehensive range of in-home care options.\n\nWith a strong focus on culturally responsive care, Korean Home Health Care provides services in multiple languages including English, Korean, Vietnamese, and Chinese, making it accessible to a diverse patient population. The agency operates under the principle that recovery and independence are best achieved through compassionate, patient-centered care delivered in the comfort of one''s home.\n\nServices include nursing services (supervised by the Texas Board of Nursing), home health aide personal assistance, therapy services (physical therapy to improve recovery), the Primary Home Care (PHC) program for nontechnical medically related personal care, and social services. They cover patients across various service areas in and around Dallas.", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=16778228685744693767&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJh1IAPYGkToYRB-IURhg-2Og", "quality_missing": ["insurance", "team_members", "appointment_url"], "search_keywords": ["primary care", "family doctor", "general practitioner", "annual physical", "checkup", "bác sĩ gia đình", "khám tổng quát", "nội khoa", "내과", "가정의학과", "家庭医生", "全科医生", "内科", "english", "korean", "한국어", "한인", "한국말", "chinese", "mandarin", "cantonese", "中文", "普通话", "国语", "粤语", "广东话", "华人", "vietnamese", "tiếng việt", "người việt", "bác sĩ việt", "nursing services", "home health aide", "primary home care (phc) program", "therapy services", "social services", "home health", "rehabilitation", "support services"], "cultural_context": "The agency’s name, website language options (English, 한국어, Tiếng Việt, 中国), and location on Royal Lane in Dallas indicate a strong focus on serving Korean, Vietnamese, Chinese, and other Asian immigrant communities with culturally and linguistically appropriate home health care.", "services_offered": [{"name": "Nursing Services", "category": "Home Health", "description": "Our nurses are fully trained and licensed by Texas Board of Nursing and have been interviewed extensively.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients needing skilled nursing care at home."}, {"name": "Home Health Aide", "category": "Home Health", "description": "Our Aides provide personal assistance services to patients.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients needing help with daily personal care tasks."}, {"name": "Primary Home Care (PHC) Program", "category": "Home Health", "description": "Primary Home Care is a nontechnical, medically related personal care service provided to adults.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Adults needing nontechnical personal care at home."}, {"name": "Therapy Services", "category": "Rehabilitation", "description": "Our highly trained physical therapists improve patient’s recovery.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients needing physical therapy to improve recovery."}, {"name": "Social Services", "category": "Support Services", "description": "Social services support for patients and families.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients needing social work support."}], "short_description": "Korean Home Health Care Inc. provides compassionate, value-driven home health services in Dallas, TX, with multilingual support in English, Korean, Vietnamese, and Chinese.", "google_website_url": "http://khhcusa.com/", "google_primary_type": "Medical Clinic", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": [], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "1908 Royal Ln, Dallas, TX 75229, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/106027498577926756546", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJI7diRDeNnJ7kjAmI9Bi6bPCF1L3