Our bilingual staff ensures clear communication and comfort for all patients, providing a welcoming environment for diverse communities. We utilize cutting-edge dental technology, including CEREC CAD/CAM for same-day crowns, and offer a convenient location with free parking. Whether you need an emergency exam, a new patient special, or advanced restorative work, we have you covered under one roof.

We accept major PPO insurances and offer flexible financing options, including an in-house Advantage Plan. New patients can take advantage of our $129 special (Exam, X-Ray, and Cleaning) and we also provide free second opinion consultations. Experience modern dentistry with a personal touch at Poway Modern Dentistry.', '12630 Monte Vista Rd STE 109, Poway, CA 92064, United States', 'Poway', 'CA', '92064', '858-675-2285', ARRAY['English', 'Spanish', 'Vietnamese']::text[], 'Dental', FALSE, '{"fax": "858-675-9015", "email": "frontdesk@ilovemysmile.com", "images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/poway-modern-dentistry-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/poway-modern-dentistry-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/poway-modern-dentistry-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/poway-modern-dentistry-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/poway-modern-dentistry-google-5.webp"], "rating": 4.8, "pricing": [{"name": "New Patient Special", "notes": "Includes: First Exam, Full Mouth X-Rays, Basic Cleaning", "price": "$129", "category": "exam", "price_range": null}, {"name": "Emergency Dental Exams", "notes": null, "price": "$99", "category": "emergency", "price_range": null}], "reviews": [{"date": "2026-05-23T22:26:40.517347669Z", "text": "I just got 2 crowns that were placed on implants by Dr. Nguyen.  I was kind of nervous going into this, but I got talking with Dr. Viet, and turns out he went to USC just like my son did, so we had something in common. And he was very personable and helped me feel at ease.  The procedure took a while, but he explained every step of the process.   I had virtually no pain during or after the procedure.  I would highly recommend Dr. Viet Ngyun for anyone that is on the fence about where to go for dental work.", "author": "Brian Robinson", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101176075284028845667/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-01-22T04:54:15.928489606Z", "text": "I had a great experience at Poway Modern Dentistry. Dr. Nguyen treated two cavities and completed onlays, and the entire process was smooth from start to finish. He was professional, patient, and genuinely caring, which made a big difference. The work itself is excellent. You honestly can''t tell I had anything done. Everything looks and feels completely natural. I really appreciate the attention to detail and would absolutely recommend Dr. Nguyen and this office.", "author": "J J", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108356614565057436284/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-04-22T02:36:36.982641850Z", "text": "I’ve been going to Poway Modern Dentistry for years! Dr. Nguyen is great and very knowledgeable and patient to explain everything.  Lori has been my Hygienist for many years.  She also takes care of my family.  We all trust Poway modern with our smile!", "author": "Charlie Stroben", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104324230487425939312/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-17T14:37:50.332205784Z", "text": "I am not a huge fan of the dentist, this place is great. My hygienist is amazing, she’s worked there for many years and makes the experience less anxious. Highly recommend this practice.", "author": "Marc Ulrich", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108991283987762905221/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-01-06T16:58:40.518839733Z", "text": "I have been extremely happy with the services of Dr. Nguyen since he has been there afte