h Dr. Viet, and turns out he went to USC just like my son did, so we had something in common. And he was very personable and helped me feel at ease.  The procedure took a while, but he explained every step of the process.   I had virtually no pain during or after the procedure.  I would highly recommend Dr. Viet Ngyun for anyone that is on the fence about where to go for dental work.", "author": "Brian Robinson", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101176075284028845667/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-01-22T04:54:15.928489606Z", "text": "I had a great experience at Poway Modern Dentistry. Dr. Nguyen treated two cavities and completed onlays, and the entire process was smooth from start to finish. He was professional, patient, and genuinely caring, which made a big difference. The work itself is excellent. You honestly can''t tell I had anything done. Everything looks and feels completely natural. I really appreciate the attention to detail and would absolutely recommend Dr. Nguyen and this office.", "author": "J J", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108356614565057436284/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-04-22T02:36:36.982641850Z", "text": "I’ve been going to Poway Modern Dentistry for years! Dr. Nguyen is great and very knowledgeable and patient to explain everything.  Lori has been my Hygienist for many years.  She also takes care of my family.  We all trust Poway modern with our smile!", "author": "Charlie Stroben", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104324230487425939312/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-17T14:37:50.332205784Z", "text": "I am not a huge fan of the dentist, this place is great. My hygienist is amazing, she’s worked there for many years and makes the experience less anxious. Highly recommend this practice.", "author": "Marc Ulrich", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108991