At Total Care Dental & Orthodontics, we strive to ensure that your upcoming visit to our dental offices is not only pleasant but also stress-free. Our team goes above and beyond to design and decorate our offices with the aim of creating a soothing atmosphere, allowing you to feel completely at ease and maximally comfortable during your time with us. From pediatric dentistry to orthodontics and oral surgery, we offer a full range of services under one roof.', '5703 Vermont Ave, Los Angeles, CA 90037', 'Los Angeles', 'CA', '90037', '(888) 998-6825', ARRAY['English', 'Spanish', 'Chinese']::text[], 'Dental', FALSE, '{"email": "info@tcdortho.com", "images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/total-care-dental-and-orthodontics-los-angeles-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/total-care-dental-and-orthodontics-los-angeles-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/total-care-dental-and-orthodontics-los-angeles-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/total-care-dental-and-orthodontics-los-angeles-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/total-care-dental-and-orthodontics-los-angeles-google-5.webp"], "rating": 4.5, "reviews": [{"date": "2025-10-15T02:00:58.050641716Z", "text": "My 90-year old mother had a 1 pm appointment and it was 2:30 and they still hadn’t seen or called her! every time i ask they say she is next. This by far the longest we have ever waited, the longest at another place was half hour and the staff let us know and apologized. what is up with this kind of service? totally wasting time especially as we arrived before 1 pm to fill out the forms. We finally said we couldn’t wait anymore because my mother was getting very hungry and tired (she’s 90!) and i asked to have all the papers that i filled out because she made it clear we WILL NEVER COME BACK HERE! They refused to give the papers back and one of the front desk ladies asked if i wanted to talk to the manager. i said YES even though my mother was adamant about leaving ASAP. Then the lady gave me back the paperwork that i filled out. i asked where the manager was and Wow, she was rude. She made me wait and then told me she was at lunch. when i asked why she didn''t tell me sooner she said \"whatever!\" Seriously?!? that attitude! No apologies but pure rudeness.We left after waiting over 1 hour, 40 minutes. WHAT A WASTE OF TIME!!! can’t believe it. Reading other 1 star reviews completely validates our experience.  DO NOT GO HERE UNLESS YOU ABSOLUTELY HAVE NO OTHER OPTION!", "author": "Loida Mosher", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100070632793279592692/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-21T22:10:18.570040528Z", "text": "I’ve had a really good experience with this dental office. The dentists and staff are all very friendly, welcoming, and professional. They always make me feel comfortable during my visits, and you can tell they truly care about their patients. The office itself is great, and I would definitely recommend people to come here for dental work.\n\nThe only issue I’ve consistently had is getting ahold of someone by phone, since they don’t always answer calls. I think that’s something that could definitely be improved. Other than that, I honestly love this dentist office. If you want quicker answers or appointments, I’d suggest stopping by in person because the service there is always great.", "author": "Bryan Reyes", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104513828675352799602/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-06T23:43:43.466048616Z", "text": "Thank you so much for your Extraordinary TEAM WORK 🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏 Done Extraordinary Service to my kiddos Thank you so much. Explain everything details with Treatments needed and what our Dental Insurance cover and whats out of pocket. Great Customer Service seem sincere respectful Staff. Keep up great positive vibes", "author": "Elizabeth Garibay", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114781930067389671380/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-10-20T20:27:16.646898584Z", "text": "I had such a great experience at this dental office! The entire team was welcoming and professional from start to finish. Alejandra was especially wonderful—she was friendly, patient, and made sure I felt comfortable the whole time. She explained everything clearly and helped ease my nerves. The office is clean, organized, and the service is top-notch. I highly recommend this place to anyone looking for quality dental care!", "author": "samantha", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107256102698575082485/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-11-07T04:36:54.380975070Z", "text": "Great experience! Misleading experiences must be a type of misunderstanding because this place was awesome for both me and my teeth. The team was awesome and welcoming, definitely a place I felt safe and taken care of at, Alejandra in Specific is great! Wonderful woman very professional and hard working, definitely doing her job to her best abilities to give us patients a reason to come back.", "author": "Giddy Yes", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101567623994025503813/reviews"}], "website": "https://tcdortho.com/", "location": {"latitude": 33.9902703, "longitude": -118.2916431}, "services": ["General Dentistry", "Cosmetic Dentistry", "Orthodontics", "Pediatric Dentistry", "Dental Implants", "Endodontics (Root Canal)", "Oral Surgery", "Preventive Care", "Restorative Dentistry", "Emergency D