ager. i said YES even though my mother was adamant about leaving ASAP. Then the lady gave me back the paperwork that i filled out. i asked where the manager was and Wow, she was rude. She made me wait and then told me she was at lunch. when i asked why she didn''t tell me sooner she said \"whatever!\" Seriously?!? that attitude! No apologies but pure rudeness.We left after waiting over 1 hour, 40 minutes. WHAT A WASTE OF TIME!!! can’t believe it. Reading other 1 star reviews completely validates our experience.  DO NOT GO HERE UNLESS YOU ABSOLUTELY HAVE NO OTHER OPTION!", "author": "Loida Mosher", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100070632793279592692/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-21T22:10:18.570040528Z", "text": "I’ve had a really good experience with this dental office. The dentists and staff are all very friendly, welcoming, and professional. They always make me feel comfortable during my visits, and you can tell they truly care about their patients. The office itself is great, and I would definitely recommend people to come here for dental work.\n\nThe only issue I’ve consistently had is getting ahold of someone by phone, since they don’t always answer calls. I think that’s something that could definitely be improved. Other than that, I honestly love this dentist office. If you want quicker answers or appointments, I’d suggest stopping by in person because the service there is always great.", "author": "Bryan Reyes", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104513828675352799602/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-06T23:43:43.466048616Z", "text": "Thank you so much for your Extraordinary TEAM WORK 🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏 Done Extraordinary Service to my kiddos Thank you so much. Explain everything details with Treatments needed and what our Dental Insurance cover and whats out of pocket. Great Customer Service seem sincere respectful Staff. Keep up great positive vibes", "author": "Elizabeth Gar