cleanliness, we ensure a hygienic environment while fostering a warm and inviting atmosphere for all your dental needs.\n\nAt Total Care Dental & Orthodontics, we strive to ensure that your upcoming visit to our dental offices is not only pleasant but also stress-free. Our team goes above and beyond to design and decorate our offices with the aim of creating a soothing atmosphere, allowing you to feel completely at ease and maximally comfortable during your time with us. From pediatric dentistry to orthodontics and oral surgery, we offer a full range of services under one roof.", "appointment_url": "https://tcdortho.com/appointment/", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=307827373700086957&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJs088kSPIwoARrfyIjV2fRQQ", "quality_missing": [], "search_keywords": ["dental", "dentist", "nha khoa", "nha sĩ", "trồng răng", "implant", "root canal", "crowns", "veneers", "braces", "invisalign", "toothache", "치과", "치과의사", "임플란트", "牙医", "牙科", "种植牙", "english", "spanish", "chinese", "mandarin", "cantonese", "中文", "普通话", "国语", "粤语", "广东话", "华人", "general dentistry", "cosmetic dentistry", "orthodontics", "pediatric dentistry", "dental implants", "endodontics (root canal)", "oral surgery", "preventive care", "restorative dentistry", "emergency dentistry", "sedation dentistry", "endodontics", "restorative", "emergency", "sedation", "medicaid", "dr. abner", "maria fernandez", "patient coordinator", "ana rosas", "financial coordinator", "ambrie", "dental assistant"], "services_offered": [{"name": "General Dentistry", "category": "General Dentistry", "description": "Comprehensive dental care including exams, cleanings, fillings, and more.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "All ages"}, {"name": "Cosmetic Dentistry", "category": "Cosmetic Dentistry", "description": "Enhance your smile with veneers, whitening, bonding, and Lumineers.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients look