re-dental-and-orthodontics-los-angeles', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

With a team of bilingual Korean-English staff, KFAM serves over 10,000 adults and children each year. In 2025 alone, they provided 7,383 individual counseling sessions, served 164 survivors of domestic violence, trained 212 faith leaders as first responders, and distributed over 508,000 healthy meals through their Child Care Food Program. They operate a 24-hour crisis hotline staffed in Korean and English for domestic violence, sexual assault, and human trafficking emergencies.

KFAM’s approach is deeply rooted in cultural humility and community partnership. They offer free self-defense classes for teen girls, adoption information sessions, and a variety of support groups and case management services. Their office is located at 3727 West 6th St., Suite 320 in Los Angeles, and they can be reached by phone at (213) 389-6755 or via their crisis hotline at (213) 338-0472.', '3727 West 6th St., Ste. 320', 'Los Angeles', 'CA', '90020', '(213) 389-6755', ARRAY['English', 'Korean']::text[], 'Mental Health', FALSE, '{"email": "admin@kfamla.org", "images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/korean-american-family-services-kfam-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/korean-american-family-services-kfam-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/korean-american-family-services-kfam-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/korean-american-family-services-kfam-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/korean-american-family-services-kfam-google-5.webp"], "rating": 4.6, "reviews": [{"date": "2025-09-30T01:12:34.772628615Z", "text": "Moxie (Xolo Maridueña) × Pregnant (Angelina Hathaway) = Korean Family Counseling Center (Mental health service in Los Angeles, California) @Finally Home Adoption (Adoption agency in Tampa, Florida)\n\nThese \"Youthfully Korean\" professionals offered to be helping me, \"Anela NG\" {Twice As Nice} adopting our foster little Korean babies girls to start our loving family to be conceiving my own beautiful daughters, likewise we want their help. 😭😭😪💙💋🧡💘💯💯💯💛💛💛💛❤️‍🔥❣️💌\nP.S. (Why just 5 stars? I would give them 10!)", "author": "Angelina Hathaway", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102612975778517440861/reviews"}, {"date": "2018-07-12T21:11:25.808Z", "text": "KFAM has provided wonderful service to Korean American families affected by physical and mental abuse. They treat individuals seeking treatment with the utmost respect and have comfortable counseling rooms that provide a safe space for sharing. Staff members are bilingual in both Korean and English, enabling service to those beyond Korean Americans. As a volunteer here, I was able to hear the stories of individuals harmed by domestic abuse who were able to rise from a painful past. Staff treated me like family and assured me that I was serving a meaningful cause. Domestic abuse in Korean American families is a caused that is too often overlooked, but in the heart of Los Angeles where thousands of Korean immigrants have resided, such abuse poses more of a threat than one may think and KFAM does well to confront the issue. KFAM also supports child wellness through the food care program and foster families through the Asian Foster Family Initiative (AFFI). I highly recommend their services to anyone with a troubled domestic experience.", "author": "Andrew Shim", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114773652261235216721/reviews"}, {"date": "2017-06-15T23:24:31.068Z", "text": "HORRIBLE MANNERS absolutely USELESS no one speaks proper English doubty and frustrating if they even understand what I''m saying, licensed professionals are not accessible during business hours they don''t even speak proper English no one here does. they should change the name to just Korean services cause aint no American in this organization. Im a Korean American", "author": "cause effect", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117952241722681793502/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-12-04T11:15:01.508664405Z", "text": "This is a reputable organization that provides incredible, unconditional help to those suffering from emotional pain they cannot share with anyone. It is a place of deep gratitude that accompanies you with a warm helping hand and assists you in making a comeback when the weight of life feels overwhelming and you do not know what to do. If you wish to escape a dark tunnel, I strongly encourage you to visit and find peace and stability of mind. I strongly recommend that anyone in need of a helping hand visit the Korean Family Counseling Center.", "author": "Debbie Kim", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112017355173542698182/reviews"}], "website": "http://www.kfamla.org/", "location": {"latitude": 34.063884, "longitude": -118.3037601}, "services": ["Mental Health Program", "Gender-Based Violence Program", "Foster & Adoption Program", "Child & Adult Wellness Program"], "insurance": {"notes": "Insurance information not provided on the website. Services may be offered on a sliding scale or through grants. Contact directly for payment options.", "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": [], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": false}, "highlights": [{"title": "Bilingual Korean-English Staff", "detail": "Staff provide services in Korean and English, with a Korean bilingual after-hours crisis hotline.", "category": "culture"}, {"title": "24/7 Crisis Hotline", "detail": "24-hour crisis hotline for domestic violence, sexual assault, and human trafficking.", "category": "access"}, {"title": "Culturally Responsive Care", "detail": "Holistic services designed specifically for Korean and Asian American families undergoing trauma or acculturation stress.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Free Self-Defense Classes", "detail": "Free self-defense and personal safety training for teen girls ages 13–18, focused on empowerment and awareness.", "category": "convenience"}, {"title": "Serving 10,000+ Clients Annually", "detail": "KFAM serves over 10,000 adults and children each year with high-quality, holistic services.", "category": "reviews"}], "price_tier": "$$", "source_url": "http://www.kfamla.org/", "appointment": {"booking_note": "Contact via phone (213) 389-6755 or email admin@kfamla.org. For crisis, call 24-hour hotline: (213) 338-0472.", "appointment_url": null, "new_patient_note": null, "phone_booking_available": true, "online_booking_available": false, "free_consultation_available": null}, "open_sunday": false, "scout_query": "Korean counseling clinic in Los Angeles, CA", "search_text": "mental health | psychiatry | psychiatrist | psychology | therapist | counseling | depression | anxiety | tâm lý | tâm thần | trầm cảm | 정신과 | 심리상담 | 心理医生 | 精神科 | english | korean | 한국어 | 한인 | 한국말 | mental health program | gender-based violence program | foster & adoption program | child & adult wellness program | crisis support | family services | wellness", "google_types": ["non_profit_organization", "medical_clinic", "association_or_organization", "health", "point_of_interest", "service", "establishment"], "open_weekend": false, "rating_count": 10, "language_note": "Korean American community-focused organization providing bilingual Korean-English services and culturally adaptive care for immigrants and families undergoing acculturation stress. Services are designed to address trauma, adaptation, and systemic barriers faced by Asian American families.", "open_saturday": false, "quality_score": 90, "working_hours": {"friday": "9:00 AM – 5:30 PM", "monday": "9:00 AM – 5:30 PM", "sunday": "Closed", "tuesday": "9:00 AM – 5:30 PM", "saturday": "Closed", "thursday": "9:00 AM – 5:30 PM", "wednesday": "9:00 AM – 5:30 PM"}, "review_profile": {"rating": 4.6, "source": "google", "themes": [{"theme": "Friendly staff", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients highlight friendly staff in their feedback."}, {"theme": "Comfortable visits", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients highlight comfortable visits in their feedback."}, {"theme": "Strong results", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients highlight strong results in their feedback."}], "summary": "Korean American Family Services (KFAM) has a 4.6 star Google rating from 10 Google reviews. Patients commonly mention friendly staff, comfortable visits, strong results.", "review_count": 10, "concern_themes": [], "positive_themes": [], "featured_reviews": [{"date": "2025-09-30T01:12:34.772628615Z", "text": "Moxie (Xolo Maridueña) × Pregnant (Angelina Hathaway) = Korean Family Counseling Center (Mental health service in Los Angeles, California) @Finally Home Adoption (Adoption agency in Tampa, Florida)\n\nThese \"Youthfully Korean\" professionals offered to be helping me, \"Anela NG\" {Twice As Nice} adopting our foster little Korean babies girls to start our loving family to be conceiving my own beautiful daughters, likewise we want their help. 😭😭😪💙💋🧡💘💯💯💯💛💛💛💛❤️‍🔥❣️💌\nP.S. (Why just 5 stars? I would give them 10!)", "author": "Angelina Hathaway", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102612975778517440861/reviews"}, {"date": "2018-07-12T21:11:25.808Z", "text": "KFAM has provided wonderful service to Korean American families affected by physical and mental abuse. They treat individuals seeking treatment with the utmost respect and have comfortable counseling rooms that provide a safe space for sharing. Staff members are bilingual in both Korean and English, enabling service to those beyond Korean Americans. As a volunteer here, I was able to hear the stories of individuals harmed by domestic abuse who were able to rise from a painful past. Staff treated me like family and assured me that I was serving a meaningful cause. Domestic abuse in Korean American families is a caused that is too often overlooked, but in the heart of Los Angeles where thousands of Korean immigrants have resided, such abuse poses more of a threat than one may think and KFAM does well to confront the issue. KFAM also supports child wellness through the food care program and foster families through the Asian Foster Family Initiative (AFFI). I highly recommend their services to anyone with a troubled domestic experience.", "author": "Andrew Shim", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114773652261235216721/reviews"}, {"date": "2017-06-15T23:24:31.068Z", "text": "HORRIBLE MANNERS absolutely USELESS no one speaks proper English doubty and frustrating if they even understand what I''m saying, licensed professionals are not accessible during business hours they don''t even speak proper English no one here does. they should change the name to just Korean services cause aint no American in this organization. Im a Korean American", "author": "cause effect", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117952241722681793502/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-12-04T11:15:01.508664405Z", "text": "This is a reputable organization that provides incredible, unconditional help to those suffering from emotional pain they cannot share with anyone. It is a place of deep gratitude that accompanies you with a warm helping hand and assists you in making a comeback when the weight of life feels overwhelming and you do not know what to do. If you wish to escape a dark tunnel, I strongly encourage you to visit and find peace and stability of mind. I strongly recommend that anyone in need of a helping hand visit the Korean Family Counseling Center.", "author": "Debbie Kim", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112017355173542698182/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Korean American Family Services (KFAM) has a 4.6 star Google rating from 10 Google reviews. Patients commonly mention friendly staff, comfortable visits, strong results.", "about_highlight": "Korean American Family Services (KFAM) is a community-based nonprofit organization dedicated to providing culturally responsive social services to the Korean and Asian American community in Los Angeles. Founded to address the unique challenges faced by immigrants and families undergoing trauma, adaptation, or acculturation stress, KFAM offers a comprehensive range of holistic services including mental health counseling, gender-based violence support, foster care and adoption, child and adult wellness programs, and the Asian Foster Family Initiative. Their work is grounded in understanding the cultural, linguistic, and systemic barriers that Asian American families often encounter.\n\nWith a team of bilingual Korean-English staff, KFAM serves over 10,000 adults and children each year. In 2025 alone, they provided 7,383 individual counseling sessions, served 164 survivors of domestic violence, trained 212 faith leaders as first responders, and distributed over 508,000 healthy meals through their Child Care Food Program. They operate a 24-hour crisis hotline staffed in Korean and English for domestic violence, sexual assault, and human trafficking emergencies.\n\nKFAM’s approach is deeply rooted in cultural humility and community partnership. They offer free self-defense classes for teen girls, adoption information sessions, and a variety of support groups and case management services. Their office is located at 3727 West 6th St., Suite 320 in Los Angeles, and they can be reached by phone at (213) 389-6755 or via their crisis hotline at (213) 338-0472.", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=1717767582262187151&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJJVS9x5y4woARj1Rr04O81hc", "quality_missing": ["insurance", "team_members", "appointment_url"], "search_keywords": ["mental health", "psychiatry", "psychiatrist", "psychology", "therapist", "counseling", "depression", "anxiety", "tâm lý", "tâm thần", "trầm cảm", "정신과", "심리상담", "心理医生", "精神科", "english", "korean", "한국어", "한인", "한국말", "mental health program", "gender-based violence program", "foster & adoption program", "child & adult wellness program", "crisis support", "family services", "wellness"], "cultural_context": "Korean American community-focused organization providing bilingual Korean-English services and culturally adaptive care for immigrants and families undergoing acculturation stress. Services are designed to address trauma, adaptation, and systemic barriers faced by Asian American families.", "services_offered": [{"name": "Mental Health Program", "category": "Mental Health", "description": "Individual counseling sessions for adults and children facing trauma, depression, anxiety, and acculturation stress.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Korean and Asian American individuals and families"}, {"name": "Gender-Based Violence Program", "category": "Crisis Support", "description": "Comprehensive case management, counseling, and support group services for survivors of domestic violence.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Survivors of domestic violence, sexual assault, and human trafficking"}, {"name": "Foster & Adoption Program", "category": "Family Services", "description": "Asian Foster Family Initiative (AFFI) provides adoption and foster care services with cultural matching and support.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Korean and Asian American children and prospective parents"}, {"name": "Child & Adult Wellness Program", "category": "Wellness", "description": "Child Care Food Program providing healthy meals and snacks, and wellness services for children and adults.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Children, adults, and families"}], "short_description": "Korean American Family Services (KFAM) provides culturally responsive social services to the Korean and Asian American community in Los Angeles, including mental health, domestic violence support, foster care, and wellness programs.", "google_website_url": "http://www.kfamla.org/", "google_primary_type": "Medical Clinic", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": [], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "3727 W 6th St #320, Los Angeles, CA 90020, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/103274863434185245464", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVjoiTdFgz2Ah7ZrQ0JtklOU6w-dcO-cnJBX1fc2WbDtCipKXFl=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "한인가정상담소American Family Services"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/103274863434185245464", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVjoiTdFgz2Ah7ZrQ0JtklOU6w-dcO-cnJBX1fc2WbDtCipKXFl=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "한인가정상담소American Family Services"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/103274863434185245464", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVjoiTdFgz2Ah7ZrQ0JtklOU6w-dcO-cnJBX1fc2WbDtCipKXFl=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "한인가정상담소American Family Services"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/103274863434185245464", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVjoiTdFgz2Ah7ZrQ0JtklOU6w-dcO-cnJBX1fc2WbDtCipKXFl=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "한인가정상담소American Family Services"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/103274863434185245464", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVjoiTdFgz2Ah7ZrQ0JtklOU6w-dcO-cnJBX1fc2WbDtCipKXFl=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "한인가정상담소American Family Services"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-26T13:02:01.694084+00:00', 'korean-american-family-services-kfam', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

The center utilizes cutting-edge technology, including CBCT (3D CT scan), digital intraoral scanners, and advanced implant planning software to ensure safe and precise surgery. Dr. Chen personally oversees every step of the treatment, from surgical placement to final restoration, providing continuity of care that is rare in corporate-owned implant centers. The practice is committed to excellence, using premium FDA-approved implants and zirconia restorations that are laser-scanned and milled for precision and durability.

Patient convenience is a priority, with free consultations available without an appointment, same-day treatment options, and a multilingual staff that includes Chinese-language support. The center serves a diverse patient population, including many from the Asian community, and strives to deliver life-changing results that restore both function and confidence.', '5321 7th Avenue, Brooklyn, NY 11220', 'Brooklyn', 'NY', '11220', '718-576-3187', ARRAY['English', 'Chinese']::text[], 'Dental', FALSE, '{"email": "bj90688@yahoo.com", "images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/3d-dental-implant-center-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/3d-dental-implant-center-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/3d-dental-implant-center-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/3d-dental-implant-center-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/3d-dental-implant-center-google-5.webp"], "rating": 4.8, "reviews": [{"date": "2025-12-06T17:30:56.634892269Z", "text": "First appointment with them had to get my teeth cleaned and a tooth checked! Had to wait awhile but that’s because it is always busy in the place and there were people there who already made appointments. The staff there are polite, listened to my questions explained it clearly for me to understand. Just gotta wait a bit and make an appointment in the future to get my tooth situation resolved. But nonetheless the establishment gave me a great first impression! Would definitely come back here!", "author": "Jia Wei Wang", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106179551297283069038/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-01T16:33:06.368496091Z", "text": "Rude front desk lady. She raised her voice and lectured my mom who wanted a consult as a new patient. Don’t know why this place has 5 stars- what a joke", "author": "Jenny L", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104249651156649491916/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-11-22T16:25:13.811792940Z", "text": "Horrible customer service, lady has an attitude. I waited three hours. They kept telling me that I''d be up next and to wait just a second. If it''s gonna take that long, atleast be honest and tell your patients so that they can do other stuff.", "author": "cocacola sprite", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100316144847456770373/reviews"}, {"date": "2024-12-31T17:36:30.765306Z", "text": "The front staff is very kind and knowledgeable. I went in for routine cleaning and to check on my wisdom teeth due to pain. The doctor kindly explained to me that my wisdom teeth were impacted, what that means for my other teeth, and what my next steps should be. Overall, very patient and helpful. My teeth were cleaned perfectly too. 😁 Highly recommend.", "author": "Ashley Y.", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110418178362253982715/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-01-04T04:54:44.617260Z", "text": "3D Dental Implant Center is fantastic! The staff is warm, welcoming, and professional. Dr. Chen is thorough, patient, and skilled, taking the time to explain every step and make sure I was comfortable.\nThe hygienists are gentle yet thorough, and scheduling is always easy. I''m so glad to have found a dental practice where I feel truly cared for--highly recommend!", "author": "Sean Deng", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100374370781349294009/reviews"}], "website": "http://www.3d-implants.net/", "location"