ansparency about delays."}, {"theme": "Front Desk Interactions", "mentions": 2, "sentiment": "Negative", "summary_quote": "A few patients report negative experiences with the front desk staff, citing rudeness and unprofessional behavior."}, {"theme": "Clinical Expertise", "mentions": 2, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Reviewers commend the doctors for their thoroughness, skill, and ability to make patients feel comfortable."}], "summary": "Most patients praise 3D Dental Implant Center for its professional, knowledgeable staff and thorough care, though some mention long wait times and occasional issues with front desk interactions.", "review_count": 258, "concern_themes": [], "positive_themes": [], "featured_reviews": [{"date": "2025-12-06T17:30:56.634892269Z", "text": "First appointment with them had to get my teeth cleaned and a tooth checked! Had to wait awhile but that’s because it is always busy in the place and there were people there who already made appointments. The staff there are polite, listened to my questions explained it clearly for me to understand. Just gotta wait a bit and make an appointment in the future to get my tooth situation resolved. But nonetheless the establishment gave me a great first impression! Would definitely come back here!", "author": "Jia Wei Wang", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106179551297283069038/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-01T16:33:06.368496091Z", "text": "Rude front desk lady. She raised her voice and lectured my mom who wanted a consult as a new patient. Don’t know why this place has 5 stars- what a joke", "author": "Jenny L", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104249651156649491916/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-11-22T16:25:13.811792940Z", "text": "Horrible customer service, lady has an attitude. I waited three hours. They kept telling me that I''d be up next and to wait just a second. If it''s gonna take that long, atleast be honest and tell your patients so that they can do other stuff.", "author": "cocacola sprite", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100316144847456770373/reviews"}, {"date": "2024-12-31T17:36:30.765306Z", "text": "The front staff is very kind and knowledgeable. I went in for routine cleaning and to check on my wisdom teeth due to pain. The doctor kindly explained to me that my wisdom teeth were impacted, what that means for my other teeth, and what my next steps should be. Overall, very patient and helpful. My teeth were cleaned perfectly too. 😁 Highly recommend.", "author": "Ashley Y.", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110418178362253982715/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-01-04T04:54:44.617260Z", "text": "3D Dental Implant Center is fantastic! The staff is warm, welcoming, and professional. Dr. Chen is thorough, patient, and skilled, taking the time to explain every step and make sure I was comfortable.\nThe hygienists are gentle yet thorough, and scheduling is always easy. I''m so glad to have found a dental practice where I feel truly cared for--highly recommend!", "author": "Sean Deng", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100374370781349294009/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Most patients praise 3D Dental Implant Center for its professional, knowledgeable staff and thorough care, though some mention long wait times and occasional issues with front desk interactions.", "about_highlight": "3D Dental Implant Center is a specialized dental implant center located in Brooklyn, NY, led by Dr. Charlie Chen, a highly experienced implantologist with over 20 years of experience and more than 30,000 successful implant procedures. The center focuses on full-arch reconstructions using the innovative All-on-8 technique, which allows patients to receive fixed, functional teeth in a single day through immediate loading. Dr. Chen''s expertise in complex bone grafting and implant placement has enabled him to treat patients who were previously considered unsuitable for implants.\n\nThe center utilizes cutting-edge technology, including CBCT (3D CT scan), digital intraoral scanners, and advanced implant planning software to ensure safe and precise surgery. Dr. Chen personally oversees every step of the treatment, from surgical placement to final restoration, providing continuity of care that is rare in corporate-owned implant centers. The practice is committed to excellence, using premium FDA-approved implants and zirconia restorations that are laser-scanned and milled for precision and durability.\n\nPatient convenience is a priority, with free consultations available without an appointment, same-day treatment options, and a multilingual staff that includes Chinese-language support. The center serves a diverse patient population, including many from the Asian community, and strives to deliver life-changing results that restore both function and confidence.", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=16633160729689296321&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJIRL9EABbwokRwY0bsY7b1OY", "quality_missing": ["insurance", "appointment_url"], "search_keywords": ["dental", "dentist", "nha khoa", "nha sĩ", "trồng răng", "implant", "root canal", "crowns", "veneers", "braces", "invisalign", "toothache", "치과", "치과의사", "임플란트", "牙医", "牙科", "种植牙", "english", "chinese", "mandarin", "cantonese", "中文", "普通话", "国语", "粤语", "广东话", "华人", "dental implants", "bone grafting", "dental extractions", "cosmetic dentistry", "general dentistry", "cosmetic", "charlie chen", "implant surgeon / dentist"], "cultural_context": "The center provides a Chinese-language version of their website and serves a diverse patient population, including Asian and immigrant communities in Brooklyn.", "services_offered": [{"name": "Dental Implants", "category": "Dental", "description": "Single, multiple, all-on-6, all-on-7, all-on-8 implants with cosmetic restorative work.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients needing tooth replacement"}, {"name": "Bone Grafting", "category": "Dental", "description": "Ridge augmentations, sinus lifts, and gum grafts for implant support.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients with insufficient bone for implants"}, {"name": "Dental Extractions", "category": "Dental", "description": "Includes wisdom teeth removal.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients requiring tooth removal"}, {"name": "Cosmetic Dentistry", "category": "Cosmetic", "description": "Bonding, veneers, all-ceramic crowns for optimal esthetics.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients seeking smile enhancement"}, {"name": "General Dentistry", "category": "Dental", "description": "Fillings, root canals, cleanings, scaling and root planing, laser gum surgeries.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients needing routine dental care"}], "short_description": "Expert dental implant center in Brooklyn offering All-on-8 same-day teeth replacement with advanced technology. Led by Dr. Charlie Chen, with over 30,000 successful implant procedures.", "google_website_url": "http://www.3d-implants.net/", "google_primary_type": "Dentist", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": ["Charlie Chen"], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "accepting_new_patients": true, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "5321 7th Ave, Brooklyn, NY 11220, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/101976367234389454712", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIg2TLz3eSMqNi_WJoRPW66Sy7WC-sS0F6SxmDFbkZtsCGYWg=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Charlie Chen DDS"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/112742298313035454039", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIA9g6Y2v6-qKR5Vrcq6SgjtmDBFvefU3cF8cDO40de7c26Vg=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "SKTERWEI hu"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/101976367234389454712", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIg2TLz3eSMqNi_WJoRPW66Sy7WC-sS0F6SxmDFbkZtsCGYWg=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Charlie Chen DDS"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/101976367234389454712", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIg2TLz3eSMqNi_WJoRPW66Sy7WC-sS0F6SxmDFbkZtsCGYWg=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Charlie Chen DDS"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/101976367234389454712", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIg2TLz3eSMqNi_WJoRPW66Sy7WC-sS0F6SxmDFbkZtsCGYWg=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Charlie Chen DDS"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-26T12:52:28.309789+00:00', '3d-dental-implant-center', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

The practice offers comprehensive dermatology care including medical, surgical (Mohs), and cosmetic dermatology, with a focus on individualized treatments in a welcoming and friendly environment. The team is dedicated to building long-lasting relationships based on trust and communication.', '1506 E. Chapman Ave.', 'Orange', 'CA', '92866', '714-538-8556', ARRAY['English', 'Vietnamese']::text[], 'Dermatology', FALSE, '{"fax": "714-538-1082", "images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/orange-dermatology-and-laser-center-google-1.webp"], "rating": 3.6, "reviews": [{"date": "2025-09-12T19:48:40.473625397Z", "text": "This place is a bait and switch. This provider (Dr Mortazie) is a $15 co pay for my insurance but when I called the office to schedule an appointment they told me he was a surgeon and does not see patients. They booked me with a nurse practitioner, Eva Hernandez. I had a serious issue but she was pretty dismissive of my symptoms. After a few visits they finally let me know what I owed and it was a $50 co pay not $15. I still have my skin issue after 4 appointments and Eva has done nothing to help me except tell me to use more vaseline.", "author": "EJ Heck", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114834121518546799692/reviews"}, {"date": "2024-05-28T19:48:48.649061Z", "text": "I came to Orange Dermatology about 3 years ago, I was depressed about my acne, hence I started looking for a Dermatologist around the area. I read good reviews about Dr. Hsu so I made a point to see her.\n\n3 years later, I can say that I am happy with the result. I don''t have acne anymore and skin is 10x better than it was before.\n\nI am happy with the results. I recommend Dr. Shu.  Also, her nurse is amazing.", "author": "Christine Straub", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107494285946161371698/reviews"}, {"date": "2017-03-23T19:10:22.419Z", "text": "Doctor offices make me nervous!  I asked my friends to recommend a dermatologist that had excellent bedside manner and was okay with a patient that''s interested in holistic treatments whenever possible.  Thank goodness someone mentioned, Dr. Sarah Stanowicz.\n\nThe office was clean and busy.  The front desk staff were organized and friendly.  And let me tell you, the attitude of the front desk can make or break a clinic in my opinion.  In this case, they were professional and welcoming.  So far so good.\n\nWhen I met Sarah, she was kind, efficient and effective.  She heard what my concerns were, what my preferences for treatment were and she offered options that reflected my goals.  When it came time to treat me, she explained the process and described what I might feel.  I felt respected.  I felt safe.  I felt confident that I was in good hands.\n\nThat is one exceptional doctor.", "author": "elizabeth b", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106325779585586647325/reviews"}, {"date": "2024-03-12T19:01:33.551417Z", "text": "Very disappointing! I was looking forward to my appointment to fix my skin!!! I haven’t been to this office in over 5 years!\nPhone appointment staff are VERY UNORGANIZED!!! 3wks prior to my appt date I provided  all my updated demographics . They reached out to an old contact from previous info to state they have my wrong number and address to mail out patient paperwork. I called this office for the 3rd time to give my info just for the clerk to state I owe $90 from a missed appointment 2017?!! If truly my balance which I doubt, why not send it in the mail, email?! Why ask me for all my info if not going to utilize!! Last time I saw Dr. D was 2021! Paid my dues, purchased products! I am not one to miss my appointments!! And why not mention this balance prior to setting appointment. I had to request early clock out just to make it to this appointment!! Waste of time!!!", "author": "Liz R.", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113377833397146185318/reviews"}, {"date": "2022-04-28T19:05:57.124746Z", "text": "I have been coming to this office for several years and the staff is very friendly and welcoming. Every Dr. I have seen have seen have been helpful and kind. Most recently I had an appointment with Dr.Hsu and she listened to all my concerns. My skin has seen a big improvement since seeing her and I will recommend this office to family and friends.", "author": "josue napoles", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111472946556180434978/reviews"}], "website": "http://www.ocderms.com/", "location": {"latitude": 33.7874085, "longitude": -117.83758959999999}, "services": ["Medical Dermatology", "Surgical Dermatology (Mohs Surgery)", "Cosmetic Dermatology"], "insurance": {"notes": null, "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": [], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": false}, "highlights": [{"title": "Over 40 Years of Service", "detail": "Proudly serving the Orange community since 1985 with comprehensive dermatology care.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Family-Owned Practice", "detail": "Founded by Dr. Steven Stanowicz and now co-run by his daughter Dr. Sarah Stanowicz, treating patients and staff like family.", "category": "culture"}, {"title": "Two Convenient Locations", "detail": "Main Dermatology & Cosmetic Center and a separate Mohs Surgery Center, both in Orange, CA.", "category": "convenience"}, {"title": "Advanced Mohs Surgery", "detail": "Microscopically controlled surgery for skin cancer with high success rates and aesthetic precision.", "category": "technology"}], "price_tier": "$$", "source_url": "http://www.ocderms.com/", "appointment": {"booking_note": "Request an appointment through the online contact form.", "appointment_url": "http://www.ocderms.com/c