nd effective technology for great results.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients seeking aesthetic improvements or medically necessary cosmetic procedures."}], "short_description": "Comprehensive skin care for the whole family. At Orange Dermatology, we are passionate about providing the best dermatology care and service possible in a welcoming and friendly environment.", "google_website_url": "http://www.ocderms.com/", "google_primary_type": "Skin Care Clinic", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": ["Dr. Steven Stanowicz", "Dr. Sarah Stanowicz", "Stahsha Diaz"], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "1506 E Chapman Ave, Orange, CA 92866, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/117914472712875124300", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWfRipN924PcpYuuvRt0b4vur5dkQJiVZoLAKCd9vH5wS1EhP_M=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Spencer T2D"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-26T13:46:54.905245+00:00', 'orange-dermatology-and-laser-center', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

The clinic uses time-tested herbal formulas and modern diagnostic tools like Omega-3 Index testing to guide recommendations. Each session is designed to help patients feel more at ease in their body and more grounded in life, combining traditional wisdom with thoughtful conversation and modern techniques.

Patients consistently praise Karen’s professional, gentle, and knowledgeable approach, noting significant improvements in chronic pain, bloating, eczema, chemotherapy side effects, and hormonal imbalances. The clinic is located in a welcoming house in East Sacramento, providing a calm and comforting environment for holistic healing.', '5431 H St Sacramento, CA 95819', 'Sacramento', 'CA', '95819', '(916) 452-5170', ARRAY['English', 'Chinese']::text[], 'Acupuncture & TCM', FALSE, '{"images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/karen-chan-acupuncture-herbal-medicine-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/karen-chan-acupuncture-herbal-medicine-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/karen-chan-acupuncture-herbal-medicine-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/karen-chan-acupuncture-herbal-medicine-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/karen-chan-acupuncture-herbal-medicine-google-5.webp"], "rating": 4.9, "reviews": [{"date": "2026-03-09T15:59:51.937660114Z", "text": "I went to Karen Chan Acupuncture to help manage some of the stress my body and mind have gone through with cancer treatments. I found the experience to be beneficial and more helpful than I was expecting. I intend to continue with the acupuncture therapy and highly recommend Karen Chan to anyone interested in Traditional Chinese Medicine.", "author": "Matthew Pugh", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111960969878637302697/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-04-02T02:54:15.965042228Z", "text": "Consulted Karen for my skin issues late last year, and have been to see her again twice since for acupuncture and TCM (supplements). She has helped me understand the areas of my body that need support and it has really helped address my issues. Karen is very gentle, supportive, and not trying to sell anything you don''t need. I would definitely recommend her!", "author": "JoAnn De Tomasi", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110819140876620351731/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-12-19T04:15:10.429357170Z", "text": "I went in for acupuncture and came out feeling very refreshed!  It was very relaxing.  Better than any massage, sleep aid, and all of the other methods I’ve tried using to relax and get rest.  Most people don’t really understand how effective it is until they actually try it.  You should at least try it once.  That way you can see if it helps.  Karen also sells herbs which are just as important.  She’s done her research and uses quality supplements.", "author": "Stephen J", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107718064622592058454/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-20T01:09:01.605714338Z", "text": "Today was my first time seeing Karen for acupuncture. She was very thorough, reviewing my entire medical history and understanding the reasons I was there. Karen was kind, patient, and knowledgeable, even providing helpful recommendations for my eating habits. I will definitely be coming back to see her.\"", "author": "Awa Manneh", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105471802864440431833/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-04-14T19:51:59.393411221Z", "text": "I want to preface this by saying that I approach this review not from a place of anger, but from a place of truth, love, and a genuine desire to educate. A high star rating tells you that a provider is skilled — it does not always tell you whether they are the right energetic fit for you, or whether they will treat every person who walks through their door with equal care and dignity. That distinction matters, especially now.\nI scheduled an appointment with Karen Chan a week in advance. I completed all intake paperwork thoroughly and sent it ahead of time, along with a detailed email outlining my needs around digestive health, sexual wellness, and nervous system regulation. I received no acknowledgment — no reply, no confirmation that my paperwork had been received, no expression of care or anticipation for the appointment. I arrived having already invested time and vulnerability, with nothing reflected back.\n\nWhen I walked into the office, I — a Black woman — made eye contact with Karen, smiled and took a seat. A white woman entered after me. When Karen finished with her prior patient, she looked past me and directed her attention toward the white woman who had arrived second. The white woman herself redirected Karen toward me. I want to name this clearly: that is racial bias, whether conscious or not. In a healing space — a space that asks for your vulnerability and your body — that kind of bias is not a small thing. It is a signal, and I have learned to trust those signals.\n\nI gave her the benefit of the doubt and continued into the appointment. The energy throughout was cold and transactional. There was no warmth, no gratitude for the preparation I had done, no curiosity about me as a whole person. It became clear she had not reviewed my paperwork in advance. Her questions felt detached, assumption-based, and reductive — as if I were a set of symptoms rather than a sovereign, knowledgeable person who has been deeply invested in my own wellness for a long time.\n\nI want to speak to something I know many women — and particularly Black women — experience in medical and healing spaces: when you arrive informed, articulate, and self-aware about your body, some providers receive that as a threat rather than a gift. Rather than leaning in, they close off. That is what happened here. My knowledge of my own body was not met with curiosity or collaboration. It was met with distance. I share this because it is worth knowing: I have a team of providers I work with across several areas of my wellness who embrace me with warmth and who genuinely appreciate my curiosity and deep knowledge of my own body. That kind of relationship with a provider is possible. It exists. You are allowed to expect it, and you should not settle for less.\nThe final moment came when, mid-appointment, she informed me she needed to step away to help another patient who “needed to get going.” A new patient appointment — which costs more and requires more time — was interrupted so she could manage her schedule at my expense.\n\nAt that point, I paused and told her honestly that this didn’t feel right, that I could sense the misalignment. Her response? That she had been feeling it too. She had known the entire time and said nothing. That is not a healing presence. That is someone going through the motions.\n\nI left with grace, and I hold no ill will toward Karen Chan. But I share this so that you — particularly if you are a person of color, or someone who arrives to a healing space as a whole, self-aware, informed human being — can factor this into your decision.\n\nYou deserve a provider who sees you fully, who meets your knowledge with curiosity, who makes you feel like the most important person in the room during your appointment. If this review helps even one person ask the right questions before lying down and handing over their nervous system, it has done its job.\n\nIn love and truth,\nLana ❤️", "author": "Lana Jackson", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117855362782535682140/reviews"}], "website": "http://www.karenchanacupuncture.com/", "location": {"latitude": 38.567957199999995, "longitude": -121.4353367}, "services": ["Acupuncture", "Herbal Medicine", "Dolphin Neurostim", "Microneedling", "Celluma LED Light Therapy", "Women''s Wellness"], "insurance": {"notes": "Insurance information not mentioned on the website. Patients are advised to contact the clinic directly regarding insurance and payment options.", "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": [], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": false}, "highlights": [{"title": "15+ Years Experience", "detail": "Licensed acupuncturist with over 15 years of experience in traditional and integrative care.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Personalized Treatment Plans", "detail": "Each plan is tailored to meet individual needs and evolves as the patient heals.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Gentle Approach", "detail": "Patients with needle anxiety report no pain due to Karen''s very gentle technique.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Wide Range of Services", "detail": "Offers acupuncture, herbal medicine, Dolphin Neurostim, microneedling, Celluma LED therapy, and women''s wellness.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Online Booking", "detail": "Book appointments directly through Vagaro for convenience.", "category": "convenience"}], "price_tier": "$$", "source_url": "http://www.karenchanacupuncture.com/", "appointment": {"booking_note": null, "appointment_url": "https://www.vagaro.com/karenchan-acupuncture/book-now?utm_source=website&utm_medium=button&utm_campaign=booking", "new_patient_note": null, "phone_booking_available": null, "online_booking_available": true, "free_consultation_available": null}, "open_sunday": false, "scout_query": "Chinese speaking medical clinic in Sacramento, CA", "search_text": "acupuncture & tcm | acupuncture | chinese medicine | tcm | herbal medicine | cupping | pain relief | châm cứu | đông y | y học cổ truyền | 한의원 | 침술 | 한약 | 中医 | 针灸 | 中药 | english | chinese | mandarin | cantonese | 中文 | 普通话 | 国语 | 粤语 | 广东话 | 华人 | dolphin neurostim | microneedling | celluma led light therapy | women''s wellness | preventive | pain management | cosmetic | wellness | karen chan | licensed acupuncturist", "google_types": ["medical_clinic", "health", "point_of_interest", "establishment"], "open_weekend": false, "rating_count": 54, "team_members": [{"name": "Karen Chan", "role": "Licensed Acupuncturist", "bio_snippet": "Licensed acupuncturist with over 15 years of experience in traditional and integrative care. Rooted in Traditional Chinese Medicine, she combines gentle, personalized care through acupuncture, herbal medicine, Celluma LED, microneedling, and Dolphin Neurostim.", "languages_spoken": []}], "language_note": "Rooted in Traditional Chinese Medicine (TCM), the clinic offers custom herbal medicine guidance using time-tested formulas from plants, roots, and minerals. The owner''s name ''Karen Chan'' reflects a likely Chinese heritage, and the practice is centered on TCM principles such as balancing qi and using acupuncture to stimulate the body''s natural healing response.", "open_saturday": false, "quality_score": 95, "working_hours": {"friday": "9:00 AM – 2:00 PM", "monday": "9:00 AM – 1:00 PM", "sunday": "Closed", "tuesday": "Closed", "saturday": "Closed", "thursday": "9:30 AM – 5:00 PM", "wednesday": "1:00 – 5:00 PM"}, "gallery_images": ["https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/62fd1880f3beef464dae4f66/25acc16f-69be-4fb3-9473-4d4b48bdea0e/DSC01352-2.jpg", "https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/62fd1880f3beef464dae4f66/29bd4745-a6b6-40ae-b7cb-bb7013032586/DSC01337.jpg", "https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/62fd1880f3beef464dae4f66/95ace3e6-c7f2-46f6-8964-9e342261f2dc/DSC05999.JPG", "https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/62fd1880f3beef464dae4f66/f89ecf42-c103-4667-944e-8bb9cd59df0d/scar-img-opt-sq.jpg", "https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/62fd1880f3beef464dae4f66/24fb61c1-fcd0-4da5-b7e4-e95567347db2/microneedling-day-1-scaled.jpg", "https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/62fd1880f3beef464dae4f66/36d2656a-cd75-4862-b7f6-32211d1c4ff5/DSC02862.jpg", "https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/62fd1880f3beef464dae4f66/b9015a97-d360-4d4c-ad44-6a5d646d4ed6/DSC08085.jpg"], "review_profile": {"rating": 4.9, "source": "google", "themes": [{"theme": "Treatment Outcomes", "mentions": 4, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Multiple reviewers found the acupuncture and herbal treatments highly effective for stress, skin issues, and relaxation."}, {"theme": "Clinical Expertise", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Karen is described as knowledgeable, thorough in reviewing medical history, and using quality supplements."}, {"theme": "Staff Professionalism", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Reviewers highlight Karen''s gentle, supportive approach and her focus on patient needs rather than sales."}, {"theme": "Communication", "mentions": 1, "sentiment": "Negative", "summary_quote": "One reviewer expressed dissatisfaction with lack of acknowledgment of pre-appointment communication and paperwork."}, {"theme": "Personal Fit", "mentions": 1, "sentiment": "Negative", "summary_quote": "A review cautions that a high rating doesn''t guarantee the provider is the right energetic fit for every patient."}], "summary": "Patients generally report highly positive experiences with Karen Chan Acupuncture & Herbal Medicine, praising the effectiveness of treatments, Karen''s expertise, and her supportive, gentle approach. However, one review highlights concerns about communication and personal fit.", "review_count": 54, "concern_themes": [], "positive_themes": ["Gentle and painless technique", "Effective relief from chronic pain", "Helpful lifestyle and stretch advice", "Compassionate care during chemotherapy", "Quick results for bloating and eczema", "Highly recommended by long-term patients"], "featured_reviews": [{"date": "2026-03-09T15:59:51.937660114Z", "text": "I went to Karen Chan Acupuncture to help manage some of the stress my body and mind have gone through with cancer treatments. I found the experience to be beneficial and more helpful than I was expecting. I intend to continue with the acupuncture therapy and highly recommend Karen Chan to anyone interested in Traditional Chinese Medicine.", "author": "Matthew Pugh", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111960969878637302697/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-04-02T02:54:15.965042228Z", "text": "Consulted Karen for my skin issues late last year, and have been to see her again twice since for acupuncture and TCM (supplements). She has helped me understand the areas of my body that need support and it has really helped address my issues. Karen is very gentle, supportive, and not trying to sell anything you don''t need. I would definitely recommend her!", "author": "JoAnn De Tomasi", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110819140876620351731/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-12-19T04:15:10.429357170Z", "text": "I went in for acupuncture and came out feeling very refreshed!  It was very relaxing.  Better than any massage, sleep aid, and all of the other methods I’ve tried using to relax and get rest.  Most people don’t really understand how effective it is until they actually try it.  You should at least try it once.  That way you can see if it helps.  Karen also sells herbs which are just as important.  She’s done her research and uses quality supplements.", "author": "Stephen J", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107718064622592058454/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-20T01:09:01.605714338Z", "text": "Today was my first time seeing Karen for acupuncture. She was very thorough, reviewing my entire medical history and understanding the reasons I was there. Karen was kind, patient, and knowledgeable, even providing helpful recommendations for my eating habits. I will definitely be coming back to see her.\"", "author": "Awa Manneh", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://w