toms rather than a sovereign, knowledgeable person who has been deeply invested in my own wellness for a long time.\n\nI want to speak to something I know many women — and particularly Black women — experience in medical and healing spaces: when you arrive informed, articulate, and self-aware about your body, some providers receive that as a threat rather than a gift. Rather than leaning in, they close off. That is what happened here. My knowledge of my own body was not met with curiosity or collaboration. It was met with distance. I share this because it is worth knowing: I have a team of providers I work with across several areas of my wellness who embrace me with warmth and who genuinely appreciate my curiosity and deep knowledge of my own body. That kind of relationship with a provider is possible. It exists. You are allowed to expect it, and you should not settle for less.\nThe final moment came when, mid-appointment, she informed me she needed to step away to help another patient who “needed to get going.” A new patient appointment — which costs more and requires more time — was interrupted so she could manage her schedule at my expense.\n\nAt that point, I paused and told her honestly that this didn’t feel right, that I could sense the misalignment. Her response? That she had been feeling it too. She had known the entire time and said nothing. That is not a healing presence. That is someone going through the motions.\n\nI left with grace, and I hold no ill will toward Karen Chan. But I share this so that you — particularly if you are a person of color, or someone who arrives to a healing space as a whole, self-aware, informed human being — can factor this into your decision.\n\nYou deserve a provider who sees you fully, who meets your knowledge with curiosity, who makes you feel like the most important person in the room during your appointment. If this review helps even one person ask the right questions before lying down and handing over their nervous system, it has done its job.\n\nIn love and truth,\nLana ❤️", "author": "Lana Jackson", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117855362782535682140/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Patients generally report highly positive experiences with Karen Chan Acupuncture & Herbal Medicine, praising the effectiveness of treatments, Karen''s expertise, and her supportive, gentle approach. However, one review highlights concerns about communication and personal fit.", "about_highlight": "Karen Chan Acupuncture & Herbal Medicine is a healing sanctuary rooted in Traditional Chinese Medicine, offering gentle, personalized care through acupuncture, custom herbal medicine, Celluma LED light therapy, microneedling, and Dolphin Neurostim. With over 15 years of experience, Karen Chan creates tailored treatment plans to support physical, mental, and emotional well-being, addressing chronic pain, stress, digestive issues, hormonal imbalances, and more.\n\nThe clinic uses time-tested herbal formulas and modern diagnostic tools like Omega-3 Index testing to guide recommendations. Each session is designed to help patients feel more at ease in their body and more grounded in life, combining traditional wisdom with thoughtful conversation and modern techniques.\n\nPatients consistently praise Karen’s professional, gentle, and knowledgeable approach, noting significant improvements in chronic pain, bloating, eczema, chemotherapy side effects, and hormonal imbalances. The clinic is located in a welcoming house in East Sacramento, providing a calm and comforting environment for holistic healing.", "appointment_url": "https://www.vagaro.com/karenchan-acupuncture/book-now?utm_source=website&utm_medium=button&utm_campaign=booking", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=3868793448685534143&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJRxZjtfZ9hYARv3tC0iS3sDU", "quality_missing": ["insurance"], "search_keywords": ["acupuncture & tcm", "acupuncture", "chinese medicine", "tcm", "herbal medicine", "cupping", "pain relief", "châm cứu", "đông y", "y học cổ truyền", "한의원", "침술", "한약", "中医", "针灸", "中药", "english", "chinese", "mandarin", "cantonese", "中文", "普通话", "国语", "粤语", "广东话", "华人", "dolphin neurostim", "microneedling", "celluma led light therapy", "women''s wellness", "preventive", "pain management", "cosmetic", "wellness", "karen chan", "licensed acupuncturist"], "cultural_context": "Rooted in Traditional Chinese Medicine (TCM), the clinic offers custom herbal medicine guidance using time-tested formulas from plants, roots, and minerals. The owner''s name ''Karen Chan'' reflects a likely Chinese heritage, and the practice is centered on TCM principles such as balancing qi and using acupuncture to stimulate the body''s natural healing response.", "services_offered": [{"name": "Acupuncture", "category": "Preventive", "description": "Strategic placement of thin needles to stimulate the body''s natural healing response. Used for chronic pain, stress, digestive issues, and more.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients seeking relief from chronic pain, stress, digestive issues, or overall health balance."}, {"name": "Herbal Medicine", "category": "Preventive", "description": "Personalized herbal support using time-tested formulas from plants, roots, and minerals. May include Omega-3 Index test kit to assess body''s needs.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients looking for natural, plant-based support for various health conditions."}, {"name": "Dolphin Neurostim", "category": "Pain Management", "description": "Innovative tool rooted in acupuncture and neurology to reduce sympathetic stress and relieve soft tissue pain. Supports nervous system regulation and deep muscular release.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients with soft tissue pain, stress, or nervous system dysregulation."}, {"name": "Microneedling", "category": "Cosmetic", "description": "Minimally invasive cosmetic treatment to support skin''s natural renewal by encouraging collagen and elastin production. Can also address hair thinning or loss.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients seeking improved skin texture, fine line reduction, or hair growth support."}, {"name": "Celluma LED Light Therapy", "category": "Wellness", "description": "Relaxing, light-based treatment using low-level LED technology to support natural healing, ease musculoskeletal discomfort, and promote stress relief. Needle-free option.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients seeking gentle, needle-free therapy for healing and stress relief."}, {"name": "Women''s Wellness", "category": "Wellness", "description": "Holistic support for women''s health concerns, including hormonal imbalances. Mentioned as a service category on the website.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Women addressing hormonal imbalances, menstrual issues, or other women''s health concerns."}], "short_description": "A holistic wellness sanctuary in East Sacramento offering personalized acupuncture, herbal medicine, and gentle therapies for whole-body healing.", "google_website_url": "http://www.karenchanacupuncture.com/", "google_primary_type": "Medical Clinic", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": ["Karen Chan"], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "5431 H St, Sacramento, CA 95819, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/106513149237279822029", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWJm5L8NzLmq4zP3QNxkIc8qZvPjjDHlwAHETElPy0ikxbWvlYN=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Karen Chan Acupuncture & Herbal Medicine"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/106513149237279822029", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWJm5L8NzLmq4zP3QNxkIc8qZvPjjDHlwAHETElPy0ikxbWvlYN=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Karen Chan Acupuncture & Herbal Medicine"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/106513149237279822029", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWJm5L8NzLmq4zP3QNxkIc8qZvPjjDHlwAHETElPy0ikxbWvlYN=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Karen Chan Acupuncture & Herbal Medicine"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/106513149237279822029", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWJm5L8NzLmq4zP3QNxkIc8qZvPjjDHlwAHETElPy0ikxbWvlYN=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Karen Chan Acupuncture & Herbal Medicine"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/106513149237279822029", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWJm5L8NzLmq4zP3QNxkIc8qZvPjjDHlwAHETElPy0ikxbWvlYN=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Karen Chan Acupuncture & Herbal Medicine"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-26T12:33:24.77237+00:00', 'karen-chan-acupuncture-herbal-medicine', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

Our dentists have over 10 years of experience. Dr. Tina ThuyTrang Nguyen is skilled in all phases of general dentistry, with extensive background working in private offices, teaching at UCSF, and serving as managing dentist for various clinics. Our office is hi-tech equipped with digital intraoral X-rays, panorex, intraoral camera, nitrous oxide relaxing gas, DentalVibe pain-free injection, in-office Zoom whitening, and laser.

We offer advanced orthodontic options including FastBraces, clear brackets, and clear aligners with SureSmile or Reveal. Our goal is your satisfaction and beautiful, healthy smile.', '1089 Park Ave. San Jose, CA 95126', 'San Jose', 'CA', '95126', '408-298-1600', ARRAY['English', 'Spanish', 'Vietnamese']::text[], 'Dental', FALSE, '{"images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/rose-park-dental-google-1.webp"], "rating": 4, "reviews": [{"date": "2026-04-24T19:48:57.117854463Z", "text": "DO NOT come to this practice!! Dr Tina is extremely rude and unprofessional to her staff and patients. She does procedures she is not qualified to be doing. I''m looking into turning her into the dental society for horrible quality of dental work. I''m surprised she hasn''t been sued multiple times.", "author": "Metro Account", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102944356300270493831/reviews"}, {"date": "2024-12-03T16:19:10.691132Z", "text": "Dr. Nguyen and her team have provided quality dental care to my family for years. I highly recommend their dental practice. Both my daughter and I had our smiles completely aligned and restored by their treatment. They also provide cleaning services, fix cavities with modern dental imaging and techniques. I had an old implant with no records, and Dr. Nguyen went the extra mile to track down the exact match for the hardware! They are always concerned about patient comfort and do a thorough job. I have had a lot of dental work done, and their office provides top notch service.", "author": "Justin Smith", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100520203445595023333/reviews"}, {"date": "2018-10-10T22:49:15.677719Z", "text": "Dr. Tina Nguyen has provided excellent dental care for my son, and she also took care of his braces.  She was very careful to take care of his dental health 