ways reassuring. She has a very calming manner of speaking to her patients and has displayed exceptional patience when doing dental check on my toddlers. Her prices are very reasonable, and gives special rates if several members of a family are her clients.", "author": "Eliza Raymundo", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102784985301529284835/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Most patients highly recommend Rose Park Dental for its professional staff, quality dental care, and excellent treatment outcomes, though one review raises concerns about professionalism and qualifications.", "about_highlight": "At Rose Park Dental, our philosophy of care governs everything we do. We truly care about our patients and want you to feel very comfortable with our experienced, well-trained, and friendly staff. We offer bilingual support in Spanish and Vietnamese to assist patients who prefer to communicate in those languages. We recognize each patient as an individual and strive to help you retain your teeth in comfort, function, and esthetics for a lifetime.\n\nOur dentists have over 10 years of experience. Dr. Tina ThuyTrang Nguyen is skilled in all phases of general dentistry, with extensive background working in private offices, teaching at UCSF, and serving as managing dentist for various clinics. Our office is hi-tech equipped with digital intraoral X-rays, panorex, intraoral camera, nitrous oxide relaxing gas, DentalVibe pain-free injection, in-office Zoom whitening, and laser.\n\nWe offer advanced orthodontic options including FastBraces, clear brackets, and clear aligners with SureSmile or Reveal. Our goal is your satisfaction and beautiful, healthy smile.", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=6128524006416213486&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJg0sIG1vLj4AR7mXkDx3kDFU", "quality_missing": ["insurance", "appointment_url"], "search_keywords": ["dental", "den