Our team of experienced general dentists, orthodontists, periodontists, and pediatric dentists, including Drs. Zhu, Su, Gong, Lee, Wong, and Wu, work closely together to ensure each patient receives the best treatments. Dr. Yuying (Eugene) Zhu, DDS, received his doctorate from Columbia University and believes that healthy teeth start with preventive care. Dr. Su Long, DDS, also from Columbia, has decades of experience in cosmetic dentistry and implants. Dr. Jean Gong, DMD, trained at Harvard and Columbia, focusing on orthodontics. Dr. Naleesa Lee, DDS, is a periodontist and active member of several dental academies. Dr. Diane Wong, DDS, specializes in pediatric dentistry and is fluent in English, Cantonese, and Mandarin. Dr. Sandy Wu, DDS, from NYU, is dedicated to gentle, high-quality care.

The practice is located on the 6th floor at 196 Canal Street in New York, next to Tai Pan Bakery and near multiple subway lines. They are open Monday through Sunday, 10:00 AM to 7:00 PM, and offer free parking on weekends at 60 Lispenard St. They accept most major PPO dental insurances such as Aetna, Metlife, Cigna, Delta, United Healthcard, Blue Cross/Blue Shield, and Guardian, and also accept Medicare for certain procedures. Payment methods include major credit cards, cash, personal check, and Apple Pay. New patients can download a first visit form and email it in advance.', '196 Canal Street, floor 6, New York, NY 10013', 'New York', 'NY', '10013', '(212) 966-3649', ARRAY['English', 'Cantonese', 'Mandarin', 'Chinese']::text[], 'Dental', FALSE, '{"email": "canaldentalgroup@gmail.com", "images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/canal-dental-group-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/canal-dental-group-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/canal-dental-group-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/canal-dental-group-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/canal-dental-group-google-5.webp"], "rating": 5, "reviews": [{"date": "2026-06-01T14:38:46.110927963Z", "text": "Canal Dental Group is the best dental practice I’ve visited in years. They made sure to verify my insurance before scheduling the appointment, and called me the day before to remind me. All the staff are friendly and super helpful. The hygienist made sure I felt comfortable, and explained my X rays in detail. Dr. Zhu listened to all of my concerns, and made helpful recommendations for avoiding future issues. I would 10/10 recommend this practice, especially for anyone who’s not super comfortable going to the dentist.", "author": "Ezekiel King Phillips", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116588796739495884792/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-06T19:42:11.192307708Z", "text": "⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n\nI’m so grateful to Canal Dental Group for taking such great care of my emergency tooth situation. A special thank you to Dr. Zhu for the excellent care during my emergency visit — professional, gentle, and very reassuring throughout a stressful experience.\n\nI’d also like to thank dental hygienist Yuki, who took great care of me during my second visit for my teeth cleaning. She was incredibly kind, gentle, and thorough, and made the whole experience very comfortable.\n\nThe front desk team was also so warm, attentive, and welcoming. From scheduling my appointments to making sure everything went smoothly, they made me feel cared for from the moment I walked in.\n\nThe entire team at Canal Dental Group truly goes above and beyond. I really appreciated how well they took care of me during both visits, and I highly recommend them to anyone looking for exceptional dental care. Thank you all so much!", "author": "Kevin Cheung", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101913246049756995970/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-08T17:24:25.756082963Z", "text": "I’ve been a patient at Canal Dental Group for several years, and my recent visit was another reminder of why I keep coming back. I had my cleaning done by a young hygienist I hadn''t met before, and she was fantastic.\n\nShe took the time to clearly communicate every step of the process before starting and answered all my questions in a way that was very easy to understand. Since I have sensitive teeth, I’m always a bit nervous, but she took special care throughout the procedure and reacted to my signals promptly and patiently.\n\nAs always, the office environment is modern, spotless, and very clean. The entire staff is professional and friendly, and I appreciated the minimal wait time. Highly recommend!", "author": "huey lee", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113372536437783400777/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-09-27T20:03:33.192886271Z", "text": "Had sudden tooth pain and found this office on Google, they were able to set me up for an appointment same day. Dr.Wu saw me right away, I have bad experiences with dentist but she offered me a conservative approach to address my tooth pain with a small filling which was done in less than 10minutes and painless. Will be coming back for my future visits.", "author": "Michael Lam", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110603001622638227517/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-11-05T15:41:36.814527567Z", "text": "I have been a patient here for several years and have always been satisfied until this recent experience with this young hygienist. My main complaint is that her cleaning technique caused discomfort,  especially on my top tooth.  As someone who works in the medical field,  I noticed she seemed inexperienced and unsure (was kept saying sorry the whole time) particularly with patients like me whose teeth might be older or more fragile.  During the procedure,  I told her that the way she cleaned my top tooth was uncomfortable and was hurting,  but she replied that it was due to deep stains and need more pressure.  Additionally,  the process felt messy -water ran down to my neck the whole time and I was not provide tissue.  I have already told the front desk not to schedule with her again. But doctor was very nice and be able to fix and fill the chipped tooth.", "author": "May Shek", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117097333490040808451/reviews"}], "website": "https://www.canaldentalgroup.com/", "location": {"latitude": 40.716681699999995, "longitude": -73.99831859999999}, "services": ["Dental Consultation", "Preventive Care", "Restoration Dentistry", "Children Dental Care", "Orthodontic Care", "Cosmetic Dentistry", "Endodontic", "Oral Surgery", "Periodontics"], "insurance": {"notes": "Most major PPO Dental Insurances are accepted. Accepts Medicare insurance for certain qualified dental procedures. Please call to confirm we take your insurance. Also accepts Major Credit Card, Cash, Personal Check, Apple Pay.", "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": true, "accepted_networks": ["Aetna", "MetLife", "Cigna", "Delta Dental", "UnitedHealthcare", "Blue Cross Blue Shield", "Guardian", "Medicare"], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": true}, "highlights": [{"title": "Bilingual/Multilingual Staff", "detail": "Dr. Diane Wong is fluent in English, Cantonese, and Mandarin. Full Chinese language website available.", "category": "culture"}, {"title": "Weekend & Evening Hours", "detail": "Open Monday through Sunday, 10:00am–7:00pm.", "category": "convenience"}, {"title": "Free Parking on Weekends", "detail": "Free parking available on weekends at 60 Lispenard St, NY, NY 10013.", "category": "convenience"}, {"title": "State-of-the-Art Technology", "detail": "Dentists trained in state-of-the-art techniques and technologies, including CBCT.", "category": "technology"}, {"title": "Accepts Medicare", "detail": "Accepts Medicare insurance for certain qualified dental procedures.", "category": "insurance"}, {"title": "Accepting New Patients", "detail": "New patients are welcome; first visit form available for download.", "category": "care"}], "price_tier": "$$", "source_url": "https://www.canaldentalgroup.com/", "appointment": {"booking_note": "Name, Email, Phone Number, Message. Submit request via form on website.", "appointment_url": null, "new_patient_note": "At your first visit, we will assess your needs and give you an estimate of cost. Please download the first visit form and bring it with you for the first visit, or email it in advance.", "phone_booking_available": true, "online_booking_available": true, "free_consultation_available": null}, "open_sunday": true, "scout_query": "Chinese dentist in New York, NY", "search_text": "dental | dentist | nha khoa | nha sĩ | trồng răng | implant | root canal | crowns | veneers | braces | invisalign | toothache | 치과 | 치과의사 | 임플란트 | 牙医 | 牙科 | 种植牙 | english | cantonese | chinese | 粤语 | 广东话 | tiếng quảng đông | mandarin | 中文 | 普通话 | 国语 | tiếng trung | tiếng phổ thông | 华人 | dental consultation | preventive care | restoration dentistry | children dental care | orthodontic care | cosmetic dentistry | endodontic | oral surgery | periodontics | preventive | restorative | pediatric | orthodontic | cosmetic | surgical | periodontic | aetna | metlife | cigna | delta dental | unitedhealthcare | blue cross blue shield | guardian | medicare | dr. yuying (eugene) zhu | general dentist | dr. su long | dr. jean gong | orthodontist | dr. naleesa lee | periodontist | dr. diane wong | pediatric dentist | dr. sandy wu", "google_types": ["dental_clinic", "dentist", "medical_clinic", "health", "point_of_interest", "establishment"], "open_weekend": true, "rating_count": 359, "team_members": [{"name": "Dr. Yuying (Eugene) Zhu", "role": "General Dentist", "bio_snippet": "Received his doctorate in dentistry from Columbia University in 1996. Recipient of the Odontology Award for top academic achievement. Believes in preventive dental care and maintenance of personal oral hygiene. Continuously trains with newest technology.", "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Dr. Su Long", "role": "General Dentist", "bio_snippet": "Graduated from the College of Dental Medicine at Columbia University in 1996. Extensive experience in cosmetic dentistry, dental implants, and oral surgery. Decades of experience with porcelain techniques.", "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Dr. Jean Gong", "role": "Orthodontist", "bio_snippet": "Received her doctorate in dentistry from the Harvard School of Dental Medicine in 2003 and completed her orthodontics residency at Columbia University College of Dental Medicine in 2005.", "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Dr. Naleesa Lee", "role": "Periodontist", "bio_snippet": "Graduated from Stony Brook in 1999 and completed her perio dentistry in 2002. Active member of the American Academy of Periodontology, Academy of Osseointegration, American Dental Association, and Nassau County Dental Society.", "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Dr. Diane Wong", "role": "Pediatric Dentist", "bio_snippet": "Obtained her doctorate in dentistry from the Columbia College of Dental Medicine in 1996 and completed her specialty training in pediatric dentistry at NYU College of Dentistry in 2004. Fluent in English, Cantonese, and Mandarin.", "languages_spoken": ["English", "Cantonese", "Mandarin"]}, {"name": "Dr. Sandy Wu", "role": "General Dentist", "bio_snippet": "Received her doctorate in dentistry from New York University College of Dentistry and continued training at NYP Brooklyn Methodist Hospital''s residency program. Clinical interests include cosmetic and restorative dentistry, and preventive care.", "languages_spoken": []}], "language_note": "Canal Dental Group serves the Chinatown area of New York City, and one of their pediatric dentists, Dr. Diane Wong, is fluent in English, Cantonese, and Mandarin. The clinic''s logo includes Chinese characters, and a full Chinese language version of the website is available, indicating a strong Asian and immigrant patient focus.", "open_saturday": true, "quality_score": 98, "working_hours": {"friday": "10:00 AM – 7:00 PM", "monday": "10:00 AM – 7:00 PM", "sunday": "9:30 AM – 5:30 PM", "tuesday": "10:00 AM – 7:00 PM", "saturday": "9:30 AM – 5:30 PM", "thursday": "10:00 AM – 7:00 PM", "wednesday": "10:00 AM – 7:00 PM"}, "gallery_images": ["https://canaldentalgroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/team2.jpeg", "https://canaldentalgroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/team1.jpg", "https://canaldentalgroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Nurse_all.jpg", "https://canaldentalgroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/office4.jpg", "https://canaldentalgroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/office3.jpg", "https://canaldentalgroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/office2.jpg", "https://canaldentalgroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/office1.jpg", "https://canaldentalgroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/room2.jpg", "https://canaldentalgroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/room1.jpg", "https://canaldentalgroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/team-party.jpg", "https://canaldentalgroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/canaldental_team2.png", "https://canaldentalgroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/canaldental_team1.png", "https://canaldentalgroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/canaldental_team4.png", "https://canaldentalgroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/canaldental_team3.png", "https://canaldentalgroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/canaldental_team5.png", "https://canaldentalgroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/drwu.jpg", "https://canaldentalgroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/about-section-2.jpg", "https://canaldentalgroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/office3_payment.jpg", "https://canaldentalgroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Canal-new-logo-350x117.png"], "review_profile": {"rating": 5, "source": "google", "themes": [{"theme": "Compassionate care", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients highlight compassionate care in their feedback."}, {"theme": "Friendly staff", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients highlight friendly staff in their feedback."}, {"theme": "Clear explanations", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients highlight clear explanations in their feedback."}, {"theme": "Comfortable visits", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients highlight comfortable visits in their feedback."}], "summary": "CANAL DENTAL GROUP has a 5.0 star Google rating from 359 Google reviews. Patients commonly mention compassionate care, friendly staff, clear explanations, comfortable visits.", "review_count": 359, "concern_themes": [], "positive_themes": ["amazing experience", "spotless office", "great location", "comforting and friendly staff", "great communication", "great service", "state of arts equipment", "super friendly front desk", "helpful with insurance", "gentle and efficient hygienists"], "featured_reviews": [{"date": "2026-06-01T14:38:46.110927963Z", "text": "Canal Dental Group is the best dental practice I’ve visited in years. They made sure to verify my insurance before scheduling the appointment, and called me the day before to remind me. All the staff are friendly and super helpful. The hygienist made sure I felt comfortable, and explained my X rays in detail. Dr. Zhu listened to all of my concerns, and made helpful recommendations for avoiding future issues. I would 10/10 recommend this practice, especially for anyone who’s not super comfortable going to the dentist.", "author": "Ezekiel King Phillips", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116588796739495884792/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-06T19:42:11.192307708Z", "text": "⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n\nI’m so grateful to Canal Dental Group for taking such great care of my emergency tooth situation. A special thank you to Dr. Zhu for the excellent care during my emergency visit — professional, gentle, and very reassuring throughout a stressful experience.\n\nI’d also like to thank dental hygienist Yuki, who took great care of me during my second visit for my teeth cleaning. She was incredibly kind, gentle, and thorough, and made the whole experience very comfortable.\n\nThe front desk team was also so warm, attentive, and welcoming. From scheduling my appointments to making sure everything went smoothly, they made me feel cared for from the moment I walked in.\n\nThe entire team at Canal Dental Group truly goes above and beyond. I really appreciated how well they took care of me during both visits, and I highly recommend them to anyone looking for exceptional dental care. Thank you all so much!", "author": "Kevin Cheung", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101913246049756995970/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-08T17:24:25.756082963Z", "text": "I’ve been a patient at Canal Dental Group for several years, and my recent visit was another reminder of why I keep coming back. I had my cleaning done by a young hygienist I hadn''t met before, and she was fantastic.\n\nShe took the time to clearly communicate every step of the process before starting and answered all my questions in a way that was very easy to understand. Since I have sensitive teeth, I’m always a bit nervous, but she took special care throughout the procedure and reacted to my signals promptly and patiently.\n\nAs always, the office environment is modern, spotless, and very clean. The entire staff is professional and friendly, and I appreciated the minimal wait time. Highly recommend!", "author": "huey lee", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113372536437783400777/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-09-27T20:03:33.192886271Z", "text": "Had sudden tooth pain and found this office on Google, they were able to set me up for an appointment same day. Dr.Wu saw me right away, I have bad experiences with dentist but she offered me a conservative approach to address my tooth pain with a small filling which was done in less than 10minutes and painless. Will be coming back for my future visits.", "author": "Michael Lam", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110603001622638227517/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-11-05T15:41:36.814527567Z", "text": "I have been a patient here for several years and have always been satisfied until this recent experience with this young hygienist. My main complaint is that her cleaning technique caused discomfort,  especially on my top tooth.  As someone who works in the medical field,  I noticed she seemed inexperienced and unsure (was kept saying sorry the whole time) particularly with patients like me whose teeth might be older or more fragile.  During the procedure,  I told her that the way she cleaned my top tooth was uncomfortable and was hurting,  but she replied that it was due to deep stains and need more pressure.  Additionally,  the process felt messy -water ran down to my neck the whole time and I was not provide tissue.  I have already told the front desk not to schedule with her again. But doctor was very nice and be able to fix and fill the chipped tooth.", "author": "May Shek", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117097333490040808451/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "CANAL DENTAL GROUP has a 5.0 star Google rating from 359 Google reviews. Patients commonly mention compassionate care, friendly staff, clear explanations, comfortable visits.", "about_highlight": "At Canal Dental Group, our goal is to offer you the best comprehensive dental healthcare. We believe it is essential to listen to you, the patient, and understand your needs. Our dentists not only offer a breadth of treatment plans and options but are also trained in state-of-the-art techniques and technologies. We are Committed To Dental Excellence.\n\nOur team of experienced general dentists, orthodontists, periodontists, and pediatric dentists, including Drs. Zhu, Su, Gong, Lee, Wong, and Wu, work closely together to ensure each patient receives the best treatments. Dr. Yuying (Eugene) Zhu, DDS, received his doctorate from Columbia University and believes that healthy teeth start with preventive care. Dr. Su Long, DDS, also from Columbia, has decades of experience in cosmetic dentistry and implants. Dr. Jean Gong, DMD, trained at Harvard and Columbia, focusing on orthodontics. Dr. Naleesa Lee, DDS, is a periodontist and active member of several dental academies. Dr. Diane Wong, DDS, specializes in pediatric dentistry and is fluent in English, Cantonese, and Mandarin. Dr. Sandy Wu, DDS, from NYU, is dedicated to gentle, high-quality care.\n\nThe practice is located on the 6th floor at 196 Canal Street in New York, next to Tai Pan Bakery and near multiple subway lines. They are open Monday through Sunday, 10:00 AM to 7:00 PM, and offer free parking on weekends at 60 Lispenard St. They accept most major PPO dental insurances such as Aetna, Metlife, Cigna, Delta, United Healthcard, Blue Cross/Blue Shield, and Guardian, and also accept Medicare for certain procedures. Payment methods include major credit cards, cash, personal check, and Apple Pay. New patients can download a first visit form and email it in advance.", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=375078216392266517&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJy4LHWZRZwokRFVMMi6aLNAU", "quality_missing": ["appointment_url"], "search_keywords": ["dental", "dentist", "nha khoa", "nha sĩ", "trồng răng", "implant", "root canal", "crowns", "veneers", "braces", "invisalign", "toothache", "치과", "치과의사", "임플란트", "牙医", "牙科", "种植牙", "english", "cantonese", "chinese", "粤语", "广东话", "tiếng quảng đông", "mandarin", "中文", "普通话", "国语", "tiếng trung", "tiếng phổ thông", "华人", "dental consultation", "preventive care", "restoration dentistry", "children dental care", "orthodontic care", "cosmetic dentistry", "endodontic", "oral surgery", "periodontics", "preventive", "restorative", "pediatric", "orthodontic", "cosmetic", "surgical", "periodontic", "aetna", "metlife", "cigna", "delta dental", "unitedhealthcare", "blue cross blue shield", "guardian", "medicare", "dr. yuying (eugene) zhu", "general dentist", "dr. su long", "dr. jean gong", "orthodontist", "dr. naleesa lee", "periodontist", "dr. diane wong", "pediatric dentist", "dr. sandy wu"], "cultural_context": "Canal Dental Group serves the Chinatown area of New York City, and one of their pediatric dentists, Dr. Diane Wong, is fluent in English, Cantonese, and Mandarin. The clinic''s logo includes Chinese characters, and a full Chinese language version of the website is available, indicating a strong Asian and immigrant patient focus.", "services_offered": [{"name": "Dental Consultation", "category": "Preventive", "description": "Comprehensive oral examination with X ray, CBCT.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Preventive Care", "category": "Preventive", "description": "Complete Oral Hygiene Care.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Restoration Dentistry", "category": "Restorative", "description": "Filling and Bonding, Crown, Bridge, Denture.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Children Dental Care", "category": "Pediatric", "description": "We''re great with kids! Make each trip to the dentist fun for the whole family!", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Orthodontic Care", "category": "Orthodontic", "description": "Tooth alignment.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Cosmetic Dentistry", "category": "Cosmetic", "description": "Teeth Whitening, Porcelain Veneer.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Endodontic", "category": "Endodontic", "description": "Root Canal Therapy.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Oral Surgery", "category": "Surgical", "description": "Tooth Extraction, Dental Implant.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Periodontics", "category": "Periodontic", "description": "Scaling and Root Planning.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}], "short_description": "A comprehensive dental healthcare practice committed to excellence, located on Canal Street in Chinatown, New York. Open seven days a week with multilingual staff and state-of-the-art technology.", "google_website_url": "https://www.canaldentalgroup.com/", "insurance_accepted": ["Aetna", "MetLife", "Cigna", "Delta Dental", "UnitedHealthcare", "Blue Cross Blue Shield", "Guardian", "Medicare"], "google_primary_type": "Dental Clinic", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": ["Dr. Yuying (Eugene) Zhu", "Dr. Su Long", "Dr. Jean Gong", "Dr. Naleesa Lee", "Dr. Diane Wong", "Dr. Sandy Wu"], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "accepting_new_patients": true, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "196 Canal St floor 6, New York, NY 10013, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/116189399780969201647", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWwNl7rWI6z4-g3PIOADJE3dsVokH1WkgcUUHh1pGupX9QYdiXV=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "CANAL DENTAL GROUP"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/116189399780969201647", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWwNl7rWI6z4-g3PIOADJE3dsVokH1WkgcUUHh1pGupX9QYdiXV=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "CANAL DENTAL GROUP"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/116189399780969201647", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWwNl7rWI6z4-g3PIOADJE3dsVokH1WkgcUUHh1pGupX9QYdiXV=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "CANAL DENTAL GROUP"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/116189399780969201647", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWwNl7rWI6z4-g3PIOADJE3dsVokH1WkgcUUHh1pGupX9QYdiXV=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "CANAL DENTAL GROUP"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/110594431551902068139", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU5NNEXELE4G-JIr9_JPrhmbJg080E6cDg0_PzUp3-SFNvRULgi=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Matthew"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-26T12:54:03.929064+00:00', 'canal-dental-group', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

The office is fluent in English and Spanish, and combined, the doctors also speak Hindi, Punjabi, and Vietnamese—making care accessible to a diverse, multilingual patient community. Patients are invited to visit the newly renovated office for clear vision and high-quality care they can trust.

Conveniently located on Meridian Avenue between San Carlos and Park Avenue, Eye Medical Clinic provides both clinic and optical services throughout the workweek. The team is dedicated to helping every patient enjoy life to the fullest with the clear vision they deserve.', '220 Meridian Avenue', 'San Jose', 'CA', '95126', '(408) 869-3400', ARRAY['Hindi', 'Spanish', 'English', 'Vietnamese', 'Punjabi']::text[], 'Ophthalmology', FALSE, '{"images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/eye-medical-clinic-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/eye-medical-clinic-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/eye-medical-clinic-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/eye-medical-clinic-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/eye-medical-clinic-google-5.webp"], "rating": 4.3, "reviews": [{"date": "2026-06-05T15:07:06.451141252Z", "text": "I was referred to Dr John Sullivan when I had an incidence of Bell''s Palsy that was not identified by my then optometrist.  I was immediately impressed by Dr Sullivan''s clear expertise, his patient explanation of everything and his manner.  I highly recommend this Doctor. I have since transferred to this Doctor.", "author": "Andy M", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102373838910635479572/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-09-25T18:09:34.562852729Z", "text": "This place is great, a few different actual OPHTHALMOLOGISTS (MDs) on staff and great optometrist and techs. For what looks old school outside they fit you in ASAP even for a new patient with blurry vision. No one else called me back but them.", "author": "Jeni Goedken", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107491819931389618749/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-03-18T00:28:01.004842265Z", "text": "Even if you have an appointment, don''t expect to see the doctor on time. You''ll likely have to wait at least an hour and a half before it''s your turn. They accept appointments but don''t honor the schedule, which is a complete waste of an hour and a half.\nTo make matters worse, the doctor was incredibly rude. I should have listened to the reviews advising people of color to avoid this clinic. I am never coming back, and I will be sharing my negative experience with my local community to warn others.\"", "author": "See’s", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116184977834829896851/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-24T19:02:59.405874295Z", "text": "Front desk clerks are very friendly. They go extra miles to make sure you can get appointments to set up to see doctors", "author": "Julienne scullion", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109478267142937981424/reviews"}, {"date": "2021-06-15T18:10:16.474184Z", "text": "I cannot recommend Dr. Deane enough.  She is skilled, efficient, and has great attention to detail.  She notices things about my eyes that other doctors have either overlooked or just not mentioned.  I feel very safe with my vision in her capable hands!\nThe office staff is also excellent, I am always seen at my appointment time and they are always friendly and helpful.\nI can also recommend the optical shop; I bought my latest frames from the Eye Medical Clinic, and over a year later they still look great! I would have never picked these frames for myself without their help.", "author": "Rachel Unger", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107027291141516635575/reviews"}], "website": "https://eyemedicalclinic.com", "location": {"latitude": 37.325364799999996, "longitude": -121.91364120000001}, "services": ["Cataract Care", "Retina Services", "Cornea Services", "Glaucoma Treatment", "Eye Exams", "Glasses + Contacts", "Dry Eye Treatment", "Eyelid Surgery", "Dermal Fillers"], "insurance": {"notes": "Insurance and financing details are not listed on this page; the clinic has a dedicated Insurance + Financing resource page.", "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": [], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": false}, "highlights": [{"title": "Multilingual Care Team", "detail": "Office staff are fluent in English and Spanish, and the doctors also speak Hindi, Punjabi, and Vietnamese.", "category": "culture"}, {"title": "75+ Years of Trusted Care", "detail": "Eye Medical Clinic has served the San Jose area for more than 75 years, building a reputation generations of families trust.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Comprehensive Eye Care", "detail": "From family eye exams to advanced cataract and glaucoma surgery, the clinic covers the full spectrum of eye care under one roof.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Newly Renovated Office", "detail": "Patients are invited to visit the clinic''s newly renovated office on Meridian Avenue in San Jose.", "category": "convenience"}], "price_tier": "$$", "source_url": "https://eyemedicalclinic.com/san-jose-location-hours/?y_source=1_MTA3OTU1MzMtNzE1LWxvY2F0aW9uLndlYnNpdGU%3D", "appointment": {"booking_note": "Patients can schedule appointments online via the Schedule Appointment page or call (408) 869-3400.", "appointment_url": "https://eyemedicalclinic.com/schedule-appointment", "new_patient_note": "New Patient Registration is available via the clinic''s website.", "phone_booking_available": true, "online_booking_available": true, "free_consultation_available": null}, "open_sunday": false, "scout_query": "Vietnamese eye clinic in San Jose, CA", "search_text": "ophtha