 described a doctor as incredibly rude."}, {"theme": "Facility Accessibility", "mentions": 1, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "A patient appreciated being fit in quickly as a new patient when other clinics didn''t respond."}], "summary": "Most patients highly recommend Eye Medical Clinic, praising the doctors'' expertise and friendly staff, though some report long wait times and negative experiences with punctuality and doctor interactions.", "review_count": 118, "concern_themes": [], "positive_themes": [], "featured_reviews": [{"date": "2026-06-05T15:07:06.451141252Z", "text": "I was referred to Dr John Sullivan when I had an incidence of Bell''s Palsy that was not identified by my then optometrist.  I was immediately impressed by Dr Sullivan''s clear expertise, his patient explanation of everything and his manner.  I highly recommend this Doctor. I have since transferred to this Doctor.", "author": "Andy M", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102373838910635479572/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-09-25T18:09:34.562852729Z", "text": "This place is great, a few different actual OPHTHALMOLOGISTS (MDs) on staff and great optometrist and techs. For what looks old school outside they fit you in ASAP even for a new patient with blurry vision. No one else called me back but them.", "author": "Jeni Goedken", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107491819931389618749/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-03-18T00:28:01.004842265Z", "text": "Even if you have an appointment, don''t expect to see the doctor on time. You''ll likely have to wait at least an hour and a half before it''s your turn. They accept appointments but don''t honor the schedule, which is a complete waste of an hour and a half.\nTo make matters worse, the doctor was incredibly rude. I should have listened to the reviews advising people of color to avoid this clinic. I am never coming back, and I will be sharing my negative experience with my local community to warn others.\"", "author": "See’s", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116184977834829896851/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-24T19:02:59.405874295Z", "text": "Front desk clerks are very friendly. They go extra miles to make sure you can get appointments to set up to see doctors", "author": "Julienne scullion", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109478267142937981424/reviews"}, {"date": "2021-06-15T18:10:16.474184Z", "text": "I cannot recommend Dr. Deane enough.  She is skilled, efficient, and has great attention to detail.  She notices things about my eyes that other doctors have either overlooked or just not mentioned.  I feel very safe with my vision in her capable hands!\nThe office staff is also excellent, I am always seen at my appointment time and they are always friendly and helpful.\nI can also recommend the optical shop; I bought my latest frames from the Eye Medical Clinic, and over a year later they still look great! I would have never picked these frames for myself without their help.", "author": "Rachel Unger", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107027291141516635575/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Most patients highly recommend Eye Medical Clinic, praising the doctors'' expertise and friendly staff, though some report long wait times and negative experiences with punctuality and doctor interactions.", "about_highlight": "Eye Medical Clinic is a comprehensive eye care destination in San Jose, California, offering everything from routine family eye exams to advanced medical, surgical, and laser procedures for cataracts and glaucoma. With a legacy of more than 75 years serving the San Jose area, the clinic has built a trusted reputation that generations of families rely on, growing alongside Silicon Valley while embracing the most advanced techniques and technology in eye care and vision correction.\n\nThe office is fluent in English and Spanish, and combined, the doctors also speak Hindi, Punjabi, and Vietnamese—making care accessible to a diverse, multilingual patient community. Patients are invited to visit the newly renovated office for clear vision and high-quality care they can trust.\n\nConveniently located on Meridian Avenue between San Carlos and Park Avenue, Eye Medical Clinic provides both clinic and optical services throughout the workweek. The team is dedicated to helping every patient enjoy life to the fullest with the clear vision they deserve.", "appointment_url": "https://eyemedicalclinic.com/schedule-appointment", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=9915905608399682231&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJM2ki0UTLj4ARt3r3Np1fnIk", "quality_missing": ["insurance", "team_members"], "search_keywords": ["ophthalmology", "optometry", "optometrist", "eye doctor", "eye exam", "cataract", "lasik", "glasses", "nhãn khoa", "khám mắt", "bác sĩ mắt", "안과", "검안", "眼科", "配镜", "hindi", "spanish", "english", "vietnamese", "tiếng việt", "người việt", "bác sĩ việt", "punjabi", "cataract care", "retina services", "cornea services", "glaucoma treatment", "eye exams", "glasses + contacts", "dry eye treatment", "eyelid surgery", "dermal fillers", "surgical", "specialty", "medical", "preventive", "optical", "cosmetic"], "cultural_context": "Eye Medical Clinic serves a multilingual community. The office staff is fluent in English and Spanish, and the doctors collectively also speak Hindi, Punjabi, and Vietnamese, offering language access for South Asian and Vietnamese patients in the San Jose area.", "services_offered": [{"name": "Cataract Care", "category": "Surgical", "description": "Cataract surgery, advanced technology lenses, and cataract self-evaluation resources.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Retina Services", "category": "Specialty", "description": "Evaluation and treatment of retinal conditions for patients who need a retina specialist.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Cornea Services", "category": "Specialty", "description": "Evaluation and treatment of corneal conditions for patients who need a cornea specialist.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Glaucoma Treatment", "category": "Medical", "description": "Diagnosis, treatment, and FAQs for glaucoma management.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Eye Exams", "category": "Preventive", "description": "Comprehensive eye exams for every member of the family.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Glasses + Contacts", "category": "Optical", "description": "Prescription glasses and contact lens services through the in-office optical.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Dry Eye Treatment", "category": "Medical", "description": "Care for patients experiencing dry eye symptoms.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Eyelid Surgery", "category": "Cosmetic", "description": "Surgical eyelid procedures offered as both medical and cosmetic care.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Dermal Fillers", "category": "Cosmetic", "description": "Cosmetic injectable treatments including dermal fillers.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}], "short_description": "Eye Medical Clinic is a San Jose eye care destination with 75+ years of trusted service, offering comprehensive eye exams and advanced cataract, glaucoma, retinal, and corneal care in a newly renovated multilingual office.", "google_website_url": "https://eyemedicalclinic.com/san-jose-location-hours/?y_source=1_MTA3OTU1MzMtNzE1LWxvY2F0aW9uLndlYnNpdGU%3D", "google_primary_type": "Medical Clinic", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": [], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "220 Meridian Ave, San Jose, CA 95126, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/106048594040559266687", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVg33M_gxvkIZ3cBvRiYj9MeXMGSd3uOfmmZDNrrxaU2UQ-zoNB=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "B W"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/107491819931389618749", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVxd1qWvU_dwW-Bk-B9c4Yxpkdlt-xxloSADItJYcADSk8xdn2m=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Jeni Goedken"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/113750467819094311941", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUiNFQg2ZusHwNyewTRLf6fieOajs8rEfVyrydV9kgDMN-KGX6s-Q=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Abdul Majid"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/106048594040559266687", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVg33M_gxvkIZ3cBvRiYj9MeXMGSd3uOfmmZDNrrxaU2UQ-zoNB=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "B W"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/107027291141516635575", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUn3ZLnKFAz5F3lw10AiwsQ1Q71xind1gaMSt1-yzdqkNKBdHiXLg=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Rachel Unger"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-26T13:21:18.182627+00:00', 'eye-medical-clinic', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

The office emphasizes transparent financial communication: all fees are presented in writing before treatment begins, insurance estimates are provided, and billing is explained thoroughly. Pannu Dental Group accepts most major dental insurance plans, files claims on behalf of patients, and partners with CareCredit and Unicorn Financial to offer interest-free financing options up to 48 months. The practice also welcomes new patients and has appointments available for cleanings and check-ups.

Located at 145 N Jackson Ave, Suite 101, San Jose, CA 95116, the office is easily accessible with on-site parking and extended weekday hours. The front desk team handles scheduling, insurance verification, and payment planning to streamline the patient experience. With a 4.8/5.0 rating and over 300 reviews, patients consistently praise the warm, welcoming front desk and the caring, family-like atmosphere that helps even nervous patients feel relaxed and at ease.', '145 N Jackson Ave, Suite 101, San Jose, CA 95116', 'San Jose', 'CA', '95116', '(669) 369-5045', ARRAY['English', 'Vietnamese']::text[], 'Dental', FALSE, '{"images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/pannu-dental-group-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/pannu-dental-group-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/pannu-dental-group-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/pannu-dental-group-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/pannu-dental-group-google-5.webp"], "rating": 4.7, "pricing": [{"name": "General Dental Visit", "notes": "All fees are presented in writing before treatment begins. Insurance estimates are provided to show out-of-pocket costs in advance.", "price": null, "category": "Exam", "price_range": null}, {"name": "CareCredit Financing", "notes": "Interest-free financing available based on approval. Flexible payment terms up to 48 months. No penalties for early payoff.", "price": null, "category": "membership", "price_range": null}, {"name": "Unicorn Financial Financing", "notes": "Interest-free financing available based on approval. Flexible payment terms up to 48 months.", "price": null, "category": "membership", "price_range": null}], "reviews": [{"date": "2026-03-07T19:59:52.552527153Z", "text": "I had a great experience by implementing the teeth with the team of Dr Pannu with the robot yomi. 1. The numbing process the perfect I feel nothing 2. The robot and the team are very professional. I literally feel nothing after the surgery! Will continue updating my experience here", "author": "JJJ", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101221141985523861380/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-01-04T21:39:41.576335545Z", "text": "I had some crown work recently at the San Jose office. Theresa and Simran who were assisting are very skillful and nice. Theresa explained to me what she’s going to do and kept checking if I’m ok. Dr. Dheri is my dentist and she is awesome. She’s calm and so soft spoken and calming! I also like Rhonda who’s in the front office. She’s very efficient and knows how to work with patients. For me the best part is, when I shared that I’m allergic to Glade and fragrance  products, they actually don’t use them anymore.", "author": "Prasanna", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105988754931941334977/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-10-18T05:23:50.668240210Z", "text": "Dr. Pannu is truly exceptional. He’s highly skilled, attentive, and genuinely values his patients. He’s always accommodating and available when needed, making every visit smooth and reassuring.\n\nThe entire team from the front desk staff to the dental hygienists provides outstanding customer service. Everyone is friendly, professional, and makes you feel completely at ease. You can tell they care about both the quality of care and the overall patient experience. Highly recommend!", "author": "Mamaye K.", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117269975882109775935/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-04-11T02:45:20.416425194Z", "text": "I got an implant and bone graft with Dr. Pannu. He is really nice!\nAfter the free consultation, he explained everything very clearly!\nThe staff and nurses are knowledgeable, nice, and polite!\nAfter the surgery and implant, I only felt a little pain. The doctor did a great job!\nThank you so much doctor Pannu and his team!", "author": "Quang Le", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106990715539370245020/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-12-30T01:24:51.056949681Z", "text": "I had an excellent experience at Pannu Dental Group for my teeth whitening treatment. The procedure was performed by dental assistant Teresa, who was highly professional, knowledgeable, and attentive throughout the entire process. She explained each step clearly, ensured I was comfortable, and delivered great results! I was very happy with how my teeth turned out. The entire team at Pannu Dental Group was welcoming, organized, and supportive, which made the visit smooth and stress-free from start to finish. It’s clear that patient care and comfort are a priority at this office. I would highly recommend Pannu Dental Group to anyone considering teeth whitening or looking for a dental practice that provides high-quality care and a great overall experience.", "author": "Marissa", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103319133166236418882/reviews"}], "website": "https://www.pannudental.com/dentist-in-san-jose-ca/", "location": {"latitude": 37.3615113, "longitude": -121.84684539999999}, "services": ["General and Preventive Dentistry", "Cosmetic Dentistry", "Dental Implants", "Orthodontics", "Restorative Dentistry", "Oral Surgery", "Root Canal Treatment", "Sleep Apnea Treatment", "Pediatric Dentistry", "Dentures"], "insurance": {"notes": "Accepts most major dental insurance plans. Billing team files claims on your behalf to maximize benefits. All fees are presented in writing before treatment begin