ry_quote": "Patients note clear explanations of procedures and regular check-ins to ensure their comfort and understanding."}, {"theme": "Facility Environment", "mentions": 2, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "The welcoming and organized office environment contributes to a smooth and stress-free experience."}], "summary": "Patients consistently praise Pannu Dental Group for their professional, attentive, and caring staff, as well as their high-quality dental treatments and comfortable patient experience.", "review_count": 411, "concern_themes": [], "positive_themes": ["Warm and welcoming front desk", "Family-like atmosphere", "Helps nervous patients feel relaxed"], "featured_reviews": [{"date": "2026-03-07T19:59:52.552527153Z", "text": "I had a great experience by implementing the teeth with the team of Dr Pannu with the robot yomi. 1. The numbing process the perfect I feel nothing 2. The robot and the team are very professional. I literally feel nothing after the surgery! Will continue updating my experience here", "author": "JJJ", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101221141985523861380/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-01-04T21:39:41.576335545Z", "text": "I had some crown work recently at the San Jose office. Theresa and Simran who were assisting are very skillful and nice. Theresa explained to me what she’s going to do and kept checking if I’m ok. Dr. Dheri is my dentist and she is awesome. She’s calm and so soft spoken and calming! I also like Rhonda who’s in the front office. She’s very efficient and knows how to work with patients. For me the best part is, when I shared that I’m allergic to Glade and fragrance  products, they actually don’t use them anymore.", "author": "Prasanna", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105988754931941334977/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-10-18T05:23:50.668240210Z", "text": "Dr. Pannu is truly exceptional. He’s highly skilled, attentive, and genuinely values his patients. He’s always accommodating and available when needed, making every visit smooth and reassuring.\n\nThe entire team from the front desk staff to the dental hygienists provides outstanding customer service. Everyone is friendly, professional, and makes you feel completely at ease. You can tell they care about both the quality of care and the overall patient experience. Highly recommend!", "author": "Mamaye K.", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117269975882109775935/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-04-11T02:45:20.416425194Z", "text": "I got an implant and bone graft with Dr. Pannu. He is really nice!\nAfter the free consultation, he explained everything very clearly!\nThe staff and nurses are knowledgeable, nice, and polite!\nAfter the surgery and implant, I only felt a little pain. The doctor did a great job!\nThank you so much doctor Pannu and his team!", "author": "Quang Le", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106990715539370245020/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-12-30T01:24:51.056949681Z", "text": "I had an excellent experience at Pannu Dental Group for my teeth whitening treatment. The procedure was performed by dental assistant Teresa, who was highly professional, knowledgeable, and attentive throughout the entire process. She explained each step clearly, ensured I was comfortable, and delivered great results! I was very happy with how my teeth turned out. The entire team at Pannu Dental Group was welcoming, organized, and supportive, which made the visit smooth and stress-free from start to finish. It’s clear that patient care and comfort are a priority at this office. I would highly recommend Pannu Dental Group to anyone considering teeth whitening or looking for a dental practice that provides high-quality care and a great overall experience.", "author": "Marissa", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103319133166236418882/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Patients consistently praise Pannu Dental Group for their professional, attentive, and caring staff, as well as their high-quality dental treatments and comfortable patient experience.", "about_highlight": "Pannu Dental Group, led by Dr. Dalvir S. Pannu, has been serving the San Jose community for over 20 years, opening its doors in 2003. The practice offers multi-specialty care under one roof, including general, cosmetic, restorative, orthodontic, implant, and pediatric dentistry, so that patients can receive coordinated treatment plans without referrals to multiple offices. The team uses advanced technology like digital X-rays, cone-beam CT imaging, intraoral scanning, and the FDA-cleared Yomi robotic implant system to deliver precise, predictable results with minimal discomfort.\n\nThe office emphasizes transparent financial communication: all fees are presented in writing before treatment begins, insurance estimates are provided, and billing is explained thoroughly. Pannu Dental Group accepts most major dental insurance plans, files claims on behalf of patients, and partners with CareCredit and Unicorn Financial to offer interest-free financing options up to 48 months. The practice also welcomes new patients and has appointments available for cleanings and check-ups.\n\nLocated at 145 N Jackson Ave, Suite 101, San Jose, CA 95116, the office is easily accessible with on-site parking and extended weekday hours. The front desk team handles scheduling, insurance verification, and payment planning to streamline the patient experience. With a 4.8/5.0 rating and over 300 reviews, patients consistently praise the warm, welcoming front desk and the caring, family-like atmosphere that helps even nervous patients feel relaxed and at ease.", "appointment_url": "https://www.pannudental.com/schedule-today/", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=15469586489920053224&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJjZKYUjXMj4AR6N_dgfMCr9Y", "quality_missing": ["insurance"], "search_keywords": ["dental", "dentist", "nha khoa", "nha sĩ", "trồng răng", "implant", "root canal", "crowns", "veneers", "braces", "invisalign", "toothache", "치과", "치과의사", "임플란트", "牙医", "牙科", "种植牙", "english", "vietnamese", "tiếng việt", "người việt", "bác sĩ việt", "general and preventive dentistry", "cosmetic dentistry", "dental implants", "orthodontics", "restorative dentistry", "oral surgery", "root canal treatment", "sleep apnea treatment", "pediatric dentistry", "dentures", "dr. dalvir s. pannu"], "services_offered": [{"name": "General and Preventive Dentistry", "category": "Dental", "description": "Regular preventive care including professional cleaning, digital X-rays, and screenings for early signs of decay, gum disease, and oral cancer.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Cosmetic Dentistry", "category": "Dental", "description": "Porcelain veneers, professional teeth whitening, and dental bonding to fix chips, gaps, stains, and uneven teeth.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Dental Implants", "category": "Dental", "description": "Uses detailed imaging and the Yomi robotic system to place implants with precision for a stable, natural-looking tooth.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Orthodontics", "category": "Dental", "description": "Invisalign clear aligners and traditional braces overseen by a Harvard-trained orthodontic specialist; Dr. Pannu is an Invisalign Elite Provider and Innovator Award recipient.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Restorative Dentistry", "category": "Dental", "description": "Restores damaged teeth with crowns, bridges, and tooth-colored fillings while preserving natural tooth structure.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Oral Surgery", "category": "Dental", "description": "Surgical treatment for severely damaged or impacted teeth with a focus on comfort and recovery.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Root Canal Treatment", "category": "Dental", "description": "Removes infection at its source to stop pain and preserve the natural tooth.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Sleep Apnea Treatment", "category": "Dental", "description": "Custom oral appliance therapy worn during sleep to keep the airway open and support better rest.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "For patients with obstructive sleep apnea."}, {"name": "Pediatric Dentistry", "category": "Dental", "description": "Calm, age-appropriate care including preventive visits, sealants, fluoride treatments, and early orthodontic evaluations.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Children"}, {"name": "Dentures", "category": "Dental", "description": "Full dentures, partial dentures, and implant-supported dentures for a comfortable and functional fit.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}], "short_description": "Pannu Dental Group in San Jose, CA provides comprehensive dental care for patients of all ages, from routine cleanings and cosmetic upgrades to full tooth replacement, using advanced technology in a warm, patient-centered environment.", "google_website_url": "https://www.pannudental.com/dentist-in-san-jose-ca/", "google_primary_type": "Dentist", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": ["Dr. Dalvir S. Pannu"], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "accepting_new_patients": true, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "145 N Jackson Ave, San Jose, CA 95116, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/103215291652320099738", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUz8so_lAdDYUSjo63AWUTAg2lIpbYOL8NpI_MZYN10oZ5IrbTO=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Pannu Dental Group"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/117956473708396721856", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocInhwmwuHlhO_v_Fkhsxr6hWVy7Ih5X-YVdRTS2UlXya3mGfA=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Eric Anderson"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/103215291652320099738", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUz8so_lAdDYUSjo63AWUTAg2lIpbYOL8NpI_MZYN10oZ5IrbTO=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Pannu Dental Group"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/103215291652320099738", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUz8so_lAdDYUSjo63AWUTAg2lIpbYOL8NpI_MZYN10oZ5IrbTO=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Pannu Dental Group"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/103215291652320099738", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUz8so_lAdDYUSjo63AWUTAg2lIpbYOL8NpI_MZYN10oZ5IrbTO=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Pannu Dental Group"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-26T12:46:41.877402+00:00', 'pannu-dental-group', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

Dr. Kwok is deeply dedicated to her patients'' success, believing that successful treatment outcomes start with accurate diagnosis. She is grateful for the opportunity to help her fertility patients become parents and to make a positive impact on their lives. The clinic is known for its high-quality care, detailed attention, and the use of custom herbal prescriptions and lifestyle recommendations to support each patient''s unique journey.

The clinic is highly rated by patients, with numerous success stories highlighting improved fertility, successful pregnancies, pain relief, and better overall health. Patients frequently praise Dr. Kwok''s expertise, compassionate care, and the calming, supportive environment she creates. Harmony Acupuncture is a top-rated fertility acupuncture clinic in the San Jose Bay Area, trusted by patients for its effective and personalized approach to Chinese medicine.', '2680 S. White Road, Suite 260A, San Jose, CA 95148', 'San Jose', 'CA', '95148', '(408) 386-1128', ARRAY['Chinese', 'English']::text[], 'Acupuncture & TCM', FALSE, '{"email": "info@HarmonyAcCM.com", "images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/harmony-acupuncture-chinese-medicine-inc-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/harmony-acupuncture-chinese-medicine-inc-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/harmony-acupuncture-chinese-medicine-inc-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/harmony-acupuncture-chinese-medicine-inc-google-4.webp"], "rating": 4.9, "pricing": [{"name": "Free Phone Consultation", "notes": "Initial free consultation to discuss health concerns and treatment options.", "price": "Free", "category": "Consultation", "price_range": null}], "reviews": [{"date": "2026-03-04T03:19:33.137405354Z", "text": "I started going to pregnancy acupuncture when I was feeling discouraged about trying to conceive at my age. After about one and a half months of consistent sessions, I can honestly say it was one of the best decisions I made. Not only did it help regulate my cycle and reduce stress, but it also gave me a sense of balance and hope during a very emotional journey.\nThe treatments were gentle, relaxing, and tailored specifically to my body and fertility goals. I always left feeling calmer, more centered, and confident that my body was being supported in the most natural way possible.\nI’m so grateful to say that I was able to get pregnant naturally, and I truly believe acupuncture played a huge role in making that happen. If you’re trying to conceive—especially if you feel like age may be working against you—I highly recommend giving pregnancy acupuncture a chance. It supported my body, my mind, and ultimately helped me receive the blessing I had been praying for. Thank you so much Harmony acupuncture!", "author": "Cua YP", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102333098526494346057/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-18T17:34:53.850223290Z", "text": "I highly recommend Dr Kwok to anyone trying to conceive especially if they experience uncommon or treatment resistant complications. I endured multiple cancelled Ivf cycles due to thin lining and fluid accumulation. Every medical treatment was unsuccessful including estrogen, prp, sildenafil. Dr Kwok is a careful listener and conducted a thorough evaluation of my history to develop a tailored treatment plan to me. I could feel her treatments taking effect right after our sessions. I had not experienced this with other acupuncturists I have worked with. Due to Dr Kwok’s expertise I was able to conceive a healthy baby boy on my first cycle with her. When I was worried about early bleeding, Dr Kwok immediately prescribed herbs to save the pregnancy. I am so thankful to have come across her clinic and hope this review can help others experiencing treatment resistant complications with ivf.", "author": "Sarah Leslie", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101213466447970438060/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-05-08T00:53:15.829140Z", "text": "This review is long overdue. Dr Kwok does wonders! I would recommend any of my friends or family who is looking for healthy fertility treatments to Dr. Kwok. She is extremely knowledgeable and will help you with your fertility journey beyond just doing acupuncture. Before I met her I was working with another acupuncturist for half a year and the comparison in works was night and day compared to Dr.Kwok. I also had two failed IUI prior to having the acupuncture visits. I got pregnant the first cycle of receiving the treatment which I thought was crazy! Now I’m a firm believe of her work and the results don’t lie. Super grateful!", "author": "Maggie Zhao", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101145388962825965641/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-09-15T23:46:48.966339162Z", "text": "I highly recommend Dr. Kwok! I had been TTC for 4 months when I found her. I was hoping it would help the process so I gave it a shot. I started going once a week in the middle of my fifth month. By my sixth month trying (after receiving treatments for a full cycle) I was pregnant! So happy, relieved,\nand grateful for the help from Dr. Kwok. She is very knowledgeable about fertility and was able to start seeing me right away. If you are curious about fertility acupuncture I highly recommend her to you.", "author": "Leslie Beck", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115341278061664827885/reviews"}, {"date": "2024-05-13T18:07:02.431070Z", "text": "Dr. Kwok is amazing! She explains things thoroughly, clearly, and in a concise manner. She is always so pleasant and professional. She always asks questions and answers all questions I have before the treatments. She is really care about her patients. With the treatments she provided to me, they helped to support my pregnancy and made my first semester smoother. I trust and highly appreciate her knowledge and advice. Would highly recommend her!", "author": "Nhu Tran", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113833297359732141541/reviews"}], "website": "https://www.harmonyaccm.com/", "location": {"latitude": 37.3296936, "longitude": -121.7971493}, "services": ["Female & Male Infertility Treatment", "IVF & IUI Support", "Egg Quality & Ovulatory Dysfunction", "Recurrent Miscarriage Support", "Sperm Quality Improvement", "Women''s Health", "Pain Management", "Stress, Anxiety & Insomnia", "Cancer Support", "Digestion & Immune Health", "Endometriosis Treatment", "Fibroid Treatment", "Menopause Symptom Relief", "Chronic Fatigue & Panic Attacks", "Allergy & Sinus Treatment", "Fibromyalgia Management"], "insurance": {"notes": null, "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": [], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": false}, "highlights": [{"title": "Top Rated Fertility Acupuncture Clinic", "detail": "Specializing in infertility, IVF support, and natural conception, with numerous patient success stories.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Personalized Herbal Medicine", "detail": "Dr. Kwok prescribes custom raw herbs tailored to each patient''s needs, not prepackaged formulas.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Free Consultation Available", "detail": "The clinic offers a free phone consultation for new patients to discuss their health concerns and treatment options.", "category": "convenience"}, {"title": "Holistic Approach", "detail": "Treatments incorporate acupuncture, herbal medicine, moxa, and lifestyle and dietary guidance for whole-body health.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Flexible Scheduling", "detail": "Appointments available on Saturdays and afternoons to accommodate work schedules.", "category": "convenience"}, {"title": "Experienced Practitioner", "detail": "Dr. Juliet Kwok is a highly skilled and experienced doctor who trained in China and is dedicated to patient care.", "category": "care"}], "price_tier": "$$", "source_url": "https://www.harmonyaccm.com/testimonials", "appointment": {"booking_note": "BOOK NOW", "appointment_url": "https://harmonyaccm.janeapp.com/", "new_patient_note": "Free phone consultation available for new patients.", "phone_booking_available": true, "online_booking_available": true, "free_consultation_available": true}, "open_sunday": false, "scout_query": "Chinese doctor in San Jose, CA", "search_text": "acupuncture & tcm | acupuncture | chinese medicine | tcm | herbal medicine | cupping | pain relief | châm cứu | đông y | y học cổ truyền | 한의원 | 침술 | 한약 | 中医 | 针灸 | 中药 | chinese | mandarin | cantonese | 中文 | 普通话 | 国语 | 粤语 | 广东话 | 华人 | english | female & male infertility treatment | ivf & iui support | egg quality & ovulatory dysfunction | recurrent miscarriage support | sperm quality improvement | women''s health | pain management | stress, anxiety & insomnia | cancer support | digestion & immune health | endometriosis treatment | fibroid treatment | menopause symptom relief | chronic fatigue & panic attacks | allergy & sinus treatment | fibromyalgia management | fertility | mental health | supportive care | general health | dr. juliet kwok | doctor of chinese medicine, licensed acupuncturist (dtcm, l.ac.)", "google_types": ["medical_clinic", "doctor", "health", "point_of_interest", "establishment"], "open_weekend": false, "rating_count": 33, "team_members": [{"name": "Dr. Juliet Kwok", "role": "Doctor of Chinese Medicine, Licensed Acupuncturist (DTCM, L.Ac.)", "bio_snippet": "Result-driven Chinese Medicine doctor with a passion for helping patients with fertility, pain, stress, and overall health. Strives for excellence in patient care and believes successful treatment starts with accurate diagnosis. Dedicated to helping patients achieve their health goals and become parents.", "languages_spoken": ["English", "Chinese"]}], "language_note": "The clinic is led by Dr. Juliet Kwok, a Chinese medicine doctor (DTCM, L.Ac.) who provides culturally responsive care rooted in traditional Chinese medicine. Patients specifically mention seeking a Chinese doctor for fertility and health concerns, and Dr. Kwok''s practice integrates Eastern and Western medicine approaches. The clinic serves a diverse patient population, including Asian and immigrant communities, and offers care in Chinese as evidenced by patient testimonials in Chinese.", "open_saturday": false, "quality_score": 95, "working_hours": {"friday": "1:30 – 5:30 PM", "monday": "1:30 – 5:30 PM", "sunday": "Closed", "tuesday": "1:30 – 5:30 PM", "saturday": "Closed", "thursday": "1:30 – 5:30 PM", "wednesday": "Closed"}, "gallery_images": ["https://static.wixstatic.com/media/9ecf08_f377485147ac4fb5a511a5f759d02314~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_75,h_55,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/9ecf08_f377485147ac4fb5a511a5f759d02314~mv2.jpg", "https://static.wixstatic.com/media/9ecf08_afe561b3aa5c4372ae149329b9b4bbe3~mv2_d_2178_1929_s_2.jpg/v1/crop/x_149,y_0,w_1928,h_1929/fill/w_126,h_126,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Dr_%20Juliet%20Kwok%20-%20Picture%20Small.jpg", "https://static.wixstatic.com/media/9ecf08_2ad004de5b62404b8fce5999f4d0cbcf~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_155,h_155,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/9ecf08_2ad004de5b62404b8fce5999f4d0cbcf~mv2.jpg", "https://static.wixstatic.com/media/9ecf08_cfa2893ce7664a798a1bf75addfd5f65~mv2.jpeg/v1/fill/w_397,h_265,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Baby%20Bryce%208_15_2021.jpeg"], "review_profile": {"rating": 4.9, "source": "google", "themes": [{"theme": "Treatment Outcomes", "mentions": 5, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Multiple reviewers credit Dr. Kwok''s treatments with helping them conceive naturally or after IVF struggles."}, {"theme": "Clinical Expertise", "mentions": 4, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients emphasize Dr. Kwok''s deep fertility knowledge and ability to address complex cases where other treatments failed."}, {"theme": "Personalized Care", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_