elaxing, and tailored specifically to my body and fertility goals. I always left feeling calmer, more centered, and confident that my body was being supported in the most natural way possible.\nI’m so grateful to say that I was able to get pregnant naturally, and I truly believe acupuncture played a huge role in making that happen. If you’re trying to conceive—especially if you feel like age may be working against you—I highly recommend giving pregnancy acupuncture a chance. It supported my body, my mind, and ultimately helped me receive the blessing I had been praying for. Thank you so much Harmony acupuncture!", "author": "Cua YP", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102333098526494346057/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-18T17:34:53.850223290Z", "text": "I highly recommend Dr Kwok to anyone trying to conceive especially if they experience uncommon or treatment resistant complications. I endured multiple cancelled Ivf cycles due to thin lining and fluid accumulation. Every medical treatment was unsuccessful including estrogen, prp, sildenafil. Dr Kwok is a careful listener and conducted a thorough evaluation of my history to develop a tailored treatment plan to me. I could feel her treatments taking effect right after our sessions. I had not experienced this with other acupuncturists I have worked with. Due to Dr Kwok’s expertise I was able to conceive a healthy baby boy on my first cycle with her. When I was worried about early bleeding, Dr Kwok immediately prescribed herbs to save the pregnancy. I am so thankful to have come across her clinic and hope this review can help others experiencing treatment resistant complications with ivf.", "author": "Sarah Leslie", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101213466447970438060/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-05-08T00:53:15.829140Z", "text": "This review is long overdue. Dr Kwok does wonders! I would recommend any of my friends or family who is looking for healthy fertility treatments to Dr. Kwok. She is extremely knowledgeable and will help you with your fertility journey beyond just doing acupuncture. Before I met her I was working with another acupuncturist for half a year and the comparison in works was night and day compared to Dr.Kwok. I also had two failed IUI prior to having the acupuncture visits. I got pregnant the first cycle of receiving the treatment which I thought was crazy! Now I’m a firm believe of her work and the results don’t lie. Super grateful!", "author": "Maggie Zhao", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101145388962825965641/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-09-15T23:46:48.966339162Z", "text": "I highly recommend Dr. Kwok! I had been TTC for 4 months when I found her. I was hoping it would help the process so I gave it a shot. I started going once a week in the middle of my fifth month. By my sixth month trying (after receiving treatments for a full cycle) I was pregnant! So happy, relieved,\nand grateful for the help from Dr. Kwok. She is very knowledgeable about fertility and was able to start seeing me right away. If you are curious about fertility acupuncture I highly recommend her to you.", "author": "Leslie Beck", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115341278061664827885/reviews"}, {"date": "2024-05-13T18:07:02.431070Z", "text": "Dr. Kwok is amazing! She explains things thoroughly, clearly, and in a concise manner. She is always so pleasant and professional. She always asks questions and answers all questions I have before the treatments. She is really care about her patients. With the treatments she provided to me, they helped to support my pregnancy and made my first semester smoother. I trust and highly appreciate her knowledge and advice. Would highly recommend her!", "author": "Nhu Tran", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113833297359732141541/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Patients overwhelmingly praise Dr. Kwok for her expertise in fertility acupuncture, with many reporting successful pregnancies and improved well-being after treatment. Her personalized care, knowledge, and supportive approach are consistently highlighted.", "about_highlight": "Harmony Acupuncture Chinese Medicine, Inc. is a result-driven Chinese Medicine clinic in San Jose, CA, led by Dr. Juliet Kwok, DTCM, L.Ac. The clinic specializes in fertility acupuncture and Chinese medicine, helping patients with infertility, IVF support, natural conception, pain management, stress disorders, and a wide range of women''s health and wellness concerns. Dr. Kwok provides tailored, holistic treatments combining acupuncture, herbal medicine, and lifestyle guidance, with a strong focus on individual patient needs and a commitment to helping patients achieve their family dreams and overall health goals.\n\nDr. Kwok is deeply dedicated to her patients'' success, believing that successful treatment outcomes start with accurate diagnosis. She is grateful for the opportunity to help her fertility patients become parents and to make a positive impact on their lives. The clinic is known for its high-quality care, detailed attention, and the use of custom herbal prescriptions and lifestyle recommendations to support each patient''s unique journey.\n\nThe clinic is highly rated by patients, with numerous success stories highlighting improved fertility, successful pregnancies, pain relief, and better overall health. Patients frequently praise Dr. Kwok''s expertise, compassionate care, and the calming, supportive environment she creates. Harmony Acupuncture is a top-rated fertility acupuncture clinic in the San Jose Bay Area, trusted by patients for its effective and personalized approach to Chinese medicine.", "appointment_url": "https://harmonyaccm.janeapp.com/", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=4584281097332797090&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJtbdeJD_Lj4ARoi4PlV6jnj8", "quality_missing": ["insurance"], "search_keywords": ["acupuncture & tcm", "acupuncture", "chinese medicine", "tcm", "herbal medicine", "cupping", "pain relief", "châm cứu", "đông y", "y học cổ truyền", "한의원", "침술", "한약", "中医", "针灸", "中药", "chinese", "mandarin", "cantonese", "中文", "普通话", "国语", "粤语", "广东话", "华人", "english", "female & male infertility treatment", "ivf & iui support", "egg quality & ovulatory dysfunction", "recurrent miscarriage support", "sperm quality improvement", "women''s health", "pain management", "stress, anxiety & insomnia", "cancer support", "digestion & immune health", "endometriosis treatment", "fibroid treatment", "menopause symptom relief", "chronic fatigue & panic attacks", "allergy & sinus treatment", "fibromyalgia management", "fertility", "mental health", "supportive care", "general health", "dr. juliet kwok", "doctor of chinese medicine, licensed acupuncturist (dtcm, l.ac.)"], "cultural_context": "The clinic is led by Dr. Juliet Kwok, a Chinese medicine doctor (DTCM, L.Ac.) who provides culturally responsive care rooted in traditional Chinese medicine. Patients specifically mention seeking a Chinese doctor for fertility and health concerns, and Dr. Kwok''s practice integrates Eastern and Western medicine approaches. The clinic serves a diverse patient population, including Asian and immigrant communities, and offers care in Chinese as evidenced by patient testimonials in Chinese.", "services_offered": [{"name": "Female & Male Infertility Treatment", "category": "Fertility", "description": "Helping patients with difficulty to conceive, miscarriage, and various fertility challenges.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Individuals or couples struggling with infertility"}, {"name": "IVF & IUI Support", "category": "Fertility", "description": "Acupuncture and herbal support for IVF cycles, including canceled cycles, poor response, chromosome abnormality, low AFC, low fertilization rate, slow cell division, and recurrent implantation failure. Also supports IUI treatments.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients undergoing IVF or IUI treatments"}, {"name": "Egg Quality & Ovulatory Dysfunction", "category": "Fertility", "description": "Treatment for high FSH, low AMH, DOR, POF, PCOS, amenorrhea, and other ovulatory issues.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients with egg quality or ovulation problems"}, {"name": "Recurrent Miscarriage Support", "category": "Fertility", "description": "Helping patients who have experienced recurrent miscarriages or unknown early losses.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients with history of recurrent miscarriage"}, {"name": "Sperm Quality Improvement", "category": "Fertility", "description": "Treatment for low motility, poor morphology, low sperm counts, and semen liquefaction abnormality.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Male patients with sperm quality issues"}, {"name": "Women''s Health", "category": "Women''s Health", "description": "Treatment for fibroids, ovarian cysts, painful/abnormal periods, PMS, abnormal cervical mucus, hot flashes, menopause, and postpartum depression.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Women with various gynecological conditions"}, {"name": "Pain Management", "category": "Pain Management", "description": "Treatment for low back pain, sciatica, neck-shoulder pain, headache, fibromyalgia, and more.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients suffering from acute or chronic pain"}, {"name": "Stress, Anxiety & Insomnia", "category": "Mental Health", "description": "Acupuncture and herbal treatment for stress, depression, anxiety, insomnia, and fatigue.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients experiencing stress or emotional disorders"}, {"name": "Cancer Support", "category": "Supportive Care", "description": "Acupuncture and herbal support for cancer patients to help manage symptoms and improve well-being.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Cancer patients seeking complementary care"}, {"name": "Digestion & Immune Health", "category": "General Health", "description": "Treatment for digestive issues, IBS, immune health, allergy, and Bell''s Palsy.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients with digestive, immune, or allergic conditions"}, {"name": "Endometriosis Treatment", "category": "Women''s Health", "description": "Focused treatment on endometriosis-related chronic menstrual pain and associated fertility issues.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients with endometriosis"}, {"name": "Fibroid Treatment", "category": "Women''s Health", "description": "Acupuncture and herbal medicine to help reduce fibroid size and manage symptoms.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients with uterine fibroids"}, {"name": "Menopause Symptom Relief", "category": "Women''s Health", "description": "Treatment to alleviate menopausal symptoms such as hot flashes and mood changes without hormones.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Women experiencing menopause symptoms"}, {"name": "Chronic Fatigue & Panic Attacks", "category": "Mental Health", "description": "Acupuncture and herbal treatment to improve energy levels and reduce panic attacks.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients with chronic fatigue or anxiety-related issues"}, {"name": "Allergy & Sinus Treatment", "category": "General Health", "description": "Treatment for chronic rhinitis and allergies, including stuffy nose and sinus issues.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients with seasonal or chronic allergies"}, {"name": "Fibromyalgia Management", "category": "Pain Management", "description": "Acupuncture and herbal support to help manage fibromyalgia pain and improve mobility.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients with fibromyalgia"}], "short_description": "Top-rated fertility acupuncture and Chinese medicine clinic in San Jose, CA, specializing in infertility, IVF support, and holistic wellness with personalized care from Dr. Juliet Kwok.", "google_website_url": "https://www.harmonyaccm.com/testimonials", "google_primary_type": "Medical Clinic", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": ["Dr. Juliet Kwok"], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "2680 S White Rd Ste 260A, San Jose, CA 95148, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/118010469958687176731", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXqS_GiM5KRAxDUhPRGDfenxX6dQYTRc1YJ6yZQPbnyA0hvrPpN=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Harmony Acupuncture Chinese Medicine, Inc."}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/118010469958687176731", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXqS_GiM5KRAxDUhPRGDfenxX6dQYTRc1YJ6yZQPbnyA0hvrPpN=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Harmony Acupuncture Chinese Medicine, Inc."}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/118010469958687176731", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXqS_GiM5KRAxDUhPRGDfenxX6dQYTRc1YJ6yZQPbnyA0hvrPpN=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Harmony Acupuncture Chinese Medicine, Inc."}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/118010469958687176731", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXqS_GiM5KRAxDUhPRGDfenxX6dQYTRc1YJ6yZQPbnyA0hvrPpN=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Harmony Acupuncture Chinese Medicine, Inc."}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-25T20:18:47.228276+00:00', 'harmony-acupuncture-chinese-medicine-inc', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

The clinic provides a full spectrum of diagnostic services, including electrocardiograms (EKG), echocardiograms, stress echocardiography, nuclear stress testing, PET imaging, Holter/event monitors, vascular ultrasound, and cardiovascular MRI and CT. Patients benefit from on-site laboratory testing and specialized care for pacemakers and defibrillators. The team includes board-certified cardiologists and nurse practitioners who work collaboratively to deliver evidence-based, patient-centered care.

As part of UT Physicians—the clinical practice of UTHealth Houston—this location reflects a commitment to multidisciplinary, accessible care across the Greater Houston area. The clinic is open Monday through Friday from 8 a.m. to 5 p.m., with convenient valet parking and a structured parking garage nearby. Patients can request appointments online or by calling the main line.', '6410 Fannin St, Ste 600, Houston, TX 77030-5206', 'Houston', 'TX', '77030', '832-325-7211', ARRAY['English', 'Vietnamese']::text[], 'Cardiology', FALSE, '{"images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/ut-physicians-cardiology-texas-medical-center-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/ut-physicians-cardiology-texas-medical-center-google-2.webp"], "rating": 4.8, "reviews": [{"date": "2025-08-27T15:50:09.701877201Z", "text": "Dr. Johnson is amazing and one the best Cardiologist. I''m blessed to be a patient. I love how he gives you his full attention and sits down with you to answer all your questions. Tracy is outstanding as well!!", "author": "Andy Williams", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106594315435991291295/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-07-30T13:59:23.435221987Z", "text": "UT physicians has an amazing set of doctors. They are very caring and knowledgeable... Doctor McPherson and his staff have made a life-saving difference in my life. I truly cannot express how appreciative I have always been of them.", "author": "jana armao", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105966314944729352850/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-03-12T12:44:53.531233Z", "text": "I just want to take a moment to express my heartfelt thanks to the amazing doctors and nurses who went above and beyond during my dad''s challenging time. A special shoutout to Dr. Owen and Dr. Estera—your dedication really saved my father''s life.\nI can''t say enough about the wonderful nurses and staff at Herman Memorial. You all made us feel so welcomed, especially being far from home in El Paso, TX. Your kindness and support truly made a difference in our experience. Thank you for everything you do!", "author": "Daisy Flores", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107894658891917321129/reviews"}, {"date": "2024-08-17T16:06:46.498838Z", "text": "Dr. Prakash and his team are outstanding! He is extremely thorough, communicates in a way that makes me feel involved in my care plan and treats me as a unique individual. I am incredibly grateful to have him as my Dr!", "author": "jessika gail", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118082976073014699645/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-01-26T13:25:26.250587Z", "text": "The UT doctors have always shown great concern regarding my health, both physical and mental. I get a chance to speak with several team members individually, who then jointly meet with me for a discussion regarding my present condition and how to continue on. It is a very personable and comforting experience that leaves me feeling confident in my future.", "author": "Ernie Glenn", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105887791672119623748/reviews"}], "website": "https://www.utphysicians.com/clinic/ut-physicians-cardiology-clinic-tmc/", "location": {"latitude": 29.714474899999995, "longitude": -95.3978218}, "services": ["Electrocardiogram (EKG)", "Echocardiogram", "Stress Echocardiography", "Nuclear Stress Testing and Nuclear Imaging", "Positron Emission Tomography (PET) / PET-CT", "Heart Rhythm Monitors (Holter / Event Recorders)", "Optimization of Pacemakers and Defibrillators (ICD)", "Vascular Ultrasound", "Vascular Screening", "Non-Invasive Vascular Testing", "Cardiovascular Magnetic Resonance Imaging