ents benefit from on-site laboratory testing and specialized care for pacemakers and defibrillators. The team includes board-certified cardiologists and nurse practitioners who work collaboratively to deliver evidence-based, patient-centered care.\n\nAs part of UT Physicians—the clinical practice of UTHealth Houston—this location reflects a commitment to multidisciplinary, accessible care across the Greater Houston area. The clinic is open Monday through Friday from 8 a.m. to 5 p.m., with convenient valet parking and a structured parking garage nearby. Patients can request appointments online or by calling the main line.", "appointment_url": "https://www.utphysicians.com/request-an-appointment/?preferredclinic_name=UT+Physicians+Cardiology+-+Texas+Medical+Center", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=9327691901397829300&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJkzl953nAQIYRtAYbNV2ecoE", "quality_missing": ["insurance"], "search_keywords": ["cardiology", "cardiologist", "heart doctor", "ekg", "blood pressure", "tim mạch", "bác sĩ tim", "심장내과", "心脏科", "心血管", "english", "vietnamese", "tiếng việt", "người việt", "bác sĩ việt", "electrocardiogram (ekg)", "echocardiogram", "stress echocardiography", "nuclear stress testing and nuclear imaging", "positron emission tomography (pet) / pet-ct", "heart rhythm monitors (holter / event recorders)", "optimization of pacemakers and defibrillators (icd)", "vascular ultrasound", "vascular screening", "non-invasive vascular testing", "cardiovascular magnetic resonance imaging (cmr)", "cardiovascular computer tomography (ct 64 slice)", "laboratory tests", "diagnostic", "therapeutic", "preventive", "h. vernon anderson", "cardiovascular disease, interventional cardiology", "kenneth l. gould", "cardiovascular disease", "maria jamilla lacap", "siddharth k. prakash", "cardiovascular disease, adult congenital heart disease", "martha s. tzou"], "services_offered": [{"name": "Elect