The practice features five specialized providers, including orthopedic surgeons, a podiatrist, a physician assistant, and a physical therapist. Services cover a wide range of procedures for the shoulder, hip, knee, elbow, ankle, and foot, as well as fracture care, sports medicine, and joint replacement. The practice has two convenient locations in Los Angeles and Fullerton, with staff available to assist patients in English, Korean, and Spanish.

Patients have shared powerful testimonials about life-changing outcomes, including a knee replacement patient who was walking the same day and now golfs and takes dance classes, and a patient with a massive rotator cuff tear who was successfully repaired by Dr. Han after being told it was irreparable by other top surgeons.', '505 S. Virgil Ave #205 Los Angeles, CA 90020', 'Los Angeles', 'CA', '90020', '(213) 805-5822', ARRAY['English', 'Korean', 'Spanish']::text[], 'Orthopedics', FALSE, '{"email": "han.orthopaedics1@gmail.com", "images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/han-orthopaedics-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/han-orthopaedics-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/han-orthopaedics-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/han-orthopaedics-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/han-orthopaedics-google-5.webp"], "rating": 3.8, "reviews": [{"date": "2026-04-01T16:01:24.255694596Z", "text": "My mother previously had a left knee replacement and surgery for a femur fracture at another hospital. Even after the procedures, she couldn’t walk properly and suffered from constant pain because she just wasn''t recovering or rehabilitating well. Last year, we found Dr. Han, who performed a revision surgery on her. We are absolutely thrilled with the results! Because of that amazing outcome, we decided to have her right knee replacement done here as well.\nThe doctors and staff are incredibly dedicated and help us through all the follow-up care and procedures with genuine care. I want to give a special shout-out to Matthew, who helps us with interpretation—he is so kind and professional. We are so grateful for this team!", "author": "Ji Yeon Kim", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112564089718226118161/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-03-24T01:54:47.875837154Z", "text": "Dr. Han and his amazing staff improved my quality of life immensely. His peerless work to reconstruct my shoulder has done wonders for my mind as well as my body. I simply cannot recommend him highly enough. He is super knowledgeable and explained everything up front in a very clear and concise manner. He answered all my questions in detail, giving me peace of mind. He treats his patients with the utmost respect and caring. He is in my opinion everything a truly excellent physician should be. I am very grateful to have him as my doctor. And his staff are all wonderful too. Fantastic experience overall!", "author": "J J", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114309320490246668380/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-14T03:27:44.055199875Z", "text": "Where should I start.  The WORST!!!!!!\nCommunication, Performance, Follow through ALL SUCK!!!\nDavid Lee was supposed to remove ALL hardware. The EXPRESSED treatment plan WAS NOT what was performed and I had to find out in RECOVERY AFTER the IV, and procedure.  The office DID NOT submit prescriptions to pharmacy as they expressed they would so when all the meds that was used in the hospital wore off, I was in excruciating pain.  The following day when they finally placed prescription they prescribed low dosage medication as if they didn''t just cut me open to the BONE.........\nWords CANNOT express😥😭\nHIGHLY DISAPPOINTED", "author": "Ingrid Edwards", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106218583826113576067/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-27T19:35:58.955618124Z", "text": "From initial consultation to surgery to 1-month check-in. Dr Han and his team were professional, courtesy and patient. Highly recommend if yiou need hip replacement surgery.", "author": "Harry Jigamian", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111927835277696260812/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-04T04:05:11.167307708Z", "text": "We waited about an hour both visits and only had around two minutes with the doctor. The doctor felt rushed, and it was hard to ask questions or feel heard. The clinic also isn’t open on Saturdays, which is inconvenient.", "author": "So Young Kim", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101991137953611813503/reviews"}], "website": "http://hanorthopaedics.com/", "location": {"latitude": 34.0648625, "longitude": -118.28756469999999}, "services": ["Shoulder Impingement", "Shoulder Arthroscopy", "Hip Replacement", "Knee Replacement", "Foot Surgery", "Ankle Surgery", "Elbow Surgery", "Joint Replacement", "Fracture Care", "Sports Medicine"], "insurance": {"notes": null, "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": [], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": false}, "highlights": [{"title": "Augmented Reality Total Knee Replacement", "detail": "Offer advanced augmented reality technology for knee replacement surgery.", "category": "technology"}, {"title": "Minimally Invasive Shoulder Replacement", "detail": "Perform shoulder replacements using minimally invasive techniques.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Bilingual Staff", "detail": "Staff available to assist in English, Korean, and Spanish.", "category": "culture"}], "price_tier": "$$", "source_url": "http://hanorthopaedics.com/", "appointment": {"booking_note": "For all appointments and inquiries, please call (213) 805-5822 or click here to request an appointment online.", "appointment_url": "https://hanorthopaedics.com/contact/", "new_patient_note": null, "phone_booking_available": true, "online_booking_available": true, "free_consultation_available": null}, "open_sunday": false, "scout_query": "Korean orthopedic clinic in Los Angeles, CA", "search_text": "orthopedics | orthopedic | joint pain | sports medicine | spine | knee | cơ xương khớp | chấn thương chỉnh hình | 정형외과 | 骨科 | english | korean | 한국어 | 한인 | 한국말 | spanish | shoulder impingement | shoulder arthroscopy | hip replacement | knee replacement | foot surgery | ankle surgery | elbow surgery | joint replacement | fracture care | shoulder | lower body | foot | ankle | arm | dr. yung han, md | orthopedic surgeon | dr. david lee, md | dr. salem lebada, dpm | podiatrist | stacey jung, mpap, pa-c | physician assistant | dr. michael kang, dpt | physical therapist", "google_types": ["medical_clinic", "health", "point_of_interest", "establishment"], "open_weekend": false, "rating_count": 77, "team_members": [{"name": "Dr. Yung Han, MD", "role": "Orthopedic Surgeon", "bio_snippet": "Former U.S. National Team member and Resident Athlete in taekwondo at the U.S. Olympic Training Center. Interested in exercise physiology, sports medicine, and orthopaedic surgery.", "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Dr. David Lee, MD", "role": "Orthopedic Surgeon", "bio_snippet": "Fellowship trained in adult joint reconstruction. Specializes in hip and knee arthroplasty including both primary and complex revision surgeries.", "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Dr. Salem Lebada, DPM", "role": "Podiatrist", "bio_snippet": "Trained in treating foot and ankle conditions with both a conservative and surgical approach. Board qualified in foot as well as reconstructive rearfoot and ankle surgery with the American Board of Foot and Ankle Surgery.", "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Stacey Jung, MPAP, PA-C", "role": "Physician Assistant", "bio_snippet": "Board-certified Physician Assistant specializing in orthopaedic surgery. Role at Han Orthopaedics is multifaceted, encompassing clinical expertise and compassionate patient care.", "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Dr. Michael Kang, DPT", "role": "Physical Therapist", "bio_snippet": "Treatment philosophy involves the utilization of manual therapy and neurodynamic techniques to restore movement and streamline its efficiency through therapeutic exercise.", "languages_spoken": []}], "language_note": "The practice highlights that its staff is available to assist patients in English, Korean, and Spanish, indicating a culturally responsive environment for Korean and Spanish-speaking communities. Patient testimonials also reference Dr. Han being a blessing for Koreatown, and the practice is located in central Los Angeles not far from Koreatown.", "open_saturday": false, "quality_score": 95, "working_hours": {"friday": "9:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "monday": "9:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "sunday": "Closed", "tuesday": "9:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "saturday": "Closed", "thursday": "9:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "wednesday": "9:00 AM – 5:00 PM"}, "gallery_images": ["https://hanorthopaedics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/Interior-Front-Desk.jpg", "https://hanorthopaedics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/KakaoTalk_20240419_121054335_031.jpg", "https://hanorthopaedics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/KakaoTalk_20240419_121054335.jpg", "https://hanorthopaedics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/KakaoTalk_20240419_121054335_06.jpg", "https://hanorthopaedics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/KakaoTalk_20240419_121054335_10.jpg", "https://hanorthopaedics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/KakaoTalk_20240419_121054335_07.jpg", "https://hanorthopaedics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/Interior-Xray-room.jpg", "https://hanorthopaedics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/Interior-PT.jpg"], "review_profile": {"rating": 3.8, "source": "google", "themes": [{"theme": "Treatment Outcomes", "mentions": 2, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Multiple patients report significant improvements in their quality of life due to successful surgeries and follow-up care."}, {"theme": "Staff Professionalism", "mentions": 2, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Reviews frequently praise the kindness and professionalism of the staff, including specific mentions of helpful interpreters."}, {"theme": "Communication", "mentions": 2, "sentiment": "Negative", "summary_quote": "Some patients report poor communication, including rushed consultations and unmet expectations regarding procedures."}, {"theme": "Clinical Expertise", "mentions": 2, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Dr. Han is described as knowledgeable and thorough, with clear explanations and respectful patient interactions."}, {"theme": "Facility Environment", "mentions": 1, "sentiment": "Negative", "summary_quote": "One patient mentions long wait times and inconvenient clinic hours as significant drawbacks."}], "summary": "Patients generally appreciate Dr. Han''s expertise and the dedicated staff, with many highlighting successful treatments and compassionate care. However, some reviews express frustration with communication issues and procedural inconsistencies.", "review_count": 77, "concern_themes": [], "positive_themes": [], "featured_reviews": [{"date": "2026-04-01T16:01:24.255694596Z", "text": "My mother previously had a left knee replacement and surgery for a femur fracture at another hospital. Even after the procedures, she couldn’t walk properly and suffered from constant pain because she just wasn''t recovering or rehabilitating well. Last year, we found Dr. Han, who performed a revision surgery on her. We are absolutely thrilled with the results! Because of that amazing outcome, we decided to have her right knee replacement done here as well.\nThe doctors and staff are incredibly dedicated and help us through all the follow-up care and procedures with genuine care. I want to give a special shout-out to Matthew, who helps us with interpretation—he is so kind and professional. We are so grateful for this team!", "author": "Ji Yeon Kim", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112564089718226118161/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-03-24T01:54:47.875837154Z", "text": "Dr. Han and his amazing staff improved my quality of life immensely. His peerless work to reconstruct my shoulder has done wonders for my mind as well as my body. I simply cannot recommend him highly enough. He is super knowledgeable and explained everything up front in a very clear and concise manner. He answered all my questions in detail, giving me peace of mind. He treats his patients with the utmost respect and caring. He is in my opinion everything a truly excellent physician should be. I am very grateful to have him as my doctor. And his staff are all wonderful too. Fantastic experience overall!", "author": "J J", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114309320490246668380/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-14T03:27:44.055199875Z", "text": "Where should I start.  The WORST!!!!!!\nCommunication, Performance, Follow through ALL SUCK!!!\nDavid Lee was supposed to remove ALL hardware. The EXPRESSED treatment plan WAS NOT what was performed and I had to find out in RECOVERY AFTER the IV, and procedure.  The office DID NOT submit prescriptions to pharmacy as they expressed they would so when all the meds that was used in the hospital wore off, I was in excruciating pain.  The following day when they finally placed prescription they prescribed low dosage medication as if they didn''t just cut me open to the BONE.........\nWords CANNOT express😥😭\nHIGHLY DISAPPOINTED", "author": "Ingrid Edwards", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106218583826113576067/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-27T19:35:58.955618124Z", "text": "From initial consultation to surgery to 1-month check-in. Dr Han and his team were professional, courtesy and patient. Highly recommend if yiou need hip replacement surgery.", "author": "Harry Jigamian", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111927835277696260812/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-04T04:05:11.167307708Z", "text": "We waited about an hour both visits and only had around two minutes with the doctor. The doctor felt rushed, and it was hard to ask questions or feel heard. The clinic also isn’t open on Saturdays, which is inconvenient.", "author": "So Young Kim", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101991137953611813503/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Patients generally appreciate Dr. Han''s expertise and the dedicated staff, with many highlighting successful treatments and compassionate care. However, some reviews express frustration with communication issues and procedural inconsistencies.", "about_highlight": "Han Orthopaedics is a Los Angeles and Orange County orthopedic practice specializing in the prevention, diagnosis, and treatment of disorders related to the musculoskeletal system. The team of medical experts is committed to providing the highest quality of orthopedic care with honesty, compassion, and excellence. Whether a condition requires non-operative treatment or surgical intervention, the goal is to get patients back to their activities as quickly and safely as possible.\n\nThe practice features five specialized providers, including orthopedic surgeons, a podiatrist, a physician assistant, and a physical therapist. Services cover a wide range of procedures for the shoulder, hip, knee, elbow, ankle, and foot, as well as fracture care, sports medicine, and joint replacement. The practice has two convenient locations in Los Angeles and Fullerton, with staff available to assist patients in English, Korean, and Spanish.\n\nPatients have shared powerful testimonials about life-changing outcomes, including a knee replacement patient who was walking the same day and now golfs and takes dance classes, and a patient with a massive rotator cuff tear who was successfully repaired by Dr. Han after being told it was irreparable by other top surgeons.", "appointment_url": "http