lacement of the knee joint, including augmented reality total knee replacement.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Foot Surgery", "category": "Foot", "description": "Surgical treatment for foot conditions.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Ankle Surgery", "category": "Ankle", "description": "Surgical treatment for ankle conditions.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Elbow Surgery", "category": "Arm", "description": "Surgical treatment for elbow conditions.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Joint Replacement", "category": "Joint Replacement", "description": "Comprehensive joint replacement services.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Fracture Care", "category": "Fracture Care", "description": "Care and treatment for bone fractures.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Sports Medicine", "category": "Sports Medicine", "description": "Specialized care for sports-related injuries and conditions.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}], "short_description": "Los Angeles and Orange County orthopedic practice offering specialized care for the musculoskeletal system with a commitment to honesty, compassion, and excellence.", "google_website_url": "http://hanorthopaedics.com/", "google_primary_type": "Medical Clinic", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": ["Dr. Yung Han, MD", "Dr. David Lee, MD", "Dr. Salem Lebada, DPM", "Stacey Jung, MPAP, PA-C", "Dr. Michael Kang, DPT"], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "505 S Virgil Ave Ste. 205, Los Angeles, CA 90020, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/111157739898791036683", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXhXUKfE3ajz4PkJ9bmy20fuRTxUKUV3aVZ9qZ8XTmzaEs9knNH=s100