Patients appreciate the quick, effective care and the ability to speak directly with Dr. Lauber, who also speaks Spanish. The practice offers same-day appointments and is open seven days a week from 8:00 am to 8:00 pm.', '320 Superior Ave, Suite 395, Newport Beach, CA 92663', 'Newport Beach', 'CA', '92663', '(949) 646-9098', ARRAY['English', 'Spanish', 'Vietnamese']::text[], 'Dermatology', FALSE, '{"email": "info@advancedskinofoc.com", "images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/advanced-skin-treatment-center-jeffrey-lauber-md-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/advanced-skin-treatment-center-jeffrey-lauber-md-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/advanced-skin-treatment-center-jeffrey-lauber-md-google-5.webp", "https://advancedskinofoc.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/Dr-Lauber.webp", "https://advancedskinofoc.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/33-scaled.jpg", "https://advancedskinofoc.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/findusonyelp-338w-300x195.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/advanced-skin-treatment-center-jeffrey-lauber-md-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/advanced-skin-treatment-center-jeffrey-lauber-md-google-2.webp"], "rating": 5, "reviews": [{"date": "2026-06-04T02:45:04.293806418Z", "text": "I had a dark spot on my face that was concerning me, so I called Dr. Jeffrey Lauber’s office and was able to get in the same day. He was incredibly professional, thorough, and put my mind at ease right away. He took excellent care of the issue and explained everything clearly.\nMy wife came with me and Dr. Lauber was kind enough to give her great advice on skin care and prevention as well. He truly went above and beyond.\nI highly recommend Dr. Lauber to anyone looking for a first-class dermatologist. He’s knowledgeable, caring, and efficient. We’ll definitely be back!", "author": "Matt Shears", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107356694547447712199/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-24T00:13:00.254932780Z", "text": "I highly recommend Dr Lauber. I found Dr Lauber on yelp and decided after reading all the amazing reviews of honesty, I called for an appointment for my boyfriend. The doctor spoke to us on the phone which I liked this more then just going through a receptionist (which he does have one but he will come on the phone and speak to you directly). I loved how he had great communication, following up and made it feel personal instead of a standard rushed doctor visit.\n\nFrom the moment we walked in Dr Lauber made us feel so incredibly comfortable and welcomed... We felt like we''ve been his patient for years. His personality is truly stellar kind, warm, and funny. He made us laugh a lot and had such a great personality, which is so rare to find especially in this area. He has a great sense of humor. He sat down and talked to us and treated and talked to us like friends.\n\nWhat my boyfriend and I appreciated most was his honesty. He educated us on skincare in a way that was clear and realistic. He didn''t push unnecessary treatments or products, and he explained everything in a way that actually made sense. We came in for a flaky beard and patches and thought we''d need medical grade treatments, he was honest and told us we did not need this and saved us tons of money and time. You can tell he genuinely cares about his patients and wants them to understand their skin, not just treat it. Many doctors would push unnecessary treatments and medicine. He did not.\n\nIt''s rare to find a doctor who is both highly skilled and so personable. We left wanting to come back. We genuinely were so happy with our experience. I''m so grateful we found him and would recommend him to anyone looking for a dermatologist they can trust. Completely worth it!", "author": "T T", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104325211520455583503/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-06-02T02:31:37.300155470Z", "text": "Dr Lauber was simply amazing. I called and he was able to accommodate me within the hour.. He made me feel very comfortable, and he is very thorough. He even made me a personalized compound in his office to treat my severe eczema, which already feels better since using it. I highly recommend him, get ready to laugh at his jokes!!! Thank you Dr!", "author": "Alina <3", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105470276548827304417/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-06-02T03:07:55.604672535Z", "text": "I was dying of a burning itchy rash that was misdiagnosed by two urgent care non-doctors and growing by the day. I was so itchy that I could not focus on anything. Life was feeling like a 3/10. I could not get any immediate appointment from a network dermatologist and most didn''t even pick up their phone. Fortunately, my coworker recommended Dr. Lauber. I was able to talk and see him within 1 hour! He looked at my condition, immediately diagnosed it, and even provided me with oral and cream medication so I didn''t have to go to CVS or Target after the appointment. I took the pill and applied the cream at the office, and was already feeling better on the car ride home. Later that same day, he called me to check if my condition improved. I thought my overseas vacations were ruined but Dr. Lauber saved my sanity and trip. I never knew there was an emergency dermatologist that could see me the same day. He''s a really funny guy too.", "author": "Irvine mom", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105261335035651896892/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-25T19:26:14.736261805Z", "text": "Dr Lauber is the best! He treated me nearly 30 years ago , and now I have brought my teenage children in He is extremely knowledgeable, hinest, and accommodating. We have even booked appointments on short notice, and most recently, he saw my daughter for a concern I had. It turned out to be nothing, and he did not even charge us. Dr Lauber is wonderful!!! I highly recommend him if you are looking for a professional dermatologist in Orange County.", "author": "Jax P", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102251611823834059657/reviews"}], "website": "http://www.advancedskinofoc.com/", "location": {"latitude": 33.626281999999996, "longitude": -117.93279699999998}, "services": ["Acne Treatment", "Genital Warts Removal", "Cyst / Lump Removal", "Rash Treatments", "Skin Infections", "Eczema Treatments", "Skin Cancer Screening", "Skin Cancer Treatments", "Botox Injections", "Psoriasis Treatment", "Rosacea Treatment", "Impetigo Treatment", "Juvederm"], "insurance": {"notes": "Only private pay clients are accepted. The practice does not accept any insurance plans.", "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": [], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": false}, "highlights": [{"title": "Same-Day Appointments", "detail": "Offers same-day appointments for urgent skin concerns.", "category": "convenience"}, {"title": "Board-Certified Dermatologist", "detail": "Dr. Lauber is board-certified by the American Board of Dermatology with over 35 years of experience.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Specializes in Acne & HPV", "detail": "Expertise in acne vulgaris and HPV-related conditions including genital warts, using advanced technology.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Private Physician-Led Practice", "detail": "Dr. Lauber personally sees all patients; no nurse practitioners or physician assistants.", "category":