nt from a network dermatologist and most didn''t even pick up their phone. Fortunately, my coworker recommended Dr. Lauber. I was able to talk and see him within 1 hour! He looked at my condition, immediately diagnosed it, and even provided me with oral and cream medication so I didn''t have to go to CVS or Target after the appointment. I took the pill and applied the cream at the office, and was already feeling better on the car ride home. Later that same day, he called me to check if my condition improved. I thought my overseas vacations were ruined but Dr. Lauber saved my sanity and trip. I never knew there was an emergency dermatologist that could see me the same day. He''s a really funny guy too.", "author": "Irvine mom", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105261335035651896892/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-25T19:26:14.736261805Z", "text": "Dr Lauber is the best! He treated me nearly 30 years ago , and now I have brought my teenage children in He is extremely knowledgeable, hinest, and accommodating. We have even booked appointments on short notice, and most recently, he saw my daughter for a concern I had. It turned out to be nothing, and he did not even charge us. Dr Lauber is wonderful!!! I highly recommend him if you are looking for a professional dermatologist in Orange County.", "author": "Jax P", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102251611823834059657/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Patients consistently praise Dr. Jeffrey Lauber for his exceptional professionalism, thoroughness, and ability to provide immediate, personalized care. Many highlight his kindness, humor, and willingness to go above and beyond to ensure patient comfort and satisfaction.", "about_highlight": "Advanced Skin Treatment Center of Orange County is a private, physician-led dermatology practice led by Dr. Jeffrey Lauber, a board-certified dermatologist with over 35 years of experience. T