The hospital offers a comprehensive range of services including cancer, cardiology, neurology, orthopedics, pediatrics, emergency medicine, and many more. It is open 24 hours a day, seven days a week, and provides same-day appointments, virtual care through the MyMountSinai app, and a patient portal for managing health care. The Mount Sinai Hospital has achieved Magnet Recognition for nursing excellence for the fifth consecutive time, awarded to less than 10 percent of U.S. hospitals.

With a commitment to serving a diverse population, the hospital provides Language Access Services and international patient services. Patients can easily find a doctor, schedule appointments online, and access billing and insurance information through the hospital''s website.', '1 Gustave L. Levy Place, New York, NY 10029', 'New York', 'NY', '10029', '212-241-6500', ARRAY['English']::text[], 'Hospital', TRUE, '{"images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/the-mount-sinai-hospital-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/the-mount-sinai-hospital-google-2.webp", "https://www.mountsinai.org/mshealth/themes/default/media/images/logo-color.png", "https://www.mountsinai.org/mshealth/themes/default/media/images/logo-color.png", "https://www.mountsinai.org/files/MSHealth/Assets/MSH/MSHS-Hosptial-FindaDoctor-Carousel-1920x575.jpg", "https://www.mountsinai.org/files/MSHealth/Assets/MSH/MSHS-MSH-ANCC-Magnet-Carousel-1920x575.jpg", "https://www.mountsinai.org/files/MSHealth/Assets/MSH/MSHS-Hospital-Newsweek-BestHospitals-2026-Carousel-1920x575-v4.jpg", "https://www.mountsinai.org/files/MSHealth/Assets/MSH/MSHS-Hospital-VirtualUrgentCare-Carousel-1920x575-v5.jpg", "https://www.mountsinai.org/files/MSHealth/Assets/HS/Locations/MSD-Queens/MSHS-Hospital-ANCC-Spotlight-740x540.jpg", "https://www.mountsinai.org/files/MSHealth/Assets/HS/MSHS-MyMountSinai-2025-Spotlight-v2.jpg", "https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/productlogos/translate/v14/24px.svg"], "rating": 3.5, "reviews": [{"date": "2025-09-10T21:14:23.011032178Z", "text": "Called 4 times left multiple messages but no one ever reached out to schedule a simple follow up appointment … told me I have to come in person 2 hours all the way from Brooklyn to schedule. Doctors are great but the scheduling team is a nightmare.", "author": "Kang", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115606118194052781320/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-09-07T19:20:10.260724149Z", "text": "This place is ridiculous. You have to wait more than one day for a procedure while fasting for over 24 hours, only for them to cancel it. It''s absurd. The nurses do not demonstrate critical thinking skills. They don''t involve the patient and family members in the plan of care process. Bedside report should involve not just the nurses, but also the family and the patient. It''s important for everyone to be included in the exchange of information for better communication and care. The collaboration is very poor; it feels like they would allow a patient to suffer and die in a miserable way.", "author": "Mitch", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108309808250691028808/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-02-07T10:26:18.298320Z", "text": "In past six months we had to go to this place twice, and highly recommended doctor had no bedside manners. I have had fare share with doctors to deal with, but this kind never. Usually with any kind of procedure they walk you through what to expect what will happen etc… needed to get the biopsy for the liver and without talking he just shoved the needle in the stomach! Painful procedure and the process! It’s not that I have got many biopsy in my life. On top of it did not follow through entire instructions given by the doctors.\nNow that you are dealing with those doctors my doctor guaranteed me about the surgeon ( she would go to her) . I needed surgery, doctor was good to talk to, she knew what she was supposed to do but only half the information was given to me.\nI was never told how long  will I be in recovery room, or  if needed instead of laparoscopic they will make a full incision…, I was out after the surgery but my relatives were told that they can be with me within 1 to 1 1/2 hours  instead they ended up staying 12 hours worrying about me.\nThey got a call that the bed was not ready but the floor I was supposed to be on, the nurse was ready and asking my relatives when were recovery room was bringing me up.  So big communication gap between each management.\nAvoid this hospital and do your homework before going to the doctor associated with this hospital.", "author": "Sd", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116075195086648505175/reviews"}, {"date": "2024-07-09T08:41:15.548115Z", "text": "I have found that the medical staff is top notch, 5*, but the admin staff can leave a bit to be desired. This is by no means a universal issue; sometimes scheduling is great. Overall, a very positive experience, you will not go wrong choosing Mount Sinai as your hospital.", "author": "Dominic Del Principe", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111441621038903719366/reviews"}, {"date": "2021-05-09T16:29:45.722615Z", "text": "I recently visited this hospital for a bad sinus infection and had to get surgery for it. I stayed 3 days and everyone was very hospitable and respectful and took very good care of me. From the moment I stepped in the hospital, everyone was so kind and helpful unlike a lot of the other hospitals here in NYC. I would recommend anyone to go here for your health needs. God bless everyone who works here and fight every day to save people’s lives.", "author": "Selt Gjergjova", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104129746288399135635/reviews"}], "website": "https://www.mountsinai.org/locations/mount-sinai", "location": {"latitude": 40.7896393, "longitude": -73.95417420000001}, "services": ["Cancer", "Dermatology", "Diabetes", "Digestive Diseases - Gastroenterology", "Ear, Nose, and Throat", "Emergency Medicine", "Geriatrics", "Heart - Cardiology and Cardiovascular Surgery", "Kidney Disease - Nephrology", "Neurology", "Neurosurgery", "Obstetrics and Gynecology", "Ophthalmology", "Orthopedics", "Pediatrics", "Psychiatry", "Pulmonology", "Radiation Oncology", "Radiology", "Rehabilitation", "Rheumatology", "Spine", "Surgery", "Urology", "Alzheimer''s Disease", "Breast Health", "Intensive Care Units", "Liver Care", "Transplantation Services"], "insurance": {"notes": null, "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": [], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": false}, "highlights": [{"title": "Magnet Recognition for Nursing Excellence", "detail": "The Mount Sinai Hospital has achieved Magnet Recognition for the fifth consecutive time, awarded to less than 10% of U.S. hospitals.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Ranked #1 in New York by Newsweek", "detail": "Newsweek/Statista ranked The Mount Sinai Hospital No. 1 in New York State and New York City on its World’s Best Hospitals 2025 list.", "category": "reviews"}, {"title": "U.S. News Honor Roll", "detail": "Listed on the U.S. News & World Report® ''Best Hospitals Honor Roll'' for 2025-26 with 12 nationally ranked specialties.", "category": "reviews"}, {"title": "24/7 Care Available", "detail": "The hospital is open 24 hours a day, every day, including holidays.", "category": "convenience"}, {"title": "Same-Day Appointments", "detail": "Same-day appointments are available for urgent needs.", "category": "convenience"}, {"title": "MyMountSinai App", "detail": "Manage your health care on the go with the MyMountSinai app, including virtual care and appointment booking.", "category": "technology"}], "price_tier": "$$", "source_url": "https://www.mountsinai.org/locations/mount-sinai?utm_source=Yext&utm_medium=local_listing&utm_campaign=MountSinai&y_source=1_MTgwODM1MS03MTUtbG9jYXRpb24ud2Vic2l0ZQ%3D%3D", "appointment": {"booking_note": "Easily search by doctor, condition, insurance, or location—and make an appointment", "appointment_url": "https://www.mountsinai.org/appointment/sameday?utm_source=link&utm_medium=sameday&utm_campaign=msorgsp", 