g choosing Mount Sinai as your hospital.", "author": "Dominic Del Principe", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111441621038903719366/reviews"}, {"date": "2021-05-09T16:29:45.722615Z", "text": "I recently visited this hospital for a bad sinus infection and had to get surgery for it. I stayed 3 days and everyone was very hospitable and respectful and took very good care of me. From the moment I stepped in the hospital, everyone was so kind and helpful unlike a lot of the other hospitals here in NYC. I would recommend anyone to go here for your health needs. God bless everyone who works here and fight every day to save people’s lives.", "author": "Selt Gjergjova", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104129746288399135635/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Patients praise the medical staff for their expertise and care, but express frustration with scheduling issues and inconsistent communication.", "about_highlight": "Founded in 1852, The Mount Sinai Hospital is one of the nation’s largest and most respected hospitals, acclaimed internationally for excellence in clinical care. Ranked among the top hospitals nationwide, we serve one of the most diverse populations in the world. The Mount Sinai Hospital is listed on the U.S. News & World Report® ''Best Hospitals Honor Roll'' for 2025-26 and 12 of our specialties are ranked nationally. In the U.S. News & World Report® 2025-26 “Best Children’s Hospitals” rankings, Mount Sinai Kravis Children’s Hospital was listed among the country’s top children’s hospitals. The Mount Sinai Hospital was ranked by Newsweek/Statista as No. 19 in the world, No. 7 nationally, No. 1 in New York State, and No. 1 in New York City on its World’s Best Hospitals 2025 list.\n\nThe hospital offers a comprehensive range of services including cancer, cardiology, neurology, orthopedics, pediatrics, emergency medicine, and many more. It is open 24 hours a day, seven days a week, and provides same-day appointments, virtual care through the MyMountSinai app, and a patient portal for managing health care. The Mount Sinai Hospital has achieved Magnet Recognition for nursing excellence for the fifth consecutive time, awarded to less than 10 percent of U.S. hospitals.\n\nWith a commitment to serving a diverse population, the hospital provides Language Access Services and international patient services. Patients can easily find a doctor, schedule appointments online, and access billing and insurance information through the hospital''s website.", "appointment_url": "https://www.mountsinai.org/appointment/sameday?utm_source=link&utm_medium=sameday&utm_campaign=msorgsp", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=6357899930223991588&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJUyrmBQ9ZwokRJFt7Ck3MO1g", "important_links": [{"url": "https://www.mountsinai.org/appointment/sameday?utm_source=link&utm_medium=sameday&utm_campaign=msorgsp", "text": "Same-Day Appointments"}, {"url": "https://www.mountsinai.org/find-a-doctor", "text": "Find a Doctor"}, {"url": "https://www.mountsinai.org/appointment/sameday", "text": "Same-Day Appointments"}, {"url": "https://www.mountsinai.org/locations", "text": "Our Locations"}, {"url": "https://www.mountsinai.org/locations/brooklyn", "text": "Mount Sinai Brooklyn"}, {"url": "https://www.mountsinai.org/locations/mount-sinai", "text": "The Mount Sinai Hospital"}, {"url": "https://www.mountsinai.org/locations/morningside", "text": "Mount Sinai Morningside"}, {"url": "https://www.mountsinai.org/locations/queens", "text": "Mount Sinai Queens"}, {"url": "https://www.mountsinai.org/locations/south-nassau", "text": "Mount Sinai South Nassau"}, {"url": "https://www.mountsinai.org/locations/west", "text": "Mount Sinai West​​​"}, {"url": "https://www.mountsinai.org/locations/spine-hospital", "text": "The Spine Hospital at Mount Sinai"}, {"url": "https://www.mounts