 and body", "director amy", "rudia"], "conditions_treated": ["Acne", "Skin tone and texture issues", "Body contouring needs", "Dead tissues on skin and body"], "google_website_url": "https://nugamedispa.com/", "google_primary_type": "Spa", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": ["Director Amy", "Rudia"], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "2005 Boggs Rd #101, Duluth, GA 30096, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/113943115136033595411", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVTtWUdW1gqZI5q0c9I9SRlpSChRuzBVZ7Iwr2CfH0zvWY-k0GU5Q=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Katharine Miele"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/114970974256127751760", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW7OYDYMVgAEMw85OwPrWC8bhrCpxCRSloUKvqfaLjtYdzsVsKU=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Nuga Skin Clinic"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/114132333449183115231", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX-hyBsqAdJOHCp41JQadSKcWfPIes8uq-Qd_uiNC6WPRkDmSZCew=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "hanna kim"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-05-23T12:28:21.642484+00:00', 'nuga-skin-clinic', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('ef2341d2-8a01-4b09-8cc3-6d9abb5a4631', NULL, 'Nuga Medi Spa', 'At Nuga Medi Spa, we combine cutting-edge technology with personalized care to help you look and feel your best. Whether you''re looking for anti-aging solutions, skin rejuvenation, or non-surgical treatments, our expert team is here to guide you on your beauty journey. We are committed to delivering results that enhance your beauty while maintaining a natural, refreshed look. Our state-of-the-art technology, highly trained and certified professionals, and customized treatment plans ensure a relaxing, spa-like environment for every client.', '2005 Boggs Rd NW #101, Duluth, GA 30096', 'Duluth', 'GA', '30096', '770-687-2545', ARRAY['English']::text[], 'Aesthetic Wellness', FALSE, '{"images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/nuga-medi-spa-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/nuga-medi-spa-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/nuga-medi-spa-google-3.webp", "https://static.wixstatic.com/media/e08f64_6bbbe0e0933a4da9904ef895793e205e~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_145,h_105,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/nugamedi-newlogo.jpg", "https://static.parastorage.com/services/linguist-flags/1.1005.0/assets/flags/round/USA.png", "https://static.parastorage.com/services/linguist-flags/1.1005.0/assets/flags/round/KOR.png", "https://static.wixstatic.com/media/45fcbf_17c8d67b342f408e83458a0771aba72b~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_1920,h_705,al_c,q_85,enc_avif,quality_auto/45fcbf_17c8d67b342f408e83458a0771aba72b~mv2.jpg", "https://static.wixstatic.com/media/3ab727_a3c3e94665da472f8418e9e1d3c78d38~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_475,h_457,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Group%2024_edited_edited.jpg", "https://static.wixstatic.com/media/3ab727_200945311e5945fa951a2ec40da68338~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_316,h_295,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/3ab727_200945311e5945fa951a2ec40da68338~mv2.png", "https://static.wixstatic.com/media/3ab727_cc93a855f34f45cf8cef2d84e54d9b43~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_316,h_294,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/image-3.png", "https://static.wixstatic.com/media/3ab727_89b9b32ba84f479ca6d06d486de782b6~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_315,h_293,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/image-5.png", "https://static.wixstatic.com/media/3ab727_38a32c0233024e5ebcde279226717930~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_316,h_294,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/image-2.png", "https://static.wixstatic.com/media/3ab727_b5f6c88f6eda4d15a4134cfe24fcafe4~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_316,h_294,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/image-4.png", "https://static.wixstatic.com/media/3ab727_094d21f0d2f8453a904b3f472fb87a6d~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_316,h_294,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/image-6.png", "https://static.wixstatic.com/media/3ab727_09720665f5424e8586202edb86a2776d~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_467,h_481,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/image.png"], "rating": 4.9, "reviews": [{"date": "2026-01-20T03:55:53.709069789Z", "text": "I can’t recommend this skin clinic enough! I’ve been to many places that claim to be “Korean clinics,” but this is the real deal. From the moment you walk in, you can tell they are professionals with the latest machines, lasers, and treatments. They offer an incredible variety—everything from acne packages (which I’m currently doing and wow, my scarred skin has completely transformed!) to hair removal, slimming/weight loss treatments, and Botox.\nThe staff are knowledgeable and genuinely care about results. I’ve discovered reliable products here that actually work, and the packages and deals they offer make it even better. I’ve been coming consistently every 4 weeks and my skin has never looked better—I’m literally glowing!\nIf you want real results and top-notch care, this clinic is hands down the best. Truly a hidden gem!", "author": "Daniela Amaya", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111676563477140179153/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-12-09T18:35:13.852326132Z", "text": "I always choose Nuga Beauty for my skin care.  All staffs are very professional,  and I feel welcome whenever I visit the clinic.\nClinic is very clean, they have so many different lasers that would help my skin glow.", "author": "hanna kim", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114132333449183115231/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-01-10T15:22:40.233637915Z", "text": "I can’t say enough good things about my experience. My injector was extremely knowledgeable, conservative, and focused on achieving natural results rather than overdoing it. They made sure all of my goals were met and took the time to explain the process, risks, and long-term safety, which made me feel very comfortable. Pricing was fair and transparent, and I’m so happy with my results. I’ll definitely be returning.", "author": "Olivia Z", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112504801391283527247/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-03-19T00:11:11.021718995Z", "text": "My mother, grandmother, and I drove 4 hours from our hometown in Florida to visit this exquisite center for an authentic Korean facial experience. I personally was treated by Yong-Pah and she was fabulous, professional, and talented. Very strong hands when needed but, gentle in all ways needed as well. LOVED it. We will be back again and again!", "author": "Gabrielle Hope", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100452622130155780917/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-08-25T14:49:58.814161515Z", "text": "I''ve been going here for about three years now and I honestly love it. My skin has gotten so much better, I get compliments all the time! My brown spots have pretty much disappeared and my skin is glowing. The staff is super friendly and really know what they’re doing. They have the latest technology, so this place has everything you need for your skincare.  Highly recommend!", "author": "Katherine Kim", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114535251823242512156/reviews"}], "website": "https://www.nugamedispa.com", "location": {"latitude": 33.969720699999996, "longitude": -84.0968248}, "services": ["Shurink Lifting", "Thermage FLX", "Potenza RF", "Laser Treatments", "Injectables", "Facials & Lymphatic Drainage"], "insurance": {"notes": "Please contact us for more information on payment options.", "accepts_medicaid": false, "accepts_medicare": false, "accepted_networks": [], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": false}, "highlights": [{"title": "State-of-the-art technology", "detail": "We use the latest technology for effective and safe treatments.", "category": "technology"}, {"title": "Highly trained professionals", "detail": "Our team is certified and experienced in various aesthetic treatments.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Customized treatment plans", "detail": "Every client receives a personalized treatment plan tailored to their needs.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Relaxing spa-like environment", "detail": "Our clinic offers a tranquil setting for your beauty journey.", "category": "convenience"}], "price_tier": "$$$", "source_url": "https://www.nugamedispa.com/", "appointment": {"booking_note": "Please call 770-687-2545 for an appointment or any inquiry.", "appointment_url": "https://www.nugamedispa.com/contact", "new_patient_note": null, "phone_booking_available": true, "online_booking_available": 