eir end throughout today.  Big thanks to the employees that were consistently assisting us throughout the day though.", "author": "Paris Yang", "rating": 2, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115577640635431585296/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-14T22:48:45.253300738Z", "text": "My daughter was hospitalized for several days in a Labor & Delivery room at Braselton. Unfortunately she lost her baby but EVERY person we had contact with during that time exhibited compassion and comforted my daughter and son in law when the baby did not survive.  The Bereavement team Jessi and Karen were AMAZING. I was thoroughly impressed.  I would give more than 5 stars if I could.", "author": "Joe Mobley", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115136237669461221581/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-07T00:16:31.184782443Z", "text": "I brought my daughter in last Saturday(1/31) night and was seen by Dr Ariel. I always have a good experience at this location, but this time, it was excellent. The level of care and concern my daughter received from Dr Ariel and the staff(Stephanie, Lauren, Justin) was out of this world. I was told that Dr Ariel was new, but I couldn''t tell. She was a natural and took great care of my baby. Thanks Doc for all you do. Continue to make a difference. You Rock!", "author": "Mz Dee", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103237340567343277493/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-12-05T16:38:48.487405344Z", "text": "I want to leave an important review about this hospital because it’s not about what they did wrong but it’s about the lengths they went to to correct what they did wrong and make it right. I am more than a month out of my stay in the ER and the ICU.\nMy concerns are still being honored and addressed, and rightfully so.\n\nWithout going into details, I feel we need to give credit when a large institution hears the voice of a single person and uses it to better their organization. For that reason, I would not hesitate to recommend this organization. I had three very serious issues and they addressed each one to my satisfaction. I set a high bar with Customer-Service and they leaped over it.", "author": "Marlayna Glynn", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113491286971811882973/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-01-26T16:36:30.842792261Z", "text": "The staff in Labor & Delivery, as well as the NICU are very professional and took great care of my family. I have no complaints there, whatsoever. They are awesome! However, the ER and especially the billing department are utterly incompetent. If you can go anywhere else for medical treatment, I would encourage it.\n\nAfter three conference calls with our insurance, we were finally able prove to the hospital that our child was indeed on our insurance, despite having already provided the needed documentation to substantiate this. We did not have such issues from our insurance company, only the billing department at the hospital.\n\nMy wife had extremely high blood pressure (190/115 at one point), with dizziness and nausea after a c-section and waited for hours to be cared for by the ER team. Things improved once we got out of the ER, and into a regular room.\n\nTo further complicate matters, the billing department billed us for an item our insurance company had no record of. Insurance told them to resubmit this claim, but this was ignored by the hospital, and they instead sent the bill to collections. Several months after all this, we learned that the billing department used the wrong code and is trying to get even more money out of us. If you use Northeast Georgia Medical Center, make sure you''ve got a few thousand more dollars in savings. They will get as much out of you as they can, insurance or not.", "author": "Rick Cole", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101780132815034183691/reviews"}]}, "about_highlight": "Northeast Georgia Medical Center Braselton is a Northeast Georgia Health System hospital campus in Braselton, Georgia. This profile was seeded from Google Places because the official website blocked automated scraping during the demo.", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=15998172264196890034&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJNbCdyZru9YgRsl32junsBN4", "important_links": [{"url": "https://www.wordfence.com/help/?query=locked-out", "text": "Documentation"}], "quality_missing": ["languages (non-default)", "insurance", "team_members", "appointment_url"], "search_keywords": ["hospital", "english", "virtual visits", "urgent care", "symptom checker", "mychart management", "classes & events", "heart services", "vascular services", "orthopedics", "neurosciences", "cancer treatment", "surgery", "emergency services", "obstetrical services", "nicu care", "pediatric emergency services", "cardiopulmonary rehabilitation", "imaging", "endoscopy", "outpatient lab", "therapy services", "emergency care", "hospital services", "labor & delivery", "medical specialty care"], "services_offered": [{"name": "Emergency care", "category": "Hospital", "description": "Emergency department and urgent hospital evaluation noted in Google review context.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Labor & Delivery", "category": "Hospital", "description": "Labor and delivery care appears in multiple Google reviews.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Expecting families and postpartum patients."}, {"name": "Medical specialty care", "category": "Hospital", "description": "Hospital campus with specialty office and inpatient care references.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}], "google_website_url": "https://www.nghs.com/locations/braselton", "google_primary_type": "Medical Clinic", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": [], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "1400 River Pl, Braselton, GA 30517, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/116159892872822292937", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUHcBZH5LYncwFuQ6N0L8QKkOVyaB-tAZ-4LR8PwIcMhDWS5syaog=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Milton Johnson"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/101985732508734360217", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXQ_vv9wrFEDVZwAX6OOh1KR76aMZrTAV0hU0AvvnRYJirur0K_SA=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "E H"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/114433351599194188276", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIU0j14zidemOYLgpT1ti3kG1wdEsJVE5u88dFRJQpPRahg5DI=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Jeff Short"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-05-10T09:19:33.854+00:00', 'northeast-georgia-medical-center-braselton', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('7271a5a9-de11-4565-b4eb-d1613b1a814c', NULL, 'Dr. Van Tran Family Practice', 'Dr. Van Tran Family Practice, located in Houston, TX, has been providing comprehensive family medicine since 2003. The practice is built on a philosophy of listening to each patient, giving them respect, and treating them as true healthcare partners. They are committed to ensuring no one goes without necessary medication, offering samples and coupons to reduce costs, and providing affordable self-pay options for lab work and office visits. The team offers a wide range of services from same-day sick visits and chronic disease management (asthma, diabetes, high blood pressure) to specialized care including weight loss programs, testosterone replacement therapy, mental health services for anxiety, depression, and ADHD, as well as cosmetic injectables like Botox and dermal fillers. Each patient receives a customized treatment plan based on their individual needs.', '1919 North Loop West, Suite 218', 'Houston', 'TX', '77008', '713-862-5797', ARRAY['English']::text[], 'Family Medicine', FALSE, '{"fax": "713-862-0166", "images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/dr.-van-tran-family-practice-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/dr.-van-tran-family-practice-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/dr.-van-tran-family-practice-google-3.webp", "https://sa1s3optim.patientpop.com/assets/images/provider/photos/1809354.png", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/dr.-van-tran-family-practice-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/dr.-van-tran-family-practice-google-5.webp", "https://sa1s3optim.patientpop.com/231x200/assets/images/provider/photos/1816022.png", "https://sa1s3optim.patientpop.com/231x200/assets/images/provider/photos/1816024.jpg", "https://sa1s3optim.patientpop.com/231x200/assets/images/provider/photos/1816025.jpg", "https://sa1s3optim.patientpop.com/231x200/assets/images/provider/photos/1816026.jpg", "https://sa1s3optim.patientpop.com/231x200/assets/images/provider/photos/1816027.jpg", "https://sa1s3optim.patientpop.com/231x200/assets/images/provider/photos/1816028.jpg", "https://sa1s3optim.patientpop.com/231x200/assets/images/provider/photos/1816029.jpg", "https://sa1s3optim.patientpop.com/231x200/assets/production/practices/059f585fd7c17e823b8526e5745d4a3561d59bbd/images/2841428.jpg", "https://sa1s3optim.patientpop.com/231x200/assets/production/practices/059f585fd7c17e823b8526e5745d4a3561d59bbd/images/2841429.jpg", "https://sa1s3optim.patientpop.com/231x200/assets/production/practices/059f585fd7c17e823b8526e5745d4a3561d59bbd/images/2841435.jpg", "https://sa1s3optim.patientpop.com/assets/images/provider/photos/2206449.png"], "rating": 4.8, "pricing": [{"name": "Self-pay office visit", "notes": "The practice offers a lower self-pay office rate than others in the community.", "price": null, "category": "Consultation", "price_range": null}, {"name": "Self-pay lab tests", "notes": "Affordable self-pay options for lab tests are available.", "price": null, "category": "Diagnostic", "price_range": null}, {"name": "Medication assistance", "notes": "Dr. Tran offers samples and coupons to help cut medication costs.", "price": null, "category": "Pharmacy", "price_range": null}], "reviews": [{"date": "2026-01-08T15:56:41.899797379Z", "text": "Everyone at Dr. Van Tran Family Practice is excellent!\n\nI have seen each provider here (pending availability) and the transition in my care has been seamless. I feel like each provider truly listens to my concerns, spends ample time helping me evaluate options, and genuinely is invested in my health. Meredith in particular deserves a huge shout out- I have never met such a thorough and thoughtful medical provider!!\n\nI’ve recommended friends and family come here and they have been so happy with the care they have received.\n\nIf you need a GP, you’ll be in great hands at this practice!", "author": "Cassondra Childs", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102501699408276609893/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-17T16:44:36.282876954Z", "text": "I have been a loyal Dr Tran patient for 18 years! The front desk lady is just down right rude. She is instantly bothered every time I have encountered her. Dr Tran and Olivia and Meridith are all wonderful. I have no clue why her behavior is tolerated. Please do better. I will be making a verbal complaint my next appointment. Absolutely unacceptable. I''m specifically talking about the girl who sits on the back when we leave to schedule our next appointment and takes payment.", "author": "Candace Nelson", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110202911358360212167/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-04T22:58:34.089922861Z", "text": "I want to start by expressing my gratitude for Dr. Olivia; she is an exceptional doctor, and I have no complaints about her care or professionalism. However, I am reaching out to address a concerning issue I’ve experienced regarding the front desk and nursing staff.\n\nI had an appointment last Thursday, during which I was prescribed medication that was supposed to be sent to my pharmacy. It has now been a week, and my prescription has not been sent. Despite my repeated calls—every single day—I am met with the same response: that they will inform the nurse, and the call ends quickly without further assistance.\n\nAdditionally, I’ve sent two messages through the patient portal and have not received any response. When I called yesterday, I learned that there is only one nurse available and that she is backed up. As unfortunate as it is this should not impact patients'' access to necessary medications.\n\nToday, I called again and was told they would again notify the nurse, it’s 4:55 pm with no update. Does the medical team know that patients are dang near begging to get their medications? It sucks to consider seeking care elsewhere simply because I cannot obtain the medication I need.", "author": "Chastity Moore", "rating": 2, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111151148603625106650/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-11-25T15:27:00.953237146Z", "text": "I’ve been coming to Dr. Van Tran’s office since June 2025, and my experience with PA-C Olivia Russell has been exceptional. She truly listens, provides thoughtful and clear guidance, and always makes sure I fully understand my care plan. Olivia creates an environment where you feel welcomed, supported, and safe to speak openly and that makes all the difference.\n\nBefore meeting Olivia, I had my PCP provider at a Memorial Hermann clinic. However, the level of care that Olivia provides is unmatched. After experiencing her professionalism, compassion, and thoroughness, I changed my PCP on my insurance specifically so I could continue being seen at Dr. Van Tran’s office. Olivia has done an exceptional job, and I’ve never felt more confident in my care.\n\nShe has a gift for explaining things in a way that feels supportive, not overwhelming, and it’s clear she genuinely cares about her patients’ well-being. Her passion for what she does shows in every visit, and I’m so grateful my colleague recommended her to me. She consistently goes above and beyond for my medical needs.\n\nWithout hesitation, I would refer anyone to schedule with Olivia and I’ve already recommended her to several of my family members.", "author": "Cristal Rodriguez", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111863072312793921168/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-03-03T23:28:10.827967728Z", "text": "I was really excited to become a new patient here, but unfortunately my experience was extremely disappointing.\nI called multiple times (at least three separate attempts), and during my final call I was placed on hold for 32 minutes. No one ever came back to the line — it appears they left me on hold until the office closed, despite knowing I was waiting. In total, I spent over an hour just trying to schedule an appointment.\nThe initial interaction was also concerning. The person who answered sounded upset and irritated when I asked about scheduling and told me they were booked until the week of March 16. I completely understand offices get busy, but professionalism and courtesy still matter.\nSadly, this experience felt like a red flag. I was truly looking forward to trying this practice, but after this, I’ll have to look for another doctor.", "author": "Jjj Gutierrez A", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105160426479205548008/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-06-03T14:36:58.877915018Z", "text": "Yesterday was my first appointment at the practice. When I arrived, I noticed that the receptionist appeared preoccupied with her phone and did not greet me. I initiated the interaction by saying hello and then signed in. During the check-in process, she never asked whether I was there for a scheduled appointment or as a walk-in patient, and there was very little acknowledgment or communication.\n\nAfter taking a seat, I was surprised when, a few minutes later, she called out across the lobby asking for my ID. As a first-time patient, I felt it would have been more professional to gather my information and verify my identification during the check-in process rather than calling attention to me in front of the entire waiting room.\n\nIn contrast, Meredith, my provider, was excellent. I was very impressed by her professionalism, compassion, and work ethic. She seemed genuinely invested in helping me get my weight back on track and took the time to listen and provide encouragement. Her positive attitude completely changed the tone of my appointment and left me feeling optimistic about my health journey. I look forward to continuing to work with Meredith in the future.", "author": "Jones Thompson", "rating": 4, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115162900433358860519/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-06T15:43:12.755331292Z", "text": "I’ve had a great experience with this office from start to finish. The office runs smoothly, and everyone is friendly and helpful.  Dr. Tran alwsys takes the time to listen and explain everything clearly, which makes a huge difference. I especially want to recognize his PA Olivia Russell—she is fantastic! She’s incredibly easy to talk to, attentive, and makes you feel completely comfortable asking questions. You can tell she genuinely cares about her patients. Highly recommend this practice!!", "author": "Lindsey Anselmo", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101222096073100140157/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-04-09T02:24:33.232567889Z", "text": "I’ve been a patient here for over 20 years, and I can’t say enough good things! Dr. Tran and Meredith are truly amazing. While the phone lines can get busy and hold times occasionally run long, I see that as a sign of how many happy patients keep coming back. Refill requests are always handled promptly—my prescriptions are called in within minutes of leaving each appointment. Highly recommend this office!", "author": "Krystal Anderson", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113554163677049473742/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-05T14:08:21.246479040Z", "text": "Have been seeing Dr. Van Tran for about 6 months now and it’s been a great experience! He takes time to run through multiple scenarios and provides realistic guidance on my journey. The staff is always nice and easy to connect with if I ever need anything between appointments!", "author": "Lauren Loera", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118347870805336854019/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-11-14T16:54:13.384844956Z", "text": "Olivia is hands down the best doctor I’ve ever had. Her bedside manner is unmatched, and she truly knows her stuff. She’s incredibly thorough, detail-oriented, and genuinely caring. You can tell she prioritizes her patients’ well-being instead of rushing through appointments or focusing on quotas. She makes you feel seen, heard, and taken care of every single visit. Highly recommend!", "author": "Tatianna Brown", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112076316550124414137/reviews"}], "website": "https://www.drvantran.com", "location": {"latitude": 29.810611599999994, "longitude": -95.434241}, "services": ["ADHD", "Botox", "Depression & Anxiety", "Diabetes", "STD Testing", "Weight Loss", "Flu & Sick Visits", "Testosterone Replacement Therapy", "Laser Skin Care", "Peptides", "Same-Day Sick Visits", "Chronic Condition Management", "Weight Loss Program", "Mental Health Care", "BOTOX®", "Dermal Fillers"], "insurance": {"notes": "We accept nearly all major insurance plans. Please call to inquire regarding yours.", "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": true, "accepted_networks": ["Aetna", "Medicare", "Amerigroup", "Assurant Health", "Blue Cross Blue Shield", "Cigna", "Coventry", "First Choice Health", "Humana", "Memorial Hermann", "UMR", "UnitedHealthcare", "WellCare"], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": true}, "highlights": [{"title": "Affordable health care for the whole family", "detail": "The practice offers a lower self-pay of