ry impressed by her professionalism, compassion, and work ethic. She seemed genuinely invested in helping me get my weight back on track and took the time to listen and provide encouragement. Her positive attitude completely changed the tone of my appointment and left me feeling optimistic about my health journey. I look forward to continuing to work with Meredith in the future.", "author": "Jones Thompson", "rating": 4, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115162900433358860519/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-06T15:43:12.755331292Z", "text": "I’ve had a great experience with this office from start to finish. The office runs smoothly, and everyone is friendly and helpful.  Dr. Tran alwsys takes the time to listen and explain everything clearly, which makes a huge difference. I especially want to recognize his PA Olivia Russell—she is fantastic! She’s incredibly easy to talk to, attentive, and makes you feel completely comfortable asking questions. You can tell she genuinely cares about her patients. Highly recommend this practice!!", "author": "Lindsey Anselmo", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101222096073100140157/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-04-09T02:24:33.232567889Z", "text": "I’ve been a patient here for over 20 years, and I can’t say enough good things! Dr. Tran and Meredith are truly amazing. While the phone lines can get busy and hold times occasionally run long, I see that as a sign of how many happy patients keep coming back. Refill requests are always handled promptly—my prescriptions are called in within minutes of leaving each appointment. Highly recommend this office!", "author": "Krystal Anderson", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113554163677049473742/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-05T14:08:21.246479040Z", "text": "Have been seeing Dr. Van Tran for about 6 months now and it’s been a great experience! He takes time to run through multiple scenarios and provides realistic guidance on my journey. The staff is always nice and easy to connect with if I ever need anything between appointments!", "author": "Lauren Loera", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118347870805336854019/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-11-14T16:54:13.384844956Z", "text": "Olivia is hands down the best doctor I’ve ever had. Her bedside manner is unmatched, and she truly knows her stuff. She’s incredibly thorough, detail-oriented, and genuinely caring. You can tell she prioritizes her patients’ well-being instead of rushing through appointments or focusing on quotas. She makes you feel seen, heard, and taken care of every single visit. Highly recommend!", "author": "Tatianna Brown", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112076316550124414137/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Dr. Van Tran Family Practice has a 4.8 star Google rating from 1385 Google reviews. Patients commonly mention compassionate care, friendly staff, clear explanations, comfortable visits.", "about_highlight": "Dr. Van Tran Family Practice, located in Houston, TX, has been providing comprehensive family medicine since 2003. The practice is built on a philosophy of listening to each patient, giving them respect, and treating them as true healthcare partners. They are committed to ensuring no one goes without necessary medication, offering samples and coupons to reduce costs, and providing affordable self-pay options for lab work and office visits. The team offers a wide range of services from same-day sick visits and chronic disease management (asthma, diabetes, high blood pressure) to specialized care including weight loss programs, testosterone replacement therapy, mental health services for anxiety, depression, and ADHD, as well as cosmetic injectables like Botox and dermal fillers. Each patient receives a customized treatment plan based on their individual needs.",