for such a positive experience. I highly recommend Dr. Pham  and their team to anyone in need of exceptional dental care.", "author": "R W", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112986801476458322256/reviews"}, {"date": "2016-06-16T15:40:17.845Z", "text": "I had been to numerous dentist previously and Dr. Pham is truly Bar None in the bay area. He clearly explains what procedure he will be preforming before starting. Dr. Pham also makes sure your time in his office is a comfortable as possible. I have recommended him to my family, friends and now to you Googlers. If you want a true professional in an extremely friendly and clean environment then North Valley Dental is the place for you.", "author": "R Ruano", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113717815423620313716/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "North Valley Dental: H. Pham, DDS has a 5.0 star Google rating from 4 Google reviews. Patients commonly mention friendly staff, clear explanations, comfortable visits, strong results.", "about_highlight": "North Valley Dental, led by Dr. H. Pham, DDS, is a family and cosmetic dentistry practice located in Milpitas, California. The practice emphasizes exceptional care with a gentle touch, serving patients in a modern facility. As a community-focused dental office, North Valley Dental aims to provide quality dental care for patients of all ages.", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=15801553702867369483&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJWewwTrnOj4ARC_6qXl9lSts", "quality_missing": ["services", "insurance", "team_members", "appointment_url"], "search_keywords": ["dental", "dentist", "nha khoa", "nha sĩ", "trồng răng", "implant", "root canal", "crowns", "veneers", "braces", "invisalign", "toothache", "치과", "치과의사", "임플란트", "牙医", "牙科", "种植牙", "english", "vietnamese", "tiếng việt", "người việt", "bác sĩ việt"], "short_description": "North Valley Dental provides family and cosmetic dentistry in Milpitas, CA, with a focus on exceptional care and a gentle touch.", "google_website_url": "http://www.northvalleydental.com/", "google_primary_type": "Dental Clinic", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": [], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "991 Montague Expy #201, Milpitas, CA 95035, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/110793623408383314250", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ7IV777szRgQuknyWprNUpaX3_L1LpZx1P1R-_-lrg4v33_A=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "North Valley Dental: Pham Hop N DDS"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/110793623408383314250", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ7IV777szRgQuknyWprNUpaX3_L1LpZx1P1R-_-lrg4v33_A=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "North Valley Dental: Pham Hop N DDS"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-25T19:21:16.318806+00:00', 'north-valley-dental-h-pham-dds', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('bf1eb878-fff2-4ca7-9b48-c6ae2d7a1a6e', NULL, 'Southeast Family Health Center', 'Open since 1979 in the Bayview Hunter''s Point neighborhood, Southeast Family Health Center is committed to serving San Franciscans with affordable, comprehensive, and quality care for all ages. The clinic provides care for common illnesses, high blood pressure, sexually transmitted diseases (STDs), and offers confidential HIV testing and counselling, pregnancy testing, prenatal care, mental health services, and vision care. Your health care team is ready and looking forward to taking care of your health care needs as well as the needs of your family. The clinic offers a wide range of services including primary care, dental care, prenatal care, pediatrics, podiatry, gynecology, nutrition counseling, acupuncture, substance use treatment, HIV/AIDS care, re-entry support, and access to a clinic pharmacist. It is a part of the San Francisco Health Network and the San Francisco Department of Public Health.
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('9bc37ed9-fb97-4645-befe-0bb7111c647e', NULL, 'Carrollton Dental Studio - Dr Linh Nguyen', 'At Carrollton Dental Studio, we value building lifelong relationships with our patients. We see patients of all ages and our doctors always listen to their concerns, tailoring treatments to fit individual needs. Ensuring each patient has a positive dental experience is one of our top priorities. We are genuinely pleased that you have chosen Carrollton Dental Studio for your dental care. We are always excited to see new smiles coming through our door.', '1809 Golden Trail Ct #140, Carrollton, TX 75010', 'Carrollton', 'TX', '75010', '(972)-242-2155', ARRAY['English', 'Vietnamese']::text[], 'Dental', FALSE, '{"images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/carrollton-dental-studio-dr-linh-nguyen-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/carrollton-dental-studio-dr-linh-nguyen-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/carrollton-dental-studio-dr-linh-nguyen-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/carrollton-dental-studio-dr-linh-nguyen-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/carrollton-dental-studio-dr-linh-nguyen-google-5.webp"], "rating": 4.9, "reviews": [{"date": "2025-08-14T19:48:38.645522998Z", "text": "I am thrilled to share my exceptional experience with Dr. Linh Nguyen and his entire staff. Initially, I sought their services for a deep cleaning, but I was so impressed that I''ve decided to make him our permanent family dentist. Dr. Linh is incredibly thorough, compassionate, and informative. His expertise and caring demeanor were evident during the comprehensive examination for my daughter, husband and myself.  The staff took the time to explain every aspect of our dental health and proposed clear, manageable treatment plans for each of us.  Their professionalism and the friendly atmosphere of the entire clinic have won over my whole family. I highly recommend Dr. Linh for anyone seeking top-notch dental care and a trustworthy healthcare provider.", "author": "gee nguyen", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107421535022395117241/reviews"}, {"date": "2024-10-20T18:32:37.636994Z", "text": "My family and I have been going to Dental Spa of Frisco for quite some time, and we cannot recommend Dr. Linh and his team enough! From the moment we walk in, we are greeted with warmth and professionalism. Dr. Linh’s expertise and the care he provides consistently exceed our expectations. Whether it’s routine check-ups or more extensive dental work, we always feel confident that we are in excellent hands.\n\nThe staff is incredibly attentive, making sure we are comfortable throughout every visit, and they go above and beyond to ensure that we understand our treatment plans. It’s rare to find a dental practice that combines exceptional skill with such genuine care for their patients. We are grateful for the outstanding service we receive each time and are proud to be patients at Dental Spa of Frisco.", "author": "Ogechi Ugwulebo", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117036329551113040114/reviews"}, {"date": "2024-12-02T20:16:57.971927Z", "text": "Absolutely incredible!  The staff is kind and helpful.  Dr. Linh is exceptionally skilled in his many areas of dental expertise.  I have been very pleased with the dental procedures that I have experienced.  I would rate this office 8 stars if they were available!", "author": "Janece Labrum", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100187437520554849773/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-08-14T22:19:48.798638274Z", "text": "I have been a patient of Dr. Linh since he bought the practice from the previous dentist, Dr. Griffin.  Dr. Linh was on the faculty at his Alma Mater, the University of Washington, before moving to DFW.  I cannot speak highly enough about Dr. Linh and his staff.  I felt some pain one day and he saw me right away.  Turns out I had a tooth crack from age and he said the crack went deep into the tooth.  Luckily he saw me right away and was able to save the tooth and add a crown.  Even my wife, who is hard to please, left her dentist of 15 years because Dr. Linh is so wonderful.  If you are looking for a great dentist, go see him.  I tease him all the time saying “I only like you because you have skinny fingers”.  But really, you won’t be disappointed.", "author": "Charles Barry", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109553340063288551936/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-01-08T22:13:02.086476Z", "text": "Carrollton Dental Studio has excellent staff and they go out of their way to make me feel comfortable during my cleanings and procedures.  Dr. Linh is very outgoing and takes great care and detail during my exams.  He is always on top of my dental history and keeps my smile healthy and looking great!", "author": "Rich 75", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108562223412591098893/reviews"}], "website": "https://www.texasdentalstudios.com/carrollton-dental-studio", "location": {"latitude": 33.0333049, "longitude": -96.8851047}, "services": ["Cleaning & Prevention", "Family Dentistry", "Children''s Dentistry", "Cosmetic Dentistry", "Tooth Replacement", "Extractions & Pr