assage as part of TCM.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Telehealth Sessions", "category": "Telemedicine", "description": "Chinese Medicine telehealth sessions available.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Case Management", "category": "Care Coordination", "description": "Ongoing case management to develop relationships with clients.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}], "short_description": "Chicken Soup Chinese Medicine offers Integrated Chinese Medicine consultations and treatment plans, blending traditional Chinese medicine with Western therapies in a caring environment.", "google_website_url": "http://www.chickensoupchinesemedicine.com/", "google_primary_type": "Health", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": [], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "2300 Sutter St #203, San Francisco, CA 94115, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/105106589058782918777", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV9KVqS2i0Jx1sPc0qhk1TuV6q1VcbeDFm4hMmJuL-HuY2iFKU9-Q=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "BayAerialDrone 2017"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/105106589058782918777", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV9KVqS2i0Jx1sPc0qhk1TuV6q1VcbeDFm4hMmJuL-HuY2iFKU9-Q=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "BayAerialDrone 2017"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/105106589058782918777", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV9KVqS2i0Jx1sPc0qhk1TuV6q1VcbeDFm4hMmJuL-HuY2iFKU9-Q=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "BayAerialDrone 2017"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/105106589058782918777", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV9KVqS2i0Jx1sPc0qhk1TuV6q1VcbeDFm4hMmJuL-HuY2iFKU9-Q=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "BayAerialDrone 2017"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/114451120299081308830", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXqLP5B_BmTJxmVorxFxiyi7Bcm596cRUFX2rDn7fghe7VPMhA=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Chicken Soup Chinese Medicine"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-25T19:39:19.218885+00:00', 'chicken-soup-chinese-medicine', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('829954b8-8f88-409b-aa17-9dd6b1e77eff', NULL, 'Meridian Hospital', 'Meridian Hospital is a healthcare facility located in Texas, providing medical services to patients in the region. While specific details about the hospital''s mission, services, and patient care approach are limited on the page, the hospital likely offers a range of inpatient and outpatient services typical of a community hospital. Patients can expect standard medical care, emergency services, and support from a team of healthcare professionals.', '9430 Katy Fwy, Houston, TX 77055, USA', 'Houston', 'TX', '77055', '(832) 730-1370', ARRAY['English']::text[], 'Hospital', FALSE, '{"images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/meridian-hospital-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/meridian-hospital-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/meridian-hospital-google-3.webp"], "rating": 4.9, "reviews": [{"date": "2026-04-14T19:00:04.274768711Z", "text": "If you can go ANYWHERE else...please do. The staff in the pain management clinic at 9430 Katy fwy, are beyond unprofessional and unproductive! They DO NOT CARE if you are seen or if your medical needs are addressed.  I wish people with their attitude and outlook did not work in Healthcare. The Healthcare system is already hard enough to navigate but they make it 10 times worse.", "author": "Dominique Fisher", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117567308229670857806/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-04-22T16:44:35.510170Z", "text": "I have had 4 visits with Meridian Hospital. Each time has been wonderful. I have always been treated with respect and dignity, and made as comfortable as they could make me.\nFrom the calls to schedule my appointments, to checking in, being taken to my room and all of the staff keeping me updated and ensuring my procedures go smoothly and efficiently as well as the doctors coming in, going over everything they will be doing, the involvement of the staff is just wonderful.\nI have not had a bad visit. The hospital is clean, smells nice (as nice as any hospital can, let''s say smells clean) and the scheduling keeps it from being packed with too many people. It has always been quiet and a peaceful environment when I''ve gone.\nI love the communication i get from here. The scheduling, my time here and the follow-up calls after. Anytime I have a question they take care of it immediately.\nI drive 2 hours to get here, so I usually try to get scheduled as early as I can because we stay the night before and come for my procedures. Makes it a lot easier. They are very good at accommodating the times.\nI recommend Meridian Hospital. These are my experiences and I hope if I continue to have these visits, it will be here and the level of care I have seen remains.\nThank you Meridian Hospital staff for making my visits welcoming and stressless.", "author": "Clayton Cummings", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104224056737879454541/reviews"}, {"date": "2023-12-08T16:50:59.192242Z", "text": "Very very professional and nice and caring and respectful practice !! Never in my life have i had to have a procedure done till now . But this place made me feel comfortable and feel like im in good hands! The whole staff is excellent and professional, from the checkin ladies to the Dr, & , nurses!! Very clean and neat organized staff and facilities", "author": "F M", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101648306150336636558/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-07-08T16:46:03.866594753Z", "text": "The experience was thoroughly enjoyable and compassionate. The medical treatment was exceptional. I would like to express my sincere gratitude to the entire staff and the surgeons who performed the surgery on me. While I acknowledge that Dr. Alcaraz is a Chicago Cubs fan 🤣, I would like to tell him GO White Sox!!! . Overall, it was an extraordinary experience, and I am deeply appreciative of the efforts made by everyone involved. Thank you 😁", "author": "juan liscano", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111795306991341130780/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-08-22T21:12:34.349561465Z", "text": "Billing department has been ghosting me for 7 months for a detailed invoice that I paid money for already .\n\nTry calling their useless front desk and no one will ever respond to you from billing . Potential scam going on . Complaint already with Texas Attorney General.\n\nDO NOT PAY THEM . they will stall", "author": "S K", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113073609281758425134/reviews"}], "website": "https://www.meridianhospitaltx.com/", "location": {"latitude": 29.7852486, "longitude": -95.5250683}, "insurance": {"notes": null, "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": [], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": false}, "price_tier": "$$", "source_url": "https://www.meridianhospitaltx.com/", "appointment": {"booking_note": null, "appointment_url": null, "new_patient_note": null, "phone_booking_available": null, "online_booking_available": null, "free_consultation_available": null}, "open_sunday": false, "scout_query": "hospitals that speak Vietnamese in Houston, Texas", "search_text": "hospital | english", "google_types": ["hospital", "health", "point_of_interest", "service", "establishment"], "open_weekend": false, "rating_co