 could make me.\nFrom the calls to schedule my appointments, to checking in, being taken to my room and all of the staff keeping me updated and ensuring my procedures go smoothly and efficiently as well as the doctors coming in, going over everything they will be doing, the involvement of the staff is just wonderful.\nI have not had a bad visit. The hospital is clean, smells nice (as nice as any hospital can, let''s say smells clean) and the scheduling keeps it from being packed with too many people. It has always been quiet and a peaceful environment when I''ve gone.\nI love the communication i get from here. The scheduling, my time here and the follow-up calls after. Anytime I have a question they take care of it immediately.\nI drive 2 hours to get here, so I usually try to get scheduled as early as I can because we stay the night before and come for my procedures. Makes it a lot easier. They are very good at accommodating the times.\nI recommend Meridian Hospital. These are my experiences and I hope if I continue to have these visits, it will be here and the level of care I have seen remains.\nThank you Meridian Hospital staff for making my visits welcoming and stressless.", "author": "Clayton Cummings", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104224056737879454541/reviews"}, {"date": "2023-12-08T16:50:59.192242Z", "text": "Very very professional and nice and caring and respectful practice !! Never in my life have i had to have a procedure done till now . But this place made me feel comfortable and feel like im in good hands! The whole staff is excellent and professional, from the checkin ladies to the Dr, & , nurses!! Very clean and neat organized staff and facilities", "author": "F M", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101648306150336636558/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-07-08T16:46:03.866594753Z", "text": "The experience was thoroughly enjoyable and compassionate. The medical treatment was exceptional. I would like to express my sincere gratitude to the entire staff and the surgeons who performed the surgery on me. While I acknowledge that Dr. Alcaraz is a Chicago Cubs fan 🤣, I would like to tell him GO White Sox!!! . Overall, it was an extraordinary experience, and I am deeply appreciative of the efforts made by everyone involved. Thank you 😁", "author": "juan liscano", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111795306991341130780/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-08-22T21:12:34.349561465Z", "text": "Billing department has been ghosting me for 7 months for a detailed invoice that I paid money for already .\n\nTry calling their useless front desk and no one will ever respond to you from billing . Potential scam going on . Complaint already with Texas Attorney General.\n\nDO NOT PAY THEM . they will stall", "author": "S K", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113073609281758425134/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Meridian Hospital has a 4.9 star Google rating from 525 Google reviews. Patients commonly mention compassionate care, friendly staff, clear explanations, comfortable visits.", "about_highlight": "Meridian Hospital is a healthcare facility located in Texas, providing medical services to patients in the region. While specific details about the hospital''s mission, services, and patient care approach are limited on the page, the hospital likely offers a range of inpatient and outpatient services typical of a community hospital. Patients can expect standard medical care, emergency services, and support from a team of healthcare professionals.", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=11838870957824792057&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJtZ-Z2n7FQIYR-dXVPmkeTKQ", "quality_missing": ["services", "languages (non-default)", "insurance", "team_members", "appointment_url"], "search_keywords": ["hospital", "english"], "short_description": "Meridian Hospital provides medical services in Texas, offering inpatient and outpatient care.", "google_website_url": "https://www.meridianhospitaltx.com/", "google_primary_type": "Hospital", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": [], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "9430 Katy Fwy, Houston, TX 77055, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/100984664899130538988", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXdyX0NytI-5zpayX-96erffw5KqgITCdQH9g4OuxEVjttxW5wq=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "In k Kim"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/100984664899130538988", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXdyX0NytI-5zpayX-96erffw5KqgITCdQH9g4OuxEVjttxW5wq=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "In k Kim"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/100393049834609761824", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI1vYFOtnbV1Ferzy53OwtVlBolb3SPF74P8P-t1yGquAgmRw=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Meridian Hospital"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-25T13:53:54.257476+00:00', 'meridian-hospital', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('c408c549-ea51-4b62-86f9-30127f9bd05d', NULL, 'Dr. Wang, Acupuncture', 'NW Alternative Healing Center is an acupuncture, Tuina-QiGong, and Chinese herb clinic with locations in Seattle and Bellevue. The clinic accepts a wide range of insurance plans including Tricare, Medicare Advantage, and many private insurers. Patients are required to wear masks during treatment due to the pandemic.', '3316 NE 125th St, Seattle, WA 98125', 'Seattle', 'WA', '98125', '(206) 528-1038', ARRAY['English', 'Chinese']::text[], 'Acupuncture & TCM', FALSE, '{"images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/dr.-wang-acupuncture-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/dr.-wang-acupuncture-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/dr.-wang-acupuncture-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/dr.-wang-acupuncture-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/dr.-wang-acupuncture-google-5.webp"], "rating": 4.5, "reviews": [{"date": "2025-06-18T15:06:09.031050864Z", "text": "The entire experience was such a nightmare! I called to find out if they took my insurance, a 3rd party operator took my info & I got a call back a few days later. Within that time, I got the call from their office, but the caller I.D. says it''s from a dental clinic.\nThe young blonde office person mentioned that they''re able to take my insurance and I was able to come in to see the Dr., so I scheduled to see him.\nMoving forward to the day of, I couldn''t locate the building because the number of the building was blocked by cars parked in front, so I called for an actual location or some landmark. It was a challenge getting that part of the information, which took nearly 10 minutes until I found the building! Then after I got the treatment, scheduled for another treatment, and the young lady at front receptionist was SO unprofessional!\nFirst, she wasn''t informative about the insurance situation, then according to the Dr., she was going to be late for work, because of some excuse about the road, then she entirely misspelled my name to the insurance, AND she LATER made more mistakes by calling me after I have left, saying that my insurance doesn''t cover the treatment & I have to pay for the service, but I have to come by that second because she''s entitled having to leave no later than 1 PM!!\nShe demanded that I pay $150 for the treatment & HER error, while she''s \"sorry\" for the mistake she''s made, and yet I am responsible for her own mistakes, because she thought that my insurance covers the treatment. She had DAYS to check on the coverage, only to find out I was lied to. Almost like a \"switch bait\" trick. Very disappointed!", "author": "August Platform,LLC.", "rating": 3, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107262888068437595812/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-11-25T22:29:38.378752110Z", "text": "Dr Wang is the best!", "author": "Jodi White", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106615295808418570806/reviews"}], "website": "http://www.chineseacupuncture.com/", "location": {"latitude": 47.7194218, "longitude": -122.2919136}, "services": ["Acupuncture", "Tuina-QiGong", "Chinese Herbal Medicine"], "insurance": {"notes": "Accepts Tricare, Medicare Advantage, and many private plans.", "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": true, "accepted_networks": ["Auto Insurance", "Aetna", "Ambetter", "Blue Cross Blue Shield", "First Choice", "Kaiser Permanente", "Lifewise", "Humana", "Medicare", "Premera", "Regence", "TRICARE", "UnitedHealthcare"], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": true}, "highlights": [{"title": "Accepts Tricare Insurance", "detail": "Tricare now covers acupuncture for veterans and their dependents at no cost to the patient.", "category": "insurance"}, {"title": "Locations in Seattle and Bellevue", "detail": "Two convenient locations in the Seattle area.", "category": "convenience"}, {"title": "Acupuncture, Tuina-QiGong, and Chinese Herbs", "detail": "Comprehensive traditional Chinese medicine services.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Accepts Multiple Insurance Plans", "detail": "Accepts a variety of insurance plans including Aetna, Blue Cross/Blue Shield, Kaiser, Premera, Regence, United Healthcare, and more.", "category": "insurance"}], "price_tier": "$$", "source_url": "http://www.chineseacupuncture.com/", "appointment": {"booking_note": "To schedule an appointment, click on ''Schedule Book'' and then click the ''Book Now'' button.", "appointment_url": null, "new_patient_note": null, "phone_booking_available": null, "online_booking_available": true, "free_consultation_available": null}, "open_sunday": false, "scout_query": "Chinese medical clinic in Seattle", "search_text": "acupuncture & tcm | acupuncture | chinese medicine | tcm | herbal medicine | cupping | pain relief | châm cứu | đông y | y học cổ truyền | 한의원 | 침술 | 한약 | 中医 | 针灸 | 中药 | english | chinese | mandarin | cantonese | 中文 | 普通话 | 国语 | 粤语 | 广东话 | 华人 | tuina-qigong | chinese herbal medicine | therapy | auto insurance | aetna | ambetter | blue cross blue shield | first choice | kaiser permanente | lifewise | humana | medicare | premera | regence | tricare | unitedhealthcare", "google_types": ["doctor", "medical_clinic", "health", "point_of_interest", "service", "establishment"], "open_weekend": false, "rating_count": 4, "language_note": "Chinese medicine clinic offering traditional acupuncture, Tuina massage, and herbal remedies.", "open_saturday": false, "quality_score": 95, "working_hours": {"friday": "Closed", "monday": "Closed", "sunday": "Closed", "tuesday": "8:45 AM – 5:45 PM", "saturday": "Closed", "thursday": "9:00 AM – 5:30 PM", "wednesday": "Closed"}, "gallery_images": ["http://www.chineseacupuncture.com/images/188_IMG_4917.JPG"], "review_profile": {"rating": 4.5, "source": "google", "themes": [{"theme": "Staff Professionalism", "mentions": 1, "sentiment": "Negative", "summary_quote": "One reviewer described the front receptionist as ''SO unprofessional'' and lacking in information about insurance."}, {"theme": "Clinical Expertise", "mentions": 1, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "One reviewer enthusiastically stated, ''Dr Wang is the best!''"}, {"theme": "Administrative Processes", "mentions": 1, "sentiment": "Negative", "summary_quote": "A reviewer reported difficulties with scheduling and insurance verification, calling the experience ''a nightmare.''"}, {"theme": "Facility Environment", "mentions": 1, "sentiment": "Negative", "summary_quote": "One reviewer had trouble locating the building due to obscured signage and poor directions."}, {"theme": "Communication", "mentions": 1, "sentiment": "Negative", "summary_quote": "A reviewer mentioned challenges in getting clear information about the clinic''s location and insurance details."}], "summary": "Reviews for Dr. Wang, Acupuncture are mixed, with some patients praising the doctor''s expertise while others report significant issues with administrative processes and professionalism.", "review_count": 4, "concern_themes": [], "positive_themes": [], "featured_reviews": [{"date": "2025-06-18T15:06:09.031050864Z", "text": "The entire experience was such a nightmare! I called to find out if they took my insurance, a 3rd party operator took my info & I got a call back a few days later. Within that time, I got the call from their office, but the caller I.D. says it''s from a dental clinic.\nThe young blonde office person mentioned that they''re able to take my insurance and I was able to come in to see the Dr., so I scheduled to see him.\nMoving forward to the day of, I couldn''t locate the building because the number of the building was blocked by cars parked in front, so I called for an actual location or some landmark. It was a challenge getting that part of the information, which took nearly 10 minutes until I found the building! Then after I got the treatment, scheduled for another treatment, and the young lady at front receptionist was SO unprofessional!\nFirst, she wasn''t informative about the insurance situation, then according to the Dr., she was going to be late for work, because of some excuse about the road, then she entirely misspelled my name to the insurance, AND she LATER made more mistakes by calling me after I have left, saying that my insurance doesn''t cover the treatment & I have to pay for the service, but I have to come by that second because she''s entitled having to leave no later than 1 PM!!\nShe demanded that I pay $150 for the treatment & HER error, while she''s \"sorry\" for the mistake she''s made, and yet I am responsible for her own mistakes, because she thought that my insurance covers the treatment. She had DAYS to check on the coverage, only to find out I was lied to. Almost like a \"switch bait\" trick. Very disappointed!", "author": "August Platform,LLC.", "rating": 3, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107262888068437595812/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-11-25T22:29:38.378752110Z", "text": "Dr Wang is the best!", "author": "Jodi White", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106615295808418570806/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Reviews for Dr. Wang, Acupuncture are mixed, with some patients praising the doctor''s expertise while others report significant issues with administrative processes and professionalism.", "about_highlight": "NW Alternative Healing Center is an acupuncture, Tuina-QiGong, and Chinese herb clinic with locations in Seattle and Bellevue. The clinic accepts a wide range of insurance plans including Tricare, Medicare Advantage, and many private insurers. Patients are required to wear masks during treatment due to the pandemic.", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=15004148417794058411&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJR1AomXwRkFQRq6jal31xOdA", "quality_missing": ["team_members", "appointment_url"], "search_keywords": ["acupuncture & tcm", "acupuncture", "chinese medicine", "tcm", "herbal medicine", "cupping", "pain relief", "châm cứu", "đông y", "y học cổ truyền", "한의원", "침술", "한약", "中医", "针灸", "中药", "english", "chinese", "mandarin", "cantonese", "中文", "普通话", "国语", "粤语", "广东话", "华人", "tuina-qigong", "chinese herbal medicine", "therapy", "auto insurance", "aetna", "ambetter", "blue cross blue shield", "first choice", "kaiser permanente", "lifewise", "humana", "medicare", "premera", "regence", "tricare", "unitedhealthcare"], "cultural_context": "Chinese medicine clinic offering traditional acupuncture, Tuina massage, and herbal remedies.", "services_offered": [{"name": "Acupuncture", "category": "Acupuncture", "description": "Traditional Chinese acupuncture treatment.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Tuina-QiGong", "category": "Therapy", "description": "Chinese therapeutic massage and energy work.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Chinese Herbal Medicine", "category": "Herbal Medicine", "description": "Custom herbal formulas.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}], "short_description": "Acupuncture, Tuina-QiGong, and Chinese herb clinic serving Seattle and Bellevue.", "google_website_url": "http://www.chineseacupuncture.com/", "insurance_accepted": ["Auto Insurance", "Aetna", "Ambetter", "Blue Cross Blue Shield", "First Choice", "Kaiser Permanente", "Lifewise", "Humana", "Medicare", "Premera", "Regence", "TRICARE", "UnitedHealthcare"], "google_primary_type": "Health", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": [], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "3316 NE 125th St, Seattle, WA 98125, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/100191307370071050867", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW1zRFm1fmJnkX1JMLMjMJ0hNh-9Xq-EOPSWYz-IeBEvUdt5B9O=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Dr. Wang, Acupuncture"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/100191307370071050867", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW1zRFm1fmJnkX1JMLMjMJ0hNh-9Xq-EOPSWYz-IeBEvUdt5B9O=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Dr. Wang, Acupuncture"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/100191307370071050867", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW1zRFm1fmJnkX1JMLMjMJ0hNh-9Xq-EOPSWYz-IeBEvUdt5B9O=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Dr. Wang, Acupuncture"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/100191307370071050867", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW1zRFm1fmJnkX1JMLMjMJ0hNh-9Xq-EOPSWYz-IeBEvUdt5B9O=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Dr. Wang, Acupuncture"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/100191307370071050867", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW1zRFm1fmJnkX1JMLMjMJ0hNh-9Xq-EOPSWYz-IeBEvUdt5B9O=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Dr. Wang, Acupuncture"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-25T19:47:26.585743+00:00', 'dr-wang-acupuncture', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('a1d85dfb-f3fb-4b24-8735-463e90259016', NULL, 'NYC Health + Hospitals/Bellevue', 'NYC Health + Hospitals/Bellevue is the oldest hospital in America, tracing its roots back to 1736 when a six-bed infirmary opened on the second floor of the New York City Almshouse. Today, it operates 1,215 beds and provides essential inpatient, outpatient, and home-based services to more than one million New Yorkers every year across more than 70 locations. Recognized as an LGBTQ+ Healthcare Equality Leader, a U.S. News & World Report Best Hospital, and a Get With the Guidelines award winner for stroke, heart attack, and heart failure care, Bellevue offers a comprehensive range of specialty services including stroke, behavioral health, emergency/trauma, heart health, ambulatory care, and same-day surgery.', '462 First Avenue', 'New York', 'NY', '10016', '1-212-562-1000', ARRAY['English', 'Vietnamese']::text[], 'Hospital', TRUE, '{"images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/nyc-health-hospitalsbellevue-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/nyc-health-hospitalsbellevue-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/nyc-health-hospitalsbellevue-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/nyc-health-hospitalsbellevue-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/nyc-health-hospitalsbellevue-google-5.webp"], "rating": 4.4, "reviews": [{"date": "2026-05-18T22:53:37.675616810Z", "text": "My visit today was amazing. 7am staff called to confirm my appointment. I explained I forgot to order my can right away she assisted. I received my ride to and from hospital. The staff at front desk know my name that feels so good and was very attentive\nTriage always are polite and patient and just adds to making a great day right before seeing the Dr. you can ask questions they always make sure I show and speak to Dr so I can get updated that Dr can advise me about my concerns.\nNow to mention My Dr. Ana Absolutely Amazing Caring great listener Attentive and Supportive\nWalks me though options and when I leave I feel great that she cares\nSo Thxs to Bellevue for having a great staff of service that supports a patient that needs so many services all of this is so important how they speak and treat me", "author": "Latonia Greene", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107637236324100862277/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-04-21T10:40:39.767696948Z", "text": "When I went there, the people were very nice, very quick. There was no time that was wasted. Everything happened so quickly every area that I went to it was on time. Everybody was willing to help everybody spoke to where you could understand it. You didn''t need no issues. You didn''t need extra people to guide you wrong.  And the experience was great. It wasn''t bad, wasn''t like other hospitals where you''re waiting for 2 to 3  hours just to see somebody when you''re on an appointment, when the appointment says they were even earlier to answer me when I got there early and not late and they were really, really great.", "author": "Jamie Sheller", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118438870391738985730/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-04-26T04:47:54.523588249Z", "text": "This is absolutely the worst hospital I’ve ever been to in my life! The doctors and nurses have terrible service attitudes and are very uncooperative in communication. Medical efficiency is abysmally low. I was forced to wait for over ten hours. Even when there were no other patients left, we were still made to wait endlessly. No one informed us how long we would have to wait, and patients couldn’t even eat properly. The staff completely ignore patients’ needs, with slow, sluggish and inefficient work. It’s nothing but a waste of money and sheer torture.", "author": "Snacky Cai", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110301366811962845329/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-21T07:36:34.040825691Z", "text": "This time I visited Bellevue hospital because I needed to make sure how I was doing with ITU symptoms. I finished my 2nd treatment and days later I was uncomfortable. Taking good advantage my son went to see his dad, after few trips back and forth I was able to show up. After I was seeing by doctor then nurse, it was okay,  that nurse was a male named Marco in E.R., he''s 👍 good!. After 2 hours I was starving and feeling dizzy. I asked a volunteer guy for a vending machine,  instead he offered me some foods, Another nurse refused that offer, then nurse Marco came in with kindness gave me a sandwich 🥪, .\n\nDiabetes patients should be treated kindly,  all patients deserve it but Diabetes patients are more delicated. 1st and 2nd doctors I saw, they were good 👍. But that nurse who refused to assist me, God have mercy on him, people are heart hardened and heartless.\n\nNow for that nurse Marco, I wish all blessings 🙌 🙏 ❤️ , now and always. He should be head of all nurses. His performance was outstanding, it was great,  it was excellent, it was good 👍 👏.", "author": "Raphael Moreno", "rating": 4, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105832473041788246993/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-06-13T01:26:08.902481306Z", "text": "I''ve been visiting a family member at Bellevue Hospital and it was a difficult experience made worse by the rigidity of visiting hours and many staff who seemed indifferent to visitors already dealing with a stressful situation. The one exception was the ICU team, who were professional, attentive and compassionate throughout. The contrast was stark, and I hope the hospital can bring that same level of care and courtesy to its front-line staff.", "author": "Nikhat Anjum", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117761611461374255759/reviews"}], "website": "http://www.nychealthandhospitals.org/bellevue/", "location": {"latitude": 40.7396865, "longitude": -73.9762044}, "services": ["Stroke Center", "Behavioral Health Services", "Emergency Services", "Heart Health Program", "Ambulatory Care", "Same Day Surgery", "Primary and Preventive Care", "Virtual Care"], "insurance": {"notes": "Insurance information not specified on the Bellevue page. The system offers a Health Insurance Search tool and Financial Assistance program for those who need help paying for care.", "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": [], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": false}, "highlights": [{"title": "Oldest Hospital in America", "detail": "Founded in 1736, the hospital''s history spans nearly 300 years of service to New York City.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "LGBTQ+ Healthcare Equality Leader", "detail": "Recognized by the Human Rights Campaign Foundation for equitable care.", "category": "culture"}, {"title": "U.S. News & World Report Best Hospital", "detail": "Awarded 2024-2025 Best Hospitals, High Performing for Heart Attack and Heart Failure, and Maternity care.", "category": "reviews"}, {"title": "Get With The Guidelines® Awards", "detail": "Received Gold Plus awards for Coronary Artery Disease, Stroke, Heart Failure, and Resuscitation.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Comprehensive Specialty Services", "detail": "Home to a Stroke Center, Behavioral Health, Emergency/Trauma, Heart Health, and Same Day Surgery.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Health Equity Fellowship", "detail": "Three physicians selected for health equity fellowship by the United Hospital Fund.", "category": "care"}], "price_tier": "$$", "source_url": "http://www.nychealthandhospitals.org/bellevue/", "appointment": {"booking_note": null, "appointment_url": "http://www.nychealthandhospitals.org/make-an-appointment/", "new_patient_note": null, "phone_booking_available": true, "online_booking_available": true, "free_consultation_available": null}, "open_sunday": true, "scout_query": "Vietnamese speaking hospital in New York, NY", "search_text": "hospital | english | vietnamese | tiếng việt | người việt | bác sĩ việt | stroke center | behavioral health services | emergency services | heart health program | ambulatory care | same day surgery | primary and preventive care | virtual care | emergency | mental health | cardiology | primary care | surgery | telehealth", "google_types": ["hospital", "health", "point_of_interest", "service", "establishment"], "open_weekend": true, "rating_count": 5753, "language_note": "Bellevue hosts a Asian American, Native Hawaiian, and Pacific Islander Heritage Month celebration highlighting unity, culture, and community partnership. The hospital provides interpreter services and a Language Assistance program, and has a dedicated WTC Environmental Health Center.", "open_saturday": true, "quality_score": 92, "working_hours": {"friday": "Open 24 hours", "monday": "Open 24 hours", "sunday": "Open 24 hours", "tuesday": "Open 24 hours", "saturday": "Open 24 hours", "thursday": "Open 24 hours", "wednesday": "Open 24 hours"}, "review_profile": {"rating": 4.4, "source": "google", "themes": [{"theme": "Staff Professionalism", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Multiple reviewers praise the staff for being attentive, caring, and supportive, with specific mentions of doctors and nurses going above and beyond."}, {"theme": "Communication", "mentions": 2, "sentiment": "Negative", "summary_quote": "Some patients report uncooperative communication and lack of updates on wait times, leading to frustration."}, {"theme": "Wait Times", "mentions": 2, "sentiment": "Negative", "summary_quote": "Several reviews highlight excessively long wait times, with one patient waiting over ten hours without proper updates."}, {"theme": "Facility Environment", "mentions": 1, "sentiment": "Neutral", "summary_quote": "One reviewer notes the stark contrast between the ICU team''s professionalism and the indifference of front-line staff."}, {"theme": "Treatment Outcomes", "mentions": 1, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "A patient expresses satisfaction with their doctor''s attentive care and thorough explanation of treatment options."}], "summary": "Overall, patients report a mix of highly positive experiences with attentive, caring staff and efficient service, alongside some negative experiences highlighting long wait times and uncooperative communication.", "review_count": 5753, "concern_themes": [], "positive_themes": [], "featured_reviews": [{"date": "2026-05-18T22:53:37.675616810Z", "text": "My visit today was amazing. 7am staff called to confirm my appointment. I explained I forgot to order my can right away she assisted. I received my ride to and from hospital. The staff at front desk know my name that feels so good and was very attentive\nTriage always are polite and patient and just adds to making a great day right before seeing the Dr. you can ask questions they always make sure I show and speak to Dr so I can get updated that Dr can advise me about my concerns.\nNow to mention My Dr. Ana Absolutely Amazing Caring great listener Attentive and Supportive\nWalks me though options and when I leave I feel great that she cares\nSo Thxs to Bellevue for having a great staff of service that supports a patient that needs so many services all of this is so important how they speak and treat me", "author": "Latonia Greene", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107637236324100862277/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-04-21T10:40:39.767696948Z", "text": "When I went there, the people were very nice, very quick. There was no time that was wasted. Everything happened so quickly every area that I went to it was on time. Everybody was willing to help everybody spoke to where you could understand it. You didn''t need no issues. You didn''t need extra people to guide you wrong.  And the experience was great. It wasn''t bad, wasn''t like other hospitals where you''re waiting for 2 to 3  hours just to see somebody when you''re on an appointment, when the appointment says they were even earlier to answer me when I got there early and not late and they were really, really great.", "author": "Jamie Sheller", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118438870391738985730/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-04-26T04:47:54.523588249Z", "text": "This is absolutely the worst hospital I’ve ever been to in my life! The doctors and nurses have terrible service attitudes and are very uncooperative in communication. Medical efficiency is abysmally low. I was forced to wait for over ten hours. Even when there were no other patients left, we were still made to wait endlessly. No one informed us how long we would have to wait, and patients couldn’t even eat properly. The staff completely ignore patients’ needs, with slow, sluggish and inefficient work. It’s nothing but a waste of money and sheer torture.", "author": "Snacky Cai", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110301366811962845329/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-21T07:36:34.040825691Z", "text": "This time I visited Bellevue hospital because I needed to make sure how I was doing with ITU symptoms. I finished my 2nd treatment and days later I was uncomfortable. Taking good advantage my son went to see his dad, after few trips back and forth I was able to show up. After I was seeing by doctor then nurse, it was okay,  that nurse was a male named Marco in E.R., he''s 👍 good!. After 2 hours I was starving and feeling dizzy. I asked a volunteer guy for a vending machine,  instead he offered me some foods, Another nurse refused that offer, then nurse Marco came in with kindness gave me a sandwich 🥪, .\n\nDiabetes patients should be treated kindly,  all patients deserve it but Diabetes patients are more delicated. 1st and 2nd doctors I saw, they were good 👍. But that nurse who refused to assist me, God have mercy on him, people are heart hardened and heartless.\n\nNow for that nurse Marco, I wish all blessings 🙌 🙏 ❤️ , now and always. He should be head of all nurses. His performance was outstanding, it was great,  it was excellent, it was good 👍 👏.", "author": "Raphael Moreno", "rating": 4, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105832473041788246993/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-06-13T01:26:08.902481306Z", "text": "I''ve been visiting a family member at Bellevue Hospital and it was a difficult experience made worse by the rigidity of visiting hours and many staff who seemed indifferent to visitors already dealing with a stressful situation. The one exception was the ICU team, who were professional, attentive and compassionate throughout. The contrast was stark, and I hope the hospital can bring that same level of care and courtesy to its front-line staff.", "author": "Nikhat Anjum", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117761611461374255759/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Overall, patients report a mix of highly positive experiences with attentive, caring staff and efficient service, alongside some negative experiences highlighting long wait times and uncooperative communication.", "about_highlight": "NYC Health + Hospitals/Bellevue is the oldest hospital in America, tracing its roots back to 1736 when a six-bed infirmary opened on the second floor of the New York City Almshouse. Today, it operates 1,215 beds and provides essential inpatient, outpatient, and home-based services to more than one million New Yorkers every year across more than 70 locations. Recognized as an LGBTQ+ Healthcare Equality Leader, a U.S. News & World Report Best Hospital, and a Get With the Guidelines award winner for stroke, heart attack, and heart failure care, Bellevue offers a comprehensive range of specialty services including stroke, behavioral health, emergency/trauma, heart health, ambulatory care, and same-day surgery.", "appointment_url": "http://www.nychealthandhospitals.org/make-an-appointment/", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=7467693700886689760&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJqccvIQxZwokR4PfF_NqTomc", "quality_missing": ["insurance", "team_members"], "search_keywords": ["hospital", "english", "vietnamese", "tiếng việt", "người việt", "bác sĩ việt", "stroke center", "behavioral health services", "emergency services", "heart health program", "ambulatory care", "same day surgery", "primary and preventive care", "virtual care", "emergency", "mental health", "cardiology", "primary care", "surgery", "telehealth"], "cultural_context": "Bellevue hosts a Asian American, Native Hawaiian, and Pacific Islander Heritage Month celebration highlighting unity, culture, and community partnership. The hospital provides interpreter services and a Language Assistance program, and has a dedicated WTC Environmental Health Center.", "services_offered": [{"name": "Stroke Center", "category": "Emergency", "description": "Comprehensive stroke prevention and care center.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Behavioral Health Services", "category": "Mental Health", "description": "Mental health and substance use services.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Emergency Services", "category": "Emergency", "description": "Emergency and trauma care for adults and children.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Heart Health Program", "category": "Cardiology", "description": "Cardiology and cardiothoracic care including transcatheter aortic valve replacement (TAVR).", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Ambulatory Care", "category": "Primary Care", "description": "Adult primary and preventive care services.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Same Day Surgery", "category": "Surgery", "description": "Same-day surgical procedures across multiple specialties.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Primary and Preventive Care", "category": "Primary Care", "description": "General primary care and preventive health services. Referral required for specialty clinics.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Virtual Care", "category": "Telehealth", "description": "Virtual urgent and primary care services via video.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}], "short_description": "America''s oldest public hospital, offering comprehensive medical, surgical, and specialty care across more than 70 locations in New York City''s five boroughs.", "google_website_url": "http://www.nychealthandhospitals.org/bellevue/", "google_primary_type": "Hospital", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": [], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "462 1st Ave, New York, NY 10016, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/109266940926613277193", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWro1d5jLX5jdumD8YkKwEwLz8WfAOZRB0JrX_g3_S6H25FgcuV=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Tommaso Giunchi"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/101227186954904662628", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX77s8YhjFdJ7pntVaH2SvTNT_1MWeQ0hiwHO6O1-fN_PNxuQbP=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "chi zhang"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/101140409814028774850", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVYo32eG_VqzxV7BnxMrPW8jO7zxUadd9p6SnOVVls5B_tapIRmzQ=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Lic. Horus Ruiseco Jacobo"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/111444671146808251214", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJvMTFe-XnhkXFW5VFNZ4ngdUxvt3s3uBD8Mhqr_jMQlLXzZQ=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Eric Finkelstein"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/101140409814028774850", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVYo32eG_VqzxV7BnxMrPW8jO7zxUadd9p6SnOVVls5B_tapIRmzQ=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Lic. Horus Ruiseco Jacobo"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-25T19:59:56.136781+00:00', 'nyc-health-hospitalsbellevue', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('54531e8f-5b2c-4cff-86d5-52d7b72cfa4d', NULL, 'NYU Langone Health', 'NYU Langone Health is a world-class academic medical center offering comprehensive care across all specialty areas. With over 6,000 providers, the institution provides expert medical services ranging from primary care to highly specialized treatments in cancer, heart, orthopedics, neurology, and pediatrics. Patients benefit from a network of hospitals and outpatient locations throughout the New York City area, Florida, and beyond, with convenient access to same-day care options including virtual urgent care, urgent care centers, and emergency services.
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('71481c29-778b-4951-b84a-90cd7e42b4dc', NULL, 'NYC Health + Hospitals/Gotham Health, Gouverneur', 'Get the high quality and affordable health services you and every member of your family need without having to leave your neighborhood. Our dedicated team provides coordinated care using the best clinical practices and tools to manage your health. Our staff are available on evenings and weekends so you can get care when it fits your schedule. And we can connect you with a doctor by phone at any time, day or night. Our goal is to help you live the healthiest life possible and to build healthy neighborhoods.', '227 Madison Street', 'New York', 'NY', '10002', '1-844-692-4692', ARRAY['English', 'Vietnamese']::text[], 'Community Health Center', TRUE, '{"images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/nyc-health-hospitalsgotham-health-gouverneur-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/nyc-health-hospitalsgotham-health-gouverneur-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/nyc-health-hospitalsgotham-health-gouverneur-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/nyc-health-hospitalsgotham-health-gouverneur-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/nyc-health-hospitalsgotham-health-gouverneur-google-5.webp"], "rating": 3.7, "reviews": [{"date": "2026-02-12T02:01:39.194904544Z", "text": "I went in for a dental appointment on 02/5/26. It had been quite a while since I had been to the dentist due to other persistent health issues. For starters, Dr.Kathy Yeung is polite. After speaking with Dr. Yeung, I was directed across the hall to the Hygienist. This is where the torture chamber began.\n\nThe Hygienist (whose name I can''t remember), does NOT have adequate communication skills, or good bed side manner. I walked in cordial and polite. He said hello and wasn''t conversational AT ALL about what he was doing or why he was doing it. The Hygienist was going beneath my gumline to clean, and it literally felt like he was striking my gum with a sharp instrument repeatedly in complete silence. I stopped him. Spat blood, and asked what he was doing. He only said, \"You have alot of calcium.\" Then he continued in silence going back to the same area scraping. The pain was sharp and excruciating!! My reflexes slapped his hand away from my mouth! He replied, \"You can''t slap my hand like that.\" Even though he was ignoring my pain.\n\nI spat in the sink, and once again it was blood. Only THEN did he explain what he was doing and said \"you can schedule a deep clean and numbing for that.\" So he KNOWS what he was doing was notoriously painful, yet he continued on. He started a third time on my lower teeth. I felt his hand slip into my gum again. Sharp and PAINFUL. Blood. Again. That''s when I jumped up and said, \"I want to speak to my Dentist! I want someone else to do this.\"\n\nI went directly to Dr. Yeung and explained exactly what was happening with the Hygienist. She listened and further explained my Xrays. But I was still adamant about seeing another hygienist. The PROBLEM with the Hygienist was that he was NOT treating me like a *human being*. Anyone with sharp tools in your mouth scraping can be extremely painful. And it WAS. Instead of him checking in with me, adjusting, or informing me on what he was doing and why, he sat there continuously scraping even though he knew I was in pain. He did it THREE TIMES. I had to STOP him 3 times. And he acted irritated that I had to stop him. From the very beginning, he should have EXPLAINED everything! Instead he sat in silence ignoring my pain. And I don''t care if he has worked at Gouverneurs for a long time. It''s possible that patients just don''t complain about his work.\n\nAs I was walking back towards the room, he requested to Dr. Yeung that I see another provider. Thank God we were on the same page about THAT!!!! I had already told him I wanted someone else ANYWAY.\n\nI was then placed with Hygienist Ashley Hui Huang. She was great! She listened, was polite, informative, respectful and checked in with me as she cleaned my teeth. I wasn''t squirming in pain while in the chair. She did all of what the other Hygienist DIDN''T do. That''s exactly how I knew I made the RIGHT decision to seek another hygienist instead of the first one. If a patient is in pain, you don''t keep doing what you''re doing ignoring them and acting like they are a nuisance to you.\n\nHe was essentially attempting to do some scaling without NUMBING me. He knew exactly what he was doing which is why he suggested scheduling a \"deep cleaning\" where I would be numbed! Because, that''s what USUALLY happens when cleaning is happening beneath the gum line because it extremely painful. I am DEFINITELY reporting this incident to higher entities. I also will not be returning to this hospital for care. There''s some other things that were deeply disturbing during my visit.", "author": "F A", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102250824278644152877/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-10-29T15:43:03.280867212Z", "text": "227 Madison\nABSOLUTELY SHOCKING CONDUCT from Head Nurse - Door Slammed in My Face.\n\nI had a deeply unsettling and unprofessional experience on the 7th Floor. I approached the Head Nurse, Ms. Joseph, at the nurse''s station with a simple, respectful question regarding the person I was visiting.\n\nThe Head Nurse responded with an immediate and hostile display of impatience. They didn''t even allow me to finish my sentence before barking, \"I''m busy,\" and slammed the office door shut right in my face.\nThis aggressive and completely unacceptable behavior is a massive failure in professionalism and human decency, especially from someone in a leadership role in patient care. Visitors should not be treated with such contempt. The nurse''s hostile reaction speaks volumes about the unit''s culture. Management needs to address this specific incident immediately. I am truly shocked by this lack of respect.\n\nThe facility and employees were very nice. She was the only one that was unprofessional.", "author": "Desery Martinez", "rating": 2, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116383478173168983496/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-01-05T21:33:16.515262150Z", "text": "This place is a rat hole. The staff on the 7 floor are horrible. My elderly mother was there and she suffered greatly. They never answered the call bell. They disconnected the bell and she developed a horrible bed sore. Stay away it’s horrible", "author": "Joann Ramos", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104138154177573182235/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-13T14:44:24.476650289Z", "text": "THIS IS THE WORST PLACE IN iTHE WORLD. NOBODY DOES THEIR JOB OR KNOW ANYTHING. DO NOT COME HERE. I ONLY HIT ONE STAR BECAUSE IT WOULDNT LET ME POST WITHOUT A SELECTION OTHER THAN THAT THIS PLACE SHOULD BE INSPECTED AND CLOSED FOR GOOD.", "author": "Nicole Williams", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113455046278674750802/reviews"}, {"date": "2021-12-19T15:53:30.285482Z", "text": "Was fourth in line at 9am for COVID testing. Still waiting an hour later - the woman controlling the line is skipping people ahead at her discretion.\n\nEmpty testing booths, while everybody waits in this bureaucratic mess!\n\n12/19 update: New person/black male managing the line - I  got in line at 8:45am and was tested and on my way at 9:02am. There was no line skippery and everything was efficient!\n\n4 stars because I wish they offered longer hours!", "author": "Ashleigh Batton", "rating": 4, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109280033977517706201/reviews"}], "website": "https://www.nychealthandhospitals.org/locations/gotham-health-gouverneur/", "location": {"latitude": 40.713208, "longitude": -73.987787}, "services": ["Adult Medicine", "Behavioral Health", "Dental Care", "Eye Care", "HIV Center", "Pediatrics", "Podiatry", "The Pride Health Center at NYC Health + Hospitals/Gotham Health, Gouverneur", "Radiology", "Women’s Health", "World Trade Center Environmental Health Center"], "insurance": {"notes": null, "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": [], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": false}, "highlights": [{"title": "LGBTQ+ Healthcare Equality Leader", "detail": "Designated as an LGBTQ+ Healthcare Equality Leader by the Human Rights Campaign Foundation.", "category": "culture"}, {"title": "Evening and Weekend Hours", "detail": "Open evenings and weekends to fit your schedule.", "category": "convenience"}, {"title": "Patient-Centered Medical Home", "detail": "NCQA Recognized NYS Patient-Centered Medical Home.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Coordinated Care", "detail": "Dedicated team using best clinical practices and tools to manage your health.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "24/7 Phone Access to a Doctor", "detail": "Connect with a doctor by phone at any time, day or night.", "category": "access"}, {"title": "Affordable Care", "detail": "Part of Gotham Health, one of the largest FQHC networks in the country, providing affordable services.", "category": "insurance"}], "price_tier": "$", "source_url": "https://www.nychealthandhospitals.org/locations/gotham-health-gouverneur/", "appointment": {"booking_note": "Call 1-844-692-4692 or book online.", "appointment_url": "https://www.nychealthandhospitals.org/make-an-appointment/", "new_patient_note": null, "phone_booking_available": true, "online_booking_available": true, "free_consultation_available": null}, "open_sunday": false, "scout_query": "Vietnamese speaking hospital in New York, NY", "search_text": "community health center | community health | fqhc | sliding scale | medicaid | medicare | low cost | trung tâm y tế cộng đồng | 커뮤니티 헬스 | 社区医疗中心 | english | vietnamese | tiếng việt | người việt | bác sĩ việt | adult medicine | behavioral health | dental care | eye care | hiv center | pediatrics | podiatry | the pride health center at nyc health + hospitals/gotham health, gouverneur | radiology | women’s health | world trade center environmental health center | primary care | mental health | dental | vision | hiv/aids | lgbtq+ | imaging | ob/gyn | environmental health", "google_types": ["medical_center", "medical_clinic", "hospital", "doctor", "government_office", "health", "finance", "point_of_interest", "service", "establishment"], "open_weekend": true, "rating_count": 328, "open_saturday": true, "quality_score": 92, "working_hours": {"friday": "8:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "monday": "8:00 AM – 7:00 PM", "sunday": "Closed", "tuesday": "8:00 AM – 7:00 PM", "saturday": "8:00 AM – 4:30 PM", "thursday": "8:00 AM – 7:00 PM", "wednesday": "8:00 AM – 5:00 PM"}, "review_profile": {"rating": 3.7, "source": "google", "themes": [{"theme": "Compassionate care", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients highlight compassionate care in their feedback."}, {"theme": "Friendly staff", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients highlight friendly staff in their feedback."}, {"theme": "Clear explanations", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients highlight clear explanations in their feedback."}], "summary": "NYC Health + Hospitals/Gotham Health, Gouverneur has a 3.7 star Google rating from 328 Google reviews. Patients commonly mention compassionate care, friendly staff, clear explanations.", "review_count": 328, "concern_themes": [], "positive_themes": [], "featured_reviews": [{"date": "2026-02-12T02:01:39.194904544Z", "text": "I went in for a dental appointment on 02/5/26. It had been quite a while since I had been to the dentist due to other persistent health issues. For starters, Dr.Kathy Yeung is polite. After speaking with Dr. Yeung, I was directed across the hall to the Hygienist. This is where the torture chamber began.\n\nThe Hygienist (whose name I can''t remember), does NOT have adequate communication skills, or good bed side manner. I walked in cordial and polite. He said hello and wasn''t conversational AT ALL about what he was doing or why he was doing it. The Hygienist was going beneath my gumline to clean, and it literally felt like he was striking my gum with a sharp instrument repeatedly in complete silence. I stopped him. Spat blood, and asked what he was doing. He only said, \"You have alot of calcium.\" Then he continued in silence going back to the same area scraping. The pain was sharp and excruciating!! My reflexes slapped his hand away from my mouth! He replied, \"You can''t slap my hand like that.\" Even though he was ignoring my pain.\n\nI spat in the sink, and once again it was blood. Only THEN did he explain what he was doing and said \"you can schedule a deep clean and numbing for that.\" So he KNOWS what he was doing was notoriously painful, yet he continued on. He started a third time on my lower teeth. I felt his hand slip into my gum again. Sharp and PAINFUL. Blood. Again. That''s when I jumped up and said, \"I want to speak to my Dentist! I want someone else to do this.\"\n\nI went directly to Dr. Yeung and explained exactly what was happening with the Hygienist. She listened and further explained my Xrays. But I was still adamant about seeing another hygienist. The PROBLEM with the Hygienist was that he was NOT treating me like a *human being*. Anyone with sharp tools in your mouth scraping can be extremely painful. And it WAS. Instead of him checking in with me, adjusting, or informing me on what he was doing and why, he sat there continuously scraping even though he knew I was in pain. He did it THREE TIMES. I had to STOP him 3 times. And he acted irritated that I had to stop him. From the very beginning, he should have EXPLAINED everything! Instead he sat in silence ignoring my pain. And I don''t care if he has worked at Gouverneurs for a long time. It''s possible that patients just don''t complain about his work.\n\nAs I was walking back towards the room, he requested to Dr. Yeung that I see another provider. Thank God we were on the same page about THAT!!!! I had already told him I wanted someone else ANYWAY.\n\nI was then placed with Hygienist Ashley Hui Huang. She was great! She listened, was polite, informative, respectful and checked in with me as she cleaned my teeth. I wasn''t squirming in pain while in the chair. She did all of what the other Hygienist DIDN''T do. That''s exactly how I knew I made the RIGHT decision to seek another hygienist instead of the first one. If a patient is in pain, you don''t keep doing what you''re doing ignoring them and acting like they are a nuisance to you.\n\nHe was essentially attempting to do some scaling without NUMBING me. He knew exactly what he was doing which is why he suggested scheduling a \"deep cleaning\" where I would be numbed! Because, that''s what USUALLY happens when cleaning is happening beneath the gum line because it extremely painful. I am DEFINITELY reporting this incident to higher entities. I also will not be returning to this hospital for care. There''s some other things that were deeply disturbing during my visit.", "author": "F A", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102250824278644152877/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-10-29T15:43:03.280867212Z", "text": "227 Madison\nABSOLUTELY SHOCKING CONDUCT from Head Nurse - Door Slammed in My Face.\n\nI had a deeply unsettling and unprofessional experience on the 7th Floor. I approached the Head Nurse, Ms. Joseph, at the nurse''s station with a simple, respectful question regarding the person I was visiting.\n\nThe Head Nurse responded with an immediate and hostile display of impatience. They didn''t even allow me to finish my sentence before barking, \"I''m busy,\" and slammed the office door shut right in my face.\nThis aggressive and completely unacceptable behavior is a massive failure in professionalism and human decency, especially from someone in a leadership role in patient care. Visitors should not be treated with such contempt. The nurse''s hostile reaction speaks volumes about the unit''s culture. Management needs to address this specific incident immediately. I am truly shocked by this lack of respect.\n\nThe facility and employees were very nice. She was the only one that was unprofessional.", "author": "Desery Martinez", "rating": 2, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116383478173168983496/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-01-05T21:33:16.515262150Z", "text": "This place is a rat hole. The staff on the 7 floor are horrible. My elderly mother was there and she suffered greatly. They never answered the call bell. They disconnected the bell and she developed a horrible bed sore. Stay away it’s horrible", "author": "Joann Ramos", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104138154177573182235/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-13T14:44:24.476650289Z", "text": "THIS IS THE WORST PLACE IN iTHE WORLD. NOBODY DOES THEIR JOB OR KNOW ANYTHING. DO NOT COME HERE. I ONLY HIT ONE STAR BECAUSE IT WOULDNT LET ME POST WITHOUT A SELECTION OTHER THAN THAT THIS PLACE SHOULD BE INSPECTED AND CLOSED FOR GOOD.", "author": "Nicole Williams", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113455046278674750802/reviews"}, {"date": "2021-12-19T15:53:30.285482Z", "text": "Was fourth in line at 9am for COVID testing. Still waiting an hour later - the woman controlling the line is skipping people ahead at her discretion.\n\nEmpty testing booths, while everybody waits in this bureaucratic mess!\n\n12/19 update: New person/black male managing the line - I  got in line at 8:45am and was tested and on my way at 9:02am. There was no line skippery and everything was efficient!\n\n4 stars because I wish they offered longer hours!", "author": "Ashleigh Batton", "rating": 4, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109280033977517706201/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "NYC Health + Hospitals/Gotham Health, Gouverneur has a 3.7 star Google rating from 328 Google reviews. Patients commonly mention compassionate care, friendly staff, clear explanations.", "about_highlight": "Get the high quality and affordable health services you and every member of your family need without having to leave your neighborhood. Our dedicated team provides coordinated care using the best clinical practices and tools to manage your health. Our staff are available on evenings and weekends so you can get care when it fits your schedule. And we can connect you with a doctor by phone at any time, day or night. Our goal is to help you live the healthiest life possible and to build healthy neighborhoods.", "appointment_url": "https://www.nychealthandhospitals.org/make-an-appointment/", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=17074563847934863321&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJFb1OxitawokR2Wfi0loJ9ew", "quality_missing": ["insurance", "team_members"], "search_keywords": ["community health center", "community health", "fqhc", "sliding scale", "medicaid", "medicare", "low cost", "trung tâm y tế cộng đồng", "커뮤니티 헬스", "社区医疗中心", "english", "vietnamese", "tiếng việt", "người việt", "bác sĩ việt", "adult medicine", "behavioral health", "dental care", "eye care", "hiv center", "pediatrics", "podiatry", "the pride health center at nyc health + hospitals/gotham health, gouverneur", "radiology", "women’s health", "world trade center environmental health center", "primary care", "mental health", "dental", "vision", "hiv/aids", "lgbtq+", "imaging", "ob/gyn", "environmental health"], "services_offered": [{"name": "Adult Medicine", "category": "Primary Care", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Behavioral Health", "category": "Mental Health", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Dental Care", "category": "Dental", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Eye Care", "category": "Vision", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "HIV Center", "category": "HIV/AIDS", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Pediatrics", "category": "Pediatrics", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Podiatry", "category": "Podiatry", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "The Pride Health Center at NYC Health + Hospitals/Gotham Health, Gouverneur", "category": "LGBTQ+", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Radiology", "category": "Imaging", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Women’s Health", "category": "OB/GYN", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "World Trade Center Environmental Health Center", "category": "Environmental Health", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}], "short_description": "NYC Health + Hospitals/Gotham Health, Gouverneur provides high-quality, affordable health services in the Lower East Side neighborhood with evening and weekend hours and 24/7 phone access to a doctor.", "google_website_url": "https://www.nychealthandhospitals.org/locations/gotham-health-gouverneur/", "google_primary_type": "Medical Center", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": [], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "227 Madison St, New York, NY 10002, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/101920234406498024329", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWTWqFQ23TbmJqOt1Y8k8z1LYmr8LbQ3q7k8XnYEBzlds05qpJn=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Hershy Fishman"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/101920234406498024329", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWTWqFQ23TbmJqOt1Y8k8z1LYmr8LbQ3q7k8XnYEBzlds05qpJn=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Hershy Fishman"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/107716760208067370787", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWZmUIXJC2B5IhT_DSigUPPwPxO3H8nKp7gJRqZEj3hjXbq7hmsSw=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Roger Bultot"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/105209394643520215791", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWOjcsm21EvA_N9HHG-_XsKaWdWiiZE2nKUTvDEJLl_EC_SMQ4-RA=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "E W"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/112095114686961638334", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVr4YwFNx_Vj8Q94P0ditxrhyq1hkMuxwRAgLS3rbDvdROHE_n4=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "IG AlePendiente"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-25T20:01:46.793373+00:00', 'nyc-health-hospitalsgotham-health-gouverneur', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('31f8795f-fef9-4f93-94a7-76e923350f3e', NULL, 'Chinese Medicine Wellness Center of America', 'Chinese Medicine Wellness Center of America aims to be ''the best acupuncturist in the nation.'' The practice combines precise diagnosis with targeted treatments, noting that a correct acupuncture session can relieve pain in one visit, and a right herbal formula can transform an anxiety patient into a ''New Person.'' The clinic specializes in fertility, with reported successes including helping a patient conceive after one cycle when a reproductive endocrinologist could not in three years. The team also assisted a baseball star in canceling a scheduled knee surgery, reflecting their commitment to perfection in Chinese medicine.', '4105 Spring Creek Pkwy Ste 608, Plano, TX 75024', 'Plano', 'TX', '75024', '(469) 774-1688', ARRAY['English', 'Chinese']::text[], 'Acupuncture & TCM', FALSE, '{"images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/chinese-medicine-wellness-center-of-america-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/chinese-medicine-wellness-center-of-america-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/chinese-medicine-wellness-center-of-america-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/chinese-medicine-wellness-center-of-america-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/chinese-medicine-wellness-center-of-america-google-5.webp"], "rating": 5, "reviews": [{"date": "2026-05-09T17:53:59.555393323Z", "text": "Chinese Medicine Wellness Center of America felt less like walking into a doctor’s office and more like finally being heard after years of static. After countless appointments, scans, bloodwork, shrugs, and the soul-numbing “everything looks normal,” I was exhausted. American medicine kept handing me clean charts while my body kept waving red flags like a storm warning no one else could see. I knew something was wrong. It’s my body. You know when something’s off.\n\nThen I met Dr. Tong.\n\nFrom the moment we sat down, he took the time to genuinely get to know me, not just my symptoms. We talked through my gut issues in detail, and for the first time in a long time, I didn’t feel rushed, dismissed, or reduced to a checklist on a clipboard. There was patience in the room. Humanity. Curiosity. Care.\n\nThe acupuncture was my first experience ever doing it, and honestly? Completely painless. Not just painless, but strangely beautiful in a way I can barely explain. At one point, a wave of warmth and positivity moved through my body like sunlight pouring into a cold room. My mind quieted. My shoulders unclenched. Even my breathing felt different. Afterward, he had me flip over and applied acupressure, which somehow deepened that sense of release even more.\n\nWe spoke again afterward, and he sent me home with supplements to take before meals, along with a clean pescatarian diet tailored to help my body heal instead of just survive.\n\nI cannot recommend this place or Dr. Tong enough. Sometimes healing begins the second someone finally listens.", "author": "Zachary Usinger Smith-Son", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101211539684065051233/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-02T17:56:32.408839348Z", "text": "I have had neck and shoulder pain for a very long time, and the previous doctor was unable to clearly identify the cause or provide effective treatment.\n\nLuckily I found Dr. Tong who has extensive experience in treating chronic conditions and quickly understood my situation. He explained everything patiently, and we developed a clear and appropriate treatment plan together. Best of all, most of the treatment is covered by my insurance.\n\nAfter several acupuncture sessions, my neck pain has significantly reduced and is now well under control. I also feel less easily fatigued or dizzy than before.I also experiencing stomach discomfort that would come and go due to an irregular schedule and stress. Dr. Tong was able to identify this issue as well, and it has improved. The treatment process was smooth, gentle, and felt very safe throughout.\n\nI would recommend Dr. Tong to anyone seeking professional and effective acupuncture care!! It truly helps!", "author": "Catherine X", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112134486517121879456/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-13T20:34:05.286692708Z", "text": "I have been having Back pain, sciatica pain for last 7 months- tried everything- regular doctor (pain killers and rest), Chiropractor and PT.  Those visits didn''t solve any of my problem. Helped little bit but pain came back. Then, one of my friend suggested this acupuncture place. Due to location, i choose another clinic near my home in Arlington and all i got there was lots of pain from needle pooking from head to toe. Didn''t improve my situation. Then i decided to try this clinic although very far from my Home.  When i went there, i was expecting to be pooked throughout my body. But Dr Tong said your main issue is back- once we take care of back,  all issues will go away. I think he used only 4 needles- pain free. After the 1st acupuncture, i already could feel the difference. Total, i did 5 visits, plus  i am just doing 2 stretches regularly  shown to me by Dr Tong, and it has been magical for me. No more painkillers and pain. Dr Tong is very knowledgeable and professional and i can''t thank him enuogh for making me  pain free.", "author": "M G", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117773482875604519899/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-09T15:54:53.395515658Z", "text": "I came to Dr. Tong for my insomnia and he treated with patience and kindness. His calm presence brings a lot of reassurance for me to recovery from my post concussion syndromes. If you prefer a good  doctor listen and hear you. He definitely is one of them. Along the treatment, Dr. Tong also treated my chronic IBS which is disturbing me for a long time. His service and treatment is effective and helpful. He is really good at diagnosing your problem from the root cause. Highly recommended him!", "author": "Eager Chen", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116005131264634722298/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-27T20:08:08.134514037Z", "text": "The best Acupuncture place I could find.\nProvides great customer service- got me in right away.Dr. Tong is treating me for anxiety and It has been very helpful.\nI also started taking the Herbal supplement and he also added more vitamins to my daily routine.\nI am much calmer.\nHighly recommend this place", "author": "Bardha Ajdini", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102242591798647231573/reviews"}], "website": "http://www.chinesemedicineoasis.com/", "location": {"latitude": 33.057318099999996, "longitude": -96.7735302}, "services": ["Acupuncture", "Herbal Medicine", "Cupping Therapy", "Fertility Treatment", "Pain Management"], "insurance": {"notes": null, "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": [], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": false}, "highlights": [{"title": "Fertility Expertise", "detail": "The clinic reports fertility success stories, including a patient who conceived after one cycle after three unsuccessful years with a reproductive endocrinologist.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Non-Surgical Pain Relief", "detail": "A baseball star patient cancelled a scheduled knee surgery after treatment at the clinic.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Accurate Diagnosis", "detail": "The practice emphasizes accurate diagnosis and right treatment, sometimes relieving pain in a single acupuncture session.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Anxiety & Mental Health", "detail": "Herbal formulas are used to transform anxiety patients, creating a ''New Person'' outcome.", "category": "care"}], "price_tier": "$$", "source_url": "http://www.chinesemedicineoasis.com/", "appointment": {"booking_note": null, "appointment_url": "http://chinesemedicineoasis.com/request-an-appointment/", "new_patient_note": null, "phone_booking_available": null, "online_booking_available": null, "free_consultation_available": null}, "open_sunday": false, "scout_query": "Chinese speaking medical clinic in Dallas, TX", "search_text": "acupuncture & tcm | acupuncture | chinese medicine | tcm | herbal medicine | cupping | pain relief | châm cứu | đông y | y học cổ truyền | 한의원 | 침술 | 한약 | 中医 | 针灸 | 中药 | english | chinese | mandarin | cantonese | 中文 | 普通话 | 国语 | 粤语 | 广东话 | 华人 | cupping therapy | fertility treatment | pain management | traditional chinese medicine", "google_types": ["medical_clinic", "store", "health", "point_of_interest", "establishment"], "open_weekend": true, "rating_count": 1400, "language_note": "The clinic is rooted in Traditional Chinese Medicine, offering acupuncture, cupping, and herbal treatments. The practice is led by practitioners of East Asian heritage and incorporates culturally traditional healing methods, though specific language services are not explicitly mentioned on the page.", "open_saturday": true, "quality_score": 92, "working_hours": {"friday": "9:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "monday": "9:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "sunday": "Closed", "tuesday": "9:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "saturday": "9:00 AM – 3:00 PM", "thursday": "9:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "wednesday": "9:00 AM – 5:00 PM"}, "gallery_images": ["http://chinesemedicineoasis.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/03/best-tai-chi-photo-1024.jpg", "http://chinesemedicineoasis.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/03/Huangshan_pic_1024.jpg", "http://chinesemedicineoasis.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/02/IMG_8445.jpg", "http://chinesemedicineoasis.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/03/IMG_2031.jpg"], "review_profile": {"rating": 5, "source": "google", "themes": [{"theme": "Clinical Expertise", "mentions": 5, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Dr. Tong is highly skilled in diagnosing and treating chronic conditions, with patients noting significant improvements in their health."}, {"theme": "Communication", "mentions": 4, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Dr. Tong listens attentively, explains treatment plans clearly, and makes patients feel heard and understood."}, {"theme": "Treatment Outcomes", "mentions": 5, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients report substantial relief from pain, insomnia, anxiety, and other chronic issues after acupuncture and herbal treatments."}, {"theme": "Staff Professionalism", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "The staff is friendly, efficient, and provides excellent customer service, ensuring a smooth experience."}, {"theme": "Facility Environment", "mentions": 2, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "The clinic offers a calming and safe atmosphere, enhancing the overall treatment experience."}], "summary": "Patients consistently praise the Chinese Medicine Wellness Center of America for its compassionate care, effective treatments, and Dr. Tong''s expertise in addressing chronic conditions and root causes of health issues.", "review_count": 1400, "concern_themes": [], "positive_themes": [], "featured_reviews": [{"date": "2026-05-09T17:53:59.555393323Z", "text": "Chinese Medicine Wellness Center of America felt less like walking into a doctor’s office and more like finally being heard after years of static. After countless appointments, scans, bloodwork, shrugs, and the soul-numbing “everything looks normal,” I was exhausted. American medicine kept handing me clean charts while my body kept waving red flags like a storm warning no one else could see. I knew something was wrong. It’s my body. You know when something’s off.\n\nThen I met Dr. Tong.\n\nFrom the moment we sat down, he took the time to genuinely get to know me, not just my symptoms. We talked through my gut issues in detail, and for the first time in a long time, I didn’t feel rushed, dismissed, or reduced to a checklist on a clipboard. There was patience in the room. Humanity. Curiosity. Care.\n\nThe acupuncture was my first experience ever doing it, and honestly? Completely painless. Not just painless, but strangely beautiful in a way I can barely explain. At one point, a wave of warmth and positivity moved through my body like sunlight pouring into a cold room. My mind quieted. My shoulders unclenched. Even my breathing felt different. Afterward, he had me flip over and applied acupressure, which somehow deepened that sense of release even more.\n\nWe spoke again afterward, and he sent me home with supplements to take before meals, along with a clean pescatarian diet tailored to help my body heal instead of just survive.\n\nI cannot recommend this place or Dr. Tong enough. Sometimes healing begins the second someone finally listens.", "author": "Zachary Usinger Smith-Son", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101211539684065051233/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-02T17:56:32.408839348Z", "text": "I have had neck and shoulder pain for a very long time, and the previous doctor was unable to clearly identify the cause or provide effective treatment.\n\nLuckily I found Dr. Tong who has extensive experience in treating chronic conditions and quickly understood my situation. He explained everything patiently, and we developed a clear and appropriate treatment plan together. Best of all, most of the treatment is covered by my insurance.\n\nAfter several acupuncture sessions, my neck pain has significantly reduced and is now well under control. I also feel less easily fatigued or dizzy than before.I also experiencing stomach discomfort that would come and go due to an irregular schedule and stress. Dr. Tong was able to identify this issue as well, and it has improved. The treatment process was smooth, gentle, and felt very safe throughout.\n\nI would recommend Dr. Tong to anyone seeking professional and effective acupuncture care!! It truly helps!", "author": "Catherine X", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112134486517121879456/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-13T20:34:05.286692708Z", "text": "I have been having Back pain, sciatica pain for last 7 months- tried everything- regular doctor (pain killers and rest), Chiropractor and PT.  Those visits didn''t solve any of my problem. Helped little bit but pain came back. Then, one of my friend suggested this acupuncture place. Due to location, i choose another clinic near my home in Arlington and all i got there was lots of pain from needle pooking from head to toe. Didn''t improve my situation. Then i decided to try this clinic although very far from my Home.  When i went there, i was expecting to be pooked throughout my body. But Dr Tong said your main issue is back- once we take care of back,  all issues will go away. I think he used only 4 needles- pain free. After the 1st acupuncture, i already could feel the difference. Total, i did 5 visits, plus  i am just doing 2 stretches regularly  shown to me by Dr Tong, and it has been magical for me. No more painkillers and pain. Dr Tong is very knowledgeable and professional and i can''t thank him enuogh for making me  pain free.", "author": "M G", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117773482875604519899/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-09T15:54:53.395515658Z", "text": "I came to Dr. Tong for my insomnia and he treated with patience and kindness. His calm presence brings a lot of reassurance for me to recovery from my post concussion syndromes. If you prefer a good  doctor listen and hear you. He definitely is one of them. Along the treatment, Dr. Tong also treated my chronic IBS which is disturbing me for a long time. His service and treatment is effective and helpful. He is really good at diagnosing your problem from the root cause. Highly recommended him!", "author": "Eager Chen", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116005131264634722298/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-27T20:08:08.134514037Z", "text": "The best Acupuncture place I could find.\nProvides great customer service- got me in right away.Dr. Tong is treating me for anxiety and It has been very helpful.\nI also started taking the Herbal supplement and he also added more vitamins to my daily routine.\nI am much calmer.\nHighly recommend this place", "author": "Bardha Ajdini", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102242591798647231573/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Patients consistently praise the Chinese Medicine Wellness Center of America for its compassionate care, effective treatments, and Dr. Tong''s expertise in addressing chronic conditions and root causes of health issues.", "about_highlight": "Chinese Medicine Wellness Center of America aims to be ''the best acupuncturist in the nation.'' The practice combines precise diagnosis with targeted treatments, noting that a correct acupuncture session can relieve pain in one visit, and a right herbal formula can transform an anxiety patient into a ''New Person.'' The clinic specializes in fertility, with reported successes including helping a patient conceive after one cycle when a reproductive endocrinologist could not in three years. The team also assisted a baseball star in canceling a scheduled knee surgery, reflecting their commitment to perfection in Chinese medicine.", "appointment_url": "http://chinesemedicineoasis.com/request-an-appointment/", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=848204751320660292&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJ1dRLV48jTIYRRDlEM7ptxQs", "quality_missing": ["insurance", "team_members"], "search_keywords": ["acupuncture & tcm", "acupuncture", "chinese medicine", "tcm", "herbal medicine", "cupping", "pain relief", "châm cứu", "đông y", "y học cổ truyền", "한의원", "침술", "한약", "中医", "针灸", "中药", "english", "chinese", "mandarin", "cantonese", "中文", "普通话", "国语", "粤语", "广东话", "华人", "cupping therapy", "fertility treatment", "pain management", "traditional chinese medicine"], "cultural_context": "The clinic is rooted in Traditional Chinese Medicine, offering acupuncture, cupping, and herbal treatments. The practice is led by practitioners of East Asian heritage and incorporates culturally traditional healing methods, though specific language services are not explicitly mentioned on the page.", "services_offered": [{"name": "Acupuncture", "category": "Traditional Chinese Medicine", "description": "Needle-based therapy for pain relief, fertility, and overall wellness.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients seeking pain relief, fertility support, or general health balance."}, {"name": "Herbal Medicine", "category": "Traditional Chinese Medicine", "description": "Custom herbal formulas to address anxiety, fertility, and other internal conditions.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients needing internal medicine support, anxiety relief, or fertility enhancement."}, {"name": "Cupping Therapy", "category": "Traditional Chinese Medicine", "description": "Fire-heated glass cups applied to the back to promote circulation and release tension.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients with muscle pain, tension, or seeking detoxification."}, {"name": "Fertility Treatment", "category": "Traditional Chinese Medicine", "description": "Combined acupuncture and herbal therapy aimed at improving fertility outcomes.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Individuals or couples struggling with infertility or seeking to enhance natural conception."}, {"name": "Pain Management", "category": "Traditional Chinese Medicine", "description": "Targeted acupuncture and cupping to address joint pain, back pain, and knee issues.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients with chronic or acute pain seeking non-surgical alternatives."}], "short_description": "Chinese Medicine Wellness Center of America offers acupuncture, herbal medicine, and cupping therapy with a focus on fertility and pain relief, striving to be the best acupuncturist in the nation.", "google_website_url": "http://www.chinesemedicineoasis.com/", "google_primary_type": "Medical Clinic", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": [], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "4105 Spring Creek Pkwy Ste 608, Plano, TX 75024, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/115850903009815063846", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWo0pLvYpCON0KBonrRagaG52PLmzFr_aOlElHSDb4ldOQ10Ug=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Chinese Medicine Wellness Center of America"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/117920287998060752446", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKejtynyjWlxFE_TVZEP_EX2QvVEj-ODauuf-EhEgFiWj4P8w=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "A. Verified Guide"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/117920287998060752446", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKejtynyjWlxFE_TVZEP_EX2QvVEj-ODauuf-EhEgFiWj4P8w=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "A. Verified Guide"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/102788824661773610217", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVxHD6lucrd3jS1LfozO-QvYu4gcbs0xNTjHUzToxfHKlqhBbd9gg=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Oliver"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/117920287998060752446", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKejtynyjWlxFE_TVZEP_EX2QvVEj-ODauuf-EhEgFiWj4P8w=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "A. Verified Guide"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-26T11:13:47.65585+00:00', 'chinese-medicine-wellness-center-of-america', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('f50d9358-f2a1-4949-af1f-e2767f248890', NULL, 'UNITY HEALTH CLINIC LLC/PHÒNG MẠCH BÁC SỸ NGA VŨ', 'Unity Health Clinic LLC is a family medicine and urgent care practice located in Morrow, GA, offering a wide range of services including primary care, urgent care, COVID-19 testing and vaccination, monoclonal antibody treatment, flu shots, and advanced body contouring treatments like BTL Emsculpt Neo, Emsealla, and Emtone. The clinic is committed to providing accessible, compassionate care with walk-in hours for COVID-19 testing and vaccines, and a bilingual (English/Vietnamese) environment to serve the diverse local community. Patients can easily book appointments online through the patient portal or contact the clinic directly for scheduling.', '7183 Jonesboro Rd Suite 100, Morrow, GA 30260', 'Morrow', 'GA', '30260', '470-221-2221', ARRAY['English', 'Vietnamese']::text[], 'Urgent Care', FALSE, '{"fax": "337-246-5144", "email": "Support@unityhealthclinic.com", "images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/unity-health-clinic-llcphong-mach-bac-sy-nga-vu-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/unity-health-clinic-llcphong-mach-bac-sy-nga-vu-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/unity-health-clinic-llcphong-mach-bac-sy-nga-vu-google-3.webp"], "rating": 3.9, "reviews": [{"date": "2026-02-05T18:50:45.901000995Z", "text": "Thank you to the male nurse and the male doctor for helping me when I truly needed it.\nI’m sorry I don’t remember your name—you have tattoos all over, but you are such a warm and kind person.\nYou looked into my eyes and understood my depression when no one else could see it, and you took time to talk and encourage me.\n\nThe doctor took the time to explain everything to me with patience and care, and he truly helped and encouraged me to stop smoking cigarettes.\n\nBoth you and the doctor helped me more than words can express, and I am deeply grateful.", "author": "Nila Orton", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116819055979944938122/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-10-16T00:15:14.135032495Z", "text": "I seriously love this clinic and the Doctor ! Every time I go to the doctor, my anxiety shows up before I do 😂 but the staff here always takes care of me like family. They’re super kind, chill, and actually make the whole visit not so scary.\n\nBig shoutout to the guy with the tattoos (wish I remembered your name 😅) — you’re the real MVP! Thanks for always keeping things calm and positive. 10/10 would recommend this place! 🙌", "author": "LilYatchy", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111467139159775924179/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-10-13T23:53:11.640202342Z", "text": "Everyone is very nice and polite at this clinic. Patient care is very important to them! I would definitely recommend Dr. Vu if you live near Morrow or the South for a compassionate doctor.", "author": "Lindsey Jiang", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112008149158738078962/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-04T05:24:36.401143046Z", "text": "Second time a charm I guess. Everything went more smoothly this time. Everyone from the staffs to the nurse and Dr. Vu were great.", "author": "Leah T", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115595042150762900250/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-01-05T17:46:52.780286569Z", "text": "Called to schedule I appointment. I liked the reviews so I wanted to 