46Z", "text": "Second time a charm I guess. Everything went more smoothly this time. Everyone from the staffs to the nurse and Dr. Vu were great.", "author": "Leah T", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115595042150762900250/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-01-05T17:46:52.780286569Z", "text": "Called to schedule I appointment. I liked the reviews so I wanted to come but I got hung up on twice so guess i’ll never get a chance. I’ll continue searching and the other person that said they were hung up on trying to make a appointment was right", "author": "Aaliyah Asante", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104301937145692047666/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "UNITY HEALTH CLINIC LLC/PHÒNG MẠCH BÁC SỸ NGA VŨ has a 3.9 star Google rating from 46 Google reviews. Patients commonly mention compassionate care, friendly staff, clear explanations, strong results.", "about_highlight": "Unity Health Clinic LLC is a family medicine and urgent care practice located in Morrow, GA, offering a wide range of services including primary care, urgent care, COVID-19 testing and vaccination, monoclonal antibody treatment, flu shots, and advanced body contouring treatments like BTL Emsculpt Neo, Emsealla, and Emtone. The clinic is committed to providing accessible, compassionate care with walk-in hours for COVID-19 testing and vaccines, and a bilingual (English/Vietnamese) environment to serve the diverse local community. Patients can easily book appointments online through the patient portal or contact the clinic directly for scheduling.", "appointment_url": "https://www.athenahealth.com/patient-login", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=8820160365545835089&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJE1qu92X59IgRUcpWCh-BZ3o", "quality_missing": ["team_members"], "search_keywords": ["urgent care", "english", "vietnamese", "tiếng việt", "người việt", "bác sĩ việt", "family medicine & urgent care", "btl emsculpt neo", "btl emsealla", "btl emtone", "covid-19 testing", "covid-19 vaccines", "monoclonal antibody treatment", "flu shots", "primary care", "cosmetic", "diagnostic", "preventive", "treatment", "medicare"], "cultural_context": "The clinic has a dedicated Vietnamese-language page (Tieng Viet) and is listed under the name \"PHÒNG MẠCH BÁC SỸ NGA VŨ,\" indicating a culturally responsive and language-accessible environment for Vietnamese-speaking patients and families.", "services_offered": [{"name": "Family Medicine & Urgent Care", "category": "Primary Care", "description": "Comprehensive primary care and urgent care services for all ages.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "BTL Emsculpt Neo", "category": "Cosmetic", "description": "A 30-minute procedure that reduces fat by 30% and increases muscle by 25%.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "BTL Emsealla", "category": "Cosmetic", "description": "Non-invasive treatment for pelvic floor health and incontinence.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "BTL Emtone", "category": "Cosmetic", "description": "Non-invasive treatment for cellulite reduction.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "COVID-19 Testing", "category": "Diagnostic", "description": "Walk-in PCR results in 2-24 hours and Rapid Antigen nasal swabs with 15-minute results, for travel, work, school, and doctor visits.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "All patients needing COVID-19 testing."}, {"name": "COVID-19 Vaccines", "category": "Preventive", "description": "Moderna (1st, 2nd, 3rd dose) for 18+ and Pfizer-BioNTech for 5 years and older, including booster shots 6 months after initial series. Walk-ins welcome.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients 5+ needing COVID-19 vaccination."}, {"name": "Monoclonal Antibody Treatment", "category": "Treatment", "description": "Treatment for COVID-19 positive patients within 10 days of symptoms, by appointment.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "COVID-19 positive patients."}, {"name": "Flu Shots", "category": "Preventive", "description": "Annual flu vaccination by appointment.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "All patients needing flu vaccination."}], "short_description": "Unity Health Clinic LLC is a family medicine and urgent care practice in Morrow, GA, providing primary care, COVID-19 services, flu shots, and advanced aesthetic treatments with a bilingual English/Vietnamese staff.", "google_website_url": "http://www.unityhealthclinic.com/", "insurance_accepted": ["Medicare"], "google_primary_type": "Medical Clinic", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": [], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "7183 Jonesboro Rd #100, Morrow, GA 30260, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/115118284128991907632", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKN_TeM0ZLtbAuEfT3Lx2OuDB5t-tGEVkA6pawQUNn4y9hNlg=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Blue Stars"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/115118284128991907632", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKN_TeM0ZLtbAuEfT3Lx2OuDB5t-tGEVkA6pawQUNn4y9hNlg=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Blue Stars"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/111425933375207038049", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKmPFBY6W2_ppGxqc-rmYwxxlv3wups3BKDyKYbrHMUZ8-93A=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "UNITY HEALTH CLINIC LLC/PHÒNG MẠCH BÁC SỸ NGA VŨ"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-26T12:09:24.266503+00:00', 'unity-health-clinic-llcphong-mach-bac-sy-nga-vu', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('3d6d21e8-f95b-44cf-adc0-cfa105c487ef', NULL, 'Seoul National University Hospital LA Office', 'Seoul National University Hospital (SNUH) is one of Korea''s most prestigious medical institutions, and its LA Office provides U.S.-based coordination for Korean patients seeking treatment at SNUH in Seoul. The office assists with medical appointments, travel logistics, and language support to ensure a seamless healthcare journey between the United States and Korea. Patients benefit from SNUH''s world-class medical expertise combined with culturally tailored services for Korean and Korean-American patients.', '3435 Wilshire Blvd, Suite 1800', 'Los Angeles', 'CA', '90010', '(866) 808-4148', ARRAY['English', 'Korean']::text[], 'Hospital', FALSE, '{"images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/seoul-national-university-hospital-la-office.webp"], "rating": 4, "reviews": [{"date": "2025-09-25T04:48:12.863214059Z", "text": "Seoul National University Hospital LA Office provides excellent support and coordination for patients seeking specialized care. Staff are professional and helpful, making the process smooth and accessible for the community.", "author": "Abihaosprify", "rating": 4, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100167906135675551912/reviews"}], "website": "http://usa.snuh.org/", "location": {"latitude": 34.0623108, "longitude": -118.3061813}, "services": ["International Medical Appointment Coordination", "Medical Travel Assistance", "Language Interpretation"], "insurance": {"notes": "Insurance information not available from the source. Patients are likely self-pay for international coordination services.", "accepts_medicaid": null, "acc