Patients appreciate the doctors'' ability to listen attentively and communicate effectively, making them feel cared for."}, {"theme": "Patient Comfort", "mentions": 2, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Reviewers highlight the clinic''s ability to make patients, including those with special needs, feel at ease and comfortable during their visits."}], "summary": "Most patients appreciate the friendly and professional staff at NYC Health + Hospitals/Gotham Health, Judson, though some have raised concerns about unprofessional behavior and facility maintenance issues.", "review_count": 136, "concern_themes": [], "positive_themes": [], "featured_reviews": [{"date": "2025-10-23T02:35:43.041939803Z", "text": "Judson is a decent place for care but I got to say I''m not a fan of some of the staff. I''m seen at both Gouverneur and Judson but, it feels like 2 totally different places and I don''t mean that in a nice way. The heavyset hispanic nurse, is taking my vitals and asking me questions like why you here, but has Airpods on and is in middle of conversation. I say this because she never picks up her phone but after doing my vitals and asking questions goes straight into convo. Like, why am I being asked about myself when you are on the phone. For all I know she talks about me after I leave. I''m sure she does. While we at it, why was she in street clothes? Nearly everyone else has only scrubs but she and another nurse had on jeans.\n\nI never have these problems at Gouverneur. I may wait longer but it''s clearly a more professional spot. Think ill be transferring my care there for now on.", "author": "UR1 TRUKING", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116722724932474466068/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-07-30T20:24:40.935222186Z", "text": "*Not a review of the staff, who are all 5 star and I adore!*\n\nIt''s been at least six months that several smoke alarms have been chirping low battery very loudly throughout this large office. I feel so much for the staff, especially reception, who has to listen to this all day. Could management disrespect their staff more than to go so long failing to do such a simple repair that would have such a big impact?  (Also not fun being a migraine patient and having to listen to this).\n\nAnd this is besides the fact that the smoke alarms haven''t been in operation, surely a fire code violation (hint hint).", "author": "Sara Nahshon", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115808689870107528997/reviews"}, {"date": "2022-07-22T17:30:43.885850Z", "text": "On the behalf of my son, our experience with the Judson Health Clinic was nothing less than excellence. From the time we walked in to leaving, we were treated with respect and kindness. All the staff was attentive to our needs and made sure everything was in place for our visit. Dr. M. Baehser is an excellent doctor. Very detailed, kind, and humorous which made my 20-year-old son with Autism comfortable enough to talk and have an important conversation with him. I would recommend this office to anyone. And it''s located in one of the best areas in NYC. After, you can definitely get a bite to eat at one of the fine restaurants located in the area.", "author": "Carlene Wright", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102416360827227451881/reviews"}, {"date": "2021-10-05T17:48:41.098297Z", "text": "I found this clinic after doing research online for a Dr. who specializes in adolescents for my teenage son.  I could not be any happier than I am now after finding Dr. Baehser. . He takes the time to really get to know his patients and goes above and beyond to make sure their needs are met. My son also likes him tremendously and is super comfortable with him. The clinic itself is always spotless and the entire staff is always helpful and friendly. I feel very lucky to have found The Judson Health Clinic.", "author": "Amy Gavilanes", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117232635948458410663/reviews"}, {"date": "2019-05-29T23:52:18.316301Z", "text": "First time visiting a healthcare center and doctor in 2 years. Was pleasantly surprised by the great service and excellent staff. Was greeted warmly by Felicia the receptionist on arrival and she was very helpful with the paperwork.\n\nI saw Dr Rachel Bring who made me feel comfortable and at ease. She was easy to communicate with, listened and answered all my questions. I genuinely felt the doctor cared and wanted to help. Definitely recommend this practice.", "author": "Hitz Mistry", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113461460206217500618/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Most patients appreciate the friendly and professional staff at NYC Health + Hospitals/Gotham Health, Judson, though some have raised concerns about unprofessional behavior and facility maintenance issues.", "about_highlight": "NYC Health + Hospitals/Gotham Health, Judson is a community health center located at 34 Spring Street, New York, NY 10012, offering primary care services. It is part of the NYC Health + Hospitals system, the largest municipal health system in the US. For appointments, call 1-844-692-4692.", "appointment_url": "https://www.nychealthandhospitals.org/make-an-appointment/", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=1380323815052918761&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJCW5juYhZwokR6b89TzLlJxM", "quality_missing": ["services", "insurance", "team_members"], "search_keywords": ["hospital", "english", "chinese", "mandarin", "cantonese", "中文", "普通话", "国语", "粤语", "广东话", "华人"], "short_description": "A community health center offering primary and preventive care services in Manhattan.", "google_website_url": "https://www.nychealthandhospitals.org/locations/?distance=10&facility_type=168&view-type=list-view", "google_primary_type": "Medical Clinic", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": [], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "34 Spring St, New York, NY 10012, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/107422820310545955185", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVa9kxqW3I5Tnuij5OUeoxEGyDIdxQocFs-H0NhwJjjo20M7kM=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "NYC Health + Hospitals/Gotham Health, Judson"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/108585025234485852384", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWs9QcntFUNgDuGpKGOzS6n5tjLrUnhRgy7x_XJI256TB87TPyugw=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "David Herszenson"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/108585025234485852384", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWs9QcntFUNgDuGpKGOzS6n5tjLrUnhRgy7x_XJI256TB87TPyugw=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "David Herszenson"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/102824433786931720370", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVpxRyeO8RIY072-iCgUqS9N8OdWRQk1P6zOjZ09Pnr0c_RPFE0Zg=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Doosung Shin"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/107422820310545955185", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVa9kxqW3I5Tnuij5OUeoxEGyDIdxQocFs-H0NhwJjjo20M7kM=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "NYC Health + Hospitals/Gotham Health, Judson"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-25T20:07:54.488383+00:00', 'nyc-health-hospitalsgotham-health-judson', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('b665a3f4-9711-4202-9fcf-f0897a663d78', NULL, 'Charles B. Wang Community Health Center', 'Charles B. Wang Community Health Center (CBWCHC) is a federally qualified health center providing high-quality, affordable health care to all, regardless of ability to pay or language spoken. Founded to serve the Asian American community in New York City, it offers comprehensive services including internal medicine, pediatrics, obstetrics & gynecology, dental care, primary eye care, mental health, social work, and health education. With locations in Manhattan and Queens, the center is open seven days a week, offers same-day appointments, and provides a sliding fee discount program for eligible patients.', '268 Canal St, New York, NY 10013', 'New York', 'NY', '10013', '(212) 379-6998', ARRAY['Chinese', 'English']::text[], 'Community Health Center', FALSE, '{"images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/charles-b.-wang-community-health-center-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/charles-b.-wang-community-health-center-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/charles-b.-wang-community-health-center-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/charles-b.-wang-community-health-center-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/charles-b.-wang-community-health-center-google-5.webp"], "rating": 4.5, "reviews": [{"date": "2026-03-25T01:13:10.311104654Z", "text": "Dr Catherine Lee has been my general practitioner doctor at the Canal Street facility for over 20 years (since the 9/11  tragedy).\n\nI''ve received outstanding care from Dr. Lee as well as  other physicians and staff at the Charles Wang Center.\n\nThe facilities and staff''s care, attention to detail and ability to provide excellent health care (which has kept me in good health, outliving most of the males in my family, makes the Charles Wang healthcare facility the health care model that other facilities should take inspiration from.\n\nMy doctor actually reads my blood tests or outside exams that I take and calls me within hours of any noted concerns).\n\nI can''t think more highly of or say enough good things about this facility. Even when I had moved out of state for a while, I would have to fly back to NYC because there is a lot of bad health care out there and no where was my health as much as a concern here.", "author": "Hypnosis And Magic", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114490866922324489930/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-03-04T02:09:48.687575993Z", "text": "Once Dr. Bui walked into the exam room it was all business. I had several pressing issues which Dr. Bui was able to handle and resolve immediately. She was very attentive and personable with a great bed side manner; I can tell right off the bat after our first meeting that Dr. Bui genuinely cares about her patients. Overall it was a pleasant first office visit with Dr. Bui !!!! Thank you.", "author": "Charles Gomez", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111962623278168756531/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-03-03T18:48:55.095247621Z", "text": "I can honestly say Dr.Kim Bui is excellent. Out of all the doctors I have seen before, she is by far the best. She truly listens, takes her time to explain everything clearly, and makes you feel comfortable and cared for. I never feel rushed during my appointments, and she always addresses all of my concerns with patience and professionalism. I’m very grateful to have found her and highly recommend her to anyone looking for a knowledgeable and compassionate doctor. The service in Charles B. Wang Community Health Care is excellent 10/10.", "author": "Carolina Orellana", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118010553873920056616/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-03-09T16:23:19.058838783Z", "text": "I am very grateful to Dr. Melissa Groves for her kindness and professionalism. She is a very attentive, calm, and caring doctor who truly listens to her patients. During appointments, she explains everything clearly and makes you feel comfortable and reassured. I especially appreciate how careful and supportive she is during pregnancy. I feel that I am in very safe and professional hands. I highly recommend Dr. Melissa Groves to anyone looking for a wonderful OB/GYN.", "author": "Nazokat Dzhumaeva", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108499321969731950142/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-01T14:51:29.917096885Z", "text": "I absolutely love Dr. Bui and the entire team at Charles B. Wang Community Health Center. Everyone is consistently kind, knowledgeable, and patient. Dr. Bui is incredibly attentive and took the time to address all of my concerns without rushing. It’s a bit out of the way for me, but I’d much rather make the trip to Charles B. Wang and their recommended locations than deal with any other offices.", "author": "Jessica Sierra", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100266359127902374598/reviews"}], "website": "https://www.cbwchc.org/", "location": {"latitude": 40.71875, "longitude": -74.00128169999999}, "services": ["Internal Medicine", "Pediatrics", "Obstetrics & Gynecology", "Dental Care", "Primary Eye Care", "Mental Health", "Social Work", "Health Educati