eds and pace."}, {"theme": "Communication", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Dr. Altschuler and the team are commended for explaining things clearly and fostering a collaborative approach."}, {"theme": "Facility Environment", "mentions": 2, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients describe the clinic as welcoming and efficient, with staff who go above and beyond to make visits pleasant."}], "summary": "Patients consistently praise Sequoia MD for its exceptional care, highlighting Dr. Altschuler''s expertise, compassion, and personalized approach. The friendly and attentive staff also receives high marks for their professionalism and responsiveness.", "review_count": 64, "concern_themes": [], "positive_themes": ["Caring and attentive providers", "Non-judgmental care", "Strong patient-provider relationships", "Listening and understanding", "Life-changing support", "Expert diabetes care", "Helpful and supportive staff"], "featured_reviews": [{"date": "2025-12-05T01:13:10.232495012Z", "text": "Dr. Altschuler is a fantastic physician who is very knowledgeable and caring. I’ve been seeing him for years and have had nothing but great experiences. He is attentive, thorough and appointments are never rushed. Staff is extremely friendly and responsive to prescription requests and appointment changes. Highly recommended!", "author": "Dana Tibbetts", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118385341353164856762/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-14T08:11:36.546053803Z", "text": "I could write a lengthy review about how Dr. Altschuler and Sequoia MD systematically changed my family’s perspective on a recent life altering diagnosis, but the many reviews here speak for themselves.\n\nDr. Altschuler is the real deal, he provides medical care at a level that I have never seen before and he does it at an affordable price. His commitment and passion for serving others is inspiring, specifically his work in the T1D community. My family will be under his care as long as he practices medicine.", "author": "Zebulon Oehlman", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116600675132307976982/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-01-29T16:35:56.720995513Z", "text": "Switching my care to Sequoia MD, specifically with Dr. Altschuler, absolutely changed my life. As somebody who struggles with really complex and fragile medical conditions (as well as a lot of previous trauma and mistrust with the healthcare system) I hadn’t seen a doctor in a long time, and was not very trusting of medical professionals. Until I met and started working with Dr. Altschuler. He has a way of making you feel very comfortable, seen, heard, and confident when it comes to your health care. He understood where I was coming from, let us take things at a slow pace, explained things in a way I understood instead of using medical jargon that was over my head, and made sure we were always working as a team instead of making decisions for me. If you want to receive healthcare that is unlike anything you have received before and actually feels like you are being listened to (and you get to spend the whole visit with your doctor, what a concept) this is the place for you. Give it a shot, and I promise you will not be disappointed!!", "author": "Jenna Ritchie", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101402559680456860826/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-10-03T17:07:58.207347544Z", "text": "I’ve received phenomenal care thus far at Sequoia MD. Dr. Altschuler has made me feel more than validated in my concerns and has worked with me to find solutions that work with my life. His staff is also very attentive and makes communications a breeze.", "author": "Hannah Wallrich", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103899317296834070904/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-08-20T23:15:10.343325594Z", "text": "Sequoia MD has been an incredible support in my recovery journey. The entire team is professional, efficient, and genuinely caring. My NP, Glenda, has been amazing—she’s kind, compassionate, and always takes the time to really listen to me and understand what I need. At the front desk, Arianna makes every visit easy and stress-free, and always greets me with a smile.\n\nI’ve felt supported every step of the way, and I can’t thank them enough for the role they’ve played in helping me move forward. I would highly recommend Sequoia MD to anyone seeking care —they truly go above and beyond.", "author": "Eric Cardenas", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116394770211171031423/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Patients consistently praise Sequoia MD for its exceptional care, highlighting Dr. Altschuler''s expertise, compassion, and personalized approach. The friendly and attentive staff also receives high marks for their professionalism and responsiveness.", "about_highlight": "Sequoia MD is a direct primary care and addiction treatment practice in Sacramento, California, founded on the belief that healthcare should be personal, accessible, and relationship-based. The clinic offers same-day or next-day appointments, minimal wait times, after-hours support, and direct access to providers via email, text, or phone. Their team focuses on treating the whole person—not just symptoms—and provides tailored care for primary care, chronic disease management, type 1 diabetes, transgender care, mental health, and substance use disorders including alcohol, opioid, and benzo addiction. Sequoia MD operates on a membership model rather than accepting insurance, making pricing simple and transparent with no co-pays, deductibles, or confusing EOBs. The practice serves patients across the Sacramento region including Auburn, Carmichael, Citrus Heights, Elk Grove, Fair Oaks, Folsom, Lincoln, Rocklin, Roseville, and more. With a 4.5-star rating on Zocdoc and glow