ant do much. units should be separated by age not how dangerous. 13 year olds shouldnt be with  16-17 yr olds. But also the super dangerous or like at risk should be watched accordingly.", "author": "Felix Gillespie", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111760339110068258328/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-03-21T22:10:22.760704756Z", "text": "My son is in this horrible place , you can not get through to talk to doctors are get any answers .\nCalling 10 times a day for 5 days , no return calls ,no one answers !\nSo frustrating when your trying to get some answers or to relay health care like medications and what’s been going on with him .\nI have reached out also multiple times a day trying to get through to his social worker to set up alternate visitation hours . I get up at 2 am , there visiting hours during the week are from 8:15 to 9:15 pm .\nHow crazy are these hours .\nThis place is not there to help your family members they are there to over medicate and keep your family members coming back so they have jobs period !!!!!\nThey are not trying g to help anyone but themselves …\nIf you can get your family member out of this HORRIBLE place do it and do it fast !\nThey should be shut down and I will be filing a formal complaint with the city state , Federal , agencies that should be overseeing these places !!!!\nThe receptionist in the front is the best part about this place. She was very friendly and could find a way better place to work than this place .", "author": "gaston daugherty", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104876445761370419626/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-05T12:55:03.849814288Z", "text": "Terrible experience. Its a cold prison. From my experience a lot of people who end up there didn''t even expect to end up there and didn''t even know what they were signing and end up getting 5150''d. And there''s weekly evaluation to see if you qualify to leave but you have to give specific answers and they don''t tell you what those answers are. And turns out THEY DONT even have a reason to KEEP you there. Me and a stranger compared our evaluation forms that was given to us and it said the EXACT same thing. The \"reason\" for being admitted: \"Potential psychosis\". And the mental health \"reason\" to stay confined without return home \"N/A\".\n\nAnd it was the exact same and we had completely different stories of how we ending up in there. Its like the person who makes these \"evaluation \" forms just copy & pastes a template with no concern of the patient.", "author": "iStanKnowledge&Reason", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111108182913106986076/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "San Jose Behavioral Health has a 2.3 star Google rating from 197 Google reviews. Patients commonly mention compassionate care, friendly staff.", "about_highlight": "San Jose Behavioral Health is a supportive and nurturing environment providing clinically superior services to adults and adolescents struggling with mental health or behavioral health issues in the Silicon Valley area and surrounding communities. Our 133-bed inpatient facility combines the clinical sophistication of a large program with the personalized attention of a small facility. Patients work closely with board-certified psychiatrists, internal medicine physicians, mental health therapists, registered nurses, activity therapists, and mental health technicians in a dynamic healing community. Upon completion, each patient leaves with a comprehensive aftercare plan to maintain progress.", "appointment_url": "https://www.sanjosebh.com/admissions/pre-admission/", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=10727634398913614964&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJhabfk1AujoARdNSB-6U24JQ", "quality_missing": ["team_members"], "search_keywords": ["mental health", "psychiatry", "psychiatrist", "psychology", "therapist", "counseling", "depression", "anxiety", "tâm lý", "tâm thần", "trầm cảm", "정신과", "심리상담", "心理医生", "精神科", "english", "vietnamese", "tiếng việt", "người việt", "bác sĩ việt", "adolescent inpatient", "adult inpatient", "adult outpatient (iop/php)", "adolescent iop", "connections – santa cruz", "continuing care", "recreation therapy", "telehealth", "veterans affairs", "blue cross blue shield", "cigna", "kaiser permanente", "magellan health", "medicare", "optum"], "services_offered": [{"name": "Adolescent Inpatient", "category": "Mental Health", "description": "Inpatient treatment for adolescents struggling with mental health disorders.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Adolescents"}, {"name": "Adult Inpatient", "category": "Mental Health", "description": "Inpatient treatment for adult men and women with behavioral and mental health disorders.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Adults"}, {"name": "Adult Outpatient (IOP/PHP)", "category": "Mental Health", "description": "Intensive outpatient and partial hospitalization programs for adults.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Adults"}, {"name": "Adolescent IOP", "category": "Mental Health", "description": "Intensive outpatient program for adolescents.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Adolescents"}, {"name": "Connections – Santa Cruz", "category": "Mental Health", "description": "Outpatient services in Santa Cruz for continued care.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Continuing Care", "category": "Mental Health", "description": "Aftercare planning and resources to maintain progress after treatment.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Recreation Therapy", "category": "Mental Health", "description": "Therapeutic recreational activities to support healing.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Telehealth", "category": "Mental Health", "description": "Virtual therapy and consultation services for remote access.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Veterans Affairs", "category": "Mental Health", "description": "Specialized programs for veterans dealing with mental health issues.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Veterans"}], "short_description": "The leading mental health hospital in San Jose, California, offering 24/7 inpatient and outpatient care for adults and adolescents.", "google_website_url": "https://www.sanjosebh.com/?utm_source=Google&utm_medium=organic&utm_campaign=listing&utm_term=brand", "insurance_accepted": ["Blue Cross Blue Shield", "Cigna", "Kaiser Permanente", "Magellan Health", "Medicare", "Optum"], "google_primary_type": "Medical Clinic", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": [], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "accepting_new_patients": true, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "455 Silicon Valley Blvd, San Jose, CA 95138, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/107729563755902914581", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUkBdPBbkSBQthBwuHEo9CJskxn1we2bTfM0RFS-iKzoDiynWKf=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "San Jose Behavioral Health"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/107729563755902914581", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUkBdPBbkSBQthBwuHEo9CJskxn1we2bTfM0RFS-iKzoDiynWKf=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "San Jose Behavioral Health"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/107729563755902914581", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUkBdPBbkSBQthBwuHEo9CJskxn1we2bTfM0RFS-iKzoDiynWKf=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "San Jose Behavioral Health"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/107729563755902914581", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUkBdPBbkSBQthBwuHEo9CJskxn1we2bTfM0RFS-iKzoDiynWKf=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "San Jose Behavioral Health"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/107729563755902914581", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUkBdPBbkSBQthBwuHEo9CJskxn1we2bTfM0RFS-iKzoDiynWKf=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "San Jose Behavioral Health"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-25T20:16:54.936319+00:00', 'san-jose-behavioral-health', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('49d02d88-80ae-47a5-9f6a-665c4b613b62', NULL, 'Acupuncture Avenue', 'Acupuncture Avenue, led by licensed acupuncturist Peter Yeung (LAc), provides holistic healing through traditional Chinese medicine including acupuncture, herbal medicine, and cupping. The practice focuses on realigning mind, body, and spirit by addressing imbalances that manifest as pain, stress, fatigue, and other health concerns. With a philosophy grounded in treating the root cause, Peter offers personalized care that combines ancient wisdom with a compassionate, professional approach to help patients achieve optimal well-being.', '1685 Westwood Dr. #9, San Jose, CA 95125', 'San Jose', 'CA', '95125', '(408)357-4191', ARRAY['English', 'Cantonese', 'Korean']::text[], 'Acupuncture & TCM', FALSE, '{"email": "acuavenue@gmail.com", "images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/acupuncture-avenue-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/acupuncture-avenue-google-2.webp"], "rating": 4.9, "reviews": [{"date": "2025-09-18T03:17:57.487245131Z", "text": "I''ve been going to acupuncture on and off for years, mostly to treat anxiety and stress, and I can tell you Peter Yeung is the best acupuncturist I''ve ever been to. He''s technique has made a huge difference in my quality of life. Going to him is the single best thing I''ve ever done for my health. He is kind and a good listener. He takes the time to understand what I need help with. His approach is incredibly effective, and I have had better results than I have ever had with anyone else. I can''t recommend him enough. Be sure to ask about remote treatment too, it really works!", "author": "Dana Pozzi", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104069687292955637821/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-03-20T23:29:43.847117Z", "text": "I’ve been dealing with some stress, hamstring & calf tightness, & heel pain. The office is in a beautiful quiet neighborhood; not too busy or noisy at all. Peter is easygoing yet attentive, compassionate, knowledgeable. I absolutely left the session feeling more peaceful throughout my body & mind. I will definitely be back!", "author": "Anthony Garcia", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112912218245436030831/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-10-11T21:46:53.200267976Z", "text": "I went to Acupuncture Avenue for a cupping session and it was a great experience! I had some pain in my right shoulder from working out with weights.  The cupping session really helped relieve the tension.\n\nPeter was professional and attentive throughout. The session lasted about 15- 20 minutes, with the cups placed around my shoulder and upper back. They felt warm and soothing, and I left feeling lighter and more relaxed.\n\nThe space itself is clean, calm, and welcoming.  The lighting and background music made it easy for me to unwind. I''ll definitely be coming back for another session! Highly recommend Acupuncture Avenue if you''re looking for effective pain relief!", "author": "Kowshik Murali", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109990147551412502269/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-10-01T02:56:13.740251850Z", "text": "10/10! I''ve dealt with Postpartum anxiety and going with Peter has helped significantly. I also deal w/ upper back pain and with his cupping and acupuncture, it has gotten better. I will be back. Great experience and service!", "author": "jasmin ramos", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117749470288055342534/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-09-08T23:58:20.181870870Z", "text": "I came Acupuncture Avenue after being diagnosed with Bell''s Palsy. From the moment I stepped into his office, I felt at ease--the space has a verycalming, Eastern medicine-inspired atmosphere.  Peter took a thorough history, focusing not just on my condition, but on me as a whole, including how and where I carry stress.\n\nAfter seven sessions, my Bell''s Palsy has nearly resolved.  I also felt noticeably lighter and less tense after each treatment. Every session felt personalized, and Peter was always attentive to my comfort--checking in about the temperature, my stress levels and how I was doing. I truly believe his expertise played a major role in my faster-than-expected recovery. I''ve been so pleased with the results that I plan to continue seeking his care even beyond my initial treatments for Bell''s palsy. I highly recommend him.", "author": "Rebecca Guenther", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101869619506997520249/reviews"}], "website": "http://www.acuavenue.com/", "location": {"latitude": 37.302968899999996, "longitude": -121.91505760000001}, "services": ["Acupuncture", "Herbal Medicine", "Cupping"], "insurance": {"notes": "Insurance information is not provided on the main page. The ''Insurance'' section under Patients is linked but not expanded with details.", "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": [], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": false}, "highlights": [{"title": "Licensed Acupuncturist", "detail": "Practice is led by Peter Yeung, LAc, a licensed acupuncturist featured in South China Morning Post and VoyageLA.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Holistic Evaluation", "detail": "Each patient receives a full holistic evaluation including tongue and pulse diagnosis.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Featured in Media", "detail": "Peter Yeung has been featured in South China Morning Post, VoyageLA, and Global Health And Travel.", "category": "reviews"}], "price_tier": "$$", "source_url": "http://www.acuavenue.com/", "appointment": {"booking_note": "Book Now button leads to JaneApp scheduling system.", "appointment_url": "https://acuavenue.janeapp.com/#/staff_member/1", "new_patient_note": "New patients can get started by visiting the Patients page for first treatment instructions.", "phone_booking_available": true, "online_booking_available": true, "free_consultation_available": null}, "open_sunday": false, "scout_query": "Korean clinic in San Jose, CA", "search_text": "acupuncture & tcm | acupuncture | chinese medicine | tcm | herbal medicine | cupping | pain relief | châm cứu | đông y | y học cổ truyền | 한의원 | 침술 | 한약 | 中医 | 针灸 | 中药 | english | cantonese | chinese | 粤语 | 广东话 | tiếng quảng đông | korean | 한국어 | 한인 | 한국말 | peter yeung | licensed acupuncturist (lac)", "google_types": ["consultant", "doctor", "medical_clinic", "health", "point_of_interest", "service", "establishment"], "open_weekend": true, "rating_count": 107, "team_members": [{"name": "Peter Yeung", "role": "Licensed Acupuncturist (LAc)", "bio_snippet": "Peter Yeung is a licensed acupuncturist featured in South China Morning Post, VoyageLA, and Global Health And Travel. He takes a holistic approach to healing, addressing the root cause of ailments.", "languages_spoken": ["English", "Cantonese"]}], "language_note": "Acupuncture Avenue is rooted in Traditional Chinese Medicine (TCM). The provider, Peter Yeung (LAc), writes his name in Chinese characters (楊紹貴) and has been featured in publications such as the South China Morning Post and Global Health And Travel discussing TCM topics like the brain-gut connection and treating insomnia. The practice''s holistic evaluation methods, including tongue diagnosis and pulse reading, reflect an East Asian medical tradition.", "open_saturday": true, "quality_score": 95, "working_hours": {"friday": "9:00 AM – 7:00 PM", "monday": "9:00 AM – 7:00 PM", "sunday": "Closed", "tuesday": "9:00 AM – 7:00 PM", "saturday": "9:00 AM – 12:00 PM", "thursday": "9:00 AM – 7:00 PM", "wednesday": "9:00 AM – 7:00 PM"}, "gallery_images": ["http://acuavenue.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/acuavenue_slider_bg2.png", "http://acuavenue.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/acuavenue_slider3_logo.png", "http://acuavenue.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/acuavenue_acu_insomnia-800x550.jpg", "http://acuavenue.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/acuavenue_acu_lowerback-800x550.jpg", "http://acuavenue.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/acuavenue_acu_neckpain-800x550.jpg", "http://acuavenue.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/acuavenue_acu_stressdepression-800x550.jpg"], "review_profile": {"rating": 4.9, "source": "google", "themes": [{"theme": "Clinical Expertise", "mentions": 5, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Multiple reviewers highlight Peter''s effective techniques and significant improvements in their conditions."}, {"theme": "Staff Professionalism", "mentions": 4, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients describe Peter as kind, attentive, and a good listener who takes time to understand their needs."}, {"theme": "Facility Environment", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "The clinic is noted for its clean, calm, and welcoming atmosphere with soothing lighting and music."}, {"theme": "Treatment Outcomes", "mentions": 5, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Reviewers report noticeable relief from pain, stress, and other conditions after treatments."}, {"theme": "Communication", "mentions": 2, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients appreciate Peter''s thorough history-taking and personalized approach to their care."}], "summary": "Patients consistently praise Peter Yeung for his effective treatments, compassionate approach, and the calming environment of Acupuncture Avenue, with many reporting significant improvements in their conditions.", "review_count": 107, "concern_themes": [], "positive_themes": ["professional", "calming", "effective pain relief", "holistic evaluation", "improved energy"], "featured_reviews": [{"date": "2025-09-18T03:17:57.487245131Z", "text": "I''ve been going to acupuncture on and off for years, mostly to treat anxiety and stress, and I can tell you Peter Yeung is the best acupuncturist I''ve ever been to. He''s technique has made a huge difference in my quality of life. Going to him is the single best thing I''ve ever done for my health. He is kind and a good listener. He takes the time to understand what I need help with. His approach is incredibly effective, and I have had better results than I have ever had with anyone else. I can''t recommend him enough. Be sure to ask about remote treatment too, it really works!", "author": "Dana Pozzi", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104069687292955637821/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-03-20T23:29:43.847117Z", "text": "I’ve been dealing with some stress, hamstring & calf tightness, & heel pain. The office is in a beautiful quiet neighborhood; not too busy or noisy at all. Peter is easygoing yet attentive, compassionate, knowledgeable. I absolutely left the session feeling more peaceful throughout my body & mind. I will definitely be back!", "author": "Anthony Garcia", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112912218245436030831/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-10-11T21:46:53.200267976Z", "text": "I went to Acupuncture Avenue for a cupping session and it was a great experience! I had some pain in my right shoulder from working out with weights.  The cupping session really helped relieve the tension.\n\nPeter was professional and attentive throughout. The session lasted about 15- 20 minutes, with the cups placed around my shoulder and upper back. They felt warm and soothing, and I left feeling lighter and more relaxed.\n\nThe space itself is clean, calm, and welcoming.  The lighting and background music made it easy for me to unwind. I''ll definitely be coming back for another session! Highly recommend Acupuncture Avenue if you''re looking for effective pain relief!", "author": "Kowshik Murali", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109990147551412502269/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-10-01T02:56:13.740251850Z", "text": "10/10! I''ve dealt with Postpartum anxiety and going with Peter has helped significantly. I also deal w/ upper back pain and with his cupping and acupuncture, it has gotten better. I will be back. Great experience and service!", "author": "jasmin ramos", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117749470288055342534/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-09-08T23:58:20.181870870Z", "text": "I came Acupuncture Avenue after being diagnosed with Bell''s Palsy. From the moment I stepped into his office, I felt at ease--the space has a verycalming, Eastern medicine-inspired atmosphere.  Peter took a thorough history, focusing not just on my condition, but on me as a whole, including how and where I carry stress.\n\nAfter seven sessions, my Bell''s Palsy has nearly resolved.  I also felt noticeably lighter and less tense after each treatment. Every session felt personalized, and Peter was always attentive to my comfort--checking in about the temperature, my stress levels and how I was doing. I truly believe his expertise played a major role in my faster-than-expected recovery. I''ve been so pleased with the results that I plan to continue seeking his care even beyond my initial treatments for Bell''s palsy. I highly recommend him.", "author": "Rebecca Guenther", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101869619506997520249/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Patients consistently praise Peter Yeung for his effective treatments, compassionate approach, and the calming environment of Acupuncture Avenue, with many reporting significant improvements in their conditions.", "about_highlight": "Acupuncture Avenue, led by licensed acupuncturist Peter Yeung (LAc), provides holistic healing through traditional Chinese medicine including acupuncture, herbal medicine, and cupping. The practice focuses on realigning mind, body, and spirit by addressing imbalances that manifest as pain, stress, fatigue, and other health concerns. With a philosophy grounded in treating the root cause, Peter offers personalized care that combines ancient wisdom with a compassionate, professional approach to help patients achieve optimal well-being.", "appointment_url": "https://acuavenue.janeapp.com/#/staff_member/1", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=15915149722569371235&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJN-LGm1vDwoARY27nwFn43dw", "quality_missing": ["insurance"], "search_keywords": ["acupuncture & tcm", "acupuncture", "chinese medicine", "tcm", "herbal medicine", "cupping", "pain relief", "châm cứu", "đông y", "y học cổ truyền", "한의원", "침술", "한약", "中医", "针灸", "中药", "english", "cantonese", "chinese", "粤语", "广东话", "tiếng quảng đông", "korean", "한국어", "한인", "한국말", "peter yeung", "licensed acupuncturist (lac)"], "cultural_context": "Acupuncture Avenue is rooted in Traditional Chinese Medicine (TCM). The provider, Peter Yeung (LAc), writes his name in Chinese characters (楊紹貴) and has been featured in publications such as the South China Morning Post and Global Health And Travel discussing TCM topics like the brain-gut connection and treating insomnia. The practice''s holistic evaluation methods, including tongue diagnosis and pulse reading, reflect an East Asian medical tradition.", "services_offered": [{"name": "Acupuncture", "category": "Acupuncture", "description": "A treatment to realign your mind, body, and spirit by unblocking stagnant areas in your body using extremely thin needles.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients with pain, stress, anxiety, fatigue, or overall imbalance."}, {"name": "Herbal Medicine", "category": "Herbal Medicine", "description": "Natural herbal remedies in tablet, powdered, or tinctured form that''s carefully selected to your specific needs.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients seeking natural, internal support for various health conditions."}, {"name": "Cupping", "category": "Cupping", "description": "Releases toxin, lactic acid, and break scar tissues built in your muscles layers. Effective for both emotional and physical detox.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients with muscle tension, scar tissue, or needing detoxification."}], "short_description": "Holistic acupuncture and traditional Chinese medicine practice in San Jose, CA, led by Peter Yeung, LAc.", "google_website_url": "http://www.acuavenue.com/", "google_primary_type": "Medical Clinic", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": ["Peter Yeung"], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "accepting_new_patients": true, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "1685 Westwood Dr Ste 9, San Jose, CA 95125, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/112912218245436030831", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK2e1i8ldTBC1PMt6AT0RFO_DN8GQktHMEoW9E5L_i1JPqjJg=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Anthony Garcia"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/107843506130618338474", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWf3sDntIUhImTVhx6hSKCEDPm_czk-zxeXu5rb81UW4hsnG5U=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Acupuncture Avenue"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-25T20:21:04.893424+00:00', 'acupuncture-avenue', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('572b66fa-aa9d-4ba2-ae41-1dc10096f67c', NULL, 'Progressive Medical Clinic', 'Progressive Medical Clinic has been proudly serving Southeast Houston since 1985. We are a group of independent physicians dedicated to providing the best quality care to our patients. We are currently accepting new patients and accept Medicare and most insurances. Affordable pricing is available for cash/self-paying patients. We offer vaccines, including school and college required shots. For our patients'' convenience, we offer complimentary valet parking and have an in-office lab station.', '11920 Astoria Blvd #110, Houston, TX 77089', 'Houston', 'TX', '77089', '(281) 481-8878', ARRAY['English', 'Vietnamese']::text[], 'Cardiology', FALSE, '{"images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/progressive-medical-clinic.webp"], "rating": 4.4, "pricing": [{"name": "Self-Pay Pricing", "notes": "Affordable pricing available for cash/self-paying patients.", "price": null, "category": "self-pay", "price_range": null}], "reviews": [{"date": "2025-10-23T19:42:16.479054308Z", "text": "Progressive Medical Clinic, all the doctors and staff are wonderful and very knowlegeable.  I thank God for them.  They have definitely increased my quality of life. I have always been treated very nicely and they have always accommodated me.  I highly recommend them.", "author": "Cecelia Lund", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101504849719787265896/reviews"}, {"date": "2022-01-01T03:39:43.073412Z", "text": "I don''t recommend this clinic because of staff''s attitudes! I have no complains about Dr. Tai and Dr. Khanh-Trang. They were wonderful! However, some of the staffs there were awful! There are better clinics in Bellaire if you can drive. Unfortunately, it''s one of a few Vietnamese clinics in this area, so my parents have no better choices.\n\nOn Dec. 30, I felt really sick as my ears were in pain. I came to the office at 8:40ish and was turned away by a nurse because I needed a negative COVID test result even though I was fully vaccinated. It took me until 2pm the same day to get a negative test result. Guess what! I called and the same nurse told me that Dr. Tai didn''t do walk-in that day because of COVID. I came to another clinic in Bellaire and they didn''t even ask me for the COVID test. All they care was I was sick, and I needed to see a doctor ASAP. I got even more sick because of running around to find a place that had result in a day. The nurse should have told me that they didn''t accept walk-in when I was there in the morning. I wasted my time and energy for nothing!!!\n\nThis is not the only bad experience I have. In 2016, my sister and I came for HPV vaccine. I asked if they offered the vaccine there. A nurse told us that there was no such vaccine in the world. We left and got the HPV vaccine from Dr. Bich Nguyen''s clinic. It was funny because she was a nurse and did not even know about HPV vaccine.\n\nIn summary, if you don''t want your blood pressure to go up, go somewhere else.", "author": "Kate Nguyen", "rating": 2, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108319054518084219284/reviews"}, {"date": "2023-07-28T17:49:20.293252Z", "text": "I have ben going to this clinic for years, I just realized I have not done a review. My entire family also goes to Progressive. The care we have received is top notch. I highly recommend.", "author": "L Landers", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104573866327530254670/reviews"}, {"date": "2022-02-15T17:02:46.691902Z", "text": "Fatima at the front desk is awesome. Always very helpful and cordial.", "author": "Janet C", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115187770361181303873/reviews"}], "website": "http://www.progmd.com/", "location": {"latitude": 29.5836707, "longitude": -95.2060589}, "services": ["Vaccines"], "insurance": {"notes": "Medicare and most insurances accepted; affordable pricing for self-pay.", "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": true, "accepted_networks": ["Medicare"], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": true}, "highlights": [{"title": "Established Since 1985", "detail": "Proudly serving Southeast Houston since 1985.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Accepts Medicare & Most Insurance", "detail": "Medicare and most insurances accepted.", "category": "insurance"}, {"title": "Affordable Self-Pay Pricing", "detail": "Affordable pricing available for cash/self-paying patients.", "category": "pricing"}, {"title": "Complimentary Valet Parking", "detail": "Complimentary valet parking available.", "category": "convenience"}, {"title": "In-Office Lab Station", "detail": "Lab station located in the office for patient convenience.", "category": "convenience"}, {"title": "Vaccines Available", "detail": "Vaccines including school/college required shots available.", "category": "services"}], "price_tier": "$$", "source_url": "http://www.progmd.com/", "appointment": {"booking_note": null, "appointment_url": null, "new_patient_note": "We are accepting new patients.", "phone_booking_available": null, "online_booking_available": false, "free_consultation_available": null}, "open_sunday": false, "scout_query": "Vietnamese cardiologist in Houston, TX", "search_text": "cardiology | cardiologist | heart doctor | ekg | blood pressure | tim mạch | bác sĩ tim | 심장내과 | 心脏科 | 心血管 | english | vietnamese | tiếng việt | người việt | bác sĩ việt | vaccines | preventive | medicare | tai n. nguyen, m.d., j.d. | physician | khanh-trang t. nguyen, m.d. | bich nguyen, m.d. | hung le, m.d. | dongchau nguyen, m.d.", "google_types": ["medical_clinic", "doctor", "health", "point_of_interest", "establishment"], "open_weekend": false, "rating_count": 5, "team_members": [{"name": "Tai N. Nguyen, M.D., J.D.", "role": "Physician", "bio_snippet": null, "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Khanh-Trang T. Nguyen, M.D.", "role": "Physician", "bio_snippet": null, "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Bich Nguyen, M.D.", "role": "Physician", "bio_snippet": null, "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Hung Le, M.D.", "role": "Physician", "bio_snippet": null, "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "DongChau Nguyen, M.D.", "role": "Physician", "bio_snippet": null, "languages_spoken": []}], "open_saturday": false, "quality_score": 98, "working_hours": {"friday": "8:00 AM – 12:00 PM, 1:00 – 5:00 PM", "monday": "8:00 AM – 12:00 PM, 1:00 – 5:00 PM", "sunday": "Closed", "tuesday": "8:00 AM – 12:00 PM, 1:00 – 5:00 PM", "saturday": "Closed", "thursday": "8:00 AM – 12:00 PM, 1:00 – 5:00 PM", "wednesday": "8:00 AM – 12:00 PM, 1:00 – 5:00 PM"}, "review_profile": {"rating": 4.4, "source": "google", "themes": [{"theme": "Friendly staff", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients highlight friendly staff in their feedback."}, {"theme": "Strong results", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients highlight strong results in their feedback."}], "summary": "Progressive Medical Clinic has a 4.4 star Google rating from 5 Google reviews. Patients commonly mention friendly staff, strong results.", "review_count": 5, "concern_themes": [], "positive_themes": [], "featured_reviews": [{"date": "2025-10-23T19:42:16.479054308Z", "text": "Progressive Medical Clinic, all the doctors and staff are wonderful and very knowlegeable.  I thank God for them.  They have definitely increased my quality of life. I have always been treated very nicely and they have always accommodated me.  I highly recommend them.", "author": "Cecelia Lund", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101504849719787265896/reviews"}, {"date": "2022-01-01T03:39:43.073412Z", "text": "I don''t recommend this clinic because of staff''s attitudes! I have no complains about Dr. Tai and Dr. Khanh-Trang. They were wonderful! However, some of the staffs there were awful! There are better clinics in Bellaire if you can drive. Unfortunately, it''s one of a few Vietnamese clinics in this area, so my parents have no better choices.\n\nOn Dec. 30, I felt really sick as my ears were in pain. I came to the office at 8:40ish and was turned away by a nurse because I needed a negative COVID test result even though I was fully vaccinated. It took me until 2pm the same day to get a negative test result. Guess what! I called and the same nurse told me that Dr. Tai didn''t do walk-in that day because of COVID. I came to another clinic in Bellaire and they didn''t even ask me for the COVID test. All they care was I was sick, and I needed to see a doctor ASAP. I got even more sick because of running around to find a place that had result in a day. The nurse should have told me that they didn''t accept walk-in when I was there in the morning. I wasted my time and energy for nothing!!!\n\nThis is not the only bad experience I have. In 2016, my sister and I came for HPV vaccine. I asked if they offered the vaccine there. A nurse told us that there was no such vaccine in the world. We left and got the HPV vaccine from Dr. Bich Nguyen''s clinic. It was funny because she was a nurse and did not even know about HPV vaccine.\n\nIn summary, if you don''t want your blood pressure to go up, go somewhere else.", "author": "Kate Nguyen", "rating": 2, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108319054518084219284/reviews"}, {"date": "2023-07-28T17:49:20.293252Z", "text": "I have ben going to this clinic for years, I just realized I have not done a review. My entire family also goes to Progressive. The care we have received is top notch. I highly recommend.", "author": "L Landers", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104573866327530254670/reviews"}, {"date": "2022-02-15T17:02:46.691902Z", "text": "Fatima at the front desk is awesome. Always very helpful and cordial.", "author": "Janet C", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115187770361181303873/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Progressive Medical Clinic has a 4.4 star Google rating from 5 Google reviews. Patients commonly mention friendly staff, strong results.", "about_highlight": "Progressive Medical Clinic has been proudly serving Southeast Houston since 1985. We are a group of independent physicians dedicated to providing the best quality care to our patients. We are currently accepting new patients and accept Medicare and most insurances. Affordable pricing is available for cash/self-paying patients. We offer vaccines, including school and college required shots. For our patients'' convenience, we offer complimentary valet parking and have an in-office lab station.", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=3803924508723833111&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJB0tHQhiaQIYRF-nixi9ByjQ", "quality_missing": ["appointment_url"], "search_keywords": ["cardiology", "cardiologist", "heart doctor", "ekg", "blood pressure", "tim mạch", "bác sĩ tim", "심장내과", "心脏科", "心血管", "english", "vietnamese", "tiếng việt", "người việt", "bác sĩ việt", "vaccines", "preventive", "medicare", "tai n. nguyen, m.d., j.d.", "physician", "khanh-trang t. nguyen, m.d.", "bich nguyen, m.d.", "hung le, m.d.", "dongchau nguyen, m.d."], "services_offered": [{"name": "Vaccines", "category": "Preventive", "description": "Vaccines including school/college required shots.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}], "short_description": "Independent physicians providing quality care serving Southeast Houston since 1985. Accepting new patients, Medicare, and most insurances.", "google_website_url": "http://www.progmd.com/", "insurance_accepted": ["Medicare"], "google_primary_type": "Medical Clinic", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": ["Tai N. Nguyen, M.D., J.D.", "Khanh-Trang T. Nguyen, M.D.", "Bich Nguyen, M.D.", "Hung Le, M.D.", "DongChau Nguyen, M.D."], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "accepting_new_patients": true, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "11920 Astoria Blvd #110, Houston, TX 77089, USA"}'::jsonb, '2026-06-26T13:33:58.954628+00:00', 'progressive-medical-clinic', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('10b3cc4c-3d9c-4eab-8b4e-ff157476e2f3', NULL, 'We Smile Dental Cheng Wang DMD 微笑牙科 王成牙医博士', 'We Smile Dental, led by Dr. Cheng Wang DMD, provides comprehensive family dentistry in a warm and soothing environment. The office features cozy décor and thoughtful design to make every visit stress-free. The friendly and knowledgeable staff are always available to answer questions and ensure patients feel confident and informed about their dental care.', '8516 Bellaire Blvd, Houston, TX 77036', 'Houston', 'TX', '77036', '832-831-4956', ARRAY['Chinese', 'English']::text[], 'Dental', FALSE, '{"images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/we-smile-dental-cheng-wang-dmd-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/we-smile-dental-cheng-wang-dmd-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/we-smile-dental-cheng-wang-dmd-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/we-smile-dental-cheng-wang-dmd-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/we-smile-dental-cheng-wang-dmd-google-5.webp"], "rating": 4.8, "reviews": [{"date": "2026-02-13T15:13:57.962158074Z", "text": "I highly recommend We Smile Dental Cheng Wang DMD!\n\nDr. Cheng Wang is extremely professional, knowledgeable, and patient. He takes the time to clearly explain every treatment option and makes sure you feel comfortable and informed throughout the entire process. His attention to detail and gentle technique truly set him apart.\n\nThe office is clean, modern, and well-organized, and the staff is always friendly and welcoming. From routine cleanings to more complex procedures, the experience has consistently been smooth and stress-free.\n\nIf you''re looking for a trustworthy and skilled dentist who genuinely cares about his patients, I highly recommend Dr. Wang and his team.", "author": "Shirley Yao", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100420946993262817394/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-13T16:46:10.196407377Z", "text": "Came in for a routine cleaning and checkup and everything went smoothly. The hygienist was very gentle and detailed, and the dentist took time to review my teeth and answer questions without rushing. The office is clean, organized, and professional.\nIt’s easy to schedule appointments and the overall experience is always consistent. I’m glad I found this dental office and will keep coming back.", "author": "Ra Zi", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114930846678295508011/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-29T16:18:42.626957008Z", "text": "The dentist was professional, knowledgeable, and very gentle throughout the entire visit. The staff were also friendly and helpful, and the office was clean and organized. Highly recommend this dentist to anyone looking for quality dental care.", "author": "Chao Zhao", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115438339970708428778/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-24T17:01:43.550793658Z", "text": "Dr. Wang is a highly professional and compassionate physician. He goes beyond simply treating the condition—he truly cares about his patients’ overall well-being. His clinic is equipped with the latest technology, providing efficient, precise, and high-quality medical care. He also gives patients a comprehensive understanding of their overall oral health, ensuring they see the full picture rather than just a single issue. I highly recommend him to anyone seeking excellent treatment and attentive service.", "author": "Laura Wang", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115052823685985193351/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-14T17:29:18.713976447Z", "text": "Dr. Wang is the only Chinese dentist I go to. He explained all my questions to me very patiently and meticulously. He also didn''t try to get me to pay extra for unnecessary procedures. I''ve already booked my next teeth cleaning appointment, and my family and I will be going with him.", "author": "Xinyue Wu", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105780287473526444891/reviews"}], "website": "http://wesmiledentalhouston.com/", "location": {"latitude": 29.7059151, "longitude": -95.5350105}, "services": ["Preventive Care", "Oral Surgery", "Restorative Dentistry", "Cosmetic Dentistry", "Periodontal Services"], "insurance": {"notes": "Insurance information not mentioned on the page. Patients are encouraged to contact the office for details.", "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": [], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": false}, "highlights": [{"title": "Comprehensive Family Care", "detail": "Offers preventive, restorative, cosmetic, oral surgery, and periodontal services for the whole family.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Soothing Atmosphere", "detail": "Office features warm colors and cozy décor to create a stress-free experience.", "category": "convenience"}, {"title": "Bilingual Support (Chinese)", "detail": "Website available in Chinese, indicating Chinese-language accessibility for staff or materials.", "category": "culture"}, {"title": "Friendly & Knowledgeable Staff", "detail": "Staff are available to answer questions and ensure patients feel informed.", "category": "access"}], "price_tier": "$$", "source_url": "