, wellness exams, and urgent visits, ensuring personalized attention in a culturally respectful environment. They proudly serve the Latino community with quality healthcare that prioritizes health, trust, and convenience, offering over 200 services and medical procedures including an onsite lab and minor surgeries.", "appointment_url": "http://clinicamundolatino.com/#Appointment", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=18110324855489931380&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJRxauX9vDQIYRdKhn4oDMVPs", "quality_missing": ["insurance", "team_members"], "search_keywords": ["primary care", "family doctor", "general practitioner", "annual physical", "checkup", "bác sĩ gia đình", "khám tổng quát", "nội khoa", "내과", "가정의학과", "家庭医生", "全科医生", "内科", "english", "spanish", "korean", "한국어", "한인", "한국말", "primary family doctor", "follow-up care", "minor surgeries", "preventive exams", "laboratory tests & diagnosis", "weight loss & vitamin shots", "dot/cdl exams", "chronic care", "minor surgery", "preventive", "lab services", "wellness", "physical exams"], "cultural_context": "The clinic proudly serves the Latino community with a bilingual team and culturally respectful environment.", "services_offered": [{"name": "Primary Family Doctor", "category": "Primary Care", "description": "Comprehensive primary care, chronic disease treatments, wellness exams, vaccines, and weight management.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Individuals and families"}, {"name": "Follow-up Care", "category": "Chronic Care", "description": "Diagnosis and treatment of diabetes & hypertension. Levels of cholesterol and glucose.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Minor Surgeries", "category": "Minor Surgery", "description": "Wart resection, wound sutures, drainage of abscesses.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Preventive Exams", "category": "Preventive", "description": "Pelvic and Pap smear exams, family planning and contraceptive methods.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Women"}, {"name": "Laboratory Tests & Diagnosis", "category": "Lab Services", "description": "Prostate blood test, pregnancy tests, blood tests and metabolic panel, thyroid function tests.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Weight Loss & Vitamin Shots", "category": "Wellness", "description": "Comprehensive weight loss programs. Vitamin shots to hydrate the body, combat fatigue, strengthen the immune system, improve skin and many others.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "DOT/CDL Exams", "category": "Physical Exams", "description": "DOT/CDL physical exams. Plus immigration and school physical exams.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Truck drivers, immigrants, students"}], "short_description": "A bilingual primary care clinic serving the Latino community in Houston with compassionate, affordable, and accessible healthcare services.", "google_website_url": "http://clinicamundolatino.com/", "google_primary_type": "Medical Clinic", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": [], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "5945 Bellaire Blvd Ste F, Houston, TX 77081, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/113243015237374301243", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWS9RWM7jysXxXL4Xy9LY0FEkUFUmXprNcJRU2xeaWMKsfhTzg=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Clínica Médica Mundo Latino"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/113243015237374301243", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWS9RWM7jysXxXL4Xy9LY0FEkUFUmXprNcJRU2xeaWMKsfhTzg=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Clínica Médica Mundo Latino"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/113243015237374301243", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleuse