. 🤍", "author": "Stephanie Álvarez", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112612859975663851913/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Overall, patients report positive experiences with compassionate and professional staff, though some mention long wait times and isolated incidents of concerning care.", "about_highlight": "Medical City Dallas is an 899-bed, acute care hospital with a medical team of more than 1,500 providers, many of whom are top experts in their fields. The hospital offers nearly 100 specialties, including world-class programs for heart and vascular, brain and spine, women''s services, orthopedics, transplant (heart, kidney and pancreas), cancer, bariatrics and robotic surgery. Our hospital is committed to offering advanced healthcare services with a compassionate, patient-focused approach in the Dallas-Fort Worth area.", "appointment_url": "https://www.medicalcityhealthcare.com/patient-resources/register-online", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=15850273575153040346&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJydUThmwgTIYR2vvBl9Z799s", "quality_missing": ["insurance", "team_members"], "search_keywords": ["hospital", "english", "vietnamese", "tiếng việt", "người việt", "bác sĩ việt", "emergency care", "heart and vascular", "cancer services", "robotic surgery", "transplant services", "women''s care", "pediatric care", "cardiology", "diagnostics and laboratory", "gastroenterology", "imaging services", "inpatient physical rehabilitation", "liver disease", "nephrology", "neurological care", "orthopedic care", "pulmonary care", "spine care", "surgery", "urology", "weight loss surgery", "wound care", "emergency", "oncology", "transplant", "pediatric", "diagnostics", "imaging", "rehabilitation", "neurology", "orthopedics", "pulmonary", "spine", "bariatrics"], "services_offered": [{"name": "Emergency Care", "category": "Emergency", "description": "When it''s an emergency, experts at Medical City Dallas are dedicated to getting you from assessment to treatment and back to life faster.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Heart and Vascular", "category": "Cardiology", "description": "Thanks to our world-class facility, many patients are living longer, happier, and healthier lives.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Cancer Services", "category": "Oncology", "description": "Medical City Dallas detects and treats all kinds of cancer in its state-of-the-art facility. Our care teams are focused on providing a calming and secure environment.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Robotic Surgery", "category": "Surgery", "description": "The physicians and staff at Texas Institute for Robotic Surgery at Medical City are pioneers in performing minimally invasive surgery.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Transplant Services", "category": "Transplant", "description": "The kidney transplant and pancreas transplant programs at Medical City Dallas have been certified as approved transplant programs since 1998.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Women''s Care", "category": "Women''s Care", "description": "Medical City Healthcare offers high-quality women''s services in the Dallas-Fort Worth area with a mission of helping women achieve optimal health through every stage of life.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Pediatric Care", "category": "Pediatric", "description": "Medical City Children''s Hospital is an award-winning pediatric hospital offering comprehensive, specialized services including pediatric emergency care.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Children"}, {"name": "Cardiology", "category": "Cardiology", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Diagnostics and Laboratory", "category": "Diagnostics", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Gastroenterology", "category": "Gastroenterology", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Imaging Services", "category": "Imaging", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Inpatient Physical Rehabilitation", "category": "Rehabilitation", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Liver Disease", "category": "Gastroenterology", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Nephrology", "category": "Nephrology", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Neurological Care", "category": "Neurology", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Orthopedic Care", "category": "Orthopedics", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Pulmonary Care", "category": "Pulmonary", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Spine Care", "category": "Spine", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Surgery", "category": "Surgery", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Urology", "category": "Urology", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Weight Loss Surgery", "category": "Bariatrics", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Wound Care", "category": "Wound Care", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}], "short_description": "Medical City Dallas is an 899-bed, acute care hospital with a medical team of more than 1,500 providers, many of whom are top experts in their fields.", "google_website_url": "https://www.medicalcityhealthcare.com/locations/medical-city-dallas-hospital?utm_campaign=corp_listings_mgmt&utm_source=google&utm_medium=business_listing", "google_primary_type": "Hospital", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": [], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "7777 Forest Ln, Dallas, TX 75230, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/114235450924926375339", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUxlVvPuQPCB4SW0Xa3rtVV5gz_HskmvNoNFRJFJQy7zF-bIR82=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Medical City Dallas Hospital"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/114235450924926375339", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUxlVvPuQPCB4SW0Xa3rtVV5gz_HskmvNoNFRJFJQy7zF-bIR82=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Medical City Dallas Hospital"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/100957192245891664431", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXsgO_tAmQntzzEFJ5pEGPXbJ9l6OknMqr4b-eu1YBwzsDjVWk=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Bishwas Sharma"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/108832769285652152368", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU2mEGxTmeI7h_JEJP4hMBQhoN8NJy2rmIkX8ABHeJHyTyCzHdp=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Minh Thu"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/108832769285652152368", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU2mEGxTmeI7h_JEJP4hMBQhoN8NJy2rmIkX8ABHeJHyTyCzHdp=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Minh Thu"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-25T20:41:21.000182+00:00', 'medical-city-dallas-hospital', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('92851b3a-df8f-411c-b216-a82e9bfc25b1', NULL, 'Acupuncture & Integrative Medical Center Irving / Dallas', 'Acupuncture & Integrative Medical Center (AIMC) serves the Irving, Dallas, and Mesquite areas with a focus on natural, whole-body healing through acupuncture, herbal medicine, and integrative therapies. The team, with over 60 years of combined Eastern Medicine experience, emphasizes finding and treating the root cause of health issues rather than just managing symptoms. By supporting nervous system regulation and cellular healing, they aim to restore balance and improve overall well-being through customized, compassionate care.', '1320 W Walnut Hill Ln, Irving, Texas 75038', 'Irving', 'TX', '75038', '972.444.0660', ARRAY['English', 'Spanish', 'Chinese']::text[], 'Acupuncture & TCM', FALSE, '{"email": "info@drchapa.com", "images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/acupuncture-integrative-medical-center-irving-dallas-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/acupuncture-integrative-medical-center-irving-dallas-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/acupuncture-integrative-medical-center-irving-dallas-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/acupuncture-integrative-medical-center-irving-dallas-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/acupuncture-integrative-medical-center-irving-dallas-google-5.webp"], "rating": 4.7, "reviews": [{"date": "2025-10-05T19:17:31.228251647Z", "text": "This was our 2nd time to see miss Amber in her massage studio, she’s so sweet and listens, she’s very professional and helpful. Also very respectful and knowledgeable. Very passionate about her work. We love her! Will definitely continue to see her for our needs.\nPrices are excellent as well! I highly recommend!\n\nThis wonderful place is called Wellness Head Quarters, located INSIDE the acupuncture building.", "author": "Tricia Harrison", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111381999018431786184/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-19T20:21:21.780646977Z", "text": "Very highly recommend Dr Chapa and his staff. I came in almost 4 months ago, experiencing between 15-20 migraine days per month. A year of working with a neurologist had gotten the pain somewhat manageable, but the associated symptoms, heavy medications and life disruption was untenable. Dr Chapa began aggressive treatment including frequent acupuncture, dietary/lifestyle changes, a cleanse and herbs. I followed his recommendations closely and can say that it has made a huge difference! As of today, I am 60 days migraine free and feeling better than I have in a long time. I am still under his care, and am so thankful to have found someone with the knowledge and insight to help me heal.", "author": "Debbie Blackwell", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108824816341920978573/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-09-25T21:45:45.315030793Z", "text": "Dr. Chapa was heaven sent, he’s such an amazing doctor that actually listens to you. He’s patient and takes time to listen to your needs. He told me I would get better before Thanksgiving, and in 2 weeks I felt 75% better than when I walked in. I have lupus & fibromyalgia in which I am no longer taking prescription medication and only taking the herbs Dr. Chapa suggested. I wish I had gone to him a lot sooner, but I’m happy I did. I highly recommend him and his entire staff to make you feel better.", "author": "Claudia Wells", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109017345790148184414/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-30T19:16:40.349334535Z", "text": "I do not like businesses that do not do their due diligence in contacting potential customers and responding to inquiries. I’ve been calling to schedule an appointment since FEBRUARY because my partner purchased me Groupon for Valentines Day and they have quite literally NEVER called me back. I drove all the way to Irving todqy to schedule my appointment in person and they close at 3 I arrived at 2 and their does were already locked. Overall very unprofessional.", "author": "marcella ras", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106043830437420417903/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-07-31T18:10:10.584342772Z", "text": "This is my first time ever with accupunture and holistic health and Dr Chapa was so personable. He explained the science of holistic medicine and treatment. He was very detailed and thorough with my issues and concerns. He made sure I understood the journey I will take and how much it can cost so there''s no surprises.  I feel very excited and hopeful to continue. Great first impression!", "author": "monica aguirre", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116822131007988449208/reviews"}], "website": "https://aimcdfw.com/", "location": {"latitude": 32.8846092, "longitude": -96.9712295}, "services": ["Acupuncture", "Herbal Medicine", "Naturopathic Medicine", "Dry Needling", "Non-Needle Therapies", "Cupping", "Nervous System Regulation & Cellular Healing", "Weight Loss", "Better Sleep", "Increase Energy", "Focus & Memory", "Boost Immunity", "Enhance Mood", "Pain Relief", "Anti-Aging", "Stress Management"], "insurance": {"notes": "Insurance information is not mentioned on the 