u, patient and takes time to listen to your needs.", "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Dr. Chang", "role": "Acupuncturist", "bio_snippet": "Awesome, amazing things for herniated disc and sciatica pain.", "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Dr. Carlos", "role": "Physician / Herbalist", "bio_snippet": "Incredible help in many stages of life, guided with great care during pregnancy and prepared special herbal cream for burn.", "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Amber", "role": "Massage Therapist", "bio_snippet": "Sweet, listens, very professional and helpful, respectful and knowledgeable, passionate about her work.", "languages_spoken": []}], "language_note": "Our dedicated experts have trained in China, Korea, & Japan. The team brings combined experience in Eastern and Oriental Medicine. The clinic offers services in Spanish (ESPAÑOL).", "open_saturday": true, "quality_score": 95, "working_hours": {"friday": "9:00 AM – 3:00 PM", "monday": "9:00 AM – 6:00 PM", "sunday": "Closed", "tuesday": "9:00 AM – 6:00 PM", "saturday": "9:00 AM – 3:00 PM", "thursday": "10:00 AM – 4:00 PM", "wednesday": "9:00 AM – 6:00 PM"}, "gallery_images": ["https://aimcdfw.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/AIMC-MENU-PHONE-EMAIL.png", "https://aimcdfw.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/AIMC_horizontal-350x74.png", "https://aimcdfw.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/AIMCDFW-Acupuncture-Holistic-Treatments-and-Herbal-Medicine-.jpg"], "review_profile": {"rating": 4.7, "source": "google", "themes": [{"theme": "Staff Professionalism", "mentions": 4, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Multiple reviewers highlight the staff''s professionalism, kindness, and expertise, particularly praising Dr. Chapa and Amber."}, {"theme": "Treatment Outcomes", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients report significant health improvements, including reduced migraines and better management of chronic conditions like lupus and fibromyalgia."}, {"theme": "Communication", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Reviewers appreciate the thorough explanations and personalized care, with Dr. Chapa taking time to listen and explain treatment plans."}, {"theme": "Facility Environment", "mentions": 1, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "One reviewer mentions the excellent prices and the welcoming atmosphere of the Wellness Head Quarters within the clinic."}, {"theme": "Appointment Scheduling", "mentions": 1, "sentiment": "Negative", "summary_quote": "A negative review criticizes the clinic for unresponsiveness and difficulty in scheduling appointments, calling it unprofessional."}], "summary": "Most patients highly praise the clinic for its professional and knowledgeable staff, particularly Dr. Chapa and Amber, noting significant improvements in their health conditions. However, one review highlights issues with appointment scheduling and responsiveness.", "review_count": 179, "concern_themes": [], "positive_themes": ["Pain relief", "Friendly staff", "Effective treatment", "Caring providers"], "featured_reviews": [{"date": "2025-10-05T19:17:31.228251647Z", "text": "This was our 2nd time to see miss Amber in her massage studio, she’s so sweet and listens, she’s very professional and helpful. Also very respectful and knowledgeable. Very passionate about her work. We love her! Will definitely continue to see her for our needs.\nPrices are excellent as well! I highly recommend!\n\nThis wonderful place is called Wellness Head Quarters, located INSIDE the acupuncture building.", "author": "Tricia Harrison", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111381999018431786184/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-19T20:21:21.780646977Z", "text": "Very highly recommend Dr Chapa and his staff. I came in almost 4 months ago, experiencing between 15-20 migraine days per month. A year of working with a neurologist had gotten the pain somewhat manageable, but the associated symptoms, heavy medications and life disruption was un