rapies.", "languages_spoken": ["English", "Chinese"]}], "language_note": "The practice serves a diverse patient base, with the website available in English and Chinese (中文), reflecting a commitment to language accessibility for Asian and immigrant communities in San Francisco.", "open_saturday": false, "quality_score": 95, "working_hours": {"friday": "9:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "monday": "9:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "sunday": "Closed", "tuesday": "9:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "saturday": "Closed", "thursday": "9:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "wednesday": "9:00 AM – 12:00 PM"}, "gallery_images": ["https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1601276174812-63280a55656e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=328&h=197%20328w"], "review_profile": {"rating": 4.6, "source": "google", "themes": [{"theme": "Compassionate care", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients highlight compassionate care in their feedback."}, {"theme": "Clear explanations", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients highlight clear explanations in their feedback."}, {"theme": "Strong results", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients highlight strong results in their feedback."}], "summary": "Joy Meng, MD has a 4.6 star Google rating from 108 Google reviews. Patients commonly mention compassionate care, clear explanations, strong results.", "review_count": 108, "concern_themes": [], "positive_themes": [], "featured_reviews": [{"date": "2026-02-06T23:54:00.130103365Z", "text": "My dad is Dr. Meng''s patient for a long time. My family appreciate Dr. Meng''s tender. loving and caring care in my dad''s Parkinson fighting journey.", "author": "Stephanie Wong", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105700351537060156385/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-04-17T16:49:34.228339467Z", "text": "Been a patios of Dr Mung for years now. She speak mandarin English and some Cantonese. Also Tiffany and Mr Chen is wonderful to work with and they both are gluten in Cantonese", "author": "Peter Wong", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107761762168302760317/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-01T22:46:43.064872258Z", "text": "Dr. Meng is very professional and helpful. She is very detailed oriented and supportive.", "author": "Towkuk Wong", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105166466047727900559/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-24T16:43:15.600248932Z", "text": "Dr. Meng and Tiffany helped my sleep problem really a lot! So greatful😀", "author": "Em Tang", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116148914570277980158/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-04-23T18:36:23.791111638Z", "text": "First time seeing Dr. Meng.  Very patient  and provided good recommendations.", "author": "Tiffany Wu", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103906027459745567914/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Joy Meng, MD has a 4.6 star Google rating from 108 Google reviews. Patients commonly mention compassionate care, clear explanations, strong results.", "about_highlight": "San Francisco Neurology and Sleep Center, led by Dr. Joy Meng, provides expert neurology and sleep services in San Francisco with a focus on brain health, sleep disorders, and advanced treatments like Exomind TMS and Botox for migraines. The center offers a whole-person approach through its Brain Health Program, integrating modern digital cognitive testing and personalized wellness plans. Dr. Meng''s practice is bilingual, serving English and Chinese-speaking patients, and emphasizes proactive care with services such as home sleep tests and cognitive baselines.", "appointment_url": "https://www.sf-neurology.com/contact", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=3290542407974437970&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJfUmqsoyAhYARUsSs0eJaqi0", "quality_missing": ["insurance"], "search_keywords": ["neurology", "english", "chinese", "mandarin", "cantonese", "中文", "普通话", "国语", "粤语", "广东话", "华人", "neurology services", "sleep services", "exomind™ tms", "botox for migraines", "brain health program", "wellness & beauty", "fullscript dispensary", "digital cognitive testing", "sleep medicine", "neuromodulation", "preventive", "wellness", "diagnostic", "joy meng, md", "physician"], "cultural_context": "The practice serves a diverse patient base, with the website available in English and Chinese (中文), reflecting a commitment to language accessibility for Asian and immigrant communities in San Francisco.", "services_offered": [{"name": "Neurology Services", "category": "Neurology", "description": "Expert neurological evaluations and treatments for various conditions.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Sleep Services", "category": "Sleep Medicine", "description": "Diagnosis and treatment of sleep disorders, including home sleep tests.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Exomind™ TMS", "category": "Neuromodulation", "description": "Advanced, noninvasive brain-stimulation technology for mood, focus, and mental wellness.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Botox for Migraines", "category": "Neurology", "description": "FDA-approved Botox injections for migraine relief.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Brain Health Program", "category": "Preventive", "description": "Whole-person approach to cognitive wellness integrating advanced neurology and digital cognitive testing.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Wellness & Beauty", "category": "Wellness", "description": "Services aimed at overall wellness and aesthetic improvements.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Fullscript Dispensary", "category": "Wellness", "description": "Personalized wellness platform for supplements and brain health support.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Digital Cognitive Testing", "category": "Diagnostic", "description": "Accurate, repeatable cognitive assessments for establishing baselines and monitoring brain health.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}], "short_description": "Joy Meng, MD, offers expert neurology and sleep services in San Francisco with a bilingual English-Chinese practice, providing advanced treatments like Exomind TMS and Botox for migraines.", "google_website_url": "https://www.sf-neurology.com/", "google_primary_type": "Doctor", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": ["Joy Meng, MD"], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "950 Stockton St Ste 206, San Francisco, CA 94108, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/112722293736555516887", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXUciOYNOsdTYjI3_DGuV49K6iVYM9heMQx9NleVndCkrJAOrk=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Joy Meng, MD"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/112722293736555516887", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXUciOYNOsdTYjI3_DGuV49K6iVYM9heMQx9NleVndCkrJAOrk=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Joy Meng, MD"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/107261580120011494639", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUfk2vbvlDzNmi79m15R4msu_tFuXO4tHrnJ7xwRynAnNMbCg-1=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Cecil"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/109497038304930581620", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX139TxHB-TjNPkMUstIbrSM1_3Q-d_ET45Cl0B7uwU-c7VZfVDZA=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "kelly Zeng"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/107261580120011494639", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUfk2vbvlDzNmi79m15R4msu_tFuXO4tHrnJ7xwRynAnNMbCg-1=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Cecil"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-25T19:38:06.054683+00:00', 'joy-meng-md', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('c3fa98a2-33fe-45d2-bdf5-ee15d42a5941', NULL, 'Parkland Health', 'Parkland Health is the public health system for Dallas County, serving as the foundation for a healthy Dallas since 1894. With a mission rooted in care, compassion, and community, Parkland provides expert medical services at its state-of-the-art main campus and through 16 neighborhood-based primary care health centers and mobile medical vans. The system is committed to the health and well-being of every patient, offering a full spectrum of specialty care including a verified Level I Trauma Center, a comprehensive Burn Center, Women and Infants'' Specialty Health, and a leading kidney transplant program. Parkland''s team of dedicated professionals delivers compassionate, culturally responsive care, supported by amenities such as an on-site cafe and a wellness garden, all designed with the patient in mind.', '5200 Harry Hines Blvd., Dallas, TX 75235', 'Dallas', 'TX', '75235', '(214) 590-8000', ARRAY['English', 'Spanish', 'Vietnamese']::text[], 'Hospital', TRUE, '{"images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/parkland-health-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/parkland-health-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/parkland-health-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/parkland-health-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/parkland-health-google-5.webp"], "rating": 3.4, "reviews": [{"date": "2026-06-09T22:19:00.575584232Z", "text": "Dr. Alexa Collazo was incredibly kind and attentive. She listened carefully, answered all my questions, and made me feel at ease throughout my visit. I’ve never felt more comfortable discussing my health concerns. Highly recommend!” The best doctor I have had in all my Life ! Thank you for caring Dr.Collazo", "author": "Flower Ramirez", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110032023605888141869/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-06-11T05:05:58.974620797Z", "text": "My health is the most important thing in my life, and I trust the doctor''s and the staff members at Parkland Hospital. If I could preach on these people here, and how they have cared for and treated me I would. They care about your health, and if something is wrong with you - they have the best specialists in the world to get you feeling better! 💯 I love Parkland Hospital!!!", "author": "Debra Money", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100283671629412016026/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-04-13T17:25:26.789092811Z", "text": "I recently visited Parkland Health and was genuinely impressed by the level of care I received. The staff were attentive, professional, and took the time to answer all of my questions. The facility was clean and well-organized, and I felt like I was in good hands throughout my entire visit. Wait times were reasonable given how busy the hospital was. I would not hesitate to return or recommend Parkland to friends and family in the Dallas area.", "author": "Ender Bates", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109862688382634324017/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-11-12T03:17:56.155682464Z", "text": "If you are in pain this is not the hospital to come to. I came here in so much and at triage the pa asked no question I waited for 5 hours in pain with no medication. When I got to the room finally the doctor said that the pain will go away on its own. I asked if I could get some meds as the pain was unbearable she then offered meds and testing. After doing labs and getting the medication I felt no relief and I was feeling nauseous I was still in some much pain but because the doctor was leaving she had to discharge me. I have been unable to eat for the past 3 days and they could care less . All they wanted was to me leave with a pain level at 10 because the incoming physician did not want overnight patients. The nurse brought discharge paperwork and I informed that they never came to check up on me after I still felt a lot of pain she said “if you don’t leave we are calling officers because you can deal with it at home” she then leaves and shoves the door and the provider comes in from they day shift and he said even if you are in pain I have to send you home ?? Excuse me I have not been able to eat or drink since Saturday and I feel nauseous how can I drive home like this ? He did not care and called the officers keep in mind with an IV still in and no nausea medication. I will never be back here the PA pictures was laughing with the nurse because I was in pain. This provider should not practice medicine and the nurse should be nurses. I will never come back.", "author": "Isamar Barrios", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101503034952346827258/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-11-12T16:31:13.045395626Z", "text": "This has been the most unreal experience I’ve ever had with a hospital. When we initially went in on Nov 5th to treat my child’s burns the staff of nurses, drs, and child life specialist were unmatched. Dr cox, nurse angel, and Victoria treated her so gentle and answered every question she had. My husband and I left the hospital thinking that they were the silver lining of our day. Then we had to schedule an appointment. And I’ve had questions since then. I have called every number imaginable in the week since we left the hospital and gotten absolutely no where. I have called 4-6 times a day for 7 days.  There is never anyone around to answer the phone and the ONE singular time I was able to get connected with some one I was treated very rudely and still didn’t have any of my questions answered. I’m so disappointed and honestly angry at their lack of communication, respect, and common courtesy.", "author": "Kim McLaughlin", "rating": 2, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102935623205148514042/reviews"}], "website": "http://www.parklandhealth.org/", "location": {"latitude": 32.813563699999996, "longitude": -96.8348}, "services": ["Burn Center", "Trauma Center", "Women and Infants'' Specialty Health", "Transplant Program", "Primary Care", "Virtual Care", "Community Health Screenings and Education", "Behavioral Health", "Cancer Center", "Pharmacy"], "insurance": {"notes": "Insurance details were not mentioned on the page. Parkland is a public health system; financial services and a price transparency page are available.", "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": [], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": false}, "highlights": [{"title": "Public Health System for Dallas County", "detail": "Parkland is the foundation for a healthy Dallas, serving the community since 1894.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Level I Trauma Center", "detail": "Texas’ first certified Level I Trauma Center, saving lives daily with internationally recognized expertise.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Comprehensive Burn Center", "detail": "The only burn center in North Texas verified for comprehensive care of both adults and children.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "16 Neighborhood Health Centers", "detail": "With 16 primary care health centers and mobile medical vans, Parkland offers accessible care throughout Dallas County.", "category": "access"}, {"title": "Virtual Care Available", "detail": "Connect with a Parkland provider from anywhere, available for adults and children.", "category": "convenience"}, {"title": "Magnet with Distinction", "detail": "Parkland is an ANCC Magnet with Distinction recognized organization for nursing excellence.", "category": "care"}], "price_tier": "$$", "source_url": "http://www.parklandhealth.org/", "appointment": {"booking_note": "Get care online or find a clinic near you.", "appointment_url": "https://www.parklandhealth.org/get-care.aspx", "new_patient_note": null, "phone_booking_available": null, "online_booking_available": null, "free_consultation_available": null}, "open_sunday": true, "scout_query": "Vietnamese speaking hospital in Dallas, TX", "search_text": "hospital | english | spanish | vietnamese | tiếng việt | người việt | bác sĩ việt | burn center | trauma center | women and infants'' specialty health | transplant program | primary care | virtual care | community health screenings and education | behavioral health | cancer center | pharmacy | specialty care | emergency care | telehealth | preventive care", "google_types": ["general_hospital", "hospital", "health", "point_of_interest", "service", "establishment"], "open_weekend": true, "rating_count": 2505, "open_saturday": true, "quality_score": 92, "working_hours": {"friday": "Open 24 hours", "monday": "Open 24 hours", "sunday": "Open 24 hours", "tuesday": "Open 24 hours", "saturday": "Open 24 hours", "thursday": "Open 24 hours", "wednesday": "Open 24 hours"}, "gallery_images": ["http://www.parklandhealth.org/Uploads/Public/Images/Design/Parkland/Parkland%20Logo_H_RGB%20280x78px.png", "http://www.parklandhealth.org/Uploads/Public/Images/Nav-Pages/C.V.%20ROMAN%20(3).png", "http://www.parklandhealth.org/Uploads/Public/Images/Design/Homepage/virtual-care.png", "http://www.parklandhealth.org/Uploads/Public/Images/Design/Homepage/mychart-300x300.png", "http://www.parklandhealth.org/Uploads/Public/Images/Design/Homepage/location-300x300.png", "http://www.parklandhealth.org/Uploads/Public/Images/Design/Homepage/pay-bill-300x300.png", "http://www.parklandhealth.org/Uploads/Public/Images/Design/Homepage/financial-services-300x300.png", "http://www.parklandhealth.org/Uploads/Public/Images/Design/Homepage/careers-300x300.png", "http://www.parklandhealth.org/Uploads/public/images/slideshow/Parkland/Homepage%20Widgets%20(1).png", "http://www.parklandhealth.org/Uploads/public/images/slideshow/Parkland/Homepage%20Widgets.png", "http://www.parklandhealth.org/Uploads/Public/Images/Design/Parkland/Parkland%20Logo_H_RGB%20280x78px.png", "http://www.parklandhealth.org/Uploads/Public/Images/Nurses/Credentialing-Marks_Magnet-Distinction.png"], "review_profile": {"rating": 3.4, "source": "google", "themes": [{"theme": "Staff Professionalism", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Multiple reviewers praise the kindness, attentiveness, and expertise of the doctors and staff."}, {"theme": "Communication", "mentions": 2, "sentiment": "Negative", "summary_quote": "Several patients express frustration with poor communication and unanswered questions."}, {"theme": "Pain Management", "mentions": 1, "sentiment": "Negative", "summary_quote": "One patient describes a distressing experience with inadequate pain relief and rushed discharge."}, {"theme": "Facility Environment", "mentions": 1, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "A reviewer notes the facility was clean, well-organized, and efficient despite being busy."}, {"theme": "Treatment Outcomes", "mentions": 1, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "A patient highlights trust in the hospital''s specialists and their ability to provide effective care."}], "summary": "Overall, patients report positive experiences with attentive and professional staff, though some highlight significant issues with pain management and communication.", "review_count": 2505, "concern_themes": [], "positive_themes": [], "featured_reviews": [{"date": "2026-06-09T22:19:00.575584232Z", "text": "Dr. Alexa Collazo was incredibly kind and attentive. She listened carefully, answered all my questions, and made me feel at ease throughout my visit. I’ve never felt more comfortable discussing my health concerns. Highly recommend!” The best doctor I have had in all my Life ! Thank you for caring Dr.Collazo", "author": "Flower Ramirez", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110032023605888141869/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-06-11T05:05:58.974620797Z", "text": "My health is the most important thing in my life, and I trust the doctor''s and the staff members at Parkland Hospital. If I could preach on these people here, and how they have cared for and treated me I would. They care about your health, and if something is wrong with you - they have the best specialists in the world to get you feeling better! 💯 I love Parkland Hospital!!!", "author": "Debra Money", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100283671629412016026/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-04-13T17:25:26.789092811Z", "text": "I recently visited Parkland Health and was genuinely impressed by the level of care I received. The staff were attentive, professional, and took the time to answer all of my questions. The facility was clean and well-organized, and I felt like I was in good hands throughout my entire visit. Wait times were reasonable given how busy the hospital was. I would not hesitate to return or recommend Parkland to friends and family in the Dallas area.", "author": "Ender Bates", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109862688382634324017/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-11-12T03:17:56.155682464Z", "text": "If you are in pain this is not the hospital to come to. I came here in so much and at triage the pa asked no question I waited for 5 hours in pain with no medication. When I got to the room finally the doctor said that the pain will go away on its own. I asked if I could get some meds as the pain was unbearable she then offered meds and testing. After doing labs and getting the medication I felt no relief and I was feeling nauseous I was still in some much pain but because the doctor was leaving she had to discharge me. I have been unable to eat for the past 3 days and they could care less . All they wanted was to me leave with a pain level at 10 because the incoming physician did not want overnight patients. The nurse brought discharge paperwork and I informed that they never came to check up on me after I still felt a lot of pain she said “if you don’t leave we are calling officers because you can deal with it at home” she then leaves and shoves the door and the provider comes in from they day shift and he said even if you are in pain I have to send you home ?? Excuse me I have not been able to eat or drink since Saturday and I feel nauseous how can I drive home like this ? He did not care and called the officers keep in mind with an IV still in and no nausea medication. I will never be back here the PA pictures was laughing with the nurse because I was in pain. This provider should not practice medicine and the nurse should be nurses. I will never come back.", "author": "Isamar Barrios", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101503034952346827258/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-11-12T16:31:13.045395626Z", "text": "This has been the most unreal experience I’ve ever had with a hospital. When we initially went in on Nov 5th to treat my child’s burns the staff of nurses, drs, and child life specialist were unmatched. Dr cox, nurse angel, and Victoria treated her so gentle and answered every question she had. My husband and I left the hospital thinking that they were the silver lining of our day. Then we had to schedule an appointment. And I’ve had questions since then. I have called every number imaginable in the week since we left the hospital and gotten absolutely no where. I have called 4-6 times a day for 7 days.  There is never anyone around to answer the phone and the ONE singular time I was able to get connected with some one I was treated very rudely and still didn’t have any of my questions answered. I’m so disappointed and honestly angry at their lack of communication, respect, and common courtesy.", "author": "Kim McLaughlin", "rating": 2, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102935623205148514042/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Overall, patients report positive experiences with attentive and professional staff, though some highlight significant issues with pain management and communication.", "about_highlight": "Parkland Health is the public health system for Dallas County, serving as the foundation for a healthy Dallas since 1894. With a mission rooted in care, compassion, and community, Parkland provides expert medical services at its state-of-the-art main campus and through 16 neighborhood-based primary care health centers and mobile medical vans. The system is committed to the health and well-being of every patient, offering a full spectrum of specialty care including a verified Level I Trauma Center, a comprehensive Burn Center, Women and Infants'' Specialty Health, and a leading kidney transplant program. Parkland''s team of dedicated professionals delivers compassionate, culturally responsive care, supported by amenities such as an on-site cafe and a wellness garden, all designed with the patient in mind.", "appointment_url": "https://www.parklandhealth.org/get-care.aspx", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=8882318995387276974&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJO6FKVW6dToYRrl7D1RBWRHs", "quality_missing": ["insurance", "team_members"], "search_keywords": ["hospital", "english", "spanish", "vietnamese", "tiếng việt", "người việt", "bác sĩ việt", "burn center", "trauma center", "women and infants'' specialty health", "transplant program", "primary care", "virtual care", "community health screenings and education", "behavioral health", "cancer center", "pharmacy", "specialty care", "emergency care", "telehealth", "preventive care"], "services_offered": [{"name": "Burn Center", "category": "Specialty Care", "description": "The only burn center in North Texas verified for comprehensive care of both adults and children.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Adults and children with burn injuries."}, {"name": "Trauma Center", "category": "Emergency Care", "description": "Texas’ first certified Level I Trauma Center, saving lives daily with internationally recognized expertise.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients with traumatic injuries."}, {"name": "Women and Infants'' Specialty Health", "category": "Specialty Care", "description": "Delivering trusted care for women and families at every stage of life.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Women and families."}, {"name": "Transplant Program", "category": "Specialty Care", "description": "Leading kidney transplants in Texas with unmatched expertise and patient support.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients in need of kidney transplant."}, {"name": "Primary Care", "category": "Primary Care", "description": "Preventive care checkups, sick visits, urgent care and mental health care for you and your family at neighborhood health centers.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Adults and children in Dallas County."}, {"name": "Virtual Care", "category": "Telehealth", "description": "Get care when and where you need it. Connect with a Parkland provider from anywhere, available for adults and children.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Adults and children."}, {"name": "Community Health Screenings and Education", "category": "Preventive Care", "description": "Parkland offers health screenings and education in the community through healthcare pop-ups.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Dallas County residents."}, {"name": "Behavioral Health", "category": "Behavioral Health", "description": "Mental health care services available.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients needing mental health support."}, {"name": "Cancer Center", "category": "Specialty Care", "description": "ASCO Certified: Patient-Centered Cancer Care Standards Program Site.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Cancer patients."}, {"name": "Pharmacy", "category": "Pharmacy", "description": "On-site pharmacy services.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Parkland patients."}], "short_description": "Dallas County''s public health system providing compassionate, expert care at our main campus and neighborhood health centers since 1894.", "google_website_url": "http://www.parklandhealth.org/", "google_primary_type": "General Hospital", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": [], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "5200 Harry Hines Blvd, Dallas, TX 75235, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/101857187683055172014", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVDyvYNc8s6wjE9gYAJQlkE-0wACIhW2EqvM9Cc8s1OequYx8oD=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Parkland Health"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/102788824661773610217", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVxHD6lucrd3jS1LfozO-QvYu4gcbs0xNTjHUzToxfHKlqhBbd9gg=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Oliver"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/102214794804836478830", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLcoQupcpUuPG4XhWJ5sy1EDV6pFj3emzn4nbp1jZ5jqdLvVw=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Ofelia Guerrero"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/112116461416759919544", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXWzUtBhi8Fa80-gpRppdC9V8KpR_cDJCCA-8krkCMWpFJ0wRSoqg=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Eddie Rivas"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/109060864772813891503", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUzMhAGrJmbmo8Pp9lzwXEd0wAWHHQkdmO6coX64A2wFLyc2zHDCg=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Bryan Seale"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-25T20:44:18.409356+00:00', 'parkland-health', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('458cca9e-5aea-418d-a45b-456c5c11899e', NULL, 'SaySmile Dental: Nuri Kim, DDS', 'SaySmile Dental, led by Dr. Nuri Kim, DDS, is a welcoming dental practice in Frisco, Texas, offering a broad range of services including root canals, teeth whitening, braces, dental implants, and wisdom teeth removal. Dr. Kim, a UCLA School of Dentistry graduate, is dedicated to providing individualized care and a wonderful dental experience for every patient. The practice features modern accommodations such as digital X-rays, kid-friendly amenities, and clean dental water technology, and the staff speaks Korean and Spanish.', '5350 Independence Parkway, Suite 140, Frisco, TX 75035', 'Frisco', 'TX', '75035', '(972) 525-4900', ARRAY['English', 'Spanish', 'Korean']::text[], 'Dental', FALSE, '{"email": "nurikim@saysmiledental.com", "images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/saysmile-dental-nuri-kim-dds-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/saysmile-dental-nuri-kim-dds-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/saysmile-dental-nuri-kim-dds-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/saysmile-dental-nuri-kim-dds-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/saysmile-dental-nuri-kim-dds-google-5.webp"], "rating": 5, "reviews": [{"date": "2026-04-30T04:37:03.971976701Z", "text": "WOW. JUST WOW. Say Smile Dental and Dr. Nuri Kim were recommended to us by a friend and they were EXACTLY what we needed. After a pretty frustrating experience at a different dental office, it was a breath of fresh air working with Dr. Kim. From the front office to everything in between, we had the warmest, friendliest, and most knowledgeable experience with Dr. Kim and team. My daughter needed extractions and instead of seeing her as a potential payday, Dr. Kim gave wise, conservative, caring advice. They prioritized the longevity of my daughter’s oral health instead of prescribing a quick fix. Due to some complications(not related to Dr. Kim), my daughter needed to be seen fairly quickly. Ashley is a phenomenal receptionist and rockstar. She got us in ASAP to see Dr. Kim. During the actual procedure, Dr. Kim’s assistant was incredibly attentive, soothing and calming my daughter when the extraction process became uncomfortable. The whole experience went off without a hitch. I even peeked back to the room a few times and I could’ve sworn my daughter was sleeping through it. This team is truly amazing and I will definitely be making this our family dentistry from here on out!", "author": "Samantha Reynolds", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115087761898339491060/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-01-14T04:49:10.372844180Z", "text": "We absolutely love Dr. Kim. She is extremely knowledgeable, patient, detailed, gentle—and has a great sense of humor! She truly cares for her patients, which makes every visit comfortable and reassuring.\n\nHer office, equipment, and tools are always clean, well maintained, and clearly sterilized.\n\nI highly recommend Dr. Kim to anyone. Our entire family goes to her—our 4-year-old twins, our 9-year-old, my husband, and myself—and we couldn’t be happier with the care we receive.", "author": "Hyera Kim", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108407140709051516091/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-01-23T00:15:05.812469552Z", "text": "Dr. Kim is truly one of the best dentists you will find. She''s professional, warm, and genuinely cares about her patients. She has been so sweet and patient with my son all the time. The staffs are amazing 10/10 highly recommend!", "author": "April", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107362786618278707284/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-24T19:04:32.015052362Z", "text": "Dr. Kim and the staff are one of the best. She understands the patient''s needs, ensures the patient is comfortable, and goes above and beyond each and every time. I would highly recommend to friends and family.", "author": "Yug Jarodiya", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113598208840676799157/reviews"}, {"date": "2022-06-03T20:45:24.093806Z", "text": "My kids all loved Dr. Kim and her staff! Young was really great and helped my 5 year old stay calm and even played with him while I was waiting on his sister. The staff here really go above and beyond for you. I brought my kids aged 1 year old-13 years old. The older ones loved being able to watch/listen to their shows while getting work done. Ashley was able to get all 4 of my kids in for their cleanings and even helped me figure out issues with my sons insurance! Definitely recommend them for you and your family!", "author": "Whitney Fulfer", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117757242915583896951/reviews"}], "website": "https://www.saysmiledental.com/", "location": {"latitude": 33.1217031, "longitude": -96.7499612}, "services": ["Braces", "Crowns", "Dental Deep Cleaning", "Root Canal", "Dental Implants", "Teeth Whitening", "Veneers", "Wisdom Teeth"], "insurance": {"notes": "Insurance logos displayed on the website include Delta Dental, Guardian, Humana, MetLife, Principia, Blue Cross Blue Shield, and Cigna.", "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": ["Delta Dental", "Guardian", "Humana", "MetLife", "Principia", "Blue Cross Blue Shield", "Cigna"], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": true}, "highlights": [{"title": "Bilingual Staff", "detail": "The staff speaks Korean and Spanish.", "category": "culture"}, {"title": "Digital X-Ray & 3D CBCT", "detail": "Delivers significantly lower radiation exposure compared to conventional X-rays and provides detailed images of the bone.", "category": "technology"}, {"title": "Kids Friendly", "detail": "Office provides kids TV entertainment, nitrous oxide (laughing gas) if needed, and a complimentary treasure box with dental toys/fun activity booklet.", "category": "access"}, {"title": "Clean Dental Water Technology", "detail": "Water used in dental chair delivery units and for sterilizing instruments is supplied by a water purification unit.", "category": "technology"}], "price_tier": "$$", "source_url": "https://www.saysmiledental.com/", "appointment": {"booking_note": "Book Now", "appointment_url": "https://flexbook.me/saysmile/", "new_patient_note": null, "phone_booking_available": true, "online_booking_available": true, "free_consultation_available": null}, "open_sunday": false, "scout_query": "Korean dentist in Dallas, TX", "search_text": "dental | dentist | nha khoa | nha sĩ | trồng răng | implant | root canal | crowns | veneers | braces | invisalign | toothache | 치과 | 치과의사 | 임플란트 | 牙医 | 牙科 | 种植牙 | english | spanish | korean | 한국어 | 한인 | 한국말 | dental deep cleaning | dental implants | teeth whitening | wisdom teeth | orthodontic | restorative | preventive | cosmetic | oral surgery | delta dental | guardian | humana | metlife | principia | blue cross blue shield | cigna | dr. nuri kim | dr. stephen chu | orthodontist", "google_types": ["dentist", "dental_clinic", "medical_clinic", "health", "point_of_interest", "establishment"], "open_weekend": false, "rating_count": 242, "team_members": [{"name": "Dr. Nuri Kim", "role": "Dentist", "bio_snippet": "Dr. Kim earned her DDS from UCLA School of Dentistry in 2009 and completed her undergraduate in biochemistry at UCLA. She provides a broad range of services including root canals, teeth whitening, braces, dental implants, and wisdom teeth removal. She participates in continuing education and invests in new technologies.", "languages_spoken": ["Korean", "English"]}, {"name": "Dr. Stephen Chu", "role": "Orthodontist", "bio_snippet": "Dr. Chu offers comprehensive orthodontic treatment including braces at SaySmile.", "languages_spoken": []}], "language_note": "The practice offers language support in Korean and Spanish, reflecting a commitment to serving diverse, including Asian and immigrant, communities. Dr. Kim''s background includes involvement in mission trips and her home church, emphasizing service and connection.", "open_saturday": false, "quality_score": 100, "working_hours": {"friday": "9:00 AM – 4:00 PM", "monday": "9:00 AM – 6:00 PM", "sunday": "Closed", "tuesday": "9:00 AM – 6:00 PM", "saturday": "Closed", "thursday": "9:00 AM – 6:00 PM", "wednesday": "Closed"}, "gallery_images": ["https://www.saysmiledental.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/03/HighResolution2-resized-1024x683.jpg", "https://www.saysmiledental.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/03/HighResolution0040-resized-1024x684.jpg", "https://www.saysmiledental.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/03/Dr.Kim_.jpg", "https://www.saysmiledental.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/braces.jpg", "https://www.saysmiledental.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/crowns.jpg", "https://www.saysmiledental.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/deep-cleaning.jpg", "https://www.saysmiledental.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/root-canal.jpg", "https://www.saysmiledental.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/dental-implants-img.jpg", "https://www.saysmiledental.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/teeth-whitening-image.jpg", "https://www.saysmiledental.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/veneer-e1522703723955.jpg", "https://www.saysmiledental.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/wisdom-teeth.jpg"], "review_profile": {"rating": 5, "source": "google", "themes": [{"theme": "Staff Professionalism", "mentions": 5, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Every reviewer highlights friendly, knowledgeable staff who go above and beyond for patients."}, {"theme": "Clinical Expertise", "mentions": 4, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Dr. Kim is described as extremely knowledgeable, patient, and gentle, with a focus on long-term oral health."}, {"theme": "Child-Friendly Care", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Multiple reviews commend the team''s ability to make children feel comfortable and calm during procedures."}, {"theme": "Facility Environment", "mentions": 2, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients note the office is clean, well-maintained, and equipped with modern tools."}, {"theme": "Communication", "mentions": 2, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Reviewers appreciate the staff''s helpfulness in scheduling and resolving insurance issues."}], "summary": "Patients consistently praise Dr. Nuri Kim and her team at SaySmile Dental for their warm, professional, and caring approach, with many highlighting the exceptional staff and child-friendly environment.", "review_count": 242, "concern_themes": [], "positive_themes": [], "featured_reviews": [{"date": "2026-04-30T04:37:03.971976701Z", "text": "WOW. JUST WOW. Say Smile Dental and Dr. Nuri Kim were recommended to us by a friend and they were EXACTLY what we needed. After a pretty frustrating experience at a different dental office, it was a breath of fresh air working with Dr. Kim. From the front office to everything in between, we had the warmest, friendliest, and most knowledgeable experience with Dr. Kim and team. My daughter needed extractions and instead of seeing her as a potential payday, Dr. Kim gave wise, conservative, caring advice. They prioritized the longevity of my daughter’s oral health instead of prescribing a quick fix. Due to some complications(not related to Dr. Kim), my daughter needed to be seen fairly quickly. Ashley is a phenomenal receptionist and rockstar. She got us in ASAP to see Dr. Kim. During the actual procedure, Dr. Kim’s assistant was incredibly attentive, soothing and calming my daughter when the extraction process became uncomfortable. The whole experience went off without a hitch. I even peeked back to the room a few times and I could’ve sworn my daughter was sleeping through it. This team is truly amazing and I will definitely be making this our family dentistry from here on out!", "author": "Samantha Reynolds", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115087761898339491060/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-01-14T04:49:10.372844180Z", "text": "We absolutely love Dr. Kim. She is extremely knowledgeable, patient, detailed, gentle—and has a great sense of humor! She truly cares for her patients, which makes every visit comfortable and reassuring.\n\nHer office, equipment, and tools are always clean, well maintained, and clearly sterilized.\n\nI highly recommend Dr. Kim to anyone. Our entire family goes to her—our 4-year-old twins, our 9-year-old, my husband, and myself—and we couldn’t be happier with the care we receive.", "author": "Hyera Kim", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108407140709051516091/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-01-23T00:15:05.812469552Z", "text": "Dr. Kim is truly one of the best dentists you will find. She''s professional, warm, and genuinely cares about her patients. She has been so sweet and patient with my son all the time. The staffs are amazing 10/10 highly recommend!", "author": "April", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107362786618278707284/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-24T19:04:32.015052362Z", "text": "Dr. Kim and the staff are one of the best. She understands the patient''s needs, ensures the patient is comfortable, and goes above and beyond each and every time. I would highly recommend to friends and family.", "author": "Yug Jarodiya", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113598208840676799157/reviews"}, {"date": "2022-06-03T20:45:24.093806Z", "text": "My kids all loved Dr. Kim and her staff! Young was really great and helped my 5 year old stay calm and even played with him while I was waiting on his sister. The staff here really go above and beyond for you. I brought my kids aged 1 year old-13 years old. The older ones loved being able to watch/listen to their shows while getting work done. Ashley was able to get all 4 of my kids in for their cleanings and even helped me figure out issues with my sons insurance! Definitely recommend them for you and your family!", "author": "Whitney Fulfer", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117757242915583896951/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Patients consistently praise Dr. Nuri Kim and her team at SaySmile Dental for their warm, professional, and caring approach, with many highlighting the exceptional staff and child-friendly environment.", "about_highlight": "SaySmile Dental, led by Dr. Nuri Kim, DDS, is a welcoming dental practice in Frisco, Texas, offering a broad range of services including root canals, teeth whitening, braces, dental implants, and wisdom teeth removal. Dr. Kim, a UCLA School of Dentistry graduate, is dedicated to providing individualized care and a wonderful dental experience for every patient. The practice features modern accommodations such as digital X-rays, kid-friendly amenities, and clean dental water technology, and the staff speaks Korean and Spanish.", "appointment_url": "https://flexbook.me/saysmile/", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=10653296321853305566&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJm-deC3UnTIYR3rIKp48c2JM", "quality_missing": [], "search_keywords": ["dental", "dentist", "nha khoa", "nha sĩ", "trồng răng", "implant", "root canal", "crowns", "veneers", "braces", "invisalign", "toothache", "치과", "치과의사", "임플란트", "牙医", "牙科", "种植牙", "english", "spanish", "korean", "한국어", "한인", "한국말", "dental deep cleaning", "dental implants", "teeth whitening", "wisdom teeth", "orthodontic", "restorative", "preventive", "cosmetic", "oral surgery", "delta dental", "guardian", "humana", "metlife", "principia", "blue cross blue shield", "cigna", "dr. nuri kim", "dr. stephen chu", "orthodontist"], "cultural_context": "The practice offers language support in Korean and Spanish, reflecting a commitment to serving diverse, including Asian and immigrant, communities. Dr. Kim''s background includes involvement in mission trips and her home church, emphasizing service and connection.", "services_offered": [{"name": "Braces", "category": "Orthodontic", "description": "Comprehensive orthodontic treatment to achieve healthy straight teeth, offered by Dr. Stephen Chu at SaySmile.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients seeking to improve alignment of teeth and smile."}, {"name": "Crowns", "category": "Restorative", "description": "Modern and effective crown treatments to protect damaged teeth from further decay or damage.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients with cracked, broken, or severely decayed teeth."}, {"name": "Dental Deep Cleaning", "category": "Preventive", "description": "Scaling or root planing to remove tartar, stains, and debris above and below the gum lines.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients showing signs of gingivitis or periodontal disease."}, {"name": "Root Canal", "category": "Restorative", "description": "Advanced treatment to remove decay and debris from the interior of a tooth, saving natural teeth from extraction.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients with decay reaching the pulp of a tooth."}, {"name": "Dental Implants", "category": "Restorative", "description": "Permanent and natural-looking solution for lost adult teeth, including a titanium post, abutment, and crown.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients needing replacement for one or more lost adult teeth."}, {"name": "Teeth Whitening", "category": "Cosmetic", "description": "In-office teeth whitening treatments using hydrogen peroxide gel and special light for a brighter smile.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients looking to brighten their smile and remove stains."}, {"name": "Veneers", "category": "Cosmetic", "description": "Expert application of thin porcelain layers bonded to the fronts of teeth to correct staining, chips, gaps, and more.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients with cosmetic concerns such as staining, chips, uneven teeth, or gaps."}, {"name": "Wisdom Teeth", "category": "Oral Surgery", "description": "Comprehensive examinations and, if necessary, extractions of wisdom teeth.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients needing wisdom teeth removal due to space issues or improper eruption."}], "short_description": "SaySmile Dental in Frisco, TX, provides comprehensive dental care with a focus on patient comfort and individualized treatment, led by Dr. Nuri Kim.", "google_website_url": "https://www.saysmiledental.com/", "insurance_accepted": ["Delta Dental", "Guardian", "Humana", "MetLife", "Principia", "Blue Cross Blue Shield", "Cigna"], "google_primary_type": "Dentist", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": ["Dr. Nuri Kim", "Dr. Stephen Chu"], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "5350 Independence Pkwy Ste 140, Frisco, TX 75035, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/107432880241673370713", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXpHwL-ueSSqMSQqjUVcMkdBhTVVluZlUcL2XZMYhboeSCDaqM=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "SaySmile Dental: Nuri Kim, DDS"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/107432880241673370713", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXpHwL-ueSSqMSQqjUVcMkdBhTVVluZlUcL2XZMYhboeSCDaqM=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "SaySmile Dental: Nuri Kim, DDS"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/107432880241673370713", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXpHwL-ueSSqMSQqjUVcMkdBhTVVluZlUcL2XZMYhboeSCDaqM=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "SaySmile Dental: Nuri Kim, DDS"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/107432880241673370713", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXpHwL-ueSSqMSQqjUVcMkdBhTVVluZlUcL2XZMYhboeSCDaqM=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "SaySmile Dental: Nuri Kim, DDS"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/107432880241673370713", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXpHwL-ueSSqMSQqjUVcMkdBhTVVluZlUcL2XZMYhboeSCDaqM=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "SaySmile Dental: Nuri Kim, DDS"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-25T20:48:44.762553+00:00', 'saysmile-dental-nuri-kim-dds', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('85402bb1-9aa7-4026-aefb-d02d03c6fbae', NULL, 'Smiley Dental & Orthodontics', 'Smiley Dental & Orthodontics in North East Dallas is dedicated to providing high-quality, affordable dental care for the whole family. Whether you need preventative care for your child, a routine cleaning, or specialized treatment like braces or dentures, their experienced team offers personalized treatment plans to meet your needs while reducing costs. The clinic believes that good oral health is essential for overall health, confidence, and happiness.
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('646cea34-e954-4cb1-a01c-7bffe022629b', NULL, 'Green Crescent Clinic', 'Green Crescent Clinic is a holistic wellness center in Richardson, TX, independently rated the #1 acupuncture clinic in the Dallas area. Since 2002, the clinic has focused on treating root causes rather than just symptoms, offering personalized, holistic care with integrity and professionalism. The clinic provides a complete system of medicine, including acupuncture, Chinese herbal medicine, functional medicine, NAET for allergies, cupping, dietary therapy, micro needling, and diagnostics, and is in-network with Blue Cross Blue Shield, Cigna, and Aetna.', '990 S. Sherman St. Richardson, TX 75081', 'Richardson', 'TX', '75081', '(214) 718-7646', ARRAY['English', 'Chinese']::text[], 'Acupuncture & TCM', FALSE, '{"images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/green-crescent-clinic-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/green-crescent-clinic-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/green-crescent-clinic-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/green-crescent-clinic-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/green-crescent-clinic-google-5.webp"], "rating": 5, "reviews": [{"date": "2025-05-20T14:14:24.260665Z", "text": "Dr. Saiyad Ahmad is an exceptional doctor of acupuncture and holistic medicine. He performed muscle testing and acupuncture with great care and precision. His approach is thorough, respectful, and rooted in genuine concern for his patients’ well-being. I felt seen and supported during each visit, and I appreciate his integrative and personalized care. Highly recommended for those seeking a natural and effective path to healing.", "author": "Amanda Burton", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106245474622367592027/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-04-29T04:14:23.433397538Z", "text": "“Dr. Ahmad at Green Crescent provided an excellent experience during my visit. He was very attentive, took the time to listen to my concerns, and explained everything clearly in a way I could understand. He made sure all my questions were answered. I highly recommend Dr. Ahmad to anyone looking for a knowledgeable and compassionate doctor.”", "author": "Mahmuda Rashid", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112575694618183815071/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-02-19T16:59:22.275193Z", "text": "I had 20 migraines a month. Dibilitating. With his acupuncture combined with a chiropractic nasal biweekly procedure, I''m down to about 4 a month. No medication has ever provided this kind of success. After dozens of doctors, including neurologists and $800/month monthly injections, this clinic has given me the only discernable relief. Thanks!!!", "author": "Marc Williams", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108578512566076949644/reviews"}, {"date": "2024-07-09T22:19:51.215954Z", "text": "Dr. Ahmed is amazing! My daughter was having problems since March with daily headaches because of which she wasn’t able to participate in a lot of activities at school. He could easily get to the root cause of the problem. We did a few sessions of acupuncture and she has not had a single headache since then. His allergy testing is amazing and helped to identify what was causing my daughter’s headaches. I definitely recommend him for anyone.", "author": "deepa mohandas", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117341866380970699676/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-11-26T13:27:46.547612523Z", "text": "The experience that I have is superb\nThe problems that I have had for years have nearly completely resolved with the treatment provided and I am extremely grateful and thankful for that. Since Salahuddin Ahmad did acupuncture and then cupping my pain has gone", "author": "Ahmed Khan", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113800629801319927844/reviews"}], "website": "http://www.greencrescentclinic.com/", "location": {"latitude": 32.937621, "longitude": -96.7400375}, "services": ["Acupuncture", "Chinese Herbal Medicine", "Functional Medicine", "N.A.E.T for Allergies", "Cupping", "Dietary Therapy", "Micro Needling", "Diagnostics"], "insurance": {"notes": "In-network with Blue Cross Blue Shield, Cigna, and Aetna.", "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": ["Blue Cross Blue Shield", "Cigna", "Aetna"], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": true}, "highlights": [{"title": "Top Rated Acupuncturist in Dallas", "detail": "Independently rated the #1 acupuncture clinic in the Dallas area, with awards from Dallas Awards (2023, 2020) and ThreeBestRated (2019).", "category": "reviews"}, {"title": "In-Network Insurance", "detail": "In-network with Blue Cross Blue Shield, Cigna, and Aetna.", "category": "insurance"}, {"title": "Holistic Root-Cause Treatment", "detail": "Treats root causes not just symptoms, offering holistic, preventive health maintenance.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Experienced Since 2002", "detail": "Has been helping patients since 2002.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Excellent Reviews", "detail": "5.0/5 rating on Google (65 reviews), Yelp (10 reviews), and Yahoo (10 reviews).", "category": "reviews"}], "price_tier": "$$", "source_url": "http://www.greencrescentclinic.com/", "appointment": {"booking_note": "Green Crescent offers flexible appointments and strives to accommodate all of your needs.", "appointment_url": "http://www.greencrescentclinic.com/request-appointment", "new_patient_note": null, "phone_booking_available": null, "online_booking_available": true, "free_consultation_available": null}, "open_sunday": false, "scout_query": "Chinese clinic in Dallas, TX", "search_text": "acupuncture & tcm | acupuncture | chinese medicine | tcm | herbal medicine | cupping | pain relief | châm cứu | đông y | y học cổ truyền | 한의원 | 침술 | 한약 | 中医 | 针灸 | 中药 | english | chinese | mandarin | cantonese | 中文 | 普通话 | 国语 | 粤语 | 广东话 | 华人 | chinese herbal medicine | functional medicine | n.a.e.t for allergies | dietary therapy | micro needling | diagnostics | allergy treatment | therapy | nutrition | cosmetic | diagnostic | blue cross blue shield | cigna | aetna | dr. ahmad | acupuncturist / practitioner", "google_types": ["medical_clinic", "doctor", "health", "point_of_interest", "service", "establishment"], "open_weekend": true, "rating_count": 81, "team_members": [{"name": "Dr. Ahmad", "role": "Acupuncturist / Practitioner", "bio_snippet": "Mentioned in patient testimonials as treating food allergies and prostatitis with NAET and herbal formulas.", "languages_spoken": []}], "open_saturday": true, "quality_score": 100, "working_hours": {"friday": "Closed", "monday": "9:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "sunday": "Closed", "tuesday": "9:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "saturday": "9:30 AM – 1:00 PM", "thursday": "9:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "wednesday": "9:00 AM – 5:00 PM"}, "review_profile": {"rating": 5, "source": "google", "themes": [{"theme": "Clinical Expertise", "mentions": 5, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients commend Dr. Ahmad''s thorough and precise approach to acupuncture and holistic treatments."}, {"theme": "Treatment Outcomes", "mentions": 4, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Many reviewers report significant improvements in chronic conditions, such as migraines and headaches, after treatment."}, {"theme": "Communication", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients appreciate Dr. Ahmad''s clear explanations and attentiveness to their concerns."}, {"theme": "Personalized Care", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Reviewers highlight Dr. Ahmad''s integrative and tailored approach to addressing individual health needs."}, {"theme": "Patient Support", "mentions": 2, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients feel seen and supported during their visits, emphasizing Dr. Ahmad''s genuine concern for their well-being."}], "summary": "Patients consistently praise Dr. Saiyad Ahmad at Green Crescent Clinic for his exceptional expertise in acupuncture and holistic medicine, highlighting his compassionate, personalized care and effective treatment outcomes.", "review_count": 81, "concern_themes": [], "positive_themes": ["Effective treatment for food allergies", "Digestive health improvement", "Professional care"], "featured_reviews": [{"date": "2025-05-20T14:14:24.260665Z", "text": "Dr. Saiyad Ahmad is an exceptional doctor of acupuncture and holistic medicine. He performed muscle testing and acupuncture with great care and precision. His approach is thorough, respectful, and rooted in genuine concern for his patients’ well-being. I felt seen and supported during each visit, and I appreciate his integrative and personalized care. Highly recommended for those seeking a natural and effective path to healing.", "author": "Amanda Burton", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106245474622367592027/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-04-29T04:14:23.433397538Z", "text": "“Dr. Ahmad at Green Crescent provided an excellent experience during my visit. He was very attentive, took the time to listen to my concerns, and explained everything clearly in a way I could understand. He made sure all my questions were answered. I highly recommend Dr. Ahmad to anyone looking for a knowledgeable and compassionate doctor.”", "author": "Mahmuda Rashid", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112575694618183815071/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-02-19T16:59:22.275193Z", "text": "I had 20 migraines a month. Dibilitating. With his acupuncture combined with a chiropractic nasal biweekly procedure, I''m down to about 4 a month. No medication has ever provided this kind of success. After dozens of doctors, including neurologists and $800/month monthly injections, this clinic has given me the only discernable relief. Thanks!!!", "author": "Marc Williams", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108578512566076949644/reviews"}, {"date": "2024-07-09T22:19:51.215954Z", "text": "Dr. Ahmed is amazing! My daughter was having problems since March with daily headaches because of which she wasn’t able to participate in a lot of activities at school. He could easily get to the root cause of the problem. We did a few sessions of acupuncture and she has not had a single headache since then. His allergy testing is amazing and helped to identify what was causing my daughter’s headaches. I definitely recommend him for anyone.", "author": "deepa mohandas", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117341866380970699676/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-11-26T13:27:46.547612523Z", "text": "The experience that I have is superb\nThe problems that I have had for years have nearly completely resolved with the treatment provided and I am extremely grateful and thankful for that. Since Salahuddin Ahmad did acupuncture and then cupping my pain has gone", "author": "Ahmed Khan", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113800629801319927844/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Patients consistently praise Dr. Saiyad Ahmad at Green Crescent Clinic for his exceptional expertise in acupuncture and holistic medicine, highlighting his compassionate, personalized care and effective treatment outcomes.", "about_highlight": "Green Crescent Clinic is a holistic wellness center in Richardson, TX, independently rated the #1 acupuncture clinic in the Dallas area. Since 2002, the clinic has focused on treating root causes rather than just symptoms, offering personalized, holistic care with integrity and professionalism. The clinic provides a complete system of medicine, including acupuncture, Chinese herbal medicine, functional medicine, NAET for allergies, cupping, dietary therapy, micro needling, and diagnostics, and is in-network with Blue Cross Blue Shield, Cigna, and Aetna.", "appointment_url": "http://www.greencrescentclinic.com/request-appointment", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=7153116241011207095&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJuRXslYcfTIYRt-uMhlL5RGM", "quality_missing": [], "search_keywords": ["acupuncture & tcm", "acupuncture", "chinese medicine", "tcm", "herbal medicine", "cupping", "pain relief", "châm cứu", "đông y", "y học cổ truyền", "한의원", "침술", "한약", "中医", "针灸", "中药", "english", "chinese", "mandarin", "cantonese", "中文", "普通话", "国语", "粤语", "广东话", "华人", "chinese herbal medicine", "functional medicine", "n.a.e.t for allergies", "dietary therapy", "micro needling", "diagnostics", "allergy treatment", "therapy", "nutrition", "cosmetic", "diagnostic", "blue cross blue shield", "cigna", "aetna", "dr. ahmad", "acupuncturist / practitioner"], "services_offered": [{"name": "Acupuncture", "category": "Acupuncture", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Chinese Herbal Medicine", "category": "Herbal Medicine", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Functional Medicine", "category": "Functional Medicine", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "N.A.E.T for Allergies", "category": "Allergy Treatment", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Cupping", "category": "Therapy", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Dietary Therapy", "category": "Nutrition", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Micro Needling", "category": "Cosmetic", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Diagnostics", "category": "Diagnostic", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}], "short_description": "Green Crescent Clinic is a top-rated acupuncture and functional medicine clinic in Richardson, TX, dedicated to holistic wellness and treating root causes since 2002.", "google_website_url": "http://www.greencrescentclinic.com/", "insurance_accepted": ["Blue Cross Blue Shield", "Cigna", "Aetna"], "google_primary_type": "Medical Clinic", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": ["Dr. Ahmad"], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "1055 S Sherman St Ste 170, Richardson, TX 75081, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/100660961939107184964", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWud4FCJ9RcMQ011lS0xJ1yOV1ii6CSNrG6gumDXaPEOG1ruuY=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Green Crescent Clinic"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/100660961939107184964", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWud4FCJ9RcMQ011lS0xJ1yOV1ii6CSNrG6gumDXaPEOG1ruuY=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Green Crescent Clinic"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/100660961939107184964", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWud4FCJ9RcMQ011lS0xJ1yOV1ii6CSNrG6gumDXaPEOG1ruuY=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Green Crescent Clinic"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/106245474622367592027", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV2gN6TaVhVx0Xhndc5AJBNuedfjKmAgwGTPjrvcskSW9rY2Sol=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Amanda Burton"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/100660961939107184964", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWud4FCJ9RcMQ011lS0xJ1yOV1ii6CSNrG6gumDXaPEOG1ruuY=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Green Crescent Clinic"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-25T20:52:16.214669+00:00', 'green-crescent-clinic', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('bc18f988-4640-403b-9ee6-9b7d800ed401', NULL, 'Washington Acupuncture Center', 'At Washington Acupuncture Center, we are dedicated to providing therapeutic benefit and result-oriented service in the field of Chinese Medicine, maintaining a patient-centered and enjoyable experience. We offer a full range of holistic therapies, including acupuncture, Chinese herbal medicine, Asian bodywork, and moxibustion, serving the Washington DC area, Northern Virginia, and Maryland. Our services address a wide array of health concerns, from pain management and fertility support to stress, anxiety, sleep disorders, and digestive issues, all guided by a caring and knowledgeable professional with a solid background in Traditional Chinese Medicine.', '1712 I (eye) Street NW #410, Washington, DC 20006', 'Washington', 'DC', '20006', '202-246-8833', ARRAY['English', 'Chinese']::text[], 'Acupuncture & TCM', FALSE, '{"email": "acupuncturewellnessfan@gmail.com", "images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/washington-acupuncture-center-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/washington-acupuncture-center-google-2.webp"], "reviews": [{"date": null, "text": "I noticed right away how much it helped with stress reduction. I feel very relaxed after each treatment. Definitely a whole body/mind treatment. Mr. Fan is a caring and knowledgeable practitioner with a solid background in Traditional Chinese Medicine. Highly recommended!", "author": "Paul B.", "rating": null, "source": "Website"}, {"date": null, "text": "I came to see Dr. Fan after having two miscarriages... The pregnancy took about 4 months of acupuncture and Chinese herbs which I also took for the first 12 weeks to prevent miscarriage.", "author": "Alice D.", "rating": null, "source": "Website"}, {"date": null, "text": "In a few short treatments I experienced measured improvement. Now I go for relaxation and to treat other maladies. I highly recommend using him for any extreme pain issues (back, leg, migraines, etc.). Shu is tremendous.", "author": "Mary T", "rating": null, "source": "Website"}], "website": "https://dc-acupuncture-chinesemedicine.com/", "location": {"latitude": 38.9011297, "longitude": -77.04025639999999}, "services": ["Acupuncture", "Chinese Herbal Medicine", "Asian Bodywork", "Moxibustion", "Tai Chi", "Consultation", "Allergies", "Fertility Support", "Oncology Support", "Addiction", "Facial Rejuvenation", "Digestive Disorders", "Stress Anxiety", "Sleep Disorder", "Pain Management"], "insurance": {"notes": "No insurance information is mentioned on the page. The clinic offers an ''Affording Care'' page link in the Features menu, which may contain payment details.", "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": [], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": false}, "highlights": [{"title": "Patient Personal Treatments", "detail": "We care about you and the success of your providing personalised care.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Professional Service", "detail": "We are highest levels of honesty and professionalism at all times.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Excellence Research", "detail": "We have the right caring, experience and dedicated professional for you.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Online Booking", "detail": "Appointments can be made via the online form on the website.", "category": "convenience"}], "price_tier": "$$", "source_url": "https://dc-acupuncture-chinesemedicine.com/", "appointment": {"booking_note": null, "appointment_url": "https://dc-acupuncture-chinesemedicine.com/appointment-form", "new_patient_note": null, "phone_booking_available": null, "online_booking_available": true, "free_consultation_available": null}, "open_sunday": false, "scout_query": "Chinese speaking medical clinic in Washington, D.C.", "search_text": "acupuncture & tcm | acupuncture | chinese medicine | tcm | herbal medicine | cupping | pain relief | châm cứu | đông y | y học cổ truyền | 한의원 | 침술 | 한약 | 中医 | 针灸 | 中药 | english | chinese | mandarin | cantonese | 中文 | 普通话 | 国语 | 粤语 | 广东话 | 华人 | chinese herbal medicine | asian bodywork | moxibustion | tai chi | consultation | allergies | fertility support | oncology support | addiction | facial rejuvenation | digestive disorders | stress anxiety | sleep disorder | pain management | holistic therapy | service | shu fan | acupuncturist, l.ac & national certification of oriental medicine", "google_types": ["medical_clinic", "health", "service", "point_of_interest", "establishment"], "open_weekend": true, "team_members": [{"name": "Shu Fan", "role": "Acupuncturist, L.AC & National Certification of Oriental Medicine", "bio_snippet": "Committed to providing therapeutic benefit and result oriented service in the field of Chinese Medicine while maintaining a patient-centered and enjoyable experience.", "languages_spoken": []}], "language_note": "The clinic specializes in Traditional Chinese Medicine, offering services such as acupuncture, Chinese herbal medicine, Asian bodywork, and moxibustion, which are deeply rooted in Eastern medical traditions. The practice serves the Washington DC area, including communities in Northern Virginia and Maryland, and emphasizes a holistic, culturally-responsive approach to health and healing.", "open_saturday": true, "quality_score": 95, "working_hours": {"friday": "9:00 AM – 6:30 PM", "monday": "9:00 AM – 6:30 PM", "sunday": "Closed", "tuesday": "9:00 AM – 6:30 PM", "saturday": "9:00 AM – 2:30 PM", "thursday": "9:00 AM – 6:30 PM", "wednesday": "Closed"}, "gallery_images": ["http://dc-acupuncture-chinesemedicine.co