Walter Angiolini", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110016551994499968269/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-27T07:06:43.997694411Z", "text": "I truly love and respect all the people in the medical field but this place needs a change of management/operation. 1st off you get in and not really greeted politely and quickly asked what do you need or why you are here. Then they take you into triage where you are put in a IV to get blood drawn so they can run some basic tests. Then you are told to wait and you will be waiting 2-8 hours and that is literally not even exaggerating. I truly wish I was. There are people in there suffering. People crying from the pain they are in. Throwing up and peeing blood from what ever is causing it. Then once you get in the doctors and nurses are super nice and very knowledgeable but they take another 2-5 hours to fully talk and figure out what is wrong with you. That’s ig you ever get pass the waiting room. I am truly surprised no one has died in the waiting room it is a miracle of God. So if you are tired of waiting and want to leave now you have to wait for the front desk people to finally stop goofing off in the back which they do and take 30 minutes while the security just sit there looking at you not at least letting the front desk people know there is someone waiting and I needed them so they can take off the IV so I can leave and look for another hospital to go too. Please fix this place this is a Christian hospital it should be the best hospital in ATL", "author": "Nahum Gonzalez", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110705660818464504348/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Reviews for Emory Saint Joseph''s Hospital reflect a mix of positive experiences with caring staff and negative experiences with long wait times and inconsistent care. While some patients praise the professionalism and compassion of doctors and nurses, others criticize management for poor organization and delays.", "about_highlight": "Emory Saint Joseph''s Hospital, Atlanta''s first hospital founded in 1880 by the Sisters of Mercy, has grown from a small house into a 32-acre campus in north Atlanta. Today, it is considered one of the top specialty-referral hospitals in the Southeast, offering nationally ranked Centers of Excellence in cancer, heart & vascular, orthopaedics, and more. The hospital is known for its compassionate, patient- and family-centered care and has earned recognition as the first community hospital in the world to receive seven straight Magnet® designations for nursing excellence. Physicians come from around the world to train here, and the hospital continues to provide exceptional care in the spirit of loving service.", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=15611926354933252037&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJW3epPTQJ9YgRxf9a5U20qNg", "quality_missing": ["insurance", "team_members", "appointment_url"], "search_keywords": ["hospital", "english", "vietnamese", "tiếng việt", "người việt", "bác sĩ việt", "cancer (oncology)", "emergency care", "gamma knife", "heart & vascular", "orthopaedics", "pulmonary rehabilitation", "radiology & imaging", "urology", "visconti center for robotics", "oncology", "emergency", "neurosurgery", "cardiology", "orthopedics", "pulmonology", "radiology", "surgery"], "services_offered": [{"name": "Cancer (Oncology)", "category": "Oncology", "description": "Winship Cancer Institute of Emory University is Georgia''s only National Cancer Institute-designated cancer center, offering leading-edge cancer care and access to over 250 clinical trials.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Emergency Care", "category": "Emergency", "description": "Emergency Department open 24/7, staffed with board-certified emergency medical physicians and nursing specialists, treating a variety of emergency medical conditions.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Gamma Knife", "category": "Neurosurgery", "description": "Gamma Knife Center provides technologically advanced means of treating brain disorders with expert team.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Heart & Vascular", "category": "Cardiology", "description": "Known as Atlanta''s ''heart hospital,'' with a long history of leadership in cardiovascular care, outstanding outcomes, and innovative prevention and treatment.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Orthopaedics", "category": "Orthopedics", "description": "Orthopaedics & Spine Pavilion offers minimally invasive and robotic-assisted approaches with specialized teams of orthopaedic and spine doctors, nurses and physical therapists.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Pulmonary Rehabilitation", "category": "Pulmonology", "description": "Provides pulmonary rehabilitation for patients with shortness of breath caused by chronic lung conditions, combining exercise and education.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Radiology & Imaging", "category": "Radiology", "description": "Advanced imaging technology including CT, MRI, nuclear medicine, ultrasound, X-ray, and interventional radiology, with convenient locations across metro Atlanta.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Urology", "category": "Urology", "description": "Expert urologists offering robotic surgery, reconstructive urology, men''s health, urologic oncology, and female incontinence and pelvic surgery.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Visconti Center for Robotics", "category": "Surgery", "description": "Offers minimally invasive surgical approaches using the da Vinci surgical system for cardiac, thoracic, urological, gynecological and oncology procedures.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}], "short_description": "Atlanta''s first hospital, founded in 1880, now a top specialty-referral hospital on a 32-acre campus in north Atlanta, offering nationally ranked care in cancer, heart & vascular, orthopaedics, and more.", "google_website_url": "https://www.emoryhealthcare.org/locations/hospitals/emory-saint-josephs-hospital?&utm_campaign=brand_all_ra_gmb-locations&utm_source=google&utm_medium=gmb&utm_content=gmb_locations?&utm_campaign=brand_all_non&utm_source=google&utm_medium=gmb&utm_content=gmb-locations", "google_primary_type": "Hospital", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": [], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "5665 Peachtree Dunwoody Rd NE, Atlanta, GA 30342, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/100055077642441545315", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUBbx_vQ6Hzsbuwbjdz4QOSJTfLHvev0pF-9RxZD3U71t6mQzn5=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Emory Saint Joseph''s Hospital"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/100055077642441545315", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUBbx_vQ6Hzsbuwbjdz4QOSJTfLHvev0pF-9RxZD3U71t6mQzn5=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Emory Saint Joseph''s Hospital"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/102537836991875460447", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLofMG_DQeM1vhgtcZIVCbxr4arPsJg7wvCMfH4lqLV8IgpNw=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Daniel"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/116476303152263394571", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV2VrukZIVabpgKczicO-4bC5dnutrh24YVndGBlyr0jNnjwrbtyQ=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Andrew Wang"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/102673535354233970025", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVzV3aMG9V_CWBeTOUeCCmjqq_hhWpIxuuQZ_-M4OpGMr21-1ni=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Thomson M"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-