 it was clear that Jennifer genuinely cares about her patients'' well-being. Her expertise and attention to detail are unmatched, and she takes the time to listen and understand each individual''s needs.\n\nJennifer has been a key component in my recovery from Bell’s Palsy. I’ve seen noticeable improvements from the very first session, and my smile is getting stronger and looking more like it did before. She already has a clear game plan in place to help restore my eye as well. The movement on the side of my face has improved significantly after each session. I truly feel like I''m on the right path, and I’m so grateful for her care.\n\nHer calming presence and thorough approach make every session feel personalized and effective. She is a great investment for my long-term health plan, and I couldn’t be more grateful for everything she’s done. If you''re looking for someone who not only knows their craft but truly cares, Jennifer is the one to see!", "author": "Laura C. Ortiz", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100540370308140597719/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-01-27T16:44:25.595070Z", "text": "Absolutely thrilled with my experience at Core Acupuncture Atlanta with Jennifer Myers! I had a microneedling session today for my face, lips, and under-eye area, along with acupuncture and red light therapy, and I can already tell I’m in for amazing results!\n\nI’ve been seeing Jenn for years for my acupuncture, and her warm and welcoming demeanor has always put me at ease. She took the time to explain all the procedures thoroughly, addressing all my questions and concerns. Her expertise and attention to detail were evident throughout the treatments, making me feel confident in her hands.\n\nThe microneedling was comfortable, and I’m excited to see how my skin''s texture and tone will improve in the next two weeks. My lips feel plump and rejuvenated, and the delicate under-eye area already looks refreshed. The red light therapy was a fantastic addition, enhancing the microneedling results and promoting healing. Plus, the acupuncture added a wonderful layer of relaxation to the experience, enhancing my overall well-being.\n\nIf you’re considering microneedling, acupuncture, or red light therapy, I wholeheartedly recommend Jennifer at Core Acupuncture Atlanta. Her skill and passion for what she does truly shine through. This place deserves all the recognition—it’s a hidden gem that’s! Thank you, Jennifer, for your incredible work! 🌟", "author": "Gallery Chimera", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100077021106152631671/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Patients consistently praise Jennifer''s professionalism, expertise, and caring approach, highlighting significant improvements in various conditions and a welcoming clinic environment.", "about_highlight": "CORE ACUPUNCTURE health+wellness is a Buckhead, Atlanta clinic led by Dr. Jennifer Myers, DAc, LAc, Dipl.Ac., offering integrative acupuncture treatments for fertility, IVF support, oncology symptom management, chronic pain relief, migraines, sports injuries, and holistic wellness care. With over a decade of service, the clinic is recognized multiple years through the BusinessRate BEST of Atlanta Awards for excellence in Fertility Care, Sports Medicine, and Acupuncture. Each new patient receives a personalized evaluation and tailored treatment plan, focusing on identifying and treating the root cause of imbalance to support the body’s natural healing systems.", "appointment_url": "https://ehr.unifiedpractice.com/Public/OnlineBooking?ClinicUid=3a373fd4-9a53-4eed-81f7-09852c9144bc", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=8754981416612638212&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJAQBQ9vIF9YgRBK5XaDbxf3k", "quality_missing": ["insurance"], "search_keywords": ["acupuncture & tcm", "acupuncture", "chinese medicine", "tcm", "herbal medicine", "cupping", "pain relief", "châm cứu", "đông y", "y học cổ truyền", "한의원", "침술", "한약", "中医", "针灸", "中药", "english", "chinese", "mandarin", "cantonese", "中文", "普通话", "国语", "粤语", "广东话", "华人", "fertility & pregnancy support", "sports medicine acupuncture", "microneedling & nanoneedling", "facial rejuvenation / cosmetic acupuncture", "oncology support care", "reproductive health", "sports medicine", "aesthetic", "oncology support", "jennifer myers", "owner, clinical director, licensed acupuncturist"], "services_offered": [{"name": "Acupuncture", "category": "Acupuncture", "description": "A safe, effective and natural approach to promote healing and prevent illness from occurring in the body.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients seeking pain relief, stress reduction, and overall wellness."}, {"name": "Fertility & Pregnancy Support", "category": "Reproductive Health", "description": "Proven benefits as an alternative or compliment to other Fertility procedures, support during pregnancy, prep for labor and postpartum support.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Individuals or couples navigating IVF, IUI, recurrent pregnancy loss, hormonal imbalance, irregular cycles, and low AMH."}, {"name": "Sports Medicine Acupuncture", "category": "Sports Medicine", "description": "For more complete injury recovery, injury prevention, quicker recoveries and enhance overall performance.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Athletes and active individuals managing injuries or seeking performance enhancement."}, {"name": "Microneedling & Nanoneedling", "category": "Aesthetic", "description": "Microneedling is a gentle, safe and effective procedure for boosting your own collagen and elastin production.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Individuals seeking skin rejuvenation, reduction of fine lines, acne scars, and age spots."}, {"name": "Facial Rejuvenation / Cosmetic Acupuncture", "category": "Aesthetic", "description": "Cosmetic acupuncture therapies for the face, neck, and abdomen.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Individuals interested in non-surgical facial rejuvenation."}, {"name": "Oncology Support Care", "category": "Oncology Support", "description": "If you have been diagnosed with cancer and/or going through cancer treatment it’s important... (full description on linked page).", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Cancer patients and survivors managing symptoms and side effects of treatment."}], "short_description": "Offers integrative acupuncture treatments for fertility, IVF support, oncology symptom management, chronic pain relief, migraines, sports injuries, and holistic wellness care. Serving the Buckhead and greater Atlanta community for over 10 years.", "google_website_url": "http://www.coreacupunctureatlanta.com/", "google_primary_type": "Medical Clinic", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": ["Jennifer Myers"], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "accepting_new_patients": true, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "455 East Paces Ferry Rd NE Ste 201, Atlanta, GA 30305, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/109008623820865961699", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKXR9vxu1vuPgKaJAkSlowEn_vBJwW9oo8UQZAxwvELC-mvdQ=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "CORE ACUPUNCTURE health+wellness"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/109008623820865961699", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKXR9vxu1vuPgKaJAkSlowEn_vBJwW9oo8UQZAxwvELC-mvdQ=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "CORE ACUPUNCTURE health+wellness"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/109008623820865961699", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKXR9vxu1vuPgKaJAkSlowEn_vBJwW9oo8UQZAxwvELC-mvdQ=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "CORE ACUPUNCTURE health+wellness"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/109008623820865961699", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKXR9vxu1vuPgKaJAkSlowEn_vBJwW9oo8UQZAxwvELC-mvdQ=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "CORE ACUPUNCTURE health+wellness"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/109008623820865961699", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKXR9vxu1vuPgKaJAkSlowEn_vBJwW9oo8UQZAxwvELC-mvdQ=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "CORE ACUPUNCTURE health+wellness"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-25T21:07:35.264735+00:00', 'core-acupuncture-healthwellness', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('2a6fff9a-13d8-4d9f-bd43-2726a5d85298', NULL, 'Chinatown Family Dental LLC', 'Established in 2007, Chinatown Family Dental is a friendly general dentistry practice providing dental care for the whole family. The practice is led by Dr. Sevila Yee, a Chicago Chinatown native with over 30 years of experience. Their philosophy emphasizes personalized dental health planning, comprehensive patient education, and an uncompromising commitment to comfort, professionalism, and safety. They offer preventive, restorative, and cosmetic services, including emergency dentistry, root canals, routine exams, and cosmetic bonding, all delivered with a focus on patient satisfaction and long-term dental health.', '2252 South Canal Street Suite 208, Chicago, IL 60616', 'Chicago', 'IL', '60616', '+1.312.842.0888', ARRAY['Chinese', 'English']::text[], 'Dental', FALSE, '{"email": "office@chinatownfamilydental.com", "images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/chinatown-family-dental-llc-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/chinatown-family-dental-llc-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/chinatown-family-dental-llc-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/chinatown-family-dental-llc-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/chinatown-family-dental-llc-google-5.webp"], "rating": 4.5, "reviews": [{"date": "2026-01-15T16:06:54.261261735Z", "text": "I have been going to  Chinatown Family Dental for over 10 years, and I couldn''t be more satisfied with the care I''ve received from Dr. Yee. She was very professional, gentle and always takes the time to explain every step of the treatment, which makes me feel very comfortable during every visit. After treatment, the staff always follow up to check if I''m doing okay,  which truly shows how much they care about their patients. The staff are friendly and welcoming, and the clinic is clean and well-organized. The entire process is smooth and stress-free. I highly recommend this clinic to anyone looking for long-term, trustworthy & high-quality dental care.", "author": "Kayi Lau", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106495139041321720368/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-12-11T14:58:58.742468589Z", "text": "I highly recommend Chinatown Family Dental. The staff is friendly from the minute you walk in to the minute you leave. Dr. Yee is great at what she does, addresses all your needs and makes a long term plan with the patient moving forward. Don''t walk , run to make an appointment with them", "author": "Kenneth Moy", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106809811778413393084/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-12-16T04:12:30.081176839Z", "text": "The doctor and staff are friendly, professional and patient when explaining the treatment plan. The location is convenient and there is free parking. I highly recommend this dental  office .", "author": "Zoe Lee", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113967755738491144755/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-10-22T01:06:27.303333169Z", "text": "Friends told me Doctor Yee was the Best. I decided to make an appointment. Seems my friends are right, she is the best !! Staff is also very professional & friendly. I highly recommend Chinatown Family Dental  !", "author": "Joey G13", "rat