 been coming for months and everytime I leave, I feel dynamically different. Whether it''s muscle ache, stress, jaw, digestive - she is transformative. I''m very picky and I highly, highly recommend her.", "author": "Lucy McRae", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104645733363769607090/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Chinese Acupuncture and Herbal Clinic has a 5.0 star Google rating from 2 Google reviews. Patients commonly mention strong results.", "about_highlight": "Chinese Acupuncture & Herbal Clinic is a clinic offering acupuncture and herbal medicine services.", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=8858909013301429668&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJ4dFR0H-4woARpIVWo88q8Xo", "quality_missing": ["services", "insurance", "team_members", "appointment_url"], "search_keywords": ["acupuncture & tcm", "acupuncture", "chinese medicine", "tcm", "herbal medicine", "cupping", "pain relief", "châm cứu", "đông y", "y học cổ truyền", "한의원", "침술", "한약", "中医", "针灸", "中药", "english", "chinese", "mandarin", "cantonese", "中文", "普通话", "国语", "粤语", "广东话", "华人"], "cultural_context": "Chinese-oriented clinic with traditional Chinese medicine focus.", "short_description": "A clinic specializing in traditional Chinese acupuncture and herbal treatments.", "google_website_url": "http://chineseacupuncturehc.com/", "google_primary_type": "Medical Clinic", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": [], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "3053 W Olympic Blvd #309, Los Angeles, CA 90006, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/101010309203407859686", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJpg6di3wpO4eDtQFEpS6j66FgPhxG3Tkv9OSf2UtTkUfZ2lQ=s10