ittle exercises I can do between appointments to maximize my treatments.\n\nI also went a few years ago for tinnitus, but it turned out mine is the type that can''t be cured and Dr Liu was very honest with me about not being able to help more.\n\nThe office is quiet and private and there''s usually easy street parking. Plus he takes insurance!", "author": "Rebecca Hirschfeld", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110269102660050560006/reviews"}, {"date": "2023-04-30T17:06:47.761955Z", "text": "This is long due for the review but I finally did it :)\n\nI am truly glad that I went to see Dr. Liu. He helped me with my fertility problem (AMH 0.06) after I failed from 3 rounds of IVF and 1 round of IUI.\n\nTo be honest, I didn''t really believe in non-western treatment at the beginning but after my case was declined by an IVF doctor, I had no choice but to try acupuncture.\n\nAfter seeing the doctor for a few months, miracle happened to me. I got pregnant naturally!\n\nI am so grateful for Dr. Liu. THANK YOU SO MUCH!", "author": "Ammie Behappy", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110445633088044182257/reviews"}, {"date": "2016-12-04T06:44:37.596Z", "text": "Dr. Liu is an excellent acupuncturist and herbalist.  He is very attentative and thorough with his examinations. Dr. Liu is truly an integrative healer through using his training and degree in Traditional Chinese Medicine and education in Western medicine.  I started showings improvements after my first visit and has continued to make progress after my third session.  Dr. Liu believes in empowering his patients by making recommendations of home practice to further his acupuncture and herbal treatments. Dr. Liu  is warm and genuinely cares about his work and his patients.  Bonus  - parking is relatively easy where his clinic is located..", "author": "Mims Lee", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113587015382420742542/reviews"}, {"date": "2019-04-11T02:38:32.752357Z", "text": "Dr.Liu is truly amazing.\n\nMy right shoulder has been suffering severe stiffness and heaviness over a decade. I tried many methods during these years, including chiropractic, acupuncture, deep tissue massage, but none of their effect can last over a day.\n\nBut as to Dr.Liu, is a different story. After only 4 sessions, the stiffness and heaviness are gone, I''ve never felt so stress-free and so light. And as a side effect, my posture gets better, I stand straighter than ever.", "author": "Yicong Chen", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103864895778546529054/reviews"}, {"date": "2019-04-12T22:49:04.360058Z", "text": "Dr. David Liu is simply the best.  I have been going for acupuncture treatments as needed for years when I found Dr. Liu.  I Have Glaucoma and  have become allergic to the western medicinal corrective eye drops.  It never occurred to me that Acupuncture and herbs might help until I finally mentioned this to Dr. Liu.  He has been giving me herbs and treatments for several months now.  Yesterday the pressure in my eyes was checked and it has been reduced to normal for me.  I am thrilled.  I am a professional artist and cannot imagine life without sight.\nI cannot recommend highly enough Dr. Liu for his skill, compassion and professionalism.  His knowledge of the body and it''s systems is unsurpassed in my  opinion.", "author": "Gary Bukovnik", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105398930806336753428/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Patients consistently praise Dr. Liu for his expertise in acupuncture and herbal treatments, noting significant improvements in various conditions and appreciating his compassionate, professional approach.", "about_highlight": "Traditional Chinese Medicine is one of the oldest healing systems, embodying knowledge accumulated over millennia. At Chinese Medicine Clinic & Education Center, we are honored to continue this lineage, offering acupuncture, moxibustion, and herbal therapy with over 50 years of professional experience. Our clinic specializes in pain management, fertility, tinnitus and hearing loss, and internal medicine, providing exceptional service to support your health.", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=16336603007561172146&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJTwVxiHh9j4ARsgRDXuFFt-I", "quality_missing": ["insurance", "appointment_url"], "search_keywords": ["acupuncture & tcm", "acupuncture", "chinese medicine", "tcm", "herbal medicine", "cupping", "pain relief", "châm cứu", "đông y", "y học cổ truyền", "한의원", "침술", "한약", "中医", "针灸", "中药", "english", "chinese", "mandarin", "cantonese", "中文", "普通话", "国语", "粤语", "广东话", "华人", "pain management", "fertility", "tinnitus and loss of hearing", "internal medicine", "ent", "dr. dave liu", "practitioner"], "cultural_context": "The clinic practices Traditional Chinese Medicine, a vast healing system originating from ancient China. It emphasizes cultural heritage and the continuity of Chinese medical traditions, including acupuncture, moxibustion, and herbal therapy.", "services_offered": [{"name": "Pain Management", "category": "Pain Management", "description": "Acupuncture and herbal treatments for various pain conditions.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Fertility", "category": "Fertility", "description": "Traditional Chinese Medicine approaches to support fertility.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Tinnitus and Loss of Hearing", "category": "ENT", "description": "Treatment for tinnitus and hearing loss using TCM methods.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Internal Medicine", "category": "Internal Medicine", "description": "Comprehensive internal medicine care through Traditional Chinese Medicine.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}], "short_description": "A San Francisco clinic specializing in Traditional Chinese Medicine, including acupuncture, herbal therapy, and pain management, with over 50 years of professional experience.", "google_website_url": "http://www.drdaveliu.com/", "google_primary_type": "Medical Clinic", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": ["Dr. Dave Liu"], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "2388 35th Ave #201, San Francisco, CA 94116, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/102031414520282109516", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW83FVExelDeaSJcDpCy9thzkKTLdSROgrJQpZTnmXujF9VaH-F=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Natalie Cleaver (Cleaver SF)"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/107721404123505875377", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVFwjOJXQGXh5XA7ruFDCklQPlKrkfqpQym3JwX3ozyPd2S0if9cw=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Trap Speed 1320"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-26T11:26:06.999493+00:00', 'chinese-medicine-clinic-education-center', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('b217ceaf-47e9-4d60-bce3-54b63941e31d', NULL, 'Dr. Wang Clinic', 'Dr. Wang Clinic, established in 1991, offers Traditional Chinese Medicine including acupuncture, herbal medicine, and Qi Gong. Dr. Xue-Zhi Wang is an internationally recognized physician with over 30 years of experience, having won numerous awards for his contributions to medicine. The clinic focuses on treating the whole person, not just the disease, using safe and natural methods with virtually no side effects. Patients have reported successful outcomes for various conditions including thyroid issues, fertility, and cancer support.', '4115 University Way NE #110', 'Seattle', 'WA', '98105', '(206) 547-2435', ARRAY['English', 'Chinese']::text[], 'Acupuncture & TCM', FALSE, '{"images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/dr.-wang-clinic-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/dr.-wang-clinic-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/dr.-wang-clinic-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/dr.-wang-clinic-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/dr.-wang-clinic-google-5.webp"], "rating": 5, "reviews": [{"date": "2026-04-28T23:07:00.280258839Z", "text": "I’ve been seeing this acupuncturist for years and couldn’t recommend him more highly. The care is consistently excellent, and the entire clinic—from the doctor to the staff—is warm, professional, and attentive. I originally came in for allergies, but now trust him with all aspects of my wellness. The treatments and herbal support have been a great experience every time.", "author": "Cynthia Conner", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108249438914727823334/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-01T21:24:47.521241375Z", "text": "Why Come to See Dr. Wang?\nChinese medicine and Western medicine work very well together.  Chinese medicine is based on millennia of knowledge about energy systems and meridians of the human body.\nFor 34 years Dr. Wang has been of significant help in my life. He has superior intuition and reads your energy skillfully.\nLONG TERM\nLong term treatments have reversed a tissue condition that Western doctors never offered help on but warned could lead to future illness. Dietary and exercise practices have also been part of this regeneration.\nSHORT TERM\nYou can see Dr. Wang for acute problems, too.\nA dental infection led to an infection of the lungs (pneumonia with spinach-green sputum).  Dr. Wang gave me Chinese herbs which I brewed and drank.  The pneumonia cleared quickly.  Then I saw an endodontist.\nDr. Wang is a direct descendant of physicians to the emperor of China.  His son Xiao has been trained for several years and is also a board-certified acupuncturist.  You will have access to treatments for decades from now.\nDr. Wang’s wife, Laura, has fluent high-level English skills and is kind, encouraging, and helpful. She can translate your requests so that Dr. Wang has a full understanding of your situation.\nDr. Wang is also an internationally recognized artist of traditional Chinese style.  His work is available for purchase.", "author": "Donna Jaeger", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114390089021588423289/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-04-30T22:28:46.784726263Z", "text": "My husband and I have seen Dr. Wang for about 15 years. From a long and impressive lineage of healers, Dr. Wang works in the traditional Chinese way, using herbs, acupuncture and cupping to treat ailments ranging from anxiety and depression to allergies to pain in the joints and muscles, etc. Not only can he provide short-term relief, but as a botanical professional, he creates herbs specific to your needs that can provide lasting results. He was recommended to me by a friend many years ago, which proved to be a very positive step forward in my health, and I gratefully pass along this recommendation to anyone who views the body-mind as an ''ecological'' system that must work in harmony to keep us well. He is a maestro.", "author": "Sandy Kaplan", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104034505056025189176/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-09-21T23:02:01.120388011Z", "text": "By: Deborah M (using my business Google account).\nYES! Please, do consider Dr. Wang for your healing and longevity!\n\nI first saw Dr Wang 30+ years ago for help with my asthma. It took awhile, yet I saw improvement of my symptoms and felt that my overall health was improving right away. Since those initial treatments and continuing the exercises (Qi Gong) he gave me I have yet to have my asthma return. I was already very heathy and active (bothered only by that asthma) yet discovered, by continuing visits these many years for improving and building my overall immunity and learning and practicing more Qi Gong, I could be even better.\n\nDr. Wang has been part of healing and curing some serious diseases and injuries for me and my family and I have witnessed (through referrals I made to him and when volunteering in his office) beyond amazing - often referred to as miracles by those he was treating - cures and improvements.\nWithout reservation I trust Dr. Wang to give me (and YOU!) beyond the best-est of care: acupuncture, herbal treatments, Qi Gong, all aspects of Chinese Medicine and basic \"good living\" guidance. Gosh he has so much to give and can be magical. I trust him and am confident Dr. Wang will be an excellent option for you.\n\nI have found pricing competitive, the clinic accepts insurance and Dr. Wang and his staff are careful listeners, generous, kind, encouraging and simply good people.\n-- Deborah M\n(posting through my business\nGoogle account)", "author": "Wudang Mountain Institute", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109899523974133002013/reviews"}, {"date": "2024-11-15T14:31:41.171556Z", "text": "I tried using Yelp waste of time! Best doctor. Our Colorado acupunturist was able to consult with him about my condition and he was so kind to do so. We moved there for 11 yrs and came back to Seattle several times , never missing a chance for Dr Wang''s consult, herbs and treatment. He has probably saved our lives more than once. We can stay healthy because of his expertise and insight. Can''t say enough. Thank you Dr Wang. So glad to be back with you in Seattle.Carrie and Tobi", "author": "Carrie Payne", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112186264157550690243/reviews"}], "website": "http://drwangclinic.com/", "location": {"latitude": 47.657440699999995, "longitude": -122.3136258}, "services": ["Acupuncture", "Herbal Medicine", "Qi Gong"], "insurance": {"notes": null, "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": [], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": false}, "highlights": [{"title": "30+ Years Experience", "detail": "Dr. Wang has been practicing medicine for over 30 years.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Internationally Recognized", "detail": "Recognized internationally as one of the world''s top physicians and has won numerous awards.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Whole Person Care", "detail": "Acupuncture treats the whole person, not just the disease.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Safe & Natural", "detail": "Acupuncture is safe and has virtually no side effects.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Multiple Modalities", "detail": "Offers acupuncture, herbal medicine, and Qi Gong.", "category": "care"}], "price_tier": "$$", "source_url": "http://drwangclinic.com/", "appointment": {"booking_note": "Call 206.547.2435 to schedule an appointment.", "appointment_url": null, "new_patient_note": null, "phone_booking_available": true, "online_booking_available": false, "free_consultation_available": null}, "open_sunday": false, "scout_query": "Chinese speaking medical clinic in Seattle, WA", "search_text": "acupuncture & tcm | acupuncture | chinese medicine | tcm | herbal medicine | cupping | pain relief | châm cứu | đông y | y học cổ truyền | 한의원 | 침술 | 한약 | 中医 | 针灸 | 中药 | english | chinese | mandarin | cantonese | 中文 | 普通话 | 国语 | 粤语 | 广东话 | 华人 | qi gong | traditional chinese medicine | dr. xue-zhi wang | oriental medicine doctor, licensed acupuncturist, aemp", "google_types": ["medical_clinic", "health", "point_of_interest", "establishment"], "open_weekend": true, "rating_count": 23, "team_members": [{"name": "Dr. Xue-Zhi Wang", "role": "Oriental Medicine Doctor, Licensed Acupuncturist, AEMP", "bio_snippet": "Dr. Wang has been practicing medicine for over 30 years. He is recognized internationally as one of the world''s top physicians and has won numerous awards for his contributions to medicine.", "languages_spoken": []}], "language_note": "Traditional Chinese Medicine clinic rooted in Eastern healing practices, with a focus on acupuncture, herbal medicine, and Qi Gong. Dr. Wang brings over three decades of experience and international recognition.", "open_saturday": true, "quality_score": 93, "working_hours": {"friday": "10:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "monday": "10:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "sunday": "Closed", "tuesday": "10:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "saturday": "10:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "thursday": "10:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "wednesday": "Closed"}, "gallery_images": ["https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/