ouraging, and helpful. She can translate your requests so that Dr. Wang has a full understanding of your situation.\nDr. Wang is also an internationally recognized artist of traditional Chinese style.  His work is available for purchase.", "author": "Donna Jaeger", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114390089021588423289/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-04-30T22:28:46.784726263Z", "text": "My husband and I have seen Dr. Wang for about 15 years. From a long and impressive lineage of healers, Dr. Wang works in the traditional Chinese way, using herbs, acupuncture and cupping to treat ailments ranging from anxiety and depression to allergies to pain in the joints and muscles, etc. Not only can he provide short-term relief, but as a botanical professional, he creates herbs specific to your needs that can provide lasting results. He was recommended to me by a friend many years ago, which proved to be a very positive step forward in my health, and I gratefully pass along this recommendation to anyone who views the body-mind as an ''ecological'' system that must work in harmony to keep us well. He is a maestro.", "author": "Sandy Kaplan", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104034505056025189176/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-09-21T23:02:01.120388011Z", "text": "By: Deborah M (using my business Google account).\nYES! Please, do consider Dr. Wang for your healing and longevity!\n\nI first saw Dr Wang 30+ years ago for help with my asthma. It took awhile, yet I saw improvement of my symptoms and felt that my overall health was improving right away. Since those initial treatments and continuing the exercises (Qi Gong) he gave me I have yet to have my asthma return. I was already very heathy and active (bothered only by that asthma) yet discovered, by continuing visits these many years for improving and building my overall immunity and learning and practicing more Qi Gong, I could be even better.\n\nDr. Wang has been part of healing and curing some serious diseases and injuries for me and my family and I have witnessed (through referrals I made to him and when volunteering in his office) beyond amazing - often referred to as miracles by those he was treating - cures and improvements.\nWithout reservation I trust Dr. Wang to give me (and YOU!) beyond the best-est of care: acupuncture, herbal treatments, Qi Gong, all aspects of Chinese Medicine and basic \"good living\" guidance. Gosh he has so much to give and can be magical. I trust him and am confident Dr. Wang will be an excellent option for you.\n\nI have found pricing competitive, the clinic accepts insurance and Dr. Wang and his staff are careful listeners, generous, kind, encouraging and simply good people.\n-- Deborah M\n(posting through my business\nGoogle account)", "author": "Wudang Mountain Institute", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109899523974133002013/reviews"}, {"date": "2024-11-15T14:31:41.171556Z", "text": "I tried using Yelp waste of time! Best doctor. Our Colorado acupunturist was able to consult with him about my condition and he was so kind to do so. We moved there for 11 yrs and came back to Seattle several times , never missing a chance for Dr Wang''s consult, herbs and treatment. He has probably saved our lives more than once. We can stay healthy because of his expertise and insight. Can''t say enough. Thank you Dr Wang. So glad to be back with you in Seattle.Carrie and Tobi", "author": "Carrie Payne", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112186264157550690243/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Patients consistently praise Dr. Wang for his exceptional expertise in traditional Chinese medicine, highlighting his ability to treat a wide range of conditions with personalized care, including acupuncture, herbs, and dietary advice. Many reviewers report long-term health improvements and describe the clinic staff as warm and professional.", "about_highlight": "Dr. Wang Clinic, established in 1991, offers Traditional Chinese Medicine including acupuncture, herbal medicine, and Qi Gong. Dr. Xue-Zhi Wang is an internationally recognized physician with over 30 years of experience, having won numerous awards for his contributions to medicine. The clinic focuses on treating the whole person, not just the disease, using safe and natural methods with virtually no side effects. Patients have reported successful outcomes for various conditions including thyroid issues, fertility, and cancer support.", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=8370670355978175817&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJSQXuaPMUkFQRScX4y1aYKnQ", "quality_missing": ["insurance", "appointment_url"], "search_keywords": ["acupuncture & tcm", "acupuncture", "chinese medicine", "tcm", "herbal medicine", "cupping", "pain relief", "châm cứu", "đông y", "y học cổ truyền", "한의원", "침술", "한약", "中医", "针灸", "中药", "english", "chinese", "mandarin", "cantonese", "中文", "普通话", "国语", "粤语", "广东话", "华人", "qi gong", "traditional chinese medicine", "dr. xue-zhi wang", "oriental medicine doctor, licensed acupuncturist, aemp"], "cultural_context": "Traditional Chinese Medicine clinic rooted in Eastern healing practices, with a focus on acupuncture, herbal medicine, and Qi Gong. Dr. Wang brings over three decades of experience and international recognition.", "services_offered": [{"name": "Acupuncture", "category": "Traditional Chinese Medicine", "description": "Acupuncture puts people back in control of their own bodies and health. It is safe and has virtually no side effects. It treats the whole person, not just the disease.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients seeking holistic, non-invasive treatment for various conditions."}, {"name": "Herbal Medicine", "category": "Traditional Chinese Medicine", "description": "Traditional Chinese medicine is a comprehensive system of health care with a continuous clinical tradition of treatments including herbal medicine.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients looking for natural, plant-based remedies."}, {"name": "Qi Gong", "category": "Traditional Chinese Medicine", "description": "Qigong treatment is a traditional method of healing through energy channeling. Dr. Wang is a trained Qigong master using his understanding of this traditional energy work to treat patients at the clinic.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients interested in energy healing and meditation."}], "short_description": "Unlock your body''s natural ability to heal with Traditional Eastern Medicine, Acupuncture & Qi Gong at Dr. Wang Clinic, serving Seattle since 1991.", "google_website_url": "http://drwangclinic.com/", "google_primary_type": "Medical Clinic", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": ["Dr. Xue-Zhi Wang"], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "4115 University Wy NE #110, Seattle, WA 98105, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/105877892124929952379", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKEPjRHzvb2mxeHkK7-yuBy0luxjM6f0wnP_3Wp3Tp3i9OZgRz0=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Jon L"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/100396942768620366810", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLQK7lyMlsuCPjeF_5IBAP-9HKnx277rS4OHRNTKpRcjKip-Q=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Dr. Xue Zhi Wang OMD,LCA"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/115061453400005050605", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJmTgYcVmqLhbLxoZur4cCDs_zZ4kns08YtA-7z2RUUdWQ8mA=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Leon Miao"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/115559805216251560289", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJn3Bluq1IOktsl2SunqMmHFHUjEPnNueBmmXjCzOZzMS8N8U9h=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "davinchiwang"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/115559805216251560289", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJn3Bluq1IOktsl2SunqMmHFHUjEPnNueBmmXjCzOZzMS8N8U9h=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "davinchiwang"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-26T11:38:43.133443+00:00', 'dr-wang-clinic', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('261b8c72-8212-49a5-a8b7-667a4e226d03', NULL, 'Somi Kim Optometry', 'Somi Kim Optometry in Koreatown, Los Angeles, offers comprehensive eye care including annual exams, medical services, dry eye treatment, children''s vision, computer vision, myopia control, and contact lenses. The practice emphasizes that a thorough eye exam can detect systemic diseases like glaucoma and diabetes. With an onsite optical lab, they provide one-hour service for many eyewear prescriptions and feature a designer optical boutique. The team is dedicated to personalized, high-quality care and building trust with every patient.', '3053 W. Olympic Blvd. Suite #101', 'Los Angeles', 'CA', '90006', '(213) 736-0066', ARRAY['English', 'Korean']::text[], 'Ophthalmology', FALSE, '{"fax": "(213) 736-5535", "images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/somi-kim-optometry-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/somi-kim-optometry-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/somi-kim-optometry-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/somi-kim-optometry-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/somi-kim-optometry-google-5.webp"], "rating": 4.3, "reviews": [{"date": "2026-04-06T05:46:12.369310344Z", "text": "I can see clearly now!\n\nDr.Somi Kim and her warm staff are absolutely something to write home about.\n\nI had been struggling with my vision and was due for an eye exam, doctor was able to spot the issue with my previous prescription providing me with informed care. She successfully literally clearing up my vision with the correct prescription that properly addressed my condition.\n\nHer patient staff then let me take my time selecting a pair of frames that made me feel confident. When my glasses were ready to pick up they welcomed me back warmly remembering me and helping me get the right fit.\n\nIf you have been searching for a comprehensive eye doctor in LA, your search is done.", "author": "Rhiannon Bowen", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102552359418602397507/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-06-22T00:20:09.134249030Z", "text": "I''ve been wearing eyeglasses my whole life, and I have to say Dr. Somi exceeded my expectations! I''m so impressed with her! Although I was the last patient, she took all the time to answer all my questions and to give me a thorough exam.\n\nShe''s an amazing optometrist. Thank you for the thorough eye exam! 👍", "author": "Mike J", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104573364079753212472/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-11T00:48:17.773494192Z", "text": "I called for something but he hung up before I finish and I was the one saying thank you(I’m nice) rude.  If you wana ruin your day ,talk to them", "author": "Echo", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118110088663313968730/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-08-19T07:43:29.870315772Z", "text": "A gem. Amazing eye care and very caring doctor. Its always a treat to see her and talk to her every year. Front desk people are very straight to the point but don''t be put off, they''re there to help you.", "author": "Kim", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100106885025546132214/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-09-18T16:01:56.500335555Z", "text": "Great 