, therefore I wouldn’t have to pay a dime, because I was losing that insurance at the end of the month and wouldn’t have been able to afford the visit otherwise. Turns out, the hospital was going to charge me $400 because I didn’t go to the doctors private office for the post op visit, which was not an option given to me.", "author": "Sierra Michel", "rating": 3, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103517946112162939390/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-12-15T06:29:51.822084394Z", "text": "I was hit by a car and rushed to this hospital. The trama center top notched, I felt they did a great job and made me feel my life matter. Once removed to the emergency room, I was put in a hallway for 20 minutes naked and everyone just walking pass me I was so uncomfortable. Then finally I was wheeled in a room by a tech, then left waiting on a nurse to come in pain flat on my back with a neckbrace, for over 30 minutes,  the machine was beeping for so long I found the strength to sit up and then the nurse appeared. The machine beeping for 30 minutes should have been a sign of distress and to come check on a patient.  When she came in the room, Melissa the nurse had a very nasty attitude, I was there for 13hrs, the t.v didn''t work, the remote to call the nurse didn''t work so I had to wait to she come in to check on me. She will pop in every 3hrs..smh im hungry and thirsty. These people need interpersonal skills training how did you become a nurse, I asked her a question and she said \"what\"..I''m like that''s not how you answer a patient..she said oh I didn''t hear your question. Smh After being there to 9pm after arriving at 8am, they decided on a MRI, I was tested out...did many xrays, catskan had a cast put on my hand..so I declined. They was upset cause yes I have good insurance get all the test they paying....so they didn''t give me any discharge instructions at all, no prescriptions or anything mind you..I was hit by a car and have a cast on my hand. I have never experienced a hospital so unprofessional and ghetto in my life. But as I said..The Trama doctor and nurses was great.", "author": "MzFit4aking Tashia", "rating": 2, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113124815976710898923/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-03-15T19:04:18.977588708Z", "text": "I recently had a hospital stay at the University of Chicago Hospital, and I felt compelled to share how exceptional my experience was. From the moment I arrived to the day I was discharged, every member of the team treated me with genuine compassion, professionalism, and respect.\n\nThe nursing staff was absolutely outstanding. They were attentive, patient, and incredibly supportive during a time that could have easily been overwhelming. Every question I had was answered thoroughly, and I always felt like my comfort and well-being truly mattered. Their kindness and dedication did not go unnoticed.\n\nThe doctors and medical team were equally impressive—knowledgeable, communicative, and committed to making sure I understood my care and treatment plan. It was clear that everyone works together as a team with the patient’s best interests at the center.\n\nClean facilities, organized care, and a staff that goes above and beyond made this the best hospital experience I’ve ever had. I am deeply grateful to the entire team at the University of Chicago Hospital for their professionalism and compassionate care. Thank you for helping me feel safe, supported, and on the path to recovery.", "author": "Andrea Smith", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116918855021393478141/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-10-08T17:51:32.490240650Z", "text": "Avoid Reem Jan. Her fellow was great but Reem Jan was content to ignore my husband''s pain for months, and never diagnosed him with anything, despite a long history of disabling symptoms. We switched to Chicago Arthritis who was much better at getting a proper diagnosis and medication. Oh and today I found out that UChicago hired an attorney to bust the resident''s union instead of raising wages. What a shitty hospital.", "author": "Hungry Hungry", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113018703829626434512/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "UChicago Medicine has a 2.9 star Google rating from 856 Google reviews. Patients commonly mention compassionate care, friendly staff, clear explanations, comfortable visits.", "about_highlight": "UChicago Medicine is a nationally ranked academic medical center affiliated with the University of Chicago. It offers comprehensive care across primary care, specialty care, urgent care, and 24/7 on-demand virtual urgent care. With a focus on patient-centered medicine, the institution provides access to leading physicians, advanced treatments, and a full range of services at multiple locations in the Chicago area. Patients can easily schedule appointments online through MyChart or by calling the appointment line.", "appointment_url": "https://www.uchicagomedicine.org/find-a-physician", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=13306841653964067001&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJSb3R6jspDogRuVDmSvtlq7g", "quality_missing": ["insurance", "team_members"], "search_keywords": ["hospital", "english", "vietnamese", "tiếng việt", "người việt", "bác sĩ việt", "primary care", "specialty care", "urgent care", "24/7 on-demand virtual urgent care", "telehealth"], "services_offered": [{"name": "Primary Care", "category": "Primary Care", "description": "Comprehensive primary care services for adults.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Adults seeking routine and preventive care."}, {"name": "Specialty Care", "category": "Specialty Care", "description": "Advanced specialty care across numerous medical disciplines.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients requiring specialized medical attention."}, {"name": "Urgent Care", "category": "Urgent Care", "description": "In-person urgent care for non-life-threatening conditions.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients needing immediate care for minor illnesses or injuries."}, {"name": "24/7 On-Demand Virtual Urgent Care", "category": "Telehealth", "description": "Virtual urgent care available 24/7 through MyChart.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients seeking convenient, remote care for urgent but non-emergency issues."}], "short_description": "UChicago Medicine is a nationally ranked academic medical center providing comprehensive care in Chicago and beyond.", "google_website_url": "https://www.uchicagomedicine.org/", "google_primary_type": "Hospital", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": [], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "5841 S Maryland Ave, Chicago, IL 60637, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/111481706620237564175", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUf9hkjoSkg3LXrpV6tiu3UnFm9mv3AGGVUL7AoglFmAmm3zLro=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "UChicago Medicine"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/117776985328567256772", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUpCYKqEeSHj2YVqUtDNE8rhOpnTkwcg311rZ2-eW88DheRHCLf=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Eventivities Miss"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/113586306243322096287", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXvVz4PPiC6snszi8KlPsARLS7Zqj3ccEruiuYXbs5tMhA0bCKFtQ=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Ruth Lamour"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/100619433355599525302", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKzmJmyNFo_CUUDTu5T_TPjAq8VF2YYXtueYK1FGn9d83-nfg=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Keith Washington"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/111481706620237564175", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUf9hkjoSkg3LXrpV6tiu3UnFm9mv3AGGVUL7AoglFmAmm3zLro=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "UChicago Medicine"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-25T21:19:38.170094+00:00', 'uchicago-medicine', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('22de9481-18a9-4b7e-bde8-f08df1a3f3df', NULL, 'China Square Clinic', 'China Square Clinic is a community health center located at 2142 S. Archer Avenue in Chicago, IL, operating as part of the Thorek Memorial Hospital network. The clinic provides comprehensive primary care services including internal medicine, diabetes management, pediatrics, preventative care, heart disease management, women’s health, wellness visits, and high blood pressure management. With extended hours including Saturdays, the clinic aims to offer accessible healthcare to the Chinatown and surrounding communities, emphasizing preventative and chronic disease care under the Thorek system.', '2142 S. Archer Avenue, Chicago, IL 60616', 'Chicago', 'IL', '60616', '(312) 326-1400', ARRAY['English', 'Vietnamese']::text[], 'Community Health Center', FALSE, '{"images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/china-square-clinic.webp"], "rating": 1.8, "reviews": [{"date": "2025-03-31T22:11:39.608664Z", "text": "This is an absolute horrible Clinic I''ve ever seen. Long waiting time, dirty place and doctor is not knowledgeable and stay far away from you and afraid of getting sickness. No question, no test and just giving RX-antibiotic, then done. In 1.5 month, you will receive 2 big bills for the doctor and for the facility.", "author": "Winnie Wu", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112668358619912965555/reviews"}, {"date": "2014-04-30T23:13:55.597653Z", "text": "This place is terrible. The hours are odd, the doctor only does well with simple stuff and the staffs are pretty ignorant. There are more than one time i go in with less than 2 people before me and ended up waiting for hours because they decided to just call people who came in after me. That''s not it, the doctor sometimes doesn''t even show up at the place. It''s just nurses. If this place weren''t at the center of chinatown I really doubt they will get any business. Every time I go in with a little problem and the doctor wants me to do a blood test. The sanitary condition there is pretty terrible too. You can see stains on the seats from who knows when and what. It''s just awful.", "author": "John Sen", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103743318333985790857/reviews"}, {"date": "2023-01-14T17:38:12.162213Z", "text": "The service attitude is terrible, the way they talk makes you feel that the place is very bad", "author": "Han Xiong", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102014825497281266412/reviews"}, {"date": "2023-08-27T18:35:45.747886Z", "text": "guy with glasses at the front desk always has the worst attitude and is so careless", "author": "ann", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116796045201081707285/reviews"}, {"date": "2024-01-19T22:36:31.599794Z", "text": "Bad attitude towards patient", "author": "S Q", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118241764727968116238/reviews"}], "website": "https://www.thorek.org/locations/china-square-clinic", "location": {"latitude": 41.8538114, "longitude": -87.63385509999999}, "services": ["Internal Medicine", "Diabetes Management", "Pediatrics", "Preventative Care", "Heart Disease", "Women\u0019s Health", "Wellness Visits", "High Blood Pressure"], "insurance": {"notes": null, "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": [], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": false}, "highlights": [{"title": "Community Health Center", "detail": "Part of the Thorek Memorial Hospital network se