Tran Nguyen- San Jose spotlight .", "author": "Dr Princess Jacqueline Victoria Le Pham", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109153110003399733572/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-26T21:06:21.523702686Z", "text": "Clean, good security, great Denital staff & Dentist, helpful pharmacy, and staff is very helpful.    They serve meals, Mexican dance lessons…..legal clinic. …", "author": "Betty Sines", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109146198152813667410/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-01-13T18:33:11.245971626Z", "text": "The poorly designed parking lot has caused several broken-bone accidents. Worse than that the administration doesn''t care at all although they have been aware of those serious injuries. What a shame!", "author": "Leon Wina", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104277956390476581077/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-07-15T19:29:24.132722474Z", "text": "They intentionally did not call me. Mental health appointments are taken very seriously, they showed concerning neglect by not updating my phone number twice when requested. They also made no attempts to call the other two numbers or my email.", "author": "G Wiz", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107321108045656466083/reviews"}, {"date": "2023-11-09T00:03:41.148003Z", "text": "What a great addition to the community! I made an appointment for flu and COVID vaccines through the Valley Health website. It was easy and straightforward. I arrived 10 minutes before my appointment. I checked in at the pharmacy on the second floor and filled out the forms. The pharm tech who helped me was very nice and efficient, so was the pharmacist who administered my vaccines. It was a pleasant experience. I also appreciate how the parking lot was spacious. I''ll definitely be making another appointment for my family members and looking into the oth