Ricardo Con for his extensive experience, compassionate care, and effective treatments in acupuncture and herbal medicine, with many highlighting his personalized approach and genuine concern for their well-being.", "about_highlight": "Centro De Medicina China is a provider of Chinese medicine, acupuncture, and Chinese herbal remedies. The clinic is located in Illinois and offers traditional healing services.", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=17808736091397940187&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJp_njCiPJwoAR2-Nz0h5XJfc", "quality_missing": ["services", "insurance", "team_members", "appointment_url"], "search_keywords": ["acupuncture & tcm", "acupuncture", "chinese medicine", "tcm", "herbal medicine", "cupping", "pain relief", "châm cứu", "đông y", "y học cổ truyền", "한의원", "침술", "한약", "中医", "针灸", "中药", "english", "chinese", "mandarin", "cantonese", "中文", "普通话", "国语", "粤语", "广东话", "华人"], "google_website_url": "https://m.facebook.com/medicinachinayacupunturahierbaschinas/", "google_primary_type": "Medical Clinic", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": [], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "6330 Pacific Blvd Ste 110, Huntington Park, CA 90255, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/115203188580606900008", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKG3BTHycHUmX7BCDF2S8sYZHv7l6mYd8MgtapbM4OG9WJk=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Centro De Medicina China"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/115203188580606900008", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKG3BTHycHUmX7BCDF2S8sYZHv7l6mYd8MgtapbM4OG9WJk=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Centro De Medicina China"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/115203188580606900008", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKG3BTHycHUmX7BCDF2S8sYZHv7l6mYd8MgtapbM4OG9WJk=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Centro De Medicina China"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/115203188580606900008", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKG3BTHycHUmX7BCDF2S8sYZHv7l6mYd8MgtapbM4OG9WJk=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Centro De Medicina China"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/117693542491636520700", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU5MeRH5HMbuvbDmTgMxraknuH6wNX5YP93kFK97vX2IcAwVe__7A=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Ricardo"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-26T10:28:28.286014+00:00', 'centro-de-medicina-china', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('d1ac51c2-80f2-4dfe-a97e-d12d33a3edad', NULL, 'Pham Medical Clinic', 'Pham Medical Clinic is a primary care practice in Houston, Texas, dedicated to serving the needs of the entire family. The clinic takes great pride in providing fine medical care and offers a comprehensive range of services including general health, preventive care, physical exams, women''s health, chronic disease management (diabetes, hypertension, asthma, COPD), and acute care for coughs, colds, flu, infections, and allergies. The clinic features in-house lab tests, immunizations, and weight loss services, and is staffed by a team of experienced providers including Dr. Bao Thang Pham and nurse practitioners Mythanh Hang and Linh Vu. Patients can conveniently fill out new patient registration forms in English or Vietnamese online before their first visit.', '12545 Briar Forest Dr., Suite A', 'Houston', 'TX', '77077', '(281) 531-5293', ARRAY['English', 'Vietnamese']::text[], 'Primary Care', FALSE, '{"fax": "(281) 759-9175", "images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/pham-medical-clinic-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/pham-medical-clinic-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/pham-medical-clinic-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/pham-medical-clinic-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/pham-medical-clinic-google-5.webp"], "rating": 4.4, "reviews": [{"date": "2026-02-20T12:06:14.972210934Z", "text": "After years of being shuffled between doctors, this was the first place where I truly felt seen and heard. Even though it’s out of network and a long drive for me, the quality of care is absolutely worth it.\n\nThe staff was kind, considerate, and never made me feel rushed. Front desk, nurse and Dr. Pham! For the first time in a long time, I finally have a place I feel confident will support me through the challenges of a progressive disease.\n\nI genuinely feel like I have someone in my corner now, and that means everything. I cried tears of happiness after my visit. I am deeply grateful for this level of care.\n\n10/10 cannot recommend enough!", "author": "CoffeeAnnBooks", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105193709033032748497/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-09-26T16:03:01.611567479Z", "text": "I have never been to this practice. They keep calling blaming my family member for claiming this is their PCP.  The person who I spoke to is rude and tried to come up with several excuses. So I would not even waste time with a medical practice with so much rudeness. If the receptionist is that rude, the medical professional--doctor is probably just as rude. They need to quit calling people and saying the person has put them as their PCP. Everyone has their own right to who they choose as their PCP.", "author": "Susan", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116248146065513382041/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-10-01T16:47:16.999192263Z", "text": "Dr. Pham is great — really kind and takes the time to listen. All the nurse practitioners are amazing too. The front desk staff and MAs are always friendly and helpful. Everyone there just makes you feel taken care of. Highly recommend this clinic.", "author": "Kayla Nguyen", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108790626273211827486/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-10-01T16:44:03.456975094Z", "text": "I’ve been coming here for ages, and Dr. Pham is such a wonderful doctor! He looks after my family and me, and he’s incredibly dedicated. He always takes his time, making sure I’m comfortable and get the best care possible every single visit.", "author": "Lien Chau Nguyen", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101116137295054304569/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-16T12:57:22.671520634Z", "text": "Excellent clinic, respectful of patient time. I really like Dr. Pham and his staff!", "author": "Bill Clarke", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100890689330950905559/reviews"}], "website": "http://www.phammedicalclinic.com/", "location": {"latitude": 29.7535405, "longitude": -95.60441660000001}, "services": ["General Health", "Preventive Care & Wellness", "Physical Exams", "Weight Loss", "Women''s Health", "Urinary Tract Infections", "Diabetes", "Cough, Cold, Flu, Sore Throat", "COPD / Other Upper Respiratory Disorders", "Immunizations", "In-House Lab Tests", "Shingles", "Pneumonia", "Obesity", "Muscle Strains", "Infections", "Skin Problems", "High Blood Pressure", "Heart Disease", "Headaches", "Ear Infections", "Asthma", "Arthritis", "Allergies"], "insurance": {"notes": "Medicaid is not accepted for new patients. This list may change at any time. For questions, call the office.", "accepts_medicaid": true, "accepts_medicare": true, "accepted_networks": ["Aetna", "Assurant", "Blue Cross Blue Shield", "Boon Chapman", "Cigna", "Entrust", "First Health", "Great West Healthcare (GWH)", "Health Choice of Oklahoma", "Humana", "Meritain", "Multiplan", "Patient/Physician Cooperatives (PPC)", "PHCS", "TRICARE", "UMR", "UnitedHealthcare", "Ambetter", "Community Health Choice", "Molina Healthcare", "Amerigroup (Star, StarPlus)", "Community Health Choice (Star)", "Medicare", "Medicaid"], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": true}, "highlights": [{"title": "Family Medicine", "detail": "We are here to serve the needs of your entire family.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "In-House Lab Tests", "detail": "On-site lab testing for patient convenience.", "category": "convenience"}, {"title": "Vietnamese Language Forms", "detail": "New patient packets available in Vietnamese.", "category": "culture"}, {"title": "Wide Insurance Coverage", "detail": "Accepts a large number of commercial, marketplace, Medicaid, and Medicare plans.", "category": "insurance"}], "price_tier": "$", "source_url": "http://www.phammedicalclinic.com/", "appointment": {"booking_note": null, "appointment_url": null, "new_patient_note": "For your convenience, please print and complete applicable forms and present them when you arrive for your first office visit.", "phone_booking_available": true, "online_booking_available": null, "free_consultation_available": null}, "open_sunday": false, "scout_query": "Vietnamese speaking medical clinic in Houston, TX", "search_text": "primary care | family doctor | general practitioner | annual physical | checkup | bác sĩ gia đình | khám tổng quát | nội khoa | 내과 | 가정의학과 | 家庭医生 | 全科医生 | 内科 | english | vietnamese | tiếng việt | người việt | bác sĩ việt | general health | preventive care & wellness | physical exams | weight loss | women''s health | urinary tract infections | diabetes | cough, cold, flu, sore throat | copd / other upper respiratory disorders | immunizations | in-house lab tests | shingles | pneumonia | obesity | muscle strains | infections | skin problems | high blood pressure | heart disease | headaches | ear infections | asthma | arthritis | allergies | preventive | wellness | acute care | chronic disease | diagnostic | aetna | assurant | blue cross blue shield | boon chapman | cigna | entrust | first health | great west healthcare (gwh) | health choice of oklahoma | humana | meritain | multiplan | patient/physician cooperatives (ppc) | phcs | tricare | umr | unitedhealthcare | ambetter | community health choice | molina healthcare | amerigroup (star, starplus) | community health choice (star) | medicare | medicaid | mythanh hang | nurse practitioner | dr. bao thang pham | physician | linh vu", "google_types": ["medical_clinic", "health", "point_of_interest", "establishment"], "open_weekend": false, "rating_count": 38, "team_members": [{"name": "Mythanh Hang", "role": "Nurse Practitioner", "bio_snippet": "NP, APRN, FNP-C", "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Dr. Bao Thang Pham", "role": "Physician", "bio_snippet": "MD, ABFM", "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Linh Vu", "role": "Nurse Practitioner", "bio_snippet": "NP, APRN, FNP-C", "languages_spoken": []}], "language_note": "The clinic provides new patient registration forms in both English and Vietnamese, indicating a commitment to serving the Vietnamese-speaking community in Houston.", "open_saturday": false, "quality_score": 98, "working_hours": {"friday": "7:00 – 11:00 AM", "monday": "8:00 AM – 4:00 PM", "sunday": "Closed", "tuesday": "8:00 AM – 4:00 PM", "saturday": "Closed", "thursday": "7:00 AM – 3:00 PM", "wednesday": "8:00 AM – 4:00 PM"}, "gallery_images": ["https://mln3nvsngxae.i.optimole.com/w:315/h:420/q:mauto/f:best/https://phammedicalclinic.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/10/pic-2a.jpg", "https://mln3nvsngxae.i.optimole.com/w:315/h:420/q:mauto/f:best/https://phammedicalclinic.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/10/pic-3b.jpg", "https://mln3nvsngxae.i.optimole.com/w:315/h:420/q:mauto/f:best/https://phammedicalclinic.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/10/pic-1.jpg"], "review_profile": {"rating": 4.4, "source": "google", "themes": [{"theme": "Staff Professionalism", "mentions": 4, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Multiple reviewers highlight the kindness, consideration, and friendliness of the staff, including the front desk, nurses, and Dr. Pham."}, {"theme": "Clinical Expertise", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients commend Dr. Pham for his dedication, thoroughness, and ability to make them feel heard and cared for."}, {"theme": "Communication", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Reviewers appreciate the time taken to listen and ensure comfort during visits, with no feeling of being rushed."}, {"theme": "Facility Environment", "mentions": 2, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients describe the clinic as a place where they feel taken care of and confident in their treatment."}, {"theme": "Receptionist Behavior", "mentions": 1, "sentiment": "Negative", "summary_quote": "One review criticizes the receptionist for rudeness and incorrect billing claims, impacting the overall perception negatively."}], "summary": "Most patients highly praise Pham Medical Clinic for its compassionate and attentive care, with many highlighting the kindness of the staff and Dr. Pham''s dedication. However, there is one negative review regarding a rude receptionist and billing issues.", "review_count": 38, "concern_themes": [], "positive_themes": [], "featured_reviews": [{"date": "2026-02-20T12:06:14.972210934Z", "text": "After years of being shuffled between doctors, this was the first place where I truly felt seen and heard. Even though it’s out of network and a long drive for me, the quality of care is absolutely worth it.\n\nThe staff was kind, considerate, and never made me feel rushed. Front desk, nurse and Dr. Pham! For the first time in a long time, I finally have a place I feel confident will support me through the challenges of a progressive disease.\n\nI genuinely feel like I have someone in my corner now, and that means everything. I cried tears of happiness after my visit. I am deeply grateful for this level of care.\n\n10/10 cannot recommend enough!", "author": "CoffeeAnnBooks", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105193709033032748497/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-09-26T16:03:01.611567479Z", "text": "I have never been to this practice. They keep calling blaming my family member for claiming this is their PCP.  The person who I spoke to is rude and tried to come up with several excuses. So I would not even waste time with a medical practice with so much rudeness. If the receptionist is that rude, the medical professional--doctor is probably just as rude. They need to quit calling people and saying the person has put them as their PCP. Everyone has their own right to who they choose as their PCP.", "author": "Susan", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116248146065513382041/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-10-01T16:47:16.999192263Z", "text": "Dr. Pham is great — really kind and takes the time to listen. All the nurse practitioners are amazing too. The front desk staff and MAs are always friendly and helpful. Everyone there just makes you feel taken care of. Highly recommend this clinic.", "author": "Kayla Nguyen", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108790626273211827486/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-10-01T16:44:03.456975094Z", "text": "I’ve been coming here for ages, and Dr. Pham is such a wonderful doctor! He looks after my family and me, and he’s incredibly dedicated. He always takes his time, making sure I’m comfortable and get the best care possible every single visit.", "author": "Lien Chau Nguyen", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101116137295054304569/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-16T12:57:22.671520634Z", "text": "Excellent clinic, respectful of patient time. I really like Dr. Pham and his staff!", "author": "Bill Clarke", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100890689330950905559/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Most patients highly praise Pham Medical Clinic for its compassionate and attentive care, with many highlighting the kindness of the staff and Dr. Pham''s dedication. However, there is one negative review regarding a rude receptionist and billing issues.", "about_highlight": "Pham Medical Clinic is a primary care practice in Houston, Texas, dedicated to serving the needs of the entire family. The clinic takes great pride in providing fine medical care and offers a comprehensive range of services including general health, preventive care, physical exams, women''s health, chronic disease management (diabetes, hypertension, asthma, COPD), and acute care for coughs, colds, flu, infections, and allergies. The clinic features in-house lab tests, immunizations, and weight loss services, and is staffed by a team of experienced providers including Dr. Bao Thang Pham and nurse practitioners Mythanh Hang and Linh Vu. Patients can conveniently fill out new patient registration forms in English or Vietnamese online before their first visit.", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=235215076432611689&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJLSQu13zcQIYRaQmVpN2mQwM", "quality_missing": ["appointment_url"], "search_keywords": ["primary care", "family doctor", "general practitioner", "annual physical", "checkup", "bác sĩ gia đình", "khám tổng quát", "nội khoa", "내과", "가정의학과", "家庭医生", "全科医生", "内科", "english", "vietnamese", "tiếng việt", "người việt", "bác sĩ việt", "general health", "preventive care & wellness", "physical exams", "weight loss", "women''s health", "urinary tract infections", "diabetes", "cough, cold, flu, sore throat", "copd / other upper respiratory disorders", "immunizations", "in-house lab tests", "shingles", "pneumonia", "obesity", "muscle strains", "infections", "skin problems", "high blood pressure", "heart disease", "headaches", "ear infections", "asthma", "arthritis", "allergies", "preventive", "wellness", "acute care", "chronic disease", "diagnostic", "aetna", "assurant", "blue cross blue shield", "boon chapman", "cigna", "entrust", "first health", "great west 