": "Top Acupuncture Clinic has a 4.9 star Google rating from 85 Google reviews. Patients commonly mention compassionate care, clear explanations, comfortable visits, strong results.", "review_count": 85, "concern_themes": [], "positive_themes": ["Professional care with heart", "Listens to patients", "Magic needles", "Easy-to-use herbal powders", "Helped with emotional sensitives, body pain, coughing, pressure release, sleeping issues"], "featured_reviews": [{"date": "2025-07-09T07:10:41.217475066Z", "text": "Absolutely Incredible Healing Experience – Highly Recommend Sylvia!\n\nI injured my knee over the July 4th weekend and was in excruciating pain. My left knee was extremely swollen, couldn’t extend on its own, and couldn’t bear any weight. I desperately searched for help, but no orthopedic clinics were open on the weekend. Thankfully, I found this amazing acupuncture clinic in Houston—open on Saturdays—and that’s when I met Sylvia.\n\nSylvia is truly exceptional. From the moment I stepped into her clean, spacious, and well-equipped office, I felt like I was in good hands. She took the time to thoroughly examine me. She treated me with great care, placing acupuncture needles on various key points, and spent two full hours working to reduce the inflammation and pain. By the time I left, the swelling had gone down quite a bit and the pain reduced.\n\nSylvia is not only deeply knowledgeable—holding a doctorate in Chinese Medicine and Acupuncture—but also incredibly compassionate. You can genuinely feel her joy in healing people. Her dedication and expertise go above and beyond.\n\nIf you’re in pain and need real relief, I highly recommend Sylvia and her clinic. She’s a rare find in Houston, and I’m so grateful for the care I received.", "author": "liyan", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115009916768354014609/reviews"}, {"date": "2022-12-16T06:49:53.860442Z", "text": "Dr. He provides professional cares with heart for her patients.  She listens to her patients and treats them with her magic needles.  Her Herbal medicines are fine powders simply mixing with hot water in a cup and ready for use.  It''s simple and easy, much better than the traditional way cooking herbal medicines could take hours to cook.  My family of 4 people benefited from her treatments for the past 3 months from emotional sensitives, body pain, coughing, pressure release, sleeping issue, and etc.  Thanks Dr. He for offering an unique place and her passions to cure each patient.  Love her smile and her optimism personality!", "author": "Lana Lee", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117570028181528691014/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-10-21T00:24:24.358726361Z", "text": "So to follow up on my first review, I left coming to top Acupuncture end of June/August of this year after having a life-threatening car accident Dr. Sylvia Qiaosha He has been an absolute blessing to say the least. I’m not sure who had a bad day with some of these questionable reviews, but I had a traumatic brain injury, a skull fracture and a respiratory infection due to a bad climate that I’ve been living in This Dr. Sylvia pinpointed almost immediately when she saw my back, but it was crooked and she knew exactly what to do. She goes out of her way to heal me and make sure that I’m not in pain. I absolutely can feel a difference in the pain from being a one to 10 which was on a 10 before meeting this doctor. It’s subsided immensely I would say I’m at four and this is just in less than two months. She’s been outstanding and I would recommend her to anyone in pain anyone with anxiety or depression. What’s I liked the most as she has a holistic approach with Healing anything wrong with you and your body physically let her know and I guarantee you she will heal it. I’m convinced. I’m beyond surprised after eight months of pain, I finally found her. I cannot believe how quickly she’s helped heal my body thank you. You’re an absolute blessing to me.", "author": "Shae j", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107662716644271649049/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-09-23T00:41:27.093889763Z", "text": "Dr. Sylvia is wonderful! She truly cares about her patients, and it shows from the first time you meet. She takes the time to really get to know your issues and concerns so that she is able to address them accordingly.\n\nMy husband and I are so glad we found her. And the fact that her office takes insurance is the cherry on top!", "author": "Joelle Vargas-Lowe", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107550626454384000775/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-01-09T00:27:13.866187Z", "text": "As a veteran, I was referred to Top Acupuncture by the VA chiropractor to address my chronic fatigue, pain, and PTSD. From the moment I walked into Top Acupuncture, Dr. Sylvia made me feel welcome and understood. She took the time to listen to my concerns and created a customized treatment plan tailored specifically to my needs. Her approach was not only professional but also deeply compassionate, which immediately put me at ease.\n\nAfter completing 12 sessions, the changes I’ve experienced have been nothing short of transformative. My chronic pain has significantly diminished, my energy levels have improved, and I’ve noticed a much more positive outlook on life. Tasks that once felt overwhelming are now manageable, and I’ve even been able to become more active, which has further improved my overall well-being.\n\nWhat truly sets Dr. Sylvia apart is her genuine empathy and dedication to her patients. She doesn’t just treat symptoms; she addresses the whole person. Her knowledge, skill, and kindness create an environment where healing feels possible, even for those like myself who have struggled for years. I cannot recommend her highly enough to anyone seeking pain relief, overall better health and a better quality of life. Dr. Sylvia is truly remarkable, and I’m deeply grateful for the care she has provided.\n\nCharles", "author": "Rusty C", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100300188046171213127/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Top Acupuncture Clinic has a 4.9 star Google rating from 85 Google reviews. Patients commonly mention compassionate care, clear explanations, comfortable visits, strong results.", "about_highlight": "Top Acupuncture Clinic in Houston, TX, offers personalized acupuncture treatments for whole-body wellness. Led by Dr. Sylvia Qiaosha He, the clinic provides a calming experience and develops treatment plans based on each patient''s specific circumstances. Services include acupuncture for pain, stress and anxiety reduction, fertility support, fibromyalgia treatment, IBS treatment, weight loss, and alternative medicine. The clinic also offers cupping therapy and herbal medicine in easy-to-use powder form. Patients come for a wide range of conditions including emotional disorders, digestive issues, women''s health, men''s health, skin disorders, anti-aging, and more. The team is dedicated to facilitating a comfortable and healing environment, helping patients experience their own natural healing power.", "appointment_url": "https://acupuncturisthoustontx.com/contact/", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=13137819012838680980&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJC24_fuDDQIYRlGmf98joUrY", "quality_missing": ["insurance"], "search_keywords": ["acupuncture & tcm", "acupuncture", "chinese medicine", "tcm", "herbal medicine", "cupping", "pain relief", "châm cứu", "đông y", "y học cổ truyền", "한의원", "침술", "한약", "中医", "针灸", "中药", "english", "chinese", "mandarin", "cantonese", "中文", "普通话", "国语", "粤语", "广东话", "华人", "acupuncture for disorders", "acupuncture for pain", "acupuncture for smoking", "acupuncture for weight loss", "alternative medicine", "fertility acupuncture", "fibromyalgia treatment", "irritable bowel syndrome treatment", "stress & anxiety reduction", "cupping therapy", "dr. sylvia qiaosha he", "acupuncturist / herbalist", "lana lee", "patient (testimonial)"], "services_offered": [{"name": "Acupuncture", "category": "Alternative Medicine", "description": "Personalized acupuncture treatments for whole-body wellness.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients with various conditions seeking natural healing."}, {"name": "Acupuncture For Disorders", "category": "Alternative Medicine", "description": "Acupuncture treatments for emotional and mental disorders.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients with anxiety, depression, stress, and other emotional disorders."}, {"name": "Acupuncture For Pain", "category": "Alternative Medicine", "description": "Acupuncture treatments for pain relief.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients experiencing pain."}, {"name": "Acupuncture For Smoking", "category": "Alternative Medicine", "description": "Acupuncture treatments to help quit smoking.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Individuals seeking to stop smoking."}, {"name": "Acupuncture For Weight Loss", "category": "Alternative Medicine", "description": "Acupuncture treatments to support weight loss.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients who are overweight or obese."}, {"name": "Alternative Medicine", "category": "Alternative Medicine", "description": "General alternative medicine services.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients seeking non-traditional healing approaches."}, {"name": "Fertility Acupuncture", "category": "Alternative Medicine", "description": "Acupuncture treatments to support fertility.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Individuals or couples trying to conceive."}, {"name": "Fibromyalgia Treatment", "category": "Alternative Medicine", "description": "Acupuncture treatments for fibromyalgia.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients with fibromyalgia."}, {"name": "Irritable Bowel Syndrome Treatment", "category": "Alternative Medicine", "description": "Acupuncture treatments for IBS.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients with irritable bowel syndrome."}, {"name": "Stress & Anxiety Reduction", "category": "Alternative Medicine", "description": "Acupuncture treatments to reduce stress and anxiety.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Individuals experiencing stress or anxiety."}, {"name": "Cupping Therapy", "category": "Alternative Medicine", "description": "Trusted cupping therapy for pain relief and wellness.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients seeking pain relief and improved well-being."}], "short_description": "Personalized acupuncture and cupping therapy for whole-body wellness in Houston, TX, led by licensed acupuncturist Dr. Sylvia Qiaosha He.", "google_website_url": "https://acupuncturisthoustontx.com/", "google_primary_type": "Medical Clinic", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": ["Dr. Sylvia Qiaosha He", "Lana Lee"], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "2000 Bering Dr Ste 270, Houston, TX 77057, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/109962704698507965474", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXCF9-FxJq0sXsEpOae3EQ74hs-5xEKwMNhr-s_KXe8iwbTAqsL=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Top Acupuncture Clinic"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/109962704698507965474", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXCF9-FxJq0sXsEpOae3EQ74hs-5xEKwMNhr-s_KXe8iwbTAqsL=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Top Acupuncture Clinic"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/108249999646063651702", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKAoO8nmmJ3JpY1hNs5SqxqQFmjPhZZRXD9R-cuQlOcTAqK0A=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Brandon Smith"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/117570028181528691014", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV44_EM0c9NK6ncl10N0tMdvsoLnHFZju1XSv45xGOhVV9HVvHeQA=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Lana Lee"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/109962704698507965474", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXCF9-FxJq0sXsEpOae3EQ74hs-5xEKwMNhr-s_KXe8iwbTAqsL=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Top Acupuncture Clinic"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-26T10:39:41.500903+00:00', 'top-acupuncture-clinic', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('3c285d04-fdb4-47e6-a013-742c93ac04e6', NULL, 'TCM Acupuncture & Herbs', 'TCM Acupuncture & Herbs, also known as TCM Houston Acupuncture & Herbs, provides Traditional Chinese Medicine (TCM) treatments including acupuncture and Chinese herbal medicine. The clinic specializes in medical dermatology, autoimmune diseases, digestive disorders, women''s health, allergy, pain management, mental health, and sub-health conditions. Their approach focuses on treating the whole body rather than just symptoms, using the finest herbs and individually designed treatment plans for each patient. The clinic emphasizes treating the root of disease with fewer side effects than medications, reducing recurrence rates, and improving overall immunity and hormonal balance.', '9440 Bellaire Blvd Ste 238', 'Houston', 'TX', '77036', '832-930-0688', ARRAY['English', 'Spanish', 'Chinese']::text[], 'Acupuncture & TCM', FALSE, '{"email": "tcmhoustontx@gmail.com", "images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/tcm-acupuncture-herbs-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/tcm-acupuncture-herbs-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/tcm-acupuncture-herbs-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/tcm-acupuncture-herbs-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/tcm-acupuncture-herbs-google-5.webp"], "rating": 4.7, "pricing": [{"name": "Pricing page link", "notes": "A pricing page is referenced in the services menu but no specific prices are listed on the homepage.", "price": null, "category": null, "price_range": null}], "reviews": [{"date": "2026-03-18T12:36:23.307709171Z", "text": "Dr. Yang is amazing! She has been treating my 1yr old daughter’s eczema for the past 5 weeks. The progress she’s experienced in the short amount of time is remarkable as we’ve been battling with her eczema since she was 6 months. Dr. Yang, is patient, kind, and knows exactly what she’s doing! I was reluctant to try this route of medicine but I am so glad we did! Below you will find pictures of my daughters before and after, thank you so much Dr. Yang!", "author": "Aimee Yanez", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105679341480348373366/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-04-02T14:39:24.741618970Z", "text": "I come here once a week sometimes twice a week for my herniated intervertebral disc pain on my back. I was skeptical because I relied on medicine for the pain but after my fourth session, I have not taken any medicine and it’s been about 3 weeks since I’ve taken medicine when I used to take it every day for years. After my first session, I was able to put on my underwear with less of a struggle. I know I am getting there since I don’t rely on pill medicine anymore. I am doing acupuncture with cupping together.", "author": "Marilyn Anguiano", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110935588398044916143/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-07T15:56:11.318918075Z", "text": "This doctor was very attentive, knowledgeable, and incredibly patient. She took the time to diagnose and explain everything thoroughly, making sure I understood every detail. She was also extremely kind and caring throughout the visit. I’m beyond excited to start my treatment and feel confident in her care. I highly recommend her to anyone looking for a doctor who truly listens and explains everything with great detail.", "author": "Mia Rayner", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115534309920053069393/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-03-23T17:08:12.692301633Z", "text": "I am currently having a wonderful experience with  drinking her teas as she instructed.  My symptom''s had been happening for years, after three months drinking the tea, I have noticed my symptoms are declining.\n\nTraditional Chinese Medicine works  for me !!\n\nDr Yang is very good at TCM practice !!!\n\n😀😀😀😀😀😀", "author": "Themetta TURNER", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101962266096814838534/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-06-26T21:12:02.093378373Z", "text": "I can’t say enough good things. my grandson has been struggling with eczema since 6months old, he’s now 7. we’ve tried EVERYTHING with no luck. He started drinking some herbs she sent to us and within 2 weeks he is practically eczema free. we are so beyond thankful and can’t recommend her enough. DO NOT HESITATE, she knows exactly what she is doing and i wish we would’ve done this sooner!", "author": "Tami", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118292916086635579379/reviews"}], "website": "https://www.acupunctureherbshouston.com", "location": {"latitude": 29.705333299999996, "longitude": -95.5499933}, "services": ["Medical Dermatology", "Autoimmune Diseases", "Digestive Disorders", "Women’s Health", "Allergy", "Pain Management", "Mental Health", "Sub–Health Conditions"], "insurance": {"notes": "No insurance information is mentioned on the page.", "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": [], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": false}, "highlights": [{"title": "Traditional Chinese Medicine", "detail": "Clinic specializes in acupuncture and Chinese herbal medicine for whole-body healing.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Bilingual Staff", "detail": "Phone support available in English, Spanish, and Chinese (En, Es, Cn).", "category": "culture"}, {"title": "Medical Dermatology Focus", "detail": "Treats acne, eczema, psoriasis, melasma, and other skin conditions with TCM.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Individualized Treatment", "detail": "Treatment plans are individually designed for each patient.", "category": "care"}], "price_tier": "$$", "source_url": "https://www.acupunctureherbshouston.com/", "appointment": {"booking_note": null, "appointment_url": null, "new_patient_note": null, "phone_booking_available": true, "online_booking_available": false, "free_consultation_available": null}, "open_sunday": false, "scout_query": "Chinese speaking medical clinic in Houston, TX", "search_text": "acupuncture & tcm | acupuncture | chinese medicine | tcm | herbal medicine | cupping | pain relief | châm cứu | đông y | y học cổ truyền | 한의원 | 침술 | 한약 | 中医 | 针灸 | 中药 | english | spanish | chinese | mandarin | cantonese | 中文 | 普通话 | 国语 | 粤语 | 广东话 | 华人 | medical dermatology | autoimmune diseases | digestive disorders | women’s health | allergy | pain management | mental health | sub–health conditions | dermatology | autoimmune | gastroenterology | women''s health | general health | dr. yang | doctor (tcm practitioner)", "google_types": ["doctor", "medical_clinic", "health", "point_of_interest", "establishment"], "open_weekend": true, "rating_count": 99, "team_members": [{"name": "Dr. Yang", "role": "Doctor (TCM Practitioner)", "bio_snippet": "Referenced in a patient review: ''Since being treated by Dr. Yang, my energy level has increased and my blood test results have improved.''", "languages_spoken": []}], "language_note": "TCM Acupuncture & Herbs is a Chinese medicine clinic that provides culturally responsive care rooted in Traditional Chinese Medicine. The clinic has a bilingual website (English and Chinese) and serves the Asian community in Houston''s Chinatown area on Bellaire Blvd. Phone support is offered in English, Spanish, and Chinese (En, Es, Cn).", "open_saturday": true, "quality_score": 93, "working_hours": {"friday": "9:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "monday": "9:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "sunday": "Closed", "tuesday": "9:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "saturday": "9:00 AM – 3:00 PM", "thursday": "9:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "wednesday": "9:00 AM – 5:00 PM"}, "gallery_images": ["https://www.acupunctureherbshouston.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/04/s-Fresh-herb-stethoscope-e1466552509470.jpg", "https://www.acupunctureherbshouston.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/05/s-growing-plants-e1466552432355.jpg", "https://www.acupunctureherbshouston.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/04/s-mimosa-on-wooden-table-e1466552358321.jpg"], "review_profile": {"rating": 4.7, "source": "google", "themes": [{"theme": "Treatment Outcomes", "mentions": 5, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Multiple reviewers report remarkable progress in conditions like eczema and chronic pain after treatment."}, {"theme": "Clinical Expertise", "mentions": 4, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients consistently highlight Dr. Yang''s deep knowledge and effective use of TCM techniques."}, {"theme": "Communication", "mentions": 2, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Reviewers appreciate Dr. Yang''s thorough explanations and patience in ensuring understanding."}, {"theme": "Staff Professionalism", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients describe Dr. Yang as kind, attentive, and genuinely caring during visits."}, {"theme": "Facility Environment", "mentions": 0, "sentiment": "Neutral", "summary_quote": "No specific mentions of the facility environment in the provided reviews."}], "summary": "Patients overwhelmingly praise Dr. Yang for her expertise in Traditional Chinese Medicine, noting significant improvements in conditions like eczema and chronic pain, along with her attentive and caring approach.", "review_count": 99, "concern_themes": [], "positive_themes": ["Comfortable discussing illness", "Good follow-up on progress", "Improved energy levels", "Improved blood test results", "Helpful for eczema"], "featured_reviews": [{"date": "2026-03-18T12:36:23.307709171Z", "text": "Dr. Yang is amazing! She has been treating my 1yr old daughter’s eczema for the past 5 weeks. The progress she’s experienced in the short amount of time is remarkable as we’ve been battling with her eczema since she was 6 months. Dr. Yang, is patient, kind, and knows exactly what she’s doing! I was reluctant to try this route of medicine but I am so glad we did! Below you will find pictures of my daughters before and after, thank you so much Dr. Yang!", "author": "Aimee Yanez", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105679341480348373366/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-04-02T14:39:24.741618970Z", "text": "I come here once a week sometimes twice a week for my herniated intervertebral disc pain on my back. I was skeptical because I relied on medicine for the pain but after my fourth session, I have not taken any medicine and it’s been about 3 weeks since I’ve taken medicine when I used to take it every day for years. After my first session, I was able to put on my underwear with less of a struggle. I know I am getting there since I don’t rely on pill medicine anymore. I am doing acupuncture with cupping together.", "author": "Marilyn Anguiano", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110935588398044916143/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-07T15:56:11.318918075Z", "text": "This doctor was very attentive, knowledgeable, and incredibly patient. She took the time to diagnose and explain everything thoroughly, making sure I understood every detail. She was also extremely kind and caring throughout the visit. I’m beyond excited to start my treatment and feel confident in her care. I highly recommend her to anyone looking for a doctor who truly listens and explains everything with great detail.", "author": "Mia Rayner", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115534309920053069393/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-03-23T17:08:12.692301633Z", "text": "I am currently having a wonderful experience with  drinking her teas as she instructed.  My symptom''s had been happening for years, after three months drinking the tea, I have noticed my symptoms are declining.\n\nTraditional Chinese Medicine works  for me !!\n\nDr Yang is very good at TCM practice !!!\n\n😀😀😀😀😀😀", "author": "Themetta TURNER", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101962266096814838534/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-06-26T21:12:02.093378373Z", "text": "I can’t say enough good things. my grandson has been struggling with eczema since 6months old, he’s now 7. we’ve tried EVERYTHING with no luck. He started drinking some herbs she sent to us and within 2 weeks he is practically eczema free. we are so beyond thankful and can’t recommend her enough. DO NOT HESITATE, she knows exactly what she is doing and i wish we would’ve done this sooner!", "author": "Tami", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118292916086635579379/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Patients overwhelmingly praise Dr. Yang for her expertise in Traditional Chinese Medicine, noting significant improvements in conditions like eczema and chronic pain, along with her attentive and caring approach.", "about_highlight": "TCM Acupuncture & Herbs, also known as TCM Houston Acupuncture & Herbs, provides Traditional Chinese Medicine (TCM) treatments including acupuncture and Chinese herbal medicine. The clinic specializes in medical dermatology, autoimmune diseases, digestive disorders, women''s health, allergy, pain management, mental health, and sub-health conditions. Their approach focuses on treating the whole body rather than just symptoms, using the finest herbs and individually designed treatment plans for each patient. The clinic emphasizes treating the root of disease with fewer side effects than medications, reducing recurrence rates, and improving overall immunity and hormonal balance.", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=17750041218820547577&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJbTDhxyTCQIYR-SNX3HHQVPY", "quality_missing": ["insurance", "appointment_url"], "search_keywords": ["acupuncture & tcm", "acupuncture", "chinese medicine", "tcm", "herbal medicine", "cupping", "pain relief", "châm cứu", "đông y", "y học cổ truyền", "한의원", "침술", "한약", "中医", "针灸", "中药", "english", "spanish", "chinese", "mandarin", "cantonese", "中文", "普通话", "国语", "粤语", "广东话", "华人", "medical dermatology", "autoimmune diseases", "digestive disorders", "women’s health", "allergy", "pain management", "mental health", "sub–health conditions", "dermatology", "autoimmune", "gastroenterology", "women''s health", "general health", "dr. yang", "doctor (tcm practitioner)"], "cultural_context": "TCM Acupuncture & Herbs is a Chinese medicine clinic that provides culturally responsive care rooted in Traditional Chinese Medicine. The clinic has a bilingual website (English and Chinese) and serves the Asian community in Houston''s Chinatown area on Bellaire Blvd. Phone support is offered in English, Spanish, and Chinese (En, Es, Cn).", "services_offered": [{"name": "Medical Dermatology", "category": "Dermatology", "description": "Acupuncture and Chinese Herbs have good effects on skin disorders, very effective on these conditions: Acne, Melasma, Eczema, Psoriasis, Vitiligo, Allergic Rhinitis, Asthma, etc.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients with skin conditions such as acne, eczema, psoriasis, melasma, vitiligo."}, {"name": "Autoimmune Diseases", "category": "Autoimmune", "description": "Scleroderma, Lupus Erythematosus, Mixed Connective Tissue Disease (MCTD), Sjogren’s Syndrome, Pemphigus, Bechet’s Disease, Vasculitis, Rheumatoid Arthritis, etc.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients with autoimmune conditions."}, {"name": "Digestive Disorders", "category": "Gastroenterology", "description": "Nausea, Malnutrition, Indigestion, Constipation, Gastroesophageal Reflux Disease (GERD), Irritable Bowel Syndrome (IBS), Stomach Pain etc.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients with digestive issues."}, {"name": "Women’s Health", "category": "Women''s Health", "description": "Dysmenorrhea, Irregular Menstruation, Hormone Imbalance, Endometriosis, Menopause Syndrome, Uterine Fibroids, etc.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Women seeking treatment for reproductive and hormonal health."}, {"name": "Allergy", "category": "Allergy", "description": "Allergic Rhinitis, Sinus Infections, Seasonal Allergies, Itchy eyes, Cough, Asthma.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients with allergies and respiratory sensitivities."}, {"name": "Pain Management", "category": "Pain Management", "description": "Headache/Migraine, Sciatica, Back pain, Joint pain, Post Stroke, and other Musculoskeletal Pain.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients with acute or chronic pain."}, {"name": "Mental Health", "category": "Mental Health", "description": "Depression, Anxiety, Insomnia, Nervousness etc.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients with mental health concerns."}, {"name": "Sub–Health Conditions", "category": "General Health", "description": "Fatigue, Dizziness, Migraines, Pain, Fever, Tinnitus, etc.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients with general wellness and sub-health issues."}], "short_description": "TCM Acupuncture & Herbs offers Traditional Chinese Medicine treatments including acupuncture and herbal medicine for skin disorders, autoimmune conditions, pain, and more in Houston, TX.", "google_website_url": "https://www.acupunctureherbshouston.com/", "google_primary_type": "Medical Clinic", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": ["Dr. Yang"], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "9440 Bellaire Blvd #238, Houston, TX 77036, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/101723341612737109362", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVZKX5HTtMzU3Ga5slgCO317hP6VANVbWJUq7jcWyCXz2hpxUk=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "TCM Acupuncture & Herbs dermatology"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/101723341612737109362", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVZKX5HTtMzU3Ga5slgCO317hP6VANVbWJUq7jcWyCXz2hpxUk=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "TCM Acupuncture & Herbs dermatology"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/101723341612737109362", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVZKX5HTtMzU3Ga5slgCO317hP6VANVbWJUq7jcWyCXz2hpxUk=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "TCM Acupuncture & Herbs dermatology"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/101723341612737109362", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVZKX5HTtMzU3Ga5slgCO317hP6VANVbWJUq7jcWyCXz2hpxUk=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "TCM Acupuncture & Herbs dermatology"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/101723341612737109362", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVZKX5HTtMzU3Ga5slgCO317hP6VANVbWJUq7jcWyCXz2hpxUk=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "TCM Acupuncture & Herbs dermatology"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-26T10:41:06.298222+00:00', 'tcm-acupuncture-herbs', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('f9c085d7-7ad7-49ea-8c09-86e6870eb29e', NULL, 'Acupuncture Herbal and Natural Therapy正本中医疑难病诊所', 'Acupuncture Herbal & Natural Therapy 正本中医疑难病诊所 combines the diagnostic precision of Western medicine with the holistic principles of Traditional Chinese Medicine (TCM). Their team of senior practitioners with 30 to 40 years of clinical experience provides personalized treatment plans using acupuncture, cupping, tuina, herbal medicine, physiotherapy, dietary therapy, qigong, and tai chi. The clinic specializes in chronic pain, sleep disorders, digestive issues, immune imbalances, gynecological conditions, and emotional stress, focusing on root-cause healing and improved vitality.', '9440 Bellaire Blvd Ste202, Houston, TX 77036', 'Houston', 'TX', '77036', '(346) 692-3445', ARRAY['English', 'Chinese']::text[], 'Acupuncture & TCM', FALSE, '{"images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/acupuncture-herbal-and-natural-therapy-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/acupuncture-herbal-and-natural-therapy-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/acupuncture-herbal-and-natural-therapy-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/acupuncture-herbal-and-natural-therapy-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/acupuncture-herbal-and-natural-therapy-google-5.webp"], "rating": 5, "reviews": [{"date": "2025-02-21T21:47:11.020896Z", "text": "I have been seeing Dr. Ye for my struggles with PCOS, and I am truly grateful for his treatment. My primary goal is to heal my body holistically while at the same time, I want to get off birth control pills. Dr. Ye has been instrumental in this journey, utilizing traditional herbs to help me manage my symptoms. After a couple of months of treatment, I’ve noticed significant improvements in my period regularity, reduced cramps, and an overall sense of well-being. I have complete trust in Dr. Ye''s expertise and professionalism, and I feel optimistic about my progress.", "author": "May S", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100287104309174260940/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-01-11T16:42:10.524476Z", "text": "I have been coming to Dr. Ye for my PCOS treatment through traditional herbal medicine for a couple of months. I love his wholistic approach and that he could help with my period regularity while also treating cramps. My ultimate goal is healed ovaries and I trust Dr. Ye to get me there.", "author": "Jane", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102811889712373832209/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-01-11T16:53:40.031729Z", "text": "I’ve been struggling with menstrual cramps for many years, but under Dr. Ye’s treatment, my problem has finally been resolved. Dr. Ye is not only highly skilled and professional but also incredibly kind and patient. He takes the time to thoroughly understand your condition and explains the treatment plan clearly. I’m truly grateful for his help! Highly recommend!", "author": "Jade", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115504581444421989686/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-06-06T18:11:43.630820Z", "text": "My mom had shingles and she was on acyclovir. She still struggled with severe neuropathic pain even taking gabapentin. After having 6 sessions of acupuncture with Dr. Ye and Dr. Zhao, her pain is almost gone. We really appreciate their care.", "author": "YG Xu", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107363671782878160365/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-02-03T22:28:20.693735Z", "text": "Dr. Ye is super experienced in Chinese medicine. I got treated for rhinitis and menstrual pain, and it really helped. Definitely recommend!", "author": "Lemmon Wang", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105004824502536094918/reviews"}], "website": "http://acupunctureherbalnaturetherapy.com/", "location": {"latitude": 29.705284, "longitude": -95.549554}, "services": ["Acupuncture", "Acupressure / Tuina", "Herbal Medicine", "Cupping", "Pain Management", "Internal Medicine", "Dermatology", "Men’s Health", "Women’s Health"], "insurance": {"notes": "Currently applying to join networks of Ambetter From Superior, Devoted, Medicaid, Community Health Choice, and Oscar. See Insurance FAQ for details. Medicare Advantage plans explicitly accepted for CMS Required CLBP.", "accepts_medicaid": true, "accepts_medicare": true, "accepted_networks": ["Aetna", "Medicare", "Blue Cross Blue Shield", "Centivo (Benefit Plan)", "ChooseHealthy Program", "Cigna", "Multiplan", "Moda Health", "Medicaid", "UnitedHealthcare", "Ambetter"], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": true}, "highlights": [{"title": "Integrative Eastern & Western Medicine", "detail": "Combines TCM (acupuncture, cupping, tuina, herbal medicine) with modern physiotherapy and diagnostic tools.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Senior Practitioners with 30–40 Years Experience", "detail": "Team includes licensed acupuncturists, certified TCM doctors, and pain management doctors with extensive clinical experience.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Personalized Treatment Plans", "detail": "Uses tongue and pulse diagnosis, lifestyle analysis, and psychological evaluation for customized root-cause care.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Accepts Multiple Insurance Plans", "detail": "Accepts Aetna, BlueCross BlueShield, Cigna, United Healthcare, Providence Health Plan, and several Medicare Advantage plans.", "category": "insurance"}, {"title": "Chronic & Complex Condition Specialists", "detail": "Focuses on chronic pain, sleep disorders, digestive issues, immune imbalances, gynecological conditions, and stress.", "category": "care"}], "price_tier": "$", "source_url": "http://acupunctureherbalnaturetherapy.com/", "appointment": {"booking_note": null, "appointment_url": null, "new_patient_note": null, "phone_booking_available": null, "online_booking_available": null, "free_consultation_available": null}, "open_sunday": false, "scout_query": "Chinese speaking medical clinic in Houston, TX", "search_text": "acupuncture & tcm | acupuncture | chinese medicine | tcm | herbal medicine | cupping | pain relief | châm cứu | đông y | y học cổ truyền | 한의원 | 침술 | 한약 | 中医 | 针灸 | 中药 | english | chinese | mandarin | cantonese | 中文 | 普通话 | 国语 | 粤语 | 广东话 | 华人 | acupressure / tuina | pain management | internal medicine | dermatology | men’s health | women’s health | men''s health | women''s health | aetna | medicare | blue cross blue shield | centivo (benefit plan) | choosehealthy program | cigna | multiplan | moda health | medicaid | unitedhealthcare | ambetter", "google_types": ["medical_clinic", "health", "point_of_interest", "establishment"], "open_weekend": false, "rating_count": 14, "language_note": "The clinic explicitly integrates Traditional Chinese Medicine (TCM) theory with modern medical advancements. The website offers both English and Chinese language versions, and the logo includes Chinese characters. Staff include senior practitioners with decades of experience in both Chinese and Western medicine, serving a diverse patient base. The clinic also mentions insurance partnerships with Medicare Advantage plans, including those from Alignment Healthcare and SCAN Health Plan, which cater to seniors in culturally diverse communities.", "open_saturday": false, "quality_score": 95, "working_hours": {"friday": "9:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "monday": "9:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "sunday": "Closed", "tuesday": "9:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "saturday": "Closed", "thursday": "9:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "wednesday": "9:00 AM – 5:00 PM"}, "gallery_images": ["https://acupunctureherbalnaturetherapy.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/2-1-768x1024.jpg", "https://acupunctureherbalnaturetherapy.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/4-1-1024x768.jpg", "https://acupunctureherbalnaturetherapy.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/IMG_4307-scaled.jpg"], "review_profile": {"rating": 5, "source": "google", "themes": [{"theme": "Treatment Outcomes", "mentions": 5, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Multiple patients report significant improvements in conditions like PCOS, menstrual pain, and shingles-related pain after treatment."}, {"theme": "Clinical Expertise", "mentions": 4, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Reviewers frequently commend Dr. Ye''s skill and experience in traditional Chinese medicine and holistic approaches."}, {"theme": "Staff Professionalism", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients describe Dr. Ye as kind, patient, and thorough in explaining treatment plans."}, {"theme": "Holistic Approach", "mentions": 2, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Several reviews highlight appreciation for the clinic''s wholistic treatment methods."}, {"theme": "Communication", "mentions": 1, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "One patient specifically noted Dr. Ye''s clear explanations of their condition and treatment plan."}], "summary": "Patients consistently praise Dr. Ye and his team for their effective holistic treatments, particularly for PCOS, menstrual pain, and shingles-related neuropathic pain, highlighting significant symptom relief and professional care.", "review_count": 14, "concern_themes": [], "positive_themes": [], "featured_reviews": [{"date": "2025-02-21T21:47:11.020896Z", "text": "I have been seeing Dr. Ye for my struggles with PCOS, and I am truly grateful for his treatment. My primary goal is to heal my body holistically while at the same time, I want to get off birth control pills. Dr. Ye has been instrumental in this journey, utilizing traditional herbs to help me manage my symptoms. After a couple of months of treatment, I’ve noticed significant improvements in my period regularity, reduced cramps, and an overall sense of well-being. I have complete trust in Dr. Ye''s expertise and professionalism, and I feel optimistic about my progress.", "author": "May S", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100287104309174260940/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-01-11T16:42:10.524476Z", "text": "I have been coming to Dr. Ye for my PCOS treatment through traditional herbal medicine for a couple of months. I love his wholistic approach and that he could help with my period regularity while also treating cramps. My ultimate goal is healed ovaries and I trust Dr. Ye to get me there.", "author": "Jane", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102811889712373832209/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-01-11T16:53:40.031729Z", "text": "I’ve been struggling with menstrual cramps for many years, but under Dr. Ye’s treatment, my problem has finally been resolved. Dr. Ye is not only highly skilled and professional but also incredibly kind and patient. He takes the time to thoroughly understand your condition and explains the treatment plan clearly. I’m truly grateful for his help! Highly recommend!", "author": "Jade", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115504581444421989686/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-06-06T18:11:43.630820Z", "text": "My mom had shingles and she was on acyclovir. She still struggled with severe neuropathic pain even taking gabapentin. After having 6 sessions of acupuncture with Dr. Ye and Dr. Zhao, her pain is almost gone. We really appreciate their care.", "author": "YG Xu", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107363671782878160365/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-02-03T22:28:20.693735Z", "text": "Dr. Ye is super experienced in Chinese medicine. I got treated for rhinitis and menstrual pain, and it really helped. Definitely recommend!", "author": "Lemmon Wang", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105004824502536094918/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Patients consistently praise Dr. Ye and his team for their effective holistic treatments, particularly for PCOS, menstrual pain, and shingles-related neuropathic pain, highlighting significant symptom relief and professional care.", "about_highlight": "Acupuncture Herbal & Natural Therapy 正本中医疑难病诊所 combines the diagnostic precision of Western medicine with the holistic principles of Traditional Chinese Medicine (TCM). Their team of senior practitioners with 30 to 40 years of clinical experience provides personalized treatment plans using acupuncture, cupping, tuina, herbal medicine, physiotherapy, dietary therapy, qigong, and tai chi. The clinic specializes in chronic pain, sleep disorders, digestive issues, immune imbalances, gynecological conditions, and emotional stress, focusing on root-cause healing and improved vitality.", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=6828189857522973364&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJWWpHFwDDQIYRtPqUhH-awl4", "quality_missing": ["team_members", "appointment_url"], "search_keywords": ["acupuncture & tcm", "acupuncture", "chinese medicine", "tcm", "herbal medicine", "cupping", "pain relief", "châm cứu", "đông y", "y học cổ truyền", "한의원", "침술", "한약", "中医", "针灸", "中药", "english", "chinese", "mandarin", "cantonese", "中文", "普通话", "国语", "粤语", "广东话", "华人", "acupressure / tuina", "pain management", "internal medicine", "dermatology", "men’s health", "women’s health", "men''s health", "women''s health", "aetna", "medicare", "blue cross blue shield", "centivo (benefit plan)", "choosehealthy program", "cigna", "multiplan", "moda health", "medicaid", "unitedhealthcare", "ambetter"], "cultural_context": "The clinic explicitly integrates Traditional Chinese Medicine (TCM) theory with modern medical advancements. The website offers both English and Chinese language versions, and the logo includes Chinese characters. Staff include senior practitioners with decades of experience in both Chinese and Western medicine, serving a diverse patient base. The clinic also mentions insurance partnerships with Medicare Advantage plans, including those from Alignment Healthcare and SCAN Health Plan, which cater to seniors in culturally diverse communities.", "services_offered": [{"name": "Acupuncture", "category": "TCM", "description": "Traditional acupuncture using fine needles to restore energy flow and treat pain, stress, and chronic conditions.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Acupressure / Tuina", "category": "TCM", "description": "Therapeutic massage and acupressure techniques to release tension and promote healing.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Herbal Medicine", "category": "TCM", "description": "Custom Chinese herbal formulas tailored to individual diagnosis.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Cupping", "category": "TCM", "description": "Suction cup therapy for pain relief, detoxification, and improved circulation.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Pain Management", "category": "Internal Medicine", "description": "Integrated approach for acute and chronic pain conditions.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Internal Medicine", "category": "Internal Medicine", "description": "Treatment of digestive, respiratory, and other internal disorders.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Dermatology", "category": "Dermatology", "description": "Management of skin conditions using TCM and natural therapies.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Men’s Health", "category": "Men''s Health", "description": "Hormonal, prostate, and vitality health for men.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Women’s Health", "category": "Women''s Health", "description": "Gynecological care, fertility support, and hormonal balance.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}], "short_description": "Acupuncture Herbal & Natural Therapy 正本中医疑难病诊所 integrates Traditional Chinese Medicine with modern diagnostic tools, offering acupuncture, herbal medicine, cupping, tuina, and personalized care for chronic and complex conditions.", "google_website_url": "http://acupunctureherbalnaturetherapy.com/", "insurance_accepted": ["Aetna", "Medicare", "Blue Cross Blue Shield", "Centivo (Benefit Plan)", "ChooseHealthy Program", "Cigna", "Multiplan", "Moda Health", "Medicaid", "UnitedHealthcare", "Ambetter"], "google_primary_type": "Medical Clinic", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": [], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "9440 Bellaire Blvd Ste202, Houston, TX 77036, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/117193368468017082089", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV6PHwYv7wU8-na3TaKgT1kC1U4xOs01vlN9GahavahIExhvjk=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Acupuncture Herbal and Natural Therapy正本中医疑难病诊所"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/117193368468017082089", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV6PHwYv7wU8-na3TaKgT1kC1U4xOs01vlN9GahavahIExhvjk=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Acupuncture Herbal and Natural Therapy正本中医疑难病诊所"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/1