my IVF procedure and it helped warm my body and my IVF was successful on the first attempt. I plan to continue receiving care even after giving birth.", "author": "ssun0702", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110859190635260239573/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-02T16:43:11.598805083Z", "text": "Kate was amazing.\nI had a lot of pelvic pain, and her acupuncture treatment really helped relieve it.\nShe was very professional and attentive throughout the session.\nHighly recommend!", "author": "Mingyu Hwang SK Hynix", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106439386553142718124/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-12-26T20:19:40.386878364Z", "text": "Always a great experience and provides a holistic approach. Everyone at this clinic are professional, knowledgeable and respectful. I had TMJ pain and neck pain and they provided specialized treatment for it. They truly care to make your body feel at its best! Highly recommend.", "author": "Chae Yeon Ahn", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101847049904787020595/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-04-01T19:26:34.456369819Z", "text": "I’m truly grateful for the care I received. The treatment was very professional and thorough, including acupuncture, cupping, and massage. I felt a noticeable improvement afterward. The staff was very kind and attentive.", "author": "Love Ha", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112568414939670411098/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-14T00:22:40.316877024Z", "text": "I visited because I had pain in my lower back and neck, and I really liked that they provided chiropractic treatment along with acupuncture and massage. All the practitioners are very kind and provide excellent care.", "author": "David Kim", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109726245340901617903/reviews"}]}, "review_summ