an) care. The clinic emphasizes traditional Korean herbal medicine (Gongjindan, postpartum care), and accepts Korean overseas travel insurance and student insurance from local universities, catering to the Korean-American community.", "services_offered": [{"name": "Spine & Joint Clinic", "category": "pain management", "description": "Disc problems, auto accident injuries, sports injuries, growth care for teens, scoliosis, frozen shoulder.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients with spine and joint conditions"}, {"name": "Chiropractic", "category": "chiropractic", "description": "Spinal, joint & muscle pain, TMJ disorder, scoliosis, disc problems, posture correction, growth care.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients needing spinal alignment and pain relief"}, {"name": "Scoliosis Clinic", "category": "chiropractic", "description": "Customized non-surgical treatment to improve spinal alignment and posture.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients with scoliosis"}, {"name": "Auto Accident Injuries", "category": "pain management", "description": "Targeted treatment for whiplash, back and neck pain, and other accident-related injuries.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Auto accident victims"}, {"name": "Women''s Clinic", "category": "women''s health", "description": "Uterine health, menopause care, PMS, menstrual irregularities, infertility support.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Women seeking gynecological and hormonal care"}, {"name": "Arthritis Clinic", "category": "pain management", "description": "Comprehensive care for joint pain, stiffness, and inflammation caused by arthritis.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients with arthritis"}, {"name": "Rhinitis Clinic", "category": "allergy & respiratory", "description": "Chronic rhinitis, allergic rhinitis, sinusitis treatment with acupuncture, herbal medicine, and natural nasal ointment.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients with allergies and sinus issues"}, {"