d remedies for asthma, eczema, PMS, arthritis, migraine, menopause, chronic fatigue, IBS, and more. Includes Gongjindan formula.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients seeking natural, traditional approaches"}], "short_description": "A holistic clinic combining Korean medicine, acupuncture, chiropractic care, and physiotherapy for natural, non-invasive pain treatment and long-term recovery.", "google_website_url": "http://www.kyungheehealing.com/", "insurance_accepted": ["Blue Cross Blue Shield", "Cigna", "UnitedHealthcare", "Aetna", "Auto Accident (Personal Injury)", "Bike accident", "Oversea Travel Insurance"], "google_primary_type": "Medical Clinic", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": ["Ashely Ro", "노경희 (Kyunghee Ro)"], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "4675 Stevens Creek Blvd #121, Santa Clara, CA 95051, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/113849973957465565867", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX9fazOK01RP7Dz2oPjouaWApSnsR09fn95yIIbQKsoH4u5uQ=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Kyunghee Healing Korean Medicine & Chiropractic 경희 힐링 한의원 & 척추교정"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/113849973957465565867", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX9fazOK01RP7Dz2oPjouaWApSnsR09fn95yIIbQKsoH4u5uQ=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Kyunghee Healing Korean Medicine & Chiropractic 경희 힐링 한의원 & 척추교정"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/113849973957465565867", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX9fazOK01RP7Dz2oPjouaWApSnsR09fn95yIIbQKsoH4u5uQ=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Kyunghee Healing Korean Medicine & Chiropractic 경희 힐링 한의원 & 척추교정"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/113849973957465565867", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX9fazOK01RP7Dz2oPjouaWApSnsR09fn95yIIbQKsoH4u5uQ=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Kyunghee Healing Korean Medicine & Chiropractic 경희 힐링 한의원 & 척추교정"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/113849973957465565867", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX9fazOK01RP7Dz2oPjouaWApSnsR09fn95yIIbQKsoH4u5uQ=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Kyunghee Healing Korean Medicine & Chiropractic 경희 힐링 한의원 & 척추교정"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-26T10:53:08.259779+00:00', 'kyunghee-healing-korean-medicine-chiropractic', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('fd8ef380-211b-45c6-94f6-276d4fd557c2', NULL, 'Hong Wei Medical Group', 'Hongwei Medical Group® offers various services to patients in the San Jose and Cupertino area, including Tui Na therapy, acupuncture, cupping, deep tissue massage, and stretch therapy. Founded in 1993 in Shandong, China, the clinic is rooted in Traditional Chinese Medicine (TCM) and was established by Hongwei Liu, who overcame a tragic bicycle accident that resulted in permanent loss of sight. The clinic''s vision is to become the most trusted TCM clinic(s) in the Bay Area, welcoming individuals and families of all ages. The team is committed to providing exceptional patient care, fostering a culture of innovation and continuous learning, promoting ethical behavior and integrity, and demonstrating compassion and empathy towards patients and their families.', '7337 Bollinger Rd Ste C & E Cupertino, CA 95014', 'Cupertino', 'CA', '95014', '(408) 645-5780', ARRAY['English', 'Chinese']::text[], 'Acupuncture & TCM', TRUE, '{"images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/hong-wei-medical-group-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/hong-wei-medical-group-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/hong-wei-medical-group-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/hong-wei-medical-group-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/hong-wei-medical-group-google-5.webp"], "rating": 5, "reviews": [{"date": "2022-11-07T04:10:53.197495Z", "text": "Hongwei clinic has very welcoming staffs. I started going to the clinic for treatments because Dr. Liu healed my mom’s frozen shoulder.  They are specialists for pain management.  They were able to resolve my shoulder and neck pain for me.  Recently I had lower back pain, and therapist Quan did a amazing job.  This place is definitely worth the try if you have injury or pain.  In addition the clinic is really clean and organized which I valued a lot.", "author": "Jenny", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113658753983441902009/reviews"}, {"date": "2022-07-07T01:31:51.377957Z", "text": "My daughter’s back was hurting for several weeks and she couldn’t even run. We tried many physical therapists,but there was little help. We tried Hongwei Medical Group, and after just couple of treatments , her back felt way better than before. My son’s knee injury was very badly,but after just one appointment he could walk properly. I have sleeping difficulty for many years, but after an single appointment I could sleep very well. This sounds too good to be true, but the doctors here are very professional and know how to make miracles happen. They are the best therapists I have ever experienced so are environment and treatment rooms. Now, my whole family are loyal clients.", "author": "youjing Zhang", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106149398171993210092/reviews"}, {"date": "2022-03-07T00:43:35.548971Z", "text": "If you look for a chiropractics place that is professional, clean, caring with reasonable price, hands down this is definitely the best place in the South Bay.\n\nMy whole family have been their patients for ~4 years. We are still impressed by their professionalism, and how much they care for their patients.\n\nI had a baby last year. My back was hurt so badly one day that I couldn’t even move, not mentioning holding my baby. I had to call Hongxia. After she heard the details about my problem on the phone, she immediately found me a slot (that’s actually her after hour) and have me come in on the same day. Since she knew if I can get the treatment asap, I will recovery much faster and come much less rather than waiting for couple of days for next availability. She had the empathy that I need to recover soon to take care of my newborn, not just making the most profit for herself. I can definitely feel me as their patient is their top priority. And after she did the treatment on my back, I can immediately move with limited pain. Of course Pain won’t be gone just after one treatment. But it’s definitely much reduced, and manageable, and I can stop the pain killer.\n\nAll the staff here are just beyond amazing, the receptionist Huiling is so nice and friendly. Also big shout out to Joanna, she is so professional and always find my problem and define a clear treatment plan. Absolutely love her. Most importantly, The charging here is very reasonable and affordable!", "author": "Le Li", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111751448900424354069/reviews"}, {"date": "2022-02-02T09:04:15.096203Z", "text": "This is a place that I would like to recommend to my family. I have visited frequently this place since 2020. They can really help me out when I suffered, I appreciate they listened carefully my feelings and gave me honest advices. Hongxia, one of the greatest Chinese medical doctor here, I feel she is my angel, and other TuiNa masters also did a great job. Here is my most recent experience, my low back was very hurting, it’s hard for me to walk or move, I have to take PTO because of this pain, I went to see internal doctor, she advised me to see therapist and take some Tylenol, anyway, the therapist will be available in one month, and I can’t wait that long, I don’t like to take Tylenol neither even though it’s hurting. So I came here to have 3 sessions treatments such as Tuina, topping and acupuncture, i feel so much better now.", "author": "chloe wang", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112976858366202869424/reviews"}, {"date": "2022-05-04T21:32:03.074832Z", "text": "I had great experience with the clinic and naturally become a frequent visitor. Due to my work set up, I developed frozen shoulder and did not get improvement after visiting several other physical therapists. After several months of treatment in this clinic, my shoulder totally recovered and moves without any limitation.\nAlso my back and hip often hurts due to poor posture, Joanna gives great treatment and also exercise suggestions which significantly improves my overall posture and chronical pain.\nWould definitely recommend this place to anyone.", "author": "Houfei Chen", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106778725650028301138/reviews"}], "website": "https://hongweimedicalgroup.com/", "location": {"latitude": 37.3126542, "longitude": -122.03415609999999}, "services": ["Acupuncture", "Cupping", "Tui Na Therapy", "Deep Tissue Massage", "Myofascial Therapy", "Stretch Therapy", "Body Mechanics"], "insurance": {"notes": "We accept most major PPO Medical Insurance; we also work with Auto and Work Injury Insurance. We welcome FSA & HSA cards.", "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": ["PPO Medical Insurance", "Auto Insurance", "Work Injury Insurance"], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": true}, "highlights": [{"title": "Founded in 1993 in Shandong, China", "detail": "The clinic has a long history rooted in Traditional Chinese Medicine.", "category": "culture"}, {"title": "Most trusted TCM clinic in the Bay Area", "detail": "Vision to become the most trusted TCM clinic(s) in the Bay Area, welcoming individuals and families of all ages.", 