 dr. angela (la.c & daom)", "google_types": ["medical_clinic", "health", "point_of_interest", "establishment"], "open_weekend": false, "rating_count": 52, "team_members": [{"name": "Dr. Tian (LA.c & DAOM)", "role": "Acupuncturist", "bio_snippet": null, "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Quon", "role": "Deep Tissue Massage Therapist", "bio_snippet": null, "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Dr. Angela (LA.c & DAOM)", "role": "Acupuncturist", "bio_snippet": null, "languages_spoken": []}], "language_note": "Hongwei Medical Group was founded in 1993 in Shandong, China, and is rooted in Traditional Chinese Medicine (TCM). The founder, Hongwei Liu, is originally from Shandong, China. The clinic offers TCM services such as Tui Na therapy, acupuncture, cupping, and herbal medicine, and serves the Asian community in the Bay Area.", "open_saturday": false, "quality_score": 100, "working_hours": {"friday": "Closed", "monday": "9:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "sunday": "Closed", "tuesday": "Closed", "saturday": "Closed", "thursday": "Closed", "wednesday": "Closed"}, "gallery_images": ["https://admin.hongweimedicalgroup.com/storage/app/public/page_images/about-img_1720718027.jpg", "https://admin.hongweimedicalgroup.com/storage/app/public/team_images/66997088bddb9_doctor1.png", "https://admin.hongweimedicalgroup.com/storage/app/public/team_images/6695806fa1a22_team6.png", "https://admin.hongweimedicalgroup.com/storage/app/public/team_images/sGMiXcdCYjiy695DvvaQurb2V3MPoUe9VYxAlr1q.png", "https://admin.hongweimedicalgroup.com/storage/app/public/testimonial_images/testimonial_1720718585.jpg", "https://admin.hongweimedicalgroup.com/storage/app/public/testimonial_images/testimonial_1720718598.jpg", "https://admin.hongweimedicalgroup.com/storage/app/public/testimonial_images/testimonial_1721339643.png", "https://admin.hongweimedicalgroup.com/storage/app/public/service_images/service1713589792.png"], "review_profile": {"rating": 5, "source": "google", "themes": [{"theme": "Treatment Outcomes", "men