just beyond amazing, the receptionist Huiling is so nice and friendly. Also big shout out to Joanna, she is so professional and always find my problem and define a clear treatment plan. Absolutely love her. Most importantly, The charging here is very reasonable and affordable!", "author": "Le Li", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111751448900424354069/reviews"}, {"date": "2022-02-02T09:04:15.096203Z", "text": "This is a place that I would like to recommend to my family. I have visited frequently this place since 2020. They can really help me out when I suffered, I appreciate they listened carefully my feelings and gave me honest advices. Hongxia, one of the greatest Chinese medical doctor here, I feel she is my angel, and other TuiNa masters also did a great job. Here is my most recent experience, my low back was very hurting, it’s hard for me to walk or move, I have to take PTO because of this pain, I went to see internal doctor, she advised me to see therapist and take some Tylenol, anyway, the therapist will be available in one month, and I can’t wait that long, I don’t like to take Tylenol neither even though it’s hurting. So I came here to have 3 sessions treatments such as Tuina, topping and acupuncture, i feel so much better now.", "author": "chloe wang", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112976858366202869424/reviews"}, {"date": "2022-05-04T21:32:03.074832Z", "text": "I had great experience with the clinic and naturally become a frequent visitor. Due to my work set up, I developed frozen shoulder and did not get improvement after visiting several other physical therapists. After several months of treatment in this clinic, my shoulder totally recovered and moves without any limitation.\nAlso my back and hip often hurts due to poor posture, Joanna gives great treatment and also exercise suggestions which significantly improves my overall posture and chronical pain.\nWould definitely recommend this place to anyone.", "author": "Houfei Chen", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106778725650028301138/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Patients consistently praise Hong Wei Medical Group for its professional staff, effective pain management treatments, and clean, organized facility. Many reviewers highlight significant improvements in their conditions and commend the clinic''s caring and empathetic approach.", "about_highlight": "Hongwei Medical Group® offers various services to patients in the San Jose and Cupertino area, including Tui Na therapy, acupuncture, cupping, deep tissue massage, and stretch therapy. Founded in 1993 in Shandong, China, the clinic is rooted in Traditional Chinese Medicine (TCM) and was established by Hongwei Liu, who overcame a tragic bicycle accident that resulted in permanent loss of sight. The clinic''s vision is to become the most trusted TCM clinic(s) in the Bay Area, welcoming individuals and families of all ages. The team is committed to providing exceptional patient care, fostering a culture of innovation and continuous learning, promoting ethical behavior and integrity, and demonstrating compassion and empathy towards patients and their families.", "appointment_url": "https://hongweimedicalgroup.com/contact", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=3988840099633033982&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJgc7MkIS1j4AR_vJ11O80Wzc", "quality_missing": [], "search_keywords": ["acupuncture & tcm", "acupuncture", "chinese medicine", "tcm", "herbal medicine", "cupping", "pain relief", "châm cứu", "đông y", "y học cổ truyền", "한의원", "침술", "한약", "中医", "针灸", "中药", "english", "chinese", "mandarin", "cantonese", "中文", "普通话", "国语", "粤语", "广东话", "华人", "tui na therapy", "deep tissue massage", "myofascial therapy", "stretch therapy", "body mechanics", "massage", "therapy", "ppo medical insurance", "auto insurance", "work injury insurance", "dr. tian (la.c & daom)", "acupuncturist", "quon", "deep tissue massage therapist", "dr. angela (la.c & daom)"], "cultural_context": "Hongwei Medical Group was founded in 1993 in Shandong, China, and is rooted in Traditional Chinese Medicine (TCM). The founder, Hongwei Liu, is originally from Shandong, China. The clinic offers TCM services such as Tui Na therapy, acupuncture, cupping, and herbal medicine, and serves the Asian community in the Bay Area.", "services_offered": [{"name": "Acupuncture", "category": "TCM", "description": "Acupuncture is often used in conjunction with Tui Na Therapy to maximize each technique''s effectiveness. Practitioners use needles at certain pressure points (Meridian points) on the body to alleviate pain.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Cupping", "category": "TCM", "description": "Fire cupping therapy is a form of Traditional Chinese Medicine in which therapists use special cups on the body to create suction, to loosen muscles, encourage blood flow, and sedate the nervous system.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Tui Na Therapy", "category": "TCM", "description": "Tui Na (pronounced ''twee nah'') means to push and pull. It is a form of therapy used in Traditional Chinese Medicine, involving the use of bodywork such as massage and acupressure. Tui Na therapy is used to rid the body of disturbances.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Deep Tissue Massage", "category": "Massage", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Myofascial Therapy", "category": "Massage", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Stretch Therapy", "category": "Therapy", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Body Mechanics", "category": "TCM", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}], "short_description": "Hongwei Medical Group® offers various services to patients in the San Jose and Cupertino area, including Tui Na therapy, acupuncture, cupping, deep tissue massage, and stretch therapy.", "google_website_url": "https://hongweimedicalgroup.com/", "insurance_accepted": ["PPO Medical Insurance", "Auto Insurance", "Work Injury Insurance"], "google_primary_type": "Medical Clinic", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": ["Dr. Tian (LA.c & DAOM)", "Quon", "Dr. Angela (LA.c & DAOM)"], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "7337 Bollinger Rd Suite C & E, Cupertino, CA 95014, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/102408550392481983939", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXnxAVNm6mhgGWS_zz2vujhje6Cl-uFPpaKsfL__BJvBue3XN0=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Hongwei Medical Group"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/113658753983441902009", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJI1a0e-kcmurPDK4wSUG0N8iTehw3cxbB7ksAcnbxxHSBjPQ=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Jenny"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/113658753983441902009", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJI1a0e-kcmurPDK4wSUG0N8iTehw3cxbB7ksAcnbxxHSBjPQ=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Jenny"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/113658753983441902009", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJI1a0e-kcmurPDK4wSUG0N8iTehw3cxbB7ksAcnbxxHSBjPQ=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Jenny"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/102408550392481983939", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXnxAVNm6mhgGWS_zz2vujhje6Cl-uFPpaKsfL__BJvBue3XN0=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Hongwei Medical Group"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-26T10:55:04.171102+00:00', 'hong-wei-medical-group', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('d968c2e1-ec6f-43f5-ba83-2811c558ce2d', NULL, 'Acupuncture China San Jose', 'Acupuncture China San Jose is led by Hong Liu, L.Ac., T.C.M.P., a China-trained expert acupuncturist with over 35 years of clinical experience. He holds both Acupuncturist and Traditional Chinese Medical Doctor licenses from the National Medical Department of China (since 1986) and has been a Licensed Acupuncturist in California since 1997. His background includes working as a staff doctor at First People’s Hospital in Chengdu, research with the Acupuncture & Acupuncture-Anesthesia Research Institute, and serving as a clinical instructor for Chengdu University of Traditional Chinese Medicine and Chengdu Athletic College. The clinic specializes in pain management, infertility, and a wide range of medical disorders, and has successfully helped over 10,000 patients. Services include acupuncture, electrical acupuncture, cupping, moxibustion, herbal formulations, massage therapy, and acupressure. The clinic accepts most insurance plans, Workers Compensation, and car accident claims, and serves the San Francisco South Bay Area.', '3880 S Bascom Avenue Suite 108, San Jose, CA 95124', 'San Jose', 'CA', '95124', '408-207-6053', ARRAY['English', 'Chinese']::text[], 'Acupuncture & TCM', FALSE, '{"fax": "408-356-7004", "email": "jennyliusi@yahoo.com", "images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/acupuncture-china-san-jose-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/acupuncture-china-san-jose-google-2.webp"], "rating": 4.8, "reviews": [{"date": "2026-02-06T01:31:24.453795563Z", "text": "这也This was my third time having facial paralysis, and the last episode was the most severe. Because of residual issues from previous episodes, it had never fully healed. I was very fortunate to find Dr. Liu. After receiving acupuncture treatment from him, I have now completely recovered. I’m truly happy and grateful to have found such an authentic and skilled Chinese medicine doctor here in the United States.", "author": "娜王", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109685612716392691072/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-09T22:25:49.067709142Z", "text": "Jenny was very helpful with my knee and reduced the pain in it a lot, she also helped me get my knee bending deeply again.", "author": "Andrew Shahtout", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117210737402153746437/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-11-03T22:52:48.044279773Z", "text": "I came to Jenny for chronic pain caused by a Schwannoma tumor on my static nerve. After regular weekly visits with Jenny my pain is significantly reduced. I''m able to go about my day without chronic pain. I''m very happy with the treatment I''ve been receiving from Jenny at Acupuncture China San Jose.", "author": "Mary-Rose Engle", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106739212252804200035/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-07-17T01:31:54.196785788Z", "text": "I’ve been using Accupuncture for past 4 years and seen significant improvement in my health. Dr. Jenny is kind and gentle with dry needling and cupping. She specializes in BackPain. I tried a few sessions at the next door ‘Accupuncture’ which was quite comparative in skillset. I returned to Dr. Jenny - I like that she takes her time to pre-assess area of pain before placing needle. Highly recommend trying her service.", "author": "Gini Muru", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106869587209371234198/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-04-26T00:52:03.775911347Z", "text": "i had irregular period for long time, I went to Jenny for a few times, I felt much much better ! !  I Highly recommend her to people who have same issue", "author": "苗三姐", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115264968826713287781/reviews"}], "website": "https://acupuncturechinasanjose.com/", "location": {"latitude": 37.2591403, "longitude": -121.94690190000001}, "services": ["Acupuncture", "Electrical Acupuncture", "Cupping and Moxibustion", "Electrical Acupoint Stimulation (no needles)", "Herbal Formulations", "Massage Therapy and Acupressure"], "insurance": {"notes": "Most insurance plans accepted. Workers Compensation and car accident claims accepted. Please call regarding other insurance plans to see if we can accept them.", "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": ["Most insurance plans", "Workers Compensation", "Car accident claims"], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": true}, "highlights": [{"title": "China-Trained Expert", "detail": "Hong Liu, L.Ac., T.C.M.P., is a China-trained acupuncturist with over 35 years of clinical experience.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Over 10,000 Patients Helped", "detail": "Successfully helped over 10,000 patients with various health issues.", "category": "reviews"}, {"title": "Pain Management & Infertility Specialist", "detail": "Specializes in pain management, infertility, and many other medical disorders.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Most Insurance Accepted", "detail": "Accepts most insurance plans, Workers Compensation, and car accident claims.", "category": "insurance"}, {"title": "Wide Range of Services", "detail": "Offers acupuncture, electrical acupuncture, cupping, moxibustion, herbal formulations, massage therapy, and acupressure.", "category": "care"}], "price_tier": "$$", "source_url": "https://acupuncturechinasanjose.com/", "appointment": {"booking_note": "Please call 408-207-6053 to make an appointment.", "appointment_url": null, "new_patient_note": null, "phone_booking_available": true, "online_booking_available": false, "free_consultation_available": null}, "open_sunday": true, "scout_query": "Chinese speaking medical clinic in San Jose, CA", "search_text": "acupuncture & tcm | acupuncture | chinese medicine | tcm | herbal medicine | cupping | pain relief | châm cứu | đông y | y học cổ truyền | 한의원 | 침술 | 한약 | 中医 | 针灸 | 中药 | english | chinese | mandarin | cantonese | 中文 | 普通话 | 国语 | 粤语 | 广东话 | 华人 | electrical acupuncture | cupping and moxibustion | electrical acupoint stimulation (no needles) | herbal formulations | massage therapy and acupressure | traditional chinese medicine | massage | most insurance plans | workers compensation | car accident claims | hong liu | licensed acupuncturist (l.ac., t.c.m.p.)", "google_types": ["medical_clinic", "store", "health", "point_of_interest", "establishment"], "open_weekend": true, "rating_count": 99, "team_members": [{"name": "Hong Liu", "role": "Licensed Acupuncturist (L.Ac., T.C.M.P.)", "bio_snippet": "China-trained expert acupuncturist with over 35 years of clinical experience. Holds both Acupuncturist and Traditional Chinese Medical Doctor licenses from National Medical Department of China since 1986. Licensed Acupuncturist in California since 1997. Worked as staff doctor in First People’s Hospital in Chengdu, China (1986-1996). Research experience with Acupuncture & Acupuncture-Anesthesia Research Institute. Clinical instructor for Chengdu University of Traditional Chinese Medicine and Chengdu Athletic College Sports Injury Division (1991-1996). Specializes in pain management, infertility, and many other medical disorders.", "languages_spoken": ["Chinese", "English"]}], "language_note": "The clinic is led by a China-trained practitioner (Hong Liu, L.Ac., T.C.M.P.) who holds licenses from China''s National Medical Department and has extensive experience in Traditional Chinese Medicine. 