egular weekly visits with Jenny my pain is significantly reduced. I''m able to go about my day without chronic pain. I''m very happy with the treatment I''ve been receiving from Jenny at Acupuncture China San Jose.", "author": "Mary-Rose Engle", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106739212252804200035/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-07-17T01:31:54.196785788Z", "text": "I’ve been using Accupuncture for past 4 years and seen significant improvement in my health. Dr. Jenny is kind and gentle with dry needling and cupping. She specializes in BackPain. I tried a few sessions at the next door ‘Accupuncture’ which was quite comparative in skillset. I returned to Dr. Jenny - I like that she takes her time to pre-assess area of pain before placing needle. Highly recommend trying her service.", "author": "Gini Muru", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106869587209371234198/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-04-26T00:52:03.775911347Z", "text": "i had irregular period for long time, I went to Jenny for a few times, I felt much much better ! !  I Highly recommend her to people who have same issue", "author": "苗三姐", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115264968826713287781/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Patients consistently praise Acupuncture China San Jose for its effective treatments, skilled practitioners, and compassionate care, with many reporting significant improvements in their health conditions.", "about_highlight": "Acupuncture China San Jose is led by Hong Liu, L.Ac., T.C.M.P., a China-trained expert acupuncturist with over 35 years of clinical experience. He holds both Acupuncturist and Traditional Chinese Medical Doctor licenses from the National Medical Department of China (since 1986) and has been a Licensed Acupuncturist in California since 1997. His background includes working as a staff doctor at First People’s Hospital in Chengdu,