/www.google.com/maps/contrib/109003831935067275560/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-11-10T22:29:36.447977798Z", "text": "We came to this clinic for a few travel vaccines and ended up spending several hours there.. far longer than expected. The visit started off poorly when the doctor asked us what we wanted instead of providing clear guidance. There were multiple long waits: for the doctor to arrive, for the brief “consultation,” for him to share his “recommendations” (which, surprisingly, appeared to come from ChatGPT), and for the staff to prepare the vaccines.\nBefore receiving the shots, we noticed that one of the vaccines presented was actually the wrong one - we caught the mistake ourselves by reading the label. After we pointed it out, they corrected it, but it was extremely concerning.\n\nWe later saw another travel doctor for a second opinion, who mentioned this provider has a reputation for recommending the wrong medications. The front desk staff was also rude and moved at a painfully slow pace.\n\nOverall, this visit felt unprofessional, unsafe, and disorganized. I would strongly recommend going elsewhere for travel vaccines or medical advice.", "author": "AZ", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113687209682280265920/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-04-30T04:00:49.070279Z", "text": "As a foreigner in San Francisco with an urgent need for medical care, I’m so glad I found Dr Savage. He was lovely, thorough, knowledgeable and very helpful. I truly don’t think I’ve ever seen a better doctor. I felt very well looked after by him and his team and highly recommend them.", "author": "Kat B", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113798526043543226564/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-08-02T13:53:51.462392354Z", "text": "Had a need for a Doctor while in SF. Spoke to secretary and arranged an appointment time. Arrived early - Waited.  No sign of the Doctor.  15 minutes later, no sign. Secretary bustles around evasively. Finally get told there’s been an emergency and Doctor may be in approx 90 minutes. Total waste of time and disrupted the day. Don’t mislead people and let them down when they need medical help", "author": "Adam Bradley", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104666367717204259049/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-01-13T21:11:48.752525Z", "text": "Dr Savage is my regular primary care physician. Recently, I had a problem with my ear that required a specialist referral.\n\nMy ear was giving me hell and I was going nuts and could not sleep.  I called Dr. Savage at 4:45 AM just to leave a message in order for them to get back to me in the morning when they check their voicemail.\n\nDr Savage returned my call immediately at 4:46 AM.\n\nYou are not gonna find very many primary care, physicians who will answer your call in the middle of the night, but Jim Savage MD will.", "author": "Jim Dzúr", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112815238977882860261/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Patients generally appreciate Dr. Savage''s thoroughness, knowledge, and dedication, especially in long-term care, though some report issues with wait times, communication, and occasional administrative errors.", "about_highlight": "Traveler Medical Group, led by Dr. Jim Y. Savage, MD, has been serving San Francisco since 1991. The practice offers comprehensive medical consultations customized to meet travel needs, from hotel doctor and airline physician services to urgent care, primary care, travel immunizations, and student health services. Patients benefit from a caring, understanding environment with same-day appointments available and a primary care physician always on call 24/7. Whether you''re a local or a visitor, Traveler Medical Group provides friendly, comfortable care—including the unique ability to come to your hotel room for treatment.", "appointment_url": "https://www.hoteldoctorsf.com/recommends/home-appointments/", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=16390194221167024703&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJg9cXYI6AhYARPxpSIM6qdeM", "quality_missing": ["insurance"], "search_keywords": ["urgent care", "english", "korean", "한국어", "한인", "한국말", "hotel doctor", "airline physician", "primary care", "travel immunization", "student health services", "set doctor for movies", "lost medication assistance", "occupational health", "preventive", "dr. jim y. savage", "physician"], "services_offered": [{"name": "Hotel Doctor", "category": "Urgent Care", "description": "Designated house doctor for major San Francisco hotels including Marriott, Hyatt, Ritz Carlton, Holiday Inn, and more.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Travelers and hotel guests in San Francisco."}, {"name": "Airline Physician", "category": "Occupational Health", "description": "Primary consulting physician in San Francisco for United, Virgin Atlantic, KLM, and other airlines.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Airline crew and passengers needing medical consultation."}, {"name": "Urgent Care", "category": "Urgent Care", "description": "Urgent care by appointment at the office, with same-day appointments available.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients with urgent medical needs."}, {"name": "Primary Care", "category": "Primary Care", "description": "Ongoing primary care services for San Francisco locals, including women''s health services.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "San Francisco locals seeking a primary care physician."}, {"name": "Travel Immunization", "category": "Preventive", "description": "Dr. Savage provides all required immunizations tailored specifically to your trip.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Travelers needing vaccinations for international trips."}, {"name": "Student Health Services", "category": "Primary Care", "description": "Health services tailored for students, including women''s health.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Students in the San Francisco area."}, {"name": "Set Doctor for Movies", "category": "Occupational Health", "description": "Primary care for movies produced in San Francisco.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Film production crews on location in San Francisco."}, {"name": "Lost Medication Assistance", "category": "Urgent Care", "description": "Help for travelers who have lost their medication while visiting San Francisco.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Visitors who need replacement medications."}], "short_description": "Traveler Medical Group, led by Dr. Jim Y. Savage, MD, offers comprehensive urgent care, primary care, and travel medicine services in San Francisco since 1991—with same-day appointments and 24/7 on-call physician availability.", "google_website_url": "https://www.hoteldoctorsf.com/", "google_primary_type": "Doctor", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": ["Dr. Jim Y. Savage"], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "490 Post St Ste 225, San Francisco, CA 94102, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/110658384265350227170", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW-WYMlYUPhpSdpxadj2TVf46k82bGXyBGGiqDymnsoLuyURv8=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Traveler Medical Group, Dr. Jim Y. Savage, MD"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/111884931130643454747", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJPihS-EPvabdojUUdlfuos0qhYk6zIh7NQ9kMxafNMTaPMWw=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Arif Can Özdemir"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/104003448008806130210", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWAidgz5LK03ax_BQX-n2nZYVAw3S4dwrbaYNL0nJ14Mt1ZEJoGcg=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Ben Gunnell"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/110658384265350227170", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW-WYMlYUPhpSdpxadj2TVf46k82bGXyBGGiqDymnsoLuyURv8=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Traveler Medical Group, Dr. Jim Y. Savage, MD"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-26T11:23:20.866086+00:00', 'traveler-medical-group-dr-jim-y-savage-md', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('52adf8f8-374d-4893-a172-a0b9839e0dce', NULL, 'Clinic by the Bay', 'Clinic by the Bay is a free health clinic that has provided primary care to uninsured adults since 2010. Its mission is to understand and serve, with dignity and respect, the health and wellness needs of the medically underserved in the San Francisco Bay Area. The clinic is 100% privately funded by its donor community and does not accept government funding or insurance, allowing it to offer all services free for patients. For every $1 donated, more than $2 is received in pro bono services by volunteer healthcare professionals, embodying healthcare as it should be.', '35 Onondaga Avenue, San Francisco, CA, 94112, United States', 'San Francisco', 'CA', '94112', '415.405.0207', ARRAY['English', 'Spanish', 'Vietnamese']::text[], 'Primary Care', FALSE, '{"email": "info@clinicbythebay.org", "images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/clinic-by-the-bay-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/clinic-by-the-bay-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/clinic-by-the-bay-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/clinic-by-the-bay-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/clinic-by-the-bay-google-5.webp"], "rating": 4.4, "reviews": [{"date": "2026-05-05T18:19:23.277531894Z", "text": "Actually so healing they can heal any dísease by just being present with you.", "author": "Jessica Li", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100743364275094714830/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-06-16T21:50:27.432432487Z", "text": "When trying to call, whether for your own job or personal, if the staff doesn’t have an answer for you, they will hang up on you instead of guiding you in the right direction, and continue to ignore your calls even when you try calling back.", "author": "Jasmine P-R", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102314003485426947963/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-09-29T21:51:05.164593066Z", "text": "Kind and dedicated staff. Great place to volunteer.", "author": "Evelyn Bigini", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101863209706899822173/reviews"}, {"date": "2024-05-30T19:04:09.792373Z", "text": "True heroes thank you all for everything you to. Amazing that it''s all volunteer 🫶", "author": "N8T1V3_5F", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100816759689049335632/reviews"}, {"date": "2023-05-12T21:36:25.213414Z", "text": "Terrible place MUST CALL before u go they dont have doctor no more old services BS FR", "author": "G TI", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105159085626918359358/reviews"}], "website": "http://www.clinicbythebay.org/", "location": {"latitude": 37.72133060000001, "longitude": -122.4383634}, "services": ["Medical Services", "Dental Services", "Mental Health Services", "Food Pharmacy Program"], "insurance": {"notes": "We are 100% privately funded by our donor community and do not accept government funding or insurance. All services are free for patients.", "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": [], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": false}, "highlights": [{"title": "Free Services", "detail": "All Clinic s