 Tran is a very skilled, knowledgeable and personable orthopedic clinician.  He keeps up with the literature and spends time with you to explain different treatment options.  He’s very good with steroid injections, I’ve always had good relief when he did them.  One time, another clinician gave it to me, and the pain did not improve, so I appreciate the skill and care Young takes to identify the right spot to make the injection.  He''s also a very kind person, all the staff say the nicest things about him!", "author": "Cynthia Sung", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110700474836028475926/reviews"}, {"date": "2023-05-17T00:27:27.663854Z", "text": "He is really good with knee ejection. A skill that help pacitent to reduce pain and fast recovery from condition", "author": "KJ Chan", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106203167301607693403/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Patients highly recommend Duong (Young) Tran, PA-C for his exceptional clinical skills, kindness, and ability to connect with both children and adults, making treatments effective and comfortable.", "about_highlight": "Young Tran, PA-C, is an orthopaedic surgery physician assistant at Optum - Madison Center in Seattle, Washington. He treats a wide range of sports-related conditions and joint replacements, with a philosophy of care that starts with listening to the patient''s concerns and goals. He explains diagnoses and treatment plans in an easily understood manner, personalizing the approach based on each patient''s hobbies and lifestyle to help them live healthier, more active lives. Young enjoys contributing to people''s well-being and, outside of work, enjoys traveling, golf, boating, fishing, and hiking.", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=17609162932661769667&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJOzfIUiVrkFQRw9VH0WNQYPQ", "quality_