ny and all medical problems.\nIf they are accepting new patients, highly recommend!", "author": "Eun-Sung Kim", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113368218892238160288/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Most patients highly recommend Joo Family Clinic, praising Dr. Joo''s empathy, clear communication, and clinical expertise, though one review highlights a serious misdiagnosis concern.", "about_highlight": "Joo Family Clinic is a primary care and family medicine practice based in Edmonds, WA, offering preventive, personalized, and accessible care for patients of all ages. The clinic provides annual physical exams, well child check-ups, chronic disease management, acute care visits, and telemedicine for established patients, alongside a full range of aesthetic treatments including Ultherapy, Botox/Fillers, laser treatments, Plexr, hydration/skin quality treatments, weight management, micro needling, and PRP. Their comprehensive care also highlights preventive care, women’s health, pediatric care, and chronic care management, all delivered with a focus on patient-centered wellness.", "appointment_url": "tel:(425) 409-9247", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=8976740195530445586&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJ10Qq054akFQREhOQo6XJk3w", "quality_missing": ["insurance", "team_members"], "search_keywords": ["family medicine", "family practice", "primary care", "bác sĩ gia đình", "가정의학과", "家庭医学", "english", "korean", "한국어", "한인", "한국말", "mandarin", "chinese", "中文", "普通话", "国语", "tiếng trung", "tiếng phổ thông", "aesthetic treatments", "preventive care", "women’s health", "pediatric care", "chronic care management", "ultherapy", "botox / fillers", "laser treatments", "plexr", "hydration / skin quality", "weight management", "micro needling", "prp", "event | gift card", "aesthetics", "preventive"], "cultural_context": "The clinic explicitly offers medical s