ard, and I highly recommend him to anyone looking for a doctor who actually listens and takes the time to care about his patients.", "author": "Javier", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102892078622589565351/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-03-02T16:15:18.306801935Z", "text": "Lovely staff! Very clean, professional and friendly environment. Dr. Nguyen makes you feel welcomed and genuinely shows care for his patients. Their phlebotomist is amazing, the needle basically nonexistent. Definitely recommend anyone coming in, prices are also great compared to other places! 🙌🏼", "author": "Ceyla", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107346880088716416247/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-12-06T16:03:52.011920373Z", "text": "since my first visit everyone was super kind and welcoming. The doctors answers all questions and listens to my concerns. The receptionist are also super kind. I will definitely make this my go to place. Thank you!", "author": "Yami Jarquin", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112341777671815728962/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-12-18T23:19:23.597336051Z", "text": "This was my first time coming to this clinic, I love it and will be coming back the staffs are amazing and it was a fast process as well. Especially Jaquelin she answered all my  questions, is very helpful.", "author": "Maria Meraz", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117462512986050275160/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-01T15:30:11.425764348Z", "text": "Amazing experience care for patient, on time , friendly good suggest devise\nhighly recommendation for DNP Vincent Chi Nguyen", "author": "Zeref Leventis", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110090464041198228245/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Chamblee Family Medical Clinic has a 4.9 star Google rating from 68 Google review