o sign in the front office to the bank office Ikeya and Mikhi they make you feel like you''re apart of the careplus family once you make your appointment you actually see the doctor at the time of your appointment I love that it''s not a 1 or 2-hour wait before you get to see the doctor Ikeya & Mikhi get your right get your vitals and ready to see your doctor this is the place to be if you''re looking for a good family care doctor\nCare Plus is your place. Dr Zhang", "author": "Curt Banks", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108212274397630366466/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "CARE PLUS FAMILY MEDICINE | Riverdale has a 3.8 star Google rating from 52 Google reviews. Patients commonly mention friendly staff, strong results.", "about_highlight": "Care Plus Family Medicine Atlanta PC is a one-stop medical center in Riverdale, GA, offering a wide spectrum of services for individuals and families. The clinic integrates Eastern and Western medicine, providing personalized care across all ages. With a multilingual team fluent in English, Chinese, Spanish, and Vietnamese, they prioritize patient-centric care, continuity, and accessibility. Services include adult and pediatric wellness, chronic disease management, women''s health, Medicare wellness checkups, Traditional Chinese Medicine, acupuncture, and medical spa treatments.", "appointment_url": "https://careplusmedicine.com/schedule-online/", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=10776100661060920600&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJOaAM91H79IgRGGVj_nRmjJU", "quality_missing": ["insurance"], "search_keywords": ["family medicine", "family practice", "primary care", "bác sĩ gia đình", "가정의학과", "家庭医学", "english", "chinese", "mandarin", "cantonese", "中文", "普通话", "国语", "粤语", "广东话", "华人", "spanish", "vietnamese", "tiếng việt", "người việt", "bác sĩ việt", "adult wellness", "pediatric wellness", "medicare wellness checkup", "women''s health", "chronic disease management", "traditional chinese medicine & acupuncture", "med spa", "remote chronic disease management", "preventive", "chronic care", "alternative", "cosmetic", "zhudong zhang", "md", "lina zhu", "msn, aprn, fnp-bc", "sydney colón"], "cultural_context": "The Riverdale location specifically offers Vietnamese language services, part of a clinic that embraces Asian medicine traditions (Traditional Chinese Medicine, acupuncture) and serves diverse communities with multilingual staff.", "services_offered": [{"name": "Adult Wellness", "category": "Preventive", "description": "Annual physical exams, cancer screenings, ultrasound services.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Adults"}, {"name": "Pediatric Wellness", "category": "Preventive", "description": "Vaccinations, school and sports physicals, annual checkups.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Children"}, {"name": "Medicare Wellness Checkup", "category": "Preventive", "description": "Includes Alzheimer''s screenings, arthritis and pain therapies.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Seniors"}, {"name": "Women''s Health", "category": "Preventive", "description": "Pap smear, HPV screening, menopause treatment.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Women"}, {"name": "Chronic Disease Management", "category": "Chronic Care", "description": "Management of Hepatitis B, diabetes, cardiovascular disease, hypertension, mental health.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients with chronic conditions"}, {"name": "Traditional Chinese Medicine & Acupuncture", "category": "Alternative", "description": "Acupuncture, herbal medicine, cupping, moxibustion for pain, fatigue, stress, and internal balance.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients seeking holistic pain relief"}, {"name": "Med Spa", "category": "Cosmetic", "description": "Botox, fillers, skin brightening, Thermage XFL, microneedling, IV therapy, weight loss.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Aesthetic patients"}, {"name": "Remote Chronic Disease Management", "category": "Chronic Care", "description": "24-hour glucose and blood pressure monitoring with nurse supervision.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients with diabetes or hypertension"}], "short_description": "Care Plus Family Medicine Riverdale offers comprehensive family medicine with a Vietnamese-speaking team, combining Eastern and Western approaches for personalized, accessible care.", "google_website_url": "https://careplusmedicine.com/", "google_primary_type": "Doctor", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": ["Zhudong Zhang", "Lina Zhu", "Sydney Colón"], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "accepting_new_patients": true, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "6584 Professional Pl, Riverdale, GA 30274, USA"}'::jsonb, '2026-06-26T12:02:36.868003+00:00', 'care-plus-family-medicine-riverdale', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('5e56d491-9b1b-4026-a4cc-4ac26d112998', NULL, 'Excelsior Healthcare Primary Care - Norcross', 'Excelsior Healthcare Primary Care in Norcross is part of a network dedicated to delivering compassionate, patient-centered primary and urgent care across North Georgia. With a team of experienced family physicians, internists, and nurse practitioners, the clinic offers comprehensive services including routine check-ups, senior care, women''s health, vaccinations, and physical exams. Patients appreciate the friendly staff, thorough care, and convenient walk-in options, reflecting the practice''s commitment to treating every patient as if they were their only patient.', '777 West Peachtree Street Norcross, GA 30071', 'Norcross', 'GA', '30071', '(770) 246-6100', ARRAY['English', 'Vietnamese']::text[], 'Primary Care', FALSE, '{"email": "contact@excelsiorhealthcare.com", "images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/excelsior-healthcare-primary-care-norcross-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/excelsior-healthcare-primary-care-norcross-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/excelsior-healthcare-primary-care-norcross-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/excelsior-healthcare-primary-care-norcross-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/excelsior-healthcare-primary-care-norcross-google-5.webp"], "rating": 4.9, "reviews": [{"date": "2025-10-30T01:09:58.463229606Z", "text": "I really, really, really wanted to call this place my new primary care facility, but was left with two disappointing experiences.\n\nFirst and foremost, the staff at the front desk was always exceptionally helpful and kind. It was such a welcomed relief!\n\nDuring my first appointment, however, I was accidentally left waiting in my room for 45 minutes after the appointment was over. Someone was supposed to come and get me to show me where to get my blood drawn, but I was forgotten until the door was opened randomly (to be cleaned, I suppose?) and I surprised the person as I was still there. Fine, whatever. Mistakes happen, and I make them, too!\n\nI was advised to get an ultrasound on my thyroid during my annual physical and I was super happy that it was suggested! My annual exam felt complete and it felt good knowing I could potentially stop something bad before I noticed any problems myself. I scheduled an appointment for two days later.\n\nAlthough I was promised my doctor would go over the results with me, I''ve never been contacted about my bloodwork nor the ultrasound and it''s been exactly one month. I had to call and get an answer about the ultrasound, although I was initially told that the doctor was on vacation for another week. When someone tells you your thyroid is abnormal, waiting for several extra weeks is a tough ask and no patient should ever be told to wait since another physician wasn''t allowed to give me my results. After some disagreeing, the person on the phone came back off hold and said there was nothing wrong with my thyroid.\n\nNo one has discussed my bloodwork results and I have a printout as I requested the results for myself. I don''t work in the medical field, but it seems that I have to advocate for myself, just to get *results* of a test. Grateful to have Google to help with this all.\n\nWas everyone super friendly? Absolutely. But if you''re looking for answers to the test they perform, perhaps this isn''t the best place for you. I shouldn''t have to fight for this basic level of care and attention. This was just too many mistakes in only two visits, especially when my life is potentially in their hands.", "author": "Melissa Sostre", "rating": 2, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111328129368273164147/reviews"}, {"date": "2024-08-05T12:36:51.985290Z", "text": "I’ve been coming to this practice since I was a child, so over 20 years now! Dr. Fu is always caring and attentive to my medical concerns and questions, as well as the staff I see each time. Hoang, at the check in, greets me each time or takes my calls with a warm welcome, which is very important to me especially if I am coming in with something I’ve been worried about. Anytime I get blood drawn, the phlebotomist always gets it the first time. I have small and also moving veins and have had horrible experiences where I have to get stuck multiple times. Never at this practice! The entire staff I’ve engaged with over the years are consistent and well trained. I will always come here and would recommend anyone looking for a new practice to also come!", "author": "Wynne Huo", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112254840045997333471/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-11-11T15:11:01.757830172Z", "text": "Many of the doctors at this clinic are interns! They prescribed the wrong medication! Their lack of experience caused my family member''s condition to worsen! The receptionist at the front desk was also very rude afterwards! I do not recommend this clinic!", "author": "Rebecca Lee", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105844076219115556992/reviews"}, {"date": "2024-11-16T19:59:00.910600Z", "text": "Over the past few years, I’ve had the best experiences at this primary care clinic, and it’s time I leave a review! I saw PA Linh, and she was absolutely phenomenal. She is kind, attentive, super efficient. Anytime I need her, she quickly fits me in to address my concerns, which is super comforting. Knowing that she actually cares and always goes above and beyond with her patients. She''s always professional and knowledgeable, so I feel at ease and very confident after seeing her that my care plan is in good hands.\n\nThe best part is that every provider here is just as awesome! The entire team is friendly, knowledgeable, and dedicated to providing top-level care. I highly recommend this clinic to anyone looking for exceptional primary care services!", "author": "Nathan Nguyen", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108545671055454984355/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-08-06T15:51:39.651198568Z", "text": "Dr James Xin had been nothing but a Great Family doctor.  He remember me and my symptoms from prior visits and very quickly with each and every treatment.  I called in for walk-ins and almost away walk-ins any days. Highly recommended.", "author": "Kevin Do", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112021743563014467933/reviews"}], "website": "https://excelsiorhealthcare.com/", "location": {"latitude": 33.935838499999996, "longitude": -84.22358589999999}, "services": ["Primary Care", "Walk-In Urgent Care", "Women''s Health", "Senior Care", "Vaccinations", "Physicals & Medical Exams"], "insurance": {"notes": "We accept most major forms of insurance and are in-network with most major providers. See all insurance on our website.", "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": true, "accepted_networks": ["Kaiser Permanente", "Aetna", "Blue Cross Blue Shield", "Humana", "UnitedHealthcare", "Medicare"], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": true}, "highlights": [{"title": "Walk-In Urgent Care Available", "detail": "Patients can walk in for urgent care needs without an appointment.", "category": "convenience"}, {"title": "Online and Phone Booking", "detail": "Appointments can be scheduled online or by calling (770) 246-6100.", "category": "convenience"}, {"title": "Most Major Insurance Accepted", "detail": "In-network with most major insurance providers including Medicare.", "category": "insurance"}, {"title": "Diverse Multilingual Team", "detail": "Providers include doctors and nurse practitioners who speak multiple Asian languages such as Mandarin, Cantonese, Korean, and Vietnamese.", "category": "culture"}, {"title": "Comprehensive Services", "detail": "Offers primary care, women''s health, senior care, vaccinations, and physical exams.", "category": "care"}], "price_tier": "$$", "source_url": "https://excelsiorhealthcare.com/", "appointment": {"booking_note": "Schedule online or call (770) 246-6100.", "appointment_url": "https://excelsiorhealthcare.com/appointments", "new_patient_note": null, "phone_booking_available": true, "online_booking_available": true, "free_consultation_available": null}, "open_sunday": false, "scout_query": "Vietnamese speaking medical clinic in Atlanta, GA", "search_text": "primary care | family doctor | general practitioner | annual physical | checkup | bác sĩ gia đình | khám tổng quát | nội khoa | 내과 | 가정의학과 | 家庭医生 | 全科医生 | 内科 | english | vietnamese | tiếng việt | người việt | bác sĩ việt | walk-in urgent care | women''s health | senior care | vaccinations | physicals & medical exams | urgent care | preventive | kaiser permanente | aetna | blue cross blue shield | humana | unitedhealthcare | medicare | christine bao, m.d. | family physician | alice-wei you, m.d. | internist | patrick huynh, d.o. | kelcie miller, d.o. | vy tran plata, md, ms, aahivs | amy tran, d.o. | cathy lee, np-c | family nurse practitioner | georgiana ying fu, acnpc-ag | acute care nurse practitioner | james yu xin, fnp-c | linh huynh, pa-c | physician assistant-certified | annie howell-freckleton, aprn, msn, fnp-bc | akua aninkorah, aprn, msn, fnp-bc | bayyinah wright,