 Mistakes happen, and I make them, too!\n\nI was advised to get an ultrasound on my thyroid during my annual physical and I was super happy that it was suggested! My annual exam felt complete and it felt good knowing I could potentially stop something bad before I noticed any problems myself. I scheduled an appointment for two days later.\n\nAlthough I was promised my doctor would go over the results with me, I''ve never been contacted about my bloodwork nor the ultrasound and it''s been exactly one month. I had to call and get an answer about the ultrasound, although I was initially told that the doctor was on vacation for another week. When someone tells you your thyroid is abnormal, waiting for several extra weeks is a tough ask and no patient should ever be told to wait since another physician wasn''t allowed to give me my results. After some disagreeing, the person on the phone came back off hold and said there was nothing wrong with my thyroid.\n\nNo one has discussed my bloodwork results and I have a printout as I requested the results for myself. I don''t work in the medical field, but it seems that I have to advocate for myself, just to get *results* of a test. Grateful to have Google to help with this all.\n\nWas everyone super friendly? Absolutely. But if you''re looking for answers to the test they perform, perhaps this isn''t the best place for you. I shouldn''t have to fight for this basic level of care and attention. This was just too many mistakes in only two visits, especially when my life is potentially in their hands.", "author": "Melissa Sostre", "rating": 2, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111328129368273164147/reviews"}, {"date": "2024-08-05T12:36:51.985290Z", "text": "I’ve been coming to this practice since I was a child, so over 20 years now! Dr. Fu is always caring and attentive to my medical concerns and questions, as well as the staff I see each time. Hoang, at the check in, greets me each time or takes my calls with a warm welcome, which is very important to me especially if I am coming in with something I’ve been worried about. Anytime I get blood drawn, the phlebotomist always gets it the first time. I have small and also moving veins and have had horrible experiences where I have to get stuck multiple times. Never at this practice! The entire staff I’ve engaged with over the years are consistent and well trained. I will always come here and would recommend anyone looking for a new practice to also come!", "author": "Wynne Huo", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112254840045997333471/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-11-11T15:11:01.757830172Z", "text": "Many of the doctors at this clinic are interns! They prescribed the wrong medication! Their lack of experience caused my family member''s condition to worsen! The receptionist at the front desk was also very rude afterwards! I do not recommend this clinic!", "author": "Rebecca Lee", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105844076219115556992/reviews"}, {"date": "2024-11-16T19:59:00.910600Z", "text": "Over the past few years, I’ve had the best experiences at this primary care clinic, and it’s time I leave a review! I saw PA Linh, and she was absolutely phenomenal. She is kind, attentive, super efficient. Anytime I need her, she quickly fits me in to address my concerns, which is super comforting. Knowing that she actually cares and always goes above and beyond with her patients. She''s always professional and knowledgeable, so I feel at ease and very confident after seeing her that my care plan is in good hands.\n\nThe best part is that every provider here is just as awesome! The entire team is friendly, knowledgeable, and dedicated to providing top-level care. I highly recommend this clinic to anyone looking for exceptional primary care services!", "author": "Nathan Nguyen", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108545671055454984355/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-08-06T15:51:39.651198568Z", "text": "Dr James Xin had been nothing but a Great Family doctor.  He remember me and my symptoms from prior visits and very quickly with each and every treatment.  I called in for walk-ins and almost away walk-ins any days. Highly recommended.", "author": "Kevin Do", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112021743563014467933/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Most patients praise the clinic for its friendly and professional staff, though some report negative experiences with wait times and clinical errors.", "about_highlight": "Excelsior Healthcare Primary Care in Norcross is part of a network dedicated to delivering compassionate, patient-centered primary and urgent care across North Georgia. With a team of experienced family physicians, internists, and nurse practitioners, the clinic offers comprehensive services including routine check-ups, senior care, women''s health, vaccinations, and physical exams. Patients appreciate the friendly staff, thorough care, and convenient walk-in options, reflecting the practice''s commitment to treating every patient as if they were their only patient.", "appointment_url": "https://excelsiorhealthcare.com/appointments", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=11611527643514385478&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJxyMPQSmh9YgRRrRNC99uJKE", "quality_missing": [], "search_keywords": ["primary care", "family doctor", "general practitioner", "annual physical", "checkup", "bác sĩ gia đình", "khám tổng quát", "nội khoa", "내과", "가정의학과", "家庭医生", "全科医生", "内科", "english", "vietnamese", "tiếng việt", "người việt", "bác sĩ việt", "walk-in urgent care", "women''s health", "senior care", "vaccinations", "physicals & medical exams", "urgent care", "preventive", "kaiser permanente", "aetna", "blue cross blue shield", "humana", "unitedhealthcare", "medicare", "christine bao, m.d.", "family physician", "alice-wei you, m.d.", "internist", "patrick huynh, d.o.", "kelcie miller, d.o.", "vy tran plata, md, ms, aahivs", "amy tran, d.o.", "cathy lee, np-c", "family nurse practitioner", "georgiana ying fu, acnpc-ag", "acute care nurse practitioner", "james yu xin, fnp-c", "linh huynh, pa-c", "physician assistant-certified", "annie howell-freckleton, aprn, msn, fnp-bc", "akua aninkorah, aprn, msn, fnp-bc", "bayyinah wright, fnp-c", "ngoc le, fnp-c", "christina gong, agpcnp-c"], "services_offered": [{"name": "Primary Care", "category": "Primary Care", "description": "Our team of primary care doctors and internists guide you every step of the way on your health journey.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "All ages"}, {"name": "Walk-In Urgent Care", "category": "Urgent Care", "description": "Appointment-free urgent care for non-emergency conditions.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "All ages"}, {"name": "Women''s Health", "category": "Women''s Health", "description": "Healthcare that evolves with women through different stages of life.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Women"}, {"name": "Senior Care", "category": "Senior Care", "description": "Over 30 years of experience working with senior patients to improve their health and quality of life.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Seniors"}, {"name": "Vaccinations", "category": "Preventive", "description": "A large range of vaccines with personalized vaccination schedules.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "All ages"}, {"name": "Physicals & Medical Exams", "category": "Preventive", "description": "Comprehensive physical wellness exams available as walk-in visits.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "All ages"}], "short_description": "Excelsior Healthcare Primary Care in Norcross provides comprehensive primary and urgent care services with a patient-focused team of doctors and nurse practitioners.", "google_website_url": "https://excelsiorhealthcare.com/", "insurance_accepted": ["Kaiser Permanente", "Aetna", "Blue Cross Blue Shield", "Humana", "UnitedHealthcare", "Medicare"], "google_primary_type": "Medical Clinic", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": ["Christine Bao, M.D.", "Alice-Wei You, M.D.", "Patrick Huynh, D.O.", "Kelcie Miller, D.O.", "Vy Tran Plata, MD, MS, AAHIVS", "Amy Tran, D.O.", "Cathy Lee, NP-C", "Georgiana Ying Fu, ACNPC-AG", "James Yu Xin, FNP-C", "Linh Huynh, PA-C", "Annie Howell-Freckleton, APRN, MSN, FNP-BC", "Akua Aninkorah, APRN, MSN, FNP-BC", "Bayyinah Wright, FNP-C", "Ngoc Le, FNP-C", "Christina Gong, AGPCNP-C"], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "777 W Peachtree St, Norcross, GA 30071, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/111431345469142854508", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV8CC1IdxvFbbA4bIb-bMGOOaibQLpY53cCUGVhsUKOl5TOsT7m=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Excelsior Healthcare Primary Care - Norcross"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/111431345469142854508", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV8CC1IdxvFbbA4bIb-bMGOOaibQLpY53cCUGVhsUKOl5TOsT7m=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Excelsior Healthcare Primary Care - Norcross"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/111431345469142854508", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV8CC1IdxvFbbA4bIb-bMGOOaibQLpY53cCUGVhsUKOl5TOsT7m=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Excelsior Healthcare Primary Care - Norcross"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/111431345469142854508", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV8CC1IdxvFbbA4bIb-bMGOOaibQLpY53cCUGVhsUKOl5TOsT7m=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Excelsior Healthcare Primary Care - Norcross"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/111431345469142854508", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV8CC1IdxvFbbA4bIb-bMGOOaibQLpY53cCUGVhsUKOl5TOsT7m=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Excelsior Healthcare Primary Care - Norcross"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-26T12:04:28.306264+00:00', 'excelsior-healthcare-primary-care-norcross', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('406e0ce9-9971-4251-9710-95bfa154ddb7', NULL, 'EAST-WEST HEALTH CARE CONSULTANTS, DR. WU ATLANTA GEORGIA', 'East-West Health Care Consultants provides Traditional Chinese Medicine (TCM), acupuncture, and Chinese herbal medicine in Atlanta, Georgia. Dr. Xiao Wu, a graduate of the Chengdu Traditional Chinese Medical University, applies classic acupuncture techniques and traditional herbs to treat a wide range of conditions, from pain and infertility to cancer support and mental health. The clinic emphasizes a holistic, individualized approach that integrates dietary and exercise guidance to help patients restore balance and achieve optimal longevity.', '5549 Roswell Rd, Atlanta, Georgia (GA)', 'Atlanta', 'GA', '30342', '(404) 236-0068', ARRAY['English', 'Chinese']::text[], 'Acupuncture & TCM', FALSE, '{"images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/east-west-health-care-consultants-dr.-wu-atlanta-georgia-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/east-west-health-care-consultants-dr.-wu-atlanta-georgia-google-2.webp"], "rating": 5, "reviews": [{"date": "2025-10-09T14:37:00.113257679Z", "text": "Best acupuncturist I’ve ever tried.  Been seeing Dr. Wu since 2022 when she helped me recover from all of my long COVID symptoms.  I used to feel tired and had low energy.  Now I have stamina to get through my day!  10/10 would recommend.", "author": "Jenica Wurm", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115443874786389557528/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-06-17T17:35:42.903604939Z", "text": "Dr Wu is the truth! My whole family has been going to her off and on for years. Shes a true healer. Pain, digestive issues, neurological, neuropathy, trouble walking, sooo many things ! Grateful for her.", "author": "Afya Ibomu", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107623632333207914241/reviews"}, {"date": "2023-02-21T19:21:18.571046Z", "text": "My name is Phaye Murphy and I''ve been a patient of Dr Wu''s off and on for the past 20+ years. From fertility challenges due to fibroids, to pain & trauma from a car accident to health maintenance, she''s helped me keep my life balanced. I have a 5 year old son & considering I''ll be 50 soon, I''m in pretty good shape. I need to come more but try to see her at least monthly if not more. My brother was diagnosed with cancer and comes for treatments to help supplement his chemo & ensure his health and nutrition are balanced. She''s a blessing. I wish there were more of her. I can''t say enough great things about Dr Wu and her desire to see people well.", "author": "Kingdom Investment Ministry''s", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104651928267194344585/reviews"}, {"date": "2021-01-11T03:37:03.879540Z", "text": "I saw Dr Wu for fertility issues that were ''incurable'' by my obgyn. She treated me with herbs and Chinese massage. The result: pregnancy within 1 year. 2 more children within 3 years. She has a God given skill and will help you. It is not quick, but it is thorough. I saw her again for chronic UTI, she cured that too. She helped immensely with menopause. Acupuncture works! 25 years of incredible treatment.", "author": "Kathy Gardner", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109503600845252433665/reviews"}, {"date": "2022-11-09T19:49:35.996509Z", "text": "Dr. Wu is very thorough and attentive in her work. I appreciated the time she spent with me working towards a healthier regimen for myself. She helped me in understanding and controlling gastro pains and energy levels. Acupuncture worked wonders as well!", "author": "Salena Araya", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114811739138921598789/reviews"}], "website": "http://www.ewhcacupuncture.com/", "location": {"latitude": 33.906183, "longitude": -84.3780726}, "services": ["Acupuncture", "Chinese Herbal Medicine", "Traditional Chinese Medicine (TCM)"], "insurance": {"notes": null, "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": [], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": false}, "highlights": [{"title": "Traditional Chinese Medicine specialist", "detail": "Dr. Xiao Wu graduated from Chengdu Traditional Chinese Medical University and trained at the China Academy of TCM in Beijing.", "category": "culture"}, {"title": "Classic acupuncture & herbal therapy", "detail": "Uses needle acupuncture and custom herbal formulas to unblock meridians and balance qi and blood.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Holistic patient-centered approach", "detail": "Combines TCM evaluation, nutritional diet, and exercise guidance for long-term wellness.", "category": "care"}], "price_tier": "$$", "source_url": "http://www.ewhcacupuncture.com/", "appointment": {"booking_note": null, "appointment_url": null, "new_patient_note": null, "phone_booking_available": null, "online_booking_available": null, "free_consultation_available": null}, "open_sunday": false, "scout_query": "Chinese speaking medical clinic in Atlanta, GA", "search_text": "acupuncture & tcm | acupuncture | chinese medicine | tcm | herbal medicine | cupping | pain relief | châm cứu | đông y | y học cổ truyền | 한의원 | 침술 | 한약 | 中医 | 针灸 | 中药 | english | chinese | mandarin | cantonese | 中文 | 普通话 | 国语 | 粤语 | 广东话 | 华人 | chinese herbal medicine | traditional chinese medicine (tcm) | traditional chinese medicine | dr. xiao wu | doctor of traditional chinese medicine", "google_types": ["medical_clinic", "health", "point_of_interest", "establishment"], "open_weekend": true, "rating_count": 12, "team_members": [{"name": "Dr. Xiao Wu", "role": "Doctor of Traditional Chinese Medicine", "bio_snippet": "Graduated from Chengdu Traditional Chinese Medical University (1984). Worked at China Academy of TCM in Beijing. Over 30 years of clinical experience helping tens of thousands of patients. Integrates acupuncture, herbs, nutrition, and exercise.", "languages_spoken": ["English", "Chinese"]}], "language_note": "The clinic is deeply rooted in Traditional Chinese Medicine (TCM) theory, including acupuncture meridians, qi and blood circulation, and the use of organic herbs. Dr. Wu brings heritage from China Academy of TCM in Beijing, and the practice serves the Asian and broader community with ancient Chinese wisdom adapted for modern times.", "open_saturday": true, "quality_score": 93, "working_hours": {"friday": "11:00 AM – 3:00 PM", "monday": "11:00 AM – 3:00 PM", "sunday": "Closed", "tuesday": "11:00 AM – 3:00 PM", "saturday": "10:00 AM – 2:00 PM", "thursday": "11:00 AM – 3:00 PM", "wednesday": "11:00 AM – 3:00 PM"}, "gallery_images": ["https://ewhcacupuncture.com/wp-content/themes/picolight/images/headers/willow.jpg", "https://i0.wp.com/ewhcacupuncture.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/IMG558.jpg", "https://i0.wp.com/ewhcacupuncture.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/IMG534.jpg", "https://i0.wp.com/ewhcacupuncture.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/IMG547-e1402705977516-225x300.jpg", "https://i0.wp.com/ewhcacupuncture.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/IMG533.jpg"], "review_profile": {"rating": 5, "source": "google", "themes": [{"theme": "Treatment Outcomes", "mentions": 5, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Multiple reviewers report remarkable recoveries from conditions like long COVID, fertility issues, and chronic pain."}, {"theme": "Clinical Expertise", "mentions": 4, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients describe Dr. Wu as a ''true healer'' with a ''God given skill'' for addressing diverse health challenges."}, {"theme": "Holistic Approach", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Reviews emphasize her comprehensive care combining acupuncture, herbs, and nutritional guidance for lasting results."}, {"theme": "Long-term Care", "mentions": 2, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Several patients report decades of successful treatment for maintenance and acute conditions alike."}, {"theme": "Patient Education", "mentions": 1, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "One reviewer specifically appreciated her thorough explanations and health regimen guidance."}], "summary": "Patients consistently praise Dr. Wu for her exceptional acupuncture and holistic treatments, highlighting significant improvements in various health conditions and overall well-being.", "review_count": 12, "concern_themes": [], "positive_themes": [], "featured_reviews": [{"date": "2025-10-09T14:37:00.113257679Z", "text": "Best acupuncturist I’ve ever tried.  Been seeing Dr. Wu since 2022 when she helped me recover from all of my long COVID symptoms.  I used to feel tired and had low energy.  Now I have stamina to get through my day!  10/10 would recommend.", "author": "Jenica Wurm", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115443874786389557528/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-06-17T17:35:42.903604939Z", "text": "Dr Wu is the truth! My whole family has been going to her off and on for years. Shes a true healer. Pain, digestive issues, neurological, neuropathy, trouble walking, sooo many things ! Grateful for her.", "author": "Afya Ibomu", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107623632333207914241/reviews"}, {"date": "2023-02-21T19:21:18.571046Z", "text": "My name is Phaye Murphy and I''ve been a patient of Dr Wu''s off and on for the past 20+ years. From fertility challenges due to fibroids, to pain & trauma from a car accident to health maintenance, she''s helped me keep my life balanced. I have a 5 year old son & considering I''ll be 50 soon, I''m in pretty good shape. I need to come more but try to see her at least monthly if not more. My brother was diagnosed with cancer and comes for treatments to help supplement his chemo & ensure his health and nutrition are balanced. She''s a blessing. I wish there were more of her. I can''t say enough great things about Dr Wu and her desire to see people well.", "author": "Kingdom Investment Ministry''s", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104651928267194344585/reviews"}, {"date": "2021-01-11T03:37:03.879540Z", "text": "I saw Dr Wu for fertility issues that were ''incurable'' by my obgyn. She treated me with herbs and Chinese massage. The result: pregnancy within 1 year. 2 more children within 3 years. She has a God given skill and will help you. It is not quick, but it is thorough. I saw her again for chronic UTI, she cured that too. She helped immensely with menopause. Acupuncture works! 25 years of incredible treatment.", "author": "Kathy Gardner", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109503600845252433665/reviews"}, {"date": "2022-11-09T19:49:35.996509Z", "text": "Dr. Wu is very thorough and attentive in her work. I appreciated the time she spent with me working towards a healthier regimen for myself. She helped me in understanding and controlling gastro pains and energy levels. Acupuncture worked wonders as well!", "author": "Salena Araya", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114811739138921598789/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Patients consistently praise Dr. Wu for her exceptional acupuncture and holistic treatments, highlighting significant improvements in various health conditions and overall well-being.", "about_highlight": "East-West Health Care Consultants provides Traditional Chinese Medicine (TCM), acupuncture, and Chinese herbal medicine in Atlanta, Georgia. Dr. Xiao Wu, a graduate of the Chengdu Traditional Chinese Medical University, applies classic acupuncture techniques and traditional herbs to treat a wide range of conditions, from pain and infertility to cancer support and mental health. The clinic emphasizes a holistic, individualized approach that integrates dietary and exercise guidance to help patients restore balance and achieve optimal longevity.", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=9238314742870800257&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJDSkmBukO9YgRgXcR3E8WNYA", "quality_missing": ["insurance", "appointment_url"], "search_keywords": ["acupuncture & tcm", "acupuncture", "chinese medicine", "tcm", "herbal medicine", "cupping", "pain relief", "châm cứu", "đông y", "y học cổ truyền", "한의원", "침술", "한약", "中医", "针灸", "中药", "english", "chinese", "mandarin", "cantonese", "中文", "普通话", "国语", "粤语", "广东话", "华人", "chinese herbal medicine", "traditional chinese medicine (tcm)", "traditional chinese medicine", "dr. xiao wu", "doctor of traditional chinese medicine"], "cultural_context": "The clinic is deeply rooted in Traditional Chinese Medicine (TCM) theory, including acupuncture meridians, qi and blood circulation, and the use of organic herbs. Dr. Wu brings heritage from China Academy of TCM in Beijing, and the practice serves the Asian and broader community with ancient Chinese wisdom adapted for modern times.", "services_offered": [{"name": "Acupuncture", "category": "Acupuncture", "description": "Needle stimulation to unblock meridians and balance qi and blood. Recognized by WHO for many conditions.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients with pain, infertility, stress, insomnia, digestive issues, and other chronic problems."}, {"name": "Chinese Herbal Medicine", "category": "Herbal Medicine", "description": "Custom and patent herbal formulas made from organic natural substances, tested for thousands of years.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients with cancers, pathological disorders, stress, depression, and general health imbalance."}, {"name": "Traditional Chinese Medicine (TCM)", "category": "Traditional Chinese Medicine", "description": "Complete TCM evaluation and treatment using acupuncture, herbs, diet, and exercise.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Anyone seeking a holistic alternative or complement to Western medicine."}], "short_description": "Atlanta-based TCM clinic offering acupuncture, Chinese herbs, and holistic care under Dr. Xiao Wu since 1984.", "google_website_url": "http://www.ewhcacupuncture.com/", "google_primary_type": "Medical Clinic", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": ["Dr. Xiao Wu"], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "5549 Roswell Rd NE, Atlanta, GA 30342, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/112134752105101565043", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVKl9Q28_shpvy1qdzTFYVDem3Wp9p2TSOCXxpBYF3HZpgGXwY=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "EAST-WEST HEALTH CARE CONSULTANTS, DR. WU ATLANTA GEORGIA"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/112134752105101565043", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVKl9Q28_shpvy1qdzTFYVDem3Wp9p2TSOCXxpBYF3HZpgGXwY=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "EAST-WEST HEALTH CARE CONSULTANTS, DR. WU ATLANTA GEORGIA"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-26T12:16:20.252408+00:00', 'east-west-health-care-consultants-dr-wu-atlanta-georgia', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('915db9e0-6ee2-488f-9ead-5f5e5fcb6bca', NULL, 'Bayanihan Clinic', 'Bayanihan Clinic is a University of California, Davis student-run free clinic and non-profit organization serving the underserved and uninsured population of Sacramento. It provides accessible primary and preventative healthcare to Filipino immigrants and all diverse, underserved communities of the Greater Sacramento area, while honoring the legacy of Filipino veterans through advocacy and community engagement. The clinic operates on Saturdays from 8:00 AM to 12:00 PM and prioritizes patients who are medically uninsured. It also offers Telehealth follow-up appointments while requiring new patients to be seen in-person.', '3030 Explorer Drive, Sacramento, CA 95827', 'Sacramento', 'CA', '95827', '(916) 234-6773', ARRAY['English', 'Spanish', 'Tagalog', 'Vietnamese']::text[], 'Primary Care', TRUE, '{"fax": "888-965-5448", "email": "clinic@bayanihanclinic.com", "images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/bayanihan-clinic-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/bayanihan-clinic-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/bayanihan-clinic-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/bayanihan-clinic-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/bayanihan-clinic-google-5.webp"], "rating": 5, "reviews": [{"date": "2019-03-11T21:45:17.272483Z", "text": "SO GOOOOOD", "author": "Sean Carnahan", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108686424367523774814/reviews"}], "website": "https://www.bayanihanclinic.com/", "location": {"latitude": 38.563214099999996, "longitude": -121.33240699999999}, "services": ["Primary Care Services", "Specialty Clinic Services", "Telehealth Follow-up"], "insurance": {"notes": "The clinic is a free clinic and prioritizes patients who are medically uninsured. No insurance is mentioned as accepted.", "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": [], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": false}, "highlights": [{"title": "Free Clinic", "detail": "Bayanihan Clinic is a free clinic serving the underserved and uninsured population of Sacramento.", "category": "access"}, {"title": "Student-Run Clinic", "detail": "The clinic is run by University of California, Davis students as a non-profit organization.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Saturdays Only", "detail": "Clinic operates every Saturday from 8:00 AM to 12:00 PM.", "category": "convenience"}, {"title": "Telehealth Available", "detail": "Scheduled video-call follow-up appointments are available; new patients must be seen in-person.", "category": "technology"}, {"title": "Multilingual Staff", "detail": "The clinic offers translation services and speaks English, Tagalog, and Spanish.", "category": "culture"}, {"title": "Focus on Uninsured", "detail": "Prioritizes patients who are medically uninsured.", "category": "access"}], "price_tier": "$$", "source_url": "http://bayanihanclinic.com/", "appointment": {"booking_note": "To schedule an appointment, call (916) 234-6773. Leave a message with your name, contact information, and reason for appointment. Walk-in appointments are not guaranteed to be seen.", "appointment_url": null, "new_patient_note": "New patients must be seen in-person and call to schedule an appointment. Walk-ins not guaranteed.", "phone_booking_available": true, "online_booking_available": false, "free_consultation_available": null}, "open_sunday": false, "scout_query": "Vietnamese speaking medical clinic in Sacramento, CA", "search_text": "primary care | family doctor | general practitioner | annual physical | checkup | bác sĩ gia đình | khám tổng quát | nội khoa | 내과 | 가정의학과 | 家庭医生 | 全科医生 | 内科 | english | spanish | tagalog | vietnamese | tiếng việt | người việt | bác sĩ việt | primary care services | specialty clinic services | telehealth follow-up", "google_types": ["doctor", "medical_clinic", "health", "point_of_interest", "establishment"], "open_weekend": true, "rating_count": 2, "language_note": "The clinic explicitly serves Filipino immigrants and diverse underserved communities, honoring the legacy of Filipino veterans. It offers Tagalog and Spanish interpreter services and lists Tagalog as a spoken language, reflecting strong Asian and immigrant cultural context.", "open_saturday": true, "quality_score": 90, "working_hours": {"friday": "Closed", "monday": "Closed", "sunday": "Closed", "tuesday": "Closed", "saturday": "8:00 AM – 12:00 PM", "thursday": "Closed", "wednesday": "Closed"}, "gallery_images": ["https://static.wixstatic.com/media/7b8854_2d8908233d6c44ea83eac302e0a4f2a0~mv2_d_5616_3510_s_4_2.jpg/v1/fill/w_1280,h_1536,al_c,q_90,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/7b8854_2d8908233d6c44ea83eac302e0a4f2a0~mv2_d_5616_3510_s_4_2.jpg", "https://static.wixstatic.com/media/7b8854_52c297eb842c4e6eb937aa52aed63762~mv2.png/v1/fit/w_960,h_722,q_90,enc_avif,quality_auto/7b8854_52c297eb842c4e6eb937aa52aed63762~mv2.png", "https://static.wixstatic.com/media/7b8854_b81e1cf205c4466bbc1cc06e3a7c4e7f~mv2.png/v1/fit/w_799,h_600,q_90,enc_avif,quality_auto/7b8854_b81e1cf205c4466bbc1cc06e3a7c4e7f~mv2.png", "https://static.wixstatic.com/media/7b8854_270b65cd0c074b41861e517e602eef09~mv2.jpg/v1/fit/w_960,h_641,q_90,enc_avif,quality_auto/7b8854_270b65cd0c074b41861e517e602eef09~mv2.jpg", "https://