progressed just as Lily described.  Following her treatment, I immediately conceived.  I was thrilled.  I went back to her for my second child and was able to get pregnant quickly.  I''ve since referred Dr Lily to others who have had similar experiences.  Many women suffer from fertility issues for one reason or another.  I would absolutely suggest trying acupuncture first before other more invasive methods of fertility.", "author": "AbbieAgentAtlantaRE", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102135441848178667207/reviews"}, {"date": "2019-07-19T12:51:25.586928Z", "text": "I have had tendinitis in my knees for several years. Had the standard cortisone shots from time to time that helped for a week or two used ice packs etc. Decided to try acupuncture, thinking had nothing to lose. I saw Dr Li for a few months on a weekly basis and stopped about 3 months ago when the pain was gone. The pain has not returned! I cannot say enough good about Dr Li, she is great.", "author": "Stan Nichols", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113462592820625037553/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Patients consistently praise Dr. Lily Li for her holistic approach, personalized care, and effective acupuncture treatments, with many reporting significant improvements in pain, fertility, and overall health.", "about_highlight": "Acupuncture & Oriental Health Care Center has been serving the community for over 25 years, offering a variety of traditional Chinese medical remedies. The center is run by Lily Li, a Georgia Licensed Acupuncturist, and provides treatments ranging from acupuncture to herbal tea and supplements. With a focus on natural healing modalities such as auricular points, detox, facial rejuvenation, infertility, kidney, pain management, sound, and specialty treatments, the center aims to improve patients'' lives through time-honored practices.", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.c