patients.", "open_saturday": false, "quality_score": 93, "gallery_images": ["https://www.psjhmedgroups.org/images/thumbnail.aspx?I=https://cdn-images.kyruus.com/providermatch/phs/photos/500/hong-seogeun-1871927962.jpg&W=240&H=260&C=TopCenter&F=Expand"], "review_profile": {"rating": 4.3, "source": "google", "themes": [{"theme": "Clinical Expertise", "mentions": 4, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Multiple reviewers commend Dr. Hong''s knowledge, professionalism, and caring approach."}, {"theme": "Staff Professionalism", "mentions": 1, "sentiment": "Negative", "summary_quote": "One review criticizes the staff for errors, lack of accountability, and poor communication."}, {"theme": "Communication", "mentions": 2, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients appreciate Dr. Hong''s listening skills and straightforward communication."}, {"theme": "Bedside Manner", "mentions": 2, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Reviewers highlight Dr. Hong''s friendly and accommodating bedside manner."}, {"theme": "Team Approach", "mentions": 1, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "One patient notes Dr. Hong''s collaborative approach to care, working as a team."}], "summary": "Most patients praise Dr. Hong for her professionalism, knowledge, and caring approach, though one review highlights significant issues with staff accountability and communication.", "review_count": 6, "concern_themes": [], "positive_themes": [], "featured_reviews": [{"date": "2023-09-27T03:26:51.854155Z", "text": "I''m sure Dr Hong is a great doctor. Unfortunately, her staff is subpar. They sent an incorrect prescription to the pharmacy for my 93 year old mother.  They were not accountable for their error. Terrible listeners. Very defensive. I tried to escalate my concerns however, the office manager indicated Dr Hong is not interested in feedback about her support staff.", "author": "Larraine Hokans", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104457020740166680814/reviews"}, {"date": "2022-11-17T05:14:06.654507Z", "text": "Dr. Hong is very professional and friendly! :)\nShe is one of the most caring doctors that I have ever had. I highly recommend her and her staff!", "author": "Da In Kim", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101232864886270004814/reviews"}, {"date": "2024-08-21T22:13:57.476280Z", "text": "Dr. Hong was highly recommended to me by knowledgeable friends. I too have been very impressed by Dr. Seogeun Hong''s knowledge and professionalism.", "author": "Robert A. Hoff", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107353055007940207393/reviews"}, {"date": "2022-09-15T23:34:13.318452Z", "text": "Dr Hong is a excellent physician.  She really listens to what you have to say about your body issues. She works WITH you not AT you. We are a TEAM..", "author": "Marjorie Gregg", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117478881512508061601/reviews"}, {"date": "2023-10-02T18:31:17.614832Z", "text": "Great bedside manner! Very knowledgeable, accommodating  and straightforward.", "author": "Cris Delcuel (CrisD)", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117115483576175803242/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Most patients praise Dr. Hong for her professionalism, knowledge, and caring approach, though one review highlights significant issues with staff accountability and communication.", "about_highlight": "Dr. Seogeun Hong is a board-certified internal medicine physician and primary care provider at Comprehensive Pulmonary and Primary Care of Orange County. She is passionate about empowering her patients to make informed medical decisions through a personalized, comprehensive approach that considers lifestyle and stress factors. Dr. Hong completed her geriatric medicine fellowship at UCLA and is dedicated to helping her patients lead happier, healthier lives. She is bilingual in English and Korean.", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=3662431847069867911&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJLQaxHcXZ3IARh1-tSlyS0zI", "quality_missing": ["working_hours", "appointment_url"], "search_keywords": ["primary care", "family doctor", "general practitioner", "annual physical", "checkup", "bác sĩ gia đình", "khám tổng quát", "nội khoa", "내과", "가정의학과", "家庭医生", "全科医生", "内科", "english", "korean", "한국어", "한인", "한국말", "vietnamese", "tiếng việt", "người việt", "bác sĩ việt", "geriatric medicine", "video visits", "aetna", "medicare", "blue cross blue shield", "cigna", "health net", "unitedhealthcare", "seogeun hong", "physician (internal medicine, geriatric medicine)"], "cultural_context": "Dr. Hong is bilingual in English and Korean and completed her medical education at Dongguk University School of Medicine in South Korea, offering culturally responsive care to Korean-speaking patients.", "services_offered": [{"name": "Primary Care", "category": "Primary Care", "description": "Personalized primary care with a focus on comprehensive health, lifestyle, and informed decision-making.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Adults and elderly patients seeking a long-term primary care provider."}, {"name": "Geriatric Medicine", "category": "Primary Care", "description": "Specialized care for aging patients, addressing age-related health concerns with a compassionate approach.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Elderly patients."}, {"name": "Video Visits", "category": "Primary Care", "description": "Meet with Dr. Hong online via telehealth for convenient follow-ups and consultations.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Established patients and new patients for virtual visits."}], "short_description": "Board-certified internal medicine physician offering personalized, comprehensive primary care. Dr. Hong believes in empowering patients through informed decision-making and a holistic approach, and is bilingual in English and Korean.", "google_website_url": "https://www.psjhmedgroups.org/Find-a-Doctor/H/Seogeun-Naomi-Hong-MD.aspx", "insurance_accepted": ["Aetna", "Medicare", "Blue Cross Blue Shield", "Cigna", "Health Net", "UnitedHealthcare"], "google_primary_type": "Medical Clinic", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": ["Seogeun Hong"], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "accepting_new_patients": true, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "1010 W La Veta Ave #750, Orange, CA 92868, USA"}'::jsonb, '2026-06-26T12:38:32.81561+00:00', 'seogeun-hong-md', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('645f1408-714e-4325-861e-5b301c83b64c', NULL, 'Kwang He Won Health Center', 'Kwang He Won Health Center is a non-profit Federally Qualified Health Center (FQHC) in Los Angeles dedicated to increasing access to quality primary healthcare and human services for all, regardless of socioeconomic or immigration status. The center maximizes the advantages of traditional Korean medicine, alternative therapy, and Western medicine to improve patient quality of life while minimizing unnecessary surgery or side effects. Their goal is to provide culturally and linguistically sensitive health services to the community, combining Western primary care with rehabilitation acupuncture and holistic approaches.', '815 S Ardmore Ave 1st Floor Los Angeles CA 90005', 'Los Angeles', 'CA', '90005', '(213) 385-0448', ARRAY['English', 'Korean', 'Spanish']::text[], 'Primary Care', FALSE, '{"email": "info@kwanghewon.org", "images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/kwang-he-won-health-center-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/kwang-he-won-health-center-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/kwang-he-won-health-center-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/kwang-he-won-health-center-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/kwang-he-won-health-center-google-5.webp"], "rating": 3.9, "pricing": [{"name": "Sliding Fee Discount", "notes": "Discounted medical services through a sliding fee schedule for qualifying patients. Nominal fee for incomes below 100% Federal Poverty Level; sliding scale discounts for incomes 101%-200% FPL.", "price": null, "category": "Primary Care", "price_range": "Based on household size and gross income"}, {"name": "Family Planning PACT", "notes": "Comprehensive family planning services for eligible low-income California residents.", "price": null, "category": "Family Planning", "price_range": null}, {"name": "Presumptive Eligibility for Pregnant Women", "notes": "Immediate temporary Medi-Cal coverage for prenatal care for low-income pregnant patients.", "price": null, "category": "Women''s Health", "price_range": null}, {"name": "Vaccine for Children (VFC)", "notes": "Federally funded program providing vaccines at no cost to children who might not otherwise be vaccinated due to inability to pay.", "price": "No cost", "category": "Vaccinations", "price_range": null}, {"name": "Vaccine for Adults (VFA)", "notes": "No-cost vaccines for uninsured or underinsured adults 19 years of age and older.", "price": "No cost", "category": "Vaccinations", "price_range": null}, {"name": "COVID-19 Vaccine & Testing", "notes": "Available for adults and children. No pricing information provided.", "price": null, "category": "Vaccinations", "price_range": null}], "reviews": [{"date": "2026-02-27T19:33:37.348951315Z", "text": "Did a walk in visit to the clinic in the afternoon. They were able to see me right away. Great staff, great doctor~great front desk. Thank you!", "author": "bora lim", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117293608419318561944/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-08-16T00:03:04.738976116Z", "text": "Inadequate, improper, insensitive care. No one deserves to be treated the way Dr. Lee treats his patients. (coming from someone who works in the medical field)\n\nThank said, reception is always very kind and helpful.", "author": "Jacqueline Contino", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117522288571114853084/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-08-08T19:33:26.423120462Z", "text": "The staff here are consistently unfriendly and seem to only pretend to be busy. They neglect their responsibilities, respond poorly to questions, show irritation, and simply tell people to wait. I strongly believe there should be more Korean staff.", "author": "mirra briasn", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112002935861072661651/reviews"}, {"date": "2023-09-02T14:47:18.579416Z", "text": "Ive been seeing Dr Brandon Oh for 8 months and he has practically almost cured me of my Fibromyalgia using TCM. Never thought itd be possible", "author": "Leslie", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107192701139276375986/reviews"}, {"date": "2021-11-22T22:51:29.600028Z", "text": "Got my booster shot here. They attended me rapidly & nicely. Good folks. 👍", "author": "Eli Mendoza", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111195005339874053605/reviews"}], "website": "https://kwanghewon.org/", "location": {"latitude": 34.0572267, "longitude": -118.30217539999998}, "services": ["General Primary Care", "Family Planning", "Women''s Health", "Vaccinations", "Sliding Fee Discount Program (SFDP)", "Family Planning PACT", "Presumptive Eligibility for Pregnant Women", "COVID-19 Vaccine & Testing", "Vaccine for Children (VFC)", "Vaccine for Adults (VFA)", "Laboratory Services", "Rehabilitation Acupuncture", "After-Hours On-Call Provider"], "insurance": {"notes": "Accepts Medi-Cal through Presumptive Eligibility for pregnant women. Offers Sliding Fee Discount Program for patients based on household size and income. No mention of private insurance or Medicare.", "accepts_medicaid": true, "accepts_medicare": true, "accepted_networks": ["Medicaid", "Medicare"], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": false}, "highlights": [{"title": "Federally Qualified Health Center (FQHC)", "detail": "Federally funded nonprofit health center that serves medically underserved areas and populations, providing primary care regardless of ability to pay.", "category": "insurance"}, {"title": "Sliding Fee Discount Program", "detail": "Discounted medical services through a sliding fee schedule based on household size and gross income for qualifying patients.", "category": "insurance"}, {"title": "Culturally & Linguistically Sensitive Care", "detail": "Services provided with cultural and linguistic sensitivity, integrating traditional Korean medicine and Western medicine.", "category": "culture"}, {"title": "Family Planning PACT Program", "detail": "Approved by California to provide comprehensive family planning services to eligible low-income residents.", "category": "insurance"}, {"title": "Presumptive Eligibility for Pregnant Women", "detail": "A Medi-Cal program providing immediate temporary coverage for prenatal care to low-income pregnant patients.", "category": "insurance"}, {"title": "Same-Day Lab Results", "detail": "Results of test procedures processed on site are reported the same day during regular business hours.", "category": "convenience"}, {"title": "Free Vaccines for Children & Adults", "detail": "VFC program provides vaccines at no cost to children; VFA program provides no-cost vaccines for uninsured/underinsured adults 19+.", "category": "insurance"}], "price_tier": "$", "source_url": "https://kwanghewon.org/", "appointment": {"booking_note": "Call (213) 385-0448 to book an appointment. Online booking form available on the website.", "appointment_url": null, "new_patient_note": null, "phone_booking_available": true, "online_booking_available": true, "free_consultation_available": null}, "open_sunday": false, "scout_query": "Korean primary care clinic in Los Angeles, CA", "search_text": "primary care | family doctor | general practitioner | annual physical | checkup | bác sĩ gia đình | khám tổng quát | nội khoa | 내과 | 가정의학과 | 家庭医生 | 全科医生 | 内科 | english | korean | 한국어 | 한인 | 한국말 | spanish | general primary care | family planning | women''s health | vaccinations | sliding fee discount program (sfdp) | family planning pact | presumptive eligibility for pregnant women | covid-19 vaccine & testing | vaccine for children (vfc) | vaccine for adults (vfa) | laboratory services | rehabilitation acupuncture | after-hours on-call provider | preventive | diagnostic | alternative medicine | medicaid | medicare | bena won | ceo | brandon oh | esther kim | receptionist | dr. richard bardowell | medical director | dr. fernando enrile | cmo", "google_types": ["medical_center", "medical_clinic", "hospital", "doctor", "health", "point_of_interest", "service", "establishment"], "open_weekend": false, "rating_count": 11, "team_members": [{"name": "Bena Won", "role": "CEO", "bio_snippet": "RN, Ph.D, L.Ac. – CEO of Kwang He Won Health Center.", "languages_spoken": ["Korean", "English"]}, {"name": "Brandon Oh", "role": "Rehabilitation Acupuncture", "bio_snippet": "Ph.D., L.Ac. – Provides rehabilitation acupuncture services.", "languages_spoken": ["Korean", "English"]}, {"name": "Esther Kim", "role": "Receptionist", "bio_snippet": "Front desk receptionist.", "languages_spoken": ["Korean", "English"]}, {"name": "Dr. Richard Bardowell", "role": "Medical Director", "bio_snippet": "M.D. – Medical Director of Kwang He Won Health Center.", "languages_spoken": ["English"]}, {"name": "Dr. Fernando Enrile", "role": "CMO", "bio_snippet": "M.D. – Chief Medical Officer.", "languages_spoken": ["English"]}], "language_note": "Kwang He Won Health Center explicitly aims to provide culturally and linguistically sensitive health services. The team includes Korean-speaking providers (Bena Won, RN, Ph.D, L.Ac.; Brandon Oh, Ph.D., L.Ac.; Esther Kim) and the center integrates traditional Korean medicine, alternative therapy, and Western medicine. Patient testimonials are published in Korean names, indicating a strong Korean-patient focus. The website is available in English, Spanish, and Korean.", "open_saturday": false, "quality_score": 98, "working_hours": {"friday": "9:00 AM – 5:30 PM", "monday": "9:00 AM – 5:30 PM", "sunday": "Closed", "tuesday": "9:00 AM – 5:30 PM", "saturday": "Closed", "thursday": "9:00 AM – 6:30 PM", "wednesday": "9:00 AM – 5:30 PM"}, "gallery_images": ["https://kwanghewon.org/images/content/kwanghewon-doctor-general-practicioner.jpg", "https://kwanghewon.org/images/content/kwanghewon-admin-doctors.jpg", "https://kwanghewon.org/images/content/kwanghewon-staff-photo-bena-won-rn.jpg", "https://kwanghewon.org/images/content/kwanghewon-staff-photo-brandon-oh-acupuncturist.jpg", "https://kwanghewon.org/images/content/kwanghewon-staff-photo-esther-kim-staff.jpg", "https://kwanghewon.org/images/content/kwanghewon-staff-photo-dr-bardowell.jpg", "https://kwanghewon.org/images/content/kwanghewon-staff-photo-dr-enrile.jpg", "https://kwanghewon.org/images/content/kwanghewon-clinic-reviews-hands-in.jpg", "https://kwanghewon.org/images/content/khw-services-sfdp.png", "https://kwanghewon.org/images/content/khw-services-pact.png", "https://kwanghewon.org/images/content/khw-services-pepw.png", "https://kwanghewon.org/images/content/khw-services-covid-testing-vaccine.png", "https://kwanghewon.org/images/content/khw-services-vfc.png", "https://kwanghewon.org/images/content/khw-services-vfa.png"], "review_profile": {"rating": 3.9, "source": "google", "themes": [{"theme": "Staff Professionalism", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Mixed", "summary_quote": "Some reviewers praise the staff as friendly and helpful, while others describe them as unfriendly and neglectful."}, {"theme": "Treatment Outcomes", "mentions": 1, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "One reviewer highlights significant improvement in their Fibromyalgia through TCM treatment."}, {"theme": "Facility Environment", "mentions": 1, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "A reviewer mentions being attended to rapidly and nicely during their visit."}, {"theme": "Clinical Expertise", "mentions": 1, "sentiment": "Negative", "summary_quote": "One reviewer criticizes the doctor for inadequate and insensitive care."}, {"theme": "Communication", "mentions": 1, "sentiment": "Negative", "summary_quote": "A reviewer notes poor responses to questions and irritation from staff."}], "summary": "Patients have mixed experiences at Kwang He Won Health Center, with some praising the friendly staff and effective treatments, while others criticize the care quality and staff behavior.", "review_count": 11, "concern_themes": [], "positive_themes": ["Improved health after treatment", "Grateful for medical staff", "Helpful health screenings"], "featured_reviews": [{"date": "2026-02-27T19:33:37.348951315Z", "text": "Did a walk in visit to the clinic in the afternoon. They were able to see me right away. Great staff, great doctor~great front desk. Thank you!", "author": "bora lim", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117293608419318561944/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-08-16T00:03:04.738976116Z", "text": "Inadequate, improper, insensitive care. No one deserves to be treated the way Dr. Lee treats his patients. (coming from someone who works in the medical field)\n\nThank said, reception is always very kind and helpful.", "author": "Jacqueline Contino", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117522288571114853084/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-08-08T19:33:26.423120462Z", "text": "The staff here are consistently unfriendly and seem to only pretend to be busy. They neglect their responsibilities, respond poorly to questions, show irritation, and simply tell people to wait. I strongly believe there should be more Korean staff.", "author": "mirra briasn", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112002935861072661651/reviews"}, {"date": "2023-09-02T14:47:18.579416Z", "text": "Ive been seeing Dr Brandon Oh for 8 months and he has practically almost cured me of my Fibromyalgia using TCM. Never thought itd be possible", "author": "Leslie", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107192701139276375986/reviews"}, {"date": "2021-11-22T22:51:29.600028Z", "text": "Got my booster shot here. They attended me rapidly & nicely. Good folks. 👍", "author": "Eli Mendoza", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111195005339874053605/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Patients have mixed experiences at Kwang He Won Health Center, with some praising the friendly staff and effective treatments, while others criticize the care quality and staff behavior.", "about_highlight": "Kwang He Won Health Center is a non-profit Federally Qualified Health Center (FQHC) in Los Angeles dedicated to increasing access to quality primary healthcare and human services for all, regardless of socioeconomic or immigration status. The center maximizes the advantages of traditional Korean medicine, alternative therapy, and Western medicine to improve patient quality of life while minimizing unnecessary surgery or side effects. Their goal is to provide culturally and linguistically sensitive health services to the community, combining Western primary care with rehabilitation acupuncture and holistic approaches.", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=12490403653961515249&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJVVUloIG4woAR8QCeP_LTVq0", "quality_missing": ["appointment_url"], "search_keywords": ["primary care", "family doctor", "general practitioner", "annual physical", "checkup", "bác sĩ gia đình", "khám tổng quát", "nội khoa", "내과", "가정의학과", "家庭医生", "全科医生", "内科", "english", "korean", "한국어", "한인", "한국말", "spanish", "general primary care", "family planning", "women''s health", "vaccinations", "sliding fee discount program (sfdp)", "family planning pact", "presumptive eligibility for pregnant women", "covid-19 vaccine & testing", "vaccine for children (vfc)", "vaccine for adults (vfa)", "laboratory services", "rehabilitation acupuncture", "after-hours on-call provider", "preventive", "diagnostic", "alternative medicine", "medicaid", "medicare", "bena won", "ceo", "brandon oh", "esther kim", "receptionist", "dr. richard bardowell", "medical director", "dr. fernando enrile", "cmo"], "cultural_context": "Kwang He Won Health Center explicitly aims to provide culturally and linguistically sensitive health services. The team includes Korean-speaking providers (Bena Won, RN, Ph.D, L.Ac.; Brandon Oh, Ph.D., L.Ac.; Esther Kim) and the center integrates traditional Korean medicine, alternative therapy, and Western medicine. Patient testimonials are published in Korean names, indicating a strong Korean-patient focus. The website is available in English, Spanish, and Korean.", "services_offered": [{"name": "General Primary Care", "category": "Primary Care", "description": "Highest standards of patient service for general primary care needs.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "All patients, regardless of socioeconomic or immigration status."}, {"name": "Family Planning", "category": "Primary Care", "description": "Comprehensive family planning services approved by the state of California, available to eligible low-income residents.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Eligible low-income residents of California."}, {"name": "Women''s Health", "category": "Primary Care", "description": "Women''s health care including a Medi-Cal program that provides immediate and temporary coverage for prenatal care.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Low-income pregnant patients."}, {"name": "Vaccinations", "category": "Preventive", "description": "Immunization services including COVID-19 vaccine and testing, VFC (Vaccines for Children), and VFA (Vaccines for Adults).", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Children, adults, uninsured/underinsured adults 19+."}, {"name": "Sliding Fee Discount Program (SFDP)", "category": "Primary Care", "description": "Discounted medical services through a sliding fee schedule based on household size and gross income.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients who qualify based on household size and gross income."}, {"name": "Family Planning PACT", "category": "Primary Care", "description": "State-approved comprehensive family planning services for eligible low-income residents.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Eligible low-income California residents."}, {"name": "Presumptive Eligibility for Pregnant Women", "category": "Primary Care", "description": "Medi-Cal program providing immediate temporary coverage for prenatal care.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Low-income pregnant patients."}, {"name": "COVID-19 Vaccine & Testing", "category": "Preventive", "description": "COVID-19 vaccine and testing available for adults and children.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Adults and children."}, {"name": "Vaccine for Children (VFC)", "category": "Preventive", "description": "Federally funded program providing vaccines at no cost to children who might not otherwise be vaccinated due to inability to pay.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Children who might not otherwise be vaccinated due to inability to pay."}, {"name": "Vaccine for Adults (VFA)", "category": "Preventive", "description": "No-cost vaccines for uninsured or underinsured adults 19 years of age and older.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Uninsured or underinsured adults 19+."}, {"name": "Laboratory Services", "category": "Diagnostic", "description": "On-site lab testing with same-day results reported during regular business hours.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients requiring lab work."}, {"name": "Rehabilitation Acupuncture", "category": "Alternative Medicine", "description": "Rehabilitation acupuncture services provided by licensed acupuncturist Brandon Oh, Ph.D., L.Ac.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients needing rehabilitation or acupuncture therapy."}, {"name": "After-Hours On-Call Provider", "category": "Primary Care", "description": "Patients can speak with an on-call provider after business hours by calling the main number.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients with urgent but non-emergency needs after hours."}], "short_description": "A non-profit FQHC in Los Angeles offering culturally sensitive primary care, family planning, women’s health, vaccinations, and sliding fee discounts, with a focus on the Korean-American community.", "google_website_url": "https://kwanghewon.org/", "insurance_accepted": ["Medicaid", "Medicare"], "google_primary_type": "Medical Clinic", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": ["Bena Won", "Brandon Oh", "Esther Kim", "Dr. Richard Bardowell", "Dr. Fernando Enrile"], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "accepting_new_patients": true, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "815 S Ardmore Ave 1st Floor, Los Angeles, CA 90005, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/116620915331508129315", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWyLNqufawLlGwfI44_3CN5x4QyT18exQxBQ9ouX3nPxk3RVKM=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Kwang He Won Health Center"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/111195005339874053605", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI9GMl6KL7Mv4Z-4P0gFbf1eRuwNryhoWUwF1OWmn2h5nUb-IIB=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Eli Mendoza"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/110036332784024248015", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVKLISBgNWz2p7-JGHTbTgtnLiqSMB6v0FBwDyODzP6bGNHSZmcMw=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Jon Gray"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/110036332784024248015", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVKLISBgNWz2p7-JGHTbTgtnLiqSMB6v0FBwDyODzP6bGNHSZmcMw=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Jon Gray"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/110036332784024248015", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVKLISBgNWz2p7-JGHTbTgtnLiqSMB6v0FBwDyODzP6bGNHSZmcMw=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Jon Gray"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-26T12:40:11.502485+00:00', 'kwang-he-won-health-center', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('f80e2d48-53c7-42de-9a34-ae343a6b6430', NULL, 'UCSF Primary Care at China Basin', 'UCSF Health Primary Care at China Basin provides comprehensive primary care for children and adults, including preventive care, immunizations, same-day care for illnesses, and chronic disease management. The clinic is part of the nationally renowned UCSF Health system, offering seamless access to specialists and advanced online health tools. Located at 185 Berry Street in San Francisco, it serves the whole family with convenient same-day appointments and a patient-centered approach.', '185 Berry Street, San Francisco, CA 94107', 'San Francisco', 'CA', '94107', '415-514-4533', ARRAY['English', 'Chinese']::text[], 'Primary Care', TRUE, '{"images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/ucsf-primary-care-at-china-basin-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/ucsf-primary-care-at-china-basin-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/ucsf-primary-care-at-china-basin-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/ucsf-primary-care-at-china-basin-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/ucsf-primary-care-at-china-basin-google-5.webp"], "rating": 2.5, "reviews": [{"date": "2026-02-25T15:51:16.656230391Z", "text": "I had an awful experience at UCSF and I would caution everyone to be very careful of them. My wife and I waited years to get into their system. We finally were able to get appointments for a new primary care physician - Dr. Chloe Courchesne. As I was driving in, I got a notification that the meeting had switched to virtual. The doctor seemed nice and friendly, but my mom is an employee benefits lawyer, so I knew that I needed to be careful  about asking too many questions etc. I answered only the questions she asked, and the meeting lasted 20 minutes. A month later, I was double billed and apparently she is claiming the zoom call was not only a new patient on boarding, but also a checkup so now I have to pay hundreds of dollars out of pocket. What is very interesting is my wife was billed entirely differently for the exact same appointment, even same day. Having to try to communicate with anyone at UCSF to get answers about this bill has been impossible. They are essentially refusing to review. This has been incredibly stressful, and will have a lasting impact on my trust of doctors and the healthcare system.", "author": "Lindsay Rand", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112020000344945069023/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-12-12T20:43:09.757779022Z", "text": "I''ve been a patient here for years and can''t recommend them. They are EXTREMELY expensive, even given the currenttly astronomical prices for Healthcare.\n\nMultiple times I''ve been seen for an annual wellness exam, which is covered as part of my insurance, and when I honestly answered how I was doing, naming a few minor issues, they turned it into an extra billing event. A 10 minute appointment which should have been free cost over $500. No procedure, no meds, no imagining, just a basic exam and 5 minutes of discussion (call it 15 including the writeup, which was dictated automatically). How can they sleep at night charging so much? Most people cannot afford it, and I have \"good\" health insurance!\n\nOn top of that, appointments are generally booked weeks in advance. Telling patients to go to urgent care for routine issues is not a good way to run a \"world class\" clinic.", "author": "Will Tull", "rating": 2, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101301883227113529682/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-03-13T19:59:50.240421023Z", "text": "I had a very frustrating experience with this practice and will not be back.\n\nI went in for a preventative visit that should have been fully covered by my insurance, but it was miscoded and I was billed over $800. It took nearly a year and countless phone calls and emails to get the issue corrected, including receiving notices that the balance would be sent to collections. Reading other reviews, it looks like this exact issue has happened to others as well.\n\nI mentioned a medical condition I suspected I had. Dr. Obiora looked at me like I was nuts, dismissed the concern, suggesting it was essentially body dysmorphia. I have since been formally diagnosed with that condition - a progressive disorder that worsens the longer it goes undetected and I''m now scheduled for 2 surgeries to address.\n\nAfter Dr. Obiora left the practice, I was reassigned to a male doctor. I called because I’m not comfortable seeing a male physician and was told by the office manager that I had been reassigned to a female doctor and that MyChart would update. Later, when I tried to schedule, I was told I was still assigned to the male doctor and that I had missed some unspecified window to establish care with the female doctor I had been previous confirmed with.\n\nI asked to speak with the manager again and was told he would call me back that afternoon. He never did.", "author": "Kim", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101772578614686015608/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-01-30T03:55:05.601132959Z", "text": "If you don''t want to be charged unexpectedly, don''t come here. Got unexpectedly charged twice and had no way to get my money back.\n\nI went to this place check my ankle injury. In the scheduling phone call, I confirmed twice that the visit will be covered by my insurance and I won''t need to pay anything out of pocket. After the visit, they billed me $400+.\n\nMy partner went through a similar situation here for an annual check-up and also got charged unexpectedly.\n\nWhat kind of ridiculous institution is this?", "author": "Cheng-Wei Hu", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115636049446087921346/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-03-30T21:41:35.237793047Z", "text": "This clinic used to be great 5 years ago. Not anymore. Front desk check-in staff doesn’t want to work. They tell people to check-in on the tablet. The staff they hire are lazy and that’s evidence by how they dress. The front desk employee named Oliver has a septum piercing like an ox with a circle ring in nose. The medical assistants look dissatisfied with their job and the doctors run late and seem tired or a bit burnt out. If the doctors orders you anything like a bedside toilet, you will need to follow up with his medical assistant who will never call you. I’ve been going here for almost a decade and it seems like they have a high turnover around of employees.", "author": "Super Superman", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101630216769667217257/reviews"}], "website": "https://www.ucsfhealth.org/clinics/primary-care-at-china-basin", "location": {"latitude": 37.7765973, "longitude": -122.3919488}, "services": ["Annual exams (checkups)", "Preventive screenings", "Immunizations", "Acute illness or injury care", "Prenatal care", "Chronic disease management", "Health education"], "insurance": {"notes": null, "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": [], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": false}, "highlights": [{"title": "Same-day appointments", "detail": "Quick access appointments are available for urgent health needs.", "category": "convenience"}, {"title": "Online tools", "detail": "Use the patient portal to make appointments, refill medications, and view test results. Virtual PCP appointments are available at some clinics.", "category": "technology"}, {"title": "Seamless specialist referrals", "detail": "If you need specialty care, UCSF coordinates an appointment with a trusted expert.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Personalized family medicine", "detail": "The team sees people of all ages and walks of life, tailoring care to individual needs.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Convenient locations", "detail": "UCSF Health has multiple care clinics in the San Francisco Bay Area.", "category": "convenience"}, {"title": "Award-winning care", "detail": "UCSF Health is one of the nation''s top hospitals for patient care and safety, according to U.S. News & World Report''s annual rankings.", "category": "reviews"}], "price_tier": "$$", "source_url": "https://www.ucsfhealth.org/clinics/primary-care-at-china-basin", "appointment": {"booking_note": null, "appointment_url": "https://www.ucsfhealth.org/locations/primary-care-china-basin/appointment-detail", "new_patient_note": null, "phone_booking_available": true, "online_booking_available": true, "free_consultation_available": null}, "open_sunday": false, "scout_query": "Chinese primary care clinic in San Francisco, CA", "search_text": "primary care | family doctor | general practitioner | annual physical | checkup | bác sĩ gia đình | khám tổng quát | nội khoa | 내과 | 가정의학과 | 家庭医生 | 全科医生 | 内科 | english | chinese | mandarin | cantonese | 中文 | 普通话 | 国语 | 粤语 | 广东话 | 华人 | annual exams (checkups) | preventive screenings | immunizations | acute illness or injury care | prenatal care | chronic disease management | health education | preventive | emergency | elisa washburn, do | family medicine | julie jehnsen, np, msn | internal medicine | karen zhang, md | anthony mrgudich, md", "google_types": ["medical_clinic", "health", "point_of_interest", "establishment"], "open_weekend": false, "rating_count": 36, "team_members": [{"name": "Elisa Washburn, DO", "role": "Family Medicine", "bio_snippet": null, "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Julie Jehnsen, NP, MSN", "role": "Internal Medicine", "bio_snippet": null, "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Karen Zhang, MD", "role": "Family Medicine", "bio_snippet": null, "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Anthony Mrgudich, MD", "role": "Family Medicine", "bio_snippet": null, "languages_spoken": []}], "open_saturday": false, "quality_score": 95, "working_hours": {"friday": "8:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "monday": "8:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "sunday": "Closed", "tuesday": "8:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "saturday": "Closed", "thursday": "8:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "wednesday": "8:00 AM – 5:00 PM"}, "gallery_images": ["https://edge.sitecorecloud.io/ucsfhealth1487c-ucsfplatfor7e11-prod0cc0-65a9/media/project/valcore/live/ucsf/50-50-hero/image/primary-care-750x670.jpg?h=670&iar=0&w=750&f=webp", "https://edge.sitecorecloud.io/ucsfhealth1487c-ucsfplatfor7e11-prod0cc0-65a9/media/project/valcore/live/ucsf/50-50-hero/secondary-image/parnassus-290a-750x670.jpg?h=670&iar=0&w=750&f=webp", "https://providers.ucsfhealth.org/sparkle-assets/images/loc0000224626-34009-ba102b10659a59ae0d483063add28804.jpg"], "review_profile": {"rating": 2.5, "source": "google", "themes": [{"theme": "Billing Practices", "mentions": 4, "sentiment": "Negative", "summary_quote": "Multiple reviewers highlight unexpected and excessive billing, even for routine visits covered by insurance."}, {"theme": "Communication", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Negative", "summary_quote": "Patients report poor follow-up and difficulty resolving billing or medical issues, often requiring extensive effort."}, {"theme": "Clinical Expertise", "mentions": 2, "sentiment": "Negative", "summary_quote": "Some reviewers express concerns about dismissive or incorrect medical assessments by providers."}, {"theme": "Facility Environment", "mentions": 2, "sentiment": "Negative", "summary_quote": "Patients describe a decline in clinic atmosphere, citing unprofessional staff and high employee turnover."}, {"theme": "Appointment Management", "mentions": 2, "sentiment": "Negative", "summary_quote": "Reviewers note long wait times for appointments and a reliance on urgent care for routine issues."}], "summary": "Patients report significant dissatisfaction with UCSF Primary Care at China Basin, citing issues with billing practices, communication, and overall clinic management. Many express frustration with unexpected charges, poor follow-up, and declining service quality.", "review_count": 36, "concern_themes": [], "positive_themes": [], "featured_reviews": [{"date": "2026-02-25T15:51:16.656230391Z", "text": "I had an awful experience at UCSF and I would caution everyone to be very careful of them. My wife and I waited years to get into their system. We finally were able to get appointments for a new primary care physician - Dr. Chloe Courchesne. As I was driving in, I got a notification that the meeting had switched to virtual. The doctor seemed nice and friendly, but my mom is an employee benefits lawyer, so I knew that I needed to be careful  about asking too many questions etc. I answered only the questions she asked, and the meeting lasted 20 minutes. A month later, I was double billed and apparently she is claiming the zoom call was not only a new patient on boarding, but also a checkup so now I have to pay hundreds of dollars out of pocket. What is very interesting is my wife was billed entirely differently for the exact same appointment, even same day. Having to try to communicate with anyone at UCSF to get answers about this bill has been impossible. They are essentially refusing to review. This has been incredibly stressful, and will have a lasting impact on my trust of doctors and the healthcare system.", "author": "Lindsay Rand", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112020000344945069023/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-12-12T20:43:09.757779022Z", "text": "I''ve been a patient here for years and can''t recommend them. They are EXTREMELY expensive, even given the currenttly astronomical prices for Healthcare.\n\nMultiple times I''ve been seen for an annual wellness exam, which is covered as part of my insurance, and when I honestly answered how I was doing, naming a few minor issues, they turned it into an extra billing event. A 10 minute appointment which should have been free cost over $500. No procedure, no meds, no imagining, just a basic exam and 5 minutes of discussion (call it 15 including the writeup, which was dictated automatically). How can they sleep at night charging so much? Most people cannot afford it, and I have \"good\" health insurance!\n\nOn top of that, appointments are generally booked weeks in advance. Telling patients to go to urgent care for routine issues is not a good way to run a \"world class\" clinic.", "author": "Will Tull", "rating": 2, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101301883227113529682/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-03-13T19:59:50.240421023Z", "text": "I had a very frustrating experience with this practice and will not be back.\n\nI went in for a preventative visit that should have been fully covered by my insurance, but it was miscoded and I was billed over $800. It took nearly a year and countless phone calls and emails to get the issue corrected, including receiving notices that the balance would be sent to collections. Reading other reviews, it looks like this exact issue has happened to others as well.\n\nI mentioned a medical condition I suspected I had. Dr. Obiora looked at me like I was nuts, dismissed the concern, suggesting it was essentially body dysmorphia. I have since been formally diagnosed with that condition - a progressive disorder that worsens the longer it goes undetected and I''m now scheduled for 2 surgeries to address.\n\nAfter Dr. Obiora left the practice, I was reassigned to a male doctor. I called because I’m not comfortable seeing a male physician and was told by the office manager that I had been reassigned to a female doctor and that MyChart would update. Later, when I tried to schedule, I was told I was still assigned to the male doctor and that I had missed some unspecified window to establish care with the female doctor I had been previous confirmed with.\n\nI asked to speak with the manager again and was told he would call me back that afternoon. He never did.", "author": "Kim", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101772578614686015608/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-01-30T03:55:05.601132959Z", "text": "If you don''t want to be charged unexpectedly, don''t come here. Got unexpectedly charged twice and had no way to get my money back.\n\nI went to this place check my ankle injury. In the scheduling phone call, I confirmed twice that the visit will be covered by my insurance and I won''t need to pay anything out of pocket. After the visit, they billed me $400+.\n\nMy partner went through a similar situation here for an annual check-up and also got charged unexpectedly.\n\nWhat kind of ridiculous institution is this?", "author": "Cheng-Wei Hu", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115636049446087921346/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-03-30T21:41:35.237793047Z", "text": "This clinic used to be great 5 years ago. Not anymore. Front desk check-in staff doesn’t want to work. They tell people to check-in on the tablet. The staff they hire are lazy and that’s evidence by how they dress. The front desk employee named Oliver has a septum piercing like an ox with a circle ring in nose. The medical assistants look dissatisfied with their job and the doctors run late and seem tired or a bit burnt out. If the doctors orders you anything like a bedside toilet, you will need to follow up with his medical assistant who will never call you. I’ve been going here for almost a decade and it seems like they have a high turnover around of employees.", "author": "Super Superman", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101630216769667217257/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Patients report significant dissatisfaction with UCSF Primary Care at China Basin, citing issues with billing practices, communication, and overall clinic management. Many express frustration with unexpected charges, poor follow-up, and declining service quality.", "about_highlight": "UCSF Health Primary Care at China Basin provides comprehensive primary care for children and adults, including preventive care, immunizations, same-day care for illnesses, and chronic disease management. The clinic is part of the nationally renowned UCSF Health system, offering seamless access to specialists and advanced online health tools. Located at 185 Berry Street in San Francisco, it serves the whole family with convenient same-day appointments and a patient-centered approach.", "appointment_url": "https://www.ucsfhealth.org/locations/primary-care-china-basin/appointment-detail", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=1354451418271792477&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJ4Y6oPNd_j4ARXT2dg2P6yxI", "quality_missing": ["insurance"], "search_keywords": ["primary care", "family doctor", "general practitioner", "annual physical", "checkup", "bác sĩ gia đình", "khám tổng quát", "nội khoa", "내과", "가정의학과", "家庭医生", "全科医生", "内科", "english", "chinese", "mandarin", "cantonese", "中文", "普通话", "国语", "粤语", "广东话", "华人", "annual exams (checkups)", "preventive screenings", "immunizations", "acute illness or injury care", "prenatal care", "chronic disease management", "health education", "preventive", "emergency", "elisa washburn, do", "family medicine", "julie jehnsen, np, msn", "internal medicine", "karen zhang, md", "anthony mrgudich, md"], "services_offered": [{"name": "Annual exams (checkups)", "category": "Preventive", "description": "A yearly exam helps prevent illness and address health issues early. Includes health history review, lab tests, and discussion of concerns.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Preventive screenings", "category": "Preventive", "description": "Routine screenings for risk factors, and developmental screenings for children.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Immunizations", "category": "Preventive", "description": "Immunizations for influenza and other preventable diseases, including regular vaccinations for children.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Acute illness or injury care", "category": "Emergency", "description": "Same-day care when you''re not feeling your best, providing treatment to recover quickly.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Prenatal care", "category": "Primary Care", "description": "Family medicine doctors offer prenatal care to patients with low-risk pregnancies.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Chronic disease management", "category": "Primary Care", "description": "Support and education for chronic conditions such as diabetes or high blood pressure, including medication, diet, and lifestyle management.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Health education", "category": "Primary Care", "description": "Research-backed information and guidance for health care decisions.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}], "short_description": "UCSF Primary Care at China Basin offers family medicine, internal medicine, and preventive care with same-day appointments and seamless specialist referrals.", "google_website_url": "https://www.ucsfhealth.org/clinics/primary-care-at-china-basin", "google_primary_type": "Medical Clinic", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": ["Elisa Washburn, DO", "Julie Jehnsen, NP, MSN", "Karen Zhang, MD", "Anthony Mrgudich, MD"], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "185 Berry St Lobby 2, Suite 130, San Francisco, CA 94107, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/103384119494121246628", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX-n2l7htoXmgb8atieesGJfAwW3Xlqc_3uboFp0W6AcPLYNx1J=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "UCSF Primary Care at China Basin"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/103384119494121246628", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX-n2l7htoXmgb8atieesGJfAwW3Xlqc_3uboFp0W6AcPLYNx1J=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "UCSF Primary Care at China Basin"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/103384119494121246628", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX-n2l7htoXmgb8atieesGJfAwW3Xlqc_3uboFp0W6AcPLYNx1J=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "UCSF Primary Care at China Basin"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/103384119494121246628", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX-n2l7htoXmgb8atieesGJfAwW3Xlqc_3uboFp0W6AcPLYNx1J=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "UCSF Primary Care at China Basin"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/111763439123905232700", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWVtBtgj2dhQngtLsRKPj-tIeLq4f2mwRO2rCWGUBjyEYVB6Oc=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Albert Wu"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-26T12:41:28.559947+00:00', 'ucsf-primary-care-at-china-basin', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('dfa4bd76-66cb-4801-9804-5455ea418711', NULL, 'Acupuncture & Oriental Medical Center', 'Acupuncture & Oriental Medical Center is a healing center that treats a broad array of ailments and disorders by promoting overall well-being in order to achieve optimal health. Traditional Chinese medicine is utilized, combining acupuncture treatments, Chinese herbs, and Tui Na, a form of physical manipulation of the body by hands to facilitate healing. The clinic was awarded ''Acupuncture clinic best of Bellevue 2021'' by the US award.
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('6ccf0eb5-565f-4feb-b653-4709487f7354', NULL, 'CHA Hollywood Presbyterian Medical Center', 'CHA Hollywood Presbyterian Medical Center (CHA HPMC) is a full-service, acute care hospital in Los Angeles, California, and part of the CHA global network. Committed to providing a full spectrum of dynamic healthcare services, CHA HPMC serves the diverse Hollywood and greater Los Angeles communities with a focus on patient safety, clinical excellence, and culturally responsive care.
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('e217af51-6749-4d9b-8ded-9640b83b1efd', NULL, 'Great Care Dental', 'Great Care Dental (大愛牙醫) provides comprehensive family, restorative, cosmetic, and emergency dentistry in the heart of San Jose, CA. Led by Dr. Andrew Lee, the clinic combines over 30 years of clinical experience with modern 3D digital imaging and microscope-assisted restorative care.
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('aa5a6673-080b-4d25-98a9-58b729006f19', NULL, 'K-TOWN DENTIST 닥터설 young hahn', 'K-TOWN DENTIST, led by Dr. Luke Sul, DDS, is a trusted dental practice located in the heart of Koreatown, Los Angeles. With over 30 years of professional experience and a degree from UCLA School of Dentistry (2006, cum laude), Dr. Sul combines modern technology with state-of-the-art expertise. The clinic is dedicated to providing affordable and reliable dental care, emphasizing patient trust and comfort.', '928 S Western Ave #231, Los Angeles, California 90006, United States', 'Los Angeles', 'CA', '90006', '(213) 214-2875', ARRAY['English', 'Korean']::text[], 'Dental', FALSE, '{"images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/k-town-dentist-young-hahn-google-1.webp"], "rating": 3.4, "pricing": [{"name": "X-Ray & Exam", "notes": null, "price": "$120", "category": "Exam", "price_range": null}, {"name": "Hiossen Implant (Crown Included)", "notes": "Crown included in price.", "price": "$1500", "category": "Implant", "price_range": null}], "reviews": [{"date": "2025-06-17T21:42:59.389631919Z", "text": "Dr Luke is very professional, nice and did a good job on all my implants and crowns. All the staff are very nice, especially Hyunjoo Chang is very good in explaining to me in details what is the best way to be done for my teeth and how much the insurance company will pay. I like her attitude and approach to the customers. She is very focused in getting a better care for patients.", "author": "kimchi nguyen", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101474332164468388624/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-04-15T17:54:34.206376Z", "text": "The office is really beautiful and clean. The staffs were nice and welcoming. Amazing service and Dr. Sul was very thorough and had skillful hands. You can tell they care about their patient. Highly recommend!!", "author": "박시은", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113050108500557757867/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-04-15T00:47:52.381209Z", "text": "I had my first implant here and it feels amazing. During the surgery, I didn’t feel a single pain. He is very quick with his hands and kind to all of his patients. Thank you DDS Sul for this terrific job!", "author": "Lawrence Sul", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114194331582909597026/reviews"}, {"date": "2023-08-13T20:06:41.763282Z", "text": "Quick, straightforward, and affordable. The doctors and staff are  also the most thoughtful and aware of your teeth if you''re a long-time client. I''ve been here maybe 5 times in the span of 3 years and the doctor noticed a small chip in my implant when I came in for a problem in the complete opposite area of the tooth that I originally came in for.\n\nCome in after you''ve done your own research and only expect about 5 minutes to ask your questions. This office is super busy to be able to provide such a high quality of service at an affordable price.", "author": "J K", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103996885200890808944/reviews"}, {"date": "2024-09-10T14:03:56.351960Z", "text": "They lie and cheat....\nI had implant, the doctor told me to come back to fallow up. So I came back 3 months later to check. One of doctor told me the implant need to befixed. she shows me the chart that is under warranty. But they charged.", "author": "Angie Yun", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105369074835138962605/reviews"}], "website": "https://ktowndentist.com/", "location": {"latitude": 34.0551603, "longitude":