55:54.703403842Z", "text": "***Update*** I received a call from the Office Manager who apologized for my experience. We were able to talk things out and so happy that I received a called to rectify this situation. I hope Dr Cung sees this review and addresses the feedback with his staff. I called Dr. Cung''s office to setup a new patient appointment. I received the answering service and left a message. I never received a call back, so two days later, I called the office again and a gentleman answered. I provided my information thinking I was scheduling an appointment and the gentleman said he would provide my information to the scheduling team and someone will call me back to setup an appointment. Days go by and no one called. So, I called again and a woman answered the phone. She requested that I send the insurance cards via email to validate insurance. I asked her if there was a secure site they could be uploaded to since one of the insurance cards included the social security number. She said no, office policy is to email them. I asked if I could provide the primary insurance via email and the secondary at the time of my appointment since it included a social security number. She said she needed to ask her office manager and would call me back. It''s been over a week and I still have not received a call back. I am disgusted with this staff. I hope they improved their communication.", "author": "Casandra Winbush", "rating": 4, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114743095576068061581/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-01-29T14:55:19.251565Z", "text": "Dr. Tam Cung is the best doctor I’ve seen in my 12 years in the U.S.! He is very knowledgeable, explains everything clearly, and even used the internet to show me exactly which ligaments were affected. Super friendly and attentive. His secretary is also amazing—Amanda Rodriguez managed to fit me into the schedule quickly. Highly recommend!", "author": "Jose Augusto Rizental", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113951058773491402225/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Aria Medical Primary Care Dr Tam Cung has a 4.8 star Google rating from 25 Google reviews. Patients commonly mention compassionate care, friendly staff, clear explanations, comfortable visits.", "about_highlight": "Dr. Cung is a primary care physician with more than 10 years of experience. Seeing many older adult patients in nursing, rehab, and assisted living where illness could have been prevented, he opened an outpatient clinic focused on preventative care and reducing medication reliance. His team cares for the entire family, from children to grandparents, and helps patients navigate the complex healthcare system. With a philosophy rooted in food as medicine, minimal medication, and holistic well-being, Dr. Cung and his staff are committed to helping patients live happy and healthy lives.", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=16308131953113948023&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJj7toJigVTIYRd9-Nb5sfUuI", "quality_missing": ["insurance", "appointment_url"], "search_keywords": ["primary care", "family doctor", "general practitioner", "annual physical", "checkup", "bác sĩ gia đình", "khám tổng quát", "nội khoa", "내과", "가정의학과", "家庭医生", "全科医生", "内科", "english", "vietnamese", "tiếng việt", "người việt", "bác sĩ việt", "preventative care", "healthcare navigation", "preventive", "dr. tam cung", "primary care physician"], "cultural_context": "The clinic''s staff speaks English and Vietnamese, and the website includes a Vietnamese greeting (''Xin Chào!''), indicating culturally responsive care for the Vietnamese-speaking community.", "services_offered": [{"name": "Primary Care", "category": "Primary Care", "description": "Comprehensive primary care services for patients of all ages, from children to grandparents.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Whole family"}, {"name": "Preventative Care", "category": "Preventive", "description": "Focus on preventing illness through lifestyle and early intervention, with the goal of reducing medication dependence.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients of all ages seeking to prevent chronic disease"}, {"name": "Healthcare Navigation", "category": "Primary Care", "description": "Helping patients navigate the complex healthcare system.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "All patients"}], "short_description": "A primary care clinic focused on preventative, holistic care for the whole family, led by Dr. Tam Cung with over a decade of experience.", "google_website_url": "http://www.ariamedicalclinic.com/", "google_primary_type": "Medical Clinic", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": ["Dr. Tam Cung"], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "3951 Alma Rd Ste 402, McKinney, TX 75070, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/109897301421025167718", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXLX0WU9s4YFEfcQNG7Qdhy7yME5VW8gEXOepgdf-ytzIiGOTfj=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Nhât-Tâm Cung"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/105389679698014965616", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLQin3uAHiDsybZnMFMWHtSipAo_TbNFHJl3dUnKP_YCiNDkQ=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Aria Medical Primary Care Dr Tam Cung"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/105389679698014965616", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLQin3uAHiDsybZnMFMWHtSipAo_TbNFHJl3dUnKP_YCiNDkQ=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Aria Medical Primary Care Dr Tam Cung"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/105389679698014965616", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLQin3uAHiDsybZnMFMWHtSipAo_TbNFHJl3dUnKP_YCiNDkQ=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Aria Medical Primary Care Dr Tam Cung"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/105389679698014965616", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLQin3uAHiDsybZnMFMWHtSipAo_TbNFHJl3dUnKP_YCiNDkQ=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Aria Medical Primary Care Dr Tam Cung"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-26T11:05:03.853832+00:00', 'aria-medical-primary-care-dr-tam-cung', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('62d7dac2-93f1-4613-9ef5-9cee27e5058a', NULL, 'Hillman City Medical', 'Hillman City Medical is a primary care practice founded by three siblings—Dr. Dang Do (D.O.), Dr. Thuy Do (M.D.), and Dr. Dang Do (M.D.)—who combine modern medicine with a holistic approach to improve patient care. The clinic is dedicated to serving patients of all backgrounds and cultures, offering accessible healthcare with same-day appointments, medical weight management, skin care consultations, and regenerative medicine. Whether seeking treatment for complicated ailments or guidance on weight loss, patients can expect a warm, non-judgmental, and collaborative relationship with their doctors.', '3828 S Graham St Suite A, Seattle, WA 98118', 'Seattle', 'WA', '98118', '(206) 480-7677', ARRAY['English', 'Vietnamese']::text[], 'Primary Care', TRUE, '{"fax": "(206) 267-3450", "images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/hillman-city-medical-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/hillman-city-medical-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/hillman-city-medical-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/hillman-city-medical-google-4.webp"], "rating": 4.2, "reviews": [{"date": "2026-05-14T02:36:19.784305179Z", "text": "When bringing my daughter to appointment for birth control she had been bleeding for 2 months. My daughter after the medicine was given Medroxyproges, teron 150 mg date was Feb 2026 .\nShe has been pale and she has been to the doctors. When calling this establishment, I wanted to speak to the female doctor that was supposed to originally be there for my daughter''s appointment and she was not there so we ended up getting DR Dang DO. First off he is not a good doctor and on top of that he told me to sue the company because I wanted to express my frustrations about my daughter being pale.\n\nI called for 2 weeks about my daughter, and no one responded until i finally came a month and half later. When I went in, I spoke with one the receptionists and she tried to explain, and I need an Expert not a receptionist. They made me another appointment to check lily and the second time coming there he just listened an did not help and told me and my daughter to go home and figure it out. I am making this complaint because I am scared for this to happen to another person who has a child who is autistic and not verbal.\n\nFor this doctor to treat us like this, is alarming and I want to make sure that this is corrected. Today I am taking my daughter to Lakeview emergency center. My family, her teachers are worried she been out of school for a month and has been bleeding to where I need to check. If today I find out something is wrong, then I will do exactly that and get my lawyers to sue .\nJust like MR. Dang DO tell me other than being professional and actually helping my daughter lily n.", "author": "Celine Nguyen", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114594320023837544679/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-05-03T20:58:39.516722Z", "text": "If I could give 100 stars I would! My family and I have been under Dr Thuy Do''s care for over 13 years. I moved away and specifically looked for her once I came back. She is the most caring Doctor, she listens to your concerns and she tries to get to the root cause. She is the only Doctor that I have ever had, that I feel, treats you like family! She cares about her patients, she cares about our well being, and most of all, she is very very knowledgeable. If she feels a specialist needs to be involved, she will happily refer you.\nThe front desk staff is always nice, and Amy is amazing. She is so thorough and really goes to bat for you when having to deal with insurance companies. I highly recommend this clinic for your whole family. They care about you as a person, they are prompt with their services and always welcoming.", "author": "Jackie Smith", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115985366426887296379/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-02-10T04:12:16.940624Z", "text": "I don''t know why someone reviewed bad, but for me this one is good, they treated me and my family very well and respected. Good point is they''re siblings,  that''s mean you alway have any doctor in charge,  you don''t worry the clinic  closes for doctor''s vacations.....\nOne more,  the clinic is good connection with Sy pharmacy,  when doctor send any prescription,  you can get your medicines right away next door.....5 stars for sure.", "author": "Luy Nguyen", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106655059046648594326/reviews"}, {"date": "2024-04-26T17:01:36.361417Z", "text": "Dr. Thuy Do was incredibly attentive, kind, validating, and took time to listen to my concerns. She treated me with trust and respect when I told her about a past negative medical experience and she responded with personalized recommendations that fit my needs. She also talked to me about taking full advantage of various insurance benefits I have but didn’t know I could use. I would highly recommend her care.", "author": "Rachel Kennedy", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101349678057585362477/reviews"}, {"date": "2024-06-23T04:10:15.496723Z", "text": "My experience here has been pretty terrible. The front desk people and doctors are always nice and polite, but that''s the only good thing about this place. I was having serious insomnia for a while, when I brought it up to Dr Thuy Do, she just brushed it off and said there''s nothing that can help me stay asleep and just eat some food with protein before bed like avocados...\n\nAnd then another time when I tested positive, no one from the office bothered to call me. I only found out a few days later when I heard from the pharmacy that they got me meds...I also didn''t get any email notification from their online system.\n\nDuring my last visit, I had my Pap test done by an intern (tbh not even sure if she was qualified to perform this?) and she messed up the process. My results came back inconclusive as there was too much lubricant....Again, no one from the office bothered to notify me. I found out a year later when I went to a new doctor who looked at my previous records. Needless to say he was surprised that no one mentioned any of this to me....\n\nIf you want reliable doctors, please stay away from this place.", "author": "J", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116996968023857420619/reviews"}], "website": "https://www.hillmancitymedical.com/", "location": {"latitude": 47.5463883, "longitude": -122.28445850000001}, "services": ["Primary Care", "Medical Weight Management", "Skin Care Consultation", "Regenerative Medicine", "Virtual Appointments"], "insurance": {"notes": "Insurance information is available on the Insurance page. Direct Medicare is also mentioned as a separate page.", "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": true, "accepted_networks": ["Medicare"], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": false}, "highlights": [{"title": "Bilingual Staff", "detail": "The clinic offers services in English and Tiếng Việt, ensuring language access for Vietnamese-speaking patients.", "category": "culture"}, {"title": "Same-day appointments", "detail": "Hillman City Medical provides accessible primary care with same-day appointments available.", "category": "convenience"}, {"title": "Virtual Appointments", "detail": "During COVID-19 isolation protocol, they offer virtual appointments by phone or video (FaceTime, Zoom).", "category": "access"}, {"title": "Medical Weight Management", "detail": "Dr. Thuy Do has over 10 years of experience helping patients manage their weight through personalized plans.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Sibling-Led Team", "detail": "The clinic is run by three sibling doctors who combine modern medicine with a holistic approach.", "category": "reviews"}], "price_tier": "$$", "source_url": "https://www.hillmancitymedical.com/", "appointment": {"booking_note": null, "appointment_url": "https://www.hillmancitymedical.com/contact", "new_patient_note": null, "phone_booking_available": false, "online_booking_available": false, "free_consultation_available": null}, "open_sunday": false, "scout_query": "Vietnamese speaking medical clinic in Seattle, WA", "search_text": "primary care | family doctor | general practitioner | annual physical | checkup | bác sĩ gia đình | khám tổng quát | nội khoa | 내과 | 가정의학과 | 家庭医生 | 全科医生 | 内科 | english | vietnamese | tiếng việt | người việt | bác sĩ việt | medical weight management | skin care consultation | regenerative medicine | virtual appointments | cosmetic | medicare | dr. dang do, d.o. | physician | dr. thuy do, m.d. | dr. dang do, m.d.", "google_types": ["medical_clinic", "doctor", "health", "point_of_interest", "establishment"], "open_weekend": true, "rating_count": 41, "team_members": [{"name": "Dr. Dang Do, D.O.", "role": "Physician", "bio_snippet": "Co-founder of Hillman City Medical, combining modern medicine with a holistic approach.", "languages_spoken": ["English", "Vietnamese"]}, {"name": "Dr. Thuy Do, M.D.", "role": "Physician", "bio_snippet": "Co-founder of Hillman City Medical, with over 10 years of experience in medical weight management and a special interest in cosmetic dermatology.", "languages_spoken": ["E