r had, that I feel, treats you like family! She cares about her patients, she cares about our well being, and most of all, she is very very knowledgeable. If she feels a specialist needs to be involved, she will happily refer you.\nThe front desk staff is always nice, and Amy is amazing. She is so thorough and really goes to bat for you when having to deal with insurance companies. I highly recommend this clinic for your whole family. They care about you as a person, they are prompt with their services and always welcoming.", "author": "Jackie Smith", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115985366426887296379/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-02-10T04:12:16.940624Z", "text": "I don''t know why someone reviewed bad, but for me this one is good, they treated me and my family very well and respected. Good point is they''re siblings,  that''s mean you alway have any doctor in charge,  you don''t worry the clinic  closes for doctor''s vacations.....\nOne more,  the clinic is good connection with Sy pharmacy,  when doctor send any prescription,  you can get your medicines right away next door.....5 stars for sure.", "author": "Luy Nguyen", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106655059046648594326/reviews"}, {"date": "2024-04-26T17:01:36.361417Z", "text": "Dr. Thuy Do was incredibly attentive, kind, validating, and took time to listen to my concerns. She treated me with trust and respect when I told her about a past negative medical experience and she responded with personalized recommendations that fit my needs. She also talked to me about taking full advantage of various insurance benefits I have but didn’t know I could use. I would highly recommend her care.", "author": "Rachel Kennedy", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101349678057585362477/reviews"}, {"date": "2024-06-23T04:10:15.496723Z", "text": "My experience here has been pretty terrible. The front desk people and doctors are always nice and polite, but that''s the only good thing about this place. I was having serious insomnia for a while, when I brought it up to Dr Thuy Do, she just brushed it off and said there''s nothing that can help me stay asleep and just eat some food with protein before bed like avocados...\n\nAnd then another time when I tested positive, no one from the office bothered to call me. I only found out a few days later when I heard from the pharmacy that they got me meds...I also didn''t get any email notification from their online system.\n\nDuring my last visit, I had my Pap test done by an intern (tbh not even sure if she was qualified to perform this?) and she messed up the process. My results came back inconclusive as there was too much lubricant....Again, no one from the office bothered to notify me. I found out a year later when I went to a new doctor who looked at my previous records. Needless to say he was surprised that no one mentioned any of this to me....\n\nIf you want reliable doctors, please stay away from this place.", "author": "J", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116996968023857420619/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Hillman City Medical has a 4.2 star Google rating from 41 Google reviews. Patients commonly mention compassionate care, friendly staff, clear explanations, strong results.", "about_highlight": "Hillman City Medical is a primary care practice founded by three siblings—Dr. Dang Do (D.O.), Dr. Thuy Do (M.D.), and Dr. Dang Do (M.D.)—who combine modern medicine with a holistic approach to improve patient care. The clinic is dedicated to serving patients of all backgrounds and cultures, offering accessible healthcare with same-day appointments, medical weight management, skin care consultations, and regenerative medicine. Whether seeking treatment for complicated ailments or guidance on weight loss, patients can expect a warm, non-judgmental, and collaborative relationship with their doctors.", "appointment_url": "https://www.hillmancitymedical.com/contact", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=2667806542554940148&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJO0zavwpBkFQR9EJzcurzBSU", "quality_missing": [], "search_keywords": ["primary care", "family doctor", "general practitioner", "annual physical", "checkup", "bác sĩ gia đình", "khám tổng quát", "nội khoa", "내과", "가정의학과", "家庭医生", "全科医生", "内科", "english", "vietnamese", "tiếng việt", "người việt", "bác sĩ việt", "medical weight management", "skin care consultation", "regenerative medicine", "virtual appointments", "cosmetic", "medicare", "dr. dang do, d.o.", "physician", "dr. thuy do, m.d.", "dr. dang do, m.d."], "cultural_context": "The clinic is founded by Vietnamese-American sibling doctors and offers bilingual services in English and Tiếng Việt, reflecting a commitment to culturally responsive care for Vietnamese and immigrant communities in Seattle.", "services_offered": [{"name": "Primary Care", "category": "Primary Care", "description": "Accessible primary care with same-day appointments available.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients of all backgrounds seeking comprehensive healthcare."}, {"name": "Medical Weight Management", "category": "Primary Care", "description": "Dr. Thuy Do has been helping patients manage their weight for over 10 years. Initial consultation to identify underlying causes of obesity and work together to reach and maintain goal weight with diet, exercise, and prescribed medications.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients seeking weight loss or weight management."}, {"name": "Skin Care Consultation", "category": "Cosmetic", "description": "Dr. Thuy Do has special interest in cosmetic dermatology. See her for consultation for acne, melasma, hair loss, eczema, and anti-aging.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients with skin concerns or cosmetic dermatology needs."}, {"name": "Regenerative Medicine", "category": "Primary Care", "description": "Platelet-rich plasma (PRP) injections for hair loss, combined with micro-needling for skin healing, or joint injections to treat arthritis conditions.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients interested in regenerative treatments for hair loss, skin healing, or arthritis."}, {"name": "Virtual Appointments", "category": "Primary Care", "description": "During COVID-19 isolation protocol, visits are offered by phone or video chat such as FaceTime or Zoom, billed through insurances as normal visits.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients who need remote care during isolation."}], "short_description": "Comprehensive, accessible primary care for the whole family, with same-day appointments and a multilingual team.", "google_website_url": "https://www.hillmancitymedical.com/", "insurance_accepted": ["Medicare"], "google_primary_type": "Medical Clinic", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": ["Dr. Dang Do, D.O.", "Dr. Thuy Do, M.D.", "Dr. Dang Do, M.D."], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "3828 S Graham St Ste a, Seattle, WA 98118, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/106309386228740787350", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIeFUyC0E6kcgpBsk7EtbJrJqa7YqhyGCXz-o3R5WtC4qIgYw=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Hillman City Medical"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/102246971880433728618", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ7pyT1GTyh8oy7wbvCooVqM5OQdZB6tBaPEEqGStEx7sm_ow=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Dang Do"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/102246971880433728618", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ7pyT1GTyh8oy7wbvCooVqM5OQdZB6tBaPEEqG