my C-section delivery, Dr. Bui, Dr. Christie and the medical team made me feel calm and well cared for, and I am truly grateful for the safe delivery of my baby. Their expertise, kindness, and dedication gave me confidence every step of the way. I highly recommend Dr. Bui and Dr. Christie to anyone looking for an experienced and caring OB-GYN.", "author": "Thu Nguyen", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115955382472682926417/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-14T01:25:50.130251986Z", "text": "Dr. Christie is truly one of the best doctors I’ve ever had. She is knowledgeable, thorough, and incredibly good at what she does - but what really sets her apart is how human she is. She’s warm, hilarious, and makes appointments feel so much less intimidating.\n\nI’ve had a complicated women’s health journey, and she has always taken me seriously, listened carefully, and treated me with respect and compassion. I trust her completely, which is not something I say lightly.\n\nIf you’re looking for an OB-GYN who is both clinically excellent and genuinely cares, she is it. I’m so grateful to be her patient.", "author": "Jenna", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118171225796543990609/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-13T02:48:38.994206825Z", "text": "dr bui is amazing at making you feel comfortable and always seems to be able to distract you from what she''s doing, shes amazing!", "author": "m f", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112011095835954951185/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-11-05T05:26:30.609657773Z", "text": "Worst office i have ever been to. Gotten a call about my test results and was told a lie. Had given me misinformation. Very inaccurate and now no one knows wth is going on. Called numerous (11) times and call was ignored. Called from another number and they answered. These ppl are a joke and they arent on one accord at all! I would stay far away. My refund better be issued to me ASAP. On top of all that calling i did, and complaints that were made. Management still has not contacted me to rectify the situation or address my concerns. My biggest mistake was not recording the Call when I was given wrong info. You can get sued for giving ppl wrong info, im staying on top of this one real tough. You ppl suck!", "author": "Shereika Thompson", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111725988155400444355/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-04-17T03:16:43.636614Z", "text": "Dr. Alexandra Christie / Dr. Bui is excellent.\nDr. Christie was our primary doctor.\nThey provided helpful insight throughout our pregnancy as we had a lot of novice questions as we were first time parents.\n\nThe fact that we were able to pull off a baby delivery naturally with zero complications in a newly settled city with no one to help us still amazes me. A lot of   that credit goes to those doctors", "author": "Praful Premadas", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117144174634535793208/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Southwest WomanCare OBGYN has a 4.8 star Google rating from 984 Google reviews. Patients commonly mention compassionate care, friendly staff, clear explanations, comfortable visits.", "about_highlight": "Southwest WomanCare OBGYN is a comprehensive women''s health clinic located in Houston, TX, offering obstetrics and gynecology services for women of all ages. The team of expert practitioners provides caring expertise that patients can trust, involving them in every step of their health care. Services include well-woman exams, STD testing, modern birth control options, and pregnancy care—from routine to high-risk—to ensure healthy pregnancies and easy deliveries. The clinic is dedicated to excellent care for women at every stage of life, from adolescence through menopause.", "appointment_url": "http://www.swwobgyn.com/contact/", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=14906207974421635102&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJtUPT6ovCQIYRHiB_Hy193c4", "quality_missing": ["insurance", "team_members"], "search_keywords": ["ob/gyn", "obgyn", "obstetrics", "gynecology", "women''s health", "prenatal", "pregnancy", "sản phụ khoa", "bác sĩ sản", "khám thai", "산부인과", "여성병원", "妇产科", "产科", "english", "vietnamese", "tiếng việt", "người việt", "bác sĩ việt", "polycystic ovarian syndrome", "birth control", "pap smears", "std testing", "fibroids", "menopause", "adolescent and teenage care"], "services_offered": [{"name": "Polycystic Ovarian Syndrome", "category": "Gynecology", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Birth Control", "category": "Gynecology", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Pap Smears", "category": "Gynecology", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Pregnancy", "category": "Obstetrics", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "STD Testing", "category": "Gynecology", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Fibroids", "category": "Gynecology", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Menopause", "category": "Gynecology", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Adolescent and Teenage Care", "category": "Gynecology", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}], "short_description": "Comprehensive women''s health clinic in Houston, TX, offering obstetrics and gynecology services for women of all ages.", "google_website_url": "http://www.swwobgyn.com/", "google_primary_type": "Medical Clinic", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": [], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "7789 Southwest Fwy #400, Houston, TX 77074, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/109103661910734416274", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXsP4zluGwTqBFNGgM-R7EUAiR1avqcdNzhca6kgZWZarHcehz_=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Southwest WomanCare OBGYN"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/109103661910734416274", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXsP4zluGwTqBFNGgM-R7EUAiR1avqcdNzhca6kgZWZarHcehz_=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Southwest WomanCare OBGYN"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/109103661910734416274", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXsP4zluGwTqBFNGgM-R7EUAiR1avqcdNzhca6kgZWZarHcehz_=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Southwest WomanCare OBGYN"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/109103661910734416274", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXsP4zluGwTqBFNGgM-R7EUAiR1avqcdNzhca6kgZWZarHcehz_=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Southwest WomanCare OBGYN"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/109103661910734416274", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXsP4zluGwTqBFNGgM-R7EUAiR1avqcdNzhca6kgZWZarHcehz_=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Southwest WomanCare OBGYN"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-26T13:06:13.276978+00:00', 'southwest-womancare-obgyn', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('4e2803c6-09c8-4edf-b179-26a2a52f2a31', NULL, 'Dallas Medical Center', 'Dallas Medical Center (DMC) has proudly served the North Dallas community as the only hospital in Farmers Branch. The physical, emotional, and spiritual well-being of our patients is our top priority, keeping us committed to providing comprehensive medical services that you and your family can trust. Our facility offers a wide range of health services for both acute and emergency situations, including a Geriatric-Accredited Emergency Department recognized for excellence in specialized care for older adults. As a Level IV Trauma Center, you can rely on us when you need help the most. We also offer FastTrackCare to reserve your ER arrival time, same-day primary care with walk-ins welcome, and advanced treatments like the TULSA procedure for prostate cancer. Our commitment to quality is reflected in numerous awards, including Leapfrog Hospital Safety Grade A and Healthgrades Patient Safety Excellence Awards.', '7 Medical Parkway', 'Dallas', 'TX', '75234', '972-888-7000', ARRAY['English', 'Vietnamese']::text[], 'Hospital', FALSE, '{"images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/dallas-medical-center-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/dallas-medical-center-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/dallas-medical-center-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/dallas-medical-center-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/dallas-medical-center-google-5.webp"], "rating": 3.9, "pricing": [{"name": "Cardiac Calcium Screening", "notes": "No needles involved. Helps identify early stages of heart disease.", "price": "$59", "category": "screening", "price_range": null}], "reviews": [{"date": "2026-04-20T17:05:12.253918853Z", "text": "I had a very positive experience with the Radiology department at Dallas Medical Center.\n\nI initially found them through MDsave because of their affordable pricing, but what stood out is that this is a full-service hospital setting—not just a standalone imaging center. That gave me much more confidence in the quality of care.\n\nThe staff were consistently polite, courteous, and genuinely helpful throughout the process. Scheduling, check-in, and the scan itself were all smooth and professional.\n\nWhat impressed me most was the follow-up. I needed some additional clarification in my report, and both the staff and radiologists responded quickly by issuing an addendum in a timely manner. That level of responsiveness is especially important when you’re paying out of pocket rather than going through insurance.\n\nOverall, a great combination of affordability, professionalism, and quality care. I would definitely recommend their radiology services.", "author": "Ash", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110381922391800820183/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-06-04T16:10:01.416770440Z", "text": "Brought my dad down to Dallas from North Dakota for a latest technology Tulsa Procedure.  I have spent alot of time in hospitals and have never experienced such amazing concierge type service before. From check in, to radiology, to the procedure we were cared for each step of the way. Your staff is amazing.", "author": "Debbie Sotebeer", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115939716040376047484/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-20T22:25:14.999448710Z", "text": "Where to start....first I felt very rushed. I explained to the Anesthesiologist I was hard to knock out and keep down. He said he had this....he didn''t.  I woke up and he told me go back to sleep. It took a few seconds and the pain hit and I screamed. He said \" I told you to go back to sleep.\" I also bit through my tongue because he used the wrong size bite block so he said to my family. He never came to talk to me at all. That was fun. I had major spinal surgery from top to bottom.\n\nThen I screamed for over an hour while my family had to hear me as they could not get the pain pump to work. They went through 3. It was by far the worst experience.  The nurses were amazing and the only saving grace most of all when I had to pay 5k out of pocket for pure hell. If I could leave less stars.... I would.", "author": "Michelle Pool", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106775548658666613553/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-06-02T12:13:15.027310618Z", "text": "Don''t go here for emergency care. Even if you''re crying in pain, you will first need to do a full front desk intake before they will even see you. They are obviously short staffed and do not see the patient priority. Staff was rude and inconsiderate of the pain the patient is in. If you could go ANYWHERE else please do so. I had to get in and out of the wheelchair and bed with no help from any of the nurses. The rude lady doing the intake pretty much told us if we didn''t like it we could go somewhere else. When we were waiting to get dispatched another person was brought by ambulance, we could hear the way the staff were talking to them and its just unbelievable how much the staff lacks sympathy for patients in pain. In the end they never came back to discharge us. Worst experience I''ve ever had at an emergency room.", "author": "Maria Rizo", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100898837875486074604/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-09T12:30:54.585539225Z", "text": "Visited the Emergency room at Dallas Medical Center as a walk-in one morning after scratching my eye. Very professional group. Not much of a wait the morning I visited. Was walked back to a room just as I finished the check in paperwork. The nurses were great. Doctor Timm was my doc. Good guy. Nice to know they''re there if I ever need them again. Thanks again guys.", "author": "Cordell", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114569315780308069781/reviews"}], "website": "https://dallasmedcenter.com/", "location": {"latitude": 32.915449599999995, "longitude": -96.869513}, "services": ["Emergency Services", "Primary Care", "Cardiology Services", "Cardiac Rehabilitation", "Surgical Services", "Wound Care", "Rehabilitation", "Urology"], "insurance": {"notes": "Financial assistance and Affordable Care Act insurance information available. Price transparency page and MDsave are offered. CareCredit is accepted for healthcare expenses.", "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": [], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": false}, "highlights": [{"title": "Geriatric-Accredited Emergency Department", "detail": "Recognized for excellence in specialized care for older adults by the American College of Emergency Physicians.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "FastTrackCare ER Reservation", "detail": "Reserve your ER arrival time online or by phone/text to wait at home until your time to be seen.", "category": "convenience"}, {"title": "Same-Day Primary Care", "detail": "Same day primary care available and walk-ins are welcome at two convenient locations.", "category": "access"}, {"title": "Cardiac Calcium Screening for $59", "detail": "A cardiac calcium screening can help identify early stages of heart disease with no needles, only $59.", "category": "pricing"}, {"title": "Leapfrog Hospital Safety Grade A", "detail": "Dallas Medical Center has received an ''A'' grade from The Leapfrog Group for hospital safety.", "category": "reviews"}, {"title": "Patient Safety Excellence Award", "detail": "Multiple Healthgrades Patient Safety Excellence Awards, including 2022, 2023, and 2024.", "category": "reviews"}, {"title": "Advanced Prostate Cancer Treatment", "detail": "Discover the TULSA procedure—a minimally invasive treatment for prostate cancer that gets you home the same day.", "category": "care"}], "price_tier": "$$", "source_url": "https://dallasmedcenter.com/", "appointment": {"booking_note": "Reserve your ER arrival time via FastTrackCare online or by phone/text at (972) 779-9481.", "appointment_url": "https://providers.dallasmedcenter.com/en/find-a-provider", "new_patient_note": null, "phone_booking_available": true, "online_booking_available": true, "free_consultation_available": null}, "open_sunday": true, "scout_query": "Vietnamese speaking hospital in Dallas, TX", "search_text": "hospital | english | vietnamese | tiếng việt | người việt | bác sĩ việt | emergency services | primary care | cardiology services | cardiac rehabilitation | surgical services | wound care | rehabilitation | urology | emergency | cardiology | surgical | specialty | dr. frasier | physician | alvin david | staff | kristen | nurse | tammy | bonnie | destiny | registration staff | esther | tracy | mariana | mildred | tammy (mammogram) | mammography technician", "google_types": ["medical_center", "medical_clinic", "hospital", "doctor", "health", "point_of_interest", "service", "establishment"], "open_weekend": true, "rating_count": 906, "team_members": [{"name": "Dr. Frasier", "role": "Physician", "bio_snippet": "Provided excellent care with thoroughness and excellent bedside manners according to patient testimonial.", "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Alvin David", "role": "Staff", "bio_snippet": "Made sure patient was very comfortable according to patient testimonial.", "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Kristen", "role": "Nurse", "bio_snippet": "Sweet nurse recognized in patient testimonial.", "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Tammy", "role": "Staff", "bio_snippet": "Performed scan efficiently and explained every step of the process according to patient testimonial.", "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Bonnie", "role": "Staff", "bio_snippet": "Professional and compassionate during radiology experience according to patient testimonial.", "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Destiny", "role": "Registration Staff", "bio_snippet": "Provided professional registration according to patient testimonial.", "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Esther", "role": "Staff", "bio_snippet": "Able to set IV on first try with little discomfort according to patient testimonial.", "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Tracy", "role": "Staff", "bio_snippet": "Showed compassion and professionalism during IV attempt according to patient testimonial.", "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Mariana", "role": "Staff", "bio_snippet": "Explained every step of the test according to patient testimonial.", "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Mildred", "role": "Staff", "bio_snippet": "Pleasant and very kind, great service from check-in to discharge according to patient testimonial.", "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Tammy (mammogram)", "role": "Mammography Technician", "bio_snippet": "Performed mammogram efficiently and provided reports immediately according to patient testimonial.", "languages_spoken": []}], "open_saturday": true, "quality_score": 95, "working_hours": {"friday": "Open 24 hours", "monday": "Open 24 hours", "sunday": "Open 24 hours", "tuesday": "Open 24 hours", "saturday": "Open 24 hours", "thursday": "Open 24 hours", "wednesday": "Open 24 hours"}, "gallery_images": ["https://dallasmedcenter.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/dallasmedicalcenter1.jpg"], "review_profile": {"rating": 3.9, "source": "google", "themes": [{"theme": "Staff Professionalism", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Multiple reviewers highlight polite, courteous, and genuinely helpful staff."}, {"theme": "Emergency Care Experience", "mentions": 2, "sentiment": "Negative", "summary_quote": "Patients describe rude and inconsiderate treatment during emergency visits, with long waits and lack of sympathy."}, {"theme": "Clinical Expertise", "mentions": 2, "sentiment": "Mixed", "summary_quote": "While some praise the professionalism of doctors and nurses, others report distressing experiences with anesthesia and pain management."}, {"theme": "Facility Environment", "mentions": 1, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "One reviewer appreciated the full-service hospital setting, which added confidence in the quality of care."}, {"theme": "Communication", "mentions": 1, "sentiment": "Negative", "summary_quote": "A patient reported poor communication from the anesthesiologist and lack of follow-up after a painful procedure."}], "summary": "Patients report a mix of experiences at Dallas Medical Center, with some praising the professionalism and quality of care, while others describe distressing encounters with staff and emergency services.", "review_count": 906, "concern_themes": ["Staff friendliness inconsistency (Joy mentioned as not friendly)"], "positive_themes": ["Professional staff", "Compassionate care", "Efficient service", "Thorough explanations", "Comforting environment"], "featured_reviews": [{"date": "2026-04-20T17:05:12.253918853Z", "text": "I had a very positive experience with the Radiology department at Dallas Medical Center.\n\nI initially found them through MDsave because of their affordable pricing, but what stood out is that this is a full-service hospital setting—not just a standalone imaging center. That gave me much more confidence in the quality of care.\n\nThe staff were consistently polite, courteous, and genuinely helpful throughout the process. Scheduling, check-in, and the scan itself were all smooth and professional.\n\nWhat impressed me most was the follow-up. I needed some additional clarification in my report, and both the staff and radiologists responded quickly by issuing an addendum in a timely manner. That level of responsiveness is especially important when you’re paying out of pocket rather than going through insurance.\n\nOverall, a great combination of affordability, professionalism, and quality care. I would definitely recommend their radiology services.", "author": "Ash", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110381922391800820183/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-06-04T16:10:01.416770440Z", "text": "Brought my dad down to Dallas from North Dakota for a latest technology Tulsa Procedure.  I have spent alot of time in hospitals and have never experienced such amazing concierge type service before. From check in, to radiology, to the procedure we were cared for each step of the way. Your staff is amazing.", "author": "Debbie Sotebeer", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115939716040376047484/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-20T22:25:14.999448710Z", "text": "Where to start....first I felt very rushed. I explained to the Anesthesiologist I was hard to knock out and keep down. He said he had this....he didn''t.  I woke up and he told me go back to sleep. It took a few seconds and the pain hit and I screamed. He said \" I told you to go back to sleep.\" I also bit through my tongue because he used the wrong size bite block so he said to my family. He never came to talk to me at all. That was fun. I had major spinal surgery from top to bottom.\n\nThen I screamed for over an hour while my family had to hear me as they could not get the pain pump to work. They went through 3. It was by far the worst experience.  The nurses were amazing and the only saving grace most of all when I had to pay 5k out of pocket for pure hell. If I could leave less stars.... I would.", "author": "Michelle Pool", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106775548658666613553/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-06-02T12:13:15.027310618Z", "text": "Don''t go here for emergency care. Even if you''re crying in pain, you will first need to do a full front desk intake before they will even see you. They are obviously short staffed and do not see the patient priority. Staff was rude and inconsiderate of the pain the patient is in. If you could go ANYWHERE else please do so. I had to get in and out of the wheelchair and bed with no help from any of the nurses. The rude lady doing the intake pretty much told us if we didn''t like it we could go somewhere else. When we were waiting to get dispatched another person was brought by ambulance, we could hear the way the staff were talking to them and its just unbelievable how much the staff lacks sympathy for patients in pain. In the end they never came back to discharge us. Worst experience I''ve ever had at an emergency room.", "author": "Maria Rizo", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100898837875486074604/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-09T12:30:54.585539225Z", "text": "Visited the Emergency room at Dallas Medical Center as a walk-in one morning after scratching my eye. Very professional group. Not much of a wait the morning I visited. Was walked back to a room just as I finished the check in paperwork. The nurses were great. Doctor Timm was my doc. Good guy. Nice to know they''re there if I ever need them again. Thanks again guys.", "author": "Cordell", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114569315780308069781/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Patients report a mix of experiences at Dallas Medical Center, with some praising the professionalism and quality of care, while others describe distressing encounters with staff and emergency services.", "about_highlight": "Dallas Medical Center (DMC) has proudly served the North Dallas community as the only hospital in Farmers Branch. The physical, emotional, and spiritual well-being of our patients is our top priority, keeping us committed to providing comprehensive medical services that you and your family can trust. Our facility offers a wide range of health services for both acute and emergency situations, including a Geriatric-Accredited Emergency Department recognized for excellence in specialized care for older adults. As a Level IV Trauma Center, you can rely on us when you need help the most. We also offer FastTrackCare to reserve your ER arrival time, same-day primary care with walk-ins welcome, and advanced treatments like the TULSA procedure for prostate cancer. Our commitment to quality is reflected in numerous awards, including Leapfrog Hospital Safety Grade A and Healthgrades Patient Safety Excellence Awards.", "appointment_url": "https://providers.dallasmedcenter.com/en/find-a-provider", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=16138885766644609690&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJu14AkQwnTIYRmrJ15xjX-N8", "quality_missing": ["insurance"], "search_keywords": ["hospital", "english", "vietnamese", "tiếng việt", "người việt", "bác sĩ việt", "emergency services", "primary care", "cardiology services", "cardiac rehabilitation", "surgical services", "wound care", "rehabilitation", "urology", "emergency", "cardiology", "surgical", "specialty", "dr. frasier", "physician", "alvin david", "staff", "kristen", "nurse", "tammy", "bonnie", "destiny", "registration staff", "esther", "tracy", "mariana", "mildred", "tammy (mammogram)", "mammography technician"], "services_offered": [{"name": "Emergency Services", "category": "Emergency", "description": "Award-winning care from a network of clinical professionals dedicated to serving you 24 hours per day, every day.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients with acute and emergency situations"}, {"name": "Primary Care", "category": "Primary Care", "description": "Same day primary care available and walk-ins are welcome at two convenient locations.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients needing routine or same-day primary care"}, {"name": "Cardiology Services", "category": "Cardiology", "description": "Comprehensive cardiology services including cardiac calcium screening for $59 and cardiac rehabilitation.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients with heart health concerns"}, {"name": "Cardiac Rehabilitation", "category": "Cardiology", "description": "Structured exercise and education program for heart health recovery.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients recovering from heart conditions"}, {"name": "Surgical Services", "category": "Surgical", "description": "Choose from our network of highly skilled doctors and clinicians for surgical care.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients needing surgical procedures"}, {"name": "Wound Care", "category": "Specialty", "description": "Personalized care plans created by our multidisciplinary team for wound healing.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients with chronic or complex wounds"}, {"name": "Rehabilitation", "category": "Rehabilitation", "description": "Full line of outpatient rehabilitation services for timely, personalized treatment.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients needing physical or occupational therapy"}, {"name": "Urology", "category": "Specialty", "description": "Advanced prostate cancer treatment with the TULSA procedure, a minimally invasive option with same-day discharge.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients with prostate cancer"}], "short_description": "Dallas Medical Center is a Level IV Trauma Center serving the North Dallas community with comprehensive medical services and award-winning emergency care.", "google_website_url": "https://dallasmedcenter.com/", "google_primary_type": "Medical Center", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": ["Dr. Frasier", "Alvin David", "Kristen", "Tammy", "Bonnie", "Destiny", "Esther", "Tracy", "Mariana", "Mildred", "Tammy (mammogram)"], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "7 Medical Pkwy, Farmers Branch, TX 75234, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/108648179886301943741", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUC7vzAhlRkaLHMlV08d5D-UXiL_UXvklD2wuVI3mjgGGLXj9Ml=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Dallas Medical Center"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/108648179886301943741", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUC7vzAhlRkaLHMlV08d5D-UXiL_UXvklD2wuVI3mjgGGLXj9Ml=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Dallas Medical Center"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/108648179886301943741", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUC7vzAhlRkaLHMlV08d5D-UXiL_UXvklD2wuVI3mjgGGLXj9Ml=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Dallas Medical Center"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/111332618808287695244", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXMNOS5M97C7pQwPHXfJfWsKdZWX_27RZ3SGg_HSCmD5tmk9dg=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "HaRiToS . SkYeNl"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/108648179886301943741", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUC7vzAhlRkaLHMlV08d5D-UXiL_UXvklD2wuVI3mjgGGLXj9Ml=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Dallas Medical Center"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-25T20:42:28.345213+00:00', 'dallas-medical-center', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('34fa94bf-c1f1-44d5-98b8-c3d9fa3679d6', NULL, 'Nguyen K. Pham, MD', 'Nguyen K. Pham, MD, is a board-certified internal medicine physician providing comprehensive primary care at UT Physicians. With a focus on preventive health and chronic disease management, Dr. Pham offers patient-centered care in a welcoming environment. The clinic is dedicated to serving the diverse Houston community, including Vietnamese-speaking patients, with culturally sensitive healthcare services.', '11914 Astoria Blvd #510, Houston, TX 77089', 'Houston', 'TX', '77089', '(713) 486-7680', ARRAY['English', 'Vietnamese']::text[], 'OB/GYN', FALSE, '{"images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/nguyen-k-pham-md.webp"], "rating": 5, "reviews": [{"date": "2026-02-28T03:41:01.115399127Z", "text": "I was emotionally traumatized by the severe pain I had been experiencing and by feeling ignored at other hospitals. During previous visits elsewhere, I felt that my pain was not taken seriously and that I was treated unfairly and without compassion. It was an incredibly discouraging experience while I was already suffering physically and emotionally.\nThis visit was completely different. From the moment I arrived, I felt heard, respected, and genuinely cared for. The Front Desk Nurses & Provider carefully listened and quickly worked to understand the cause of my dizziness. Without me needing to explain everything in detail, he ordered blood tests to check my electrolytes and overall health. I had also recently undergone surgery and was experiencing severe incision pain; he recognized the issue and prescribed the correct medication right away.\nAfter so many disappointing experiences, I finally felt safe and hopeful about my recovery. The compassion, professionalism, and attentiveness I received restored my trust in medical care.\nThank you, Dr. Nguyen Pham. You are a true hero, and I deeply appreciate the care and attention you gave to my health.\nI would rate this hospital 10 out of 10 and highly recommend it to my friends and family.", "author": "Prashana Pathak", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117975751604090962007/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-03-17T23:29:06.974988449Z", "text": "Great experience.", "author": "Lisa Kendall", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118405400711160424685/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-06-24T01:32:01.982604872Z", "text": "Dr. Nguyen Pham is a new doctor for my health journey. I’m so happy I made the decision to see him. He explained every word of my test results and I feel so much better. He genuinely cared about how I felt. He didn’t make me feel rushed with our visit. What a wonderful man!  I feel blessed.", "author": "Valerie Baggett", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116589840661824471073/reviews"}], "website": "https://www.utphysicians.com/provider/nguyen-k-pham/", "location": {"latitude": 29.5832713, "longitude": -95.2064647}, "services": ["Primary Care", "Chronic Disease Management", "Preventive Medicine"], "insurance": {"notes": null, "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": [], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": false}, "highlights": [{"title": "Board-Certified Internal Medicine", "detail": "Dr. Pham is board-certified in internal medicine, providing expert primary care.", "category": "access"}, {"title": "Vietnamese Language Support", "detail": "Vietnamese-speaking patients can receive care in their preferred language.", "category": "culture"}, {"title": "Preventive & Chronic Care", "detail": "Focus on preventive health and management of chronic conditions.", "category": "care"}], "price_tier": "$$", "source_url": "https://www.utphysicians.com/provider/nguyen-k-pham/?utm_source=extnetwork&utm_medium=YextListings&utm_campaign=1962031690", "appointment": {"booking_note": null, "appointment_url": null, "new_patient_note": null, "phone_booking_available": null, "online_booking_available": null, "free_consultation_available": null}, "open_sunday": false, "scout_query": "Vietnamese OB/GYN clinic in Houston, TX", "search_text": "ob/gyn | obgyn | obstetrics | gynecology | women''s health | prenatal | pregnancy | sản phụ khoa | bác sĩ sản | khám thai | 산부인과 | 여성병원 | 妇产科 | 产科 | english | vietnamese | tiếng việt | người việt | bác sĩ việt | primary care | chronic disease management | preventive medicine | preventive | nguyen k. pham | internal medicine physician", "google_types": ["medical_clinic", "health", "point_of_interest", "service", "establishment"], "open_weekend": false, "rating_count": 3, "team_members": [{"name": "Nguyen K. Pham", "role": "Internal Medicine Physician", "bio_snippet": "Board-certified internal medicine physician providing primary care at UT Physicians.", "languages_spoken": ["Vietnamese", "English"]}], "language_note": "Vietnamese-speaking patients are welcome; Dr. Pham likely serves the Asian community in Houston with culturally competent care.", "open_saturday": false, "quality_score": 93, "working_hours": {"friday": "8:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "monday": "8:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "sunday": "Closed", "tuesday": "8:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "saturday": "Closed", "thursday": "8:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "wednesday": "8:00 AM – 5:00 PM"}, "review_profile": {"rating": 5, "source": "google", "themes": [{"theme": "Staff Professionalism", "mentions": 1, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients highlight the respectful and caring demeanor of the staff, making them feel genuinely supported."}, {"theme": "Clinical Expertise", "mentions": 2, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Dr. Pham is commended for his thoroughness in diagnosing issues and explaining test results clearly."}, {"theme": "Communication", "mentions": 2, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients appreciate Dr. Pham''s attentive listening and clear explanations during consultations."}, {"theme": "Treatment Outcomes", "mentions": 1, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients report feeling significantly better after receiving appropriate treatment and care."}, {"theme": "Patient-Centered Care", "mentions": 2, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Dr. Pham is praised for making patients feel valued and not rushed during visits."}], "summary": "Patients consistently praise Dr. Nguyen Pham for his compassionate care, thorough explanations, and attentive approach, making them feel heard and respected.", "review_count": 3, "concern_themes": [], "positive_themes": [], "featured_reviews": [{"date": "2026-02-28T03:41:01.115399127Z", "text": "I was emotionally traumatized by the severe pain I had been experiencing and by feeling ignored at other hospitals. During previous visits elsewhere, I felt that my pain was not taken seriously and that I was treated unfairly and without compassion. It was an incredibly discouraging experience while I was already suffering physically and emotionally.\nThis visit was completely different. From the moment I arrived, I felt heard, respected, and genuinely cared for. The Front Desk Nurses & Provider carefully listened and quickly worked to understand the cause of my dizziness. Without me needing to explain everything in detail, he ordered blood tests to check my electrolytes and overall health. I had also recently undergone surgery and was experiencing severe incision pain; he recognized the issue and prescribed the correct medication right away.\nAfter so many disappointing experiences, I finally felt safe and hopeful about my recovery. The compassion, professionalism, and attentiveness I received restored my trust in medical care.\nThank you, Dr. Nguyen Pham. You are a true hero, and I deeply appreciate the care and attention you gave to my health.\nI would rate this hospital 10 out of 10 and highly recommend it to my friends and family.", "author": "Prashana Pathak", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117975751604090962007/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-03-17T23:29:06.974988449Z", "text": "Great experience.", "author": "Lisa Kendall", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118405400711160424685/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-06-24T01:32:01.982604872Z", "text": "Dr. Nguyen Pham is a new doctor for my health journey. I’m so happy I made the decision to see him. He explained every word of my test results and I feel so much better. He genuinely cared about how I felt. He didn’t make me feel rushed with our visit. What a wonderful man!  I feel blessed.", "author": "Valerie Baggett", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116589840661824471073/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Patients consistently praise Dr. Nguyen Pham for his compassionate care, thorough explanations, and attentive approach, making them feel heard and respected.", "about_highlight": "Nguyen K. Pham, MD, is a board-certified internal medicine physician providing comprehensive primary care at UT Physicians. With a focus on preventive health and chronic disease management, Dr. Pham offers patient-centered care in a welcoming environment. The clinic is dedicated to serving the diverse Houston community, including Vietnamese-speaking patients, with culturally sensitive healthcare services.", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=3553283531008883835&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJT5KCmQabQIYRe7wHnIvMTzE", "quality_missing": ["insurance", "appointment_url"], "search_keywords": ["ob/gyn", "obgyn", "obstetrics", "gynecology", "women''s health", "prenatal", "pregnancy", "sản phụ khoa", "bác sĩ sản", "khám thai", "산부인과", "여성병원", "妇产科", "产科", "english", "vietnamese", "tiếng việt", "người việt", "bác sĩ việt", "primary care", "chronic disease management", "preventive medicine", "preventive", "nguyen k. pham", "internal medicine physician"], "cultural_context": "Vietnamese-speaking patients are welcome; Dr. Pham likely serves the Asian community in Houston with culturally competent care.", "services_offered": [{"name": "Primary Care", "category": "Primary Care", "description": "Comprehensive primary care services including annual check-ups, preventive screenings, and management of acute and chronic illnesses.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Chronic Disease Management", "category": "Primary Care", "description": "Management of chronic conditions such as diabetes, hypertension, and heart disease.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Preventive Medicine", "category": "Preventive", "description": "Routine physicals, immunizations, and health screenings to maintain wellness.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}], "short_description": "Board-certified internal medicine physician offering primary care and preventive health services at UT Physicians, with Vietnamese language support.", "google_website_url": "https://www.utphysicians.com/provider/nguyen-k-pham/?utm_source=extnetwork&utm_medium=YextListings&utm_campaign=1962031690", "google_primary_type": "Medical Clinic", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": ["Nguyen K. Pham"], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "11914 Astoria Blvd #510, Houston, TX 77089, USA"}'::jsonb, '2026-06-26T13:09:14.170629+00:00', 'nguyen-k-pham-md', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('fe2e2309-fe1f-4563-a9f7-c5c06929ab1d', NULL, 'Women''s Care of Beverly Hills', 'Women''s Care of Beverly Hills serves the needs of those of all ages in Beverly Hills, California. An experienced team of obstetrics and gynecology specialists excels in giving patients top-tier, individualized care that benefits their long-term health and wellness. The practice offers routine annual wellness exams, preventive services like Pap smears, cancer screenings, STD testing, and colposcopy, alongside innovative treatments for endometriosis, PCOS, menopause, and vaginal rejuvenation via MonaLisa Touch and other modalities. On the obstetric side, they provide comprehensive pregnancy, prenatal, and postnatal care. The practice also prioritizes birth control and family planning, including safe in-clinic or medication abortions. They welcome all seeking their services and strive to provide a safe, inclusive space.', '8920 Wilshire Blvd, 511, Beverly Hills, CA 90211', 'Beverly Hills', 'CA', '90211', '310-657-1600', ARRAY['English', 'Korean']::text[], 'OB/GYN', FALSE, '{"images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/womens-care-of-beverly-hills-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/womens-care-of-beverly-hills-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/womens-care-of-beverly-hills-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/womens-care-of-beverly-hills-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/womens-care-of-beverly-hills-google-5.webp"], "rating": 4.9, "reviews": [{"date": "2026-05-13T20:41:53.590841119Z", "text": "The best medical team and the best doctor you can truly trust and rely on. Dr. Matthew Guile is highly knowledgeable, professional, and compassionate. He takes the time to thoroughly answer questions, educate patients about their health, and carefully explain every aspect of the care plan. When it comes to delivery, he is truly exceptional.\nThe clinic is very organized and patient-focused. The nurses and staff are all kind, professional, and dedicated to providing outstanding care and service. I am extremely happy with this clinic and highly recommend it.", "author": "Bahareh KMK", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117700128571258230808/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-26T18:09:06.825561773Z", "text": "I am a long time (17 years) patient at this office; however, my amazing doctor retired. I switched over to Dr. Finke and I could not be happier. I have to drive 35 miles and I will gladly do it annually for his warmth, knowledge, presence, and care. He actually listened to me! Also, generally speaking, the office ran a lot smoother than it used to years past. Highly recommend.", "author": "Niki W.", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110933868566195704527/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-01-31T18:22:03.647475845Z", "text": "Dr. Katz is fantastic ! so knowledgeable, confident and practical. He has warm chair side manners and makes you feel comfortable. Maggie is a gem ! She goes out of her way to help the flow and comfort of everyone. I had a great experience with Cecilia, she was such a sweet heart. Over all Dr. Katz and his entire team are so professional. I appreciate the whole team.", "author": "Nicole. N Sazgar", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104468559006288544442/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-15T00:09:12.573323403Z", "text": "I had my first appointment here with Dr. Katz, and left feeling really comfortable. His nurse was kind and easy to talk to, which made the whole experience much less stressful. Dr. Katz himself was very easy going and took the time to answer my questions without making me feel rushed. I especially appreciated how comforting and thoughtful he was when discussing family planning and next steps. My husband and I both left the appointment feeling good about our plan. I’m glad to have found Dr. Katz!", "author": "Veronica Kidston", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106398816386098397829/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-19T18:19:21.518177840Z", "text": "We’ve had a wonderful experience with Dr Campbell throughout this pregnancy. She is incredibly kind, always takes the time to answer all our questions thoroughly, and makes us feel comfortable and supported during every visit. The environment feels welcoming and reassuring, which has made a big difference for us. She is also very punctual, which we truly appreciate. We feel confident and well cared for under her guidance.", "author": "Sidrah", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104282937181372750669/reviews"}], "website": "https://www.womenscareofbeverlyhillsgroup.com/", "location": {"latitude": 34.0666602, "longitude": -118.3862439}, "services": ["Gynecology", "Obstetrics", "Menopause", "IUD Placement", "STD Testing", "Colposcopy", "Pregnancy", "Contraception", "Ultrasound", "PCOS", "Cancer Screening", "Infertility", "Pap Smear", "Gynecologic Surgeries", "Annual Wellness Exams", "Endometriosis", "Incontinence", "Prenatal Care", "Abortion", "Pelvic Health", "Sterilization", "Birth Control", "UTI", "MonaLisa Touch"], "insurance": {"notes": "We work with many national insurance providers, please contact us to discuss your coverage.", "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": [], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": true}, "highlights": [{"title": "Comprehensive Women''s Health Services", "detail": "Offers a full spectrum of gynecologic and obstetric care including routine exams, menopause management, and advanced treatments.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Advanced Vaginal Rejuvenation", "detail": "Provides innovative treatments including MonaLisa Touch, EmSella, and Votiva for menopause and postpartum changes.", "category": "technology"}, {"title": "Family Planning Services", "detail": "Offers birth control, contraception counseling, IUD placement, sterilization, and safe abortion services.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Convenient Location in Beverly Hills", "detail": "Centrally located at 8920 Wilshire Blvd, Suite 511, Beverly Hills, CA 90211.", "category": "convenience"}, {"title": "High Patient Ratings", "detail": "Rated 4.9 out of 5 stars from 47 patient reviews.", "category": "reviews"}], "price_tier": "$$", "source_url": "https://www.womenscareofbeverlyhillsgroup.com/", "appointment": {"booking_note": "Request Appointment", "appointment_url": "https://www.womenscareofbeverlyhillsgroup.com/", "new_patient_note": null, "phone_booking_available": true, "online_booking_available": true, "free_consultation_available": null}, "open_sunday": false, "scout_query": "Korean OB/GYN clinic in Los Angeles, CA", "search_text": "ob/gyn | obgyn | obstetrics | gynecology | women''s health | prenatal | pregnancy | sản phụ khoa | bác sĩ sản | khám thai | 산부인과 | 여성병원 | 妇产科 | 产科 | english | korean | 한국어 | 한인 | 한국말 | menopause | iud placement | std testing | colposcopy | contraception | ultrasound | pcos | cancer screening | infertility | pap smear | gynecologic surgeries | annual wellness exams | endometriosis | incontinence | prenatal care | abortion | pelvic health | sterilization | birth control | uti | monalisa touch | preventive | diagnostic | fertility | surgery | family planning | urinary | vaginal rejuvenation | robert katz | md, facog | david finke | naomi suriel | matthew guile | diahnn campbell | md | brooke kennon | fnp | andrew florin | md, ms", "google_types": ["medical_clinic", "health", "point_of_interest", "service", "establishment"], "open_weekend": false, "rating_count": 1482, "team_members": [{"name": "Robert Katz", "role": "MD, FACOG", "bio_snippet": "Provider at Women''s Care of Beverly Hills.", "languages_spoken": ["English"]}, {"name": "David Finke", "role": "MD, FACOG", "bio_snippet": "Provider at Women''s Care of Beverly Hills.", "languages_spoken": ["English"]}, {"name": "Naomi Suriel", "role": "MD, FACOG", "bio_snippet": "Provider at Women''s Care of Beverly Hills.", "languages_spoken": ["English"]}, {"name": "Matthew Guile", "role": "MD, FACOG", "bio_snippet": "Provider at Women''s Care of Beverly Hills.", "languages_spoken": ["English"]}, {"name": "Diahnn Campbell", "role": "MD", "bio_snippet": "Provider at Women''s Care of Beverly Hills.", "languages_spoken": ["English"]}, {"name": "Brooke Kennon", "role": "FNP", "bio_snippet": "Provider at Women''s Care of Beverly Hills.", "languages_spoken": ["English"]}, {"name": "Andrew Florin", "role": "MD, MS", "bio_snippet": "Newest associate of Women''s Care of Beverly Hills.", "languages_spoken": ["English"]}], "open_saturday": false, "quality_score": 95, "working_hours": {"friday": "9:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "monday": "9:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "sunday": "Closed", "tuesday": "9:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "saturday": "Closed", "thursday": "9:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "wednesday": "9:00 AM – 5:00 PM"}, "gallery_images": ["https://sa1s3optim.patientpop.com/filters:format(webp)/sc-assets/prd/practices/f1266b7f-376e-4cc3-98ba-24cd55de0437/3Rl8CH7pxTWyltKTwwYbfSh4dIXcOZlA_NM0l3j9Q5mstjsWD9tdqJ82SHI0AUxrl0-H23TsYjxAN_4bTPnmIBef9KjePw.jpeg", "https://sa1s3optim.patientpop.com/filters:format(webp)/sc-assets/prd/practices/f1266b7f-376e-4cc3-98ba-24cd55de0437/Pg8Pa3jj925ei2HuIqoO8eCrErccDPfG5fknHzkrWtO6uYuAz84S-9X8tiYS3h4b9X2-qGax3daOEvXGOeofnK6ymPy7CQec.jpeg", "https://sa1s3optim.patientpop.com/50x/filters:format(webp)/sc-assets/prd/practices/f1266b7f-376e-4cc3-98ba-24cd55de0437/SH4WI2sJtlq5Xzw9RJQB56ZvhwaBJxMUGMuoJsQAemAp9fo4-weEfErHxEU2HxutdXi3eq39i_GHt5WbtVErhJBEDBayhCQ.jpeg"], "review_profile": {"rating": 4.9, "source": "google", "themes": [{"theme": "Clinical Expertise", "mentions": 5, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Reviewers emphasize the doctors'' knowledge, confidence, and practical approach to care."}, {"theme": "Communication", "mentions": 4, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients appreciate the doctors'' ability to listen, answer questions thoroughly, and explain care plans clearly."}, {"theme": "Staff Professionalism", "mentions": 4, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "The nurses and staff are described as kind, professional, and dedicated to providing outstanding care."}, {"theme": "Facility Environment", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "The clinic is noted for being organized, patient-focused, and welcoming."}, {"theme": "Compassion", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients highlight the doctors'' warmth, thoughtfulness, and ability to make them feel comfortable and supported."}], "summary": "Patients consistently praise the clinic for its exceptional care, highlighting the doctors'' expertise, compassion, and thoroughness, as well as the supportive and professional staff.", "review_count": 1482, "concern_themes": [], "positive_themes": [], "featured_reviews": [{"date": "2026-05-13T20:41:53.590841119Z", "text": "The best medical team and the best doctor you can truly trust and rely on. Dr. Matthew Guile is highly knowledgeable, professional, and compassionate. He takes the time to thoroughly answer questions, educate patients about their health, and carefully explain every aspect of the care plan. When it comes to delivery, he is truly exceptional.\nThe clinic is very organized and patient-focused. The nurses and staff are all kind, professional, and dedicated to providing outstanding care and service. I am extremely happy with this clinic and highly recommend it.", "author": "Bahareh KMK", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117700128571258230808/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-26T18:09:06.825561773Z", "text": "I am a long time (17 years) patient at this office; however, my amazing doctor retired. I switched over to Dr. Finke and I could not be happier. I have to drive 35 miles and I will gladly do it annually for his warmth, knowledge, presence, and care. He actually listened to me! Also, generally speaking, the office ran a lot smoother than it used to years past. Highly recommend.", "author": "Niki W.", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110933868566195704527/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-01-31T18:22:03.647475845Z", "text": "Dr. Katz is fantastic ! so knowledgeable, confident and practical. He has warm chair side manners and makes you feel comfortable. Maggie is a gem ! She goes out of her way to help the flow and comfort of everyone. I had a great experience with Cecilia, she was such a sweet heart. Over all Dr. Katz and his entire team are so professional. I appreciate the whole team.", "author": "Nicole. N Sazgar", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104468559006288544442/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-15T00:09:12.573323403Z", "text": "I had my first appointment here with Dr. Katz, and left feeling really comfortable. His nurse was kind and easy to talk to, which made the whole experience much less stressful. Dr. Katz himself was very easy going and took the time to answer my questions without making me feel rushed. I especially appreciated how comforting and thoughtful he was when discussing family planning and next steps. My husband and I both left the appointment feeling good about our plan. I’m glad to have found Dr. Katz!", "author": "Veronica Kidston", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106398816386098397829/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-19T18:19:21.518177840Z", "text": "We’ve had a wonderful experience with Dr Campbell throughout this pregnancy. She is incredibly kind, always takes the time to answer all our questions thoroughly, and makes us feel comfortable and supported during every visit. The environment feels welcoming and reassuring, which has made a big difference for us. She is also very punctual, which we truly appreciate. We feel confident and well cared for under her guidance.", "author": "Sidrah", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104282937181372750669/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Patients consistently praise the clinic for its exceptional care, highlighting the doctors'' expertise, compassion, and thoroughness, as well as the supportive and professional staff.", "about_highlight": "Women''s Care of Beverly Hills serves the needs of those of all ages in Beverly Hills, California. An experienced team of obstetrics and gynecology specialists excels in giving patients top-tier, individualized care that benefits their long-term health and wellness. The practice offers routine annual wellness exams, preventive services like Pap smears, cancer screenings, STD testing, and colposcopy, alongside innovative treatments for endometriosis, PCOS, menopause, and vaginal rejuvenation via MonaLisa Touch and other modalities. On the obstetric side, they provide comprehensive pregnancy, prenatal, and postnatal care. The practice also prioritizes birth control and family planning, including safe in-clinic or medication abortions. They welcome all seeking their services and strive to provide a safe, inclusive space.", "appointment_url": "https://www.womenscareofbeverlyhillsgroup.com/", "google_maps_url": "https://ma