health | prenatal | pregnancy | sản phụ khoa | bác sĩ sản | khám thai | 산부인과 | 여성병원 | 妇产科 | 产科 | english | korean | 한국어 | 한인 | 한국말 | abortion | birth control | sti testing | telehealth | abortion for out-of-state patients | prep and pep | sti testing for men | teen wellness | preventive | wellness | medicaid", "google_types": ["medical_clinic", "health", "service", "point_of_interest", "establishment"], "open_weekend": false, "rating_count": 539, "open_saturday": false, "quality_score": 97, "working_hours": {"friday": "8:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "monday": "8:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "sunday": "Closed", "tuesday": "8:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "saturday": "Closed", "thursday": "8:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "wednesday": "8:00 AM – 5:00 PM"}, "gallery_images": ["https://www.fpawomenshealth.com/application/files/6016/5591/6202/hero-new-3.jpg", "https://www.fpawomenshealth.com/application/files/5316/5171/1810/feature-1.jpg", "https://www.fpawomenshealth.com/application/files/4016/5216/7829/feature-4.jpg", "https://www.fpawomenshealth.com/application/files/1816/5171/1811/feature-3.jpg", "https://www.fpawomenshealth.com/application/files/4216/5171/2403/hero-1.jpg", "https://www.fpawomenshealth.com/application/files/4416/5171/2404/hero-2.jpg", "https://www.fpawomenshealth.com/application/files/9416/5171/2405/hero-3.jpg", "https://www.fpawomenshealth.com/application/files/8416/5171/1663/telehealth-2.png"], "review_profile": {"rating": 4.6, "source": "google", "themes": [{"theme": "Staff Professionalism", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Mixed", "summary_quote": "Several reviews highlight both highly professional and caring staff, while others report rude and dismissive behavior."}, {"theme": "Emotional Support", "mentions": 2, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Many patients appreciate the emotional sensitivity and kindness received during vulnerable moments."}, {"theme": "Communication", "mentions": 2, "sentiment": "Negative", "summary_quote": "Some patients felt rushed and unheard when asking questions about their procedures."}, {"theme": "Facility Environment", "mentions": 1, "sentiment": "Negative", "summary_quote": "One review describes an unprofessional and rude encounter with the manager and front desk staff."}, {"theme": "Clinical Expertise", "mentions": 1, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients commend the professional and informative care provided by certain staff members."}], "summary": "Patients report mixed experiences at FPA Women''s Health, with some praising the compassionate and professional care they received, while others describe distressing interactions with staff and management.", "review_count": 539, "concern_themes": [], "positive_themes": [], "featured_reviews": [{"date": "2026-04-03T03:35:35.544121163Z", "text": "I went to this clinic after having an unfortunate interaction with planned parenthood, where I felt such a lack of empathy and kindness that prompted me to cancel my appointment with them. I found FPA and went to two separate locations where I had incredible experiences at both. The first location was in east LA where I got all of my intake done, but due to a rescheduling I was sent over to Koreatown location a couple weeks later. I went to receive a procedure that required me to go under anesthesia and I was incredibly nervous and in desperate need of emotional sensitivity and empathetic kindness, which is exactly what I received here. I had the most positive experience with a situation that felt incredibly daunting and heartbreaking. I received care from such incredible women who made me feel the safest I’ve ever felt in a medical setting. Dr. Stewart, Tauri, Elsa, Rose, and Virgine. I will always remember these women for taking care of me. Their kindness made such a huge difference in the aftermath of the procedure and I feel that my healing process will be easier because of them 💖 I will absolutely be recommending this clinic and coming back if I ever need.", "author": "Anonymous", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116823487414749818591/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-03-01T19:28:54.586387395Z", "text": "Absolutely horrible clinic. Their lead doctor is a disgusting person. During a consult, with a sinister smile, she said she might poke a hole through my uterus. I got up, left, and canceled. Today I got a bill in the mail from FPA threatening to sue me if I don’t pay for the services I refused.\n\nThat doctor should be dismissed, and quite frankly this facility shouldn’t be funded if they’re going to condone her behavior and effectively force patients to go through treatments with physicians they’re uncomfortable with or pay the full amount.\n\nHorrible, horrible, horrible place. Their staff should be ashamed.", "author": "Angelica Terrazas", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107437997817951732952/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-01-12T04:25:40.272828539Z", "text": "I went to this clinic feeling nervous, and unfortunately my experience with one of the nurse practitioners was extremely upsetting. During my visit, I was assigned to the nurse practitioner RASHEEDAT. She was abrupt and dismissive when I asked questions about my procedure. I felt rushed, unheard, and made to feel like I was a burden for simply trying to understand what was happening to my body.\n\nWhat made this even more concerning is that my roommate later went to the same clinic and was also seen by this same nurse. She also described feeling anxious and distressed due to the way she was treated by this nurse, which made me realize my experience was not an isolated incident.\n\nThis is a women’s health clinic, where patients often come in feeling vulnerable and scared. Compassion, patience, and clear communication are essential. Unfortunately, that was not my experience with this nurse. I will say I had a great experience with all other nurses I encountered there, but RASHEEDAT was truly traumatizing and unprofessional and i will never forget the way she made me feel.\n\nI hope the clinic’s leadership takes this feedback seriously so future patients can feel safe, respected, and supported.", "author": "Kylie Blessing", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113345878537960065174/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-21T01:23:12.564160970Z", "text": "NP Kwong was very caring and professional. As well with the rest of the staff. They were very quick with my appointment and informative. Definitely fell safe and cared for!\nComing back .", "author": "Terry Palacios", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104106688355352040259/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-12T21:41:47.643269011Z", "text": "I visited the clinic recently and the manger was absolutely rude including the staff at the front desk. It was definitely an experience I won’t forget. Very unprofessional on both parts.", "author": "Jeremy Orefice", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106905670052351792450/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Patients report mixed experiences at FPA Women''s Health, with some praising the compassionate and professional care they received, while others describe distressing interactions with staff and management.", "about_highlight": "Since the practice’s inception in 1969, Family Planning Associates Medical Group, now FPA Women’s Health, has been providing the highest standard of medical care for women in a warm, caring environment. They offer gynecology, birth control, abortion and STI testing services online and across California with a wide range of anesthesia options. The practice is known for same-day appointments, immediate on-site financial assistance for those without insurance, and a commitment to trauma-informed care.", "appointment_url": "https://www.fpawomenshealth.com/book-online", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=4411145861990817819&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJ8XjEbXrHwoARG6BlTMqJNz0", "quality_missing": ["team_members"], "search_keywords": ["ob/gyn", "obgyn", "obstetrics", "gynecology", "women''s health", "prenatal", "pregnancy", "sản phụ khoa", "bác sĩ sản", "khám thai", "산부인과", "여성병원", "妇产科", "产科", "english", "korean", "한국어", "한인", "한국말", "abortion", "birth control", "sti testing", "telehealth", "abortion for out-of-state patients", "prep and pep", "sti testing for men", "teen wellness", "preventive", "wellness", "medicaid"], "services_offered": [{"name": "Abortion", "category": "Abortion", "description": "Abortion services including medication abortion (in-office), surgical abortion, and abortion by mail.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Individuals seeking abortion care"}, {"name": "Birth Control", "category": "Birth Control", "description": "Birth control options including IUD, Depo Shot, emergency contraception, contraceptive implant, birth control patch, pill, and ring.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Individuals seeking contraception"}, {"name": "Gynecology", "category": "Gynecology", "description": "Comprehensive gynecological care including annual exams, cervical cancer screening, colposcopy, endometrial biopsy, hormone replacement therapy, LEEP procedure, pap smears, STI testing, ultrasound, vaginal infection screening & treatment, vulvar biopsy, and UTI treatment.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Individuals seeking gynecological care"}, {"name": "STI Testing", "category": "STI Testing", "description": "STI testing and treatment services.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Individuals needing STI testing"}, {"name": "Telehealth", "category": "Telehealth", "description": "Video visit with your provider from the comfort of your home for abortion by mail, birth control, emergency contraception, STI treatment, UTI treatment, and vaginitis treatment.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Individuals seeking remote care"}, {"name": "Abortion for Out-of-State Patients", "category": "Abortion", "description": "Travel to an abortion friendly state and receive the care you are entitled to. Financial assistance is available.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Out-of-state patients seeking abortion care"}, {"name": "PrEP and PEP", "category": "Preventive", "description": "PrEP and PEP services for HIV prevention.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Individuals at risk for HIV"}, {"name": "STI Testing for Men", "category": "STI Testing", "description": "STI testing services available for men.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Men needing STI testing"}, {"name": "Teen Wellness", "category": "Wellness", "description": "Teen wellness services.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Teens"}], "short_description": "FPA Women’s Health provides gynecology, birth control, abortion and STI testing services online and across California with a wide range of anesthesia options.", "google_website_url": "https://www.fpawomenshealth.com/", "insurance_accepted": ["Medicaid"], "google_primary_type": "Medical Clinic", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": [], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "601 Westmoreland Ave, Los Angeles, CA 90005, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/112023622972042257383", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW93kqvMPmW-SkoY5NXrd_GEQZgbp2-zF8PF4bqWDQqtfbJuYJVaw=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "NAKI STUDIO"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/112087837758889944469", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVNvpHdTsiUMdJ3Uh374_eczRUOd7JuxKsAgb1v1lM7sv7h6YUa=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Treaunna Campbell"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/114843379845123950776", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJTdOI3pzyWnzGD6viokee99OdH9u0QtNSjlL6_DuQbXP3Wmw=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "FPA Women''s Health"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-26T13:13:18.628069+00:00', 'fpa-womens-health', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('8f099b01-4ac3-4f41-847e-9fe2ec26c531', NULL, 'SFWomen''s GYN Inc.', 'SFWomen''s GYN Inc. is a women''s health clinic based in San Francisco, committed to providing high-quality gynecological care in a patient-centered environment. The clinic focuses on the unique health needs of women and individuals seeking gynecological services, offering a welcoming and supportive atmosphere. Their approach emphasizes comprehensive care that respects the dignity and privacy of every patient.', '3838 California St #412, San Francisco, CA 94118', 'San Francisco', 'CA', '94118', '(415) 563-9000', ARRAY['English', 'Chinese']::text[], 'OB/GYN', FALSE, '{"images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/sfwomens-gyn-inc-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/sfwomens-gyn-inc-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/sfwomens-gyn-inc-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/sfwomens-gyn-inc-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/sfwomens-gyn-inc-google-5.webp"], "rating": 4.8, "reviews": [{"date": "2026-03-04T21:21:02.607062993Z", "text": "CAUTION HERE : I got diagnosed by Mrs. Chun and she said she would be available for my questions after the visit because I was in a hurry to work and still processing the information. When I called the office to schedule an appointment they said she was on for two weeks and I’d have to wait. Then I urged to see if there was other doctor that could answer my basic questions. I explained my financial situation and asked for a telehealth call which they booked for me. Then the next day I had to call because they did not call me at the appointment time and then then said Mrs shu wasn’t comfortable talking to me without meeting me first (they wanted me to pay for another in person visit). So I will never be returning to this office again. Mind you this is after I went for my follow up to review my results and Mrs chun said everything was ok because she hadn’t even opened my abnormal test until we were saying goodbye and I asked for confirmation of a clear result.", "author": "Naomi D", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104838404888488587965/reviews"}, {"date": "2022-12-22T00:25:29.777974Z", "text": "As long as I can remember I have had to deal with horrible monthly cycles. And for as equally long I can remember being dismissed by health care providers, \"it''s just what women have to go through\", was what I was told. I felt hopeless and in my worst moments thought of ending it all rather than deal with the pain. Then finally at 42, I decided to look into a smaller practice, and that''s when I found Dr. Karen Chu. She is by far the best provider I have ever had, the very first visit I had sent over some records and she read them all before meeting me. Every single question I have ever asked her, she answered with thoughtfulness and provides detailed and specific answers. She worked with me until my problem was resolved and walked through everything with me, pretty much gave me my life back. The front desk staff are always friendly and I genuinely enjoy seeing them each time I visit the office. My only complaint is that I wish Dr. Chu could be my PCP but she is a GYN and in my humble opinion the best there is to offer.", "author": "MaiLee Mai", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115236268351315816897/reviews"}, {"date": "2019-01-25T22:48:20.318438474Z", "text": "Dr. Chun is a fantastic physician.  Kind and thorough.  Office staff are very pleasant and helpful.  At my last appointment recently I did have to wait to be seen a little longer than usual, but overall very happy with the care.", "author": "McFadden Family", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101649697873569791757/reviews"}, {"date": "2017-07-27T00:45:40.933Z", "text": "I was seeing a different OB-GYN prior to my delivery and was referred to Dr. Rachel Shu for emergency reasons. I saw Dr. Shu while in the middle of contractions and she handled the situation very well. She made me feel comfortable and relaxed even if I had to deliver my baby via C-section. She is a great doctor and can''t thank her enough for safely delivering my baby.", "author": "Vennette Legasto", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111491104403325224457/reviews"}, {"date": "2018-11-10T19:32:04.679457145Z", "text": "I was seen on time, the appointment was quick and effortless. I appreciate Dr. Chu''s to-the-point method (she''s caring and kind but is conscious of your time as well which is great for someone like me who''s on a tight schedule usually).", "author": "jodi inkenbrandt", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104043997919070411322/reviews"}], "website": "http://www.sfwgyn.com/", "location": {"latitude": 37.786181, "longitude": -122.457608}, "insurance": {"notes": null, "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": [], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": false}, "price_tier": "$$", "source_url": "http://www.sfwgyn.com/", "appointment": {"booking_note": null, "appointment_url": null, "new_patient_note": null, "phone_booking_available": null, "online_booking_available": null, "free_consultation_available": null}, "open_sunday": false, "scout_query": "Chinese OB/GYN clinic in San Francisco, CA", "search_text": "ob/gyn | obgyn | obstetrics | gynecology | women''s health | prenatal | pregnancy | sản phụ khoa | bác sĩ sản | khám thai | 산부인과 | 여성병원 | 妇产科 | 产科 | english | chinese | mandarin | cantonese | 中文 | 普通话 | 国语 | 粤语 | 广东话 | 华人", "google_types": ["medical_clinic", "health", "point_of_interest", "service", "establishment"], "open_weekend": false, "rating_count": 34, "open_saturday": false, "quality_score": 80, "working_hours": {"friday": "8:30 AM – 5:00 PM", "monday": "8:30 AM – 5:00 PM", "sunday": "Closed", "tuesday": "8:30 AM – 5:00 PM", "saturday": "Closed", "thursday": "8:30 AM – 5:00 PM", "wednesday": "8:30 AM – 5:00 PM"}, "review_profile": {"rating": 4.8, "source": "google", "themes": [{"theme": "Compassionate care", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients highlight compassionate care in their feedback."}, {"theme": "Friendly staff", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients highlight friendly staff in their feedback."}, {"theme": "Clear explanations", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients highlight clear explanations in their feedback."}, {"theme": "Comfortable visits", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients highlight comfortable visits in their feedback."}], "summary": "SFWomen''s GYN Inc. has a 4.8 star Google rating from 34 Google reviews. Patients commonly mention compassionate care, friendly staff, clear explanations, comfortable visits.", "review_count": 34, "concern_themes": [], "positive_themes": [], "featured_reviews": [{"date": "2026-03-04T21:21:02.607062993Z", "text": "CAUTION HERE : I got diagnosed by Mrs. Chun and she said she would be available for my questions after the visit because I was in a hurry to work and still processing the information. When I called the office to schedule an appointment they said she was on for two weeks and I’d have to wait. Then I urged to see if there was other doctor that could answer my basic questions. I explained my financial situation and asked for a telehealth call which they booked for me. Then the next day I had to call because they did not call me at the appointment time and then then said Mrs shu wasn’t comfortable talking to me without meeting me first (they wanted me to pay for another in person visit). So I will never be returning to this office again. Mind you this is after I went for my follow up to review my results and Mrs chun said everything was ok because she hadn’t even opened my abnormal test until we were saying goodbye and I asked for confirmation of a clear result.", "author": "Naomi D", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104838404888488587965/reviews"}, {"date": "2022-12-22T00:25:29.777974Z", "text": "As long as I can remember I have had to deal with horrible monthly cycles. And for as equally long I can remember being dismissed by health care providers, \"it''s just what women have to go through\", was what I was told. I felt hopeless and in my worst moments thought of ending it all rather than deal with the pain. Then finally at 42, I decided to look into a smaller practice, and that''s when I found Dr. Karen Chu. She is by far the best provider I have ever had, the very first visit I had sent over some records and she read them all before meeting me. Every single question I have ever asked her, she answered with thoughtfulness and provides detailed and specific answers. She worked with me until my problem was resolved and walked through everything with me, pretty much gave me my life back. The front desk staff are always friendly and I genuinely enjoy seeing them each time I visit the office. My only complaint is that I wish Dr. Chu could be my PCP but she is a GYN and in my humble opinion the best there is to offer.", "author": "MaiLee Mai", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115236268351315816897/reviews"}, {"date": "2019-01-25T22:48:20.318438474Z", "text": "Dr. Chun is a fantastic physician.  Kind and thorough.  Office staff are very pleasant and helpful.  At my last appointment recently I did have to wait to be seen a little longer than usual, but overall very happy with the care.", "author": "McFadden Family", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101649697873569791757/reviews"}, {"date": "2017-07-27T00:45:40.933Z", "text": "I was seeing a different OB-GYN prior to my delivery and was referred to Dr. Rachel Shu for emergency reasons. I saw Dr. Shu while in the middle of contractions and she handled the situation very well. She made me feel comfortable and relaxed even if I had to deliver my baby via C-section. She is a great doctor and can''t thank her enough for safely delivering my baby.", "author": "Vennette Legasto", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111491104403325224457/reviews"}, {"date": "2018-11-10T19:32:04.679457145Z", "text": "I was seen on time, the appointment was quick and effortless. I appreciate Dr. Chu''s to-the-point method (she''s caring and kind but is conscious of your time as well which is great for someone like me who''s on a tight schedule usually).", "author": "jodi inkenbrandt", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104043997919070411322/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "SFWomen''s GYN Inc. has a 4.8 star Google rating from 34 Google reviews. Patients commonly mention compassionate care, friendly staff, clear explanations, comfortable visits.", "about_highlight": "SFWomen''s GYN Inc. is a women''s health clinic based in San Francisco, committed to providing high-quality gynecological care in a patient-centered environment. The clinic focuses on the unique health needs of women and individuals seeking gynecological services, offering a welcoming and supportive atmosphere. Their approach emphasizes comprehensive care that respects the dignity and privacy of every patient.", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=14792159718092558166&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJieCThDCHhYARVs-_MeROSM0", "quality_missing": ["services", "insurance", "team_members", "appointment_url"], "search_keywords": ["ob/gyn", "obgyn", "obstetrics", "gynecology", "women''s health", "prenatal", "pregnancy", "sản phụ khoa", "bác sĩ sản", "khám thai", "산부인과", "여성병원", "妇产科", "产科", "english", "chinese", "mandarin", "cantonese", "中文", "普通话", "国语", "粤语", "广东话", "华人"], "short_description": "A San Francisco gynecology clinic offering compassionate, patient-focused care for women''s health.", "google_website_url": "http://www.sfwgyn.com/", "google_primary_type": "Medical Clinic", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": [], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "3838 California St #412, San Francisco, CA 94118, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/102638345892205820912", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIy5e2IVovLjpkZb7bWb8c8Su0ZOJ-kYnCVknK0Lm7UhmBQ4A=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "SFWomen''s GYN Inc."}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/102638345892205820912", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIy5e2IVovLjpkZb7bWb8c8Su0ZOJ-kYnCVknK0Lm7UhmBQ4A=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "SFWomen''s GYN Inc."}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/102638345892205820912", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIy5e2IVovLjpkZb7bWb8c8Su0ZOJ-kYnCVknK0Lm7UhmBQ4A=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "SFWomen''s GYN Inc."}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/102638345892205820912", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIy5e2IVovLjpkZb7bWb8c8Su0ZOJ-kYnCVknK0Lm7UhmBQ4A=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "SFWomen''s GYN Inc."}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/102638345892205820912", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIy5e2IVovLjpkZb7bWb8c8Su0ZOJ-kYnCVknK0Lm7UhmBQ4A=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "SFWomen''s GYN Inc."}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-26T13:13:56.860145+00:00', 'sfwomens-gyn-inc', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('e9969ec7-77d1-4e11-bad1-7f4e51631163', NULL, 'Pacific Women''s OB/GYN Medical Group', 'Pacific Women''s OB/GYN Medical Group was founded in 1989 by Drs. Laurie Green and Joanne Hom with the goal of providing state-of-the-art, empathic obstetrics and gynecology care in a woman-run, visually beautiful environment. Over the years, the practice has expanded to now include six female obstetrician-gynecologists and two physician assistants. Our providers come from diverse backgrounds and have trained at several of the country''s top OB/GYN residencies. Working together, the physicians and physician assistants of Pacific Women''s share their collective clinical experience and expertise to provide comprehensive and compassionate care for our patients. From routine gynecological and obstetrics needs to complex women’s health issues, we are committed to providing you personalized, supportive care in a serene, respectful private practice atmosphere. It is an honor to serve our patients and their families.', '1375 Sutter Street, Suite 105', 'San Francisco', 'CA', '94109', '(415) 379-9600', ARRAY['English', 'Chinese']::text[], 'OB/GYN', TRUE, '{"fax": "(415) 379-9823", "email": "pacificwomensadmin@pacwomens.com", "images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/pacific-womens-obgyn-medical-group.webp"], "rating": 3, "reviews": [{"date": "2026-05-28T01:56:31.030590620Z", "text": "Dr. Fung Yee Chan is truly the greatest doctor. I was incredibly nervous about an IUD replacement, after my first insertion was the most painful experience I’ve ever had. As soon as she learned that I was nervous, Dr. Chan was incredibly kind - explaining every step of the process as she went through the procedure so I knew exactly what to expect, allowing me to play music, and having ALL the right pain relief options prepped for me. The experience was infinitely better than my first insertion. Highly highly recommend seeing Dr. Chan!! I never thought I’d say this, but I’d happily get another IUD as long as she’s my doctor.", "author": "Michelle Park", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108737110881843981379/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-04-20T22:57:14.579048821Z", "text": "If I could give less than 1 star, I would. I should have never gone after reading the reviews. I went for an annual exam in January, which would''ve been fully covered by insurance, but due to their shady billing practices I ended up with an insane bill that my insurance didn''t even cover all of it. I have emailed 4 times and called their billing twice with ZERO response. Do not go here unless you want mediocre care, pay the highest possible price, and then get ghosted.", "author": "Julia Parry", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103259395000187884162/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-01-08T19:24:47.259637999Z", "text": "I’ve been seeing by obgyn from this office, whom I love, for the past 22 years.  They have an appointment request form on their website, which I’ve submitted twice this week.  I thought perhaps I filled out the first one incorrectly, so submitted another the next day.  (You do not receive an acknowledgement email.)  I followed up yesterday with an email and still have not received any response.   What has happened with this office?  From the other reviews, I’m wondering if they are even operating anymore.   I’d hate to have to find a new obgyn, but this is no way to run a medical practice.", "author": "Christina Lum-Lee", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108202027180045502836/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-12-22T23:24:04.647734942Z", "text": "They took advantage financially and charged several hundred dollars upfront for a procedure without trying insurance. Ended up not needing the procedure and claimed what they charged me was still correct since I went to the office and was examined. Pretty sure they also billed insurance too for the extra cash. Ended up going to a different place for the same thing a year later and of course, insurance accepted it and it was billed correctly. Pacific has awful billing tactics and practices. Should not be practicing medicine. Would never ever step anywhere near here for any type of care.", "author": "Shivani R", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114342452596693570738/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-14T20:14:55.011419604Z", "text": "Dr Neiman had a one hour appointment with me which she only talked to me for 10 minutes and forgot to order me multiple lab experiments causing me having to go back and forth to the labs. She later charged me for those appointments as well even though all she said during the appointment was “ oops sorry I forgot to order you this other thing”\nThank you for not being helpful", "author": "Marine Lin", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116390305008760741406/reviews"}], "website": "https://www.pacificwomens.com/", "location": {"latitude": 37.787258099999995, "longitude": -122.42300530000001}, "services": ["Obstetrical Care", "Gynecological Care", "Colposcopy & ECC", "Endometrial Biopsy", "IUD Insertion", "Virtual Appointment"], "insurance": {"notes": null, "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": [], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": false}, "highlights": [{"title": "Woman-Run Practice", "detail": "Founded and operated by women, providing care in a visually beautiful, empathic environment.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Diverse Providers", "detail": "Six female OB/GYNs and two PAs from diverse backgrounds trained at top residencies.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Comprehensive Care", "detail": "From routine gynecology to high-risk obstetrics, offering personalized, state-of-the-art care.", "category": "care"}], "price_tier": "$$", "source_url": "https://www.pacificwomens.com/", "appointment": {"booking_note": "Request an Appointment", "appointment_url": "https://www.pacificwomens.com/hours-scheduling/appointments", "new_patient_note": "Save time during your next appointment with PWOG! Fill out patient forms from the comfort of your own home.", "phone_booking_available": null, "online_booking_available": true, "free_consultation_available": null}, "open_sunday": false, "scout_query": "Chinese OB/GYN clinic in San Francisco, CA", "search_text": "ob/gyn | obgyn | obstetrics | gynecology | women''s health | prenatal | pregnancy | sản phụ khoa | bác sĩ sản | khám thai | 산부인과 | 여성병원 | 妇产科 | 产科 | english | chinese | mandarin | cantonese | 中文 | 普通话 | 国语 | 粤语 | 广东话 | 华人 | obstetrical care | gynecological care | colposcopy & ecc | endometrial biopsy | iud insertion | virtual appointment | telehealth | dr. fung-yee chan | obstetrician-gynecologist | dr. laurie green | dr. sarah hebl | dr. poornima kaul | dr. elizabeth moy | dr. jaimie lee | lily connor | physician assistant | kelcey nishihara | dr. joanne hom | dr. secily bason-mitchell", "google_types": ["medical_clinic", "doctor", "health", "point_of_interest", "service", "establishment"], "open_weekend": false, "rating_count": 43, "team_members": [{"name": "Dr. Fung-Yee Chan", "role": "Obstetrician-Gynecologist", "bio_snippet": null, "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Dr. Laurie Green", "role": "Obstetrician-Gynecologist", "bio_snippet": "Co-founder of Pacific Women''s OB/GYN Medical Group.", "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Dr. Sarah Hebl", "role": "Obstetrician-Gynecologist", "bio_snippet": null, "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Dr. Poornima Kaul", "role": "Obstetrician-Gynecologist", "bio_snippet": n