ry I forgot to order you this other thing”\nThank you for not being helpful", "author": "Marine Lin", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116390305008760741406/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Patients have mixed experiences at Pacific Women''s OB/GYN Medical Group, with some praising Dr. Chan''s compassionate care during procedures, while others express frustration with billing practices and poor communication.", "about_highlight": "Pacific Women''s OB/GYN Medical Group was founded in 1989 by Drs. Laurie Green and Joanne Hom with the goal of providing state-of-the-art, empathic obstetrics and gynecology care in a woman-run, visually beautiful environment. Over the years, the practice has expanded to now include six female obstetrician-gynecologists and two physician assistants. Our providers come from diverse backgrounds and have trained at several of the country''s top OB/GYN residencies. Working together, the physicians and physician assistants of Pacific Women''s share their collective clinical experience and expertise to provide comprehensive and compassionate care for our patients. From routine gynecological and obstetrics needs to complex women’s health issues, we are committed to providing you personalized, supportive care in a serene, respectful private practice atmosphere. It is an honor to serve our patients and their families.", "appointment_url": "https://www.pacificwomens.com/hours-scheduling/appointments", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=10993135569680331375&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJieCThDCHhYARb_KBdo52j5g", "quality_missing": ["insurance"], "search_keywords": ["ob/gyn", "obgyn", "obstetrics", "gynecology", "women''s health", "prenatal", "pregnancy", "sản phụ khoa", "bác sĩ sản", "khám thai", "산부인과", "여성병원", "妇产科", "产科", "english", "chinese", "mandarin", "cantonese", "中文", "普通话", "国语", "粤语", "广东话", "华人", "obstetrical care", "gynecological care", "colposcopy & ecc", "endometrial biopsy", "iud insertion", "virtual appointment", "telehealth", "dr. fung-yee chan", "obstetrician-gynecologist", "dr. laurie green", "dr. sarah hebl", "dr. poornima kaul", "dr. elizabeth moy", "dr. jaimie lee", "lily connor", "physician assistant", "kelcey nishihara", "dr. joanne hom", "dr. secily bason-mitchell"], "services_offered": [{"name": "Obstetrical Care", "category": "Obstetrics", "description": "Highest quality obstetrical care, including multiple and high-risk pregnancy needs.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Future parents"}, {"name": "Gynecological Care", "category": "Gynecology", "description": "Advanced gynecological care including contraception and annual exams.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Women"}, {"name": "Colposcopy & ECC", "category": "Gynecology", "description": "Colposcopy and endocervical curettage procedures.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Endometrial Biopsy", "category": "Gynecology", "description": "Endometrial biopsy procedure.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "IUD Insertion", "category": "Gynecology", "description": "IUD insertion appointment.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Virtual Appointment", "category": "Telehealth", "description": "Virtual appointment for remote care.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}], "short_description": "Pacific Women''s OB/GYN Medical Group provides comprehensive obstetrical and gynecological care in a woman-run, compassionate private practice in San Francisco.", "google_website_url": "https://www.pacificwomens.com/", "google_primary_type": "Medical Clinic", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": ["Dr. Fung-Yee Chan", "Dr. Laurie Green", "Dr. Sarah Hebl", "Dr. Poornima Kaul", "Dr. Elizabeth Moy", "Dr. Jaimie Lee", "Lily Connor", "Kelcey Nishihara", "Dr. Joanne Hom", "Dr. Secily Bason-Mitchell"], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "1375 Sutter St #105, San Francisco, CA 94109, USA"}'::jsonb, '2026-06-26T13:15:12.554182+00:00', 'pacific-womens-obgyn-medical-group', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('ee8bb068-9852-4ec1-94a7-a73c6d488ee6', NULL, 'Shifa Community Clinic', 'Shifa Community Clinic is a 501(c)(3) non-profit, student-run medical facility dedicated to delivering high quality, free, multilingual, and multicultural healthcare to the diverse, medically uninsured population of the Greater Sacramento Area. Founded with the mission to integrate socially and medically disenfranchised communities into the mainstream healthcare system, the clinic serves as a vital safety net for those without insurance. By fostering meaningful mentorship between undergraduate scholars and working professionals, the clinic enhances the patient experience while providing a valuable cultural learning environment for healthcare providers.', '419 V Street, Sacramento, CA 95818', 'Sacramento', 'CA', '95818', '(916) 441-6008', ARRAY['English', 'Vietnamese']::text[], 'Community Health Center', FALSE, '{"email": "info@shifacommunityclinic.org", "images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/shifa-community-clinic-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/shifa-community-clinic-google-2.webp"], "rating": 4.5, "reviews": [{"date": "2021-04-04T18:04:19.273713Z", "text": "Got my first dose here. It was packed but moved along super fast. Temperatures taken upon entering the gates outside, check-in is quick and they are friendly n helpful. The organization of the whole thing was better than expected given how many people showed up. I have anxiety and panic attacks, and struggle with crowds, but this place made me feel super comfortable throughout each step.", "author": "Dizzplay Name", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111825000701291399893/reviews"}, {"date": "2019-04-28T18:44:33.164855Z", "text": "This is a great clinic that offers a lot of resources to patients that might not have any other options/insurance. The staff is amazing and very caring. They will go above and beyond to make sure you’re comfortable and get the care you need. I’m surprised by the other reviews as they’re not even close to what this clinic embodies..", "author": "Santana", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118232929805059675044/reviews"}, {"date": "2021-04-07T00:48:11.736188Z", "text": "My experience was very good. I came to get my C19 vaccine. The employees were very professional, courteous and answered all my questions and concerns. They serve the community here in Sacramento downtown area.", "author": "OMAR", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108906646662311246661/reviews"}, {"date": "2018-09-09T18:39:26.931313Z", "text": "Worst clinic I have been to in my life. Slow moving and definitely doesn''t help the community. Highly incompetent with minimal services. Just go somewhere else. Don''t waste your time\nPS. If the doctor doesn''t feel like you''re worth her time, she literally won''t even see you. I went through the preliminary health check, waited, got a full body physical, waited some more and then the doctor never met me. Just had her assistant minions shoo me away.", "author": "Xia Bradford", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117479831943594923661/reviews"}, {"date": "2021-04-03T19:10:31.587522Z", "text": "Shifa Clinic volunteers are kind and empathetic to concerns of the community. They do a great job with accessibility and answering questions. Thank you for all your hard work!", "author": "Sonum Saeed", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109033540980340043134/reviews"}], "website": "https://shifaclinic.org", "location": {"latitude": 38.569336199999995, "longitude": -121.5063153}, "services": ["Primary Care Clinic", "Dental Clinic", "Vaccine Clinic", "Women''s Health Clinic", "Diabetic Retinopathy Clinic", "Mind Clinic", "Dermatology Clinic", "Podiatry Clinic", "Legal Clinic"], "insurance": {"notes": "Shifa Community Clinic provides free healthcare to the uninsured. They do not bill insurance; all services are free for eligible patients.", "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": [], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": false}, "highlights": [{"title": "Free Healthcare", "detail": "All services are provided free of charge to uninsured patients.", "category": "insurance"}, {"title": "Multilingual & Multicultural", "detail": "Delivers healthcare in a multilingual, multicultural environment.", "category": "culture"}, {"title": "Student-Run", "detail": "A student-run facility fostering mentorship and education.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Comprehensive Services", "detail": "Offers primary care, dental, women''s health, eye, mind, dermatology, podiatry, legal, and vaccine clinics.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Serving the Uninsured", "detail": "Dedicated to the medically uninsured population of Greater Sacramento.", "category": "access"}], "price_tier": "$", "source_url": "https://shifaclinic.org/", "appointment": {"booking_note": "By appointment only.", "appointment_url": "https://shifaclinic.org/contact/", "new_patient_note": null, "phone_booking_available": null, "online_booking_available": null, "free_consultation_available": null}, "open_sunday": true, "scout_query": "Vietnamese speaking medical clinic in Sacramento, CA", "search_text": "community health center | community health | fqhc | sliding scale | medicaid | medicare | low cost | trung tâm y tế cộng đồng | 커뮤니티 헬스 | 社区医疗中心 | english | vietnamese | tiếng việt | người việt | bác sĩ việt | primary care clinic | dental clinic | vaccine clinic | women''s health clinic | diabetic retinopathy clinic | mind clinic | dermatology clinic | podiatry clinic | legal clinic | primary care | dental | preventive | women''s health | eye care | mental health | dermatology | podiatry | legal", "google_types": ["medical_clinic", "doctor", "health", "point_of_interest", "establishment"], "open_weekend": true, "rating_count": 21, "language_note": "Shifa Community Clinic emphasizes multilingual and multicultural care, serving the diverse immigrant and refugee communities of the Greater Sacramento Area. The clinic offers language-accessible services and culturally responsive healthcare, exemplified by its Refugee Initiative and resources like ''Haram Medication'' information for Muslim patients.", "open_saturday": false, "quality_score": 92, "working_hours": {"sunday": "8 AM - 12 PM"}, "gallery_images": ["https://shifaclinic.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/Shifa-CC-Logo.png", "https://shifaclinic.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/I-love-shifa.jpeg", "https://shifaclinic.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/primary-Dep.jpg", "https://shifaclinic.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/Dental-Dep.jpg", "https://shifaclinic.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/Vacc-Dep.jpg"], "review_profile": {"rating": 4.5, "source": "google", "themes": [{"theme": "Staff Professionalism", "mentions": 4, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Multiple reviewers highlight the staff''s friendliness, professionalism, and willingness to go above and beyond."}, {"theme": "Facility Efficiency", "mentions": 2, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients note the clinic''s well-organized processes, even during busy times like vaccination drives."}, {"theme": "Community Focus", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Reviewers appreciate the clinic''s dedication to serving the community, especially those without other healthcare options."}, {"theme": "Doctor Availability", "mentions": 1, "sentiment": "Negative", "summary_quote": "One patient reported a negative experience with the doctor refusing to see them despite completing preliminary checks."}, {"theme": "Patient Comfort", "mentions": 2, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Several reviews mention the clinic''s efforts to make patients feel comfortable, even those with anxiety or specific concerns."}], "summary": "Most patients praise Shifa Community Clinic for its efficient, caring staff and community-focused services, though one review highlights significant dissatisfaction with service and doctor availability.", "review_count": 21, "concern_themes": [], "positive_themes": [], "featured_reviews": [{"date": "2021-04-04T18:04:19.273713Z", "text": "Got my first dose here. It was packed but moved along super fast. Temperatures taken upon entering the gates outside, check-in is quick and they are friendly n helpful. The organization of the whole thing was better than expected given how many people showed up. I have anxiety and panic attacks, and struggle with crowds, but this place made me feel super comfortable throughout each step.", "author": "Dizzplay Name", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111825000701291399893/reviews"}, {"date": "2019-04-28T18:44:33.164855Z", "text": "This is a great clinic that offers a lot of resources to patients that might not have any other options/insurance. The staff is amazing and very caring. They will go above and beyond to make sure you’re comfortable and get the care you need. I’m surprised by the other reviews as they’re not even close to what this clinic embodies..", "author": "Santana", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118232929805059675044/reviews"}, {"date": "2021-04-07T00:48:11.736188Z", "text": "My experience was very good. I came to get my C19 vaccine. The employees were very professional, courteous and answered all my questions and concerns. They serve the community here in Sacramento downtown area.", "author": "OMAR", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108906646662311246661/reviews"}, {"date": "2018-09-09T18:39:26.931313Z", "text": "Worst clinic I have been to in my life. Slow moving and definitely doesn''t help the community. Highly incompetent with minimal services. Just go somewhere else. Don''t waste your time\nPS. If the doctor doesn''t feel like you''re worth her time, she literally won''t even see you. I went through the preliminary health check, waited, got a full body physical, waited some more and then the doctor never met me. Just had her assistant minions shoo me away.", "author": "Xia Bradford", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117479831943594923661/reviews"}, {"date": "2021-04-03T19:10:31.587522Z", "text": "Shifa Clinic volunteers are kind and empathetic to concerns of the community. They do a great job with accessibility and answering questions. Thank you for all your hard work!", "author": "Sonum Saeed", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109033540980340043134/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Most patients praise Shifa Community Clinic for its efficient, caring staff and community-focused services, though one review highlights significant dissatisfaction with service and doctor availability.", "about_highlight": "Shifa Community Clinic is a 501(c)(3) non-profit, student-run medical facility dedicated to delivering high quality, free, multilingual, and multicultural healthcare to the diverse, medically uninsured population of the Greater Sacramento Area. Founded with the mission to integrate socially and medically disenfranchised communities into the mainstream healthcare system, the clinic serves as a vital safety net for those without insurance. By fostering meaningful mentorship between undergraduate scholars and working professionals, the clinic enhances the patient experience while providing a valuable cultural learning environment for healthcare providers.", "appointment_url": "https://shifaclinic.org/contact/", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=10121713686719735316&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJfwNarTvRmoARFKYjj_iMd4w", "quality_missing": ["insurance", "team_members"], "search_keywords": ["community health center", "community health", "fqhc", "sliding scale", "medicaid", "medicare", "low cost", "trung tâm y tế cộng đồng", "커뮤니티 헬스", "社区医疗中心", "english", "vietnamese", "tiếng việt", "người việt", "bác sĩ việt", "primary care clinic", "dental clinic", "vaccine clinic", "women''s health clinic", "diabetic retinopathy clinic", "mind clinic", "dermatology clinic", "podiatry clinic", "legal clinic", "primary care", "dental", "preventive", "women''s health", "eye care", "mental health", "dermatology", "podiatry", "legal"], "cultural_context": "Shifa Community Clinic emphasizes multilingual and multicultural care, serving the diverse immigrant and refugee communities of the Greater Sacramento Area. The clinic offers language-accessible services and culturally responsive healthcare, exemplified by its Refugee Initiative and resources like ''Haram Medication'' information for Muslim patients.", "services_offered": [{"name": "Primary Care Clinic", "category": "Primary Care", "description": "Accessible healthcare to the uninsured.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Uninsured patients needing general medical care."}, {"name": "Dental Clinic", "category": "Dental", "description": "Extractions, cavity treatment, fillings.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Vaccine Clinic", "category": "Preventive", "description": "COVID-19 and Influenza vaccinations.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Women''s Health Clinic", "category": "Women''s Health", "description": "Exams, Pap smears, pregnancy tests.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Women needing reproductive health services."}, {"name": "Diabetic Retinopathy Clinic", "category": "Eye Care", "description": "Eye disease screening and management for diabetic patients.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Diabetic patients."}, {"name": "Mind Clinic", "category": "Mental Health", "description": "Support and destigmatize mental health.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients needing mental health support."}, {"name": "Dermatology Clinic", "category": "Dermatology", "description": "Dermatology clinic services.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Podiatry Clinic", "category": "Podiatry", "description": "Foot care for our diabetic patient population.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Diabetic patients."}, {"name": "Legal Clinic", "category": "Legal", "description": "Between healthcare and legal aid.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}], "short_description": "A student-run, non-profit clinic providing free, multilingual, and multicultural healthcare to the uninsured in Greater Sacramento.", "google_website_url": "https://shifaclinic.org/", "google_primary_type": "Medical Clinic", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": [], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "419 V St, Sacramento, CA 95818, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/116666446501069357392", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUONpeIs7coriUAiE_6Fr2IgxY2HX4gDJdHdCOmPeC5TemRKaYq=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Hamza Feroz Wani"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/102765494128966706648", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJI9S99dqbHfKruP3O5IvqJl6mmBarxguoEUGpUT-StmHZLaw=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Dave Abc"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-26T12:25:24.147308+00:00', 'shifa-community-clinic', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('5f42c7aa-e8ca-4032-ad86-f9a3479388a1', NULL, 'One Medical Primary Care Clinic - Union Station', 'One Medical’s Union Station office in Washington, DC offers exceptional primary care for adults of all ages, including seniors on Medicare. The practice focuses on building real relationships with patients and using technology to simplify every aspect of getting care. They are not just there for when you are sick or injured—they also help patients meet physical and mental health goals, manage chronic illnesses, and live a happier, healthier life. Through their affiliation with MedStar Health, patients can expect improved coordination of specialty care. Same- and next-day appointments are available and can be booked online without a membership.', '601 New Jersey Avenue NW, Suite 200, Washington, DC 20001', 'Washington', 'DC', '20001', '888-663-6331', ARRAY['English', 'Korean']::text[], 'Primary Care', FALSE, '{"images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/one-medical-primary-care-clinic-union-station-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/one-medical-primary-care-clinic-union-station-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/one-medical-primary-care-clinic-union-station-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/one-medical-primary-care-clinic-union-station-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/one-medical-primary-care-clinic-union-station-google-5.webp"], "rating": 4.6, "reviews": [{"date": "2026-01-05T17:16:39.791150725Z", "text": "Always a great environment - pleasant people, comfortable waiting area, and generally always on time appointments. The care and concern shown by the providers - you don’t feel like they are watching the clock and trying to answer only one question when arrived - they take their time, answer all your questions and show genuine concern to your issues. Happy with One Medical.", "author": "TL Minty", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100676630867485088773/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-01-13T17:29:21.746720720Z", "text": "All went well as usual with Dr. Noyes. I appreciate her health care support.\n\nI would like it noted that your front desk colleague Tania is a star. She is professional, engaging and an overall pleasue to communicate with.\n\nPlease  let her know that she is in the right place, at the right time, doing all the right things and is much appreciated by this patient.", "author": "Linda White", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111084126557594118456/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-07-31T18:53:42.098007949Z", "text": "Great first visit!  I was simply unable to get an appointment after being out of the DMV area for four years.  One Medical was recommended by another provider and I was able to get in almost the next day.  Had sort of a spa feel in the waiting room — very chill with nice staff and none of the usual hassles.  The PA went over everything thoroughly; I was able to do lab work in-office immediately after; and then the PA contacted me through the app three days later to go through the results.  My wife has now signed up based on this experience.", "author": "Duncan Walker", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105724661744986720582/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-08-22T16:52:54.715569621Z", "text": "My experience at One Medical - Union Market has been  professional and courteous from the moment I signed in downstairs wherein the gentleman at the front desk handles the elevator ….the people at the desk once I enter One Medical office have been pleasant … my wait time is 15 minutes for my appointment either seeing doctor, blood work, then the turn around time for results is rarely more than a day or two. It would behoove anyone seeking medical advise to make an appointment. I have seen Dr. Baik on several occasions and been very pleased.", "author": "Mary Grant", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102968166343842926809/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-09-11T18:37:04.350513095Z", "text": "I was incredibly impressed by my One Medical experience! Everything from making the appointment, to how I was greeted by the receptionist, to the thorough care by my provider was really a wonderful experience. Extremely happy with my service and definitely would recommend!", "author": "Sonia Swaray", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100212567548699443237/reviews"}], "website": "https://onemedical.com/locations/dc/unionstation", "location": {"latitude": 38.8978664, "longitude": -77.01145009999999}, "services": ["Everyday and preventative care", "Physical exams (Live Well visits)", "Women''s health", "Mental health"], "insurance": {"notes": "Accepts self-pay for those without insurance or with insurance where One Medical is out of network. Use insurance finder to check specific plan.", "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": true, "accepted_networks": ["Most commercial plans", "Medicare"], "out_of_network_available": true, "accepts_private_insurance": true}, "highlights": [{"title": "Same/next-day appointments", "detail": "Same/next-day appointments available. Book online, no membership needed. Appointments are billed to you or your insurance; copays or deductibles may apply.", "category": "convenience"}, {"title": "Affiliated with MedStar Health", "detail": "Improved coordination of specialty care through their affiliation with MedStar Health.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Accepts Medicare and commercial plans", "detail": "Takes most commercial plans as well as Original Medicare with or without most Medicare supplement plans and select Medicare Advantage plans.", "category": "insurance"}], "price_tier": "$$", "source_url": "https://onemedical.com/locations/dc/unionstation?y_source=1_MTA1Mzk0OTQzMC03MTUtbG9jYXRpb24ud2Vic2l0ZQ%3D%3D", "appointment": {"booking_note": null, "appointment_url": "https://health.amazon.com/onemedical/service-areas/dc?cta=omdc_office_gs_hl_dc_kst", "new_patient_note": null, "phone_booking_available": true, "online_booking_available": true, "free_consultation_available": null}, "open_sunday": false, "scout_query": "Korean speaking medical clinic in Washington, D.C.", "search_text": "primary care | family doctor | general practitioner | annual physical | checkup | bác sĩ gia đình | khám tổng quát | nội khoa | 내과 | 가정의학과 | 家庭医生 | 全科医生 | 内科 | english | korean | 한국어 | 한인 | 한국말 | everyday and preventative care | physical exams (live well visits) | women''s health | mental health | preventive | most commercial plans | medicare | rose nganga, md | physician | tyra smith, do | drew roenneburg, pa-c | physician assistant | chi chi udochi, md | esther baik, md | michelle patterson, np | nurse practitioner | jennifer barnwell, np | shobhna shukla, np | jillian noyes, md | sarah barnhart, np | amy stulman, np", "google_types": ["medical_clinic", "medical_center", "hospital", "doctor", "health", "point_of_interest", "service", "establishment"], "open_weekend": false, "rating_count": 152, "team_members": [{"name": "Rose Nganga, MD", "role": "Physician", "bio_snippet": null, "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Tyra Smith, DO", "role": "Physician", "bio_snippet": null, "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Drew Roenneburg, PA-C", "role": "Physician Assistant", "bio_snippet": null, "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Chi Chi Udochi, MD", "role": "Physician", "bio_snippet": null, "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Esther Baik, MD", "role": "Physician", "bio_snippet": null, "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Michelle Patterson, NP", "role": "Nurse Practitioner", "bio_snippet": null, "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Jennifer Barnwell, NP", "role": "Nurse Practitioner", "bio_snippet": null, "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Shobhna Shukla, NP", "role": "Nurse Practitioner", "bio_snippet": null, "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Jillian Noyes, MD", "role": "Physician", "bio_snippet": null, "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Sarah Barnhart, NP", "role": "Nurse Practitioner", "bio_snippet": null, "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Amy Stulman, NP", "role": "Nurse Practitioner", "bio_snippet": null, "languages_spoken": []}], "open_saturday": false, "quality_score": 100, "working_hours": {"friday": "8:00 AM – 5:30 PM", "monday": "8:00 AM – 5:30 PM", "sunday": "Closed", "tuesday": "8:00 AM – 5:30 PM", "saturday": "Closed", "thursday": "8:00 AM – 4:00 PM", "wednesday": "8:00 AM – 5:30 PM"}, "gallery_images": ["https://www.onemedical.com/media/images/dc-unionstation-large.original.jpg"], "review_profile": {"rating": 4.6, "source": "google", "themes": [{"theme": "Friendly staff", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients highlight friendly staff in their feedback."}, {"theme": "Clear explanations", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients highlight clear explanations in their feedback."}, {"theme": "Comfortable visits", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients highlight comfortable visits in their feedback."}, {"theme": "Strong results", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients highlight strong results in their feedback."}], "summary": "One Medical Primary Care Clinic - Union Station has a 4.6 star Google rating from 152 Google reviews. Patients commonly mention friendly staff, clear explanations, comfortable visits, strong results.", "review_count": 152, "concern_themes": [], "positive_themes": [], "featured_reviews": [{"date": "2026-01-05T17:16:39.791150725Z", "text": "Always a great environment - pleasant people, comfortable waiting area, and generally always on time appointments. The care and concern shown by the providers - you don’t feel like they are watching the clock and trying to answer only one question when arrived - they take their time, answer all your questions and show genuine concern to your issues. Happy with One Medical.", "author": "TL Minty", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100676630867485088773/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-01-13T17:29:21.746720720Z", "text": "All went well as usual with Dr. Noyes. I appreciate her health care support.\n\nI would like it noted that your front desk colleague Tania is a star. She is professional, engaging and an overall pleasue to communicate with.\n\nPlease  let her know that she is in the right place, at the right time, doing all the right things and is much appreciated by this patient.", "author": "Linda White", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111084126557594118456/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-07-31T18:53:42.098007949Z", "text": "Great first visit!  I was simply unable to get an appointment after being out of the DMV area for four years.  One Medical was recommended by another provider and I was able to get in almost the next day.  Had sort of a spa feel in the waiting room — very chill with nice staff and none of the usual hassles.  The PA went over everything thoroughly; I was able to do lab work in-office immediately after; and then the PA contacted me through the app three days later to go through the results.  My wife has now signed up based on this experience.", "author": "Duncan Walker", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105724661744986720582/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-08-22T16:52:54.715569621Z", "text": "My experience at One Medical - Union Market has been  professional and courteous from the moment I signed in downstairs wherein the gentleman at the front desk handles the elevator ….the people at the desk once I enter One Medical office have been pleasant … my wait time is 15 minutes for my appointment either seeing doctor, blood work, then the turn around time for results is rarely more than a day or two. It would behoove anyone seeking medical advise to make an appointment. I have seen Dr. Baik on several occasions and been very pleased.", "author": "Mary Grant", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102968166343842926809/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-09-11T18:37:04.350513095Z", "text": "I was incredibly impressed by my One Medical experience! Everything from making the appointment, to how I was greeted by the receptionist, to the thorough care by my provider was really a wonderful experience. Extremely happy with my service and definitely would recommend!", "author": "Sonia Swaray", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100212567548699443237/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "One Medical Primary Care Clinic - Union Station has a 4.6 star Google rating from 152 Google reviews. Patients commonly mention friendly staff, clear explanations, comfortable visits, strong results.", "about_highlight": "One Medical’s Union Station office in Washington, DC offers exceptional primary care for adults of all ages, including seniors on Medicare. The practice focuses on building real relationships with patients and using technology to simplify every aspect of getting care. They are not just there for when you are sick or injured—they also help patients meet physical and mental health goals, manage chronic illnesses, and live a happier, healthier life. Through their affiliation with MedStar Health, patients can expect improved coordination of specialty care. Same- and next-day appointments are available and can be booked online without a membership.", "appointment_url": "https://health.amazon.com/onemedical/service-areas/dc?cta=omdc_office_gs_hl_dc_kst", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=9132732940084710297&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJLYRC8om3t4kRmQtCwjj8vX4", "quality_missing": [], "search_keywords": ["primary care", "family doctor", "general practitioner", "annual physical", "checkup", "bác sĩ gia đình", "khám tổng quát", "nội khoa", "내과", "가정의학과", "家庭医生", "全科医生", "内科", "english", "korean", "한국어", "한인", "한국말", "everyday and preventative care", "physical exams (live well visits)", "women''s health", "mental health", "preventive", "most commercial plans", "medicare", "rose nganga, md", "physician", "tyra smith, do", "drew roenneburg, pa-c", "physician assistant", "chi chi udochi, md", "esther baik, md", "michelle patterson, np", "nurse practitioner", "jennifer barnwell, np", "shobhna shukla, np", "jillian noyes, md", "sarah barnhart, np", "amy stulman, np"], "services_offered": [{"name": "Everyday and preventative care", "category": "Preventive", "description": "State-of-the-art screening, disease prevention, and lifestyle advice. Diagnose and treat a wide spectrum of illnesses including flu, rashes, and more.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Physical exams (Live Well visits)", "category": "Preventive", "description": "Personalized physicals guided by questions in the app about health issues that matter most, including mental health, diet, exercise, and sexual health.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Women''s health", "category": "Primary Care", "description": "Primary care providers handle most women''s health issues, including birth control, sexual health, cancer screenings, menopause, preventive care, aging, and gynecological problems.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Mental health", "category": "Mental Health", "description": "Suite of mental health services – Mindset by One Medical – to help with depression, anxiety, insomnia, or more complex concerns.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}], "short_description": "One Medical’s Union Station office provides primary care for adults of all ages, including seniors on Medicare, with same/next-day appointments available and a focus on building real relationships through technology.", "google_website_url": "https://onemedical.com/locations/dc/unionstation?y_source=1_MTA1Mzk0OTQzMC03MTUtbG9jYXRpb24ud2Vic2l0ZQ%3D%3D", "insurance_accepted": ["Most commercial plans", "Medicare"], "google_primary_type": "Medical Clinic", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": ["Rose Nganga, MD", "Tyra Smith, DO", "Drew Roenneburg, PA-C", "Chi Chi Udochi, MD", "Esther Baik, MD", "Michelle Patterson, NP", "Jennifer Barnwell, NP", "Shobhna Shukla, NP", "Jillian Noyes, MD", "Sarah Barnhart, NP", "Amy Stulman, NP"], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "601 New Jersey Ave NW #200, Washington, DC 20001, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/108195427183664780122", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWYEqMz8lzKoAnBuFWj0HEHHofpG3wJ_NMxtMtaAOYPZOX6RZcZ=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "One Medical Primary Care Clinic - Union Station"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/108195427183664780122", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWYEqMz8lzKoAnBuFWj0HEHHofpG3wJ_NMxtMtaAOYPZOX6RZcZ=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "One Medical Primary Care Clinic - Union Station"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/102167855366124860477", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXpzYXFsRmh_V1GM7BMArq_9dDad-smTX_GP8linTM6BZ_bgYFMTA=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Shomari Daley"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/108195427183664780122", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWYEqMz8lzKoAnBuFWj0HEHHofpG3wJ_NMxtMtaAOYPZOX6RZcZ=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "One Medical Primary Care Clinic - Union Station"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/102167855366124860477", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXpzYXFsRmh_V1GM7BMArq_9dDad-smTX_GP8linTM6BZ_bgYFMTA=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Shomari Daley"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-26T11:48:01.689275+00:00', 'one-medical-primary-care-clinic-union-station', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('a99b2033-8d9c-4b09-8945-bdcc447941ff', NULL, 'Serrano Eye Center Medical Group', 'Serrano Eye Center Medical Group is a comprehensive ophthalmology practice serving the Los Angeles community with board-certified specialists and over 20 years of experience. The center offers advanced diagnostic and surgical care for cataracts, glaucoma, corneal conditions, and retinal diseases using state-of-the-art technology. Patients benefit from thorough eye exams, same-day urgent appointments, and a friendly, knowledgeable staff dedicated to personalized vision care.
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('5ac4950a-9d65-4ce7-821c-16f0c4a59a5b', NULL, 'Advanced Eye Physician 永 明 眼 科中心', 'Advanced Eye Physician, established in 1996, is a medically-driven eye care practice with two locations in New York (Manhattan and Flushing). The team of highly skilled physicians uses the latest technology to provide comprehensive eye care—from routine exams and myopia management to dry eye therapy and cataract surgery—in a friendly, welcoming environment. The practice is committed to personalized, compassionate care for every patient.', '99 Elizabeth Street 2nd Floor, New York, NY 10013', 'New York', 'NY', '10013', '(212) 227-8837', ARRAY['English', 'Fuzhounese', 'Cantonese', 'Chinese']::text[], 'Ophthalmology', FALSE, '{"images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/advanced-eye-physician-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/advanced-eye-physician-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/advanced-eye-physician-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/advanced-eye-physician-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/advanced-eye-physician-google-5.webp"], "rating": 4.6, "reviews": [{"date": "2026-05-02T16:36:58.802313852Z", "text": "Amazing service. I was traveling and had an emergency with my Ortho-K lenses, and they stepped in immediately to help and figure everything out without any hesitation. The front desk and staff were wonderful. I highly recommend them! You can really tell even from a small interaction, that they are reliable and responsible.", "author": "Katrina", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101709160558891299461/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-12-05T22:08:28.981179375Z", "text": "The team at Advanced Eye Physician were awesome, especially Nicole Chen.  Nicole is incredibly friendly and efficient!  She explained everything clearly, fixed my issue quickly, and went above and beyond. Highly recommend Nicole for new glasses frame.", "author": "george lee", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105809501977647583530/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-03-30T19:14:11.672211Z", "text": "So glad I found this office. Got scratched in the eye and had to be seen immediately and was lucky enough to find this office to be open on Sunday. The front desk was very professional and caring when they heard about the scratch and made the effort to squeeze me in when someone had a last minute cancellation, so gratefully I got checked the same day. Dr Tsai was very nice and resolved the problem and I will be returning for a comprehensive eye exam. The staff also speak English/Cantonese/mandarin and will work with you to make sure you’re taken care of, so definitely recommend this office.", "author": "Xiali Shi Gillette", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101577453350243955691/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-11-30T20:51:35.987868471Z", "text": "What an amazing place! I slept in my contacts accidentally and developed a corneal ulcer, which needs immediate attention. They work so hard and are one of the only places open on a Sunday, which is when I needed help! Dr. Tsai has incredible bedside manner, and she carefully explained to me the treatment process and prescribed what Id need so I would have it ready within the hour! Thinking of now making this my regular optician and place for glasses/contacts as everyone seemed very pleased!", "author": "Danielle Neil", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105633590655276438944/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-11-17T00:20:12.771353105Z", "text": "The wait time was extremely long just to see the doctor for a few minutes—with a nasty, apathetic attitude on top of it. The whole experience was very stressful and unpleasant. Wouldn’t recommend, management really needs some work.", "author": "Julia", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105112342953506726717/reviews"}], "website": "https://eyecure.com/", "location": {"latitude": 40.718614099999996, "longitude": -73.99587439999999}, "services": ["Adult & Senior Eye Exams", "Children''s Eye Exams", "Diabetic Eye Exams", "General Ophthalmology", "Glaucoma Treatment", "Cataract Treatment", "Myopia Management", "Digital Eye Strain", "Age-Related Macular Degeneration", "Emergency Eye Care", "Dry Eye Therapy", "IPL Therapy", "Aesthetic Treatments"], "insurance": {"notes": "Insurance and payment information is available on the Insurance & Payment Information page, but no specific plans are listed on this page.", "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": [], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": false}, "highlights": [{"title": "Established 1996", "detail": "Serving the community for over 25 years with medically-driven eye care.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Two Convenient Locations", "detail": "Offices in New York (Chinatown) and Flushing, NY.", "category": "convenience"}, {"title": "Multilingual Staff", "detail": "Staff speak Cantonese, Fuzhounese, and other languages to serve diverse patients.", "category": "culture"}, {"title": "Comprehensive Eye Care", "detail": "From routine exams to cataract surgery, glaucoma treatment, and dry eye therapy.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Latest Technology", "detail": "Uses advanced technology including OptiLight by Lumenis for dry eye and laser cataract surgery.", "category": "technology"}], "price_tier": "$$", "source_url": "http://eyecure.com/", "appointment": {"booking_note": "Request an appointment today!", "appointment_url": "http://eyecure.com/appointments/", "new_patient_note": null, "phone_booking_available": true, "online_booking_available": true, "free_consultation_available": null}, "open_sunday": true, "scout_query": "Chinese eye clinic in New York, NY", "search_text": "ophthalmology | optometry | optometrist | eye doctor | eye exam | cataract | lasik | glasses | nhãn khoa | khám mắt | bác sĩ mắt | 안과 | 검안 | 眼科 | 配镜 | english | fuzhounese | cantonese | chinese | 粤语 | 广东话 | tiếng quảng đông | mandarin | 中文 | 普通话 | 国语 | 华人 | adult & senior eye exams | children''s eye exams | diabetic eye exams | general ophthalmology | glaucoma treatment | cataract treatment | myopia management | digital eye strain | age-related macular degeneration | emergency eye care | dry eye therapy | ipl therapy | aesthetic treatments | preventive | specialty | emergency | dry eye | aesthetics | dr. tsai/choi | physician", "google_types": ["medical_clinic", "store", "health", "point_of_interest", "service", "establishment"], "open_weekend": true, "rating_count": 218, "team_members": [{"name": "Dr. Tsai/Choi", "role": "Physician", "bio_snippet": "Mentioned in a patient review as being attentive and friendly, and for performing cataract surgery.", "languages_spoken": []}], "language_note": "The practice serves a diverse community and has staff who speak multiple languages and dialects including Cantonese and Fuzhounese, as noted in patient reviews. The website also offers a Chinese (Simplified) language option, reflecting a commitment to Asian and immigrant patient populations.", "open_saturday": true, "quality_score": 95, "working_hours": {"friday": "9:00 AM – 4:00 PM", "monday": "9:00 AM – 4:00 PM", "sunday": "9:00 AM – 4:00 PM", "tuesday": "9:00 AM – 4:00 PM", "saturday": "9:00 AM – 4:00 PM", "thursday": "9:00 AM – 4:00 PM", "wednesday": "9:00 AM – 4:00 PM"}, "gallery_images": ["http://eyecure.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/AEP-Logo-removebg-preview.png", "http://eyecure.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/women-focus-on-eyes-1920-1.jpg"], "review_profile": {"rating": 4.6, "source": "google", "themes": [{"theme": "Compassionate care", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients highlight compassionate care in their feedback."}, {"theme": "Friendly staff", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients highlight friendly staff in their feedback."}, {"theme": "Clear explanations", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients highlight clear explanations in their feedback."}, {"theme": "Strong results", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients highlight strong results in their feedback."}], "summary": "Advanced Eye Physician 永 明 眼 科中心 has a 4.6 star Google rating from 218 Google reviews. Patients commonly mention compassionate care, friendly staff, clear explanations, strong results.", "review_count": 218, "concern_themes": ["Waiting area cramped and chaotic"], "positive_themes": ["Attentive and friendly doctors", "Multilingual staff (Cantonese, Fuzhounese)", "Excellent cataract surgery outcomes", "Welcoming and friendly staff"], "featured_reviews": [{"date": "2026-05-02T16:36:58.802313852Z", "text": "Amazing service. I was traveling and had an emergency with my Ortho-K lenses, and they stepped in immediately to help and figure everything out without any hesitation. The front desk and staff were wonderful. I highly recommend them! You can really tell even from a small interaction, that they are reliable and responsible.", "author": "Katrina", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101709160558891299461/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-12-05T22:08:28.981179375Z", "text": "Th