in;ache;condition;treatment;therapy"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/112549522030513260996", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX8496zvDovTIVhkM2c8UHkLld_FFjdh7fxOZhvgmHYyiSH2ns=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Fubao Eye Adhesive Patch－dry;eye;disease;floaters;eyelid;dryness;syndrome;eyeball;pain;ache;condition;treatment;therapy"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/115989303114142369896", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVml1aLyEa0OeqvU6WijVy26f08Aaid7X4p1KnYBiuAgF5dsN2jBg=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Grace Hong"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/112549522030513260996", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX8496zvDovTIVhkM2c8UHkLld_FFjdh7fxOZhvgmHYyiSH2ns=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Fubao Eye Adhesive Patch－dry;eye;disease;floaters;eyelid;dryness;syndrome;eyeball;pain;ache;condition;treatment;therapy"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-26T13:30:26.202218+00:00', 'new-welling-physical-therapy-and-acupuncture-clinic', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('1f6e17d4-baa2-40d1-8251-81c3d2468543', NULL, 'Advanced Eye Care', 'Advanced Eye Care is a comprehensive eye care center with three locations in New York City: Manhattan''s Chinatown, Queens'' Flushing, and Brooklyn. The practice offers a wide range of services including cataract surgery, LASIK, glaucoma treatments, corneal care, and premium IOLs. Their team of board-certified ophthalmologists includes sub-specialists in glaucoma, retina, and corneal disease, with fellowship-trained surgeons.
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('58f57278-8855-44f0-bdef-130fb63680ca', NULL, 'Dallas Acupuncture Clinic', 'Dallas Acupuncture Clinic was founded by Dr. Qiong Bai, O.M.D., L.Ac., over 32 years ago in Dallas, Texas. The clinic''s mission is to provide professional acupuncture and Traditional Chinese Medicine (TCM) treatments, welcoming all walks of life. They believe each patient deserves special care and strive to help everyone attain their highest levels of physical and mental well-being. Thousands of patients from all nationalities have responded well to their treatments. The clinic is led by Dr. Bai, a physician from China and a National Board-Certified Acupuncturist (NCCAOM) who earned his medical degree from Shanghai University of Traditional Chinese Medicine in 1984. With over 40 years of total clinical experience, he has treated over 160,000 satisfied patients. Dr. Bai has been recognized by major media outlets including The Dallas Morning News, D-Magazine, ABC, CBS, NBC, Fox News, and NPR, and is considered one of DFW''s top-rated acupuncturists. The clinic offers a safe, effective, and holistic approach to health, with strong specializations in pain management and fertility treatment.', '12900 Preston Road Suite 1116, Dallas, Texas 75230', 'Dallas', 'TX', '75230', '(214) 739-5535', ARRAY['Chinese', 'English']::text[], 'Acupuncture & TCM', FALSE, '{"fax": "(214) 739-5502", "email": "bai@acupuncturetx.com", "images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/dallas-acupuncture-clinic-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/dallas-acupuncture-clinic-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/dallas-acupuncture-clinic-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/dallas-acupuncture-clinic-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/dallas-acupuncture-clinic-google-5.webp"], "rating": 4.9, "reviews": [{"date": "2025-12-12T16:16:19.608868394Z", "text": "I had a terrible bout of insomnia and needed to get in quickly to see if acupuncture could help. Dr. Jane saw me that day and I had relief immediately. I’ve been about 7 times and am finally sleeping well every night. She works with my schedule which has been hectic this time of year. I’m so grateful to have found her.", "author": "shannon", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107739411343398034026/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-06-03T03:02:30.762571Z", "text": "I’ve seen several acupuncturists in Dallas over the years, and Dr. Bai is by far the most skilled and experienced. He consistently goes above and beyond to provide exceptional care. Without a doubt, he is the best acupuncturist in the DFW area.", "author": "Scott Golden", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110774796755954862638/reviews"}, {"date": "2022-12-10T21:00:05.514035Z", "text": "Dr. Bai is one of the best acupuncture doctors I have seen! He is very knowledgeable and patient. I have started to see him since last year. I see and feel big improvements on my conditions in the first a few sessions. Definitely recommend him to my friends! Thank you! Dr. Bai", "author": "Sasha Alexander", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102782886702769119972/reviews"}, {"date": "2024-03-02T18:30:38.254625Z", "text": "This doctor is amazing!!! He’s very knowledgeable and experienced. First time I ever experienced acupuncture and I felt so comfortable and relaxed. The environment is very peaceful as well.\nI 100% recommend this place to anyone with any type of health problems.", "author": "Rachel Yankson", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113466330786343390729/reviews"}, {"date": "2020-05-21T17:06:26.563097Z", "text": "Dr. Bai is very professional and the new office setting is exceptionally relaxing. I had tennis elbow and some other pains. Dr. Bai was able to treat my problems successfully. He is knowledgeable in the art of integrating Eastern and Western medicine. I still go to him to help me relax, because I sometimes feel anxious before presenting at my firm''s corporate meetings. You can tell that his decades of experience of practicing acupuncture and herbal medicine pays significant dividends for his patients. I just visited this week, and his COVID-19 protocols are superb. Besides the standard masks and alcohol gels/cleaning, his staff uses an ultraviolet ozone machine every night to thoroughly clean the office space.", "author": "Charles Johnston", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110838104590568382867/reviews"}], "website": "http://acupuncturetx.com/", "location": {"latitude": 32.9239708, "longitude": -96.8028995}, "services": ["Pain Management", "Neurological Conditions", "Fertility and Women''s Health", "Facial Cosmetic Acupuncture", "Digestive Health", "Emotional and Mental Health", "Respiratory Health", "Skin Conditions", "Addiction Recovery", "Cancer Support", "Chinese Herbs"], "insurance": {"notes": "We are an acupuncture provider for several major health insurance plans, including BlueCross BlueShield, Aetna, UnitedHealthcare, and more.", "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": ["Blue Cross Blue Shield", "Aetna", "UnitedHealthcare"], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": true}, "highlights": [{"title": "32+ Years of Experience", "detail": "Over 32 years serving the Dallas community with professional acupuncture and TCM treatments.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "160,000+ Patients Treated", "detail": "Over 160,000 satisfied patients have responded well to treatments at the clinic.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Media Recognized", "detail": "Dr. Bai has been recognized by The Dallas Morning News, D-Magazine, ABC, CBS, NBC, Fox News, and NPR.", "category": "reviews"}, {"title": "Insurance Accepted", "detail": "Accepts BlueCross BlueShield, Aetna, UnitedHealthcare, and other major plans.", "category": "insurance"}], "price_tier": "$$", "source_url": "http://acupuncturetx.com/", "appointment": {"booking_note": "Please give us a call @ (214)739-5535 to schedule an appointment.", "appointment_url": null, "new_patient_note": null, "phone_booking_available": true, "online_booking_available": false, "free_consultation_available": null}, "open_sunday": false, "scout_query": "Chinese clinic in Dallas, TX", "search_text": "acupuncture & tcm | acupuncture | chinese medicine | tcm | herbal medicine | cupping | pain relief | châm cứu | đông y | y học cổ truyền | 한의원 | 침술 | 한약 | 中医 | 针灸 | 中药 | chinese | mandarin | cantonese | 中文 | 普通话 | 国语 | 粤语 | 广东话 | 华人 | english | pain management | neurological conditions | fertility and women''s health | facial cosmetic acupuncture | digestive health | emotional and mental health | respiratory health | skin conditions | addiction recovery | cancer support | chinese herbs | cosmetic | traditional chinese medicine | blue cross blue shield | aetna | unitedhealthcare | dr. qiong bai | founder and licensed acupuncturist", "google_types": ["medical_clinic", "health", "point_of_interest", "establishment"], "open_weekend": true, "rating_count": 11, "team_members": [{"name": "Dr. Qiong Bai", "role": "Founder and Licensed Acupuncturist", "bio_snippet": "Physician from China and National Board-Certifie