cupuncture and integrative medicine."}, {"theme": "Treatment Outcomes", "mentions": 4, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients report significant relief from conditions like insomnia, pain, and anxiety after just a few sessions."}, {"theme": "Facility Environment", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "The clinic is described as peaceful, relaxing, and meticulously maintained, enhancing the overall experience."}, {"theme": "Staff Professionalism", "mentions": 2, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients appreciate the practitioners'' professionalism, patience, and ability to accommodate busy schedules."}, {"theme": "Communication", "mentions": 1, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "One reviewer noted feeling comfortable and well-informed during their first acupuncture session."}], "summary": "Patients consistently praise Dallas Acupuncture Clinic for its skilled practitioners, effective treatments, and relaxing environment, with many noting significant improvements in their health conditions.", "review_count": 11, "concern_themes": [], "positive_themes": [], "featured_reviews": [{"date": "2025-12-12T16:16:19.608868394Z", "text": "I had a terrible bout of insomnia and needed to get in quickly to see if acupuncture could help. Dr. Jane saw me that day and I had relief immediately. I’ve been about 7 times and am finally sleeping well every night. She works with my schedule which has been hectic this time of year. I’m so grateful to have found her.", "author": "shannon", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107739411343398034026/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-06-03T03:02:30.762571Z", "text": "I’ve seen several acupuncturists in Dallas over the years, and Dr. Bai is by far the most skilled and experienced. He consistently goes above and beyond to provide exceptional care. Without a doubt, he is the best acupuncturist in the DFW area.", "author": "Scott Golden", "rating": 5, "source