Dallas Acupuncture Clinic for its skilled practitioners, effective treatments, and relaxing environment, with many noting significant improvements in their health conditions.", "about_highlight": "Dallas Acupuncture Clinic was founded by Dr. Qiong Bai, O.M.D., L.Ac., over 32 years ago in Dallas, Texas. The clinic''s mission is to provide professional acupuncture and Traditional Chinese Medicine (TCM) treatments, welcoming all walks of life. They believe each patient deserves special care and strive to help everyone attain their highest levels of physical and mental well-being. Thousands of patients from all nationalities have responded well to their treatments. The clinic is led by Dr. Bai, a physician from China and a National Board-Certified Acupuncturist (NCCAOM) who earned his medical degree from Shanghai University of Traditional Chinese Medicine in 1984. With over 40 years of total clinical experience, he has treated over 160,000 satisfied patients. Dr. Bai has been recognized by major media outlets including The Dallas Morning News, D-Magazine, ABC, CBS, NBC, Fox News, and NPR, and is considered one of DFW''s top-rated acupuncturists. The clinic offers a safe, effective, and holistic approach to health, with strong specializations in pain management and fertility treatment.", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=5314003885199012405&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJByMqfyeeToYRNTJV-GAiv0k", "quality_missing": ["appointment_url"], "search_keywords": ["acupuncture & tcm", "acupuncture", "chinese medicine", "tcm", "herbal medicine", "cupping", "pain relief", "châm cứu", "đông y", "y học cổ truyền", "한의원", "침술", "한약", "中医", "针灸", "中药", "chinese", "mandarin", "cantonese", "中文", "普通话", "国语", "粤语", "广东话", "华人", "english", "pain management", "neurological conditions", "fertility and women''s health", "facial cosmetic acupuncture", "digestive health", "emotional and mental health", "respiratory health", "skin conditions", "addiction recovery", "cancer support", "chinese herbs", "cosmetic", "traditional chinese medicine", "blue cross blue shield", "aetna", "unitedhealthcare", "dr. qiong bai", "founder and licensed acupuncturist"], "cultural_context": "The clinic is founded by Dr. Qiong Bai, a physician from China who earned his medical degree from Shanghai University of Traditional Chinese Medicine. He is one of the pioneering licensed acupuncturists in Dallas, Texas, and has extensively taught and practiced Acupuncture and Traditional Chinese Medicine in both China and the United States. The clinic offers Traditional Chinese Medicine (TCM) treatments and Chinese herbs, reflecting its deep roots in Asian medical traditions.", "services_offered": [{"name": "Pain Management", "category": "Acupuncture", "description": "Comprehensive treatment for acute and chronic pain, including headaches, back and neck pain, arthritis, tendonitis, plantar fasciitis, frozen shoulder, and bursitis.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Neurological Conditions", "category": "Acupuncture", "description": "Specialized care for stroke rehabilitation, Multiple sclerosis (MS), Parkinson''s disease, muscle spasms, tremors, vertigo (Meniere''s disease, BPPV), tinnitus, Bell''s palsy, neuropathy, and neuralgias (including trigeminal neuralgia).", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Fertility and Women''s Health", "category": "Acupuncture", "description": "Holistic support for infertility, IVF preparation and enhancement, and management of polycystic ovary syndrome (PCOS).", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Facial Cosmetic Acupuncture", "category": "Cosmetic", "description": "Facial rejuvenation therapy designed to promote a youthful, natural appearance, enhance the appearance of the skin and face, and improve overall skin health through the stimulation of blood flow and collagen production.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Digestive Health", "category": "Acupuncture", "description": "Gentle, effective treatment for constipation, diarrhea, and other gastrointestinal disorders.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Emotional and Mental Health", "category": "Acupuncture", "description": "Supportive care for stress, depression, anxiety, panic disorder, sleep disturbances, and insomnia.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Respiratory Health", "category": "Acupuncture", "description": "Relief for allergies, sinusitis, asthma, chronic cough, emphysema, and COPD.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Skin Conditions", "category": "Acupuncture", "description": "Customized treatments for acne, eczema, hives, psoriasis, pruritus, and urticaria.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Addiction Recovery", "category": "Acupuncture", "description": "Acupuncture-assisted care for overcoming dependency on drugs, alcohol, and tobacco.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Cancer Support", "category": "Acupuncture", "description": "Acupuncture is used as an adjunctive treatment to help reduce certain side effects of cancer treatment, including anxiety, depression, dry mouth, nausea, vomiting, pain, fatigue, sleep problems, and peripheral neuropathy.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Chinese Herbs", "category": "Traditional Chinese Medicine", "description": "Use of Chinese herbal medicine as part of TCM treatments.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}], "short_description": "Dallas Acupuncture Clinic, founded by Dr. Qiong Bai, O.M.D., L.Ac. over 32 years ago, provides professional acupuncture and Traditional Chinese Medicine treatments with a focus on pain management and fertility.", "google_website_url": "http://acupuncturetx.com/", "insurance_accepted": ["Blue Cross Blue Shield", "Aetna", "UnitedHealthcare"], "google_primary_type": "Medical Clinic", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": ["Dr. Qiong Bai"], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "accepting_new_patients": true, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "12900 Preston Rd Ste 1116, Dallas, TX 75230, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/117159399626007866686", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJxIFHuWQW-iNfrBeV1r0k59jIgLJMnp8lVGDdfk9Wic386Qg=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Dallas Acupuncture Clinic"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/117159399626007866686", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJxIFHuWQW-iNfrBeV1r0k59jIgLJMnp8lVGDdfk9Wic386Qg=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Dallas Acupuncture Clinic"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/117159399626007866686", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJxIFHuWQW-iNfrBeV1r0k59jIgLJMnp8lVGDdfk9Wic386Qg=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Dallas Acupuncture Clinic"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/117159399626007866686", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJxIFHuWQW-iNfrBeV1r0k59jIgLJMnp8lVGDdfk9Wic386Qg=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Dallas Acupuncture Clinic"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/117159399626007866686", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJxIFHuWQW-iNfrBeV1r0k59jIgLJMnp8lVGDdfk9Wic386Qg=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Dallas Acupuncture Clinic"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-25T20:54:48.302587+00:00', 'dallas-acupuncture-clinic', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('f927e224-4f3f-4464-8ee0-a65f7d63931c', NULL, 'Comprehensive Cardiology', 'Comprehensive Cardiology provides expert cardiovascular care through Dr. Vince T. Nguyen, a board-certified cardiologist with over 20 years of experience. Dr. Nguyen offers a full spectrum of services including cardiac imaging, interventional cardiology, hypertension management, preventive cardiology, and treatment for structural heart disease and peripheral vascular disease. Committed to patient-centered care, the practice accepts new patients and offers video visits for added convenience. With hospital affiliations at Houston Methodist Hospital and Houston Methodist Clear Lake Hospital, patients receive seamless, high-quality care across multiple locations in the Houston area.', '2200 Nasa Parkway Suite 220, Houston, TX 77058', 'Houston', 'TX', '77058', '281.333.9200', ARRAY['English', 'Vietnamese']::text[], 'Cardiology', TRUE, '{"images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/comprehensive-cardiology.webp"], "rating": 4.8, "reviews": [{"date": "2025-11-20T20:33:32.578276374Z", "text": "This location and the friendswood one are horrible at answering the phones, and making sure you’re checked in. As well as have attitude when you’re trying to figure stuff out, or correct them on the amount of times you’ve called/they’ve called, like i don’t have my call logs saying the amount of times i’ve been contacted by them. I love Dr.Nguyen but the staff is awful. not to mention the amount of times i’ve checked in at the window but they haven’t checked me in is horrible.", "author": "Aurora Smith", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114129528671809760440/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-03-13T02:39:28.194440287Z", "text": "Love the Doctor and NPs, they are very personal and take the time to get the know the patient.", "author": "B G", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111884452794448775083/reviews"}, {"date": "2022-02-16T17:54:14.963050Z", "text": "My every appointment has been very pleasant. Dr NGUYEN has definitely extended my good health.  I feel like a young man.  He explains on layman terms any problems and treatment options.  Very caring in deed.   The staff is equally caring, making sure the info that us required by the doctor is gathered.  Great staff, no exclusions.", "author": "Kenneth Aiken", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112772500456233691614/reviews"}, {"date": "2023-03-24T22:08:30.881421Z", "text": "I had an appointment for getting a Cardiac Echo at the office yesterday. Being a retired physician myself, I am fully aware of the fact that it is impossible to predict if you can be on time. When I arrived 30 minutes early, I expected to wait and even take a nap in the waiting area. The receptionist was polite and friendly. But the surprise was that there was only one person waiting who was ahead of me. He went inside for the test as I sat down, right on time. Came out in about 20 minutes. Next thing I know is that exactly on time, Hannah the Echo Technologist comes out and escorts me to the procedure room. Five minutes for me to take my shirt off and she helped me to get on the stretcher and adjust my posture, ever so gently. Her smile was very reassuring and then she surprised me with her skill level. No cold gel on my skin and no baby talk from Hannah. The conclusion was just as polite and respectful as the beginning. And I was done. I hope I don''t have to but if I need another Echo, I am heading to the Comprehensive Cardiology Office, where the waiting room is empty, and you get treated with respect. BTW, Hannah did not know I was a retired physician. Keep up the good work.", "author": "Suresh Raina", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102210804934115961458/reviews"}, {"date": "2022-04-17T13:19:03.925959Z", "text": "I am very thankful for Dr. Vince Nguyen and all star staff.  Communication for next appointment by email and text messages are very helpful reminders.  The staff are very professional, patient, treat their patients with respect and great attitudes!  Dr. Nguyen has a great welcome, reviews history, makes recommendations for future checks, time for questions and concerns.  Very happy with my cardiologist Dr. Nguyen and all star team ❤️", "author": "Bruce Blankenship", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109104819960173117703/reviews"}], "website": "http://www.houstonmethodist.org/doctor/vince-nguyen/", "location": {"latitude": 29.5519906, "longitude": -95.085397}, "services": ["Cardiac Imaging", "Cardiology", "Hypertension Management", "Interventional Cardiology", "Peripheral Vascular Disease Cardiology", "Preventive Cardiology", "Structural Heart Disease Cardiology", "Women''s Cardiovascular Disease"], "insurance": {"notes": null, "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": [], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": true}, "highlights": [{"title": "Board-Certified Cardiologist", "detail": "Dr. Vince T. Nguyen is board-certified in Interventional Cardiology, Cardiovascular Disease, and Internal Medicine.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Over 20 Years Experience", "detail": "Dr. Nguyen has been practicing cardiology in Houston for more than 20 years.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Video Visits Available", "detail": "Patients can access care via telehealth video visits.", "category": "convenience"}, {"title": "Vietnamese Language Services", "detail": "Dr. Nguyen and office staff speak Vietnamese.", "category": "culture"}, {"title": "Accepting New Patients", "detail": "The practice is currently accepting new patients.", "category": "access"}, {"title": "Multiple Locations", "detail": "Office locations in Houston and Friendswood, TX.", "category": "convenience"}], "price_tier": "$$", "source_url": "http://www.houstonmethodist.org/doctor/vince-nguyen/", "appointment": {"booking_note": null, "appointment_url": "https://www.houstonmethodist.org/request-an-appointment/insurance/?physician=vince-nguyen&pcg=false", "new_patient_note": null, "phone_booking_available": true, "online_booking_available": true, "free_consultation_available": null}, "open_sunday": false, "scout_query": "Vietnamese cardiologist in Houston, TX", "search_text": "cardiology | cardiologist | heart doctor | ekg | blood pressure | tim mạch | bác sĩ tim | 심장내과 | 心脏科 | 心血管 | english | vietnamese | tiếng việt | người việt | bác sĩ việt | cardiac imaging | hypertension management | interventional cardiology | peripheral vascular disease cardiology | preventive cardiology | structural heart disease cardiology | women''s cardiovascular disease | vince t. nguyen | md", "google_types": ["medical_clinic", "doctor", "health", "point_of_interest", "establishment"], "open_weekend": false, "rating_count": 115, "team_members": [{"name": "Vince T. Nguyen", "role": "MD", "bio_snippet": "Cardiologist with over 20 years of experience. Medical degree from University of Alabama School of Medicine. Board-certified in Interventional Cardiology, Cardiovascular Disease, and Internal Medicine. Instructor in Medicine at Houston Methodist Academic Institute.", "languages_spoken": ["English", "Vietnamese"]}], "language_note": "Dr. Vince T. Nguyen and his office staff speak Vietnamese, making the practice accessible to Vietnamese-speaking patients in the Houston area.", "open_saturday": false, "quality_score": 95, "working_hours": {"friday": "8:30 AM – 5:00 PM", "monday": "8:30 AM – 5:00 PM", "sunday": "Closed", "tuesday": "8:30 AM – 5:00 PM", "saturday": "Closed", "thursday": "8:30 AM – 5:00 PM", "wednesday": "8:30 AM – 5:00 PM"}, "gallery_images": ["https://cdn-images.kyruus.com/providermatch/hm/photos/200/nguyen-vince-1952506511.jpg"], "review_profile": {"rating": 4.8, "source": "google", "themes": [{"theme": "Clinical Expertise", "mentions": 4, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Multiple reviewers highlight Dr. Nguyen''s excellent care and ability to explain treatments clearly."}, {"theme": "Staff Professionalism", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Mixed", "summary_quote": "While some praise the staff''s professionalism, others report issues with phone communication and check-in processes."}, {"theme": "Communication", "mentions": 2, "sentiment": "Negative", "summary_quote": "Several reviewers mention difficulties with phone communication and administrative coordination."}, {"theme": "Patient-Centered Care", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Many appreciate the personalized attention and time taken to address their concerns."}, {"theme": "Facility Efficiency", "mentions": 2, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Some patients note smooth appointment experiences with minimal wait times."}], "summary": "Most patients praise Dr. Nguyen and the clinical team for their expertise and caring approach, though some express frustration with administrative staff and phone communication.", "review_count": 115, "concern_themes": [], "positive_themes": [], "featured_reviews": [{"date": "2025-11-20T20:33:32.578276374Z", "text": "This location and the friendswood one are horrible at answering the phones, and making sure you’re checked in. As well as have attitude when you’re trying to figure stuff out, or correct them on the amount of times you’ve called/they’ve called, like i don’t have my call logs saying the amount of times i’ve been contacted by them. I love Dr.Nguyen but the staff is awful. not to mention the amount of times i’ve checked in at the window but they haven’t checked me in is horrible.", "author": "Aurora Smith", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114129528671809760440/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-03-13T02:39:28.194440287Z", "text": "Love the Doctor and NPs, they are very personal and take the time to get the know the patient.", "author": "B G", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111884452794448775083/reviews"}, {"date": "2022-02-16T17:54:14.963050Z", "text": "My every appointment has been very pleasant. Dr NGUYEN has definitely extended my good health.  I feel like a young man.  He explains on layman terms any problems and treatment options.  Very caring in deed.   The staff is equally caring, making sure the info that us required by the doctor is gathered.  Great staff, no exclusions.", "author": "Kenneth Aiken", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112772500456233691614/reviews"}, {"date": "2023-03-24T22:08:30.881421Z", "text": "I had an appointment for getting a Cardiac Echo at the office yesterday. Being a retired physician myself, I am fully aware of the fact that it is impossible to predict if you can be on time. When I arrived 30 minutes early, I expected to wait and even take a nap in the waiting area. The receptionist was polite and friendly. But the surprise was that there was only one person waiting who was ahead of me. He went inside for the test as I sat down, right on time. Came out in about 20 minutes. Next thing I know is that exactly on time, Hannah the Echo Technologist comes out and escorts me to the procedure room. Five minutes for me to take my shirt off and she helped me to get on the stretcher and adjust my posture, ever so gently. Her smile was very reassuring and then she surprised me with her skill level. No cold gel on my skin and no baby talk from Hannah. The conclusion was just as polite and respectful as the beginning. And I was done. I hope I don''t have to but if I need another Echo, I am heading to the Comprehensive Cardiology Office, where the waiting room is empty, and you get treated with respect. BTW, Hannah did not know I was a retired physician. Keep up the good work.", "author": "Suresh Raina", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102210804934115961458/reviews"}, {"date": "2022-04-17T13:19:03.925959Z", "text": "I am very thankful for Dr. Vince Nguyen and all star staff.  Communication for next appointment by email and text messages are very helpful reminders.  The staff are very professional, patient, treat their patients with respect and great attitudes!  Dr. Nguyen has a great welcome, reviews history, makes recommendations for future checks, time for questions and concerns.  Very happy with my cardiologist Dr. Nguyen and all star team ❤️", "author": "Bruce Blankenship", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109104819960173117703/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Most patients praise Dr. Nguyen and the clinical team for their expertise and caring approach, though some express frustration with administrative staff and phone communication.", "about_highlight": "Comprehensive Cardiology provides expert cardiovascular care through Dr. Vince T. Nguyen, a board-certified cardiologist with over 20 years of experience. Dr. Nguyen offers a full spectrum of services including cardiac imaging, interventional cardiology, hypertension management, preventive cardiology, and treatment for structural heart disease and peripheral vascular disease. Committed to patient-centered care, the practice accepts new patients and offers video visits for added convenience. With hospital affiliations at Houston Methodist Hospital and Houston Methodist Clear Lake Hospital, patients receive seamless, high-quality care across multiple locations in the Houston area.", "appointment_url": "https://www.houstonmethodist.org/request-an-appointment/