 | chequeo médico anual | limpieza de oídos | diagnostic | chronic care | preventive | procedure", "google_types": ["government_office", "medical_clinic", "health", "point_of_interest", "establishment"], "open_weekend": true, "rating_count": 53, "language_note": "Clínica Hispana Vida Sana está enfocada en servir a la comunidad hispana, ofreciendo atención médica en español e inglés, con un equipo de doctores que comprenden las necesidades culturales y lingüísticas de sus pacientes.", "open_saturday": true, "quality_score": 92, "working_hours": {"friday": "9:00 AM – 9:00 PM", "monday": "9:00 AM – 9:00 PM", "sunday": "9:00 AM – 3:00 PM", "tuesday": "9:00 AM – 9:00 PM", "saturday": "9:00 AM – 7:00 PM", "thursday": "9:00 AM – 9:00 PM", "wednesday": "9:00 AM – 9:00 PM"}, "gallery_images": ["https://www.clinicahispanavidasana.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/A7406576.jpg-scaled.jpeg", "https://www.clinicahispanavidasana.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/A7406318.jpg-scaled.jpeg", "https://www.clinicahispanavidasana.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/IMG_3790_mod1.jpg", "https://www.clinicahispanavidasana.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/IMG_3812_mod1.jpg", "https://www.clinicahispanavidasana.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Diseno-sin-titulo-2.png", "https://www.clinicahispanavidasana.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/Banner-CHVS-4.jpg", "https://www.clinicahispanavidasana.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/clinicavidasana.jpg", "https://www.clinicahispanavidasana.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/rayosxr-CHVS.jpg"], "review_profile": {"rating": 4.9, "source": "google", "themes": [{"theme": "Staff Professionalism", "mentions": 5, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Every reviewer highlights friendly, knowledgeable, and empathetic staff, with specific praise for their professionalism and warmth."}, {"theme": "Facility Environment", "mentions": 2, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Multiple reviews mention the clinic''s cleanliness, maintenance, and comfortable atmosphere."}, {"theme": "Efficiency", "mentions": 2, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients appreciate the clinic''s efficiency, noting minimal wait times and smooth scheduling."}, {"theme": "Clinical Expertise", "mentions": 2, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Reviewers commend the doctors for their accuracy, professionalism, and effective treatment outcomes."}, {"theme": "Communication", "mentions": 1, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients feel well-cared for and appreciated, with staff making them feel comfortable and valued."}], "summary": "Patients consistently praise Clinica Hispana Vida Sana for its exceptional efficiency, welcoming staff, and professional care, with many highlighting minimal wait times and a clean, well-maintained facility.", "review_count": 53, "concern_themes": [], "positive_themes": ["Excelente servicio", "Personal profesional y amable", "Atención humana"], "featured_reviews": [{"date": "2025-09-09T17:13:22.605445624Z", "text": "Exceptional efficiency and warmth! Our annual exam was perfectly on time with almost no wait at the clinic. The entire staff was welcoming and friendly, and the professionalism throughout was top-tier. A truly impressive practice. Highly recommended.", "author": "Ajaz Karim", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103316732910495210911/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-01-02T22:47:54.528513478Z", "text": "Great service!\nKnowledgeable and empathetic personnel.", "author": "Vania", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107892903732998279207/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-09-23T17:26:43.377935840Z", "text": "Very nice staff and doctor. No rush and wait times like other clinics. Very clean and well-maintained clinic. Very reasonable charge as well.\n5/5.", "author": "Sheetal Panchal", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107108118240637846778/reviews"}, {"date": "2024-09-08T22:13:57.550843Z", "text": "Had a pleasant experience.  They always have trouble drawing blood, but Mariana was the best! She hit my vein on the first try.\nDefinitely recommend.", "author": "TC Dominguez", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117223584161603033286/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-04-08T17:30:27.706673Z", "text": "Doctor Fonseca is a very accurate professional. Everybody here is so kind, they make you feel well and the results are very good. Thanks", "author": "Sonia Romero", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111379423447326126215/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Patients consistently praise Clinica Hispana Vida Sana for its exceptional efficiency, welcoming staff, and professional care, with many highlighting minimal wait times and a clean, well-maintained facility.", "about_highlight": "Clínica Hispana Vida Sana es una clínica familiar con tres ubicaciones en el norte de Texas (Fort Worth, Plano y Dallas), dedicada a brindar atención médica de excelencia a la comunidad hispana. Nuestro equipo de doctores con experiencia ofrece servicios en español e inglés, incluyendo medicina general, laboratorio, control de diabetes, presión arterial, ultrasonido y rayos X. Con más de 35,000 pacientes atendidos, nos enorgullece ofrecer consultas médicas desde $30 y estamos abiertos los 7 días de la semana para su conveniencia.", "appointment_url": "https://www.clinicahispanavidasana.com/reserva/", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=12775942374143460486&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJje7CXql5ToYRhoSuQeZDTbE", "quality_missing": ["insurance", "team_members"], "search_keywords": ["primary care", "family doctor", "general practitioner", "annual physical", "checkup", "bác sĩ gia đình", "khám tổng quát", "nội khoa", "내과", "가정의학과", "家庭医生", "全科医生", "内科", "english", "spanish", "vietnamese", "tiếng việt", "người việt", "bác sĩ việt", "medicina general", "laboratorio", "examen y tratamiento de la diabetes", "control de presión arterial y examen del corazón", "ultrasonido y rayos x", "examen de papanicolaou", "chequeo médico anual", "limpieza de oídos", "diagnostic", "chronic care", "preventive", "procedure"], "cultural_context": "Clínica Hispana Vida Sana está enfocada en servir a la comunidad hispana, ofreciendo atención médica en español e inglés, con un equipo de doctores que comprenden las necesidades culturales y lingüísticas de sus pacientes.", "services_offered": [{"name": "Medicina General", "category": "Primary Care", "description": "Diagnóstico y tratamiento de colesterol, alta presión, diabetes, gastritis, reflujo, infecciones respiratorias, asma, alergias, infecciones urinarias y más.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Pacientes que necesitan atención primaria y manejo de condiciones comunes."}, {"name": "Laboratorio", "category": "Diagnostic", "description": "Complejo metabólico, lipidograma, tiroides (TSH, T3, T4), vitamina D, ácido úrico, pruebas de embarazo, Papanicolaou, VPH, antígeno prostático, exámenes hormonales, ETS.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Pacientes que requieren análisis de sangre, orina o pruebas específicas."}, {"name": "Examen y Tratamiento de la Diabetes", "category": "Chronic Care", "description": "Control del nivel de azúcar en la sangre mediante dieta, medicamentos orales o insulina.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Pacientes con diabetes o en riesgo de desarrollarla."}, {"name": "Control de Presión Arterial y Examen del Corazón", "category": "Preventive", "description": "Detección temprana de hipertensión arterial para reducir riesgos de complicaciones cardíacas y renales.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Pacientes con hipertensión o factores de riesgo cardiovascular."}, {"name": "Ultrasonido y Rayos X", "category": "Diagnostic", "description": "Medios diagnósticos de alta tecnología para un mejor diagnóstico y tratamiento.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Pacientes que necesitan estudios de imagen."}, {"name": "Examen de Papanicolaou", "category": "Preventive", "description": "Prueba para detectar cambios anormales en las células del cuello uterino, previniendo el cáncer cervical. Se recomienda a partir de los 21 años o al iniciar vida sexual.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Mujeres a partir de 21 años o que hayan iniciado vida sexual."}, {"name": "Chequeo Médico Anual", "category": "Preventive", "description": "Evaluación general de salud para prevenir enfermedades, detectar condiciones a tiempo y mejorar la calidad de vida.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Todas las personas, incluso si se sienten bien."}, {"name": "Limpieza de Oídos", "category": "Procedure", "description": "Lavado de oídos para limpiar el cerumen de los conductos auditivos.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Pacientes con acumulación de cerumen."}], "short_description": "Clínica Hispana Vida Sana ofrece atención médica en español en tres ubicaciones del norte de Texas, con consultas desde $30 y servicios de laboratorio, diagnóstico y medicina general.", "google_website_url": "https://www.clinicahispanavidasana.com/", "google_primary_type": "Government Office", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": [], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "6242 Rufe Snow Dr, Fort Worth, TX 76148, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/117564584794583802985", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU3zmvbZdwbH0C_WR9Zw4kYdr4wUxD9NTzkZ-9u-0qLA8fWYK0=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Clinica Hispana Vida Sana"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/117564584794583802985", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU3zmvbZdwbH0C_WR9Zw4kYdr4wUxD9NTzkZ-9u-0qLA8fWYK0=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Clinica Hispana Vida Sana"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/117564584794583802985", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU3zmvbZdwbH0C_WR9Zw4kYdr4wUxD9NTzkZ-9u-0qLA8fWYK0=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Clinica Hispana Vida Sana"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/100215395556980035259", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW90b_b2E8Sy36Ij99nQ86dXI4trm-ErTrb7r4Qbtr4ilGFEu4=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Asdrubal Jesus Sequera Nuñez"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/117564584794583802985", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU3zmvbZdwbH0C_WR9Zw4kYdr4wUxD9NTzkZ-9u-0qLA8fWYK0=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Clinica Hispana Vida Sana"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-26T11:03:32.304119+00:00', 'clinica-hispana-vida-sana', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('13934dd6-d4ef-47be-b839-ce4db2415594', NULL, 'First OC Dermatology', 'First OC Dermatology is a cosmetic and medical dermatology practice serving Orange County with locations in Irvine and Fountain Valley. Founded by board-certified dermatologist Dr. Tien Nguyen, who brings over 30 years of experience, the practice is committed to providing excellent care to patients wanting beautiful, healthy skin. The team includes multiple board-certified dermatologists and highly skilled physician assistants who work together to offer a full spectrum of dermatologic services, from general skin care to advanced cosmetic procedures and clinical trials.', '17305 Von Karman Ave #107, Irvine, CA 92614', 'Irvine', 'CA', '92614', '(949) 679-9997', ARRAY['English', 'Vietnamese']::text[], 'Dermatology', FALSE, '{"fax": "(949) 679-9933", "images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/first-oc-dermatology-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/first-oc-dermatology-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/first-oc-dermatology-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/first-oc-dermatology-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/first-oc-dermatology-google-5.webp"], "rating": 4.8, "reviews": [{"date": "2026-02-14T01:37:36.298482858Z", "text": "Mr. Martin was very straightforward which took fears away. He was very understanding when I shared about myself and issues that I’m dealing with in my life. Even the nurse was understanding and comforted me during the procedure. They worked together and quickly yet accurately finished the procedure.", "author": "A B", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114504422527687856677/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-03-05T02:59:52.007950427Z", "text": "Their app helps expedite the usual wait in the office by filling out forms. The person at the front desk is very friendly. I was called in exactly at my appointment time, which is something I really appreciate. The PA, David Sanchez is not only very nice, but he is also very knowledgeable and thorough. I feel that my I am in good hands with them.", "author": "Gina W. Householder", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100405828378425648727/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-26T02:33:20.564247146Z", "text": "Dr Andrea Nguyen was very attentive.  Diagnose my issue and provides a few options for me.  She''s very genuine. She ended up performing a small procedure on me, very fast, effective and no pain.  She was very attentive and calm my nerves down when she sensed that I was nervous before the procedure.  Pleasant visit!!!!", "author": "Katie Trinh", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101133073110238003519/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-03-01T18:59:49.615626419Z", "text": "Dr. Tran was very thorough with the consultation and information provided. Any concerns I had regarding the condition I was there for were addressed in detail and preventive steps were recommended in a comprehensive way. The entire staff was professional and welcomming. Dr. Tran''s approach to address the concerns and make recommendations is outstanding.", "author": "Alex S", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112672167620575292603/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-29T01:53:34.608760035Z", "text": "Great office, everyone was really kind and helpful. I felt very comfortable as a new patient. I saw the PA today and loved her. Looking forward to having them as my Dr''s.\nThe parking was a little tricky, I went through the backdoor but there is a front parking lot with a direct door to their office. Keep driving through parking complex and out the other side to find the front of this practice. Rooms need little heaters in them, it''s freezing.", "author": "Erin O", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102953837130435700781/reviews"}], "website": "https://firstocdermatology.com/", "location": {"latitude": 33.6902999, "longitude": -117.84229270000002}, "services": ["General Dermatology", "Skin Cancer Surgery", "Clinical Trials", "Acne Treatment", "Eczema Treatment", "Psoriasis Treatment", "Rosacea Treatment", "Vitiligo Treatment", "Injectable Fillers", "Neurotoxins", "Cautery", "Dermroller", "Fractional CO2 DOT Therapy", "Palomar Laser Resurfacing", "RF Laser", "Photodynamic Therapy (PDT)", "Intense Pulse Light (IPL)"], "insurance": {"notes": "Insurance verification handled during appointment scheduling; please contact office for details.", "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": [], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": false}, "highlights": [{"title": "Board-Certified Dermatologists", "detail": "Led by Dr. Tien Nguyen, FAAD, with over 30 years of experience, and a team of board-certified specialists.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Two Convenient Locations", "detail": "Offices in Irvine and Fountain Valley, open Monday through Friday.", "category": "convenience"}, {"title": "Comprehensive Services", "detail": "General dermatology, skin cancer surgery, cosmetic treatments, and clinical trials all in one practice.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Advanced Cosmetic Procedures", "detail": "Offers injectable fillers, neurotoxins, laser resurfacing, and more.", "category": "technology"}], "price_tier": "$$", "source_url": "https://firstocdermatology.com/", "appointment": {"booking_note": "Schedule an appointment via phone or contact form.", "appointment_url": null, "new_patient_note": null, "phone_booking_available": true, "online_booking_available": false, "free_consultation_available": null}, "open_sunday": false, "scout_query": "Vietnamese dermatologist clinic in Orange County, CA", "search_text": "dermatology | dermatologist | skin doctor | acne | eczema | skin cancer | da liễu | bác sĩ da liễu | 피부과 | 皮肤科 | english | vietnamese | tiếng việt | người việt | bác sĩ việt | general dermatology | skin cancer surgery | clinical trials | acne treatment | eczema treatment | psoriasis treatment | rosacea treatment | vitiligo treatment | injectable fillers | neurotoxins | cautery | dermroller | fractional co2 dot therapy | palomar laser resurfacing | rf laser | photodynamic therapy (pdt) | intense pulse light (ipl) | surgical | research | cosmetic | procedural | tien nguyen | md, faad | vivian laquer | brent martin | samantha tran | andrea nguyen | pa-c, ms | melanie anderson | pa-c | teresa nguyen | jason huling | david sanchez | grace nakamura | lien nguyen", "google_types": ["doctor", "health", "point_of_interest", "establishment"], "open_weekend": false, "rating_count": 814, "team_members": [{"name": "Tien Nguyen", "role": "MD, FAAD", "bio_snippet": null, "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Vivian Laquer", "role": "MD, FAAD", "bio_snippet": null, "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Brent Martin", "role": "MD, FAAD", "bio_snippet": null, "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Samantha Tran", "role": "MD, FAAD", "bio_snippet": null, "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Andrea Nguyen", "role": "PA-C, MS", "bio_snippet": null, "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Melanie Anderson", "role": "PA-C", "bio_snippet": null, "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Teresa Nguyen", "role": "PA-C", "bio_snippet": null, "langu