nal", "effective treatments", "helpful staff", "knowledgeable"], "featured_reviews": [{"date": "2026-02-14T01:37:36.298482858Z", "text": "Mr. Martin was very straightforward which took fears away. He was very understanding when I shared about myself and issues that I’m dealing with in my life. Even the nurse was understanding and comforted me during the procedure. They worked together and quickly yet accurately finished the procedure.", "author": "A B", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114504422527687856677/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-03-05T02:59:52.007950427Z", "text": "Their app helps expedite the usual wait in the office by filling out forms. The person at the front desk is very friendly. I was called in exactly at my appointment time, which is something I really appreciate. The PA, David Sanchez is not only very nice, but he is also very knowledgeable and thorough. I feel that my I am in good hands with them.", "author": "Gina W. Householder", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100405828378425648727/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-26T02:33:20.564247146Z", "text": "Dr Andrea Nguyen was very attentive.  Diagnose my issue and provides a few options for me.  She''s very genuine. She ended up performing a small procedure on me, very fast, effective and no pain.  She was very attentive and calm my nerves down when she sensed that I was nervous before the procedure.  Pleasant visit!!!!", "author": "Katie Trinh", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101133073110238003519/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-03-01T18:59:49.615626419Z", "text": "Dr. Tran was very thorough with the consultation and information provided. Any concerns I had regarding the condition I was there for were addressed in detail and preventive steps were recommended in a comprehensive way. The entire staff was professional and welcomming. Dr. Tran''s approach to address the concerns and make recommendations is outstanding.", "author": "Alex S", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112672167620575292603/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-29T01:53:34.608760035Z", "text": "Great office, everyone was really kind and helpful. I felt very comfortable as a new patient. I saw the PA today and loved her. Looking forward to having them as my Dr''s.\nThe parking was a little tricky, I went through the backdoor but there is a front parking lot with a direct door to their office. Keep driving through parking complex and out the other side to find the front of this practice. Rooms need little heaters in them, it''s freezing.", "author": "Erin O", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102953837130435700781/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Patients consistently praise First OC Dermatology for its professional, knowledgeable, and compassionate staff, as well as efficient and thorough care. Many highlight the welcoming atmosphere and the ability of providers to ease anxieties during procedures.", "about_highlight": "First OC Dermatology is a cosmetic and medical dermatology practice serving Orange County with locations in Irvine and Fountain Valley. Founded by board-certified dermatologist Dr. Tien Nguyen, who brings over 30 years of experience, the practice is committed to providing excellent care to patients wanting beautiful, healthy skin. The team includes multiple board-certified dermatologists and highly skilled physician assistants who work together to offer a full spectrum of dermatologic services, from general skin care to advanced cosmetic procedures and clinical trials.", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=8915179401632791165&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJ6xtC75ne3IARfbozX24UuXs", "quality_missing": ["insurance", "appointment_url"], "search_keywords": ["dermatology", "dermatologi