edical dermatologists in Irvine and Fountain Valley, offering comprehensive skin care with over 30 years of experience.", "google_website_url": "https://firstocdermatology.com/", "google_primary_type": "Doctor", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": ["Tien Nguyen", "Vivian Laquer", "Brent Martin", "Samantha Tran", "Andrea Nguyen", "Melanie Anderson", "Teresa Nguyen", "Jason Huling", "David Sanchez", "Grace Nakamura", "Lien Nguyen"], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "17305 Von Karman Ave #107, Irvine, CA 92614, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/114584603445533449113", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUPITg32UwoTCLmbfEjS6OsInPCZE4rWy1Jlg5CdkP1gYmGLpXs=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Emma Al"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/105473903653040373535", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX8_iIDju7WTsnEHfrDzPxCUZBwXTI4inhXKkyZNisnAm-mogA=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "SoCal Development"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/114584603445533449113", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUPITg32UwoTCLmbfEjS6OsInPCZE4rWy1Jlg5CdkP1gYmGLpXs=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Emma Al"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/105473903653040373535", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX8_iIDju7WTsnEHfrDzPxCUZBwXTI4inhXKkyZNisnAm-mogA=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "SoCal Development"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/102862417964245732416", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV9-KOLonp0rCAUvo_dFEP7pJcYKVny91IZYzL4sZIqj4zsKo9d2Q=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "B Kal"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-26T13:46:03.332174+00:00', 'first-oc-dermatology', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('9cdb266e-f3eb-49e4-a250-108982dd4958', NULL, 'BMB Medical Group, INC', 'BMB Medical Group, INC, also known as 아름다운 병원 in Korean, is a Los Angeles-based medical aesthetics and laser clinic led by Dr. Walter Kim, M.D., a leader with over 25 years of experience in laser technology. The clinic focuses on natural results and individualized care, offering a comprehensive range of cosmetic services including advanced laser treatments, acne care, injectables like Botox and fillers, and innovative procedures such as Agnes and Thermage. With a patient-first approach, BMB Medical combines cutting-edge technology with a comfortable, spa-like environment to help patients improve their looks and change their lives. The clinic is located at 450 S Western Ave #206, Los Angeles, CA 90020, and is open Monday through Saturday by appointment.', '450 S Western Ave #206, Los Angeles, CA 90020', 'Los Angeles', 'CA', '90020', '(323) 965-9650', ARRAY['English', 'Korean']::text[], 'Dermatology', FALSE, '{"email": "bmbmedgroup@gmail.com", "images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/bmb-medical-group-inc-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/bmb-medical-group-inc-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/bmb-medical-group-inc-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/bmb-medical-group-inc-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/bmb-medical-group-inc-google-5.webp"], "rating": 4.9, "reviews": [{"date": "2026-06-11T21:54:05.871087392Z", "text": "I have been seeing Dr. Kim for years to address long term TMJ issues as recommended by my dentist. I choose to come here instead of anywhere else, including a dental office, because I feel safe in Dr. Kim''s care and know that I can trust this office for reasonable prices and transparency. My jaw always feels much needed relief for a few months after treatment. Thank you Dr. Kim and team.", "author": "Angela", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106995999861074757411/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-11-18T19:09:02.313602362Z", "text": "I’ve been seeing **Dr. Walter at BMB Skin Care Clinic** for over 10 years, and I can confidently say he is the best in Los Angeles. I actually drive an hour just to see him—he’s that good. His Botox work is consistently natural, precise, and long-lasting, and he’s always honest about pricing and dosages. There’s never any upselling, just genuine care and transparency.\n\nMy kids have also seen him for acne facials, and their skin improved tremendously. On top of that, Dr. Walter always takes the time to advise me on vitamins and supplements that support healthy aging, which I really appreciate.\n\nThe clinic is conveniently located inside the California Market, which makes every visit even better—after my appointment I always grab some Korean food, especially from the famous kimbap spot downstairs.\n\nIf you’re looking for a trustworthy, experienced, and talented doctor, I can’t recommend Dr. Walter enough. Truly a 5-star experience every time!", "author": "Arjin Kim", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103215358025533791402/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-06-06T23:14:41.576273876Z", "text": "I had a really good experience here. The doctor personally did the treatment for me at a great price, which I really appreciated. The doctor and the staff were also very kind and welcoming, so I felt comfortable the whole time. Thank you!", "author": "Hyeok", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111732011758475531428/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-04-26T19:26:42.177152Z", "text": "I usually never leave reviews, but I had to make time to write one for this place because it truly deserves it. Honestly, I didn’t expect much at first, but I found out this clinic is one of the few in LA where the doctor personally treats you (which is so rare) so I decided to give it a try and got Botox on my first visit.\n\nOf course, Botox results can be similar across places, but what really stood out was how incredibly thorough and kind Dr. Walter Kim was. He took the time to explain everything carefully and genuinely thought about what would be best for me.\n\nI also ended up getting a few skin treatments, and I’m not exaggerating! Within just two days, my skin became noticeably smoother and clearer. I have absolutely no regrets, and I even want to recommend him to my family and friends.\n\nIt honestly feels like I discovered a hidden gem, and just writing this doesn’t feel like enough to express how grateful I am. Thank you so much, Dr. Walter Kim!! Even back in Korea, I visited a lot of dermatologists, but I have never met a doctor this meticulous and kind. Truly the best!", "author": "Woo C.", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116092844664690293820/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-29T21:21:44.694073999Z", "text": "The lady who manages the front desk and phone is very rude and unprofessional. She says things that are untrue and then says the opposite when called out. I have never had such a hard time trying to make an appointment to see the doctor. Would definitely go elsewhere, as it is not worth the rudeness and hassle of the woman at the front. She is truly the reason I will not be coming back and definitely cannot recommend this place to anyone as long as she works there. Feels like they are deleting negative reviews because there is no way this place can be so highly rated with one of the worst customer services experiences I have had in my life.", "author": "Brooke Smith", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114166427486419000297/reviews"}], "website": "https://www.bmbmedical.net/", "location": {"latitude": 34.065722199999996, "longitude": -118.30838609999999}, "services": ["Laser Treatments", "Acne Care", "Agnes", "Botox", "Filler", "Kybella", "Thermage"], "insurance": {"notes": null, "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": [], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": false}, "highlights": [{"title": "Leader in Laser Technology", "detail": "Dr. Walter Kim, M.D. has over 25 years of experience in laser technology.", "category": "technology"}, {"title": "Korean-Speaking Staff", "detail": "The clinic offers a Korean-language version of its website, indicating bilingual services for Korean-speaking patients.", "category": "culture"}, {"title": "Natural Results Focus", "detail": "Dr. Kim is focused on natural results and individualized care.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Convenient Appointment Hours", "detail": "Open Mon - Sat 10:00 am - 5:00 pm, all by appointment.", "category": "convenience"}, {"title": "Free Consultation Available", "detail": "A ''Request Consultation'' form is available on the website.", "category": "access"}], "price_tier": "$$", "source_url": "http://www.bmbmedical.net/", "appointment": {"booking_note": "All appointments by appointment. Click ''Request Consultation'' or call (323) 965-9650.", "appointment_url": null, "new_patient_note": null, "phone_booking_available": true, "online_booking_available": false, "free_consultation_available": true}, "open_sunday": false, "scout_query": "Korean dermatology clinic in Los Angeles, CA", "search_text": "dermatology 