 "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients highlight compassionate care in their feedback."}, {"theme": "Friendly staff", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients highlight friendly staff in their feedback."}, {"theme": "Clear explanations", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients highlight clear explanations in their feedback."}, {"theme": "Comfortable visits", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients highlight comfortable visits in their feedback."}], "summary": "BMB Medical Group, INC has a 4.9 star Google rating from 135 Google reviews. Patients commonly mention compassionate care, friendly staff, clear explanations, comfortable visits.", "review_count": 135, "concern_themes": [], "positive_themes": [], "featured_reviews": [{"date": "2026-06-11T21:54:05.871087392Z", "text": "I have been seeing Dr. Kim for years to address long term TMJ issues as recommended by my dentist. I choose to come here instead of anywhere else, including a dental office, because I feel safe in Dr. Kim''s care and know that I can trust this office for reasonable prices and transparency. My jaw always feels much needed relief for a few months after treatment. Thank you Dr. Kim and team.", "author": "Angela", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106995999861074757411/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-11-18T19:09:02.313602362Z", "text": "I’ve been seeing **Dr. Walter at BMB Skin Care Clinic** for over 10 years, and I can confidently say he is the best in Los Angeles. I actually drive an hour just to see him—he’s that good. His Botox work is consistently natural, precise, and long-lasting, and he’s always honest about pricing and dosages. There’s never any upselling, just genuine care and transparency.\n\nMy kids have also seen him for acne facials, and their skin improved tremendously. On top of that, Dr. Walter always takes the time to advise me on vitamins and supplements that support healthy aging, which I really appreciate.\n\nThe clinic is conveniently located inside the California Market, which makes every visit even better—after my appointment I always grab some Korean food, especially from the famous kimbap spot downstairs.\n\nIf you’re looking for a trustworthy, experienced, and talented doctor, I can’t recommend Dr. Walter enough. Truly a 5-star experience every time!", "author": "Arjin Kim", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103215358025533791402/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-06-06T23:14:41.576273876Z", "text": "I had a really good experience here. The doctor personally did the treatment for me at a great price, which I really appreciated. The doctor and the staff were also very kind and welcoming, so I felt comfortable the whole time. Thank you!", "author": "Hyeok", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111732011758475531428/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-04-26T19:26:42.177152Z", "text": "I usually never leave reviews, but I had to make time to write one for this place because it truly deserves it. Honestly, I didn’t expect much at first, but I found out this clinic is one of the few in LA where the doctor personally treats you (which is so rare) so I decided to give it a try and got Botox on my first visit.\n\nOf course, Botox results can be similar across places, but what really stood out was how incredibly thorough and kind Dr. Walter Kim was. He took the time to explain everything carefully and genuinely thought about what would be best for me.\n\nI also ended up getting a few skin treatments, and I’m not exaggerating! Within just two days, my skin became noticeably smoother and clearer. I have absolutely no regrets, and I even want to recommend him to my family and friends.\n\nIt honestly feels like I discovered a hidden gem, and just writing this doesn’t feel like enough to express how grateful I am. Thank you so much, Dr. Walter Kim!! Even back in Korea, I visited a lot of dermatologists, but I have never met a doctor this meticulous and kind. Truly the best!", "author": "Woo C.", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116092844664690293820/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-29T21:21:44.694073999Z", "text": "The lady who manages the front desk and phone is very rude and unprofessional. She says things that are untrue and then says the opposite when called out. I have never had such a hard time trying to make an appointment to see the doctor. Would definitely go elsewhere, as it is not worth the rudeness and hassle of the woman at the front. She is truly the reason I will not be coming back and definitely cannot recommend this place to anyone as long as she works there. Feels like they are deleting negative reviews because there is no way this place can be so highly rated with one of the worst customer services experiences I have had in my life.", "author": "Brooke Smith", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114166427486419000297/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "BMB Medical Group, INC has a 4.9 star Google rating from 135 Google reviews. Patients commonly mention compassionate care, friendly staff, clear explanations, comfortable visits.", "about_highlight": "BMB Medical Group, INC, also known as 아름다운 병원 in Korean, is a Los Angeles-based medical aesthetics and laser clinic led by Dr. Walter Kim, M.D., a leader with over 25 years of experience in laser technology. The clinic focuses on natural results and individualized care, offering a comprehensive range of cosmetic services including advanced laser treatments, acne care, injectables like Botox and fillers, and innovative procedures such as Agnes and Thermage. With a patient-first approach, BMB Medical combines cutting-edge technology with a comfortable, spa-like environment to help patients improve their looks and change their lives. The clinic is located at 450 S Western Ave #206, Los Angeles, CA 90020, and is open Monday through Saturday by appointment.", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=9868671781140068068&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJu4-ZN5K4woAR5HbGz7KQ9Ig", "quality_missing": ["insurance", "appointment_url"], "search_keywords": ["dermatology", "dermatologist", "skin doctor", "acne", "eczema", "skin cancer", "da liễu", "bác sĩ da liễu", "피부과", "皮肤科", "english", "korean", "한국어", "한인", "한국말", "laser treatments", "acne care", "agnes", "botox", "filler", "kybella", "thermage", "cosmetic", "injectables", "laser", "dr. walter kim", "physician (m.d.)"], "cultural_context": "BMB Medical Group, INC (아름다운 병원) has a Korean-language version of its website (한국어), indicating a focus on serving Korean and Korean-American patients. The clinic’s location in the Koreatown area of Los Angeles and use of Korean language in its branding reinforce this cultural connection.", "services_offered": [{"name": "Laser Treatments", "category": "Cosmetic", "description": "Advanced laser technology for skin rejuvenation, including ND-YAG, Agnes, and Thermage.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Acne Care", "category": "Dermatology", "description": "Comprehensive acne treatments including Agnes acne care, acne extraction, microneedling, and teen acne solutions.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Teens and adults struggling with acne"}, {"name": "Agnes", "category": "Cosmetic", "description": "A minimally invasive radiofrequency microneedling treatment for skin tightening and rejuvenation.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Botox", "category": "Injectables", "description": "Injectable treatment for wrinkles and fine lines.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Filler", "category": "Injectables", "description": "Dermal fillers for volume restoration and facial contouring.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Kybella", "category": "Injectables", "description": "Injectable treatment to reduce submental fat (double chin).", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Thermage", "category": "Laser", "description": "Non-invasive skin tightening treatment using radiofrequency.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}], "short_description": "BMB Medical Group, INC is a Los Angeles medical aesthetics clinic led by Dr. Walter Kim, M.D., offering advanced laser treatments, acne care, and injectables with a focus on natural results and individualized care.", "google_website_url": "http://www.bmbmedical.net/", "google_primary_type": "Doctor", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": ["Dr. Walter Kim"], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "450 S Western Ave #206, Los Angeles, CA 90020, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/113285245250511192683", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUZULUFVUiWBd7VkNKkA-cs99w6SNn2fzp_ui4RtC8p5Ti8BaiN=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "BMB Medical Group, INC"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/107130589482227614149", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWcNp2hkJbQueN7M6_U50dp1V6qMH_a5Nv1BRcqSXg5VP6yWqFn=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "IVY Consulting & Associates J. KIM"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/100820361316547744200", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU-kzFIxOaEWbTszJucPWXyIvaEKWAp2iEYqEjII116V2qAhR3r=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "walter kim"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/107130589482227614149", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWcNp2hkJbQueN7M6_U50dp1V6qMH_a5Nv1BRcqSXg5VP6yWqFn=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "IVY Consulting & Associates J. KIM"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/113285245250511192683", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUZULUFVUiWBd7VkNKkA-cs99w6SNn2fzp_ui4RtC8p5Ti8BaiN=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "BMB Medical Group, INC"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-26T13:50:54.108042+00:00', 'bmb-medical-group-inc', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('9ea209a2-93f0-4509-852c-e12a4c436ef8', NULL, 'Misarang Beauty & M Clinic', 'The clinic''s website was not accessible for data extraction due to a security check requiring cookies. No detailed information could be retrieved.', '3030 W Olympic Blvd Unit 111, Los Angeles, CA 90006', 'Los Angeles', 'CA', '90006', '(213) 383-3377', ARRAY['English', 'Korean']::text[], 'Dermatology', FALSE, '{"images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/misarang-beauty-m-clinic-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/misarang-beauty-m-clinic-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/misarang-beauty-m-clinic-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/misarang-beauty-m-clinic-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/misarang-beauty-m-clinic-google-5.webp"], "rating": 4.9, "reviews": [{"date": "2025-11-27T00:15:23.752181356Z", "text": "I’ve been coming to Misarang for years, and their service has never been anything short of exceptional. The team here is truly amazing—warm, attentive, and always going above and beyond to make every visit feel welcoming. You can tell they genuinely care about their customers.\n\nWhat keeps me coming back is the consistent quality. Whether it’s the service, the atmosphere, or the little details they never overlook, Misarang delivers every single time. It’s rare to find a place that maintains such high standards for so long, and that’s exactly why I’ve stayed loyal for years.\n\nHighly recommend to anyone looking for great service, wonderful people, and quality you can always count on.", "author": "Xian Jan", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109559889540830386101/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-01-08T19:58:44.881097644Z", "text": "I recently visited Misarang Beauty Clinic and had an amazing experience!! From the moment I walked in, I was greeted by a wonderfully friendly and efficient front desk staff. The clinic itself was immaculately clean, which immediately put me at ease.\n\nDuring my initial consultation, the team took the time to thoroughly discuss all of my needs and concerns. They went above and beyond to ensure that I felt comfortable and informed. I was happily surprised when they were able to accommodate me for mole removal on the same day as my consultation. Not only did they remove the moles I had initially discussed, but they also took the initiative to remove a few extra ones that were bothering me.\n\nI truly appreciate the care and attention given to me throughout the process. I would highly recommend Misarang Beauty Clinic to anyone looking for professional, friendly, and effective services. This was truly a wonderful experience!", "author": "Shelby Cummings", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110576123778017131708/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-06-03T20:57:26.275908108Z", "text": "I really enjoyed my mole removal experience at Misarang Beauty! Staff was very thorough and explained the procedure very well. The clinic is clean, well lit, and well organized. They explained the procedure very well during the consultation, and the actual procedure was exactly what they explained during the consultation; no surprises. The staff is very accommodating and transparent with what they think will work best for each individual’s skin type.", "author": "Precilla Tea", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115114525791890220111/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-16T22:01:51.565366128Z", "text": "I’ve had a really great experience here for both laser treatments and facials. I originally came in to help with post-acne marks and rosacea redness, and I’ve definitely noticed improvement from both services.\n\nThe facials are especially relaxing — they include a great massage, and the staff always takes the time to ask about your skin concerns and goals. They also give thoughtful recommendations on products and ingredients that would work best for your skin.\n\nAnother nice bonus is that if you purchase a package, they’ll sometimes include a complimentary facial or laser treatment. Overall, the service is professional, welcoming, and effective. I would definitely recommend this place!", "author": "Anastasia Kuo", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101291982118734289635/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-01-17T17:42:29.848937559Z", "text": "I’ve been coming here for about a year and have absolutely love it! All the estheticians are great but I’ve been seeing Silvia more consistently and she does such an amazing job! She’s really knowledgeable and kind, and has helped transform my skin even more the last few months. Worth every penny :)", "author": "Mandy Miller", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106239583771255783882/reviews"}], "website": "https://misarangbeauty.com/", "location": {"latitude": 34.0523609, "longitude": -118.30155730000001}, "insurance": {"notes": null, "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": [], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": false}, "price_tier": "$$", "source_url": "https://misarangbeauty.com/", "appointment": {"booking_note": null, "appointment_url": null, "new_patient_note": null, "phone_booking_available": null, 