 about their customers.\n\nWhat keeps me coming back is the consistent quality. Whether it’s the service, the atmosphere, or the little details they never overlook, Misarang delivers every single time. It’s rare to find a place that maintains such high standards for so long, and that’s exactly why I’ve stayed loyal for years.\n\nHighly recommend to anyone looking for great service, wonderful people, and quality you can always count on.", "author": "Xian Jan", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109559889540830386101/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-01-08T19:58:44.881097644Z", "text": "I recently visited Misarang Beauty Clinic and had an amazing experience!! From the moment I walked in, I was greeted by a wonderfully friendly and efficient front desk staff. The clinic itself was immaculately clean, which immediately put me at ease.\n\nDuring my initial consultation, the team took the time to thoroughly discuss all of my needs and concerns. They went above and beyond to ensure that I felt comfortable and informed. I was happily surprised when they were able to accommodate me for mole removal on the same day as my consultation. Not only did they remove the moles I had initially discussed, but they also took the initiative to remove a few extra ones that were bothering me.\n\nI truly appreciate the care and attention given to me throughout the process. I would highly recommend Misarang Beauty Clinic to anyone looking for professional, friendly, and effective services. This was truly a wonderful experience!", "author": "Shelby Cummings", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110576123778017131708/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-06-03T20:57:26.275908108Z", "text": "I really enjoyed my mole removal experience at Misarang Beauty! Staff was very thorough and explained the procedure very well. The clinic is clean, well lit, and well organized. They explained the procedure very well during the consultation, and the actual procedure was exactly what they explained during the consultation; no surprises. The staff is very accommodating and transparent with what they think will work best for each individual’s skin type.", "author": "Precilla Tea", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115114525791890220111/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-16T22:01:51.565366128Z", "text": "I’ve had a really great experience here for both laser treatments and facials. I originally came in to help with post-acne marks and rosacea redness, and I’ve definitely noticed improvement from both services.\n\nThe facials are especially relaxing — they include a great massage, and the staff always takes the time to ask about your skin concerns and goals. They also give thoughtful recommendations on products and ingredients that would work best for your skin.\n\nAnother nice bonus is that if you purchase a package, they’ll sometimes include a complimentary facial or laser treatment. Overall, the service is professional, welcoming, and effective. I would definitely recommend this place!", "author": "Anastasia Kuo", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101291982118734289635/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-01-17T17:42:29.848937559Z", "text": "I’ve been coming here for about a year and have absolutely love it! All the estheticians are great but I’ve been seeing Silvia more consistently and she does such an amazing job! She’s really knowledgeable and kind, and has helped transform my skin even more the last few months. Worth every penny :)", "author": "Mandy Miller", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106239583771255783882/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Misarang Beauty & M Clinic has a 4.9 star Google rating from 495 Google reviews. Patients commonly mention compassionate care, friendly staff, clear explanations, comfortable visits.", "about_highlight": "The clinic''