se nerve pain that no doctor to could give me answers for. After consistently going for a few months I felt insanely better and no longer have the pain anymore. Very knowledgeable and cares", "author": "Cassie Renner", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116388577698653628437/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-10-23T20:18:19.607092940Z", "text": "Dr. Zhang/Johnson is amazing! I started coming to Strive Total Wellness originally for some severe chronic lower back-pain. Shortly after six months, not only is my back-pain now gone, Johnson is helping me in my other health aspects.\n\nI have done cuppings and needles with electricity with Johnson. Each time, I am left feeling better right after the appt. Johnson also gives good advice for my diets (when I do follow it thoroughly, my eczema wouldn’t flare up).\n\nRecently, I switched my back pain concerns (woo hoo!) to focus on my painful periods, and Johnson’s practices have been instrumental in helping me heal and feel better.\n\nI’d definitely recommend Johnson!", "author": "LZ H", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105411543779486801985/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-01-30T14:32:30.176591468Z", "text": "I have been seeing Xing Zhang for herbal blends to remedy a viral infection when western medicine said there was no treatment. The experience is very fast and easy and I’m very grateful for the care!", "author": "Nicole S", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113760105928603992436/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Patients consistently praise Dr. Zhang for his holistic, personalized approach, noting significant improvements in their health, from chronic pain relief to stress reduction and overall well-being.", "about_highlight": "Xing Zhang Acupuncture & Herbs Clinic is a dedicated acupuncture and herbal medicine practice located in New York, NY. The clinic offers a range of services includin