ferent areas and aspects of your lifestyle and makes suggestions on even small things you can do to help better yourself and the goals you want to achieve.  I’d really recommend Juliette to anyone looking to heal any of the health conditions she tackles!!!", "author": "Astrid Lopus", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114553085863207905969/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Patients consistently praise Juliette for her expertise, kindness, and effective treatments, with many reporting significant improvements in their conditions.", "about_highlight": "Juliette Aiyana, L.Ac., MTCM is a licensed acupuncturist and herbalist specializing in Traditional Chinese Herbal Medicine and holistic tele-health consultations. She takes the time to understand each patient''s unique needs, identifies the root causes of imbalance, and creates personalized wellness plans. Her boutique practice offers virtual online video appointments, with herbs and supplements shipped directly to patients'' doors. Juliette has specialized training in identifying and supporting skin diseases on diverse skin tones and provides affirming care for people of all ages, races, genders, sexual orientations, body sizes, abilities, and cultural or ethnic identities.", "appointment_url": "https://acusimple.com/bookings/1622", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=9836373571034500169&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJwWmCbaJZwokRSUyNw6XRgYg", "quality_missing": ["insurance"], "search_keywords": ["dermatology", "dermatologist", "skin doctor", "acne", "eczema", "skin cancer", "da liễu", "bác sĩ da liễu", "피부과", "皮肤科", "english", "chinese", "mandarin", "cantonese", "中文", "普通话", "国语", "粤语", "广东话", "华人", "gut & digestive health", "allergies & immunity", "pelvic, menstrual & hormone support", "initial consultation", "follow-up consultation", "gastroenterology", "immunology", "women''s health", "consultation", "juliette aiyana", "licensed acupuncturist (l.ac.), master of traditional chinese medicine (mtcm), herbalist"], "cultural_context": "Juliette Aiyana''s practice affirms people of various ages, races, genders, sexual orientations, body sizes, abilities, and cultural or ethnic identities. She stands against systemic bias and oppression in healthcare, creating a safe and respectful space for healing. Her approach integrates Traditional Chinese Herbal Medicine principles.", "services_offered": [{"name": "Dermatology", "category": "Dermatology", "description": "All-natural, non-toxic, non-steroidal treatments for eczema, atopic dermatitis, acne, rosacea, lichen sclerosus, topical steroid withdrawal, shingles, perioral dermatitis, warts, fungus, and more.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "All skin types, including skin of color."}, {"name": "Gut & Digestive Health", "category": "Gastroenterology", "description": "Customized gut recovery programs for IBS/IBD, chronic constipation, bloating, nausea, acid reflux, leaky gut, food sensitivities, and more. Avoids harsh elimination diets.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Allergies & Immunity", "category": "Immunology", "description": "Natural management of seasonal allergies, food sensitivities, chronic sinusitis, asthma, autoimmune disorders, Hashimoto''s, HIV, PCOS, Raynaud''s, chronic Lyme, COVID/post-COVID syndrome, pre-diabetes, and more.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Pelvic, Menstrual & Hormone Support", "category": "Women''s Health", "description": "Support for PMS, cramps, endometriosis, heavy/irregular periods, PCOS, UTIs, yeast infections, hot flashes, night sweats, anxiety, painful sex, fatigue, peri-menopause and menopause. Experience working with trans and non-binary people.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Women, trans, and non-binary individuals."}, {"name": "Initial Consultation", "category": "Consultation", "description": "Comprehensive 1.5-hour meeting to discuss root causes, Chinese medical principles, self-care techniques, diet, sleep, exercise, and mind-body relaxation.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "New patients."}, {"name": "Follow-Up Consultation", "category": "Consultation", "description": "30-minute monthly follow-up to monitor progress and adjust treatment plan and herbal prescriptions.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Existing patients."}], "short_description": "Juliette Aiyana, L.Ac. offers personalized Traditional Chinese Herbal Medicine and holistic tele-health consultations, with herbs and supplements shipped to your door.", "google_website_url": "http://www.julietteaiyana.com/", "google_primary_type": "Medical Clinic", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": ["Juliette Aiyana"], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "accepting_new_patients": true, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "134 W 26th St #903, New York, NY 10001, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/117478417626708056744", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWi5qa4kaV9T7feM3IjXwdCh30qyqQPDli7FMf5qNii-7q0aiEI=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Juliette Aiyana, L.Ac. Traditional Chinese Medicine Herbalist"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/117478417626708056744", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWi5qa4kaV9T7feM3IjXwdCh30qyqQPDli7FMf5qNii-7q0aiEI=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Juliette Aiyana, L.Ac. Traditional Chinese Medicine Herbalist"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/101945746173603937060", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUZGJ6wWom5UlLeSSTIAcr0uNP1af_P6WiMaaItrLlt3jXcJuWg=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Juliette Aiyana, LAc. MTCM"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/117478417626708056744", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWi5qa4kaV9T7feM3IjXwdCh30qyqQPDli7FMf5qNii-7q0aiEI=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Juliette Aiyana, L.Ac. Traditional Chinese Medicine Herbalist"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/117478417626708056744", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWi5qa4kaV9T7feM3IjXwdCh30qyqQPDli7FMf5qNii-7q0aiEI=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Juliette Aiyana, L.Ac. Traditional Chinese Medicine Herbalist"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-26T13:55:06.841631+00:00', 'juliette-aiyana-lac-traditional-chinese-medicine-herbalist', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('fb14fb3a-a0c2-4c35-8a6a-83f0eb0e7850', NULL, 'Taek Soo Shin MD, Care MD Clinic', 'Care MD Clinic is a primary care clinic dedicated to providing comprehensive and personalized care. Dr. Taek Soo Shin, a board-certified internist with extensive experience, believes medicine should focus on the human relationship between patient and provider. Patients are listened to, never rushed, and guided through each decision. Dr. Shin earned his medical degree at Seoul National University College of Medicine and completed residencies in both Family Medicine and Internal Medicine, including at St Francis Hospital in Illinois. He has won awards such as ''The Resident of the Year'' and the ''Physician-Patient Experience Award.'' The clinic offers acute and chronic disease management, preventive care, immigration physicals, and more under a philosophy of high-quality, personalized attention.', '2601 Little Elm Pkwy Suite 2501, Little Elm, TX 75068', 'Little Elm', 'TX', '75068', '(972) 972-4234', ARRAY['English', 'Spanish', 'Korean']::text[], 'Primary Care', FALSE, '{"fax": "(972) 777-1090", "email": "caremdclinic@gmail.com", "images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/taek-soo-shin-md-care-md-clinic-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/taek-soo-shin-md-care-md-clinic-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/taek-soo-shin-md-care-md-clinic-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/taek-soo-shin-md-care-md-clinic-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/taek-soo-shin-md-care-md-clinic-google-5.webp"], "rating": 4.9, "reviews": [{"date": "2026-05-21T13:44:56.783060301Z", "text": "I am so glad I found Dr. Shin. He is incredibly kind, professional, and thorough, and it’s clear that he truly cares about his patients.\n\nHis staff is also warm and pleasant, and the facility itself is beautiful and spotless.\n\nI will be recommending everyone I know to Dr. Shin.", "author": "Shonda Buckhaulton", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109803636476722340155/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-28T01:20:24.769188906Z", "text": "We love Dr. Shin! Every time we need to see the doctor, the receptionists manage to give us an appointment the same day or the next day. The doctor always kind and with all the time to listen. He takes the time to explain to me even with the computer any questions or concerns I have. I totally recommend it.", "author": "Flaquita Love", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101319335470925239480/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-03-29T12:36:52.337884162Z", "text": "Dr. Shin and his administrative team are exceptional. They’re consistently responsive, helpful, and respectful of your time—I’ve never had to wait. I would recommend them without hesitation.", "author": "Raja Jayakanthan", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115575165012563346411/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-12-24T19:14:11.867901585Z", "text": "Dr. Shin and his Team are great! We needed exam for immigration and they were really helpful and fast to complete all the required paperwork! Highly recommended", "author": "Andras Titton", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113618179376654095176/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-09-18T16:35:16.140480582Z", "text": "Dr.Shin is accurately  assesses  patient''s conditions and tailors his prescriptions  to my specific  health needs. He is extremely  knowledgeable  and his staff are all friendly.  I highly recommend  him.", "author": "Joie''s Art Studio Frisco", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110346366503552366684/reviews"}], "website": "http://caremdclinic.com/", "location": {"latitude": 33.1699512, "longitude": -96.89480030000001}, "services": ["Primary Care", "Immigration Physicals", "Acute Disease Management", "Chronic Disease Management"], "insurance": {"notes": null, "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": [], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": false}, "highlights": [{"title": "Board-Certified Internist", "detail": "Dr. Taek Soo Shin is a board-certified internist with decades of experience in managing acute and chronic diseases.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Personalized Care Philosophy", "detail": "The clinic prioritizes the human relationship, ensuring patients feel listened to and never rushed.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Multilingual Staff", "detail": "The website is available in English, Spanish, and Korean, and Dr. Shin connects with people from different backgrounds.", "category": "culture"}], "price_tier": "$$", "source_url": "http://caremdclinic.com/", "appointment": {"booking_note": null, "appointment_url": null, "new_patient_note": null, "phone_booking_available": true, "online_booking_available": false, "free_consultation_available": null}, "open_sunday": false, "scout_query": "Korean speaking medical clinic in Dallas, TX", "search_text": "primary care | family doctor | general practitioner | annual physical | checkup | bác sĩ gia đình | khám tổng quát | nội khoa | 내과 | 가정의학과 | 家庭医生 | 全科医生 | 内科 | english | spanish | korean | 한국어 | 한인 | 한국말 | immigration physicals | acute disease management | chronic disease management | preventive | emergency | taek soo shin, md | board-certified internist", "google_types": ["medical_clinic", "health", "point_of_interest", "establishment"], "open_weekend": false, "rating_count": 158, "team_members": [{"name": "Taek Soo Shin, MD", "role": "Board-Certified Internist", "bio_snippet": "Dr. Shin earned his MD from Seoul National University College of Medicine, completed a Family Medicine residency at SNU Hospital (Resident of the Year for 3 years), and holds a Master''s in Public Health. He served as a medical officer in the Korean Army, ran a practice in Seoul, relocated to the US in 2004, and completed an Internal Medicine residency at St Francis Hospital in Illinois. He worked as a hospitalist for 14 years in the Chicago area, winning the Physician-Patient Experience Award at St. Alexius Medical Center.", "languages_spoken": ["English", "Korean"]}], "language_note": "Dr. Shin earned his medical degree at Seoul National University College of Medicine in South Korea and completed a Family Medicine residency at Seoul National University Hospital. He served as a medical officer in the Korean Army and ran a practice in Seoul before relocating to the United States in 2004. The clinic website is available in English, Spanish, and Korean, indicating a multilingual approach and cultural competency for Asian and immigrant patients.", "open_saturday": false, "quality_score": 93, "working_hours": {"friday": "8:00 AM – 4:30 PM", "monday": "8:00 AM – 4:30 PM", "sunday": "Closed", "tuesday": "8:00 AM – 4:30 PM", "saturday": "Closed", "thursday": "8:00 AM – 4:30 PM", "wednesday": "8:00 AM – 4:30 PM"}, "gallery_images": ["https://static.wixstatic.com/media/887cf2_75f80d5337384acfa9bcc20b5c7e92f0~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_271,h_271,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/887cf2_75f80d5337384acfa9bcc20b5c7e92f0~mv2.png", "https://static.wixstatic.com/media/887cf2_e4ff9a4579f84f9cb6d070b419d7b29c~mv2.jpg/v1/crop/x_250,y_340,w_2491,h_2684/fill/w_310,h_333,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/887cf2_e4ff9a4579f84f9cb6d070b419d7b29c~mv2.jpg"], "review_profile": {"rating": 4.9, "source": "google", "themes": [{"theme": "Staff Professionalism", "mentions": 4, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Every reviewer highlights friendly, knowledgeable staff who are responsive and respectful of patients'' time."}, {"theme": "Clinical Expertise", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Dr. Shin is described as extremely knowledgeable, thorough, and attentive to patients'' specific health needs."}, {"theme": "Communication", "mentions": 2, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients appreciate Dr. Shin''s ability to take time to explain concerns and answer questions clearly."}, {"theme": "Facility Environment", "mentions": 1, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "The clinic is noted for being beautiful, spotless, and well-maintained."}, {"theme": "Efficiency", "mentions": 2, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Reviewers commend the clinic for same-day or next-day appointments and quick completion of paperwork."}], "summary": "Patients consistently praise Dr. Shin for his kindness, professionalism, and thorough care, highlighting his attentive approach and the supportive, efficient staff.", "review_count": 158, "concern_themes": [], "positive_themes": [], "featured_reviews": [{"date": "2026-05-21T13:44:56.783060301Z", "text": "I am so glad I found Dr. Shin. He is incredibly kind, professional, and thorough, and it’s clear that he truly cares about his patients.\n\nHis staff is also warm and pleasant, and the facility itself is beautiful and spotless.\n\nI will be recommending everyone I know to Dr. Shin.", "author": "Shonda Buckhaulton", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109803636476722340155/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-02-28T01:20:24.769188906Z", "text": "We love Dr. Shin! Every time we need to see the doctor, the receptionists manage to give us an appointment the same day or the next day. The doctor always kind and with all the time to listen. He takes the time to explain to me even with the computer any questions or concerns I have. I totally recommend it.", "author": "Flaquita Love", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101319335470925239480/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-03-29T12:36:52.337884162Z", "text": "Dr. Shin and his administrative team are exceptional. They’re consistently responsive, helpful, and respectful of your time—I’ve never had to wait. I would recommend them without hesitation.", "author": "Raja Jayakanthan", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115575165012563346411/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-12-24T19:14:11.867901585Z", "text": "Dr. Shin and his Team are great! We needed exam for immigration and they were really helpful and fast to complete all the required paperwork! Highly recommended", "author": "Andras Titton", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113618179376654095176/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-09-18T16:35:16.140480582Z", "text": "Dr.Shin is accurately  assesses  patient''s conditions and tailors his prescriptions  to my specific  health needs. He is extremely  knowledgeable  and his staff are all friendly.  I highly recommend  him.", "author": "Joie''s Art Studio Frisco", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110346366503552366684/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Patients consistently praise Dr. Shin for his kindness, professionalism, and thorough care, highlighting his attentive approach and the supportive, efficient staff.", "about_highlight": "Care MD Clinic is a primary care clinic dedicated to providing comprehensive and personalized care. Dr. Taek Soo Shin, a board-certified internist with extensive experience, believes medicine should focus on the human relationship between patient and provider. Patients are listened to, never rushed, and guided through each decision. Dr. Shin earned his medical degree at Seoul National University College of Medicine and completed residencies in both Family Medicine and Internal Medicine, including at St Francis Hospital in Illinois. He has won awards such as ''The Resident of the Year'' and the ''Physician-Patient Experience Award.'' The clinic offers acute and chronic disease management, preventive care, immigration physicals, and more under a philosophy of high-quality, personalized attention.", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=1579816300798867779&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJXTchr9tr12YRQ_l8K46i7BU", "quality_missing": ["insurance", "appointment_url"], "search_keywords": ["primary care", "family doctor", "general practitioner", "annual physical", "checkup", "bác sĩ gia đình", "khám tổng quát", "nội khoa", "내과", "가정의학과", "家庭医生", "全科医生", "内科", "english", "spanish", "korean", "한국어", "한인", "한국말", "immigration physicals", "acute disease management", "chronic disease management", "preventive", "emergency", "taek soo shin, md", "board-certified internist"], "cultural_context": "Dr. Shin earned his medical degree at Seoul National University College of Medicine in South Korea and completed a Family Medicine residency at Seoul National University Hospital. He served as a medical officer in the Korean Army and ran a practice in Seoul before relocating to the United States in 2004. The clinic website is available in English, Spanish, and Korean, indicating a multilingual approach and cultural competency for Asian and immigrant patients.", "services_offered": [{"name": "Primary Care", "category": "Primary Care", "description": "Comprehensive and personalized primary care for acute and chronic diseases, health promotion, and preventive care.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "All ages requiring ongoing primary care management."}, {"name": "Immigration Physicals", "category": "Preventive", "description": "Physical examinations required for immigration purposes.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Applicants needing USCIS-related medical exams."}, {"name": "Acute Disease Management", "category": "Emergency", "description": "Expert management of acute illnesses and conditions.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients with sudden or short-term medical issues."}, {"name": "Chronic Disease Management", "category": "Primary Care", "description": "Comprehensive care for long-term conditions such as diabetes, hypertension, etc.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients with ongoing chronic conditions."}], "short_description": "Care MD Clinic provides truly personalized primary care under board-certified internist Dr. Taek Soo Shin, with a focus on the human relationship between patient and provider.", "google_website_url": "http://caremdclinic.com/", "google_primary_type": "Medical Clinic", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": ["Taek Soo Shin, MD"], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "2601 Little Elm Pkwy Ste 2501, Little Elm, TX 75068, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/115544665878615786066", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUy1-Nb6wtd9E3rYBOhjz44ngHJqQGk8jZz7X0PCjC8Mt_gfkKy=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "josue hernandez"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/101033227459527247535", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK_B66et1lx1XpigK5eCvnnMaPsb9shW5dclYN0U-NGu7C2vg=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Taek Soo Shin MD, Care MD Clinic"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/101033227459527247535", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK_B66et1lx1XpigK5eCvnnMaPsb9shW5dclYN0U-NGu7C2vg=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Taek Soo Shin MD, Care MD Clinic"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/101033227459527247535", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK_B66et1lx1XpigK5eCvnnMaPsb9shW5dclYN0U-NGu7C2vg=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Taek Soo Shin MD, Care MD Clinic"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/101033227459527247535", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK_B66et1lx1XpigK5eCvnnMaPsb9shW5dclYN0U-NGu7C2vg=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Taek Soo Shin MD, Care MD Clinic"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-26T11:10:38.093297+00:00', 'taek-soo-shin-md-care-md-clinic', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('2859f2c0-ae7d-4d7b-810e-d56ffcd0a931', NULL, 'Athletic Orthopedics & Knee Center', 'Athletic Orthopedics & Knee Center (AOKC) is a comprehensive orthopedic and sports medicine practice serving the Houston area for over 25 years. The center offers a one-stop convenient location integrating orthopedic treatment, physical therapy, regenerative cell therapy, pain management, and imaging to ensure the best possible medical and surgical outcomes. With a team of board-certified orthopedic surgeons and specialists, AOKC is dedicated to treating a wide range of orthopedic conditions from knee and shoulder injuries to spine disorders and foot/ankle problems. The practice has been recognized with multiple awards, including Best Physical Therapist and Best Sports Medicine by Living Magazine, and is committed to providing integrated, patient-centered care.', '9180 Katy Freeway, Suite 200', 'Houston', 'TX', '77055', '(713) 984-1400', ARRAY['English', 'Vietnamese']::text[], 'Orthopedics', FALSE, '{"fax": "(713) 984-0544", "images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/athletic-orthopedics-knee-center-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/athletic-orthopedics-knee-center-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/athletic-orthopedics-knee-center-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/athletic-orthopedics-knee-center-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/athletic-orthopedics-knee-center-google-5.webp"], "rating": 4.4, "reviews": [{"date": "2026-01-31T13:40:00.747873251Z", "text": "I really appreciate the convenience of having the MRI facility, surgeon, and surgery center all in one location. It made the entire process much less stressful and very efficient.\nMy surgeon, Dr. Jensen, did an excellent job with my surgery and I feel confident in his skill and expertise. Just be aware that appointments tend to be brief, so you may not get a lot of one-on-one time with him personally.\nThe only minor concern I had with the surgeon’s office was occasional communication gaps with newer or student staff. During one visit, after the doctor gave instructions and left, a nurse asked me to clarify what he had said. On another visit, a staff member dismissed me before my appointment was complete and had to be called back. It wasn’t poor service — just a bit awkward and disorganized at times.\nMy biggest challenge was with physical therapy. Initially, things were going well, but after being reassigned to a different therapist, my experience changed significantly. My post-op restrictions didn’t seem to be reviewed, and my knee was pushed into full flexion only days after ACL and meniscus surgery, which caused severe pain. I also felt rushed, left alone frequently, and not well supported during sessions. It was discouraging enough that I chose not to return.\nSince transferring to another PT facility, I’ve had a much better experience with attentive therapists who follow my recovery plan carefully and work progressively without overdoing it.\nOverall, I would absolutely recommend the surgery team and facility for the procedure itself. My suggestion would simply be to research your physical therapy options to ensure you’re matched with the right provider for your recovery.", "author": "Tiffani Garza", "rating": 3, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100101941158581488355/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-01-07T16:29:32.702761078Z", "text": "On a recent visit, Dr Jensen was out and I saw Nicole Jordan, OPA.  She was very pleasant, answered all my questions and explained her diagnosis of my knee and back. Dr Jensen is fortunate to have her as part of his staff.", "author": "Mary Kay Donovan", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117022108332160986179/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-06-27T16:18:04.980949802Z", "text": "Absolutely outstanding experience at AOKC. From the moment I walked into the clinic, I was greeted warmly by the front desk staff who made the check-in process fast, easy, and stress-free. The entire facility is clean modern and well organized, creating a professional yet welcoming atmosphere.\n\nIf you’re looking for an orthopedic clinic where you’re treated with respect, compassion and top tier expertise, I highly recommend Athletic Orthopedics and Knee Center. Dr. Jensen and the entire team go above and beyond. I won’t trust my care anywhere else!", "author": "Sina Jafari", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117564742479138570494/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-01-06T15:43:30.586785645Z", "text": "Horrible dr Gover never helped when I went in with neck pain. Scribbled a few orders and when I called the office more than a dozen times to do orders No one ever responded ever . Now a year later they bill me! The nerve!!", "author": "Cheryl Engel", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117494251746778119509/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-08-05T21:23:59.905053230Z", "text": "The staff that work the phones here are very rude. I called the office wanting more information on the clinic and to be seen. The lady that picked up the phone was VERY unprofessional and hung up on my face. I work in the health field and it’s just unacceptable how they treat a potential patient. I will not be coming here to be seen because if you can treat somebody in need like that over the phone i don’t even want to imagine how they would treat me in person.", "author": "Zayra Ekoki", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108566909181068449842/reviews"}], "website": "http://www.aokc.net", "location": {"latitude": 29.785243399999995, "longitude": -95.5162998}, "services": ["Knee", "Shoulder", "Elbow", "Foot & Ankle", "Hand and Wrist", "Spine", "Orthopedics", "Sports Medicine", "Physical Therapy", "Imaging", "Stem Cell Therapy for Joint Pain", "Regenerative Cell Therapy – PRP"], "insurance": {"notes": null, "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": [], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": false}, "highlights": [{"title": "One-Stop Convenient Location", "detail": "Integrates orthopedic treatment, physical therapy, regenerative cell therapy, pain management, and imaging under one roof.", "category": "convenience"}, {"title": "Over 25 Years of Service", "detail": "Proudly serving the Houston area with trusted orthopedic care for more than 25 years.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Board-Certified Orthopedic Surgeons", "detail": "Expert team led by board-certified orthopedic surgeons and specialists.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Integrated Treatment Approach", "detail": "Combines surgical and non-surgical options including regenerative cell therapy and physical therapy.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Award-Winning Practice", "detail": "Recognized as Best Physical Therapist and Best Sports Medicine by Living Magazine, and top three Orthopedic Centers by Houston Chronicle.", "category": "reviews"}], "price_tier": "$$", "source_url": "http://www.aokc.net/?utm_source=local&utm_medium=organic&utm_campaign=gmb", "appointment": {"booking_note": null, "appointment_url": "http://www.aokc.net/appointments-orthopedic-surgeons-houston-tx.html", "new_patient_note": null, "phone_booking_available": true, "online_booking_available": true, "free_consultation_available": null}, "open_sunday": false, "scout_query": "Vietnamese orthopedic clinic in Houston, TX", "search_text": "orthopedics | orthopedic | joint pain | sports medicine | spine | knee | cơ xương khớp | chấn thương chỉnh hình | 정형외과 | 骨科 | english | vietnamese | tiếng việt | người việt | bác sĩ việt | shoulder | elbow | foot & ankle | hand and wrist | physical therapy | imaging | stem cell therapy for joint pain | regenerative cell therapy – prp | rehabilitation | diagnostic | regenerative medicine | jack e. jensen, m.d., f.a.c.s.m. | board-certified orthopedic surgeon | pawan grover, m.d. | back pain and interventional specialist | sherman nagler, d.p.m., f.a.c.f.a.s | podiatrist, foot & ankle surgeon", "google_types": ["physiotherapist", "medical_clinic", "health", "point_of_interest", "establishment"], "open_weekend": false, "rating_count": 418, "team_members": [{"name": "Jack E. Jensen, M.D., F.A.C.S.M.", "role": "Board-Certified Orthopedic Surgeon", "bio_snippet": "Board-Certified Orthopedic Surgeon with over 25 years of service.", "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Pawan Grover, M.D.", "role": "Back Pain And Interventional Specialist", "bio_snippet": "Back Pain And Interventional Specialist.", "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Sherman Nagler, D.P.M., F.A.C.F.A.S", "role": "Podiatrist, Foot & Ankle Surgeon", "bio_snippet": "Podiatrist, Foot & Ankle Surgeon.", "languages_spoken": []}], "open_saturday": false, "quality_score": 95, "working_hours": {"friday": "8:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "monday": "8:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "sunday": "Closed", "tuesday": "8:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "saturday": "Closed", "thursday": "8:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "wednesday": "8:00 AM – 5:00 PM"}, "gallery_images": ["http://www.aokc.net/images/logo-aokc.jpg", "http://www.aokc.net/images/jack-jensen-new-img.jpg", "http://www.aokc.net/images/pawan-grover-new-img.jpg", "http://www.aokc.net/images/sherman-nagler-img-h.jpg", "http://www.aokc.net/images/aokc-urgent-orthocare-img.jpg", "http://www.aokc.net/images/aokc-stem-cell-therapy-img.jpg", "http://www.aokc.net/images/aokc-physical-therapy-img.jpg"], "review_profile": {"rating": 4.4, "source": "google", "themes": [{"theme": "Compassionate care", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients highlight compassionate care in their feedback."}, {"theme": "Friendly staff", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients highlight friendly staff in their feedback."}, {"theme": "Clear explanations", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients highlight clear explanations in their feedback."}, {"theme": "Comfortable visits", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients highlight comfortable visits in their feedback."}], "summary": "Athletic Orthopedics & Knee Center has a 4.4 star Google rating from 418 Google reviews. Patients commonly mention compassionate care, friendly staff, clear explanations, comfortable visits.", "review_count": 418, "concern_themes": [], "positive_themes": ["Bedside manners", "Knowledge", "Care"], "featured_reviews": [{"date": "2026-01-31T13:40:00.747873251Z", "text": "I really appreciate the convenience of having the MRI facility, surgeon, and surgery center all in one location. It made the entire process much less stressful and very efficient.\nMy surgeon, Dr. Jensen, did an excellent job with my surgery and I feel confident in his skill and expertise. Just be aware that appointments tend to be brief, so you may not get a lot of one-on-one time with him personally.\nThe only minor concern I had with the surgeon’s office was occasional communication gaps with newer or student staff. During one visit, after the doctor gave instructions and left, a nurse asked me to clarify what he had said. On another visit, a staff member dismissed me before my appointment was complete and had to be called back. It wasn’t poor service — just a bit awkward and disorganized at times.\nMy biggest challenge was with physical therapy. Initially, things were going well, but after being reassigned to a different therapist, my experience changed significantly. My post-op restrictions didn’t seem to be reviewed, and my knee was pushed into full flexion only days after ACL and meniscus surgery, which caused severe pain. I also felt rushed, left alone frequently, and not well supported during sessions. It was discouraging enough that I chose not to return.\nSince transferring to another PT facility, I’ve had a much better experience with attentive therapists who follow my recovery plan carefully and work progressively without overdoing it.\nOverall, I would absolutely recommend the surgery team and facility for the procedure itself. My suggestion would simply be to research your physical therapy options to ensure you’re matched with the right provider for your recovery.", "author": "Tiffani Garza", "rating": 3, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100101941158581488355/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-01-07T16:29:32.702761078Z", "text": "On a recent visit, Dr Jensen was out and I saw Nicole Jordan, OPA.  She was very pleasant, answered all my questions and explained her diagnosis of my knee and back. Dr Jensen is fortunate to have her as part of his staff.", "author": "Mary Kay Donovan", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117022108332160986179/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-06-27T16:18:04.980949802Z", "text": "Absolutely outstanding experience at AOKC. From the moment I walked into the clinic, I was greeted warmly by the front desk staff who made the check-in process fast, easy, and stress-free. The entire facility is clean modern and well organized, creating a professional yet welcoming atmosphere.\n\nIf you’re looking for an orthopedic clinic where you’re treated with respect, compassion and top tier expertise, I highly recommend Athletic Orthopedics and Knee Center. Dr. Jensen and the entire team go above and beyond. I won’t trust my care anywhere else!", "author": "Sina Jafari", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117564742479138570494/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-01-06T15:43:30.586785645Z", "text": "Horrible dr Gover never helped when I went in with neck pain. Scribbled a few orders and when I called the office more than a dozen times to do orders No one ever responded ever . Now a year later they bill me! The nerve!!", "author": "Cheryl Engel", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117494251746778119509/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-08-05T21:23:59.905053230Z", "text": "The staff that work the phones here are very rude. I called the office wanting more information on the clinic and to be seen. The lady that picked up the phone was VERY unprofessional and hung up on my face. I work in the health field and it’s just unacceptable how they treat a potential patient. I will not be coming here to be seen because if you can treat somebody in need like that over the phone i don’t even want to imagine how they would treat me in person.", "author": "Zayra Ekoki", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108566909181068449842/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Athletic Orthopedics & Knee Center has a 4.4 star Google rating from 418 Google reviews. Patients commonly mention compassionate care, friendly staff, clear explanations, comfortable visits.", "about_highlight": "Athletic Orthopedics & Knee Center (AOKC) is a comprehensive orthopedic and sports medicine practice serving the Houston area for over 25 years. The center offers a one-stop convenient location integrating orthopedic treatment, physical therapy, regenerative cell therapy, pain management, and imaging to ensure the best possible medical and surgical outcomes. With a team of board-certified orthopedic surgeons and specialists, AOKC is dedicated to treating a wide range of orthopedic conditions from knee and shoulder injuries to spine disorders and foot/ankle problems. The practice has been recognized with multiple awards, including Best Physical Therapist and Best Sports Medicine by Living Magazine, and is committed to providing integrated, patient-centered care.", "appointment_url": "http://www.aokc.net/appointments-orthopedic-surgeons-houston-tx.html", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=10745596816937529089&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJXRNef2HEQIYRAS8hVV8HIJU", "quality_missing": ["insurance"], "search_keywords": ["orthopedics", "orthopedic", "joint pain", "sports medicine", "spine", "knee", "cơ xương khớp", "chấn thương chỉnh hình", "정형외과", "骨科", "english", "vietnamese", "tiếng việt", "người việt", "bác sĩ việt", "shoulder", "elbow", "foot & ankle", "hand and wrist", "physical therapy", "imaging", "stem cell therapy for joint pain", "regenerative cell therapy – prp", "rehabilitation", "diagnostic", "regenerative medicine", "jack e. jensen, m.d., f.a.c.s.m.", "board-certified orthopedic surgeon", "pawan grover, m.d.", "back pain and interventional specialist", "sherman nagler, d.p.m., f.a.c.f.a.s", "podiatrist, foot & ankle surgeon"], "services_offered": [{"name": "Knee", "category": "Orthopedics", "description": "Treatment for complex knee joint injuries including bones, tendons, ligaments, and muscles.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Shoulder", "category": "Orthopedics", "description": "Treatment for the entire spectrum of shoulder conditions.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Elbow", "category": "Orthopedics", "description": "Treatment for lateral epicondylitis (''tennis elbow'') and other elbow conditions.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Foot & Ankle", "category": "Orthopedics", "description": "Using the latest medical technology to treat foot and ankle conditions.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Hand and Wrist", "category": "Orthopedics", "description": "Treatment for hand, wrist, and arm injuries using latest diagnostic and treatment techniques.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Spine", "category": "Orthopedics", "description": "Treatment for spine disorders including disc problems, scoliosis, arthritis.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Orthopedics", "category": "Orthopedics", "description": "Dedicated to treating a wide range of orthopedic conditions and injuries with an integrated treatment approach.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Sports Medicine", "category": "Sports Medicine", "description": "Diagnostic, surgical and non-surgical treatment of orthopedic injuries by a highly respected team.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Athletes and active individuals"}, {"name": "Physical Therapy", "category": "Rehabilitation", "description": "Goal to enable patients to become stronger, faster, and more balanced than before injury.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Imaging", "category": "Diagnostic", "description": "Provides digital x-ray services on-site.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Stem Cell Therapy for Joint Pain", "category": "Regenerative Medicine", "description": "Uses your own cells or frozen donated cells to support the body''s natural healing.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Regenerative Cell Therapy – PRP", "category": "Regenerative Medicine", "description": "Platelet-rich plasma therapy injecting concentrated platelets from patient''s own blood.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}], "short_description": "Exceptional care for orthopedic and sports medicine injuries at a one-stop convenient location.", "google_website_url": "http://www.aokc.net/?utm_source=local&utm_medium=organic&utm_campaign=gmb", "google_primary_type": "Medical Clinic", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": ["Jack E. Jensen, M.D., F.A.C.S.M.", "Pawan Grover, M.D.", "Sherman Nagler, D.P.M., F.A.C.F.A.S"], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "9180 Katy Fwy # 200, Houston, TX 77055, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/103899041426342602737", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjViI_QWzzCwiP4KxaYcvIpT4b8pZSMN84d0aX2Fj7ervB5fYvs=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Athletic Orthopedics & Knee Center"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/113004552756966218774", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWFfyqFotDd5lJPMWKs1wBzs4gSLevKmOStuLh1tieJA8ss73Fy=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Greg St Cyr"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/103899041426342602737", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjViI_QWzzCwiP4KxaYcvIpT4b8pZSMN84d0aX2Fj7ervB5fYvs=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Athletic Orthopedics & Knee Center"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/103899041426342602737", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjViI_QWzzCwiP4KxaYcvIpT4b8pZSMN84d0aX2Fj7ervB5fYvs=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Athletic Orthopedics & Knee Center"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/103899041426342602737", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjViI_QWzzCwiP4KxaYcvIpT4b8pZSMN84d0aX2Fj7ervB5fYvs=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Athletic Orthopedics & Knee Center"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-26T14:01:16.91275+00:00', 'athletic-orthopedics-knee-center', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('63204184-db40-4201-af64-78e94ec680fe', NULL, 'UT Physicians Orthopedics Trauma Clinic', 'UT Physicians Orthopedics Trauma Clinic provides specialized orthopedic trauma care for adult patients. The team includes surgeons trained in the latest and least invasive surgical approaches, including robotic and arthroscopic surgery. The clinic offers comprehensive care for a wide range of orthopedic conditions, from sports medicine and total joint replacements to reconstructive trauma and pain management. The clinic is part of UT Physicians, a large multi-specialty group with over 2,000 clinicians and more than 100 locations across the Greater Houston area.', '6414 Fannin St, Ste G.150, Houston, TX 77030-1514', 'Houston', 'TX', '77030', '713-486-7560', ARRAY['English', 'Vietnamese']::text[], 'Orthopedics', FALSE, '{"fax": "713-486-7512", "images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/ut-physicians-orthopedics-trauma-clinic-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/ut-physicians-orthopedics-trauma-clinic-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/ut-physicians-orthopedics-trauma-clinic-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/ut-physicians-orthopedics-trauma-clinic-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/ut-physicians-orthopedics-trauma-clinic-google-5.webp"], "rating": 4.9, "reviews": [{"date": "2026-04-30T18:52:04.909562597Z", "text": "Dr Munz''s and his staff are exceptional! The are knowledgeable, skilled and understanding a well as kind. One of the best medical experiences I have ever had during the most scary and difficult medical situation I have been in.  Without their care and kindness I believe my situation would not be turning out as well as it is.", "author": "Jim Sydnor", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110920592878351704680/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-10-22T16:01:29.329334218Z", "text": "Sr Fullick and his team were excellent!  1st appointment met with Fellow - Matthew who was so patient, reviewed my MRI with me, explained \"why\" rotator cuff repair was better than replacement. Dr. Fullick was very thorough. Maria followed up quickly addressing my concerns and I met Fabian today for post op followup and he was top\nnotch as well!  Highly recommend!", "author": "Dianne M.", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118254827851486511618/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-10-22T15:03:42.832110618Z", "text": "Great Experience.  Everyone was very friendly and professional.  FNP Cheryl Stano and Dr Woerner was awesome.  It was clearly busy but I did not feel rushed.  I left my appointment feeling heard, cared for and confident about my diagnosis and treatment.   I would entrust them with the care of myself, family, friends and anyone who needs a recommendation.  Good People!", "author": "Shrowder Grandaughter", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112077204871687530106/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-10-15T11:23:33.364266356Z", "text": "Dr Greaser and the UT Orthopedics Group are excellent. I have been seeing Dr Greaser for about 8 years for an ankle issue. I will need a replacement eventually; however, he has been very careful to not encourage surgery until the time is right and it will improve my quality of life. I really appreciate h