": "Clinical Expertise", "mentions": 5, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Doctors are praised for their thoroughness, skill, and ability to explain treatments clearly."}, {"theme": "Communication", "mentions": 4, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients appreciate the time doctors take to answer questions and explain diagnoses."}, {"theme": "Treatment Outcomes", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Many mention significant improvements in their conditions due to the clinic''s care."}, {"theme": "Compassionate Care", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Reviewers frequently note the kindness and understanding shown during difficult medical situations."}], "summary": "Patients consistently praise the clinic for its exceptional staff, knowledgeable doctors, and compassionate care, often describing their experiences as among the best they''ve had in healthcare.", "review_count": 362, "concern_themes": [], "positive_themes": [], "featured_reviews": [{"date": "2026-04-30T18:52:04.909562597Z", "text": "Dr Munz''s and his staff are exceptional! The are knowledgeable, skilled and understanding a well as kind. One of the best medical experiences I have ever had during the most scary and difficult medical situation I have been in.  Without their care and kindness I believe my situation would not be turning out as well as it is.", "author": "Jim Sydnor", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110920592878351704680/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-10-22T16:01:29.329334218Z", "text": "Sr Fullick and his team were excellent!  1st appointment met with Fellow - Matthew who was so patient, reviewed my MRI with me, explained \"why\" rotator cuff repair was better than replacement. Dr. Fullick was very thorough. Maria followed up quickly addressing my concerns and I met Fabian today for post op followup and he was top\nnotch as well!  Highly recommend!", "author": "Dianne M.", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118254827851486511618/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-10-22T15:03:42.832110618Z", "text": "Great Experience.  Everyone was very friendly and professional.  FNP Cheryl Stano and Dr Woerner was awesome.  It was clearly busy but I did not feel rushed.  I left my appointment feeling heard, cared for and confident about my diagnosis and treatment.   I would entrust them with the care of myself, family, friends and anyone who needs a recommendation.  Good People!", "author": "Shrowder Grandaughter", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112077204871687530106/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-10-15T11:23:33.364266356Z", "text": "Dr Greaser and the UT Orthopedics Group are excellent. I have been seeing Dr Greaser for about 8 years for an ankle issue. I will need a replacement eventually; however, he has been very careful to not encourage surgery until the time is right and it will improve my quality of life. I really appreciate his honesty, and the time he takes to explain how best to treat my injury.", "author": "Rhonda Gutierrez", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100579382576775290219/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-04-30T02:59:39.884562775Z", "text": "Dr Munz is knowledgeable and kind. He took time to answer all of my  questions at the follow up  appointments after surgery. It’s difficult recovering after an accident. I was lucky Dr Munz helped every step of the way. Thank you Dr Munz!", "author": "Karen Aptekar", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109188917115732890173/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Patients consistently praise the clinic for its exceptional staff, knowledgeable doctors, and compassionate care, often describing their experiences as among the best they''ve had in healthcare.", "about_highlight": "UT Physicians Orthopedics Trauma Clinic provides specialized 