ew to acupuncture and Dr Lee has truly answered all my questions and walked me through the process.  I feel great and look forward to my visits.", "author": "Priscilla", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102063761597532879878/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-12-19T19:45:56.063138734Z", "text": "I have been dealing with back pain and spasms for about 6 months due to a car accident. Throughout the 6 months, I’ve been doing physiotherapy and chiropractic therapy, however, my pain still remained. I found Texas Acupuncture on Google and after seeing the reviews, I took a chance. Dr.Lee has been amazing! Very professional and effective. He explained the entire treatment throughout each step and created a treatment plan for me that truly works!!! In less than a month of treatment, I had less pain and eventually pain free days. The results from acupuncture has made a positive impact in my daily and work life. I wish I started sooner.", "author": "Stephanie A", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113804619721376469011/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-04-17T18:04:27.769252768Z", "text": "Dr Lee is an excellent physician and I highly recommend him. I frequently get minor joint aches and muscular cramping from working out. Dr Lee’s acupuncture treatment significantly reduces and often relieves this pain entirely.", "author": "Conor K", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100513607101200468657/reviews"}, {"date": "2023-11-01T15:25:46.300641Z", "text": "The best Chinese medicine clinic I’ve ever been to。\nBefore I went they were very patient to check my insurance and give me recommendations. They also have a good website for EHR, and which saves time and increases efficiency.\nBefore the treatment， Dr. Fan was friendly and gentle and professional, asked about my life, and gave me some advice for improving my health. The treatment process is also pretty nice, the room/environment/background music... I feel better after treatment!👍👍👍👍👍\nDr.Lee also very professional and nice, he treated my boyfriend.", "author": "Hannah Z", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118282491476481688503/reviews"}, {"date": "2023-01-17T20:21:34.167881Z", "text": "Dr. Lee & Dr. Fan are so amazing! I received cupping and i definitely left feeling better than when I came in. I appreciate how kind the doctors are, how clean and peaceful the office feels. I would absolutely recommend someone coming here & to put forth effort into making cupping or acupuncture a necessary practice and intention.", "author": "Jasmyn Beasley", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102150191138906056690/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Patients consistently praise Texas Acupuncture Center for its professional and effective treatments, with many highlighting significant pain relief and improved well-being. The friendly, knowledgeable staff and peaceful clinic environment are also frequently commended.", "about_highlight": "Texas Acupuncture Center offers several treatment modality options that can be successfully integrated with the patient’s current medical protocols as well as preventive healthcare to achieve maximum health potential and quality of life through Traditional Chinese Medicine including acupuncture, cupping, herbal therapy, and holistic bodywork. The clinic is led by Dr. Brendan Lee, DACM, L.Ac, and Dr. Cunyu Fan, DACM, L.Ac, who provide personalized care rooted in ancient healing traditions. Located in Farmers Branch, Texas, the center serves the Dallas-Fort Worth metroplex with a focus on pain management, stress and emotional issues, women''s health, and facial rejuvenation.", "appointment_url": "https://ehr.unifiedpractice.com/Public/OnlineBooking?ClinicUid=23d93b6b-a492-4027-bba9-9c4be16e15a1", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=7617616511628388174&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJgb_6XTAnTIYRTqfCgts1t2k", "quality_missing": ["insurance"], "search_keywords": ["acupuncture & tcm", "acupuncture", "chinese medicine", "tcm", "herbal medicine", "cupping", "pain relief", "châm cứu", "đông y", "y học cổ truyền", "한의원", "침술", "한약", "中医", "针灸", "中药", "english", "chinese", "mandarin", "cantonese", "中文", "普通话", "国语", "粤语", "广东话", "华人", "herbal therapy", "holistic bodywork", "pain management", "stress & emotional issues", "women''s health", "facial rejuvenation", "traditional chinese medicine", "bodywork", "pain", "mental health", "cosmetic", "dr. brendan lee", "dacm, l.ac", "dr. cunyu fan"], "services_offered": [{"name": "Acupuncture", "category": "Traditional Chinese Medicine", "description": "A key modality of Traditional Chinese Medicine using fine needles to balance energy flow.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Cupping", "category": "Traditional Chinese Medicine", "description": "Therapeutic suction cups to relieve muscle tension and promote circulation.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Herbal Therapy", "category": "Traditional Chinese Medicine", "description": "Customized herbal formulas to support healing and balance.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Holistic Bodywork", "category": "Bodywork", "description": "Hands-on techniques to release tension and improve overall well-being.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Pain Management", "category": "Pain", "description": "Treatment for various pain conditions using acupuncture and other modalities.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients with acute or chronic pain."}, {"name": "Stress & Emotional Issues", "category": "Mental Health", "description": "Support for stress, anxiety, and emotional imbalance.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients experiencing stress or emotional difficulties."}, {"name": "Women''s Health", "category": "Women''s Health", "description": "Care for menstrual issues, fertility, menopause, and other women''s health concerns.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Women seeking holistic reproductive health support."}, {"name": "Facial Rejuvenation", "category": "Cosmetic", "description": "Acupuncture-based facial treatments to promote a youthful appearance.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Individuals seeking non-surgical facial rejuvenation."}], "short_description": "Texas Acupuncture Center provides acupuncture and Traditional Chinese Medicine services to help patients achieve optimal health and wellness.", "google_website_url": "http://texasacupuncturecenter.com/", "google_primary_type": "Medical Clinic", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": ["Dr. Brendan Lee", "Dr. Cunyu Fan"], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "13150 Senlac Dr Ste 170, Farmers Branch, TX 75234, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/117279387516064491398", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXdovplCEsqpwMQ8JpwqVcmv_hZOY7PtioQXfI5YtzwieyhO38=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Texas Acupuncture Center"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/107950574586691806213", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKzTDd8u2Ws44o7w6G0MzmH4yXIj9SpMMYx5zVNHvmZAQEXvw=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Cunyu Fan"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/107950574586691806213", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKzTDd8u2Ws44o7w6G0MzmH4yXIj9SpMMYx5zVNHvmZAQEXvw=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Cunyu Fan"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/117279387516064491398", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXdovplCEsqpwMQ8JpwqVcmv_hZOY7PtioQXfI5YtzwieyhO38=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Texas Acupuncture Center"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/103632565585437588481", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUkjptOg38c8qHFTzULqoXB9rNO5ILDiMtgeeyYcRJtEDajrp68=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Cunwei Fan"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-26T11:16:57.259365+00:00', 'texas-acupuncture-center', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('b509fdcc-92ec-4d64-a44b-29937fef27c4', NULL, 'VM Clinic - Pediatrics', 'VM Clinic is a trusted medical practice located in Westminster, California, offering both pediatric and internal medicine services. The clinic is dedicated to providing compassionate, high-quality care for patients of all ages. Their team of experienced providers takes time to understand each patient''s individual needs, delivering personalized care tailored to unique circumstances. The clinic emphasizes convenient scheduling, affordable payment plans, and a welcoming environment for families and individuals alike.', '8251 Westminster Blvd, Westminster, CA 92683', 'Westminster', 'CA', '92683', '+1-714-465-2222 (Pediatrics)', ARRAY['English', 'Vietnamese']::text[], 'Pediatrics', FALSE, '{"email": "info@vmclinic.us", "images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/vm-clinic-pediatrics-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/vm-clinic-pediatrics-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/vm-clinic-pediatrics-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/vm-clinic-pediatrics-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/vm-clinic-pediatrics-google-5.webp"], "rating": 4.4, "reviews": [{"date": "2018-09-28T00:01:07.355481Z", "text": "Making appointment is very easy. A lot of parking spaces. Doctors are young and nice.", "author": "Dung Tran", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109795280311430566439/reviews"}, {"date": "2023-08-02T23:50:56.897096Z", "text": "Overall, the primary doctor Thao provided great advice to the kids, and the assistant Ann was attentive during the examinations, listening to the kids'' concerns. Additionally, Aiden efficiently handled paperwork and communication, making the entire process easy and smooth. I would highly recommend this primary doctor and their team for your siblings'' healthcare needs.", "author": "Ahmad Abu Rezeq", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117307246471537629331/reviews"}, {"date": "2020-11-13T19:45:38.335161Z", "text": "Have seen this doctors office 3x for my newborn child, it''s been pretty frustrating having to deal with this medical office especially with the staff, twice that I''ve made appointments they call me and make me reschedule the appointments because doctor isn''t available, when I started coming here I submitted a paper copy and the actual insurance card for my child and the 3x I''ve came they give me issues where they don''t have the insurance on file and can''t find it so they hold us back after the visit until they figure it out it''s just annoying how I gave them a copy of it to place In his folder file and still they don''t have it figured out. They shouldn''t give the patient the option to make an appointment if there going to keep calling the patient to reschedule the appointments especially when they call you the day before to change the appointment. I will definitely be looking for another medical group to take my child too. To provide better hospitality to the patients they need to train there staff much more.", "author": "Remigio Cruz", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106328117622460766711/reviews"}, {"date": "2023-05-03T18:27:47.777699Z", "text": "Doctor is very informative and nice. She listens to all of our questions and try her best to answer them.\nStaffs are attentive and very friendly to the kids.\nRooms are nice and clean. Expect a bit of wait when you come there but they make it worth the wait.\nHighly recommended!!!", "author": "Aiden Vo", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117795868401077478974/reviews"}, {"date": "2019-10-08T00:12:23.223112Z", "text": "We were referred by our OBGYN to Dr. Mai as our family physician and Dr. Vo as the pediatrician for our daughter. We''ve been to both of the office and we have had the most pleasant experiences. Dr. Mai was very knowledgeable and personal. He explained everything and he takes his time to answer any questions you may have instead of rushing you out. Dr. Vo is very kind and you can tell she loves children. She takes excellent care of our daughter. Also, both office are clean and modern, their staff are nice and friendly. Both are great Dr''s.", "author": "Ryan Nguyen", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113807723311559872930/reviews"}], "website": "https://vmclinic.us/", "location": {"latitude": 33.7596527, "longitude": -117.98511239999999}, "services": ["Pediatrics", "Internal Medicine"], "insurance": {"notes": null, "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": [], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": false}, "highlights": [{"title": "Compassionate and personalized care", "detail": "The clinic takes time to get to know patients and understand their individual needs, providing care tailored to each patient''s unique circumstances.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Experienced and qualified providers", "detail": "The team of providers is experienced and qualified in providing high-quality care for patients of all ages, staying up-to-date on the latest medical advancements.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Convenient and affordable care", "detail": "Offers convenient scheduling options and affordable payment plans to make it easy for patients to get the care they need.", "category": "convenience"}], "price_tier": "$$", "source_url": "http://vmclinic.us/", "appointment": {"booking_note": null, "appointment_url": null, "new_patient_note": null, "phone_booking_available": null, "online_booking_available": null, "free_consultation_available": null}, "open_sunday": false, "scout_query": "Vietnamese pediatric clinic in Orange County, CA", "search_text": "pediatrics | pediatrician | child doctor | vaccines | newborn | nhi khoa | bác sĩ nhi | khám trẻ em | 소아과 | 소아청소년과 | 儿科 | english | vietnamese | tiếng việt | người việt | bác sĩ việt | internal medicine | primary care", "google_types": ["medical_clinic", "doctor", "health", "point_of_interest", "establishment"], "open_weekend": false, "rating_count": 21, "open_saturday": false, "quality_score": 90, "working_hours": {"friday": "9:00 AM – 1:00 PM, 2:00 – 5:00 PM", "monday": "9:00 AM – 1:00 PM, 2:00 – 5:00 PM", "sunday": "Closed", "tuesday": "9:00 AM – 1:00 PM, 2:00 – 5:00 PM", "saturday": "Closed", "thursday": "Closed", "wednesday": "9:00 AM – 1:00 PM, 2:00 – 5:00 PM"}, "gallery_images": ["https://vmclinic.us/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/home2.jpg", "https://vmclinic.us/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/home1.jpg", "https://vmclinic.us/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/home3.jpg", "https://vmclinic.us/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/bg-home-page-2-01.jpg", "https://vmclinic.us/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/bg-hp3-scaled.jpg"], "review_profile": {"rating": 4.4, "source": "google", "themes": [{"theme": "Staff Professionalism", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Multiple reviewers highlight friendly and attentive staff, especially with children."}, {"theme": "Facility Environment", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients frequently mention clean, modern, and well-maintained clinic spaces."}, {"theme": "Clinical Expertise", "mentions": 4, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Doctors are praised for being knowledgeable, kind, and thorough in addressing patient concerns."}, {"theme": "Appointment Management", "mentions": 1, "sentiment": "Negative", "summary_quote": "One reviewer reported frustration with frequent appointment rescheduling and administrative disorganization."}, {"theme": "Communication", "mentions": 2, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Staff and doctors are noted for clear communication and making processes smooth for patients."}], "summary": "Most patients appreciate the friendly and knowledgeable staff, clean facilities, and attentive doctors, though some have experienced frustrations with appointment scheduling and administrative issues.", "review_count": 21, "concern_themes": [], "positive_themes": [], "featured_reviews": [{"date": "2018-09-28T00:01:07.355481Z", "text": "Making appointment is very easy. A lot of parking spaces. Doctors are young and nice.", "author": "Dung Tran", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109795280311430566439/reviews"}, {"date": "2023-08-02T23:50:56.897096Z", "text": "Overall, the primary doctor Thao provided great advice to the kids, and the assistant Ann was attentive during the examinations, listening to the kids'' concerns. Additionally, Aiden efficiently handled paperwork and communication, making the entire process easy and smooth. I would highly recommend this primary doctor and their team for your siblings'' healthcare needs.", "author": "Ahmad Abu Rezeq", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117307246471537629331/reviews"}, {"date": "2020-11-13T19:45:38.335161Z", "text": "Have seen this doctors office 3x for my newborn child, it''s been pretty frustrating having to deal with this medical office especially with the staff, twice that I''ve made appointments they call me and make me reschedule the appointments because doctor isn''t available, when I started coming here I submitted a paper copy and the actual insurance card for my child and the 3x I''ve came they give me issues where they don''t have the insurance on file and can''t find it so they hold us back after the visit until they figure it out it''s just annoying how I gave them a copy of it to place In his folder file and still they don''t have it figured out. They shouldn''t give the patient the option to make an appointment if there going to keep calling the patient to reschedule the appointments especially when they call you the day before to change the appointment. I will definitely be looking for another medical group to take my child too. To provide better hospitality to the patients they need to train there staff much more.", "author": "Remigio Cruz", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106328117622460766711/reviews"}, {"date": "2023-05-03T18:27:47.777699Z", "text": "Doctor is very informative and nice. She listens to all of our questions and try her best to answer them.\nStaffs are attentive and very friendly to the kids.\nRooms are nice and clean. Expect a bit of wait when you come there but they make it worth the wait.\nHighly recommended!!!", "author": "Aiden Vo", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117795868401077478974/reviews"}, {"date": "2019-10-08T00:12:23.223112Z", "text": "We were referred by our OBGYN to Dr. Mai as our family physician and Dr. Vo as the pediatrician for our daughter. We''ve been to both of the office and we have had the most pleasant experiences. Dr. Mai was very knowledgeable and personal. He explained everything and he takes his time to answer any questions you may have instead of rushing you out. Dr. Vo is very kind and you can tell she loves children. She takes excellent care of our daughter. Also, both office are clean and modern, their staff are nice and friendly. Both are great Dr''s.", "author": "Ryan Nguyen", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113807723311559872930/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Most patients appreciate the friendly and knowledgeable staff, clean facilities, and attentive doctors, though some have experienced frustrations with appointment scheduling and administrative issues.", "about_highlight": "VM Clinic is a trusted medical practice located in Westminster, California, offering both pediatric and internal medicine services. The clinic is dedicated to providing compassionate, high-quality care for patients of all ages. Their team of experienced providers takes time to understand each patient''s individual needs, delivering personalized care tailored to unique circumstances. The clinic emphasizes convenient scheduling, affordable payment plans, and a welcoming environment for families and individuals alike.", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=6958658973704785828&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJwzZVcOcn3YARpA_C0HcfkmA", "quality_missing": ["insurance", "team_members", "appointment_url"], "search_keywords": ["pediatrics", "pediatrician", "child doctor", "vaccines", "newborn", "nhi khoa", "bác sĩ nhi", "khám trẻ em", "소아과", "소아청소년과", "儿科", "english", "vietnamese", "tiếng việt", "người việt", "bác sĩ việt", "internal medicine", "primary care"], "services_offered": [{"name": "Pediatrics", "category": "Primary Care", "description": "Pediatric care for children, provided by dedicated specialists.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Children"}, {"name": "Internal Medicine", "category": "Primary Care", "description": "Internal medicine care for adults, provided by dedicated specialists.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Adults"}], "short_description": "VM Clinic provides compassionate pediatric and internal medicine care for patients of all ages in Westminster, CA.", "google_website_url": "http://vmclinic.us/", "google_primary_type": "Medical Clinic", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": [], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "8251 Westminster Blvd. Ste 110, Westminster, CA 92683, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/109074308096227598870", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKKu5I7Js_Qh2l5h47qjqolM4RqyiwVIl3NOVU9CcPFQFglXQ=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "VM Clinic - Pediatrics"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/109074308096227598870", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKKu5I7Js_Qh2l5h47qjqolM4RqyiwVIl3NOVU9CcPFQFglXQ=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "VM Clinic - Pediatrics"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/109795280311430566439", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXzzapbbDFVL3g5jIcQ35BKkAx7R1lrlMQSt2bBCnhFiFTxvUXDFA=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Dung Tran"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/109795280311430566439", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXzzapbbDFVL3g5jIcQ35BKkAx7R1lrlMQSt2bBCnhFiFTxvUXDFA=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Dung Tran"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/112170202591769815841", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXxTNbHNxwzPkDmC3RS6DtsnlnCKip1LEmp6yszFcTFCZHXftgztA=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Lu Ta"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-26T14:12:15.623107+00:00', 'vm-clinic-pediatrics', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('40bb0851-f01e-4a03-b603-c76b34e4aa09', NULL, 'Pediatric & Adult Medicine', 'Pediatric & Adult Medicine (PAM) is a member of the CHOC Primary Care Network, providing comprehensive pediatric care in Tustin, CA. The practice is known for its long-standing, stable team—most physicians have been with the practice since residency—and for building generational trust, with some doctors now caring for the children of their original patients. PAM offers on-site lab work, hearing and vision screenings, minor procedures, and laceration care, allowing families to handle most health needs under one roof. The practice serves patients from birth through age 22 and is backed by Rady Children’s Health for specialty referrals.', '18102 Irvine Blvd. Suite 103 and 105, Tustin, CA 92780', 'Tustin', 'CA', '92780', '(714) 565-7960', ARRAY['English', 'Vietnamese']::text[], 'Pediatrics', FALSE, '{"fax": "(714) 565-7982", "images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/pediatric-adult-medicine-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/pediatric-adult-medicine-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/pediatric-adult-medicine-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/pediatric-adult-medicine-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/pediatric-adult-medicine-google-5.webp"], "rating": 4.7, "reviews": [{"date": "2025-07-10T22:31:26.389074217Z", "text": "I''ve been bringing my kids here for 20 years.   They are very professional and nice.  I''ve never waited more than 10 minutes to see the doctor.   The staff is very efficient.  You can get appointments on the same day since there''s a several pediatricians. We''ve seen Dr. Martinez and Dr. Angela DangVu, they are both exceptional.", "author": "Ana Corona", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104031878316769219327/reviews"}, {"date": "2024-06-07T23:34:04.368491Z", "text": "All the doctors are great here. I’ve been taking my boys for 17 years now. From my 21 year old, 17 year old, now my 2 littlest ones 2 and 4. I have no problem making appointments even same day appointments. Everyone is so kind. My 4 year old has multiple birth defects and his primary care doctor Dr DangVu is so amazing. She always listens and takes her time with us. She is so kind, compassionate and such a great doctor! I love this doctor’s office. All the girls in the front and are nice. We never have to wait long and the office is always clean. Again Dr. Dang Vu is the best.", "author": "Jennifer", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103632096928064147560/reviews"}, {"date": "2024-07-03T23:19:37.332436Z", "text": "Amazing physicians. I’m so happy with our choice to come here. We primarily see Dr Martinez but have seen other doctors here for sick visits and had a great experience with all. We never feel rushed or dumb for asking questions. Even though we’ve moved 30+ minutes away, we’ve been coming here for our kids’ care because I trust Dr. Martinez and the staff. So lucky to have found this office!", "author": "Anjum B.", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107883027961735831876/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-04-23T14:46:51.295727178Z", "text": "The Dr.s here are amazing. My kids will never go anywhere else", "author": "roque rios", 