and such a great doctor! I love this doctor’s office. All the girls in the front and are nice. We never have to wait long and the office is always clean. Again Dr. Dang Vu is the best.", "author": "Jennifer", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103632096928064147560/reviews"}, {"date": "2024-07-03T23:19:37.332436Z", "text": "Amazing physicians. I’m so happy with our choice to come here. We primarily see Dr Martinez but have seen other doctors here for sick visits and had a great experience with all. We never feel rushed or dumb for asking questions. Even though we’ve moved 30+ minutes away, we’ve been coming here for our kids’ care because I trust Dr. Martinez and the staff. So lucky to have found this office!", "author": "Anjum B.", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107883027961735831876/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-04-23T14:46:51.295727178Z", "text": "The Dr.s here are amazing. My kids will never go anywhere else", "author": "roque rios", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112855674265736990354/reviews"}, {"date": "2022-10-11T18:21:50.972133Z", "text": "I have 4 children and have been going here for 16 years. I have been satisfied with my experience. Some doctors are better than others however in the last year we have been primarily seeing Dr. Mody she is my absolute favorite doctor ever!!!! She is kind, she  listens and she cares. I couldn’t recommend her enough!!!!", "author": "MEGAN Budd-Reyes", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101440685461141087409/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Pediatric & Adult Medicine has a 4.7 star Google rating from 27 Google reviews. Patients commonly mention compassionate care, friendly staff, strong results.", "about_highlight": "Pediatric & Adult Medicine (PAM) is a member of the CHOC Primary Care Network, providing comprehensive pediatric c