nage years and up to age 22.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Teens and young adults up to age 22"}, {"name": "Immunizations", "category": "Preventive", "description": "Vaccinations for children and teens.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Children and teens"}, {"name": "After-Hours Care", "category": "Emergency", "description": "24/7 Nurse Advice Line and pediatric urgent care for non-life-threatening illnesses and injuries.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Patients needing care outside regular hours"}], "short_description": "A trusted pediatric practice in Tustin, CA, offering comprehensive care from birth through age 22 with on-site diagnostics and a stable, experienced team.", "google_website_url": "https://pam.choc.org/?utm_source=google&utm_medium=gmb&utm_content=clinic&utm_campaign=pediatric_&_adult_medicine", "google_primary_type": "Doctor", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": ["Dr. Martinez", "Dr. Angela DangVu", "Dr. Mody"], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "accepting_new_patients": true, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "18102 Irvine Blvd Suite 103 & 105, Tustin, CA 92780, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/107014253723494469502", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWn3WNB-jQiYRc-1bVQlWoHu-k43p5C2u9mvmfBUPgyWcjnpUM=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Pediatric & Adult Medicine"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/111521687676297201680", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV7aLtsIehy86N8hHF05XFxkHbkhodyHlt-w-YRR4QA-j0_bRpM=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Erik P"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/110621357241457965008", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX3mL95sH7dE6NG9rOC-3ifYefqkIY0lFZcwU9tpEOXzaMEoCVfiQ=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Humberto C"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/107014253723494469502", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWn3WNB-jQiYRc-1bVQlWoHu-k43p5C2u9mvmfBUPgyWcjnpUM=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Pediatric & Adult Medicine"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/107014253723494469502", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWn3WNB-jQiYRc-1bVQlWoHu-k43p5C2u9mvmfBUPgyWcjnpUM=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Pediatric & Adult Medicine"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-26T14:13:17.954808+00:00', 'pediatric-adult-medicine', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('77da5d6b-ed67-4fe4-91bb-0836dd757c7c', NULL, 'PM Pediatric Urgent Care', 'PM Pediatric Urgent Care in Tustin, CA provides compassionate, kid-focused urgent care for children and young adults ages 0-26. From strep to stitches, their pediatric-trained team offers on-site X-rays, lab testing, splinting, and more in a fun, beach-themed environment designed to put kids at ease. With online booking, walk-in welcome, and an average wait time of about 20 minutes, they complement your child''s pediatrician by providing after-hours and same-day care when you need it most.', '14971 Holt Avenue Tustin, CA 92780', 'Tustin', 'CA', '92780', '949-356-7676', ARRAY['English', 'Vietnamese']::text[], 'Pediatrics', TRUE, '{"fax": "949-356-7673", "images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/pm-pediatric-urgent-care-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/pm-pediatric-urgent-care-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/pm-pediatric-urgent-care-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/pm-pediatric-urgent-care-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/pm-pediatric-urgent-care-google-5.webp"], "rating": 4.6, "reviews": [{"date": "2026-01-31T11:40:29.946322740Z", "text": "We’ve been twice now to PM Pediatrics. Once with my son and once for my daughter for different health concerns. Both times the experience was incredible. I easily selected appointments from home on the website with minimal check in information (so helpful when you have a very sick or very injured kid) and then when we arrived the office is so sweetly decorated with a fun beach theme. The front office people were kind and helpful guiding me though any info they needed. We then only waiting about 10 minutes in the waiting room before they called us back. The nurse was efficient at getting weights and vitals. Then both doctors we saw were awesome! Special shout out to Dr. Jacobson who did the “magic” trick to reset a nursemaids elbow injury so gently and swiftly!! It wowed my kid and me! Thanks for going the extra mile to help us get in and out quickly and leave with peace of mind. We will be back for all our after hours pediatric health needs!", "author": "Allison Krikorian", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103102822495581399058/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-03-06T12:24:22.527279815Z", "text": "Always a great experience! This place is like a hidden gem—there is rarely a wait and the care is excellent. The doctors and nurses are wonderful with young patients and make kids feel comfortable. It’s fast, efficient, and we’re usually in and out, which is so nice when you have young children. Highly recommend!", "author": "Ava Polanco", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103722973149053349290/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-11-30T16:54:55.379047913Z", "text": "Last night was our second visit to this urgent care and once again we had an exceptional experience. The doctor who helped us, an African American woman whose name I unfortunately cannot remember, was truly incredible with our son. He absolutely adored her and she made him feel so comfortable. Alex, who took his x-rays, was also fantastic.\n\nI love that we were able to schedule our arrival time online which made everything so smooth. My husband and I were amazed that we were in and out within 45 minutes. We could not be more pleased with the care we received and we will absolutely return if we ever need to.\n\nThank you to the entire team.", "author": "Daniella Blaul", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104608507820907863318/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-31T00:59:12.846223750Z", "text": "I went here because my son had an infection due to his eczema and everyone was super helpful. The PA and nurse was very knowledgeable and identified my son’s symptoms right away. Everything was quick and easy and now my boy is on antibiotics. He definitely would recommend going here again", "author": "Anthony Nguyen", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115987118818622926228/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-12-12T22:44:24.616301314Z", "text": "I had my 3 year old grand daughter visiting me from out of state. We searched for a pediatric urgent care to take her to and saw that PM Pediatric had great reviews. I took her in and the staff was wonderful! They were very kind, friendly and helpful. The waiting area was very clean and open space. When we went back into the exam room they were very prompt in coming in for her exam. We saw Nancy and she was fantastic! She was sweet and so happy and fun and put my grand daughter at ease. As we were leaving the office my grand daughter said she wanted to go back in to see Nancy, that’s how good she is. If there is ever a need for any of my visiting grandchildren to visit an urgent care, I will definitely bring the here. I highly recommend them.", "author": "Stacey Taylor", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104677542757729706325/reviews"}], "website": "https://pmpediatriccare.com/location/california-tustin/", "location": {"latitude": 33.7463281, "longitude": -117.81433650000001}, "services": ["Urgent Care for Illnesses", "Injury & Minor Trauma Care", "On-Site X-Ray Services", "Lab Testing", "Splinting & Stitches", "Sports Physicals", "Telemedicine Virtual Visits", "EKG Testing", "Oxygen & Nebulizer Treatments"], "insurance": {"notes": "Accepts most major insurance plans. Patients without insurance or with out-of-network coverage may use a self-pay option with affordable rates. Copayments, coinsurance, or deductibles apply per plan.", "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": [], "out_of_network_available": true, "accepts_private_insurance": true}, "highlights": [{"title": "Online Booking Available", "detail": "Select an arrival time and register from the comfort of home.", "category": "convenience"}, {"title": "Board-Certified Pediatric Experts", "detail": "Only board-certified, pediatric-trained experts care for your child.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Walk-Ins Welcome", "detail": "No appointment required; walk-ins are always welcome.", "category": "access"}, {"title": "Average Wait Time ~20 Minutes", "detail": "Most visits are completed in under an hour.", "category": "convenience"}, {"title": "On-Site X-Rays & Lab Testing", "detail": "X-ray, EKG, and lab testing available on-site for faster diagnosis.", "category": "technology"}, {"title": "Translation Services Available", "detail": "Video translation apps with hundreds of languages, including sign language.", "category": "culture"}, {"title": "Self-Pay Option", "detail": "Affordable self-pay rates available for uninsured or out-of-network patients.", "category": "insurance"}, {"title": "Sports Physicals Offered", "detail": "Now offering sports and extracurricular physicals, no appointment needed.", "category": "care"}], "price_tier": "$$", "source_url": "https://pmpediatriccare.com/location/california-tustin/", "appointment": {"booking_note": "Select an arrival time and register from the comfort of home.", "appointment_url": "https://healow.com/apps/jsp/webview/openaccess/widgets/uc/ucFacility.jsp?apu_id=317507&facility_id=90&locale=en", "new_patient_note": null, "phone_booking_available": true, "online_booking_available": true, "free_consultation_available": null}, "open_sunday": true, "scout_query": "Vietnamese pediatric clinic in Orange County, CA", "search_text": "pediatrics | pediatrician | child doctor | vaccines | newborn | nhi khoa | bác sĩ nhi | khám trẻ em | 소아과 | 소아청소년과 | 儿科 | english | vietnamese | tiếng việt | người việt | bác sĩ việt | urgent care for illnesses | injury & minor trauma care | on-site x-ray services | lab testing | splinting & stitches | sports physicals | telemedicine virtual visits | ekg testing | oxygen & nebulizer treatments | urgent care | diagnostic | procedure | preventive | telemedicine | treatment", "google_types": ["medical_clinic", "health", "point_of_interest", "establishment"], "open_weekend": true, "rating_count": 445, "language_note": "All offices are equipped with video translation apps that have hundreds of languages, including sign language, ensuring language access for diverse families.", "open_saturday": true, "quality_score": 92, "working_hours": {"friday": "9:00 AM – 9:00 PM", "monday": "9:00 AM – 9:00 PM", "sunday": "9:00 AM – 9:00 PM", "tuesday": "9:00 AM – 9:00 PM", "saturday": "9:00 AM – 9:00 PM", "thursday": "9:00 AM – 9:00 PM", "wednesday": "9:00 AM – 9:00 PM"}, "gallery_images": ["https://b4485928.smushcdn.com/4485928/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/Seaside_Murals_2_411.jpg?lossy=2&strip=1&webp=1", "https://b4485928.smushcdn.com/4485928/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/Seaside_ProcedureRoom_071.jpg?lossy=2&strip=1&webp=1", "https://b4485928.smushcdn.com/4485928/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/Seaside_Mural1_075.jpg?lossy=2&strip=1&webp=1", "https://b4485928.smushcdn.com/4485928/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/Seaside_FrntLobby_2_029.jpg?lossy=2&strip=1&webp=1"], "review_profile": {"rating": 4.6, "source": "google", "themes": [{"theme": "Staff Professionalism", "mentions": 5, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Reviewers frequently highlight the kindness, expertise, and child-friendly approach of the doctors and nurses."}, {"theme": "Facility Environment", "mentions": 2, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "The clinic is noted for its clean, welcoming, and child-appropriate decor, making visits less stressful for young patients."}, {"theme": "Efficiency", "mentions": 4, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Multiple reviews commend the quick service, with many patients mentioning being in and out within an hour."}, {"theme": "Online Scheduling", "mentions": 2, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients appreciate the ease of scheduling appointments online, which simplifies the process during stressful times."}, {"theme": "Child Comfort", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Several reviews mention how well the staff interacts with children, making them feel at ease during their visit."}], "summary": "Patients consistently praise PM Pediatric Urgent Care for its efficient, child-friendly service, knowledgeable staff, and quick, comforting care experiences.", "review_count": 445, "concern_themes": [], "positive_themes": ["compassionate", "quick and efficient", "thorough", "kid-friendly", "understanding", "clean facility"], "featured_reviews": [{"date": "2026-01-31T11:40:29.946322740Z", "text": "We’ve been twice now to PM Pediatrics. Once with my son and once for my daughter for different health concerns. Both times the experience was incredible. I easily selected appointments from home on the website with minimal check in information (so helpful when you have a very sick or very injured kid) and then when we arrived the office is so sweetly decorated with a fun beach theme. The front office people were kind and helpful guiding me though any info they needed. We then only waiting about 10 minutes in the waiting room before they called us back. The nurse was efficient at getting weights and vitals. Then both doctors we saw were awesome! Special shout out to Dr. Jacobson who did the “magic” trick to reset a nursemaids elbow injury so gently and swiftly!! It wowed my kid and me! Thanks for going the extra mile to help us get in and out quickly and leave with peace of mind. We will be back for all our after hours pediatric health needs!", "author": "Allison Krikorian", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103102822495581399058/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-03-06T12:24:22.527279815Z", "text": "Always a great experience! This place is like a hidden gem—there is rarely a wait and the care is excellent. The doctors and nurses are wonderful with young patients and make kids feel comfortable. It’s fast, efficient, and we’re usually in and out, which is so nice when you have young children. Highly recommend!", "author": "Ava Polanco", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103722973149053349290/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-11-30T16:54:55.379047913Z", "text": "Last night was our second visit to this urgent care and once again we had an exceptional experience. The doctor who helped us, an African American woman whose name I unfortunately cannot remember, was truly incredible with our son. He absolutely adored her and she made him feel so comfortable. Alex, who took his x-rays, was also fantastic.\n\nI love that we were able to schedule our arrival time online which made everything so smooth. My husband and I were amazed that we were in and out within 45 minutes. We could not be more pleased with the care we received and we will absolutely return if we ever need to.\n\nThank you to the entire team.", "author": "Daniella Blaul", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104608507820907863318/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-31T00:59:12.846223750Z", "text": "I went here because my son had an infection due to his eczema and everyone was super helpful. The PA and nurse was very knowledgeable and identified my son’s symptoms right away. Everything was quick and easy and now my boy is on antibiotics. He definitely would recommend going here again", "author": "Anthony Nguyen", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115987118818622926228/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-12-12T22:44:24.616301314Z", "text": "I had my 3 year old grand daughter visiting me from out of state. We searched for a pediatric urgent care to take her to and saw that PM Pediatric had great reviews. I took her in and the staff was wonderful! They were very kind, friendly and helpful. The waiting area was very clean and open space. When we went back into the exam room they were very prompt in coming in for her exam. We saw Nancy and she was fantastic! She was sweet and so happy and fun and put my grand daughter at ease. As we were leaving the office my grand daughter said she wanted to go back in to see Nancy, that’s how good she is. If there is ever a need for any of my visiting grandchildren to visit an urgent care, I will definitely bring the here. I highly recommend them.", "author": "Stacey Taylor", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104677542757729706325/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Patients consistently praise PM Pediatric Urgent Care for its efficient, child-friendly service, knowledgeable staff, and quick, comforting care experiences.", "about_highlight": "PM Pediatric Urgent Care in Tustin, CA provides compassionate, kid-focused urgent care for children and young adults ages 0-26. From strep to stitches, their pediatric-trained team offers on-site X-rays, lab testing, splinting, and more in a fun, beach-themed environment designed to put kids at ease. With online booking, walk-in welcome, and an average wait time of about 20 minutes, they complement your child''s pediatrician by providing after-hours and same-day care when you need it most.", "appointment_url": "https://healow.com/apps/jsp/webview/openaccess/widgets/uc/ucFacility.jsp?apu_id=317507&facility_id=90&locale=en", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=2058435722526893664&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJ1UfZU7nb3IARYKYwMmIIkRw", "quality_missing": ["insurance", "team_members"], "search_keywords": ["pediatrics", "pediatrician", "child doctor", "vaccines", "newborn", "nhi khoa", "bác sĩ nhi", "khám trẻ em", "소아과", "소아청소년과", "儿科", "english", "vietnamese", "tiếng việt", "người việt", "bác sĩ việt", "urgent care for illnesses", "injury & minor trauma care", "on-site x-ray services", "lab testing", "splinting & stitches", "sports physicals", "telemedicine virtual visits", "ekg testing", "oxygen & nebulizer treatments", "urgent care", "diagnostic", "procedure", "preventive", "telemedicine", "treatment"], "cultural_context": "All offices are equipped with video translation apps that have hundreds of languages, including sign language, ensuring language access for diverse families.", "services_offered": [{"name": "Urgent Care for Illnesses", "category": "Urgent Care", "description": "Treatment for fevers, cold, flu, COVID-19, bacterial infections, pink eye, rashes, vomiting, diarrhea, sore throats, earaches, and more.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Children and young adults ages 0-26"}, {"name": "Injury & Minor Trauma Care", "category": "Urgent Care", "description": "Care for broken bones, sprains, cuts, burns, wounds requiring stitches, foreign objects, concussions, and dehydration.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Children and young adults ages 0-26"}, {"name": "On-Site X-Ray Services", "category": "Diagnostic", "description": "X-ray imaging available on-site for fracture and injury evaluation.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Lab Testing", "category": "Diagnostic", "description": "Testing for infections, strep, flu, COVID-19, and more.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Splinting & Stitches", "category": "Procedure", "description": "Splinting for injuries and wound closure with stitches.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Sports Physicals", "category": "Preventive", "description": "Sports and extracurricular physicals, no appointment required.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Children and young adults"}, {"name": "Telemedicine Virtual Visits", "category": "Telemedicine", "description": "Access the same great care from home via virtual visits, available 6am to midnight in many states.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Children and young adults"}, {"name": "EKG Testing", "category": "Diagnostic", "description": "Electrocardiogram testing available on-site.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Oxygen & Nebulizer Treatments", "category": "Treatment", "description": "Oxygen therapy and nebulizer treatments for respiratory conditions.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}], "short_description": "PM Pediatric Urgent Care in Tustin, CA provides compassionate, kid-focused urgent care for children and young adults ages 0-26, with online booking, walk-ins welcome, and on-site X-rays and lab testing.", "google_website_url": "https://pmpediatriccare.com/location/california-tustin/", "google_primary_type": "Medical Clinic", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": [], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "14971 Holt Ave, Tustin, CA 92780, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/104580850475391805314", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV40X0CiAHZtNZ63gTpzTJHbphAIAJBshQ2Xeex-4OGv7kERIwU=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "PM Pediatric Urgent Care"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/104580850475391805314", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV40X0CiAHZtNZ63gTpzTJHbphAIAJBshQ2Xee