ot tell him any symptoms, so that he is forced to take the consultation more seriously.  And the other thing I did not like was that the consultation was $100!  At all other Chinese doctors, the consultation is free (since it''s a 5 minute conversation), and then you just buy the herbs.  I did not negotiate down to $50, but I still felt that was too much money for a 5 minute chat, which was in the end was an incorrect diagnosis.  Other people have had great experiences with him, so I would not write him off, I would just avoid telling him your symptoms so that you can get a more accurate reading of what your body is saying.  He is very experienced and knowledgeable, and I understand that my case is unique.", "author": "LK", "rating": 2, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104965083135046454112/reviews"}, {"date": "2016-09-09T08:29:48.981Z", "text": "Dr. Wang is a kind and generous medical professional. He is no common acupuncturist, but in fact, a fully educated MD (his degree is from China). His knowledge in conventional western medicine is comparable to most MDs here and he knows full well what can and cannot be treated through herbal medicines and acupuncture. He would provide you with the most pleasant and accurate medical experience. I highly recommend him.", "author": "Leo Lam, Ph.D.", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100658780705232598736/reviews"}, {"date": "2019-11-15T22:07:47.306172Z", "text": "Dr. Wang is a very experienced doctor. And he is GOOD!\nI had seen several western medicine doctors and all of them cannot treat the pressure in my ears, which lasted for 2 months. They believed it was because of meniere''s disease.\nDr. Wang did not agree with their diagnose and helped me get rid of the pressure in my ears in 10 days with Chinese herb medicine.", "author": "Tao Ye", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104003727289047085411/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Chinese Acupuncture & Oriental Herbs Clinic has a 4.5 star Google rating from 25 Google reviews. Patients commonly mention compassionate care, friendly staff, comfortable visits, strong results.", "about_highlight": "Chinese Acupuncture & Oriental Herbs Clinic, also known as Lake City Chinese Acupuncture & Oriental Herbs, is led by Yun Wang, M.D. (China), M.Ac., E.A.M.P., who has over 35 years of experience. Dr. Wang received his medical training at Qingdao Medical College (1978) and acupuncture training at the Northwest Institute of Acupuncture and Oriental Medicine (1993). The clinic specializes in treating musculoskeletal pain, trauma, stroke, and many other medical conditions using Chinese acupuncture and oriental herbs. Dr. Wang also serves as a professor and clinical supervisor at the Seattle Institute of Oriental Medicine, bringing deep expertise and academic rigor to patient care. The clinic serves King and Snohomish County areas including Seattle, Lake City, Shoreline, University District, Mountlake Terrace, Kenmore, Ballard, Fremont, Lynnwood, and Edmonds.", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=13982134066051314624&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJ-_822t8TkFQRwHPgQNqECsI", "quality_missing": ["insurance", "appointment_url"], "search_keywords": ["acupuncture & tcm", "acupuncture", "chinese medicine", "tcm", "herbal medicine", "cupping", "pain relief", "châm cứu", "đông y", "y học cổ truyền", "한의원", "침술", "한약", "中医", "针灸", "中药", "english", "chinese", "mandarin", "cantonese", "中文", "普通话", "国语", "粤语", "广东话", "华人", "chinese acupuncture", "oriental herbal medicine", "yun wang", "m.d. (china), m.ac., e.a.m.p."], "cultural_context": "The clinic specializes in traditional Chinese acupuncture and oriental herbs, reflecting a deep Asian medical heritage. Dr. Yun Wang is a Chinese-trained physician (M.D. from Qingdao Medical College) and an experienced acupuncturist, providing culturally rooted care for the Asian and broader community in the Seattle area.", "services_offered": [{"name": "Chinese Acupuncture", "category": "Acupuncture", "description": "Traditional Chinese acupuncture for musculoskeletal pain, trauma, stroke, and other conditions.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients seeking pain relief, recovery from trauma or stroke, and general wellness."}, {"name": "Oriental Herbal Medicine", "category": "Herbal Medicine", "description": "Custom Chinese herbal formulas available for various health conditions, with shipping available.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients who prefer herbal treatments or need custom formulas."}], "short_description": "Chinese Acupuncture & Oriental Herbs Clinic in Lake City, Seattle, offers over 35 years of experience in Chinese acupuncture and oriental herbs for musculoskeletal pain, trauma, stroke, and more.", "google_website_url": "http://www.lakecityacupuncture.com/", "google_primary_type": "Medical Clinic", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": ["Yun Wang"], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "11046 Lake City Way NE, Seattle, WA 98125, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/100658780705232598736", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXXbGt1NoK2uxMB-Ka2kXbK-MBDV7eGcMHDjGGZg1ThaUK4Fj65SQ=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Leo Lam, Ph.D."}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/106769757185956151674", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVXcxXgIDkjT9FfLKQ8r-EB3xYugZvtLWAMQLIvcCBG3e8wGX8Kdg=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Frank Kroger"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/106769757185956151674", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVXcxXgIDkjT9FfLKQ8r-EB3xYugZvtLWAMQLIvcCBG3e8wGX8Kdg=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Frank Kroger"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/100658780705232598736", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXXbGt1NoK2uxMB-Ka2kXbK-MBDV7eGcMHDjGGZg1ThaUK4Fj65SQ=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Leo Lam, Ph.D."}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/100658780705232598736", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXXbGt1NoK2uxMB-Ka2kXbK-MBDV7eGcMHDjGGZg1ThaUK4Fj65SQ=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Leo Lam, Ph.D."}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-26T11:40:42.932597+00:00', 'chinese-acupuncture-oriental-herbs-clinic', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('d0874f24-f4b4-4234-bed9-f3408c42c0b1', NULL, 'Caring Hearts Medical Foundation', 'Caring Hearts Medical Foundation is a comprehensive, primary care clinic located in the heart of Paradise Hills, San Diego. Our Clinic provides excellent medical and ambulatory care through a team of dedicated and caring health care providers. Our health care providers are bilingual and sensitive to the cultural needs of our patients. We provide care to people of all cultures in a caring and sensitive way. Our physicians are Board Certified and we strive to provide excellent preventive care to our patients. We have the most qualified hands for each and every case, with industry standards as our core guidelines of operations.', '2401 Reo Dr, San Diego, CA 92139', 'San Diego', 'CA', '92139', '1-619 479-6767', ARRAY['English', 'Korean']::text[], 'Primary Care', FALSE, '{"email": "appointments@chchc.org", "images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/caring-hearts-medical-foundation.webp"], "rating": 4.2, "reviews": [{"date": "2019-01-25T20:07:34.776006260Z", "text": "I went there today for the first time. The lady at the front desk was very friendly and very helpful. She was able to answer all of my questions on filling out my paper work. They called me right away. The staff was super friendly and very professional. They took their time to ask all of the medical questions and I felt they really cared about my health concerns. They were able to refer me to different health specialist right away. I already made my appointments. I am very happy and satisfied with their service. Thank you everyone at caring hearts medical clinic!", "author": "Jessica Guerrero", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108584960636370242371/reviews"}, {"date": "2017-06-01T15:29:34.804Z", "text": "I was a member of this facility up until this year (Kaiser Ins.)  I loved their services and that is the reason why my husband is now their patient.  His health is a priority so he deserves to have the best!  You get the feeling of your GrandMother''s love from the entire staff but especially from Dr. Daramola & Mia.  I love them.", "author": "Gwen Hayes", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105330954967235146917/reviews"}, {"date": "2022-09-15T22:12:51.866819Z", "text": "I normally do not write reviews but I feel if you’re with tricare, stay far from this place. I don’t understand how this place is readily available to be picked as a PCM yet they have no idea how to see patients with tricare. I was steered away and told to change my PCM from the front desk themselves and was told what I needed could not be done there. All I needed was a physical with a series of yes or no questions at which the doctor will determine after if I’m basically healthy. I didn’t speak with the doctor at all. This was all from the front desk and she honestly didn’t seem like she wanted to help me at all. Never have I been more frustrated. I ended up going to another doctor not too far and got in n out of there in less than 30 minutes for the physical I needed. Absolutely ridiculous", "author": "Gloria Her", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116420056655375434814/reviews"}, {"date": "2021-08-06T22:37:13.038189Z", "text": "This Clinic has the worst service ever! My experience as a patient has been  so frustrating dealing with the unprofessional office staff while trying to take care of my health concerns. The person in charge of setting up referral appointments, lacks empathy and does not own up to her mistakes.  The amount of time that I had to wait to get my medical results is a JOKE! I called constantly for two weeks and the office staff kept saying that their fax machine was backed up . It is also impossible to get in contact with the Doctor. I''ve never received a follow up call from her. I was unable to schedule my appointment to see a specialist due to being forwarded to voicemail constantly . WORST experience ever! I''m so disappointed.", "author": "Antionette Simmons", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118104039911787271506/reviews"}, {"date": "2018-01-05T22:54:05.944Z", "text": "These people can''t keep a schedule to save a life! We had an appointment for 3pm and they had so many people waiting, there was no room in the waiting room, and there was overflow already outside waiting too. They claimed atleast an hour wait... if I have an appointment at a designated time I expect to be seen at or within 15 minutes of that time!!! Learn to spread your scheduled appointments out more so you don''t waste patients time!", "author": "Christopher Crum", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101087676339092619593/reviews"}], "website": "http://caringheartsmedicalfoundation.org/", "location": {"latitude": 32.675270499999996, "longitude": -117.0640455}, "services": ["Adult Immunizations", "Blood Pressure Check", "College Physicals", "Cholesterol Check", "DMV Physicals", "Glaucoma Screening", "Free Mammograms", "Cancer Screening", "Bone Density Testing", "Diabetes Screening", "Free Pap Smears", "Health Screening"], "insurance": {"notes": null, "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": [], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": false}, "highlights": [{"title": "Bilingual Staff", "detail": "Our health care providers are bilingual and sensitive to the cultural needs of our patients.", "category": "culture"}, {"title": "Board Certified Physicians", "detail": "Our physicians are Board Certified.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Preventive Care Focus", "detail": "We strive to provide excellent preventive care to our patients.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Cultural Sensitivity", "detail": "We provide care to people of all cultures in a caring and sensitive way.", "category": "culture"}], "price_tier": "$$", "source_url": "http://caringheartsmedicalfoundation.org/", "appointment": {"booking_note": "Book an appointment through the booking portal.", "appointment_url": "https://caringheartsmedicalfoundation.org/book-an-appointment/", "new_patient_note": "New patient? Please click here to download Patient Registration Packet: https://caringheartsmedicalfoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/10/NEW-PATIENT-PACKET-ENGLISH-regular.pdf", "phone_booking_available": false, "online_booking_available": true, "free_consultation_available": null}, "open_sunday": false, "scout_query": "Korean speaking medical clinic in San Diego, CA", "search_text": "primary care | family doctor | general practitioner | annual physical | checkup | bác sĩ gia đình | khám tổng quát | nội khoa | 내과 | 가정의학과 | 家庭医生 | 全科医生 | 内科 | english | korean | 한국어 | 한인 | 한국말 | adult immunizations | blood pressure check | college physicals | cholesterol check | dmv physicals | glaucoma screening | free mammograms | cancer screening | bone density testing | diabetes screening | free pap smears | health screening | preventive | diagnostic | iyabo daramola | medical director / internal medicine physician | steven bayer | physician assistant | kenneth campos | psychiatrist", "google_types": ["medical_clinic", "health", "point_of_interest", "establishment"], "open_weekend": false, "rating_count": 38, "team_members": [{"name": "Iyabo Daramola", "role": "Medical Director / Internal Medicine Physician", "bio_snippet": "Iyabo O. Daramola, MD is the Medical Director of Caring Hearts Medical Clinic. She founded Caring Hearts Medical Clinic in January of 2000. She is honored to have served thousands of families in San Diego county over the last nearly two decades as their Primary Care Physician.", "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Steven Bayer", "role": "Physician Assistant", "bio_snippet": "Steven completed PA school in 2017 at Marshall B. Ketchum University in Fullerton, California.", "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Kenneth Campos", "role": "Psychiatrist", "bio_snippet": "Dr Ken Campos is an experienced Psychiatrist focused on creating a balanced, healthful, meaningful & respectful lives for those living with schizophrenia, depression and other mental illnesses. He is skilled in hospital based Clinical Supervision, Prevention, Psychopharmacology, Cognitive Behavioral Therapy (CBT), and Medical Education.", "languages_spoken": []}], "language_note": "Our health care providers are bilingual and sensitive to the cultural needs of our patients. We provide care to people of all cultures in a caring and sensitive way.", "open_saturday": false, "quality_score": 95, "working_hours": {"friday": "9:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "monday": "9:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "sunday": "Closed", "tuesday": "9:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "saturday": "Closed", "thursday": "9:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "wednesday": "9:00 AM – 5:00 PM"}, "gallery_images": ["https://i0.wp.com/caringheartsmedicalfoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2017/04/h1-img-1.jpg?fit=800%2C523&ssl=1", "https://i0.wp.com/caringheartsmedicalfoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2017/04/h1-img-2.jpg?fit=800%2C523&ssl=1", "https://i0.wp.com/caringheartsmedicalfoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2017/04/h1-img-3.jpg?fit=800%2C523&ssl=1", "https://i0.wp.com/caringheartsmedicalfoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2017/04/h1-img-4.jpg?fit=800%2C523&ssl=1", "https://i0.wp.com/caringheartsmedicalfoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2017/04/h1-img-5.jpg?fit=800%2C523&ssl=1", "https://i0.wp.com/caringheartsmedicalfoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2017/04/h1-img-6.jpg?fit=800%2C523&ssl=1"], "review_profile": {"rating": 4.2, "source": "google", "themes": [{"theme": "Compassionate care", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients highlight compassionate care in their feedback."}, {"theme": "Friendly staff", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients highlight friendly staff in their feedback."}, {"theme": "Strong results", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients highlight strong results in their feedback."}], "summary": "Caring Hearts Medical Foundation has a 4.2 star Google rating from 38 Google reviews. Patients commonly mention compassionate care, friendly staff, strong results.", "review_count": 38, "concern_themes": [], "positive_themes": [], "featured_reviews": [{"date": "2019-01-25T20:07:34.776006260Z", "text": "I went there today for the first time. The lady at the front desk was very friendly and very helpful. She was able to answer all of my questions on filling out my paper work. They called me right away. The staff was super friendly and very professional. They took their time to ask all of the medical questions and I felt they really cared about my health concerns. They were able to refer me to different health specialist right away. I already made my appointments. I am very happy and satisfied with their service. Thank you everyone at caring hearts medical clinic!", "author": "Jessica Guerrero", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108584960636370242371/reviews"}, {"date": "2017-06-01T15:29:34.804Z", "text": "I was a member of this facility up until this year (Kaiser Ins.)  I loved their services and that is the reason why my husband is now their patient.  His health is a priority so he deserves to have the best!  You get the feeling of your GrandMother''s love from the entire staff but especially from Dr. Daramola & Mia.  I love them.", "author": "Gwen Hayes", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105330954967235146917/reviews"}, {"date": "2022-09-15T22:12:51.866819Z", "text": "I normally do not write reviews but I feel if you’re with tricare, stay far from this place. I don’t understand how this place is readily available to be picked as a PCM yet they have no idea how to see patients with tricare. I was steered away and told to change my PCM from the front desk themselves and was told what I needed could not be done there. All I needed was a physical with a series of yes or no questions at which the doctor will determine after if I’m basically healthy. I didn’t speak with the doctor at all. This was all from the front desk and she honestly didn’t seem like she wanted to help me at all. Never have I been more frustrated. I ended up going to another doctor not too far and got in n out of there in less than 30 minutes for the physical I needed. Absolutely ridiculous", "author": "Gloria Her", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116420056655375434814/reviews"}, {"date": "2021-08-06T22:37:13.038189Z", "text": "This Clinic has the worst service ever! My experience as a patient has been  so frustrating dealing with the unprofessional office staff while trying to take care of my health concerns. The person in charge of setting up referral appointments, lacks empathy and does not own up to her mistakes.  The amount of time that I had to wait to get my medical results is a JOKE! I called constantly for two weeks and the office staff kept saying that their fax machine was backed up . It is also impossible to get in contact with the Doctor. I''ve never received a follow up call from her. I was unable to schedule my appointment to see a specialist due to being forwarded to voicemail constantly . WORST experience ever! I''m so disappointed.", "author": "Antionette Simmons", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118104039911787271506/reviews"}, {"date": "2018-01-05T22:54:05.944Z", "text": "These people can''t keep a schedule to save a life! We had an appointment for 3pm and they had so many people waiting, there was no room in the waiting room, and there was overflow already outside waiting too. They claimed atleast an hour wait... if I have an appointment at a designated time I expect to be seen at or within 15 minutes of that time!!! Learn to spread your scheduled appointments out more so you don''t waste patients time!", "author": "Christopher Crum", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101087676339092619593/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Caring Hearts Medical Foundation has a 4.2 star Google rating from 38 Google reviews. Patients commonly mention compassionate care, friendly staff, strong results.", "about_highlight": "Caring Hearts Medical Foundation is a comprehensive, primary care clinic located in the heart of Paradise Hills, San Diego. Our Clinic provides excellent medical and ambulatory care through a team of dedicated and caring health care providers. Our health care providers are bilingual and sensitive to the cultural needs of our patients. We provide care to people of all cultures in a caring and sensitive way. Our physicians are Board Certified and we strive to provide excellent preventive care to our patients. We have the most qualified hands for each and every case, with industry standards as our core guidelines of operations.", "appointment_url": "https://caringheartsmedicalfoundation.org/book-an-appointment/", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=5576132979271820998&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJ8cIEMJNR2YARxmbWqWZnYk0", "quality_missing": ["insurance"], "search_keywords": ["primary care", "family doctor", "general practitioner", "annual physical", "checkup", "bác sĩ gia đình", "khám tổng quát", "nội khoa", "내과", "가정의학과", "家庭医生", "全科医生", "内科", "english", "korean", "한국어", "한인", "한국말", "adult immunizations", "blood pressure check", "college physicals", "cholesterol check", "dmv physicals", "glaucoma screening", "free mammograms", "cancer screening", "bone density testing", "diabetes screening", "free pap smears", "health screening", "preventive", "diagnostic", "iyabo daramola", "medical director / internal medicine physician", "steven bayer", "physician assistant", "kenneth campos", "psychiatrist"], "cultural_context": "Our health care providers are bilingual and sensitive to the cultural needs of our patients. We provide care to people of all cultures in a caring and sensitive way.", "services_offered": [{"name": "Adult Immunizations", "category": "Preventive", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Blood Pressure Check", "category": "Preventive", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "College Physicals", "category": "Primary Care", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Cholesterol Check", "category": "Preventive", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "DMV Physicals", "category": "Primary Care", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Glaucoma Screening", "category": "Preventive", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Free Mammograms", "category": "Preventive", "description": "Free mammograms", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Cancer Screening", "category": "Preventive", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Bone Density Testing", "category": "Diagnostic", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Diabetes Screening", "category": "Preventive", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Free Pap Smears", "category": "Preventive", "description": "Free Pap smears", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Health Screening", "category": "Preventive", "description": null, "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}], "short_description": "Caring Hearts Medical Foundation is a comprehensive primary care clinic in Paradise Hills, San Diego, offering professional medical and diagnostic services for all adults with bilingual, culturally sensitive providers.", "google_website_url": "http://caringheartsmedicalfoundation.org/", "google_primary_type": "Medical Clinic", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": ["Iyabo Daramola", "Steven Bayer", "Kenneth Campos"], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "2401 Reo Dr, San Diego, CA 92139, USA"}'::jsonb, '2026-06-26T11:59:39.495087+00:00', 'caring-hearts-medical-foundation', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('0becab55-260f-4d4c-936f-de56147d7e90', NULL, 'Asia Natural Products, Inc. (Dr. Kang Formulas)', 'Asia Natural Products, Inc., established in 1991, is the parent company behind Dr. Kang’s Formulas and Guang Ci TCM Clinic. Founded by Dr. Ping Qi Kang and Dr. Yu J. Liang, the company was born from a need for high‑quality, chemical‑free Chinese herbs in the U.S. Dr. Kang, a former Chief of TCM at Shanghai Hospital #1, and Dr. Liang, an expert herbalist, work directly with farmers in more than six Chinese provinces to source pure, wild‑crafted herbs. Their mission is to provide the top functional herbs of Traditional Chinese Medicine at the best possible prices, while also offering Dr. Kang’s proprietary formulas — a blend of over 3,000 years of Eastern medical tradition and modern Western knowledge. These formulas are made from 7:1 concentrate, are easily absorbed, and are available directly to patients and practitioners without a prescription.', '590 Townsend Street, San Francisco CA 94103', 'San Francisco', 'CA', '94103', '415-522-1668', ARRAY['English', 'Chinese']::text[], 'Acupuncture & TCM', FALSE, '{"fax": "415-522-1988", "email": "sale@drkangformulas.com", "images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/asia-natural-products-inc-dr-kang-formulas.webp"], "website": "http://www.drkangformulas.com/", "location": {"latitude": 37.7723278, "longitude": -122.40128990000001}, "services": ["Raw Chinese Herbs", "Dr. Kang’s Formulas (Proprietary Blends)"], "insurance": {"notes": "No insurance information is mentioned on the page. The business sells herbs and formulas directly to patients and practitioners; it does not appear to be a medical clinic that bills insurance.", "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": [], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": false}, "highlights": [{"title": "Chemical‑Free Chinese Herbs", "detail": "Herbs are grown without pesticides, GMOs, sulfites, or preservatives, and many are wild‑crafted.", "category": "quality"}, {"title": "Direct Farm Sourcing", "detail": "Dr. Liang personally visits and prepays farmers in six Chinese provinces to ensure top‑quality ingredients.", "category": "quality"}, {"title": "12‑Generation Lineage", "detail": "Dr. Kang’s formulas have been handed down over 12 generations of world‑renowned TCM experts.", "category": "tradition"}, {"title": "7:1 Concentrate Formulas", "detail": "Dr. Kang’s Formulas are made from a 7:1 herbal concentrate that dissolves instantly and is easily absorbed.", "category": "technology"}, {"title": "San Francisco Warehouse", "detail": "Maintains 5–6 containers of dried herbs in a San Francisco warehouse with regular shipments from China.", "category": "convenience"}], "price_tier": "$$", "source_url": "http://www.drkangformulas.com/", "appointment": {"booking_note": null, "appointment_url": null, "new_patient_note": null, "phone_booking_available": null, "online_booking_available": null, "free_consultation_available": null}, "open_sunday": false, "scout_query": "Chinese speaking medical clinic in San Francisco, CA", "search_text": "acupuncture & tcm | acupuncture | chinese medicine | tcm | herbal medicine | cupping | pain relief | châm cứu | đông y | y học cổ truyền | 한의원 | 침술 | 한약 | 中医 | 针灸 | 中药 | english | chinese | mandarin | cantonese | 中文 | 普通话 | 国语 | 粤语 | 广东话 | 华人 | raw chinese herbs | dr. kang’s formulas (proprietary blends) | dr. ping qi kang | doctor of tcm, acupuncture, and herbology; founder | dr. yu j. liang | president, omd; expert herbalist | emmanuel segmen | general manager", "google_types": ["store", "point_of_interest", "establishment"], "open_weekend": false, "team_members": [{"name": "Dr. Ping Qi Kang", "role": "Doctor of TCM, Acupuncture, and Herbology; Founder", "bio_snippet": "Former Chief Medical Officer at Shanghai Hospital #1. Studied medicine from age ten. Has 60+ years of experience and a successful private practice with international patients.", "languages_spoken": ["English", "Chinese"]}, {"name": "Dr. Yu J. Liang", "role": "President, OMD; Expert Herbalist", "bio_snippet": "Expert herbalist who travels to China regularly to select and prepay farmers for top‑quality herbs. Oversees herb procurement and quality control.", "languages_spoken": ["English", "Chinese"]}, {"name": "Emmanuel Segmen", "role": "General Manager", "bio_snippet": "Responsible for communicating with purchasing departments, QA officers, R&D scientists, and U.S. government agencies.", "languages_spoken": ["English"]}], "language_note": "Founded by Chinese immigrants Dr. Ping Qi Kang and Dr. Yu J. Liang, the company reflects a deep commitment to authentic Traditional Chinese Medicine. Dr. Kang left his post at Shanghai Hospital #1 to teach in San Francisco, and the business was built on direct relationships with Chinese farmers to ensure the highest‑quality, unsprayed herbs. The cultural value of preserving ancient lineage formulas for modern use is central to the brand.", "open_saturday": false, "quality_score": 93, "working_hours": {"friday": "9:00 AM – 4:30 PM", "monday": "9:00 AM – 4:30 PM", "sunday": "Closed", "tuesday": "9:00 AM – 4:30 PM", "saturday": "Closed", "thursday": "9:00 AM – 4:30 PM", "wednesday": "9:00 AM – 4:30 PM"}, "gallery_images": ["http://www.drkangformulas.com/images/herbformulas.jpg", "http://www.drkangformulas.com/images/drkanglogo1.jpg"], "review_profile": {"rating": null, "source": null, "summary": null, "review_count": null, "concern_themes": [], "positive_themes": [], "featured_reviews": []}, "about_highlight": "Asia Natural Products, Inc., established in 1991, is the parent company behind Dr. Kang’s Formulas and Guang Ci TCM Clinic. Founded by Dr. Ping Qi Kang and Dr. Yu J. Liang, the company was born from a need for high‑quality, chemical‑free Chinese herbs in the U.S. Dr. Kang, a former Chief of TCM at Shanghai Hospital #1, and Dr. Liang, an expert herbalist, work directly with farmers in more than six Chinese provinces to source pure, wild‑crafted herbs. Their mission is to provide the top functional herbs of Traditional Chinese Medicine at the best possible prices, while also offering Dr. Kang’s proprietary formulas — a blend of over 3,000 years of Eastern medical tradition and modern Western knowledge. These formulas are made from 7:1 concentrate, are easily absorbed, and are available directly to patients and practitioners without a prescription.", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=4534598122669041312&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJpTtqTdN_j4ARoGbXnPcg7j4", "quality_missing": ["insurance", "appointment_url"], "search_keywords": ["acupuncture & tcm", "acupuncture", "chinese medicine", "tcm", "herbal medicine", "cupping", "pain relief", "châm cứu", "đông y", "y học cổ truyền", "한의원", "침술", "한약", "中医", "针灸", "中药", "english", "chinese", "mandarin", "cantonese", "中文", "普通话", "国语", "粤语", "广东话", "华人", "raw chinese herbs", "dr. kang’s formulas (proprietary blends)", "dr. ping qi kang", "doctor of tcm, acupuncture, and herbology; founder", "dr. yu j. liang", "president, omd; expert herbalist", "emmanuel segmen", "general manager"], "cultural_context": "Founded by Chinese immigrants Dr. Ping Qi Kang and Dr. Yu J. Liang, the company reflects a deep commitment to authentic Traditional Chinese Medicine. Dr. Kang left his post at Shanghai Hospital #1 to teach in San Francisco, and the business was built on direct relationships with Chinese farmers to ensure the highest‑quality, unsprayed herbs. The cultural value of preserving ancient lineage formulas for modern use is central to the brand.", "services_offered": [{"name": "Raw Chinese Herbs", "category": "Herbal Medicine", "description": "Top‑quality, chemical‑free, unsprayed Chinese herbs sourced directly from farms in six Chinese provinces.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Practitioners and patients seeking pure, high‑potency herbs for TCM formulas."}, {"name": "Dr. Kang’s Formulas (Proprietary Blends)", "category": "Herbal Medicine", "description": "Proprietary 7:1 concentrate formulas based on a 12‑generation TCM lineage, designed for acute and chronic care.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Patients and practitioners looking for safe, effective, easily absorbed herbal formulas."}], "short_description": "Asia Natural Products, Inc. supplies premium, chemical‑free Chinese herbs and Dr. Kang’s proprietary formulas, rooted in a 3,000‑year tradition and backed by direct sourcing from Chinese farms.", "google_website_url": "https://www.drkangformulas.com/", "google_primary_type": "Store", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": ["Dr. Ping Qi Kang", "Dr. Yu J. Liang", "Emmanuel Segmen"], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "QHCX+W8, 590 Townsend St, San Francisco, CA 94103, USA"}'::jsonb, '2026-06-26T11:27:59.370051+00:00', 'asia-natural-products-inc-dr-kang-formulas', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('3b1bfe8f-ce43-4111-809f-c5737de4f53b', NULL, 'Chinese Acupuncture & Herb Center', 'Since ancient times, Traditional Chinese Medicine has advised the importance of Body & Spirit health through a multidimensional healthcare insight. We are generations of acupuncturists serving patients in the Washington metropolitan region since the 1990s. Our practitioners combine over 70 years of clinical experience to restore health, reduce pain, and overcome intractable diseases. When each patient comes in, we evaluate, personalize treatment plans, and re-evaluate to achieve precision and maximize benefits. Our treatments complement and enhance conventional medicine with no side effects and no chemical dependency.', '529 14th Street N.W. #988, Washington, DC 20045 / 9075 Shady Grove Ct., Gaithersburg, MD 20877', 'Washington', 'DC', '20045', '(240) 778-4568', ARRAY['English', 'Chinese']::text[], 'Acupuncture & TCM', TRUE, '{"images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/chinese-acupuncture-herb-center.webp"], "website": "http://www.chineseacupunctureherbcenter.net/", "location": {"latitude": 39.119394199999995, "longitude": -77.1833415}, "services": ["Acupuncture", "Acupressure", "Herbal Medicine", "Cupping", "Moxibustion", "Gua Sha", "Electric Acupuncture", "Scalp Acupuncture", "Auricular Acupuncture", "Wrist/Ankle/Cheek Acupuncture", "Japanese Style Acupuncture", "Pain Management", "Foot Pain Treatment", "TMJ Pain Treatment", "Anxiety & Depression Treatment", "Infertility Treatment", "Allergy Treatment", "Facial Rejuvenation / Acne", "Weight Loss Treatment", "Digestive Issues", "Chronic Fatigue Syndrome", "Holistic Eastern Nutrition Consultation", "Self Care Consultation", "Telemedicine / Virtual Consultation", "COVID19 Treatment"], "insurance": {"notes": "Not mentioned on the page. There is a separate ''Insurance'' page but content was not provided.", "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": [], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": false}, "highlights": [{"title": "70+ years combined experience", "detail": "Practitioners have over 70 years of combined clinical experience.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Generations of acupuncturists", "detail": "Family tradition of acupuncture since the 1990s in the Washington metropolitan area.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Personalized treatment plans", "detail": "Each patient receives an evaluation, personalized plan, and re-evaluation for precision treatment.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "No side effects", "detail": "Traditional Chinese Medicine methods treat diseases with no side effects and no chemical dependency.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Accepts new patients", "detail": "The clinic accepts new patients and can be contacted by phone.", "category": "convenience"}, {"title": "Telemedicine available", "detail": "Virtual consultations are available Monday through Friday by appointment.", "category": "technology"}], "price_tier": "$$", "source_url": "http://www.chineseacupunctureherbcenter.net/", "appointment": {"booking_note": "Call 240-778-4568 to make an appointment.", "appointment_url": null, "new_patient_note": "Accepts new patients.", "phone_booking_available": true, "online_booking_available": false, "free_consultation_available": null}, "open_sunday": false, "scout_query": "Chinese speaking medical clinic in Washington, D.C.", "search_text": "acupuncture & tcm | acupuncture | chinese medicine | tcm | herbal medicine | cupping | pain relief | châm cứu | đông y | y học cổ truyền | 한의원 | 침술 | 한약 | 中医 | 针灸 | 中药 | english | chinese | mandarin | cantonese | 中文 | 普通话 | 国语 | 粤语 | 广东话 | 华人 | acupressure | moxibustion | gua sha | e