"Velscope oral cancer screening, Biolase Waterlase, and Sirolaser.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}], "short_description": "Dental Care Today of Richardson is a boutique dental office offering comprehensive dental services including preventive, restorative, cosmetic, and implant dentistry, led by Dr. David Nguyen, DDS, FICOI.", "google_website_url": "https://www.dentistryinrichardson.com/?utm_source=GMB&utm_medium=organic&utm_campaign=richardson", "google_primary_type": "Dentist", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": ["Dr. David Nguyen"], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "1600 N Plano Rd #2200, Richardson, TX 75081, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/109141641507006730608", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVS_x0NOJFiLQExo4nummFrZqphsTGfrTGSEeuQ9B9sf38mtxFU=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "SKYLINE DENTISTRY. David Nguyen DDS"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/101307249602340920234", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUVvivythCmit8jjqSsoHGaiggekg02qLMxzv5Z_U2vJD8a5RAK4Q=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Sonia"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/109141641507006730608", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVS_x0NOJFiLQExo4nummFrZqphsTGfrTGSEeuQ9B9sf38mtxFU=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "SKYLINE DENTISTRY. David Nguyen DDS"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/117165663558123388320", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL3x3oYf0xP9v3x85FH6Pgi0iidmu456vhXHsKoOfT9T6gy6A=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Beba pham"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/109141641507006730608", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVS_x0NOJFiLQExo4nummFrZqphsTGfrTGSEeuQ9B9sf38mtxFU=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "SKYLINE DENTISTRY. David Nguyen DDS"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-25T19:22:06.490083+00:00', 'skyline-dentistry-david-nguyen-dds', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('2637cec4-2a79-40f2-9422-8b885f0972e3', NULL, 'Total Care Dental and Orthodontics | Los Angeles', 'Discover exceptional dental care in Los Angeles, Baldwin Park and Huntington Park at Total Care Dental & Orthodontics. We pride ourselves on being a pristine, welcoming, and professional dental practice, where every patient is treated like family. Our commitment is to deliver an unparalleled dental care experience from the moment you step into our office. With a strong emphasis on cleanliness, we ensure a hygienic environment while fostering a warm and inviting atmosphere for all your dental needs.
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('7a014e81-6892-4423-86bd-e3dd2ba6c475', NULL, 'Korean American Family Services (KFAM)', 'Korean American Family Services (KFAM) is a community-based nonprofit organization dedicated to providing culturally responsive social services to the Korean and Asian American community in Los Angeles. Founded to address the unique challenges faced by immigrants and families undergoing trauma, adaptation, or acculturation stress, KFAM offers a comprehensive range of holistic services including mental health counseling, gender-based violence support, foster care and adoption, child and adult wellness programs, and the Asian Foster Family Initiative. Their work is grounded in understanding the cultural, linguistic, and systemic barriers that Asian American families often encounter.
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('865af1cc-4792-402c-b4dd-3bc80793858f', NULL, '3D Dental Implant Center', '3D Dental Implant Center is a specialized dental implant center located in Brooklyn, NY, led by Dr. Charlie Chen, a highly experienced implantologist with over 20 years of experience and more than 30,000 successful implant procedures. The center focuses on full-arch reconstructions using the innovative All-on-8 technique, which allows patients to receive fixed, functional teeth in a single day through immediate loading. Dr. Chen''s expertise in complex bone grafting and implant placement has enabled him to treat patients who were previously considered unsuitable for implants.
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('10a151e4-c119-45a7-bf6b-af5fa1ac3a8d', NULL, 'Revival Mental Health', 'Revival Mental Health is a residential mental health treatment facility in Orange County, CA, offering a private and personalized program for adults. Located in Fountain Valley and Huntington Beach, the facility provides 24/7 clinical support, crisis stabilization, and a structured therapeutic environment. Clients receive individualized treatment plans overseen by a psychiatry team and doctorate or master''s-level clinicians, with evidence-based therapies such as CBT, DBT, and ACT. The program includes family therapy, holistic approaches like mindfulness and art therapy, and a focus on long-term recovery with aftercare planning. The facility features comfortable living spaces, an in-house chef, and a supportive community atmosphere, as highlighted by positive client reviews.', '9879 Hamilton Ave, Fountain Valley, CA 92708', 'Fountain Valley', 'CA', '92708', '(949) 776-8871', ARRAY['English', 'Vietnamese']::text[], 'Mental Health', FALSE, '{"images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/revival-mental-health-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/revival-mental-health-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/revival-mental-health-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/revival-mental-health-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/revival-mental-health-google-5.webp"], "rating": 4.9, "reviews": [{"date": "2026-03-08T19:30:56.309545008Z", "text": "Revival is a great place for mental health residential treatment. The staff is remarkable and caring and really listen to your needs and take action to reach out to the right parties to assist in the care you need. The clinical team works hard day and night to assist in all ways needed. It''s a warm and cozy atmosphere so you don''t feel lost or scared, It has all the comforts of home. There is an in house chef that prepares your meals which makes it easy so you have more time to focus on you. The group facilitators are wonderful and knowledgeable and if you pay attention and do the work, IT WORKS. You have two days a week you are permitted to go shopping with a staff member to get whatever essentials you need and Sundays they have group outtings. Definitely give them a chance, take a tour, you won''t regret.", "author": "Kimberly Thomas", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105488124608406093695/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-11T17:41:45.032824752Z", "text": "I highly recommend this facility for anybody and everybody. The staff was absolutely incredible from the moment of admission to the moment of discharge I felt supported, and I do believe that revival saved my life. The facility is beautiful. The staff is compassionate and reliable, and honestly wouldn’t change anything about it. My experience was life-changing. I would actually write them a 10 star if I could. Shout out to faith, Dylan, T, Chloe Victor and Donielle .", "author": "Vanessa Bowers", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111367175919000169514/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-04-14T22:36:14.929391212Z", "text": "I was in a really dark place before coming here, and I reached out to Revival for help. I flew in from Texas, and from the very beginning of my treatment, they welcomed me with open arms and made me feel at home. I felt genuinely cared for the entire time I was there.\n\nThe therapy was incredibly beneficial, especially my individual sessions with Haylee, which made a huge impact on my healing. I also really appreciated how diligent the psychiatrist was in making sure I was on the right medications, it made a meaningful difference in my progress.\n\nSome of the people who meant the most to me during my stay were Haylee, Dylan, Erin, Chloe, Pam, Taylor, and Sophie. I’m so grateful for each of them.\n\nI would highly recommend this place to anyone who is struggling and needs support.", "author": "Berklee Huff", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115818478787977857268/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-03-08T23:58:01.712072125Z", "text": "Revival Huntington Beach Mental Health has been the BEST live in residential place for my son age 23yrs to get stable and regain purpose and hope! It’s a beautiful house! We chose it because we were literally at a hopeless dead end and needed the absolute best mental health treatment! Jordan, a coordinator, said Revival not only had an opening but that their counseling staff is fabulous and they proved it! Trevor (Program Director) went above and beyond to help my son be able to stay! He is an  incredible man! My son loved his individual therapist Olivia he said she helped him work through a whole lot! My son also loved his case manager Dillon, the group sessions, the house and pool, the food, the positive environment and the respect and care! Excellent psychiatry (medicine) doctors too! Overnight staff is great! It’s an all in smooth running structured program with 6 in patient residents from all walks of life getting help and all getting along, like friends! 😃 The staff is behind the success and Revival far exceeded my expectations!!! My son can now press on! Thank you Revival Huntington Beach for everything!!  ❤️", "author": "Jordan", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104574354384090010175/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-10-12T17:04:01.976934948Z", "text": "I am so grateful the universe guided me to Revival for my residential mental health care. From excellent to facilities to phenomenal staff, the care I received here has changed my life for the better in a way I never thought possible. From my first intake call with Andrew, I felt cared and supported. Revival is a village of folks who actually care; it lacks clinical sterility and fear and instead provides homeliness, a sense of genuine safety, and fosters a community of real support. Shoutout to my case manager Dylan for making me feel like I had control of my journey every step of the way. And shout out to all the wonderful techs that made the house feel like home. If you or a loved one need residential care, you can trust Revival is one the good ones, if not the best one!", "author": "Erinn Veach", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109909890991534393510/reviews"}], "website": "https://revivalmentalhealth.com", "location": {"latitude": 33.7032949, "longitude": -117.9560331}, "services": ["Residential Inpatient Treatment", "CBT & DBT Informed Care", "On-Site Doctors & Psychiatrists", "24-Hour Care", "Depression Treatment", "Anxiety Treatment", "Bipolar Disorder I & II Treatment", "Schizo-Affective Treatment", "Co-Occurring Disorder Treatment", "PTSD Treatment", "OCD Treatment", "Personality Disorder Treatment", "Adult ADD/ADHD Treatment", "Trauma-Informed Care", "Insomnia Treatment", "EMDR Therapy", "Process Group Therapy", "Family Group Therapy", "Individualized Treatment", "Cognitive Behavioral Therapy", "Dialectical Behavioral Therapy", "Acceptance and Commitment Therapy (ACT)"], "insurance": {"notes": "Insurance accepted; verify coverage through the website at https://revivalmentalhealth.com/verify-insurance/", "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": [], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": true}, "highlights": [{"title": "24/7 Clinical Support", "detail": "Around-the-clock care from trained professionals, including on-call psychiatry and nursing checks.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Private Rooms", "detail": "Recover in private rooms within a residential setting.", "category": "convenience"}, {"title": "Crisis Stabilization", "detail": "Immediate support for safety risks, including suicidal ideation and psychosis.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Covered By Your Insurance", "detail": "Insurance accepted; verify coverage through the website.", "category": "insurance"}, {"title": "Evidence-Based Therapies", "detail": "Utilizes CBT, DBT, and ACT for effective symptom management.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Family Involvement", "detail": "Family therapy and education to strengthen support networks.", "category": "care"}], "price_tier": "$$", "source_url": "https://revivalmentalhealth.com/?utm_campaign=gmb", "appointment": {"booking_note": "Call (949) 776-8871 or use the contact form to schedule.", "appointment_url": "https://revivalmentalhealth.com/contact-us/", "new_patient_note": null, "phone_booking_available": true, "online_booking_available": false, "free_consultation_available": null}, "open_sunday": true, "scout_query": "Vietnamese mental health counseling in Orange County, CA", "search_text": "mental health | psychiatry | psychiatrist | psychology | therapist | counseling | depression | anxiety | tâm lý | tâm thần | trầm cảm | 정신과 | 심리상담 | 心理医生 | 精神科 | english | vietnamese | tiếng việt | người việt | bác sĩ việt | residential inpatient treatment | cbt & dbt informed care | on-site doctors & psychiatrists | 24-hour care | depression treatment | anxiety treatment | bipolar disorder i & ii treatment | schizo-affective treatment | co-occurring disorder treatment | ptsd treatment | ocd treatment | personality disorder treatment | adult add/adhd treatment | trauma-informed care | insomnia treatment | emdr therapy | process group therapy | family group therapy | individualized treatment | cognitive behavioral therapy | dialectical behavioral therapy | acceptance and commitment therapy (act) | inpatient | therapy | medical | treatment | trevor | program director | olivia | individual therapist | dillon | case manager | jordan | coordinator", "google_types": ["doctor", "medical_clinic", "health", "service", "point_of_interest", "establishment"], "open_weekend": true, "rating_count": 86, "team_members": [{"name": "Trevor", "role": "Program Director", "bio_snippet": "Went above and beyond to help a client be able to stay.", "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Olivia", "role": "Individual Therapist", "bio_snippet": "Helped a client work through a whole lot.", "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Dillon", "role": "Case Manager", "bio_snippet": "Loved by a client.", "languages_spoken": []}, {"name": "Jordan", "role": "Coordinator", "bio_snippet": "Coordinator who helped with admissions.", "languages_spoken": []}], "open_saturday": true, "quality_score": 95, "working_hours": {"friday": "Open 24 hours", "monday": "Open 24 hours", "sunday": "Open 24 hours", "tuesday": "Open 24 hours", "saturday": "Open 24 hours", "thursday": "Open 24 hours", "wednesday": "Open 24 hours"}, "gallery_images": ["https://revivalmentalhealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/15-FountainValley-9879Hamilton-15.png", "https://revivalmentalhealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/1-FountainValley-9879Hamilton-1.jpg", "https://revivalmentalhealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/18-FountainValley-9879Hamilton-18.png", "https://revivalmentalhealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/17-FountainValley-9879Hamilton-17.png", "https://revivalmentalhealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/16-FountainValley-9879Hamilton-16.png", "https://revivalmentalhealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/19-FountainValley-9879Hamilton-19.png", "https://revivalmentalhealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/20-FountainValley-9879Hamilton-20.png", "https://revivalmentalhealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/10-FountainValley-9879Hamilton-10.png", "https://revivalmentalhealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/11-FountainValley-9879Hamilton-11.png", "https://revivalmentalhealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/12-FountainValley-9879Hamilton-12.png", "https://revivalmentalhealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/13-FountainValley-9879Hamilton-13.png", "https://revivalmentalhealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/14-FountainValley-9879Hamilton-14.png", "https://revivalmentalhealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/1747994774921_1747958801661dsc05352-scaled.jpg", "https://revivalmentalhealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/1.png", "https://revivalmentalhealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/2.png", "https://revivalmentalhealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/3.png", "https://revivalmentalhealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/4.png", "https://revivalmentalhealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/5.png", "https://revivalmentalhealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/6.png", "https://revivalmentalhealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Untitled-design-2025-06-06T220459.959.png", "https://revivalmentalhealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/1747994775508_1747958823495dsc05353-scaled.jpg", "https://revivalmentalhealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/1747994754030_1747957894671dsc05309-scaled.jpg", "https://revivalmentalhealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/1747994766896_1747958417083dsc05332-scaled.jpg", "https://revivalmentalhealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/1747994770594_1747958578067dsc05342-scaled.jpg", "https://revivalmentalhealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/1747994758261_1747958073217dsc05317-scaled.jpg", "https://revivalmentalhealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/1747994755606_1747957960213dsc05312-scaled.jpg"], "review_profile": {"rating": 4.9, "source": "google", "themes": [{"theme": "Staff Professionalism", "mentions": 5, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Every reviewer highlights the remarkable, caring, and knowledgeable staff who provide consistent support."}, {"theme": "Facility Environment", "mentions": 4, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Multiple reviews mention the warm, cozy, and homely atmosphere that makes patients feel safe and comfortable."}, {"theme": "Treatment Outcomes", "mentions": 4, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients describe their experiences as life-changing, with therapy and medication management making a significant impact."}, {"theme": "Clinical Expertise", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Reviewers commend the excellent psychiatry and individual therapy sessions for their effectiveness in healing."}, {"theme": "Community Support", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients appreciate the sense of community and genuine safety fostered by the staff and group activities."}], "summary": "Patients overwhelmingly praise Revival Mental Health for its compassionate staff, homely atmosphere, and life-changing treatment outcomes, with many highlighting the facility''s supportive environment and excellent clinical care.", "review_count": 86, "concern_themes": ["Rules can be strict but are seen as beneficial", "Shared rooms may be a concern initially"], "positive_themes": ["Caring and remarkable staff", "Effective therapy and group sessions", "Warm and cozy atmosphere", "In-house chef and good food", "24/7 support and crisis care", "Positive environment and bonding with other clients", "Excellent psychiatry and medication management"], "featured_reviews": [{"date": "2026-03-08T19:30:56.309545008Z", "text": "Revival is a great place for mental health residential treatment. The staff is remarkable and caring and really listen to your needs and take action to reach out to the right parties to assist in the care you need. The clinical team works hard day and night to assist in all ways needed. It''s a warm and cozy atmosphere so you don''t feel lost or scared, It has all the comforts of home. There is an in house chef that prepares your meals which makes it easy so you have more time to focus on you. The group facilitators are wonderful and knowledgeable and if you pay attention and do the work, IT WORKS. You have two days a week you are permitted to go shopping with a staff member to get whatever essentials you need and Sundays they have group outtings. Definitely give them a chance, take a tour, you won''t regret.", "author": "Kimberly Thomas", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105488124608406093695/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-05-11T17:41:45.032824752Z", "text": "I highly recommend this facility for anybody and everybody. The staff was absolutely incredible from the moment of admission to the moment of discharge I felt supported, and I do believe that revival saved my life. The facility is beautiful. The staff is compassionate and reliable, and honestly wouldn’t change anything about it. My experience was life-changing. I would actually write them a 10 star if I could. Shout out to faith, Dylan, T, Chloe Victor and Donielle .", "author": "Vanessa Bowers", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111367175919000169514/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-04-14T22:36:14.929391212Z", "text": "I was in a really dark place before coming here, and I reached out to Revival for help. I flew in from Texas, and from the very beginning of my treatment, they welcomed me with open arms and made me feel at home. I felt genuinely cared for the entire time I was there.\n\nThe therapy was incredibly beneficial, especially my individual sessions with Haylee, which made a huge impact on my healing. I also really appreciated how diligent the psychiatrist was in making sure I was on the right medications, it made a meaningful difference in my progress.\n\nSome of the people who meant the most to me during my stay were Haylee, Dylan, Erin, Chloe, Pam, Taylor, and Sophie. I’m so grateful for each of them.\n\nI would highly recommend this place to anyone who is struggling and needs support.", "author": "Berklee Huff", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115818478787977857268/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-03-08T23:58:01.712072125Z", "text": "Revival Huntington Beach Mental Health has been the BEST live in residential place for my son age 23yrs to get stable and regain purpose and hope! It’s a beautiful house! We chose it because we were literally at a hopeless dead end and needed the absolute best mental health treatment! Jordan, a coordinator, said Revival not only had an opening but that their counseling staff is fabulous and they proved it! Trevor (Program Director) went above and beyond to help my son be able to stay! He is an  incredible man! My son loved his individual therapist Olivia he said she helped him work through a whole lot! My son also loved his case manager Dillon, the group sessions, the house and pool, the food, the positive environment and the respect and care! Excellent psychiatry (medicine) doctors too! Overnight staff is great! It’s an all in smooth running structured program with 6 in patient residents from all walks of life getting help and all getting along, like friends! 😃 The staff is behind the success and Revival far exceeded my expectations!!! My son can now press on! Thank you Revival Huntington Beach for everything!!  ❤️", "author": "Jordan", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104574354384090010175/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-10-12T17:04:01.976934948Z", "text": "I am so grateful the universe guided me to Revival for my residential mental health care. From excellent to facilities to phenomenal staff, the care I received here has changed my life for the better in a way I never thought possible. From my first intake call with Andrew, I felt cared and supported. Revival is a village of folks who actually care; it lacks clinical sterility and fear and instead provides homeliness, a sense of genuine safety, and fosters a community of real support. Shoutout to my case manager Dylan for making me feel like I had control of my journey every step of the way. And shout out to all the wonderful techs that made the house feel like home. If you or a loved one need residential care, you can trust Revival is one the good ones, if not the best one!", "author": "Erinn Veach", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109909890991534393510/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Patients overwhelmingly praise Revival Mental Health for its compassionate staff, homely atmosphere, and life-changing treatment outcomes, with many highlighting the facility''s supportive environment and excellent clinical care.", "about_highlight": "Revival Mental Health is a residential mental health treatment facility in Orange County, CA, offering a private and personalized program for adults. Located in Fountain Valley and Huntington Beach, the facility provides 24/7 clinical support, crisis stabilization, and a structured therapeutic environment. Clients receive individualized treatment plans overseen by a psychiatry team and doctorate or master''s-level clinicians, with evidence-based therapies such as CBT, DBT, and ACT. The program includes family therapy, holistic approaches like mindfulness and art therapy, and a focus on long-term recovery with aftercare planning. The facility features comfortable living spaces, an in-house chef, and a supportive community atmosphere, as highlighted by positive client reviews.", "appointment_url": "https://revivalmentalhealth.com/contact-us/", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=18443454059712850141&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJhRteuHcn3YAR3ahr7L9P9P8", "quality_missing": ["insurance"], "search_keywords": ["mental health", "psychiatry", "psychiatrist", "psychology", "therapist", "counseling", "depression", "anxiety", "tâm lý", "tâm thần", "trầm cảm", "정신과", "심리상담", "心理医生", "精神科", "english", "vietnamese", "tiếng việt", "người việt", "bác sĩ việt", "residential inpatient treatment", "cbt & dbt informed care", "on-site doctors & psychiatrists", "24-hour care", "depression treatment", "anxiety treatment", "bipolar disorder i & ii treatment", "schizo-affective treatment", "co-occurring disorder treatment", "ptsd treatment", "ocd treatment", "personality disorder treatment", "adult add/adhd treatment", "trauma-informed care", "insomnia treatment", "emdr therapy", "process group therapy", "family group therapy", "individualized treatment", "cognitive behavioral therapy", "dialectical behavioral therapy", "acceptance and commitment therapy (act)", "inpatient", "therapy", "medical", "treatment", "trevor", "program director", "olivia", "individual therapist", "dillon", "case manager", "jordan", "coordinator"], "services_offered": [{"name": "Residential Inpatient Treatment", "category": "Inpatient", "description": "An intensive, 24/7 therapeutic program designed to provide a supportive and immersive environment for individuals facing complex mental health challenges.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": "Adults with complex mental health conditions"}, {"name": "CBT & DBT Informed Care", "category": "Therapy", "description": "Utilize evidence-based Cognitive Behavioral Therapy (CBT) and Dialectical Behavioral Therapy (DBT) approaches for effective symptom management.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "On-Site Doctors & Psychiatrists", "category": "Medical", "description": "Benefit from the expertise of our experienced medical professionals, available for personalized consultations and treatment plans.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "24-Hour Care", "category": "Inpatient", "description": "Feel secure knowing our compassionate and experienced staff is available around the clock to provide care and assistance.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Depression Treatment", "category": "Treatment", "description": "For individuals experiencing severe depression, our residential treatment center provides a structured environment where they can receive the intensive support needed to manage their symptoms and begin the healing process.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Individuals with severe depression"}, {"name": "Anxiety Treatment", "category": "Treatment", "description": "Our residential treatment programs offer specialized care for individuals dealing with anxiety disorders, helping them develop coping mechanisms to manage their anxiety and improve their overall mental health.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Individuals with anxiety disorders"}, {"name": "Bipolar Disorder I & II Treatment", "category": "Treatment", "description": "Managing bipolar disorder can be challenging, but our residential mental health treatment program offers the stability and support necessary to help individuals achieve mood stabilization and better manage their condition.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Individuals with bipolar disorder"}, {"name": "Schizo-Affective Treatment", "category": "Treatment", "description": "Our residential facility for mental health is equipped to provide specialized care for individuals with schizophrenia and other psychotic disorders, offering a safe environment where they can receive the treatment they need.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Individuals with schizophrenia or psychotic disorders"}, {"name": "Co-Occurring Disorder Treatment", "category": "Treatment", "description": "Many individuals struggling with mental health disorders also face substance abuse issues. Our residential treatment programs address both conditions simultaneously, providing integrated care for co-occurring disorders.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Individuals with co-occurring mental health and substance abuse issues"}, {"name": "PTSD Treatment", "category": "Treatment", "description": "Specialized treatment for PTSD.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "OCD Treatment", "category": "Treatment", "description": "Specialized treatment for OCD.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Personality Disorder Treatment", "category": "Treatment", "description": "Specialized treatment for personality disorders.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Adult ADD/ADHD Treatment", "category": "Treatment", "description": "Specialized treatment for adult ADD/ADHD.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Trauma-Informed Care", "category": "Therapy", "description": "Trauma-informed therapeutic care.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Insomnia Treatment", "category": "Treatment", "description": "Specialized treatment for insomnia.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "EMDR Therapy", "category": "Therapy", "description": "Eye Movement Desensitization and Reprocessing therapy.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Process Group Therapy", "category": "Therapy", "description": "Group therapy sessions.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Family Group Therapy", "category": "Therapy", "description": "Family therapy sessions.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Individualized Treatment", "category": "Therapy", "description": "Personalized treatment plans.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Cognitive Behavioral Therapy", "category": "Therapy", "description": "Evidence-based CBT.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Dialectical Behavioral Therapy", "category": "Therapy", "description": "Evidence-based DBT.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Acceptance and Commitment Therapy (ACT)", "category": "Therapy", "description": "ACT helps clients build psychological flexibility and live by core values. Clinicians teach mindfulness, acceptance, and committed action drawn from behavioral psychology.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": "Individuals with mood and thought disorders, dual diagnosis needs, and high-risk presentations"}], "short_description": "Revival Mental Health is a 5-star rated residential mental health treatment facility in Orange County, CA, offering private and personalized care for adults in a supportive, home-like environment.", "google_website_url": "https://revivalmentalhealth.com/?utm_campaign=gmb", "google_primary_type": "Medical Clinic", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": ["Trevor", "Olivia", "Dillon", "Jordan"], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "9879 Hamilton Ave, Fountain Valley, CA 92708, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/112759220720324044872", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUGFI7dfDxl4f6C4OnISwKu9ApkImry1UPIlW1AiLdsOQJHa1Hk=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Revival Mental Health"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/112759220720324044872", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUGFI7dfDxl4f6C4OnISwKu9ApkImry1UPIlW1AiLdsOQJHa1Hk=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Revival Mental Health"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/112759220720324044872", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUGFI7dfDxl4f6C4OnISwKu9ApkImry1UPIlW1AiLdsOQJHa1Hk=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Revival Mental Health"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/112759220720324044872", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUGFI7dfDxl4f6C4OnISwKu9ApkImry1UPIlW1AiLdsOQJHa1Hk=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Revival Mental Health"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/112759220720324044872", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUGFI7dfDxl4f6C4OnISwKu9ApkImry1UPIlW1AiLdsOQJHa1Hk=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Revival Mental Health"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-26T12:59:20.678188+00:00', 'revival-mental-health', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('723a71d5-a42c-4857-86c9-0d03a8e47632', NULL, 'Orange Dermatology and Laser Center', 'Orange Dermatology and Laser Center has proudly been serving this community for over 40 years. Founded in 1985 by Dr. Steven Stanowicz with his sister Stahsha Diaz as office manager, the practice began in Villa Park, CA and later moved to its current location at 1506 E. Chapman Ave in Orange, CA, with a second location at 368 S. Glassell Street serving as a dedicated Mohs Surgery Center. Dr. Steven Stanowicz’s daughter, Dr. Sarah Stanowicz, joined the practice in 2010, sharing the same philosophy of treating both employees and patients as family.
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('3fbc03e2-fd7c-4458-8149-725d12df003b', NULL, 'UT Physicians Orthopedics – Memorial Villages', 'As a group, UT Physicians Orthopedics has orthopedic doctors who specialize in every procedure in Orthopedics today, and physicians who are developing the techniques and procedures for tomorrow. All of our surgeons are trained on the latest and least invasive surgical approaches including robotic and arthroscopic surgery. The clinic provides comprehensive care for the entire musculoskeletal system, including sports medicine, total joint replacements, knee injuries, foot and ankle care, reconstructive trauma, shoulder and elbow surgery, hand and wrist surgery, concussion management, specialized injection services, EMG, and pain management. Both adult and pediatric patients are seen.', '950 Corbindale Rd, Ste 300, Houston, TX 77024-2849', 'Houston', 'TX', '77024', '(713) 486-1700', ARRAY['English', 'Vietnamese']::text[], 'Orthopedics', FALSE, '{"fax": "(713) 467-6682", "images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/ut-physicians-orthopedics-memorial-villages-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/ut-physicians-orthopedics-memorial-villages-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/ut-physicians-orthopedics-memorial-villages-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/ut-physicians-orthopedics-memorial-villages-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/ut-physicians-orthopedics-memorial-villages-google-5.webp"], "rating": 4.7, "reviews": [{"date": "2026-05-31T19:29:24.963430281Z", "text": "I would highly recommend this practice. From the time you enter the front door, until you leave, you couldn’t ask for better care and concern. Dr. Sabongy performed arthroscopic surgery on my left knee. The surgery was successful and the rehab is going well. Carla, his nurse assistant was exceptional. During the evaluation, before the surgery and afterwards,  she kept me updated, stayed in contact with me and always answered my emails promptly. It’s important to me for the physician and his staff to hear my concerns, explain to me in non medical terms what’s going on, the treatment plan, the expectations and to respond in a timely manner. I am thoroughly pleased with this practice.", "author": "Stephanie Johnson", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110281009752111538658/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-12-04T15:49:26.854482378Z", "text": "My son sustained an injury and needed immediate attention, and I was able to get a same-day appointment. The receptionist was kind, pleasant, and made the check-in process quick and easy. The customer service here is truly top-notch.\n\nMy son is on the autism spectrum, and the clinical team showed so much patience, understanding, and compassion toward him. They handled everything that comes with caring for an autistic child with grace and professionalism.\n\nMy experience with Dr. Shiraz Younas was amazing. His patience, kindness, and expertise made it clear that he truly loves what he does. He was incredibly gentle and patient with my son, and even the experience of getting X-rays was smooth and comforting for him.\n\nI highly recommend Dr. Younas and the entire staff at this facility. If you bring your child here, you will be very pleased with the level of care and service.", "author": "Tiffany Davis", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116188209941901509372/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-01-30T16:48:18.196793973Z", "text": "Wow! I was in and out BEFORE my appointment time.  Apt 1030, 1020 i was checking out.  The lobby was full so I expected it to be at least a few hours.  Ada was my nurse Katy was my, like, before the nurse person, they were amazing.  Norberto checked me in and he too was super cool.  5 stars 🌟 all around.", "author": "Seed Sowers", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118260907298014142348/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-03-04T00:29:18.467356076Z", "text": "Dr. Rodriguez and the team at UT Physicians and Orthopedics are outstanding. Several years ago, I saw Dr. Beaver for a different issue that he specializes in, and Dr. Rodriguez provided the same courteous specialty care, along with a very nice personality and disposition. I highly recommend this orthopedic practice.", "author": "Alli Jarrett", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115282381176621580919/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-01-28T03:38:10.843679890Z", "text": "“Dr. James Gregory is simply the best! He performed reverse shoulder surgery on my wife Bimla Jain with amazing results—she loves her new shoulder and is back to living fully. Incredibly impressed by his skill, professionalism, and bedside manner. 10/10 recommend!”", "author": "Swatantra Jain", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117559144487093264345/reviews"}], "website": "https://www.utphysicians.com/clinic/ut-physicians-orthopedics-memorial-villages/", "location": {"latitude": 29.7826539, "longitude": -95.5123125}, "services": ["Sports Medicine", "Total Joint Replacements", "Knee Injuries", "Hip", "Foot and Ankle", "Reconstructive Trauma", "Shoulder", "Hand & Wrist", "Elbow", "Concussion Management", "Specialized Injection Services", "EMG", "Pain Managem