ide manner", "experienced"], "featured_reviews": [{"date": "2026-05-15T15:21:39.542595848Z", "text": "Dr. Masson has been a huge help throughout my recovery. He has taken the time to listen to my concerns about my leg and arm and has shown genuine care during every visit. His professionalism, patience, and dedication have made a difficult situation much easier to handle. I truly appreciate the support, treatment, and encouragement he has provided along the way. I’m grateful to have a doctor who is so attentive and committed to helping me heal.\n\nThe staff has also been amazing from the moment I walk in. Everyone is kind, respectful, and welcoming, and they always make me feel comfortable. They are very professional, helpful, and attentive, and they work hard to make sure patients are taken care of. I truly appreciate the positive atmosphere and excellent customer service from the entire team.", "author": "Jessi", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101989551781338778266/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-06-09T20:33:58.136376076Z", "text": "Really disorganized when it comes to scheduling anything. I have had to follow up so many times for various needs for my mom and before we even had surgery was told every day something new we had to get done and it''s been a cat and mouse chase with trying to schedule her therapy with one person blaming another for not getting back to them with what they need and yada yada yada. Thankfully the surgery was well done but the organization here has been less than professional. Nice people, but when you''re needing to care for your loved ones it would be helpful to have a better system in place. Extremely unimpressed.", "author": "Richard Chaz Gomez", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103512236597936416283/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-03-28T14:52:00.777688720Z", "text": "Dr. Masson is absolutely amazing! I came to him for a second opinion after anot