sson, M.D.", "Fernando Levaro-Pano, M.D."], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "1200 Binz St #100, Houston, TX 77004, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/114185297203598895661", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXWCG3JljJba3jpnz1ZyfCRg4iyvwrvxDZ0F-uM0f7WQWHl9Tk=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Reconstructive Orthopedic Center"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/100301362473507177002", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ9jSr-QiaLsMTbdXmJbl11ebbiwtTWnkAqBr5LQBCaS-pWPQ=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Jo Zepeda"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/114185297203598895661", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXWCG3JljJba3jpnz1ZyfCRg4iyvwrvxDZ0F-uM0f7WQWHl9Tk=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Reconstructive Orthopedic Center"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/114185297203598895661", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXWCG3JljJba3jpnz1ZyfCRg4iyvwrvxDZ0F-uM0f7WQWHl9Tk=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "Reconstructive Orthopedic Center"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/115491975261184462185", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWjqzW_6txp2-DW6dzBkIp2sdm3FbJB9H16SU84s__zYR59F_GSvA=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "MR. C"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-26T13:59:41.705188+00:00', 'reconstructive-orthopedic-center', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('996cbd87-ce60-4329-8978-5826e03d2ce1', NULL, 'Han Orthopaedics', 'Han Orthopaedics is a Los Angeles and Orange County orthopedic practice specializing in the prevention, diagnosis, and treatment of disorders related to the musculoskeletal system. The team of medical experts is committed to providing the highest quality of orthopedic care with honesty, compassion, and excellence. Whether a condition requires non-operative treatment or surgical intervention, the goal is to get patients back to their activities as quickly and safely as possible.
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('f458a82c-dfd3-4865-a6b5-f4c25dcd0e45', NULL, 'UT Southwestern Medical Center', 'UT Southwestern Medical Center is the No. 1 hospital in Dallas-Fort Worth for the ninth consecutive year and ranks among the nation''s top hospitals for care in 12 specialties – the most in Texas, according to U.S. News & World Report. Combining breakthrough science with the latest medical advancements, UT Southwestern sets the standard for innovative, compassionate, high-quality patient care for North Texas.
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('76f93235-9845-4abe-9cf9-9e8b6a0326c3', NULL, 'James Chen, MD', 'James Chen, MD is a board-certified, fellowship-trained orthopaedic surgeon in San Francisco, CA, specializing in sports-related injuries and minimally-invasive arthroscopic procedures. He provides state-of-the-art care for the knee, shoulder, elbow, hip, and ankle, using the latest technologies to reduce incisions to just 4-millimeter portals for faster recovery. Dr. Chen believes in treating the whole patient, emphasizing personal attention before and after surgery, and he and his staff are available to answer any questions. His private practice, Advanced Orthopaedics & Sports Medicine Inc., is located in a modern 4,000 square-foot facility in Union Square, offering on-site x-rays and ultrasounds, a comfortable waiting room, and a dedicated staff. Dr. Chen also works with local school athletic departments and serves as the team physician for the San Francisco City Football Club, and offers urgent orthopedic care through Ortho Care On Demand with a simple, transparent fee.', '450 Sutter Street, Suite 400, San Francisco, CA 94108', 'San Francisco', 'CA', '94108', '(415) 900-3000', ARRAY['English', 'Chinese']::text[], 'Orthopedics', FALSE, '{"images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/james-chen-md-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/james-chen-md-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/james-chen-md-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/james-chen-md-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/james-chen-md-google-5.webp"], "rating": 4.9, "pricing": [{"name": "Urgent Orthopedic Care Visit", "notes": "Simple, transparent fee covering the visit, x-rays, cast or splint through Ortho Care On Demand.", "price": null, "category": "urgent care", "price_range": null}], "reviews": [{"date": "2026-05-28T18:25:21.459408766Z", "text": "Dr Chen is the best! I came in with a torn Achilles and he took care of me promptly with the utmost professionalism and empathy.\n\nHis PA Matt Mabida is also phenomenal - he''s super knowledgable but most importantly he''s a great listener and I know his personalized recommendations have helped accelerate my recovery.\n\nI can''t recommend this team strongly enough!", "author": "Kojo Minta", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117876470404130188668/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-01-16T23:33:08.635214024Z", "text": "(Update: Dr. Chen called and was very kind. I thought I should update the star rating because he was very helpful and the negatives I mention don’t directly relate to him.)\n\nI came in recently for a broken foot. Dr. Chen was great. He was kind and efficient with his diagnosis. I have only good things to say about him.\n\nThe three stars are because his staff were weirdly checked-out. I thought it might just have been me at first. But I ended up having to go to multiple labs & doctors’ offices in the course of getting surgery on my foot and this ended up standing out.\n\nFor example this is the only office where I had to wait standing up on crutches while checking in because the person at the desk wanted to finish chatting with their friends. Later Dr. Chen mentioned I needed to get surgery ASAP, i.e. within the next two weeks. I mentioned this to the person on the phone when asking them to fax a referral and they nonchalantly said it should be done within a week or so. I had to point out that that’d give me only a week after the referral to schedule the surgery.\n\nIn contrast, at literally every other office, people held the door for me, told me to sit down so they could bring the forms to me, etc. Of course these things are minor and ultimately don’t affect the quality of the treatment and diagnosis from Dr. Chen. But this office was such an outlier that I felt a need to write a review.", "author": "Jonathan Chan", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113730118947207917968/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-11-12T04:08:19.326156284Z", "text": "Dr. Chen and his staff, PAs and the anesthesiologist were very warm, competent and professional.  I had arthoscopic surgery on my knee.  I was surprised that the whole experience was pretty pain free, and I did not need any pain meds.  The swelling was minor too.  I feel good recommending Dr. Chen.", "author": "Karen Uchiyama", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115268748132964455474/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-07-10T00:23:20.951403466Z", "text": "Dr. Chen and his staff have been wonderful. Dr Chen fixed my shoulder after an on the job injury and has been very attentive and accommodating with recovery needs. His staff is friendly and efficient and everyone listens to any concern you have. I highly recommend Dr Chen for any orthopedic needs. Will definitely return should another injury come up!", "author": "Kristina douglas", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102535595331690303905/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-06-26T22:12:27.633726632Z", "text": "Dr. Chen was amazing for my ACL surgery. He fit me in for a consultation the same day I called so we could move quickly, which I really appreciated. He’s trusted in the sports community and really understands wanting to get back out there for sports and exercise. He’s straightforward, honest, and always takes the time to answer every question. His team, including the top-notch residents, took great care of me, especially on surgery day — they made sure I felt comfortable and at ease. Surgery and recovery have gone great, and I always felt like I was in good hands. Highly recommend Dr. Chen!", "author": "Nicole Vasquez", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113372157627642663697/reviews"}], "website": "https://jameschenmd.com", "location": {"latitude": 37.7896873, "longitude": -122.4078464}, "services": ["Shoulder Surgery", "Knee Surgery", "Elbow Surgery", "Wrist/Hand Surgery", "Ankle Surgery", "Orthobiologics", "Fracture Care", "Total Joint Replacement", "Ligament Repair"], "insurance": {"notes": "Referrals required in some cases. Please call (415) 900-3000 to verify coverage specific to your plan.", "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": true, "accepted_networks": ["Blue Cross Blue Shield", "Health Net", "CCHP", "MultiPlan", "Hill Physicians", "Brown and Toland", "Aetna", "Cigna", "United", "Medicare"], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": true}, "highlights": [{"title": "Minimally Invasive Arthroscopic Surgery", "detail": "Uses 4-millimeter portals instead of 5-7 inch incisions for less scarring and faster recovery.", "category": "technology"}, {"title": "Team Physician for SF City FC", "detail": "Serves as team physician for the San Francisco City Football Club and works with local school athletic departments.", "category": "care"}, {"title": "Urgent Orthopedic Care", "detail": "Offers Ortho Care On Demand with a transparent fee covering visit, x-rays, cast or splint.", "category": "convenience"}], "price_tier": "$$", "source_url": "https://jameschenmd.com/?utm_source=google&utm_medium=organic&utm_campaign=gbp", "appointment": {"booking_note": "Click here to book online.", "appointment_url": "https://www.zocdoc.com/doctor/james-chen-md-42450", "new_patient_note": null, "phone_booking_available": true, "online_booking_available": true, "free_consultation_available": null}, "open_sunday": false, "scout_query": "Chinese orthopedic clinic in San Francisco, CA", "search_text": "orthopedics | orthopedic | joint pain | sports medicine | spine | knee | cơ xương khớp | chấn thương chỉnh hình | 정형외과 | 骨科 | english | chinese | mandarin | cantonese | 中文 | 普通话 | 国语 | 粤语 | 广东话 | 华人 | shoulder surgery | knee surgery | elbow surgery | wrist/hand surgery | ankle surgery | orthobiologics | fracture care | total joint replacement | ligament repair | orthopedic surgery | orthopedic treatment | blue cross blue shield | health net | cchp | multiplan | hill physicians | brown and toland | aetna | cigna | united | medicare | dr. james chen | orthopedic surgeon", "google_types": ["doctor", "medical_clinic", "health", "point_of_interest", "establishment"], "open_weekend": false, "rating_count": 338, "team_members": [{"name": "Dr. James Chen", "role": "Orthopedic Surgeon", "bio_snippet": "Board-certified, fellowship-trained general orthopaedic surgeon with a focus on sports-related injuries. Trained with best knee and shoulder surgeons in the U.S. Team physician for San Francisco City Football Club.", "languages_spoken": []}], "open_saturday": false, "quality_score": 100, "working_hours": {"friday": "8:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "monday": "8:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "sunday": "Closed", "tuesday": "8:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "saturday": "Closed", "thursday": "8:00 AM – 5:00 PM", "wednesday": "8:00 AM – 5:00 PM"}, "gallery_images": ["https://cdn.sanity.io/images/cgk0qdc0/production/e2e6395822f9d386c0b5c333957697d9d1f031e4-518x762.png", "https://cdn.sanity.io/images/cgk0qdc0/production/648d4ebe7a4ac10f3cb053abbc7b7922c6e16528-1942x1874.png"], "review_profile": {"rating": 4.9, "source": "google", "themes": [{"theme": "Clinical Expertise", "mentions": 5, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Multiple reviewers highlight Dr. Chen''s knowledge, efficiency, and successful treatment outcomes."}, {"theme": "Staff Professionalism", "mentions": 2, "sentiment": "Mixed", "summary_quote": "While some praise the staff''s friendliness and efficiency, others note instances of unprofessional behavior."}, {"theme": "Communication", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients appreciate Dr. Chen''s straightforward, honest communication and willingness to answer all questions."}, {"theme": "Treatment Outcomes", "mentions": 3, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Many reviewers report successful surgeries and recoveries with minimal pain and complications."}, {"theme": "Empathy and Care", "mentions": 4, "sentiment": "Positive", "summary_quote": "Patients consistently mention Dr. Chen''s warmth, attentiveness, and personalized care."}], "summary": "Patients highly recommend Dr. James Chen for his professionalism, empathy, and expertise in orthopedic care, with many praising his attentive and efficient approach to treatment and recovery.", "review_count": 338, "concern_themes": [], "positive_themes": ["great communication", "efficiency with appointments", "professional and thoughtful staff", "smooth surgery and recovery", "personal attention from doctor", "conservative treatment approach", "excellent results"], "featured_reviews": [{"date": "2026-05-28T18:25:21.459408766Z", "text": "Dr Chen is the best! I came in with a torn Achilles and he took care of me promptly with the utmost professionalism and empathy.\n\nHis PA Matt Mabida is also phenomenal - he''s super knowledgable but most importantly he''s a great listener and I know his personalized recommendations have helped accelerate my recovery.\n\nI can''t recommend this team strongly enough!", "author": "Kojo Minta", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117876470404130188668/reviews"}, {"date": "2026-01-16T23:33:08.635214024Z", "text": "(Update: Dr. Chen called and was very kind. I thought I should update the star rating because he was very helpful and the negatives I mention don’t directly relate to him.)\n\nI came in recently for a broken foot. Dr. Chen was great. He was kind and efficient with his diagnosis. I have only good things to say about him.\n\nThe three stars are because his staff were weirdly checked-out. I thought it might just have been me at first. But I ended up having to go to multiple labs & doctors’ offices in the course of getting surgery on my foot and this ended up standing out.\n\nFor example this is the only office where I had to wait standing up on crutches while checking in because the person at the desk wanted to finish chatting with their friends. Later Dr. Chen mentioned I needed to get surgery ASAP, i.e. within the next two weeks. I mentioned this to the person on the phone when asking them to fax a referral and they nonchalantly said it should be done within a week or so. I had to point out that that’d give me only a week after the referral to schedule the surgery.\n\nIn contrast, at literally every other office, people held the door for me, told me to sit down so they could bring the forms to me, etc. Of course these things are minor and ultimately don’t affect the quality of the treatment and diagnosis from Dr. Chen. But this office was such an outlier that I felt a need to write a review.", "author": "Jonathan Chan", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113730118947207917968/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-11-12T04:08:19.326156284Z", "text": "Dr. Chen and his staff, PAs and the anesthesiologist were very warm, competent and professional.  I had arthoscopic surgery on my knee.  I was surprised that the whole experience was pretty pain free, and I did not need any pain meds.  The swelling was minor too.  I feel good recommending Dr. Chen.", "author": "Karen Uchiyama", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115268748132964455474/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-07-10T00:23:20.951403466Z", "text": "Dr. Chen and his staff have been wonderful. Dr Chen fixed my shoulder after an on the job injury and has been very attentive and accommodating with recovery needs. His staff is friendly and efficient and everyone listens to any concern you have. I highly recommend Dr Chen for any orthopedic needs. Will definitely return should another injury come up!", "author": "Kristina douglas", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102535595331690303905/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-06-26T22:12:27.633726632Z", "text": "Dr. Chen was amazing for my ACL surgery. He fit me in for a consultation the same day I called so we could move quickly, which I really appreciated. He’s trusted in the sports community and really understands wanting to get back out there for sports and exercise. He’s straightforward, honest, and always takes the time to answer every question. His team, including the top-notch residents, took great care of me, especially on surgery day — they made sure I felt comfortable and at ease. Surgery and recovery have gone great, and I always felt like I was in good hands. Highly recommend Dr. Chen!", "author": "Nicole Vasquez", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113372157627642663697/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Patients highly recommend Dr. James Chen for his professionalism, empathy, and expertise in orthopedic care, with many praising his attentive and efficient approach to treatment and recovery.", "about_highlight": "James Chen, MD is a board-certified, fellowship-trained orthopaedic surgeon in San Francisco, CA, specializing in sports-related injuries and minimally-invasive arthroscopic procedures. He provides state-of-the-art care for the knee, shoulder, elbow, hip, and ankle, using the latest technologies to reduce incisions to just 4-millimeter portals for faster recovery. Dr. Chen believes in treating the whole patient, emphasizing personal attention before and after surgery, and he and his staff are available to answer any questions. His private practice, Advanced Orthopaedics & Sports Medicine Inc., is located in a modern 4,000 square-foot facility in Union Square, offering on-site x-rays and ultrasounds, a comfortable waiting room, and a dedicated staff. Dr. Chen also works with local school athletic departments and serves as the team physician for the San Francisco City Football Club, and offers urgent orthopedic care through Ortho Care On Demand with a simple, transparent fee.", "appointment_url": "https://www.zocdoc.com/doctor/james-chen-md-42450", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=14892048458095624463&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJc9vdePOAhYARD4Gx0isvq84", "quality_missing": [], "search_keywords": ["orthopedics", "orthopedic", "joint pain", "sports medicine", "spine", "knee", "cơ xương khớp", "chấn thương chỉnh hình", "정형외과", "骨科", "english", "chinese", "mandarin", "cantonese", "中文", "普通话", "国语", "粤语", "广东话", "华人", "shoulder surgery", "knee surgery", "elbow surgery", "wrist/hand surgery", "ankle surgery", "orthobiologics", "fracture care", "total joint replacement", "ligament repair", "orthopedic surgery", "orthopedic treatment", "blue cross blue shield", "health net", "cchp", "multiplan", "hill physicians", "brown and toland", "aetna", "cigna", "united", "medicare", "dr. james chen", "orthopedic surgeon"], "services_offered": [{"name": "Shoulder Surgery", "category": "Orthopedic Surgery", "description": "Dr. Chen specializes in both arthroscopic and open shoulder procedures.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Knee Surgery", "category": "Orthopedic Surgery", "description": "Dr. Chen recommends the least invasive treatment and uses latest advancements when surgery is necessary.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Elbow Surgery", "category": "Orthopedic Surgery", "description": "Advanced arthroscopic and open surgery procedures for the elbow.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Wrist/Hand Surgery", "category": "Orthopedic Surgery", "description": "Treatment for wrist, hand and upper extremity injuries and disorders.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Ankle Surgery", "category": "Orthopedic Surgery", "description": "Expert treatment for ankle fractures and other damage using arthroscopic or open technique.", "is_featured": true, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Orthobiologics", "category": "Orthopedic Treatment", "description": "Administration of naturally occurring substances to treat conditions and enable healing.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Fracture Care", "category": "Orthopedic Surgery", "description": "Covers a broad range of orthopaedic treatments including fracture care.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Total Joint Replacement", "category": "Orthopedic Surgery", "description": "Includes total joint replacement procedures.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}, {"name": "Ligament Repair", "category": "Orthopedic Surgery", "description": "Ligament repair procedures.", "is_featured": false, "patient_fit": null}], "short_description": "Fellowship-trained orthopedic surgeon offering sports medicine, minimally-invasive arthroscopic surgery, and comprehensive orthopaedic care in San Francisco''s Union Square.", "google_website_url": "https://jameschenmd.com/?utm_source=google&utm_medium=organic&utm_campaign=gbp", "insurance_accepted": ["Blue Cross Blue Shield", "Health Net", "CCHP", "MultiPlan", "Hill Physicians", "Brown and Toland", "Aetna", "Cigna", "United", "Medicare"], "google_primary_type": "Doctor", "provider_credentials": {"education": [], "providers": ["Dr. James Chen"], "residency": [], "years_in_practice": null, "board_certifications": [], "hospital_affiliations": [], "professional_memberships": []}, "google_business_status": "OPERATIONAL", "google_formatted_address": "450 Sutter St #400, San Francisco, CA 94108, USA", "google_photo_attributions": [[{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/114074319916919645838", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVHfPDItxxZc03ltoD-HXS_GYwgpW7Spl_ohaLM9Xd--Mb9p6PH=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "James Chen, MD: Advanced Orthopaedics & Sports Medicine"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/114074319916919645838", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVHfPDItxxZc03ltoD-HXS_GYwgpW7Spl_ohaLM9Xd--Mb9p6PH=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "James Chen, MD: Advanced Orthopaedics & Sports Medicine"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/104578908630386681512", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXG5DwyHQJtHvjl5_B6ymS4j38a0ymlBMchtRPEVA-HWRd_yaI=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "James Chen, MD | Orthopedic Surgeon in San Francisco"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/104578908630386681512", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXG5DwyHQJtHvjl5_B6ymS4j38a0ymlBMchtRPEVA-HWRd_yaI=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "James Chen, MD | Orthopedic Surgeon in San Francisco"}], [{"uri": "https://maps.google.com/maps/contrib/104578908630386681512", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXG5DwyHQJtHvjl5_B6ymS4j38a0ymlBMchtRPEVA-HWRd_yaI=s100-p-k-no-mo", "displayName": "James Chen, MD | Orthopedic Surgeon in San Francisco"}]]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-26T14:11:02.588218+00:00', 'james-chen-md', NULL, FALSE) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO public.clinics ("id", "org_id", "name", "description", "address", "city", "state", "zip_code", "phone", "languages", "specialty", "is_telehealth_available", "metadata", "created_at", "slug", "claimed_by", "is_claimed") VALUES ('9dbb39d6-05d5-41e2-8b66-465bb7fd7934', NULL, 'International District Medical and Dental Clinic (ICHS) - International Community Health Services', 'The International District Medical & Dental Clinic is ICHS’ flagship clinic and headquarters, located in the heart of Seattle’s Chinatown-International District. It offers a comprehensive range of services including adult and pediatric medical care, dental care, behavioral health, pregnancy care, WIC, nutrition services, sexual health, medication assisted treatment, an on-site pharmacy, geriatric care, integrative medicine, acupuncture, eye care, health education, and insurance enrollment. The clinic is committed to providing affordable, quality health care to all, regardless of insurance or ability to pay, with sliding scale discounts and language assistance services available.', '720 8th Ave S, Seattle, WA 98104', 'Seattle', 'WA', '98104', '206.788.3700', ARRAY['Korean', 'Hindi', 'Amharic', 'Russian', 'English', 'Urdu', 'Japanese', 'Tagalog', 'Mandarin', 'Toisanese', 'Vietnamese', 'French', 'Tigrinya', 'Cantonese', 'Spanish', 'Chinese']::text[], 'Dental', TRUE, '{"fax": "206.962.3297", "images": ["https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/international-district-medical-and-dental-clinic-ichs-international-community-health-services-google-1.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/international-district-medical-and-dental-clinic-ichs-international-community-health-services-google-2.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/international-district-medical-and-dental-clinic-ichs-international-community-health-services-google-3.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/international-district-medical-and-dental-clinic-ichs-international-community-health-services-google-4.webp", "https://smkyqdkuablxlexyuhgs.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-images/generated-clinics/google-places/international-district-medical-and-dental-clinic-ichs-international-community-health-services-google-5.webp"], "rating": 3.8, "reviews": [{"date": "2026-03-23T17:03:31.050050293Z", "text": "I have used ICHS for about 2-3 years now. I have health insurance from my employer, but ICHS continually delivers such excellent service that I see no reason to go elsewhere. Having an excellent dental clinic next door and an integrated pharmacy is fantastic. It almost feels like you’re in Europe.\n\nThis place is so well run, and every staff member I’ve interacted with has been excellent. Truly a public good. More ICHS type clinics in America, please.", "author": "Morgan Weaver", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102551102624229700112/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-11-30T09:01:41.609939119Z", "text": "Honestly pleasantly surprised me after experience at other low income, primarily minority clinics. Other than the hard to understand accents, people keep reading my middle name as my last name and the fact that I''m the only one in the building that isn''t Asian, they were pretty efficient with wait times, doctors and dentists are good and easier to understand, they respond to Mychart messages and the phones quickly. I highly prefer this clinic to the few I''ve been to down in the White Center, Burien areas.", "author": "Dom", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101857135383165055904/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-07-10T19:39:01.698929858Z", "text": "OMG, I keep telling people to go here. The first thing I noticed was after doctor lightly knocks on door she has a big smile as she enters. She tells me not to be in a hurry like most places are exact to 15 minutes appointment. I always feel better when I leave than when I got there just because of the demeanor of entire staff from time you check in. I''ve written 2 \" medical assistants\" Thank You cards for how they treated me. The Plebotomists are the best; you never feel the stick. I''m so fortunate to have ICHS for my doctor.", "author": "Nicole", "rating": 5, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112981409896375523864/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-06-11T05:31:30.347934Z", "text": "Absolutely do not go here. This was my childhood clinic because my parents didn''t know better. They always just tell you to go home and wait it out no matter your problem. This is the case with not only me but my entire family.\nMy sister''s condition was discovered until she was sent to the ER even though she was checked here throughout childhood and still at the time.\nMy mom who lost mobility due to cancer was written a physical therapy appointment. When I questioned the doctor, she said my mom still had to go to the appointment. Since when did physical therapy cure cancer??!!", "author": "Silvia Y", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111616744733453599813/reviews"}, {"date": "2025-01-02T20:30:19.522640Z", "text": "i am writing this review with deep disappointment and troubling experience after our recent visit to this clinic, which occurred despite our punctuality in arriving at 9am for my two years old brother’s appointment. i have to question whether the medical staff in this clinic are fully aware of or practicing the relevant laws and regulations. this is especially concerning after the excessive blood draw from my two years old brother, which was beyond pediatric guidelines, and the lack of proper communication and informed consent. telling me that there is a significant lapse in following legal standards at the clinic. we anticipated the usual long wait times but were unprepared for the shocking and potentially harmful treatment he received. what transpired was far beyond our expectations and has left us extremely distressed. despite the fact that my brother is a toddler, medical staff proceeded to draw an excessive amount of blood from my brother—four full sized bottles. that clearly seemed like they were more than 2ml. this is not only against pediatric guidelines but also poses a significant risk to a child his age. the recommended amount for a blood culture bottle is the child’s age in milliliters, which should have been no more than 2ml for my brother. yet, the amount taken was clearly far in excess of this limit. throughout the process, the staff seemed indifferent to our concerns, showed a lack of concern and provided no justification for their actions. they never mentioned to my mom or me about my brother having draw four bottles of blood. my brother, who also suffers from amnesia, was subjected to this traumatic and dangerous procedure without any consideration for his well being. the fact that he must undergo this every three months is deeply concerning and raises questions about the long-term effects on his health. drawing such a large volume of blood repeatedly could worsen his amnesia and weaken his immune function, not to mention the trauma this will inflict on a young child. while the clinic staff did apologize and mention that they will inform us of the number of blood bottles to be drawn next time, seeking our consent, this does not fully address the concerns raised. the focus should not be on merely seeking consent for potentially excessive procedures, but rather on ensuring that the procedures themselves are medically necessary, safe, and in line with pediatric guidelines. while the clinic staff did apologize and mention that they will inform us of the number of blood bottles to be drawn next time and seek our consent, this does not fully address the concerns raised. the focus should be on ensuring that the procedures themselves are medically necessary, safe, and in line with pediatric guidelines. the clinic needs to conduct a thorough investigation to determine why the excessive blood draw occurred and review and revise their protocols to align with established pediatric standards. i don’t know why this even needs to be said, but clinic staff should receive comprehensive training on handling pediatric patients with care, sensitivity, and proper communication, prioritizing patient safety and well being. also, the nurse only informed us that the medical staff had added two blood draw orders after we questioned them why they drew four bottles of blood. (due to character limited exceeded, the rest is in the photo.)", "author": "qi", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111648201897843546376/reviews"}], "website": "https://www.ichs.com/locations/international-district-medical-and-dental-clinic", "location": {"latitude": 47.596142799999996, "longitude": -122.32193280000001}, "services": ["Adult and Pediatric Medical Care", "Comprehensive Adult and Pediatric Dental Care", "Behavioral Health", "Pregnancy Care and Maternity Support", "Women, Infants & Children (WIC)", "Nutrition Services", "Sexual Health and Wellness", "Medication Assisted Treatment", "On-site Pharmacy", "Geriatric Care", "Integrative Medicine", "Acupuncture", "Eye Care and Prescriptions for Glasses", "Health Education", "Insurance Enrollment"], "insurance": {"notes": "Sliding scale discount available for those without insurance. Insurance assistance and enrollment help provided.", "accepts_medicaid": null, "accepts_medicare": null, "accepted_networks": [], "out_of_network_available": null, "accepts_private_insurance": true}, "highlights": [{"title": "Bilingual Staff", "detail": "Many providers speak multiple languages includ