term effects on his health. drawing such a large volume of blood repeatedly could worsen his amnesia and weaken his immune function, not to mention the trauma this will inflict on a young child. while the clinic staff did apologize and mention that they will inform us of the number of blood bottles to be drawn next time, seeking our consent, this does not fully address the concerns raised. the focus should not be on merely seeking consent for potentially excessive procedures, but rather on ensuring that the procedures themselves are medically necessary, safe, and in line with pediatric guidelines. while the clinic staff did apologize and mention that they will inform us of the number of blood bottles to be drawn next time and seek our consent, this does not fully address the concerns raised. the focus should be on ensuring that the procedures themselves are medically necessary, safe, and in line with pediatric guidelines. the clinic needs to conduct a thorough investigation to determine why the excessive blood draw occurred and review and revise their protocols to align with established pediatric standards. i don’t know why this even needs to be said, but clinic staff should receive comprehensive training on handling pediatric patients with care, sensitivity, and proper communication, prioritizing patient safety and well being. also, the nurse only informed us that the medical staff had added two blood draw orders after we questioned them why they drew four bottles of blood. (due to character limited exceeded, the rest is in the photo.)", "author": "qi", "rating": 1, "source": "google", "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111648201897843546376/reviews"}]}, "review_summary": "Most patients praise ICHS for its excellent service, friendly staff, and integrated facilities, though some report serious concerns about medical care and communication.", "about_highlight": "The International District Medical & Dental Clinic is ICHS’ flagship clinic and headquarters, located in the heart of Seattle’s Chinatown-International District. It offers a comprehensive range of services including adult and pediatric medical care, dental care, behavioral health, pregnancy care, WIC, nutrition services, sexual health, medication assisted treatment, an on-site pharmacy, geriatric care, integrative medicine, acupuncture, eye care, health education, and insurance enrollment. The clinic is committed to providing affordable, quality health care to all, regardless of insurance or ability to pay, with sliding scale discounts and language assistance services available.", "appointment_url": "https://www.ichs.com/make-an-appointment", "google_maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=17797826659490596283&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA", "google_place_id": "ChIJDyxYabxqkFQRuwXqxAyV_vY", "quality_missing": ["insurance"], "search_keywords": ["dental", "dentist", "nha khoa", "nha sĩ", "trồng răng", "implant", "root canal", "crowns", "veneers", "braces", "invisalign", "toothache", "치과", "치과의사", "임플란트", "牙医", "牙科", "种植牙", "korean", "한국어", "한인", "한국말", "hindi", "amharic", "russian", "english", "urdu", "japanese", "tagalog", "mandarin", "chinese", "中文", "普通话", "国语", "tiếng trung", "tiếng phổ thông", "toisanese", "vietnamese", "tiếng việt", "người việt", "bác sĩ việt", "french", "tigrinya", "cantonese", "粤语", "广东话", "tiếng quảng đông", "spanish", "华人", "adult and pediatric medical care", "comprehensive adult and pediatric dental care", "behavioral health", "pregnancy care and maternity support", "women, infants & children (wic)", "nutrition services", "sexual health and wellness", "medication assisted treatment", "on-site pharmacy", "geriatric care", "integrative medicine", "acupuncture", "eye care and prescriptions for glasses", "health education", "insurance enrollment", "primary care", "pregnancy care", "nutrition", "sexual health", "addiction medicine", "pharmacy", "geriatrics", "vision", "preventive", "insurance", "